(6356, 'en-US', 'Useful for getting inside buildings. It has the ability to remotely detonate: to do this, select C4 in the inventory and press “#rf_on”, this will turn on the remote mode, then specify the frequency at which C4 will wait for the signal and throw it where you need it. As soon as a signal appears at the specified frequency, it will detonate! Advice: if during a raid you need to blow up several C4 (for example, when raiding walls), you can use remote detonation, just set the number of C4 you need to one wiretapping frequency, then stick them where you need them, and then detonate using a remote control tuned to frequency C4. This will reduce the number of audible explosions for areas around the raid site.'),
