(6553, 'en-US', 'These white berry seeds can be planted in the ground and grown to harvest additional food. Plant these seeds in a bed and then water them with plenty of water, which will produce significantly more fruit and faster growth.'),
(6554, 'en-US', 'White Berry Seeds'),
(6555, 'en-US', 'These blue berry seeds can be planted in the ground and grown to collect additional food. Plant these seeds in a bed and then water them with plenty of water, which will produce significantly more fruit and faster growth.'),
(6556, 'en-US', 'Blueberry seeds'),
(6557, 'en-US', 'These yellow berry seeds can be planted in the ground and grown to collect additional food. Plant these seeds in a bed and then water them with plenty of water, which will produce significantly more fruit and faster growth.'),
(6558, 'en-US', 'Yellow Berry Seeds'),
(6559, 'en-US', 'These green berry seeds can be planted in the ground and grown to harvest additional food. Plant these seeds in a bed and then water them with plenty of water, which will produce significantly more fruit and faster growth.'),
(6560, 'en-US', 'Green berry seeds'),
(6561, 'en-US', 'Hemp seeds can be found when harvesting wild hemp. These seeds can be planted in the ground and grown to harvest additional tissue. Plant these seeds in a bed, then water them with plenty of water to greatly increase growth rate and tissue production.'),
(6562, 'en-US', 'Hemp Seed'),
(6563, 'en-US', 'These red berry seeds can be planted in the ground and grown to harvest additional food. Plant these seeds in a bed and then water them with plenty of water, which will produce significantly more fruit and faster growth.'),
(6564, 'en-US', 'Red Berry Seeds'),
(6565, 'en-US', 'Corn seeds can be found when harvesting wild corn. These seeds can be planted in the ground and grown to collect additional food. Plant these seeds in a bed, then water them with plenty of water to greatly increase the growth rate and quantity of corn.'),
(6566, 'en-US', 'Corn seeds'),
(6567, 'en-US', 'Pumpkin seeds can be found when collecting wild pumpkins. These seeds can be planted in the ground and grown to collect additional food. Plant these seeds in a garden bed, then water them with plenty of water to greatly increase their growth rate and yield.'),
(6568, 'en-US', 'Pumpkin seeds'),
(6569, 'en-US', 'These black berry seeds can be planted in the ground and grown to harvest additional food. Plant these seeds in a bed and then water them with plenty of water, which will produce significantly more fruit and faster growth.'),
(6570, 'en-US', 'Blackberry seeds'),
(6571, 'en-US', 'These potato seeds can be planted in the ground and grown to harvest additional food. Planting these seeds in a seeder and then watering them with plenty of water produces significantly more potatoes and faster growth.'),
(6572, 'en-US', 'Potato seed'),
