(7972, 'en-US', '<h2>1. Introduction to the game Rust</h2><p> Rust is a multiplayer sandbox game developed by Facepunch Studios. Players find themselves stranded on a desert island with minimal resources and must use their survival skills to fend off danger and other players while building their base, mining resources, and fighting for territory.</p><h2> 2. What are explosives in Rust</h2><p> Explosives are one of the important gameplay elements of Rust. It allows players to penetrate the protected bases of other players, destroy walls, doors and gain access to resources hidden inside.</p><h2> 3. Main types of explosives in the game</h2><p> There are several main types of explosives in Rust. Let\'s look at some of them:</p><ul><li> <b>C4</b> - C4 is the most powerful explosive projectile in the game. It is capable of blowing up even the most durable walls and doors. However, its production requires a lot of resources and time.</li><li> <b>RVB</b> - RVB (Hand Explosives) is a cheaper and more accessible option for explosives. It allows players to blow up doors and damage walls.</li><li> <b>Projectiles</b> - Projectiles can be used to destroy large structures such as towers or large walls. They require a special artillery mount to fire them and take longer to produce.</li></ul><h2> 4. Secret recipes for creating explosives</h2><p> Crafting explosives in Rust requires certain resources and recipes. Let\'s look at some of the secret recipes:</p><ul><li> Secret recipe for making C4:</li><ul><li> 1 Fuel</li><li> 2 Sulfur powders</li><li> 3 metal tips</li><li> 1 Cord</li></ul><li> Secret recipe for making RVB:</li><ul><li> 1 Fuel</li><li> 1 Sulfur powders</li><li> 1 Metal tip</li><li> 1 Cord</li></ul></ul><h2> 5. Use of explosives in gameplay</h2><p> Explosives play an important role in Rust\'s gameplay. With its help, players can secure their base by blowing up surrounding buildings and structures. It also allows you to attack other players, infiltrate their bases, steal resources and take control of territory.</p><h2> 6. Pitfalls when working with explosives</h2><p> Working with explosives in Rust can present some risks and challenges. Incorrect use of explosives can lead to loss of resources and destruction of your own base. In addition, explosives attract the attention of other players who may try to attack you or steal your resources.</p><h2> 7. Conclusion</h2><p> Explosives are an integral part of the game Rust. Knowing the different types of explosives, secret recipes and how to use them will give you an advantage in the fight for survival and control of territory. However, you need to be careful and use explosives correctly to avoid unnecessary problems and losses. Good luck on your adventures in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(7973, 'en-US', 'The most powerful explosive in the game Rust: what to choose?'),
(7974, 'en-US', 'Learn about the different types of explosives in Rust, compare their effectiveness, learn how to properly use explosives in gameplay, and get recommendations for choosing the most powerful option.'),
