(9200, 'en-US', '<div style=\"text-align: left\">After purchasing, you will have access to construction skins and teams for 14 days:<br> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #aaf16e;\">/bskin</span> - opens a menu for setting the default building skin.<br> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #aaf16e;\">/bskin build</span> - update the skin of the block you are viewing and everything connected with it.<br> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #aaf16e;\">/bskin all</span> - update the skin of all buildings owned by the player.</div>'),
