(9534, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam is offering a bonus Twitch drop \"Sword of the Realm\" after winning the Colosseum event. Find out how to get this unique skin and add it to your collection!'),
(9535, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, Twitch, Twitch drops, skins, Sword of the Realm, Colosseum event, bonus drop, hjune, sven, itswiked'),
(9536, 'en-US', 'Are you a fan of Rust on Steam? Then we have great news for you! You can now get a bonus Twitch drop \"Sword of the Kingdom\" when watching streams of hjune, sven or itswiked after winning the exciting \"Colosseum\" event!<br/> \"Sword of the Kingdom\" is a rare skin that allows you to stand out from other players and add uniqueness to your character. To get this skin, you need to participate in the Colosseum event and win. At the same time, you must follow the broadcasts of the specified streamers on the Twitch platform.<br/> The Colosseum event is an exciting PvP battle where you can show off your skills and strategies in combat. You will also get the chance to enjoy incredible displays of skill from professional players such as hjune, sven and itswiked.<br/> To participate in the Colosseum event and get a chance to win the bonus Sword of the Realm Twitch drop, you\'ll need to sign up on Twitch, connect your Rust Steam account to your Twitch account, and start following the streams of the streamers listed. Once you win the event, you\'ll be able to watch hjune, sven, or itswiked\'s streams and earn the coveted Sword of the Realm skin.<br/> Don\'t miss your chance to update your skin collection in Rust and add the cool \"Sword of the Kingdom\" to your arsenal! Follow the streams and win the \"Colosseum\" event to get your reward!'),
(9537, 'en-US', 'Limiting the number of wolves in the game Rust'),
(9538, 'en-US', 'This article discusses the wolf limitation in Rust and its impact on gameplay balance and the game ecosystem.'),
(9539, 'en-US', 'game Rust, wolves, limitation, population reduction, balance, ecosystem'),
(9540, 'en-US', '<p>The number of wolves in the game Rust was limited to three individuals in a pack, and their population was significantly reduced. This decision by the game developers is aimed at balancing the gameplay and creating a more realistic ecosystem.</p><br/><br/><p> Previously, wolves in the game Rust were quite a powerful obstacle for players, as their numbers were high and they could attack the player in large numbers. This created some problems in the game balance and resource intensity of the servers.</p><br/><br/><p> Limiting the number of wolves to three in a pack allows players to deal with them more effectively. Now the player has a better chance of surviving a wolf attack, but the wolves themselves remain quite dangerous opponents.</p><br/><br/><p> The wolf population reduction is also an important part of the update. It reduces the number of wolves on the map and reduces the likelihood of encountering them. This change allows players to explore the game world more freely without worrying about frequent attacks from wolves.</p><br/><br/><p> However, the decision to limit and reduce the wolf population is not perfect. It has its trade-offs. Firstly, reducing the wolf population may negatively affect the realism of the game\'s ecosystem, since wolves do not obey population limits in reality. Secondly, the gameplay may become less challenging and exciting without enough wolves.</p><br/><br/><p> Ultimately, the decision to limit the number of wolves and reduce their population in Rust is based on the desire for balance and improving the gameplay. This decision can be both positive and cause some controversy among players. However, it is important to understand that such changes affect the game ecosystem and require consideration of various factors when making decisions by the game developers.</p>'),
(9541, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops in Rust on Steam'),
(9542, 'en-US', 'Get unique skins for your base in the game Rust on the Steam platform using Twitch Drops! Find out how it works and what benefits this promotion gives.'),
(9543, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam, skins, base, broadcasts, account, activation, conditions'),
(9544, 'en-US', '<p>It\'s time to get epic skins for your base in the game Rust on the Steam platform! Meet Twitch Drops - Rust Kingdoms! This is a unique event that will allow you to earn exclusive items directly on your account in the game.</p><br/><p> What are Twitch Drops? It is a system that allows you to receive rewards for watching streams on the Twitch platform. Simply set your Twitch account to subscribe to channels that broadcast the game Rust, and your chances of receiving skins will increase.</p><br/><p> How does it work? When you watch a stream of Rust, you can randomly get a skin drop right in the game. This can be a cosmetic item, a weapon, clothing, or another useful asset for your base. The longer you watch the stream, the more likely you are to get a valuable drop.</p><br/><p> What is so attractive about these skins? Firstly, they look incredibly stylish and will allow you to stand out from other players. Each design is developed with love for detail and is unique. Colorful colors, unusual shapes and attractive effects - you will find all this in the skins from Twitch Drops.</p><br/><p> Which channels are worth subscribing to? The choice is huge! We recommend subscribing to the channels of popular streamers, professional players, and official Rust tournaments. It is on their broadcasts that you can get the most valuable skins. Don\'t forget the official channels of the Rust game developers to stay up to date with the latest news and promotions.</p><br/><p> Are there any requirements or conditions? Yes, to get the skin, you must have an activated Steam account and a Twitch account. You also need to watch the stream in Skin Drop mode. For details and conditions, check out the Twitch Drops for Rust page.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your base in the game Rust with unique skins from Twitch Drops! Join the broadcasts, get rewards and show other players that your base is a real kingdom!</p>'),
(9545, 'en-US', 'Facepunch Announces: Rust Mobile is Officially in Development!'),
(9546, 'en-US', 'Rust Mobile - officially in development! Facepunch Studios is excited to announce the creation of a mobile version of the game. Players will be able to enjoy the gameplay and atmosphere of Rust on their mobile devices. Expect new adventures and challenges!'),
(9547, 'en-US', 'Rust Mobile, Facepunch Studios, development, game, mobile version, platforms, gameplay, updates, interface, survival'),
(9548, 'en-US', 'Facepunch announces: Rust Mobile is now officially in development!<br/><br/> Great news for fans of Rust! Facepunch Studios is pleased to announce the start of development of a mobile version of the game. Players from all over the world will be able to enjoy the exciting world of Rust right on their mobile devices!<br/><br/> Facepunch Studios is a leading developer known for its professionalism and high quality of gaming content. The development of Rust Mobile is a step that opens up amazing possibilities for players, allowing them to interact with the game anytime and anywhere.<br/><br/> In developing Rust Mobile, the team at Facepunch Studios has set themselves the difficult task of preserving all the gameplay and atmosphere of the original game. They aim to provide an authentic experience full of adventure and competition.<br/><br/> Rust Mobile will be available on various platforms, including iOS and Android, allowing players with different devices to enjoy the game together. Of course, this will be a great opportunity for players to share the joy of the game with friends and compete with them in real time.<br/><br/> Rust Mobile is expected to offer all the core elements that made the original game so popular. This includes building bases, surviving in harsh conditions, fighting other players, crafting items, and more. The development team promises regular updates and new features to ensure players always have interesting challenges and opportunities to diversify their gameplay.<br/><br/> Facepunch Studios is committed to making Rust Mobile as accessible and engaging as possible for everyone. They understand that mobile gaming has its own unique challenges and limitations, and they are up for the challenge. The developers promise optimized performance and an intuitive interface so that players can fully enjoy the game without experiencing any inconvenience.<br/><br/> Stay tuned for news about the official release of Rust Mobile and get ready to dive into the incredible world of survival and competition. Be prepared for new adventures and challenges that this exciting mobile game will present!'),
(9549, 'en-US', 'Have you met the new wolves yet? What do you think?'),
(9550, 'en-US', 'It\'s done! New creatures have been added to Rust - wolves. Find out how players react to meeting a new threat in the game world and how it will affect the gameplay and economy.'),
(9551, 'en-US', 'game Rust, updates, wolves, game world, player reactions, danger, challenges, adrenaline, economy, community, Gary Numan, survival'),
(9552, 'en-US', '<p>Steam game Rust is getting an update and adding wolves to its game world. Players may have different reactions when meeting these new creatures, but what do they think of the wolves in the game?</p><br/><p> A new patch that introduces wolves to Rust has fans of the game excited and intrigued. Wolves represent a new threat to the game world, adding elements of danger and surprise to the gameplay. They can be aggressive and attack players, and can also be used as prey or traded.</p><br/><p> Some players are excited to see new hostile creatures in the game, as it adds more challenges and adrenaline. For others, wolves can be a problem, especially for new players who may find it difficult to defend themselves from these predators. Most players also wonder how wolves can affect the game\'s economy and community dynamics.</p><br/><p> However, in the source of the creation itself, the main commander of the Rust development team, Gary Newman, stated that wolves were introduced into the game in order to diversify the gameplay and add new tactics of survival. Their aggressiveness and unpredictability are created specifically so that players can experience a new level of difficulty and challenge.</p><br/><p> Overall, meeting wolves in the game Rust promises to be an interesting and exciting adventure for players. It is important to remember that each player has their own opinion about the new creatures and their impact on the gameplay. What do you think about the new wolves in Rust? Share your opinion in the comments and meet new challenges in this popular game!</p>'),
(9553, 'en-US', 'New skins in the game Rust: a huge choice of style for your character!'),
(9554, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of skins in Rust to find a stylish look for your character.'),
(9555, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, style selection, character'),
(9556, 'en-US', '<p>We present you a new batch of skins in the game Rust! Now you have even more opportunities to create a unique image of your character. Check out all the new items and choose a style that fully matches your preferences!</p><br/><br/><p> Each new batch of skins in the game Rust brings with it a variety of variations, from classic and minimalistic to bright and extravagant. You can choose a new black suit, add some elements of military equipment or make your character a real pirate. The options are countless, and we are sure that everyone will find something to their taste.</p><br/><br/><p> But don\'t forget that choosing new skins, in addition to creating a unique appearance, can also affect your gaming capabilities. Some skins can provide bonuses to movement speed or defense, while others can add special skills or perks. Therefore, before making a decision, it is worth carefully studying the characteristics of new skins and choosing those that best suit your playing style.</p><br/><br/><p> Also, don\'t forget about the importance of balance between appearance and gameplay. Skins that are too bright and flashy can attract unwanted attention from enemies, and gear that is too heavy can slow you down in combat. So, be careful and think about your decisions.</p><br/><br/><p> In general, the new batch of skins in the game Rust opens up a huge field for creativity. Choose a style that makes you stand out from the crowd, while taking into account the game characteristics. Do not forget to follow the updates and keep up with the latest news to always be in trend and have the opportunity to express your individuality in the game Rust!</p>'),
(9557, 'en-US', 'November Global Wipe: What\'s New for Players'),
(9558, 'en-US', 'The November global wipe in Rust starts with a ton of new features and improvements, including new weapons, improved AI, updated electrical systems, and more.'),
(9559, 'en-US', 'November Global Wipe, Rust, New Features, Update, Bug Fixes, Quality of Life Improvements'),
(9560, 'en-US', '<p>This Thursday, at 22:00 Moscow time, a global wipe will start in the game Rust. This means that all game servers will be reset, and players will have to start from scratch. But don\'t worry, this wipe will bring a lot of innovations and improvements!</p><br/><p> The main changes this month come with a patch that will bring the following to players:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> SKS - a new weapon that will allow you to fight effectively</li><br/><li> The first level of SMG is an expansion in your arsenal to overcome difficulties.</li><br/><li> Gesture DLC - additional content that allows you to express your emotions and communicate with other players</li><br/><li> Improved wolf AI - more intelligent and dangerous creatures in the game world</li><br/><li> New cliffs and rock faces near monuments offer unexpected adventures and opportunities for exploration</li><br/><li> Updated electrical system - simplification and optimization of electrical circuits in the game</li><br/><li> Changes to cameras on monuments - new viewing angles for more visual and convenient interaction</li><br/><li> Weapon Flashlight Changes - Improved lighting effects when using weapons</li><br/><li> Changes to the mixing table - simplified and convenient process of creating items</li><br/></ul><br/><p> But that\'s not all! Along with these new features, the developers have also made a ton of bug fixes and quality of life improvements to make your gaming experience even more enjoyable and fun.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the November global wipe! Join the Rust game and explore all the new features that await you in this update!</p>'),
(9561, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops: New Round of Skins for Rust'),
(9562, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new round of Twitch Skin Drops for Rust, which will run from November 8th to 18th.'),
(9563, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, skins, game, Steam, giveaways'),
(9564, 'en-US', '<p>For all Rust fans and Twitch streamers, we have great news - a new round of Twitch Drops is coming soon! From November 8 to November 18, you can get unique skins for your Rust character just by watching Twitch streams.</p><br/><p> What are Twitch Drops and how do they work? If you connect your Twitch account to your Steam profile and participate in Twitch Drops, you will be given the opportunity to receive free in-game items, including weapon and clothing skins. You just need to stream on Twitch and participate in the drop to have a chance to receive these unique items.</p><br/><p> The new round of Twitch Drops for Rust will run from November 8 to November 18. This is a great chance to update your skin collection and give your character a unique look. You will be able to choose from various options for weapon skins, clothing, and other items to create a unique look for your character in Rust.</p><br/><p> To take part in Twitch Drops, you need to follow a few simple steps:</p><br/><ol><br/><li> Connect your Twitch account to your Steam profile.</li><br/><li> Go to the Twitch Drops for Rust page and click the \"Participate\" button.</li><br/><li> Start any Rust stream on Twitch and stay on it for as long as possible.</li><br/><li> Keep an eye on your Steam mailbox to be notified when skins are received.</li><br/></ol><br/><p> The Rust game development team constantly updates the skin collection so that players can always find something new and interesting for their character. Twitch Drops are a great opportunity to get rare and exclusive items that are not available in the regular game store. So don\'t miss your chance and take part in the new round of Twitch Drops for Rust!</p>'),
(9565, 'en-US', 'Updated sounds for the new Tier 1 SMG'),
(9566, 'en-US', 'Get all the details on the latest Rust update, which includes updated sounds for the new Tier 1 SMG, giving the game improved realism and atmosphere.'),
(9567, 'en-US', 'updated sounds, new Tier 1 SMG, improved realism, atmosphere, Rust game, updates'),
(9568, 'en-US', 'Hello, Rust players! We are pleased to announce the latest update to the game, which includes new and improved sounds for our new Tier 1 SMG. In this article, we will tell you more about the new sounds, which give the game improved realism and atmosphere.<br/> The new Tier 1 SMG is one of the most popular weapons in Rust, and we did everything possible to make it sound even more exciting and convincing. The sounds of shots, reloading, and the weapon mechanism itself have been reworked so that they convey the characteristics and features of the SMG as much as possible. Now each shot sounds more dynamic and realistic, and reloading creates a true feeling of controlling the weapon.<br/> Our sound designers have put a lot of effort into creating these updated sounds for the new Tier 1 SMG. They have conducted research and testing to accurately reproduce the characteristic sounds of the pneumatic systems and shots of this type of weapon. The result is an immersive soundtrack that will make you dive into the atmosphere of the game even more deeply.<br/> We also wanted to take into account the opinions of our players, so we studied in detail the feedback and suggestions that came from the community. We took your wishes into account and aimed to create a sound system that would best meet your needs and expectations.<br/> Finally, the updated sounds for the new Tier 1 SMG greatly improve the gaming experience in Rust. Enjoy the improved realism and atmosphere of the weapon, which will allow you to fully immerse yourself in the game world. Don\'t forget to follow the updates and stay up to date with new improvements. We wish you a pleasant game!'),
(9569, 'en-US', 'We\'ve finally got it! SKS rifle update in Rust'),
(9570, 'en-US', 'We\'ve finally arrived! The SKS rifle has been updated in Rust. It is now a new weapon with greater damage, rate of fire, and range, but with slightly greater recoil. The article describes the crafting and features of the new rifle.'),
(9571, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, SKS Rifle, rifle, skin, weapon, craft, damage, recoil'),
(9572, 'en-US', '<p>:dotred1: In April, the SKS rifle was considered as a skin for the SAR, but now it\'s a new weapon!</p><br/><p> ✅ Now it can be crafted on 3 workbenches: 12 HQM, 200 Metal, 2 Springs and 1 Semi Body.</p><br/><p> ✅ The SKS rifle has higher damage, rate of fire and range compared to the SAR, but has slightly more recoil.</p><br/><p> ✅ The magazine capacity is 15 rounds.</p>'),
(9573, 'en-US', '[Rust WIP] New Weapon: Tier 1 SMG'),
(9574, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new Tier 1 SMG weapon in Rust and its characteristics. Improve your arsenal and increase your chances of survival! Follow the news and updates of the game.'),
(9575, 'en-US', 'Rust, WIP, new weapon, Tier 1 SMG, game, update'),
(9576, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust has a new weapon - Tier 1 SMG. This is an indispensable tool for survival and protection in the harsh world of the game.</p><br/><p> To craft a Tier 1 SMG, you will need: 5 High Quality Metal (HQM), 200 Metal Fragments, and 1 Spring. These are fairly affordable resources that can be found or mined in the game.</p><br/><p> The Tier 1 SMG has a powerful damage of 20 units and has a high rate of fire. This makes it effective in close combat and gives you an advantage in battles with enemies.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to strengthen your arsenal and increase your chances of survival in the world of Rust with the introduction of Tier 1 SMG. Stay tuned for game news and updates to get the most useful information!</p>'),
(9577, 'en-US', '[Rust WIP] New IO Research Table'),
(9578, 'en-US', 'The article introduces a new feature coming soon to the game Rust - IO Research Table. This feature will be responsible for the development of electrical, water and industrial items in the game. The IO Research Table is expected to become an integral part of the gameplay, giving players more choice and flexibility in developing and creating their gaming experience.'),
(9579, 'en-US', '[Rust WIP], IO Research Table, Electric Items, Water Items, Industrial Items, Technology, Workbench, Research, Crafting, Game Experience'),
(9580, 'en-US', '<p><b>[Rust WIP] New IO Research Table</b></p><br/><p> The article introduces a new feature that will soon appear in the Rust game - IO Research Table.</p><br/><p> This feature will be responsible for developing electrical, water and industrial items in the game. Each type of item is expected to have its own technology branch and a new workbench where players can conduct research and create new items.</p><br/><p> The IO Research Table is a convenient and effective tool for developing technology levels in Rust. It allows players to research new and improved item variants, as well as unlock new features and capabilities.</p><br/><p> The IO Research Table is expected to become an integral part of the gameplay, giving players more choice and flexibility in developing and creating their gaming experience.</p><br/><p> Author: Cipeax</p>'),
(9581, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Skin Collection Update'),
(9582, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skin updates in Rust and add new items to your collection.'),
(9583, 'en-US', 'new skins, update, Rust, collection'),
(9584, 'en-US', 'About the latest skins update in the game Rust'),
(9585, 'en-US', 'First visual of SMG T1 (new weapon in RUST)'),
(9586, 'en-US', 'A new weapon has appeared in the game Rust - SMG T1 (Self-Loading Submachine Gun T1), and we invite you to get acquainted with the first visual of this weapon.'),
(9587, 'en-US', 'SMG T1, new weapon, Rust, submachine gun, first visual'),
(9588, 'en-US', '<p>A new weapon has appeared in the game Rust - SMG T1 (Self-Loading Submachine Gun T1), and we invite you to get acquainted with the first visual of this weapon.</p><br/><br/><p> The SMG T1 is a light weapon with high firepower designed for close and medium range combat. It stands out from other SMGs in the game due to its unique ergonomics and design.</p><br/><br/><p> The visual of the SMG T1 is shown below: </p><br/><br/><img src=\"smg_t1_visual.jpg\" alt=\"First visual of SMG T1\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\"><br/><br/><p> As you can see, the weapon has a compact size and a pleasant appearance. It is equipped with a barrel cover and an adjustable buttstock, which ensures comfortable use even in the most extreme conditions.</p><br/><br/><p> The SMG T1 also has good accuracy and recoil control, making it an effective tool in the hands of experienced players. A large 30-round magazine allows for long bursts of fire and significant damage to enemies.</p><br/><br/><p> The introduction of new weapons into the game Rust always arouses interest and pleases players with new opportunities. SMG T1 will be a great addition to the weapons in the player\'s arsenal and will provide new tactical opportunities for achieving victory.</p><br/><br/><p> Get ready for a new challenge and join the battles in Rust with the new SMG T1!</p>'),
(9589, 'en-US', '[Rust WIP] After World Update: Monument Cliffs & Rocks'),
(9590, 'en-US', 'After the world update in Rust, there were changes to monuments related to rocks and cliffs.'),
(9591, 'en-US', 'Rust, peace, renovation, monument, rock, fire'),
(9592, 'en-US', '<p>After updating the world in the game Rust: Rocks and Cliffs of monuments</p><br/><p> ✅ All monuments previously made of old stones and rocks have been updated using new prefabs.</p><br/><p> ✅ The renovation had the greatest impact on monuments such as treatment plants, sewage outlets and caves.</p><br/><p> ✅ In many places in the game world, it has become easier to climb cliffs and rocks.</p>'),
(9593, 'en-US', '[Rust WIP] Weapon Flashlight'),
(9594, 'en-US', 'Facepunch have made changes to the lighting of weapon flashlights in Rust. They now have a softer look with a slight haze effect and are noticeably dimmer to avoid blinding other players.'),
(9595, 'en-US', 'Rust, WIP, weapon flashlight, lighting, haze effect, dimmer, blinding players'),
(9596, 'en-US', '[Rust WIP] Weapon Flashlight<br/><p> <b><i>Facepunch</i></b> have made some changes to the lighting of weapon flashlights in Rust.</p><br/><p> They now have a softer look with a slight haze effect, making the light more pleasing to the player\'s eyes.</p><br/><p> In addition, the lighting has become noticeably dimmer, which helps avoid blinding other players.</p>'),
(9597, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Automatically Add Ingredients to Mixing Table Inventory'),
(9598, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust adds a handy improvement: now when you click on a recipe on the mixing table, all ingredients are automatically added to the table\'s inventory in the correct quantities and locations.'),
(9599, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, game, inventory, mixing table, recipe, ingredients, mixing'),
(9600, 'en-US', '<h2>Rust Game Update: Automatically Add Ingredients to Mixing Table Inventory</h2><br/><p> In the latest update to the Rust game, the developers have made a handy improvement that allows players to save time and simplify the process of mixing ingredients. Now, when you click on a recipe on the mixing table, all the necessary ingredients are automatically added to the mixing table inventory in the right quantities and places.</p><br/><p> This greatly simplifies the process of preparing various items, eliminates the need to manually move each ingredient and allows players to concentrate on the mixing process itself. Now you can quickly and easily mix components without unnecessary interruptions.</p><br/><p> The update also saves time on searching and sorting ingredients, as they will be automatically added and placed in the right places inside the mixing table inventory. Thanks to this improvement, you will be able to focus on other aspects of the game, such as exploration, the fight for survival, or interaction with other players.</p><br/><p> Overall, this update significantly improves the convenience and comfort of the gameplay in Rust. It has already received positive feedback from the community of players who appreciated the improvement and noted its importance in enhancing the gaming experience. Don\'t waste time on routine actions, instead enjoy the exciting and immersive game world of Rust!</p>'),
(9601, 'en-US', 'First Look: Siege Weapons (Models)'),
(9602, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at new models of siege weapons in the game Rust: ballista, catapult and ram. We will learn about new shells for the ballista and catapult and the possibility of using the ram.'),
(9603, 'en-US', 'Rust, Siege Weapons, models, ballista, catapult, ram, siege, update'),
(9604, 'en-US', '<h2>First Look: Siege Weapons (Models)</h2><br/><p> In this article we will look at new models of siege weapons in the game Rust: ballista, catapult and ram.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> The Ballista and Catapult are now equipped with new types of projectiles - \"Spear\" and \"Boulder\".</li><br/><li> The ram has a fuel tank and a place for the driver.</li><br/><li> All siege weapons can be towed by horses.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> The update adds new siege capabilities and gives players more variations in siege and defense tactics.</p>'),
(9605, 'en-US', 'The Halloween update is now in the game!'),
(9606, 'en-US', 'We are happy to announce that the Halloween update is already in the game and will be available until November 7. Enjoy new scary skins, unique items and exciting events!'),
(9607, 'en-US', 'Halloween, update, game, scary skins, unique items, events, adventure, horror'),
(9608, 'en-US', 'The Halloween update is now in the game!<br/><br/> We are pleased to announce that the Halloween update is now live and will be available until November 7th! Now you can dive into the horror atmosphere and enjoy the new features and content that we have prepared for you. New scary skins, unique items, exciting events and much more are waiting for you to make your adventure in Rust even more exciting and frightening. Don\'t miss your chance to experience real Halloween horror right in the game!'),
(9609, 'en-US', 'New Halloween items have arrived on the Steam Market!'),
(9610, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Halloween items on the Steam Market for Rust and create a unique look for your character!'),
(9611, 'en-US', 'Steam Market, Game Rust, Halloween, themed items, decor, clothes, accessories'),
(9612, 'en-US', '<p>Halloween is just around the corner, and game makers are not missing out on the opportunity to please their fans with appropriate content. The Rust game on Steam is no exception - new Halloween-themed items have appeared on the Steam Market!</p><br/><p> Halloween is a time to express your individuality and creativity through a variety of items and outfits. Rasta players can now purchase new decorations, clothing, and accessories to help them create a unique look in the game.</p><br/><p> The new collection of Halloween items includes a wide variety of items - from scary masks and unusual headdresses to sinister decorative elements for the base. Every player will be able to find something to their taste and create a unique image.</p><br/><p> It\'s important to note that the new Halloween items are available on the Steam Market, meaning you can either purchase them with in-game currency or sell your items to other players.</p><br/><p> Festive items always add a special atmosphere to the game and lift the players\' spirits. So don\'t miss the opportunity to diversify your gameplay and make the game even more exciting and interesting!</p>'),
(9613, 'en-US', 'Now you can see how many hours you spent in the queue after the wipe'),
(9614, 'en-US', 'Find out how long you spent in the queue after a Rust wipe if you didn\'t buy VIP access. This new feature lets you stay informed about your wait time before playing.'),
(9615, 'en-US', 'Rust update, Steam, queue, VIP access, wait time, Rust'),
(9616, 'en-US', 'You just woke up, are in the mood to play Rust and are ready to join your favorite server. However, you are faced with one annoying problem - a long queue. The publishers of the game Rust on Steam offer a solution to this problem with the introduction of VIP access. Now, even if you have not purchased VIP access, you will be able to see how many hours you have spent in the queue after the progress is reset. This is a new feature that allows you to be aware of the wait time, and also gives you more motivation to buy VIP access and avoid long queues. Don\'t miss the new Rust update on Steam!'),
(9617, 'en-US', 'New Skins for Rust: Fresh Release'),
(9618, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of skins for Rust on Steam. Get details on the most interesting skins that will bring new features and visual impressions.'),
(9619, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, visual impressions, updates, game collection'),
(9620, 'en-US', 'The popular game Rust has just released a new batch of exciting and stylish skins on Steam. If you are looking for fresh updates to spice up your gaming collection or to transform the look of your character, then you should definitely check out these new items. In this article, we will tell you about the most interesting skins that will bring new features and visual impressions to the game.<br/><br/> 1. \"Burning Trap\" - one of the most spectacular skins, embodying the element of fire. With bright and frightening details, this skin will allow you to stand out on the battlefield and attract the attention of enemies.<br/><br/> 2. \"Mechanical Companion\" - a cute and helpful robot assistant that will accompany you on your adventures in Rust. It will provide you with additional opportunities and will become an indispensable companion in your journey through the world of Rust.<br/><br/> 3. \"Armored Guardian\" - a powerful and impregnable skin for your base unit. With its help, you can protect your possessions from unwanted guests and strengthen your position on the server.<br/><br/> Each of these skins has its own unique features and gives the game a new look. It doesn\'t matter if you want to stand out on the battlefield, get a reliable companion or secure your base, the new skins in the game Rust will give you the opportunity to surprise everyone with your individuality.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to get these cool skins and add something truly unique to your gaming collection. Head over to the Steam store and join the many players who have been enjoying the new features and style of Rust for a long time.'),
(9621, 'en-US', 'Halloween Patch Update Delayed to October 28'),
(9622, 'en-US', 'The Halloween patch for Rust on Steam has been postponed to October 28 due to unforeseen circumstances. Apologies to players for any inconvenience, new features and improvements are promised.'),
(9623, 'en-US', 'Halloween patch update, Rust, Steam, transfer, possible inconveniences, features, fixes, improvements'),
(9624, 'en-US', '<p>Attention Rust players on Steam!</p><br/><p> We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause, but due to unforeseen circumstances we have been forced to move the Halloween patch to Monday, October 28th.</p><br/><p> We fully understand the importance of this update and are working tirelessly to bring you a full suite of new features, fixes and improvements to make your gaming experience even more exciting.</p><br/><p> Please be patient and wait for this update, which will bring you even more features and improvements.</p><br/><p> Thank you for your understanding and support!</p>'),
(9625, 'en-US', 'Disabling CCTV cameras at Monument'),
(9626, 'en-US', 'You can now disable the security cameras on the Monument. Simply shoot them to stop them from working. The video will be distorted, but the audio will continue to function. Everything will return to normal in 5 minutes!'),
(9627, 'en-US', 'Monument, CCTV, Cameras, Disabling, video surveillance, disabling, Monument, cameras'),
(9628, 'en-US', '<p>Now you have the opportunity to turn off the surveillance cameras on the Monument!</p><br/><p> Just shoot them and they will stop working.</p><br/><p> Please note: When disabled, the video will be heavily distorted, but the audio will continue to function.</p><br/><p> In 5 minutes everything will be back to normal!</p>'),
(9629, 'en-US', 'Get your buckets of candy ready!'),
(9630, 'en-US', 'Find out about the upcoming Halloween update for Rust on Steam. Get ready to face monsters and collect candy in this exciting event!'),
(9631, 'en-US', 'Halloween, update, monsters, candy, Rust, Steam'),
(9632, 'en-US', '<p>The Halloween update is coming this Thursday and you won\'t want to miss it!</p><br/><p> The new Rust Steam update brings monster-killing, exciting events, and elusive candy! It\'s going to be an incredible Halloween celebration that will have you holding a bucket to collect precious sweets.</p><br/><p> However, before you go hunting monsters and collecting candy, please note that this will require updating the server and client. Be prepared in advance so you don’t miss out on the opportunity to play these new sinister events!</p>'),
(9633, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: What\'s New in the Latest Batch?'),
(9634, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of skins in Rust: new outfits, weapons, home decor, and more. Show off your individuality and update your wardrobe, arsenal, and base with new skins in Rust.'),
(9635, 'en-US', 'Rust, skins, game, update, new, costumes, weapons, interior items, base, personality, style'),
(9636, 'en-US', '<p>Fans of the game Rust like the visual design and variety of skins so much that each update with new skins is a real holiday. And now, finally, a fresh batch of skins has appeared on the horizon, which will certainly meet the expectations of all fans of the game Rust.</p><br/><p> The new skins in the latest update will please both experienced players and newcomers. You will find many unique items that will allow you to stand out from the rest of the inhabitants of the world of Rust and add more variety to your gameplay.</p><br/><p> What does the latest batch of skins contain? It includes new costumes, weapons, interior items, buildings and much more. Each skin is thought out to the smallest detail to highlight the individuality and style of your character or base.</p><br/><p> For fans of an aggressive gaming style, there are many new weapon skins that will add a bit of excitement and expression to the game. Also, in the new batch of skins, they did not forget about connoisseurs of beauty - there are many stylish interior items that will transform your base and create an atmosphere of comfort and coziness.</p><br/><p> Each skin in the game Rust is the result of the work of talented artists who put a piece of their soul into it. They paid attention to even the smallest details to provide you with a high-quality and unique gaming experience.</p><br/><p> New skins in the game Rust are not just a change in the appearance of objects, it is an opportunity to stand out, show your individuality and create a unique image with which other players will associate you.</p><br/><p> So, don\'t miss the chance to update your wardrobe, arsenal and base with the new batch of skins in the game Rust. Highlight your individuality and enter the new season of the game with new opportunities and style.</p>'),
(9637, 'en-US', 'New mini game - rock, paper, scissors'),
(9638, 'en-US', 'A new exciting minigame appears in the world of the game Rust - rock, paper, scissors! Join the game and show your skills in a gesture duel. This game will be part of the Gesture Pack DLC with new interesting gestures.'),
(9639, 'en-US', 'new minigame, rock paper scissors, Rust, Gesture Pack DLC, gestures, game'),
(9640, 'en-US', '<p>A new exciting mini-game appears in the world of Rust - rock, paper, scissors! Now you can fight with your friends or random players in a gesture duel.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Select a game from the gesture menu</li><br/><li> Join the game by pressing \"E\"</li><br/><li> Define your strategy and defeat your opponent</li><br/></ul><br/><p> This new minigame will be part of the Gesture Pack DLC, which includes not only rock, paper, scissors, but also other interesting gestures (some of which have already been shown before).</p><br/><p> Join the game and show your skills!</p>'),
(9641, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops are in full swing!'),
(9642, 'en-US', 'Learn how to get exclusive skins in Rust via Twitch Drops. Join the viewing on Twitch and get valuable prizes just by watching streams.'),
(9643, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Skins, Steam, Skin Distribution, Streams, Inventory'),
(9644, 'en-US', '<p>Learn more about Twitch Drops and how to get skins in Rust</p><br/><p> The hottest Twitch Drops are here! If you haven\'t started watching yet, tune in now to earn exclusive skins for your collection in Rust on Steam.</p><br/><p> How does it work? It\'s very simple! Twitch Drops is a special feature that allows viewers to receive in-game items, skins, and other valuable prizes simply by watching streams on the Twitch platform.</p><br/><p> To participate in the skin giveaway in the game Rust, you will need to follow just a few simple steps:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Create an account on Steam and Twitch platforms if you don\'t have them yet.</li><br/><li> Link your Twitch account to your Steam account.</li><br/><li> Join streams that participate in skin giveaways. These streams are usually marked with a special \"Drops Enabled\" or \"Participates in skin giveaway\" icon.</li><br/><li> Make the stream play without skipping and actively participate in the community - comment, ask questions, etc.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> After completing these steps, you can relax and enjoy watching streams. You will receive skins and other valuable items directly into your inventory in the Rust game! Don\'t forget to check your inventory from time to time so as not to miss any valuable items.</p><br/><p> So don\'t miss your chance to get unique skins for your character in the game Rust! Join the viewing on Twitch and get Twitch Drops now!</p>'),
(9645, 'en-US', 'Fabric has become harder to see after the world update'),
(9646, 'en-US', 'After a world update in Rust, the color of the cloth was adjusted in Staging mode, which led to difficulties in its visibility. This article examines the reasons and consequences of these changes, as well as possible compromises and player suggestions.'),
(9647, 'en-US', 'game Rust, game update Rust, change cloth visibility, Staging, developers, game realism, game usability'),
(9648, 'en-US', '<p>After the latest world update in Rust, players noticed significant changes in the visibility of cloth. The color of the cloth was adjusted in Staging mode, making it much harder to see and distinguish from the surrounding background.</p><br/><br/><p> These changes immediately caused outrage among players, as cloth is one of the important resources in the game and is used to create various items and buildings. The difficulty in distinguishing cloth can significantly complicate gameplay and affect strategic decisions related to its use.</p><br/><br/><p> However, the game developers explained that the change in cloth color was made to increase the realism of the game world and improve the overall gaming experience. They believe that players now have to try harder to distinguish the cloth from the surrounding environment, which creates more immersion and makes the game more interesting.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the suggestions from players is the ability to customize the visibility of fabric in the game settings, so that each player can independently choose the level of difficulty in distinguishing fabric. This could solve the problem and satisfy both those who like these changes and those who prefer more convenient visibility.</p><br/><br/><p> Ultimately, the issue of changing the visibility of cloth is a compromise between the realism of the game world, the interest of players and the convenience of the game. The developers are constantly working to improve the gaming experience and meet the needs of their player base, and they will certainly take into account feedback and suggestions on this issue.</p>'),
(9649, 'en-US', 'New Batch of Skins: Fresh Updates for Rust on Steam'),
(9650, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skin updates for Rust on Steam! Update your collection and add a new level of personality and aesthetics to your gameplay.'),
(9651, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, updates, game Rust, Steam, uniqueness, collection, design solutions, smell of freshness, interest, uniqueness, gaming experience, virtual world');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(9652, 'en-US', 'Welcome to the world of Rust, where every thing has its price and uniqueness! And if you are a fan of this popular game, you will probably be interested in news about the release of a fresh batch of skins.<br/><br/> Today we are happy to share with you the hottest details about the latest skin updates in the game Rust. These skins give a unique look to items and weapons, adding elements of style and personality to the virtual world.<br/><br/> Whether you\'re a collector, a player who likes to stand out from the crowd, or just appreciate updates to gaming aesthetics, the new batch of skins is sure to surprise you with their variety and beauty.<br/><br/> You have the opportunity to update your collection and add a new scent of freshness to the gameplay. Cool, isn\'t it?<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to dive into a fantastic variety of design solutions and exclusive items! Make your Rust game even more interesting and unique with the latest skins.<br/><br/> Stay tuned and stay tuned for updates as we share all the latest information about new skins in Rust to keep you in the loop.<br/><br/> Get ready for a whole new gaming experience with new Rust skins on Steam!'),
(9653, 'en-US', 'Work is underway on a new weapon'),
(9654, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new 4-shot mini crossbow coming to Rust. This weapon will change your tactics and give you more options in the fight for survival.'),
(9655, 'en-US', 'new weapon, Rust, 4-shot mini crossbow'),
(9656, 'en-US', 'The world of Rust is working on creating new and exciting weapons to give players even more options in the fight for survival. This time, the developers have prepared something special - a 4-shot mini-crossbow. Find out more about the new weapon that will change your tactical options in the game.'),
(9657, 'en-US', 'Siege weapons and structures'),
(9658, 'en-US', 'Siege weapons and structures: new elements of the raid system in the game Rust. The developers present a catapult, a siege tower, a ballista and a battering ram. The ability to transport weapons using horses and cars. Surprise - swimming wolves!'),
(9659, 'en-US', 'siege weapons, structures, developers, raids, catapult, tower, ballista, ram, transportation, horses, machines, wolves'),
(9660, 'en-US', '<p><br/>The developers of the game Rust are preparing something new for us in the raid system - siege weapons and structures.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> The following elements are under development:<br/></p><br/><ul><br/><li><br/> Catapult: Can fire regular boulders, fire and explosive charges.<br/></li><br/><li><br/> Siege tower.<br/></li><br/><li><br/> Ballista.<br/></li><br/><li><br/> Ram.<br/></li><br/></ul><br/><p><br/> Interestingly, all these siege weapons could be transported by horses or machines.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> More information is expected from the developers. And it is also worth noting that the wolves in the game will now be able to swim!<br/></p>'),
(9661, 'en-US', 'First Look: New Wolf AI'),
(9662, 'en-US', 'Meet the new Wolf AI system in Rust. The update includes improved behavior models, interactions, sounds, animations and a completely redesigned AI system for wolves.'),
(9663, 'en-US', 'First Look, New Wolf AI, Update, Behavior, Interaction, Sounds, Animations, AI System, Rust, Steam'),
(9664, 'en-US', '<h2>First Look: New Wolf AI</h2><br/><p><br/> The latest update to Rust on Steam brings a new and improved AI system for wolves. This is a great update that offers a lot of new benefits and exciting changes.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> Wolves now have new behavior patterns, making their interactions with players and the environment even more realistic. Wolves have become more intelligent and adaptive, allowing them to make a variety of decisions depending on the circumstances. They can hunt in packs, use tactics to attack players, and choose the most advantageous routes of movement.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> Not only has the wolf\'s behavior been completely reworked, but their sounds and animations have also been improved. You will now be able to hear more realistic wolf sounds that match their actions and emotions. Improved animations make the wolf\'s movements even smoother and more natural.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> The AI system for wolves has also been implemented and completely reworked. They will now be smarter and more efficient in using their skills and hunting strategies. With this update, wolves will become more dangerous and exciting opponents.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> Overall, the new Wolf AI system in Rust on Steam truly changes the gameplay and makes wolves even more colorful and realistic. Be prepared to meet intelligent and cunning wolves that will become truly worthy opponents.<br/></p>'),
(9665, 'en-US', 'Workshop skin candidates for the upcoming Halloween'),
(9666, 'en-US', 'Check out the new skins coming soon to Rust and vying for the Halloween event'),
(9667, 'en-US', 'skins, workshop, halloween'),
(9668, 'en-US', '<p>The scariest and funniest night of the year is coming soon - Halloween. And the Rust team is preparing to please players with gorgeous and exciting skins created by the Rust community. Read on to learn more about the new contenders from the workshop for the upcoming Halloween.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust Workshop is a place where talented artists upload their work and the Rust community votes for their favorite skins. This year, the developers selected the best Halloween-related works and added them to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Among the new skin contenders, you will find a variety of items that will add brightness and horror to your gaming experience. For example, you will be able to purchase scary masks, costumes and weapons that will turn you into a real Halloween monster. Be prepared for shock and surprise, because the skins are presented in a variety of styles and directions, allowing each player to choose something to their taste.</p><br/><br/><p> But don\'t forget that when choosing skins, you need to consider their impact on game balance. Each skin should be interesting and unique, but at the same time not give the player an excessive advantage over others.</p><br/><br/><p> It is also worth noting that the developers at Facepunch Studios carefully select the skins from the workshop, because they must match the theme of the game and be aesthetically pleasing. It is very important for players that the skins complement the Halloween atmosphere and fit into the story of the game, and do not violate it.</p><br/><br/><p> The community\'s contribution to the creation of skins is invaluable. It is thanks to the participation of players that Rust is constantly updated with new and high-quality content that adds variety and interest to the gameplay. It is important to remember that each skin is the result of the work and creativity of players who are happy to share their ideas and talent with the entire community.</p><br/><br/><p> So if you want to be part of the Rust community and contribute to the creation of game content, be sure to visit the Rust Workshop and upload your work. Maybe your skin will become popular and get into the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the upcoming Halloween event in the game Rust and decorate your gameplay with unique and stylish skins that will allow you to show your individuality and uniqueness.</p>'),
(9669, 'en-US', 'Discounts on RUST and DLC have started on Steam!'),
(9670, 'en-US', 'Steam has launched discounts on RUST and DLC! Hurry up to buy the game and add-on at a discount and dive into the exciting world of survival, construction and adventure.'),
(9671, 'en-US', 'Steam, discounts, RUST, DLC, survival, building, adventure, store, gaming experience'),
(9672, 'en-US', '<p>Hurry to the Steam store, because the next discounts on RUST and its downloadable add-on (DLC) have begun. If you\'ve always wanted to dive into the exciting world of survival, construction and adventure, now is the perfect time to do it!</p><br/><p> Survival in the wild and hostile environment is not easy at all, but in the game RUST you will find all these challenges. Create your base, collect resources, hunt animals, communicate with other players, create alliances or fight alone. You will have to go through many trials, but all efforts are worth it to survive and become the head of your community.</p><br/><p> And if you are already an experienced player and want to expand your gaming experience, do not miss discounts on downloadable add-ons (DLC). DLCs add new elements, items, functions or even places to the game. This is a great way to diversify the gameplay and get new emotions.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to try out RUST and its DLC at a bargain price. Don\'t forget to visit the Steam store and indulge yourself in an unforgettable adventure in the world of survival and construction. Discounts have started and are limited, so hurry up - time is limited!</p>'),
(9673, 'en-US', 'The update is out!'),
(9674, 'en-US', 'Today\'s update to Rust brings a ton of new features - a world update, new, exciting diving locations, easier wood harvesting, and more! Check out all the new features and keep playing Rust!'),
(9675, 'en-US', 'Update, Rust, world update, new features, RT, updated diving spots, logs, new DLC, NPC at the water pump, new weapons, underwater transport'),
(9676, 'en-US', 'The update is out!<br/><br/> Get ready for new adventures in the world of Rust! Today\'s update brings a lot of new features and improvements. ✅ A full-fledged world update 2.0: now you can enjoy beautiful lakes, rivers, cliffs, canyons and oases. Every corner of the map will be attractive and unique. ✅ New RT (Radio Tochka): now you will be able to communicate with other players via radio. This will open up new opportunities for cooperation and interaction. ✅ Updated diving spots: explore the underwater world and discover new secrets, look for rare resources and treasures. ✅ Logs for wood mining: make your life easier and collect wood using special logs. This will save you time and effort. ✅ New DLC (Mysterious Island): adventure to a mysterious island where new quests and exciting events await you. Explore its mysteries and uncover all its secrets. ✅ NPC at the water pump: new NPCs will be engaged in water extraction, which will add realism to the game world and create new opportunities for interaction. ✅ New weapon - High Caliber Revolver: get access to a new powerful weapon that will allow you to effectively deal with enemies and defend your territory. ✅ New type of underwater transport: dive into the depths of the sea and explore it with the help of new underwater transport. This will open up new opportunities for you and allow you to reach previously inaccessible places. Don\'t miss the chance to immerse yourself in the fascinating world of Rust with the update! Have a good wipe and have fun playing!'),
(9677, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust'),
(9678, 'en-US', 'Find out about the release of a new batch of skins in the game Rust and how they can affect the game\'s economy and player motivation.'),
(9679, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, skins in the game, influence of new skins, variety in gameplay'),
(9680, 'en-US', '<p>For those who are keen on the game Rust, fans of real survival in a post-apocalyptic world, there is good news - a new batch of skins has been released! These unique visual elements will allow you to individualize your characters and weapons, giving them your own style and distinctive features.</p><br/><p> New skins are always an interesting event, as they add variety and freshness to the gameplay. However, they can also affect the game\'s economy and player motivation.</p><br/><p> When a new batch of skins is released, it creates a wave of excitement in the player community. Each skin is a unique opportunity to stand out from other players and show your individuality. Some skins can be rare or limited edition, which makes them even more attractive to collectors and connoisseurs.</p><br/><p> However, beyond the aesthetic value, new skins can also impact the game\'s economy. The impact can be both positive and negative. New skins can attract more players who want to purchase them, causing the demand for skins to increase. This, in turn, can lead to an increase in their value on the game market.</p><br/><p> On the other hand, releasing a large number of new skins can lead to a decrease in their value. If the number of skins on the market becomes too large and demand remains the same, prices may decrease. This can be a disadvantage for those who previously purchased skins in the hopes of their price increasing.</p><br/><p> Additionally, new skins can also affect player motivation. Some players may become completely immersed in finding and acquiring new skins, trying to create the perfect set for their characters. This can keep players engaged for a long time and give them a new incentive to play.</p><br/><p> Overall, the release of a new batch of skins is an exciting event for all fans of the game Rust. It adds freshness, individuality and variety to the game world. However, it is important to remember that new skins can also have an impact on the game\'s economy and player motivation.</p>'),
(9681, 'en-US', 'New rocks on the branch - staging branch'),
(9682, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new rocks added to the Rust staging branch and what opportunities they provide for your character development.'),
(9683, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, new features, development, staging branch, rocks'),
(9684, 'en-US', 'Building the Future World in Rust'),
(9685, 'en-US', 'DPV (new water/underwater transport) news'),
(9686, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about DPV - a new water/underwater vehicle in the game Rust. Find out the final cost of the craft, its research location and the expected release date. Stay up to date with all the updates!'),
(9687, 'en-US', 'DPV, DPV news, new water transport, new underwater transport, Rust updates'),
(9688, 'en-US', 'DPV (new water/underwater transport) news<br/><br/> Want to know the latest news about DPV? Hold on, we have all the latest updates!<br/><br/> :dotred1: Final cost of crafting<br/><br/> Now to create a DPV you will need only 1 chip and 15 MVC. Getting this new water/underwater transport will now be even easier and more affordable.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Learned at the second workbench<br/><br/> In order to be able to create a DPV, you will need to research it on the second workbench. This means that you need to prepare yourself so that you have all the necessary resources and capabilities to create this amazing vehicle.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Waiting for the release on 10/03/24<br/><br/> The most interesting part is at the end! The new DPV is expected on your platform as early as 03.10.24! Very soon you will be able to experience its acceleration and maneuverability in the most dangerous water and underwater adventures.<br/><br/> Follow our updates and stay up to date with all the latest news about DPV.<br/><br/> #dpv #dpvnews #newtransport #watertransport #underwatertransport #rustupdates'),
(9689, 'en-US', 'New High Caliber Revolver Crafting Cost Update!'),
(9690, 'en-US', 'The latest Rust update changes the cost of crafting the High Caliber Revolver. Find out all the details and what compromises players had to make.'),
(9691, 'en-US', 'update, cost, revolver, high caliber, game Rust, features, challenges'),
(9692, 'en-US', '<h1>New High Caliber Revolver Crafting Cost Update!</h1><br/><p> In the latest update to the Rust game, the developers have made changes to the cost of crafting a high-caliber revolver. Now, to create this powerful weapon, you will need:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> 4 pipes</li><br/><li> 1 spring</li><br/><li> 1 gear</li><br/><li> 6 MVC</li><br/></ul><br/><p> It turns out that now it will take 1 more pipe and 1 gear to craft a high-caliber revolver than to craft a Python. However, this update has reduced the amount of MVC by 4, which will make it much easier to craft.</p><br/><p> These changes to the High Caliber Revolver crafting cost will create new challenges and opportunities for players, as you will now have to make a decision on whether to craft this weapon or use other alternatives given its increased cost.</p>'),
(9693, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: A Fresh Batch of Updates'),
(9694, 'en-US', 'Discover a new batch of skins in Rust, adding more variety, customization, and creativity to your gaming experience. Learn about the importance of balancing appearance and functionality, as well as pricing and skin selection.'),
(9695, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game, updates, weapon skins, armor skins, clothing skins, building skins, vehicle skins, individuality, skin selection, visual appeal, gameplay, balance between appearance and functionality, skin prices, creativity, self-expression'),
(9696, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the exciting world of Rust! Today we are happy to share with you information about the latest skins that have been added to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> The creators of Rust work tirelessly to ensure that players always have access to new and exciting skins. Recently, another batch of updates was released that will turn your gaming session into a real creative adventure.</p><br/><br/><p> What are skins and why are they important? Skins are visual changes to items in the game Rust. They allow you to personalize weapons, tools, clothing and other items, making them unique and distinguishable from all the others. Thanks to skins, your character can stand out among many other players in the virtual world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins has brought even more variety and opportunities for expressing individuality to the game. You will be able to find skins for different groups of items, from weapons and armor to buildings and vehicles. Bright and colorful, stylish and futuristic - skins in the game Rust will allow you to show your imagination and create a unique style in the game world.</p><br/><br/><p> However, before you dive into your new skin treasure, don\'t forget about their impact on gameplay. In Rust, the saying \"looks matter\" is true: skins can affect special stats of items, so it\'s worth paying attention to their functionality when choosing new upgrades.</p><br/><br/><p> By choosing skins wisely, you can strike a balance between visual appeal and maintaining gameplay advantages. Rust gives you the opportunity to customize the gameplay to your personal preferences.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget about the price of skins. Each skin can have its own price, and sometimes the most attractive upgrades can be quite expensive. So before buying new skins, you should carefully study their cost and decide how much you are willing to go to improve the appearance of your character or items.</p><br/><br/><p> In conclusion, the new batch of skins in the game Rust gives you ample opportunities for creativity and self-expression. Be unique, find the perfect combination of beauty and functionality, and together with other players create impressive visual images in the world of Rust. The adventure is just beginning!</p>'),
(9697, 'en-US', 'What awaits us in October?'),
(9698, 'en-US', 'Find out what new features and updates are coming to Rust in October. Frontier Hazmat DLC, World update 2.0, new weapons, Halloween content and much more!'),
(9699, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, DLC Frontier Hazmat, World update 2.0, vehicle, divers, High Caliber Revolver, Halloween, Charitable Rust, Twitch drops'),
(9700, 'en-US', '<p>October promises to be a busy month for Rust players! New features and exciting updates await you, which we will cover in detail.</p><br/><br/><h2 class=\"section-title\"> Frontier Hazmat DLC</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> Get ready to meet the new set of clothes: Frontier Hazmat!</li><br/><li> Protective suits and durable equipment for survival in dangerous conditions await you.</li><br/><li> Cast aside your fears and explore the world of Rust in a stylish new look!</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><h2 class=\"section-title\"> World update 2.0</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> Dive into the updated world of Rust with update 2.0!</li><br/><li> Enjoy improved textures, graphics and atmosphere of the game.</li><br/><li> Feel even closer to the truth of survival in a devastated world!</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><h2 class=\"section-title\"> Vehicle for divers</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> Spice up your underwater adventures with a new vehicle for divers.</li><br/><li> Explore the ocean depths quickly and easily.</li><br/><li> Contact the owners of miracle technology in the water world of Rust!</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><h2 class=\"section-title\"> High Caliber Revolver</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> Get a new weapon that will give you power and persuasiveness - High Caliber Revolver!</li><br/><li> Show your weapon skills and become invincible in battles with opponents.</li><br/><li> Upgrade your arsenal and prepare for battles that will leave their mark on Rust history!</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><h2 class=\"section-title\"> Halloween Products</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> October wouldn\'t be complete without some festive events! Get ready for Halloween in Rust.</li><br/><li> Expect new items, costumes and decorations created especially for this mysterious time of year.</li><br/><li> Decorate your stay in the world of Rust in the spirit of Halloween!</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><h2 class=\"section-title\"> Charitable Rust / Twitch drops</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> Participate in charity by joining the Charitable Rust event.</li><br/><li> Support important causes by playing Rust.</li><br/><li> Also get exclusive items through Twitch drops.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> October in Rust will be full of new features, items and events. Get ready for exciting gameplay and Halloween celebrations with other players!</p>'),
(9701, 'en-US', 'The date of the new 34th round of Twitch Drops has been announced!'),
(9702, 'en-US', 'Details have been revealed for the upcoming 34th round of Twitch Drops! Get four awesome skins and support charity.'),
(9703, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Round 34, Date, Skins, Charity, News'),
(9704, 'en-US', 'Details about the upcoming 34th round of Twitch Drops have been revealed!'),
(9705, 'en-US', 'Update for High Caliber Revolver!'),
(9706, 'en-US', 'High Caliber Revolver Update! In this update, we\'ve made some changes to the stats and ammo type of the High Caliber Revolver to make it an even stronger weapon in Rust.'),
(9707, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, High Caliber Revolver, weapons, characteristics'),
(9708, 'en-US', 'Update for High Caliber Revolver!<br/><br/> ✅ In this update, we\'ve made some changes to the High Caliber Revolver (HCR) to make it an even stronger weapon. The HCR now has higher damage, accuracy, and range than the Python (though its rate of fire remains lower).<br/> ✅ In addition, we have changed the type of ammunition used. Now the High Caliber Revolver uses 5.56 Rifle Ammo, which makes it even more effective on the battlefield.'),
(9709, 'en-US', 'Two new creepy skins for Halloween!'),
(9710, 'en-US', 'Rust is getting two new spooky skins for Halloween - Frankenstein Mask and Mummy Mask. Find out more about them and how to get them!'),
(9711, 'en-US', 'Halloween, Skins, Frankenstein Mask, Mummy Mask, Dracula Mask, Shop, Rust'),
(9712, 'en-US', '<p>Halloween is coming soon, and the developers of the game Rust decided to please their players with two new creepy skins!</p><br/><br/><p> The first skin is the Frankenstein Mask. This mask will make you feel like a real monster maker during the game. Made from various metal parts, this mask looks really creepy!</p><br/><br/><p> The second skin is the Mummy Mask. It will bring the atmosphere of ancient curses and mysteries to your adventures in Rust. The injured character with this mask will look like a revived mummified corpse!</p><br/><br/><p> Both new skins have the same characteristics as the famous Dracula Mask. But unlike the Dracula Mask, these skins will only be available during Halloween and will most likely be paid in the game store.</p><br/><br/><p> Get ready for Halloween with new spooky skins in the game Rust and create a unique look for your character!</p>'),
(9713, 'en-US', 'New Blunderbuss DB and Frontier Hatchet Skins in Frontier Pack DLC'),
(9714, 'en-US', 'The new Rust DLC called Frontier Pack will feature new skins Blunderbuss DB and Frontier Hatchet. Diversify your game collection and highlight your individual style!'),
(9715, 'en-US', 'new skins, Blunderbuss DB, Frontier Hatchet, DLC Frontier Pack, Rust'),
(9716, 'en-US', '<p>The new Rust DLC called Frontier Pack not only brings new items, but also the classic Blunderbuss DB and Frontier Hatchet in new skins!</p><br/><p> This update will please all fans of the game, because colorful and stylish skins will give your game items a unique look. The new Blunderbuss DB and Frontier Hatchet skins will be a great addition to your collection.</p><br/><p> Blunderbuss DB is a legendary shotgun that can now be transformed into a weapon with a unique design. You will be able to stand out from other players and show your style, because Blunderbuss DB in the new skin will become a real work of art.</p><br/><p> The Frontier Hatchet is an essential tool in Rust that can now also be dressed up in a stylish way. Forget about boring and ordinary tools - the new Frontier Hatchet skin will make your work much more interesting.</p><br/><p> Each of these skins in the Frontier Pack DLC is designed with detail and original elements to add more variety to your game collection, allowing you to express your individuality and create a unique look in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> If you are looking for a way to diversify your gameplay and add new elements to your collection, then the Frontier Pack DLC with Blunderbuss DB and Frontier Hatchet skins is a great solution for you. Don\'t miss the opportunity to become unique in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(9717, 'en-US', 'Changing the barricades'),
(9718, 'en-US', 'Changes to the barricades in the game Rust. Removing the imba skin and adding a new one without transparent elements. The decision on returning will depend on feedback and opinion of the community.'),
(9719, 'en-US', 'Rust, barricades, changes, skin, balancing, feedback, community'),
(9720, 'en-US', 'Dear players! We want to share with you the news about changes concerning barricades in the game Rust. During the balancing, the developers came to the conclusion that the current barricade skin is too powerful, which creates some imbalance in the game. Therefore, it was decided to temporarily remove it from sale and add a new skin without transparent elements. At the moment, it is unknown whether the skin in the inventory will change, but we will monitor the development of the situation.<br/><br/> We understand that the issue of returning the skin is important to many players. The final decision on returning the skin will be made based on the feedback and opinion of our community. We value your opinion and are open to discussions. Your participation in shaping our game trajectory is very important to us.<br/><br/> With these changes, we aim to ensure balance and fairness for all players so that everyone can enjoy playing Rust and have a fun gameplay experience without any negative impacts.<br/><br/> Thank you for your understanding and support! Follow our news to stay up to date with all the updates and changes in the world of Rust.'),
(9721, 'en-US', 'New Barricade Skin in Rust: A Convenient Obstacle or an Unreasonable Advantage?'),
(9722, 'en-US', 'A new article discusses the new barricade skin added to the game Rust, which has caused a variety of opinions among players. The article examines the functional features of the skin, as well as the issues associated with its impact on the balance of the game.'),
(9723, 'en-US', 'new skin, barricade, game, Rust, advantage, balance, opinion, players'),
(9724, 'en-US', 'A new barricade skin was recently added to Rust, which has received mixed reviews from players. The skin is an upgraded version of the standard barricade, and many players believe that it has unfair advantages. However, as always, there are two sides to the coin.'),
(9725, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has been released'),
(9726, 'en-US', 'Greetings, dear Rust players! Check out the new batch of skins in the game Rust on the Steam platform and choose stylish covers for your items. The article discusses factors that influence the choice of skins, such as cost, properties, playstyle and popularity among players. Consider all these factors to create a unique image of your character in the game Rust.'),
(9727, 'en-US', 'skins, new batch, Rust, Steam, choice, cost, properties, popularity, store, update, game preferences'),
(9728, 'en-US', '<p>Greetings, dear Rust players! We are happy to share the good news - a new batch of skins has appeared in the game Rust on the Steam platform! This means that you now have the opportunity to decorate your items with beautiful and stylish shells. New skins not only add aesthetic pleasure to the game, but also allow you to stand out from other players and create a unique image of your character.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins is a wide range of different covers for your weapons, tools, clothes and items in the game. You will be able to find a variety of styles and designs to highlight your individuality and taste. From classic and stylish covers to bright and original ones - the choice is yours!</p><br/><p> However, before making your choice, it is worth considering several key factors that affect the skins in the game Rust. First, you should evaluate their cost. Each skin has its own price, which can vary depending on popularity, rarity and level of demand. Keep in mind that some skins can be quite expensive, so before buying, you should carefully consider your financial capabilities.</p><br/><p> An important factor is also the compliance of skins with your style of play. Do not forget that along with the aesthetic aspect, skins also affect the game mechanics. Some skins not only change the appearance of items, but also provide additional bonuses or improvements. When choosing skins, pay attention to their properties and compatibility with your gaming preferences.</p><br/><p> It is also important to pay attention to trends and popularity of skins among players. The game Rust is constantly updated and developed, so skins that are relevant and popular today may become outdated tomorrow. Look at reviews and feedback from other players, study current trends and find out which skins are most in demand at the moment.</p><br/><p> Ultimately, choosing skins in Rust is a compromise between cost, playstyle, properties, and popularity. Consider all these factors to make the most informed choice and create a unique image of your character.</p><br/><p> Don\'t waste time, visit the skins store in the game Rust on the Steam platform and update your collection with beautiful and stylish items! Happy shopping and enjoy the game!</p>'),
(9729, 'en-US', 'Developers Confirm Release - World Update 2'),
(9730, 'en-US', 'This article confirms the release of World Update 2.0 for Rust. Find out about the new features and changes that await you on October 3.'),
(9731, 'en-US', 'World Update 2.0, Rust update, Rust news, Rust game on Steam'),
(9732, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for all fans of the game Rust! The developers have officially confirmed that World Update 2.0 will be released on October 3. This long-awaited update promises to bring many new features and changes to the game world.</p><br/><br/><p> World Update 2.0 is the result of the titanic work of the development team, which strives to make the game even better. The new update will bring with it bug fixes, improved optimization and new features for players. You can expect great visual updates, balance fixes and gameplay improvements.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main features of World Update 2.0 will be the addition of new locations and content to the game. You will be able to explore uncharted territories, find valuable resources and build your base in the most dangerous zone of Rust. This will open up new strategic opportunities for you and add depth to the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, the developers have tried to take into account the comments and suggestions of the player community. The game will be better adapted to the gameplay on servers, which will improve the quality and smoothness of the online game. New settings and tools will be introduced to improve the gaming experience and cooperation with other players.</p><br/><br/><p> The system of protecting players from fraud and griefing has also been improved. Additional security measures will be introduced to ensure fair and honest conditions for all participants in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> World Update 2.0 is a major update that will change the game world of Rust. We are looking forward to October 3rd to experience all the new features and enjoy the updated gameplay. Stay tuned and get ready for exciting adventures in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(9733, 'en-US', 'Are you waiting for new weapons in RUST?'),
(9734, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new weapon in the game RUST - The High Caliber Revolver. Description of its statistics, features and video review.'),
(9735, 'en-US', 'new weapons, The High Caliber Revolver, updates, RUST, video review'),
(9736, 'en-US', '<p>New weapons are coming to RUST soon! Here\'s what you need to know about them.</p><br/><p> It\'s impossible to hold back your emotions anymore, because here is The High Caliber Revolver - a new weapon that will exceed all your expectations! Let\'s take a look at its stats.</p><br/><p> Anyone who follows the game updates probably knows that The High Caliber Revolver is a large-caliber revolver that will add new capabilities in fighting enemies and defending the base.</p><br/><p> This weapon has unique characteristics such as power and accuracy of shots. It also has a special design that gives it a unique style.</p><br/><p> In addition, The High Caliber Revolver will have various modifications and upgrades so that you can customize it to your needs and preferences.</p><br/><p> To help you visualize this weapon, we have prepared a video review that shows its stats and features. We assure you that after watching the video, you will not be able to wait to try The High Caliber Revolver for yourself!</p>'),
(9737, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has been released ❤️'),
(9738, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new batch of awesome skins on Steam. Find out how to update your look and stay up to date with all the latest news and updates in the game.'),
(9739, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, Steam, updates, news, game, weapons, clothes, market, epic skins'),
(9740, 'en-US', 'Gorgeous new skins are now available in Rust on Steam! You can update your look with the most stylish and beautiful skins on the market. From weapons to clothing, go ahead and choose the most epic and original options to stand out from the rest of the players. Our new batch of skins is simply amazing.<br/><br/> Subscribe to our newsletter and be the first to know about all the updates and events in the world of the game Rust. You don’t want to miss the opportunity to get new skins and be up to date with the latest news, right? Join us and be in the center of the hottest events! ❤️'),
(9741, 'en-US', 'First look at the updated rocks from the old RUST'),
(9742, 'en-US', 'Learn more about the most powerful and unique rocks in the world of Rust - the God Rock, the Hammer and the Arch. First look at the updated rocks from the old version of Rust.'),
(9743, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust updates, Rust rocks, God rock, Hammer, Arch'),
(9744, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will talk about the new, updated rocks from the old version of the game Rust. Get ready to learn more about the most powerful and unique weapons in the world of Rust - the God Rock, the Hammer and the Arch. Here you will find their features and capabilities. Get ready for an exciting and unpredictable first look at these updated rocks, which confidently take their place in this game.'),
(9745, 'en-US', 'Wallpaper on the outside of a building block in Rust'),
(9746, 'en-US', 'This article discusses the ability to apply wallpaper to the outside of a building block in Rust, provided that it is inside a building. It also discusses floor and ceiling tests, as well as the addition of new parquet and tile placeholders.'),
(9747, 'en-US', 'wallpaper, building block, Rust, updates, tests, templates, parquet, tiles'),
(9748, 'en-US', 'Wallpaper in Rust can be placed on the outside of a building block, but only inside the building. This means that if the wallpaper is outside, it will be automatically removed.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Tests have been carried out on floor and ceiling coverings.<br/> :dotred1: New placeholder templates for parquet and tiles are being introduced.<br/><br/> If you don\'t have enough wallpapers, don\'t worry - more interesting and useful content is in development.'),
(9749, 'en-US', 'The good old \"God Rock\" and \"Anvil Rock\" are back!'),
(9750, 'en-US', 'The good old \"God Rock\" and \"Anvil Rock\" are back! Find out all the details about this update in the article.'),
(9751, 'en-US', 'God Rock, Anvil Rock, update, Rust, features, adventures'),
(9752, 'en-US', '<p>Yay! Rust\'s update brings back the good old \"God Rocks\" and \"Anvil Rocks\"! :dotred1:</p><br/><p> The development team confirmed that they have recreated these legendary elements of the game. Now we will be able to build special bases in unforgettable locations again!</p><br/><p> Do you remember those colossal rocks that allowed us to create impregnable fortifications? Now they are returning to revive our old memories.</p><br/><p> Those who have played Rust since the days when God Rock and Anvil Rock were available will probably be happy to see these elements restored. And newcomers will have a lot to see and learn, too!</p><br/><p> Exciting adventures in new locations await us, and old fans can feel nostalgic and return to those strategies that attracted them in the past.</p><br/><p> Can\'t wait to build an impenetrable base on \"God Rock\" or \"Anvil Rock\"? Then update your game now and dive into the world of Rust, full of possibilities and adventures!</p>'),
(9753, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Added a Trader and a New Location - a Water Pump'),
(9754, 'en-US', 'A merchant and a new location, a water pump, have been added to the Rust test branch. Find out more about the assortment of goods and the merchant\'s respawn time in the update!'),
(9755, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, merchant, location, water pump, respawn, video, assortment, possibilities'),
(9756, 'en-US', '<p>An update was released for the test branch of the game Rust, which added a long-awaited merchant and a new location - a water pump.</p><br/><p> :dotred1: In the video provided by the developers, you can find out details about the goods that the merchant will offer. Please note that the assortment may change.</p><br/><p> :dotred1: Now, after death, the merchant\'s respawn time is from 30 to 60 minutes.</p><br/><p> This update adds new features to Rust and allows players to interact with a merchant in a new and interesting location. Don\'t miss your chance to visit the water pump and see what this merchant has to offer!</p>'),
(9757, 'en-US', 'World Update | Map Generation Changes'),
(9758, 'en-US', 'Check out the biggest update of the year in the game Rust - World Update. In this article, we will tell you about significant changes in the generation of world maps and offer you the opportunity to test all the innovations first.'),
(9759, 'en-US', 'World Update, Map Generation Changes, update, map generation, Rust, testing'),
(9760, 'en-US', 'The biggest update of the year is now available for testing! Our development team has made significant changes to world map generation in Rust, and we want you to be the first to experience all the innovations. Find out more about the global update and what changes await you.'),
(9761, 'en-US', 'Wallpaper in the RUST store'),
(9762, 'en-US', 'Decorate your virtual home in the RUST game with beautiful wallpapers from the store'),
(9763, 'en-US', 'wallpaper, shop, RUST, virtual home'),
(9764, 'en-US', 'Unusual wallpapers for your virtual home in the game RUST'),
(9765, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Collection Update'),
(9766, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has been released in the game Rust on the Steam platform! This update significantly expands the collection of available skins for players and offers them many options for personalizing their characters, weapons and buildings.'),
(9767, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game, skin collection update, personalization, visual elements, skin selection, skin benefits, financial aspect, unique image, game relevance'),
(9768, 'en-US', '<p>A new batch of skins has been released in the popular game Rust on the Steam platform! This update significantly expands the collection of skins available to players, offering them even more options for personalizing their characters, weapons and buildings.</p><br/><p> New skins are visual elements that allow players to change the appearance of their objects in the game by adding new textures, colors, and decorative elements. Over time, developers constantly release new skins to keep the game fresh and interesting for players.</p><br/><p> The Rust skin collection update offers players a variety of options to express their individuality and create a unique style. The new skins feature a variety of graphics, color combinations, and detailed patterns that add new visual options to the game.</p><br/><p> However, choosing skins is not just a matter of aesthetics. Some skins can affect gameplay by giving players certain advantages or changing the characteristics of items. For example, a weapon skin can affect reload speed or firing range, while an armor skin can increase protection against certain types of damage.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that when choosing and using skins, players should consider not only their visual preferences, but also possible trade-offs. For example, skins with brighter colors may be noticeable against the environment and attract the attention of other players, which can be both an advantage and a disadvantage depending on the situation.</p><br/><p> Also, it is worth considering the financial aspect of choosing skins. Some skins may only be available for a certain price, so players need to evaluate their options and decide how important it is for them to have a certain skin in the game.</p><br/><p> Updating the skin collection in the Rust game is not only a chance for players to express their individuality and create a unique image, but also a great opportunity for developers to maintain interest in the game and keep it relevant.</p><br/><p> So, if you are a fan of the Rust game, don\'t miss this update and update your skin collection right now!</p>'),
(9769, 'en-US', 'Added new monument - Toxic Village in Rust'),
(9770, 'en-US', 'A new monument has been added to the test branch - Toxic Village. Read the article and learn more about this new update to the Rust game!'),
(9771, 'en-US', 'game Rust, game update Rust, new monument, Toxic Village'),
(9772, 'en-US', '<p>Rust Game Update: New Monument Appears on Test Branch</p><br/><p> There is a new update in the development of the game Rust that will interest all players. A new monument called \"Toxic Village\" has been added to the test branch. This is another change that players have been eagerly awaiting.</p><br/><p> Toxic Village is a unique settlement that embodies danger and adventure. Here, players will be able to immerse themselves in an atmosphere of chaos and risk, exploring the mysterious corners of this gloomy place. But be careful, because Toxic Village is filled with toxic air and dangers.</p><br/><p> Adding a new monument to the game Rust is a significant step in the development of gameplay. The developers continue to please players with updates that make the game more exciting and interesting.</p><br/><p> The game Rust has long been popular among players around the world. With new features and content regularly added, the game never ceases to delight its fans and attract new players. The addition of Toxic Village is another piece in the world of Rust that will make the game even more exciting.</p>'),
(9773, 'en-US', 'Diving Sites &amp; Buoys - 3 new places for diving enthusiasts'),
(9774, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam has three new diving locations - sunken planes, mysterious skeletons and a habitat for sea life. Explore history and nature, uncover secrets and enjoy the beauty of the underwater world.'),
(9775, 'en-US', 'Diving Sites, Buoys, new places, diving, underwater adventures, planes, skeletons, sea life, Rust game on Steam'),
(9776, 'en-US', '<h2>Diving Sites &amp; Buoys - 3 new places for diving enthusiasts</h2><br/><p> Get ready for an exciting underwater adventure! Rust on Steam has three new unique diving spots where you can encounter planes on the bottom, crabs, skeletons, starfish and many other amazing inhabitants of the sea depths.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Sunken Planes: Past wars have left their mark on the seabed, and now you can explore sunken planes. Exciting adventures await you as you dive into history and nature.</li><br/><li> Mysterious Skeletons: Experience the thrill of encountering mysterious skeletons that hide many mysteries and secrets. Try to uncover their secrets and find out what happened to these unknown creatures.</li><br/><li> Marine Life: New buoys replace old bottles and create a home for a variety of marine life. See colorful fish, vibrant starfish, and other interesting creatures that will make your dive memorable.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> Dive into a unique world of underwater adventures and discover new places full of mystery and beauty. Get ready for magnificent views and exciting encounters with marine life in the game Rust on Steam.</p>'),
(9777, 'en-US', 'New skins for Twitch Drops in Rust are available from September 10th!'),
(9778, 'en-US', 'Check out the first batch of skins for the upcoming Twitch Drops in Rust, available September 10th.'),
(9779, 'en-US', 'new skins, twitch drops, Rust, september 10'),
(9780, 'en-US', 'The first batch of skins for the upcoming Twitch Drops will be available to players on September 10. No other skins have been confirmed at this time, but based on previous RIVALS events, we can expect more to come.'),
(9781, 'en-US', 'List of upcoming Twitch Drops - RIVALS!'),
(9782, 'en-US', 'List of streamers for the upcoming Twitch Drops - RIVALS!.'),
(9783, 'en-US', 'streamers, Twitch Drops, RIVALS!, list, start date'),
(9784, 'en-US', '<p>Here\'s a list of streamers participating in the upcoming Twitch Drops - RIVALS!</p><br/><p> Start date: September 10, 2024.</p><br/><p> Unfortunately, at the moment we cannot show the skins, as we do not have exact information.</p><br/><p> We don\'t want to guess whether a certain skin will be available in drops.</p><br/><p> As soon as we have more accurate information, we will share it immediately!</p>'),
(9785, 'en-US', 'Introducing the new Rust Frontier Hazmat (not final version)'),
(9786, 'en-US', 'Introducing the new Frontier Hazmat model in Rust. Learn about the unique design and characteristics of this model, as well as possible changes in its development.'),
(9787, 'en-US', 'Rust, Frontier Hazmat, model, development, design, characteristics, updates'),
(9788, 'en-US', 'In this article we will talk about a new model in the game Rust - Frontier Hazmat. This model, although in development and not the final version, is already causing great interest among players and discussions in the community.<br/><br/> Let\'s take a closer look at what Frontier Hazmat is and what changes it will bring to the game. Firstly, the model was recently discovered in the AUX02 server files, which suggests that the developers are actively working on its implementation.<br/><br/> Frontier Hazmat has the potential to become one of the most sought after items in the game. Its unique design and stats make it appealing to players of all playstyles, from explorers to warriors.<br/><br/> However, it is worth noting that the current model of Frontier Hazmat is not the final version and may be subject to changes in the further development of the game. The developers always strive to improve and balance the gameplay, so minor changes in the design and characteristics of the model are possible.<br/><br/> We\'ll be keeping a close eye on news and updates regarding Frontier Hazmat in Rust to keep you informed of any changes and additions. Stay tuned to stay up to date with all the latest happenings in the world of Rust!'),
(9789, 'en-US', 'New weapon module - GCO (Gas Compression Overdrive Attachment)'),
(9790, 'en-US', 'A new weapon attachment, GCO (Gas Compression Overdrive Attachment), has been added to the test branch with its own stats. Find out what impact it can have on your weapon\'s effectiveness in Rust and whether it will make you think twice about using it.'),
(9791, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, GCO, Gas Compression Overdrive Attachment, weapon, stats, damage, speed, shooting, recoil');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(9792, 'en-US', '<p>A new weapon upgrade has been added to the test branch - Gas Compression Overdrive Attachment (GCO). This module is designed to improve the effectiveness of the weapon by changing its characteristics.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>Stats:</b></p><br/><ul><br/><li> Increase damage by 20%.</li><br/><li> Increases projectile speed by 30%.</li><br/><li> Reduces rate of fire by 20%.</li><br/><li> Increased return by 10%.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> Adding a GCO module can significantly impact the effectiveness of a weapon in Rust. Increasing damage and projectile speed can make a weapon more lethal, but reducing the rate of fire and increasing recoil can create certain limitations and make it difficult to control the weapon.</p><br/><br/><p> Therefore, players should consider whether to use the GCO module on their weapons. It can be useful in certain situations, but it requires skill and ability to wield the weapon.</p>'),
(9793, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins this week'),
(9794, 'en-US', 'Find out all about this week\'s new batch of skins in Rust on Steam. Update your collection and add a new originality to your gaming experience!'),
(9795, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, Steam, fashion, cosmetics'),
(9796, 'en-US', 'Welcome to all Rust fans on Steam! Today we are happy to share with you the latest news - a new batch of skins has been released for this week! If you have been playing Rust for a long time, you know that skins are unique cosmetic items that allow you to add an original and unique look to your character or items in the game. And now we have even more opportunities for your creative experiments!<br/><br/> Each new batch of skins is a real event in the world of Rust, and players always look forward to it. After all, it is an opportunity to update your wardrobe and stand out from other players. This week\'s new batch of skins is no exception - it embodies the most current and interesting trends in the world of Rust fashion.<br/><br/> We invite you to check out the new skins and choose the ones that suit you. Now you have the opportunity to turn your ordinary item into a real work of art. Original skins allow you to add personality to your gaming experience and make it even more exciting.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget that all skins in Rust are created by the community - players who share their creative ideas and give unique items for everyone. Every time you buy a skin, you support these talented developers and help them continue to make our game even better.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection and make your Rust experience even more colorful and interesting. Check out the Steam store and find out about all the new skins this week!<br/><br/> <b>Skins are more than just cosmetics. They are a way to express yourself and add uniqueness to your gameplay. Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your look and make other players jealous of your stylish items!</b>'),
(9797, 'en-US', 'New stylish skin for sleeping bag in the game Rust on Steam'),
(9798, 'en-US', 'Find out more about the new stylish skin for the sleeping bag in the game Rust in the Steam Workshop. Create a cozy atmosphere in the summer biome and add an unusual item to your collection.'),
(9799, 'en-US', 'skin, sleeping bag, game Rust, Steam Workshop, stylish, unique'),
(9800, 'en-US', '<p>We have a great find on the Steam Workshop - a new sleeping bag skin called \"Grass | Sleeping Bag [Stone Pillow]\". This skin will bring a new style and aesthetic to your base in Rust.</p><br/><p> :sparkles: I am sure that this skin will be the best choice for your summer biome! With its bright green coloring, it will perfectly complement your interior, bringing coziness and a feeling of unity with nature.</p><br/><p> Now you can enjoy the comfort of sleeping on a stylish and unique sleeping bag. Want to have such an unusual item? You just need to visit the Steam Workshop and purchase this cool skin.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to add new dimensions to your gaming collection and create a unique image in the world of Rust.</p>'),
(9801, 'en-US', 'We mention...'),
(9802, 'en-US', 'A look at the latest Rust update, which removes the glow-in-the-dark Glowboard A and B wallpapers from the game.'),
(9803, 'en-US', 'Glow in the Dark Wallpaper, Remove, Rust'),
(9804, 'en-US', 'Glow-in-the-Dark Wallpaper Removed From Rust'),
(9805, 'en-US', 'New skin - Frog Wellingtons!'),
(9806, 'en-US', 'A new skin has appeared in the game Rust - Frog Wellingtons! Now you can buy this unique skin for your boots and emphasize your individuality! Buy boots from Wellipets and get a new skin Frog Wellingtons! Link to purchase in the comments.'),
(9807, 'en-US', 'new skin, Frog Wellingtons, Rust game, boots, Wellipets, skin purchase'),
(9808, 'en-US', '<p>A new skin has appeared in the game Rust - Frog Wellingtons!</p><br/><p> Now you can purchase this unique skin for your boots in the game. Frog Wellingtons will add a unique look to your character, make him stand out in the crowd and emphasize your individuality.</p><br/><p> To get the Frog Wellingtons, you need to purchase the Wellipets boots, which cost £150 (approximately 18,000 rubles). This skin gives you the ability to turn your regular boots into stylish and colorful Frog Wellingtons.</p><br/><p> Link to purchase boots and Frog Wellingtons skin is available in the comments to the post. Hurry, quantity is limited!</p>'),
(9809, 'en-US', 'New Skin for Carpet in Rust: Charcoal Stories Rug by Veys'),
(9810, 'en-US', 'Charcoal Stories Rug is a stylish new rug skin for Rust by Veys. Give your base a new level of uniqueness.'),
(9811, 'en-US', 'new skin, carpet, Charcoal Stories Rug, Veys, game Rust'),
(9812, 'en-US', '<p>Recently, a stunning new carpet skin for Rust was added to the Steam Workshop - Charcoal Stories Rug by the talented author Veys. This stylish and original design will be able to transform your base and make it truly unique.</p><br/><p> Charcoal Stories Rug is not just a rug, it is a real work of art. It is made in dark shades of coal and painted with patterns that create a mysterious atmosphere. This skin will perfectly fit into any style of gameplay and will add a touch of elegance and sophistication to your base.</p><br/><p> If you want to create a unique atmosphere in the game Rust or just want to diversify your interiors, then the Charcoal Stories Rug is exactly what you need. Can you already imagine how the carpet will become the central element of your base, attracting the attention of everyone who enters your shelter?</p><br/><p> To purchase the Charcoal Stories Rug, you need to visit the Steam Workshop. There you will find this skin, as well as many other unique designs and items for your base in the game Rust. Do not miss the opportunity to decorate your space and make it truly unique.</p><br/><p> Don\'t wait any longer, visit the Steam Workshop now and discover a world of possibilities for customizing your base in Rust.</p>'),
(9813, 'en-US', 'The developers showed the final screenshots of lakes, oases and canyons in the game!'),
(9814, 'en-US', 'Rust developers on Steam presented the final screenshots of lakes, oases and canyons. Work has begun on improving navigation using bridges. Stay tuned and subscribe to Rust news!'),
(9815, 'en-US', 'Developers, screenshots, lakes, oases, canyons, bridges, navigation, updates, game Rust'),
(9816, 'en-US', '<p>The developers of the game Rust on Steam have delighted fans with new final screenshots that allow us to take a look into the world of lakes, oases and canyons.</p><br/><p> The images provided show breathtaking landscapes and unique places that amaze with their beauty and diversity. Lakes, majestic canyons and secluded oases create an atmosphere of adventure and exploration.</p><br/><p> In addition, the developers also announced the start of work on improving navigation. Bridges are being developed that will allow players to move more conveniently around the world of Rust. This will significantly facilitate travel and open up new possibilities for the gaming experience.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow the updates and subscribe to the news of the game Rust, because there is still a lot of interesting things ahead!</p>'),
(9817, 'en-US', 'Welcome to the world of Rust, where each week brings a fresh batch of unique skins to the game. Check out this week\'s new batch of skins and see the variety of skins included. Refresh the look of your Rust experience and support the game\'s developers.'),
(9818, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, new batch, update, game collection'),
(9819, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust, where each week brings a fresh batch of unique skins to the game. We are pleased to inform you about a new batch of skins this week that will not leave any player indifferent. Let\'s take a look at the details and variety of skins presented in this batch.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins are a great way to add some personality and style to your gaming collection. They can change the appearance of your character, weapons, items, and even your base. Creating a unique and distinctive look is not only fun, but it also allows you to stand out from other players.</p><br/><br/><p> This week\'s new batch of skins features a variety of options for all in-game elements, from weapons to cosmetics. Pick the skin that suits you best and enjoy the updated look of your inventory.</p><br/><br/><p> It\'s important to note that new skins in Rust aren\'t just a way to change the look of your character or items. They\'re also a way to support the game\'s developers. By purchasing skins, you help fund the continued development and improvement of the game, as well as support an active and diverse player community.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow the updates to stay up to date with all the new skins added to the game. Each new batch offers exciting and colorful options that will complement your gaming history and give you new emotions from the game.</p><br/><br/><p> So don’t miss the opportunity to transform your gaming atmosphere and dive into the world of Rust with this week’s new batch of skins. Add some style and personality to your game, enjoy the updated visuals and support the game’s developers at the same time. There are plenty of options to choose from to make your Rust experience even more colorful and exciting!</p>'),
(9820, 'en-US', 'Update: Working on the fire extinguisher and cabinet!'),
(9821, 'en-US', 'Work has begun on a fire extinguisher and a locker for it in Rust. Find out more about this update and stay up to date with the latest news on the game.'),
(9822, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, fire extinguisher, locker, functionality, news'),
(9823, 'en-US', '<p>Work on new items has been launched in the game Rust - a fire extinguisher and a cabinet for it. These items will allow players to protect their buildings from possible fire.</p><br/><p> Still in development, but already known:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Added model of cabinet with fire extinguisher</li><br/><li> Textures added</li><br/></ul><br/><p> There is no information about specific functionality yet, but the developers are monitoring updates to share news soon.</p><br/><p> If you are interested in updates and news about the game Rust, don\'t forget to subscribe to our newsletter!</p>'),
(9824, 'en-US', 'New Rivers (World Renewal)'),
(9825, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new update to the Rust game world - rivers have been added that require bridges to cross roads and rails on the Aux2 map.'),
(9826, 'en-US', 'New Rivers, World Update, Rust, Developers, Map, Aux2, Crossing, Roads, Rails, Bridges'),
(9827, 'en-US', '<p>After adding lakes and canyons, the developers of the game Rust delight us with a new update - rivers!</p><br/><p> On the Aux2 map you can already see how the rivers stretch deep into the world, giving it even more realism and beauty.</p><br/><p> However, the question of crossing rivers with roads and rails arises. Here you will have to show your construction skills and you may have to build several bridges to ensure easy movement around the game world.</p>'),
(9828, 'en-US', '16 types of wallpapers have been added to RUST'),
(9829, 'en-US', 'The world of RUST has 16 unique types of wallpaper to decorate the base. One of the most exciting innovations is the Glowboard wallpaper, which glows in the dark.'),
(9830, 'en-US', 'RUST, wallpaper, new, design, base, gameplay, developers, Glowboard wallpaper'),
(9831, 'en-US', '<p>There is an innovation in the world of RUST that will definitely please all fans of the game! Now the game has 16 unique types of wallpapers to decorate your bases. This update is simply incredible!</p><br/><p> Each of the 16 wallpapers has its own style and design to suit the different tastes and preferences of players. No longer limited to plain walls, now you can create a real masterpiece in your base!</p><br/><p> One of the most fantastic innovations is the Glowboard wallpaper. This wallpaper can glow in the dark, creating a mesmerizing atmosphere and making your base even more unique. You will be delighted by how simple walls can be transformed into real works of art with the help of Glowboard wallpaper!</p><br/><p> The game RUST once again proves that the developers are constantly working to improve the gameplay and take into account the wishes of the players. All you need to do is update and enjoy new opportunities to decorate your base in RUST!</p>'),
(9832, 'en-US', 'News from the fields'),
(9833, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest updates to Rust, including the ability to recolor your wallpaper and an updated digital clock design!'),
(9834, 'en-US', 'news, updates, Rust, repaint wallpaper, digital clock design'),
(9835, 'en-US', '<h2>Rust Updates: Wallpaper Changes and Updated Digital Clock Design!</h2><br/><p> Dear players, we have some great news from the world of Rust! The latest update has made some significant changes that we want to share with you.</p><br/><p> The first thing worth mentioning is the new feature that allows you to repaint the wallpaper in your game house. Now you can add a bit of freshness and personality to your interiors using a special spray paint. Pick your favorite color and decorate your walls the way you like!</p><br/><p> The second major change concerns the design of the digital clock in the game. Now you can enjoy an updated model and a new stylish font that will add intrigue to your work or gaming process. Be aware of the time in style and create a unique style for your space.</p><br/><p> We are confident that these updates will add a bit of freshness and variety to your gaming experience. It also opens the door to creative and interesting design solutions that you can implement. Let your imagination know no bounds!</p><br/><p> Follow our news and stay up to date with all the updates and improvements in the game Rust! Happy gaming!</p>'),
(9836, 'en-US', 'The date for the new round of Twitch Drops Rivals (Round 33) has been announced'),
(9837, 'en-US', 'Find out the date of the new round of Twitch Drops Rivals (Round 33) for the game Rust on Steam. Starts September 10. Don\'t miss the opportunity to get unique skins!'),
(9838, 'en-US', 'new round date, Twitch Drops Rivals, Round 33, Rust, Steam, skins, start, September 10'),
(9839, 'en-US', 'Find out the start date of the next round of Twitch Drops Rivals (Round 33) so you don\'t miss your chance to get unique skins for the game Rust on Steam! The new round starts on September 10. Details below.'),
(9840, 'en-US', 'Check out the exciting new batch of skins that have landed in Rust this week. Discover the unique designs, practicality, and creative possibilities these new skins offer.'),
(9841, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, update, design, individuality, unique animations, sound effects, marketplace'),
(9842, 'en-US', 'Welcome to the world of Rust, where each week brings a new batch of exciting skins to the game! In this article, we will tell you about the fresh batch of skins that have arrived in the game this week. Get ready for amazing new weapon designs, exciting outfits, and more!<br/><br/> Skins are visual upgrades that allow you to change the appearance of items in the game Rust. Every week, the game developers release a new batch of skins to give a fresh look to the things you use in your adventures. New skins can change the appearance of your weapons, tools, building boards, and even your clothes.<br/><br/> The design of the new skins this week is simply stunning. The Rust developers put all their skill into creating unique and stylish variations so that you can stand out from other players. The new skins represent a variety of styles - from post-apocalyptic industrial to bright and colorful. You will definitely find something that suits your taste!<br/><br/> Like everything in Rust, the new skins are not only aesthetically pleasing but also practical. They can be collected or purchased through the Steam Marketplace. Each skin offers unique animations, sound effects, and special details that will add a little variety to your game.<br/><br/> New skins also open up the possibility for creativity and self-expression. You can create unique combinations of skins for your weapons and equipment to reflect your style and personality. Rust offers endless possibilities, and new skins only expand this list.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to update your skin collection and give your items in Rust a fresh look. Dive into this week\'s skins and enjoy a new level of visuals and customization!<br/><br/> <b>Improvements to new skins:</b><br/><ul><br/><li> Unique and stylish design</li><br/><li> Practical meaning with unique animations and sound effects</li><br/><li> Variety of styles to stand out from other players</li><br/><li> Opportunity for creativity and self-expression</li><br/></ul><br/><br/> Hurry, because the new batch of skins is available only during this week! Don\'t miss the opportunity to get your new favorite designs and add some freshness to your adventures in Rust!'),
(9843, 'en-US', 'Learn about the work being done to add new buoys to Rust, new dive spots, and see screenshots of the world changes in our latest News from the Field article.'),
(9844, 'en-US', 'News from the field, Rust updates, buoys, diving underwater, new locations, screenshots of world changes'),
(9845, 'en-US', '<p>Work is underway to add two different buoy variants to Rust that will replace the current water bottles. Instead, the new buoys will be used to mark underwater dive sites.</p><br/><p> The next update to the game will add three new exciting places to dive into, but there is no exact information yet about which places exactly these will be.</p><br/><p> We are also happy to share with you the first screenshots of the new changes to the world! Beautiful lakes, impressive canyons and cozy oases await you.</p>'),
(9846, 'en-US', 'In this article you will find the latest news from the game Rust, including a new clock, a wallpaper skin, new locations and radiation water.'),
(9847, 'en-US', 'news, Rust, updates, clock, skin, wallpaper, radiation water'),
(9848, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we bring you the latest news from the world of Rust, so you can stay up to date with all the updates and additions to the game.</p><br/><br/><h3> 1. New clock with the ability to set alarms</h3><br/><p> A new clock will be coming to the game soon, which will display server time and allow you to set up to 5 alarms. This will be useful for players to be on time and not miss important events or meetings on the server (screenshot 1).</p><br/><br/><h3> 2. New Metro Wallpaper Skin</h3><br/><p> There is a new wallpaper skin available now, which is done in the style of Metro. The price of this skin is 20 fabric. It is important to note that this skin does not block the wall upgrade with a mallet, so you will be able to change your interiors without problems (screenshot 2).</p><br/><br/><h3> 3. Lakes, canyons and oases on the aux2 branch</h3><br/><p> If you are looking for adventure and new places to explore, we are happy to announce that lakes, canyons and oases are now available on the aux2 branch. Explore these picturesque places and enjoy the beautiful views (screenshot 3).</p><br/><br/><h3> 4. Work on radioactive water</h3><br/><p> Currently, work is underway on a new element - radiation water. If the player drinks this water or comes into contact with it, he will receive a certain dose of radiation. Also, if you water your farm with this water, all the plants will die. This new element will add new challenges and strategies to the game.</p>'),
(9849, 'en-US', 'First look at the wallpaper'),
(9850, 'en-US', 'Wallpapers is a new addition to the Rust game that allows players to craft and install wallpapers on their buildings, adding the ability to personalize and change the appearance.'),
(9851, 'en-US', 'Rust, wallpaper, new addition, crafting, fabric, customization, mallet, updates'),
(9852, 'en-US', 'Wallpapers are a new addition to the Rust game that have caused a lot of excitement and excitement among players. Today we will take a closer look at them and discuss their main features and capabilities.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Very little is known about the new wallpapers yet - the developers are keeping them a secret, and everything can change at any moment. But the first recipes and tools for creating wallpapers have already been observed.<br/> :dot: Wallpaper is crafted from 20 units of fabric, which makes it available for production even in the early stages of the game. This gives players more options for personalizing their buildings.<br/> :dot: One of the interesting additions is the ability to remove wallpaper with a mallet. Now you can easily change the appearance of your buildings without worrying about the complex process of rebuilding.<br/><br/> Remember that wallpapers are a new art in Rust, and the developers are constantly working on improving them and expanding their capabilities. Stay up to date with the latest updates and don’t miss the chance to bring your creative ideas to life in the game.'),
(9853, 'en-US', 'Our article takes a look at the new skins that have arrived in Rust this week. Learn about the latest updates and character customization options.'),
(9854, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game, updates, skin appearance, skin cost, skin features, character personality'),
(9855, 'en-US', 'Welcome! In this article, we will take a closer look at the new batch of skins that have appeared in the game Rust this week. If you are a fan of the game and like to customize your characters, then you will definitely be interested in learning about the latest updates and new skin variations. We will tell you about each skin, provide information about its appearance, cost and features. Dive into the world of skin diversity and choose the ones that will highlight your individuality in the game Rust. Together, we will explore how new skins affect the gameplay and create unique opportunities for players. Stay up to date with the latest trends and do not miss the opportunity to purchase new unique equipment for your character. Join us on this journey and dive into the world of new skins!'),
(9856, 'en-US', 'Rust Game on Steam: New Round 32 of Twitch Drops is Coming Soon'),
(9857, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Round 32 of Twitch Drops for Rust on Steam, where you can get exclusive skins and items. Skins from YouTubers also count towards Twitch streams.'),
(9858, 'en-US', 'Rust Game on Steam, Twitch Drops, Skins, YouTubers, Twitch, Live, Odds, Wardrobe, Gear, Gameplay, E-Economy'),
(9859, 'en-US', '<p>In just a few minutes, the new 32nd round of Twitch Drops for the popular game Rust on Steam begins. This is a great opportunity to get exclusive skins for your character and in-game items.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that the YouTuber skins in Twitch Drops are considered general skins and are counted when watching mainstream streamers on the Twitch platform. This means that you can get these skins even when watching streams on Twitch, not just YouTube.</p><br/><p> To participate in the Twitch Drops round, you need to have an account on the Twitch platform, connect your Steam account to Twitch, and activate Twitch Drops for the game Rust. After that, you just need to be on the live stream of a supported streamer and you will have a chance to get skins!</p><br/><p> But remember that the chances of getting skins through Twitch Drops are lower than when buying or trading them on the Steam marketplace. Rust pays great attention to fairness and balance between the gameplay and the digital economy.</p><br/><p> So, don\'t miss the opportunity to update your wardrobe and gear in Rust with the new 32nd round of Twitch Drops! Don\'t forget to set up your Twitch account and follow popular streamers live to increase your chances of getting rare skins and items.</p>'),
(9860, 'en-US', 'Creative Week: Developing a Loot Box Auto-Sorting System'),
(9861, 'en-US', 'Rust is currently hosting a hackweek where developers are working on new and improved features. One of the most interesting projects the team is working on is an automatic loot sorting system for crates.'),
(9862, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, development, auto-sorting loot, boxes, creative week, hackweek, update'),
(9863, 'en-US', '<p>Rust is currently hosting a hackweek where developers are working on new and improved features. One of the most interesting projects the team is working on is an automatic loot sorting system for crates.</p><br/><p> This innovative feature will allow players to save time and simplify the process of sorting the received loot. Instead of spending minutes on manually arranging items in boxes, the system will now do it automatically, based on preset parameters and rules.</p><br/><p> The development of the auto-sorting system is carried out using advanced technologies and algorithms, which guarantees efficient and accurate work. The development team takes into account many factors when creating the system, including types of items, their weight, categories and much more.</p><br/><p> However, while the auto-sorting system promises to make the gameplay much easier, it also raises some questions among the player community. Some fear that the automatic sorting may lead to the loss of valuable items or the disruption of one’s own sorting order. But the developers promise that there will be settings and the possibility of player intervention in the sorting process so that everyone can customize the system to their own gaming strategy and preferences.</p><br/><p> Overall, the loot box auto-sorting system is an important and useful addition to the Rust game. It will allow players to save time on routine tasks and focus more on the main game mechanics. The developers continue to work on the system, and it will soon be available in the game, giving players a new level of comfort and convenience.</p>'),
(9864, 'en-US', 'Two interesting ideas are being developed as part of the creative week (hackweek)'),
(9865, 'en-US', 'Two interesting ideas for Rust are being developed as part of hackweek: a car stereo and adding planes. Find out more about these potential updates.'),
(9866, 'en-US', 'creative week, hackweek, car stereo, planes, updates, Rust game'),
(9867, 'en-US', '<p>As part of the hackweek, Rust is currently working hard on two exciting ideas that could become new additions:</p><br/><br/><h2> Idea 1: Car radio</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> Controls like a boombox</li><br/><li> Supports all three cabin types: regular, engined and armored</li><br/><li> Works only when the car is running</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><h2> Idea 2: Airplanes</h2><br/><p> Information about this idea is limited at the moment, but the developers have already started working on the possibility of adding aircraft to the game. Stay tuned for more information about the features of this upcoming update.</p>'),
(9868, 'en-US', 'One of the most useless items in RUST'),
(9869, 'en-US', 'An article about one of the most useless items in the game RUST and the players\' positions on this issue. Do you agree?'),
(9870, 'en-US', 'RUST, game, item, uselessness, strategy, tactics'),
(9871, 'en-US', 'There are many different items in the game Rust, each with its own use and value. However, among them, there is one item that often becomes the cause of disputes and disagreements among players. We are talking about an item that many consider completely useless.<br/><br/> This item is [item name]. It has minor stats and offers limited options to players. Some players believe that this item should be removed from the game entirely, as it does not provide any benefit and only takes up inventory space.<br/><br/> However, despite the fact that this item is not very effective and useful, there are those players who find ways to use it to their advantage. Thoughtfully exploring the game world, they find non-standard solutions and applications for this item, which allows them to survive and thrive even in difficult conditions.<br/><br/> The uselessness of one item can be relative, as each player has their own style of play and their own preferences. What is useless for one player may be an integral element of strategy and tactics for another.<br/><br/> Thus, the question of \"the most useless item in RUST\" remains open and invites players to reflect. And you, do you agree with the opinion that this item is useless?'),
(9872, 'en-US', 'The final list of skins and streamer names for Twitch Drops Round 32, scheduled for August 8-18'),
(9873, 'en-US', 'We\'re revealing the final skin list and streamer names for Round 32 of Rust\'s Twitch Drops, scheduled for August 8th - 18th. Find out how to get exclusive skins and support your favorite streamers.'),
(9874, 'en-US', 'Final list of skins, streamer names, round 32 Twitch Drops, Rust, skins for the game Rust, skin collection, Twitch, Rust game broadcasts, stream links'),
(9875, 'en-US', '<p>Final Skin List and Streamer Names for Round 32 of Twitch Drops</p><br/><p> Scheduled dates: August 8-18</p><br/><br/><p> Hello, Rust fans! If you want to stay up to date with the latest news about skins added to the game, you\'ve come to the right place. In this article, we\'ll tell you about the final list of skins and streamer names for Twitch Drops Round 32, which is scheduled for August 8-18.</p><br/><br/><p> What are Twitch Drops? This is a unique opportunity for viewers to watch Rust broadcasts on the Twitch streaming platform and receive exclusive skins in the game. It\'s a great way to enrich your skin collection and show your support for your favorite streamers.</p><br/><br/><p> Twitch Drops Round 32 is a special round that will run from August 8th to August 18th. New skins will be added in this round and you can check out the full list right here.</p><br/><br/><p> Which streamers will be participating in this round? We are happy to announce the names of the streamers who will be streaming Rust and offering you a chance to get these skins. Be sure to keep an eye on their streams so you don’t miss out on the opportunity to get rich with your skins.</p><br/><br/><p> All the details and stream links you need will be provided in our next article, so be sure to subscribe to our newsletter and stay tuned for updates.</p><br/><br/><p> We hope that the final list of skins and streamers for Twitch Drops Round 32 will make your Rust experience even more fun and diverse. Support the streamers, enjoy the broadcasts and get these exclusive skins that cannot be found anywhere else!</p>'),
(9876, 'en-US', 'Update from developer Flavien: simplification of the construction process in the game Rust'),
(9877, 'en-US', 'Developer Flavien is preparing a new update for the game Rust, which will significantly simplify the construction process. Thanks to an innovative feature, players will be able to easily identify which building blocks are preventing them from building the structure they need.'),
(9878, 'en-US', 'update, developer Flavien, simplification of construction, game Rust'),
(9879, 'en-US', 'Developer Flavien is preparing a new update for the game Rust, which promises to significantly simplify the construction process. In the near future, players will be able to use a new feature that will allow them to easily determine which building blocks are preventing them from building the structure they need.<br/> Nowadays, building plays a major role in Rust, allowing players to create fortified bases, defend themselves from other players and animals, and keep their resources safe. However, the building process can be quite complex and time-consuming, especially for beginners.<br/> The update from developer Flavien will include an innovative feature that will help players deal with such problems with ease. It will show which building blocks are preventing the desired structure from being built, allowing you to quickly and efficiently make the necessary changes and continue to develop your base.<br/> This upgrade will significantly reduce the time spent on building, rebuilding or upgrading the base. Players will be able to easily find and remove any obstacles during the construction process, allowing them to focus on other aspects of the game.<br/> The update from developer Flavien will be a real find for all Rust players who want to create reliable and efficient bases with minimal effort and time. We will be waiting for the release of this update to see how it will transform the process of building in the game Rust.'),
(9880, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest skins that have appeared in the game RUST this week. Highlight your individuality and add style to the world of RUST with a new collection of skins. Support the developers and purchase unique items in the Steam store.'),
(9881, 'en-US', 'skins, RUST, new items, style, individuality, collection, Steam store'),
(9882, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of RUST, where each week brings a new batch of exciting and unique skins! In this article, we will tell you about the freshest skins that have appeared in the game this week. Get ready for a wave of new features and style!</p><br/><p> With the help of new skins in RUST you will be able to stand out from the crowd, emphasize your individuality and give your character a new, epic look. Thanks to the constant updating of the skin collection, you will always find something new and unique.</p><br/><p> This week\'s new batch of skins includes a wide selection of different items from clothing to weapons. You will be able to find skins for your weapons, armor, tools, as well as many decorative items for the base. All skins are made in high quality and varied in design, so that every player can find something to their taste.</p><br/><p> Each skin has its own story and can tell about the adventures of its creator. You can learn more about how the skins were created, as well as the creative process of the developers in our article \"Skin Stories\".</p><br/><p> However, it is important to remember that skins are not only a way to give game items a new look, but also a way to support the RUST developers. Each purchase of a skin directly supports the development team and helps them in the further development of the game.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to add some uniqueness and style to the world of RUST with this week\'s new batch of skins. Head to the Steam Store to check out the full selection and choose the skins that reflect your uniqueness and individuality!</p>'),
(9883, 'en-US', 'Rust August Update: Everything You\'ll Get'),
(9884, 'en-US', 'The August Rust update and forced wipe are just minutes away. Check out the new features and improvements coming your way: tin can alarms, updated vending machine prices, improved zipline, item buoyancy, and system fixes. Don\'t miss out on this important update!'),
(9885, 'en-US', 'Rust August Update, New Features, Improvements, Gameplay Experience, Updates, Alarms, Vending Machines, Zipline, Item Float, Fixes'),
(9886, 'en-US', 'The August Rust update and forced wipe are coming soon! New features and improvements are coming to make your experience even better. Here\'s what to expect:<br/><br/><p> :dotred1: Alarm system made from tin cans</p><br/><p> :dotred1: Prices in vending machines now update every 5 in-game days</p><br/><p> :dotred1: Zipline improvements: additional descents added and transitions lengthened</p><br/><p> :dotred1: Buoyancy of objects</p><br/><p> :dotred1: Fixes and improvements to systems from previous updates</p><br/><br/> The new tin can alarm will keep you informed of what\'s going on around your base, so you won\'t miss any attacks or intrusions.<br/><br/> The updated vending machine pricing system will ensure a fairer trading and economy. Prices will now update every 5 in-game days, so you will always know when it is time to make a good deal.<br/><br/> The zipline, a popular feature among players, has been improved with new drops and transitions to help you move faster and more efficiently through the game world.<br/><br/> Item Buoyancy is a new feature that can change the way you play. You can now create floating items, such as floating bases or floating tents, to improve your tactical options and expand the boundaries of your base.<br/><br/> Additionally, this update includes fixes and improvements to systems from previous updates to make the game more stable and enjoyable for all players.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss this important August update and get all the new features and improvements coming soon!'),
(9887, 'en-US', 'New Machine Gun Skin and Updated Sight – TWITCH DROP Event'),
(9888, 'en-US', 'As part of the \"TWITCH DROP\" promotion, players are given a unique opportunity to get a skin for a machine gun with an updated sight in the game Rust. Find out more about the details and conditions of the promotion in our article.'),
(9889, 'en-US', 'skin, machine gun, updated sight, TWITCH DROP, Rust, promotion'),
(9890, 'en-US', '<p>Guys and gals, pay attention! We have some exciting news for Rust players, especially those who love collecting weapon skins. As part of the ongoing TWITCH DROP event, you can get a unique machine gun skin that will stand out from the rest with its stylish and updated appearance.</p><br/><br/><p> Long work on this skin has been completed, and the developers will not disappoint you - the updated sight will be a demonstration of great attention to detail. It will not only be an effective tool for aiming, but also a real work of art. After all, the entire texture of the skin, including the sight itself, was completely redesigned. To do this, it was necessary to remove all the old elements in order to implement a completely new visual concept.</p><br/><br/><p> We are confident that this skin will become a true premium addition to your arsenal in the game Rust. Don\'t miss the opportunity to get it as part of the \"TWITCH DROP\" promotion. We are distributing it in limited quantities, so be prepared to show all your skills and secure your place in the history of Rust.</p>'),
(9891, 'en-US', 'New Skins for Twitch Drops in Rust'),
(9892, 'en-US', 'Unique new skins for Twitch Drops in Rust. Get rare items that will add style and uniqueness to your game.'),
(9893, 'en-US', 'new skins, Twitch Drops, Rust, game, exclusive items'),
(9894, 'en-US', '<h2>Three More Skins to Be Added in Upcoming Twitch Drops</h2><br/><p> Scheduled to run from August 8th to August 18th, Twitch Drops will give Rust players a unique opportunity to earn new skins for their characters.</p><br/><p> This event will add three new skins that will give your heroes a new look. In addition to these three skins, other exclusive items will also be available.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to get these rare items that will add uniqueness and style to your Rust game.</p><br/><p> You can see the rest of the skins participating in Twitch Drops in the feed above.</p>'),
(9895, 'en-US', 'New Skins for Twitch Drops in Rust: Two Additional Offers'),
(9896, 'en-US', 'Find out about two new skins that will be added to the upcoming Twitch Drops in Rust and decide if they are worth getting.'),
(9897, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, Twitch Drops, Rust skins, new Rust skins'),
(9898, 'en-US', '<p>Two more new skins for Rust have been announced for the upcoming Twitch Drops scheduled from August 8th to August 18th. These skins will be available to earn during the event, and you can see them in the feed above.</p><br/><br/><p> Now it\'s time for an important decision: should you pick up these two new skins? It\'s a question that deserves attention and a thoughtful answer.</p><br/><br/><p> When we talk about new skins in Rust, we have to take into account several factors. First, the appearance and quality of the skins. How do they look and how attractive are they? This is important for most Rust players who want to have a unique and interesting appearance for their character or items.</p><br/><br/><p> Secondly, cost and availability. How easy and expensive is it to get these new skins? If they are expensive or hard to get, this may discourage many players. It is important to find a balance between the desire of players to get these skins and their availability.</p><br/><br/><p> Finally, it’s worth considering the impact on gameplay. Do these new skins provide some kind of advantage in the game? Or, on the contrary, are they simply cosmetic changes that don’t affect gameplay mechanics? This is an important factor that players should also consider when deciding whether to get new skins.</p><br/><br/><p> So, the choice of whether to get these two new skins is an individual one and depends on the preferences of each player. They must consider the appearance, availability, and impact on gameplay to determine whether these skins are worth the purchase.</p><br/><br/><p> Now that you know more about the new skins for the upcoming Twitch Drops in Rust, the question is: will you be picking them up?</p>'),
(9899, 'en-US', 'A little boomerang?'),
(9900, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have announced that they are working on a new weapon - a blowpipe for shooting darts - to satisfy the desires of players.'),
(9901, 'en-US', 'boomerang, rust, developers, blowpipe, darts'),
(9902, 'en-US', '<p>Unhappy with the number of boomerangs in Rust? The developers heard you and prepared a surprise!</p><br/><p> The Rust development team has begun work on a new weapon - a blowpipe for shooting darts.</p>'),
(9903, 'en-US', 'The date for the new round of Twitch Drops has been announced'),
(9904, 'en-US', 'The article talks about the new round of Twitch Drops, which will take place from August 8 to 18. The article also lists the participants of Round 32 and a reminder about the start of Round 31.'),
(9905, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, New Round, Date, Participants, Candidates, Screenshot, Reminder'),
(9906, 'en-US', 'The date of the new round of Twitch Drops has been announced. They will take place from August 8 to 18. The following candidates will participate in round 32 (see screenshot below). In addition, we would like to remind you that round 31 of Twitch Drops starts today at 21:00.'),
(9907, 'en-US', 'In this article, you\'ll learn about the new batch of Rust skins on Steam, as well as the key points to consider when choosing them. Update your wardrobe and add some personality to your gaming experience!'),
(9908, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, Steam, updates, style, personality'),
(9909, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, friends! Another week has come, and with it comes a new batch of gorgeous skins for Rust on Steam. Get ready to dive into a world of style and personality! In this article, we’ll take a look at the most colorful and exciting updates coming this week. Get ready to update your wardrobe and add exclusive items to your arsenal!</p><br/><p> Each batch of new skins is an opportunity to show your individuality and stand out from other players. Choose from a variety of styles, from bright and extravagant to classic and stylish. Updates will come to you along with updated interface elements and new features to make your gaming experience even more exciting and interesting.</p><br/><p> However, before you dive into the world of fashion, there are a few key points to consider. First, the price of skins. Purchasing new skins can be a bit expensive. But don\'t forget that it\'s an investment in your in-game visual aesthetics and sense of authenticity. Also, remember that the quality of some skins can vary greatly, so it\'s important to research their appearance and community reviews before purchasing.</p><br/><p> Secondly, the choice of skins can affect your gameplay tactics and strategy. Some skins can make you more visible and vulnerable, while others can help you hide and remain invisible on the battlefield. Think about which skins suit your playstyle and help you achieve the results you want.</p><br/><p> Third, don\'t try to buy everything at once. New skins go on sale every week, so you\'ll always have fresh offers to choose from. Chances are that the next batch will feature something even more unique and attractive. So be patient and don\'t get overwhelmed by the variety of choices.</p><br/><p> So, dear players, get ready for a new batch of stylish and exciting skins ready to decorate your gaming collection. Remember that skins are not only a way to express your individuality, but also a chance to decorate the world of Rust with unique items and visual effects. Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your wardrobe and emphasize your gaming style - a new batch of skins is already waiting for you!</p>'),
(9910, 'en-US', 'First Look: Shockbyte Tool Cupboard (TS Skin) Glows in the Dark'),
(9911, 'en-US', 'This article introduces a new skin for Tool Cupboard in Rust - Shockbyte Tool Cupboard, which glows in the dark. Learn more about this unique skin and how it can add personality to your base.'),
(9912, 'en-US', 'Shockbyte Tool Cupboard, new skin, Tool Cupboard, Rust game, glow in the dark, Shockbyte, hosting provider, skin features, design, personality'),
(9913, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we will look at a new skin for the Tool Cupboard in the game Rust - Shockbyte Tool Cupboard, which attracts attention with its feature - it glows in the dark.</p><br/><p> Shockbyte is a well-known game server hosting provider, and this skin is a result of their collaboration with the Rust developers. The details of this collaboration have not yet been announced, but this new product is already generating interest among players.</p><br/><p> Players will now be able to present their bases in a whole new light - literally. The defensive structure, the Tool Cupboard, that players use to capture territory and save their progress can now be customized with this skin. It will give your base a unique look and allow it to stand out from the rest.</p><br/><p> The Shockbyte Tool Cupboard is designed around a bright LED effect that makes it visible in complete darkness. This feature can be very useful for players during night attacks or simply to create an atmospheric lighting accent in the base.</p><br/><p> In addition, the skin is of high quality and detail. It accurately conveys the style and aesthetics of Shockbyte, allowing players to enjoy the unique design and appearance of their bases.</p><br/><p> So, if you want to highlight your individuality in the game Rust and add fresh impressions to your base, check out the new Shockbyte Tool Cupboard skin that glows in the dark. Make your base unique!</p>'),
(9914, 'en-US', 'First look at new tin can alarm'),
(9915, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new tin can alarm in Rust. A base security device that can be placed almost anywhere and triggers everything, including animals and NPCs.'),
(9916, 'en-US', 'alarm, tin cans, Rust, security, base'),
(9917, 'en-US', 'An article about a new security device for bases in the game Rust - alarms made of tin cans. These devices are easy to make and can be installed almost anywhere. Let\'s take a look at the main advantages and functionality of this new alarm:<br/><br/><ul><li> Made from 100% wood and 2 empty tuna cans.</li><li> Can be installed almost anywhere except roads and safe areas.</li><li> If someone passes through the stretched string, a sound signal will be triggered. The sound will be improved.</li><li> The alarm goes off for everyone, including animals and NPCs.</li></ul><br/> This new tin can alarm will be a reliable security device for your base in the game Rust. Its simplicity and effectiveness will allow you to protect your resources from unwanted encroachment.'),
(9918, 'en-US', 'Updated RadTown in Rust: Developers Showcase Final Results'),
(9919, 'en-US', 'Check out the new updated RadTown in Rust and its exciting final results that the developers showed off to players.'),
(9920, 'en-US', 'RadTown, update, Rust, developers, results, research, resources'),
(9921, 'en-US', 'Recently, the developers of the game Rust have prepared a pleasant surprise for the players — the updated RadTown. This is one of the key places in the game, where players can get resources and find interesting items. In the new version, the developers have made several significant changes that have made the place even more attractive for exploration and battles. In this article, we will tell you about the most interesting final results of the updated RadTown from the game Rust. Get ready for an exciting expedition to a dangerous but exciting area!'),
(9922, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest skins that have appeared in Rust this week and how they can affect gameplay and balance. Stay up to date with the latest updates and trends in the world of Rust!'),
(9923, 'en-US', 'new batch, skins, Rust, updates, trends');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(9924, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will be covering the latest skins that have been released in Rust this week. Check them out to learn about the latest trends and updates in the world of Rust. We will be doing a comprehensive analysis of each skin, looking at its features and possible trade-offs associated with its use. We will also outline how these new skins may affect the gameplay and balance of the game. This is an important aspect to consider when making decisions about purchasing new skins. We will make sure that you are aware of all the changes that have occurred in Rust, so that you can be on trend and stand out from other players with your stylish appearance. Join us to learn all about this week\'s new batch of skins in Rust!'),
(9925, 'en-US', 'Facepunch is celebrating its 15th anniversary with a big sale!'),
(9926, 'en-US', 'Facepunch Studios is celebrating its 15th anniversary with an incredible 50% off sale on all games and add-ons, giving fans of Rust and other games the chance to pick up their favorite titles at a great price.'),
(9927, 'en-US', 'Facepunch, Rust, Anniversary, Discount, Games, DLC, Steam'),
(9928, 'en-US', 'Facepunch Studios, the popular developer, is officially celebrating its 15th anniversary this summer. It’s a remarkable achievement that highlights the talent and resilience of the team behind successful titles like Rust.'),
(9929, 'en-US', 'Rust Leaf Rustling Sound Effect Update'),
(9930, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has fixed a bug with the rustling leaves sound effect, which was previously only heard on the local client. Now you can enjoy the atmospheric sounds of nature in Rust again.'),
(9931, 'en-US', 'update, sounds, rustling leaves, bug fix, game Rust'),
(9932, 'en-US', '<p>We have great news for all Rust players! The latest update has fixed a bug that prevented the rustling leaf sound from playing correctly.</p><br/><p> Previously, this sound could only be heard on the local client, which created implausible situations. But thanks to the latest update, you can now hear the sounds of rustling leaves in Rust again.</p><br/><p> And that\'s not all! Now, if someone moves in the bushes nearby, you will also hear it. This will add even more atmosphere and realism to the game.</p><br/><p> We understand that details matter, and sound effects play a vital role in creating an engaging gaming experience. That\'s why we\'re always looking to improve and fix any bugs that might arise to give you the best possible experience while playing Rust.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow our updates to stay up to date with all the latest news and improvements in the game Rust. We wish you pleasant adventures and unforgettable moments in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(9933, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam update - a new batch of unique skins. Learn about the new features, style and value of skins, as well as how to buy and sell them on the Steam Marketplace. Be on trend, stand out and enjoy new advantages in Rust!'),
(9934, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, Steam, update, shop, weapons, clothes, buildings, purchase, sale, discounts, game items'),
(9935, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, dear players! Today we have hot news for you - a new batch of amazing skins has been added to the game Rust on Steam! Witness the largest update of this week, which will bring even more diversity and opportunities for self-expression to the gaming world.</p><br/><br/><p> The developers have worked hard on stylish new skins for your items. Every detail is conceived and thought out so that you can create a unique image of your character or item that will stand out from all the others. Stylish options for weapons, clothing, buildings and other items are waiting for you in the Steam store.</p><br/><br/><p> This time, the skin collection impresses with its diversity and quality of execution. You will be able to choose the perfect weapon for yourself to stand out on the battlefield, or give your house a unique look that everyone will appreciate. Constantly updating the range of skins allows you not only to express your individuality, but also to be inspired by the ideas of other players.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main advantages of new skins is the ability to sell them on the Steam marketplace. If you manage to get a rare skin, then there is every chance to sell it profitably and get various game items or additional funds for further development in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> However, it is worth remembering that choosing a skin is not just a matter of taste, but also an important decision that affects the gameplay. Some skins can be more effective and functional, which will help you survive in the harsh world of Rust. Therefore, before buying, you need to carefully study the characteristics of the skin and evaluate its value.</p><br/><br/><p> Last but not least, stay tuned for updates and discounts on skins! Don\'t miss the chance to buy your favorite items at a bargain price!</p><br/><br/><p> We hope that the new batch of skins will become a source of inspiration and joy for you. Enjoy your choice and successful battles in Rust!</p>'),
(9936, 'en-US', 'Developers are introducing innovations to the game Rust: what\'s new with the boomerang?'),
(9937, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new feature in the game Rust - the boomerang and its possible use as a weapon. Updates to the game Rust are always interesting for gamers, and this article will tell you about the latest changes.'),
(9938, 'en-US', 'Developers, innovations, Rust, boomerang, changes, weapons, gameplay, interest, variety'),
(9939, 'en-US', 'The developers continue to actively work on improving the game Rust, introducing innovations that make the gameplay even more interesting and diverse. One of the latest changes was the introduction of the boomerang into the game. However, the question remains open whether it will be used as a weapon or for other purposes. We will have to watch and wait to find out what role the boomerang will play in the world of Rust.'),
(9940, 'en-US', 'Rust developers pause footstep sound updates after community backlash'),
(9941, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have temporarily suspended the update of footstep sounds in response to negative feedback from the community. The changes caused discontent among players, so the developers decided to listen to the opinion of the community and take a break from implementing new sound effects.'),
(9942, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, footstep sounds, community, developers, negative reviews'),
(9943, 'en-US', 'Following a surge of negative feedback from the community regarding the change in footstep sounds in the game Rust, the developers decided to pause this update. Players expressed their dissatisfaction with the changes, believing that the new sounds do not correspond to realism and add additional difficulties to the gameplay. Acting in the interests of the gaming community, the development team decided to listen to the opinions of players and temporarily postpone the implementation of changes to the footstep sounds.'),
(9944, 'en-US', 'Rust Footstep Sound Update: Better Team Coordination'),
(9945, 'en-US', 'Learn about a new update in Rust that will help players distinguish between their teammates\' footsteps and those of their opponents for improved coordination.'),
(9946, 'en-US', 'Rust update, footstep sound, team coordination, distinguish footsteps, review, news'),
(9947, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest update to the Rust game, the developers have made some minor changes to the sound of other players\' footsteps. Now the sound of teammates\' footsteps will be slightly different from the footsteps of opponents. This change is intended to help players more effectively distinguish the footsteps of their teammates from the footsteps of enemy players, which in turn promotes better team coordination and cooperation.</p><br/><br/><p> Organized teams of players in Rust will have an advantage thanks to the new audio distinction in footsteps. Players will be able to more easily and quickly determine who is nearby before deciding whether to attack or retreat. This is especially useful in close combat situations or when pursuing an enemy.</p><br/><br/><p> However, it is important to note that changing the footstep sounds in Rust may elicit different reactions from players. Some players may prefer to keep the sounds consistent to maintain a realistic gaming experience. Others welcome this update as a welcome improvement that will help to more accurately identify the location of allies and enemies.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust developers always strive for a balance between realism and game dynamics, and changing the footstep sounds is one of the compromises they propose. This update allows for better team play and coordination without compromising the game balance and the ability to enjoy the realistic environment in Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> Your opinion on this change is very important. What do you think about the new sound differences in other players\' footsteps? How will it affect your experience playing Rust? Share your thoughts and opinions in the comments!</p>'),
(9948, 'en-US', 'A nice change for water fight fans'),
(9949, 'en-US', 'Check out a nice change for fans of water fights in Rust. Now, objects thrown into the water have resistance and can be picked up. Add more strategy and tactics to your water fights!'),
(9950, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, water fights, item resistance, sinking items, tactics, strategy'),
(9951, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust has an interesting update that will please all fans of water fights!</p><br/><p> Items thrown into water now have resistance and sink slowly, adding new strategy and tactics to combat situations near water surfaces.</p><br/><p> Throwing objects into the water no longer means they instantly disappear. You can now watch them tie up and sink into the water, while still being visible and able to be picked up.</p><br/><p> This change will allow players to leave traps, create cover, or simply avoid losing their gear in fights near water areas.</p><br/><p> Keep in mind that certain items can be difficult to lift, so when planning your actions, it\'s worth considering what items you plan to use in a fight on the water.</p><br/><p> The update adds new features and expands the gaming experience, bringing more realism and tactics to water battles.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to try out these nice changes and defeat your enemies on the water in Rust!</p>'),
(9952, 'en-US', 'Global Warfare 2 Map Screenshots'),
(9953, 'en-US', 'Check out screenshots of Global Warfare 2\'s Rust map and learn about the new landscapes to explore. Look out for content events on July 26 and Twitch drops.'),
(9954, 'en-US', 'Rust server, Global Warfare 2, map update'),
(9955, 'en-US', '<p>Rust developers are pleased to present you with screenshots of the new Global Warfare 2 map!</p><br/><p> As part of our Rust event, we have completely reworked the Earth map and created different types of landscapes that await you. Now you will be able to travel to a giant rainforest in the Amazon or wander through huge glacier valleys in Greenland. We aimed to make a map that will be exciting to explore.</p><br/><p> The new Global Warfare 2 map will be available during a content event on July 26. We encourage you to look forward to this event and, of course, enjoy the Twitch drops.</p>'),
(9956, 'en-US', 'What other animals are we missing?'),
(9957, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust on Steam have begun work on adding snakes to the game world. They are expected to bring more realism and atmosphere, bringing new challenges and opportunities for players.'),
(9958, 'en-US', 'animals, snakes, updates, game Rust, developers'),
(9959, 'en-US', 'Are there any uninhabited animals in our world of islands? The developers of the game Rust asked themselves this question and invite you to think together about what other animals we are missing. One possible answer is a snake.<br/><br/> Snakes are interesting creatures that can add more realism and atmosphere to the game. Work has begun on bringing these reptiles to the world of Rust. The developers did this together with the player community to take into account their wishes and suggestions. This is a great example of how important it is to take into account the opinion of the community when making decisions about game updates.<br/><br/> Snakes will be unique and dangerous creatures that will be found in different biomes of the game world. They will be able to chase players, attack and cause damage. Interaction with these snakes will cause adrenaline and require strategic thinking and the ability to make quick decisions from players.<br/><br/> Balancing the introduction of a new animal into a game is a complex task. Developers must consider both its role in the game world ecosystem and its impact on gameplay and balance. It is important that snakes do not become too unpleasant and distort the game dynamics. Additional adjustments and changes to the game world may be required to ensure harmonious interaction with new animals.<br/><br/> A new update that includes snakes will be released in the near future. This update will open up new opportunities and challenges for players. Snakes are expected to bring an atmosphere of mystery and tension to the game world that has been lacking so far.<br/><br/> Join the discussion in the player community and express your opinion on what other animals should be added to the game Rust. Your vote could be decisive!'),
(9960, 'en-US', 'Rust developers are working on creating a new biome - the jungle'),
(9961, 'en-US', 'The developers of Rust are starting to create an exciting new biome - the jungle. Find out what changes await players and how the developers balance the complexity and fun of the game experience.'),
(9962, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, developers, biome, jungle, crocodiles, tigers, balance, survival'),
(9963, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust on Steam have taken on the creation of a new exciting biome - the jungle!<br/><br/> They not only add new locations, but also completely create the atmosphere of real exotic forests. This new biome is distinguished by its dense vegetation, magnificent water spaces and unique animal world.<br/><br/> One of the main questions many fans of the game asked the developers was why work was done to add crocodiles and tigers. Now everything falls into place! In the new jungle biome, these two dangerous and exotic animals will become part of the Rust animal world. This will add even more tension and opportunities for survival in this ruthless world.<br/><br/> But the developers will have to find a balance in the jungle biome. After all, dense undergrowth and dangerous predators should be a challenge for players, but at the same time should not turn into something that makes the game too difficult and exhausting. The process of creating the perfect balance in a new biome is not an easy task, but the Rust developers have taken on it with passion and enthusiasm.<br/><br/> Taking into account all the problems and based on the experience of many updates of the game, the development team is trying to create a new jungle biome that will be interesting and exciting for all Rust players. They strive to provide their fans with new opportunities to explore, survive and interact with a rich and living game environment. We are looking forward to these amazing changes and looking forward to seeing the results of the developers\' work!'),
(9964, 'en-US', 'Latest update information'),
(9965, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust, which significantly improves the fight against cheaters and ensures a cleaner gameplay experience.'),
(9966, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, cheaters, protection, gameplay, news'),
(9967, 'en-US', 'Today, another exciting update for Rust awaits you! Alistair, the lead developer, shared the latest news with our community.<br/><br/> Very good news for those who love fair play - the latest update turned out to be a real breakthrough in the fight against cheaters. The developers made significant changes and improved the system of protection against dishonest players.<br/><br/> If you want to continue enjoying the pure gaming experience, don\'t miss this update. All you need to do is update your game client to access the servers.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget to follow the news and updates of the game Rust to always be aware of the latest events and enjoy the game to the fullest. Thank you for your support and good game!'),
(9968, 'en-US', 'Server and client update in the game Rust'),
(9969, 'en-US', 'Learn about an important server and client update for Rust that will not affect your game progress and requires downloading the latest version through the Steam platform.'),
(9970, 'en-US', 'server update, client update, Rust game, fixes, improvements, download, Steam'),
(9971, 'en-US', 'Today at 17:00, the developers will release a mandatory server and client update in the game Rust. This is an important event that will bring many fixes and improvements. At the same time, your game progress and achievements will remain intact, so you do not have to worry about losing data. To continue playing, you will only need to download the latest version of the game Rust through the Steam platform.'),
(9972, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Skins Final List - Global Warfare 2'),
(9973, 'en-US', 'Find out what unique Twitch Drops skins are available in Global Warfare 2 and how they will help you in epic battles on the battlefield.'),
(9974, 'en-US', 'final skins list, Twitch Drops, Global Warfare 2, game, unique skins, fire sword, dragon scale armor, electron shield, cybernetic implant, vehicle paint, battle'),
(9975, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Global Warfare 2! We are excited to present you with the final list of skins available through Twitch Drops to help you succeed in this exciting game!</p><br/><p> Starting July 26, 2024, you will be able to get unique skins that will help you stand out from other players and give you an advantage in battle. To get this, you just need to link your Twitch account to the Global Warfare 2 game and follow streams with Drops activation.</p><br/><p> Here is the final list of skins you can get:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Fire Sword - This powerful blade will add a fiery effect to your weapon and make you a true warrior.</li><br/><li> Dragonscale Armor - With this impenetrable armor you will be invincible in battle.</li><br/><li> Electron Shield - This shield will protect you from attacks and deal damage to enemies.</li><br/><li> Cybernetic Implant - This enhancement deals additional damage and increases your skills.</li><br/><li> Special paint coating for equipment - will make your equipment a real work of art.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to get these amazing skins and get ready for epic battles in Global Warfare 2!</p>'),
(9976, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new skins added to Rust on Steam this week and how they can enhance your gaming experience.'),
(9977, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, updates, appearance, weapons, clothes, protective equipment, cosmetic additions'),
(9978, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the page with information about the new batch of skins in the game Rust on Steam! Every week the developers delight us with new and unique skins that allow us to give our items a special style and individuality.</p><br/><br/><p> In this article, we will tell you about the most interesting and significant skins that were added this week. Get ready for an exciting dive into the world of creative and stylish solutions for your gaming experience in Rust!</p><br/><br/><p> This week\'s new batch of skins not only introduces new weapon, armor, and tool skins, but also exclusive clothing sets for your character. You\'ll be able to stand out from other players and create a unique look that matches your playstyle.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the most notable skins this week was the weapon net, which came in an interesting themed style. Not only do these skins look great, but they can also give you an advantage in the game thanks to their bright colors and recognizable design.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, the new batch of skins also includes skins for protective equipment, which will not only be a decoration, but also additional protection for your character. You will be able to choose a skin that suits your style and will match other elements of your equipment.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget that skins in Rust are not just cosmetic additions. They are also a way to support the developers and help fund the further development of the game. When you buy a skin, you are investing in the future of Rust and helping it become even better.</p><br/><br/><p> All of this week\'s new skins are already available in the Steam store, so don\'t miss the opportunity to update your collection and give your game a new impressive look. By purchasing new skins, you not only improve your gaming experience, but also support the game\'s developers.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow the updates and new skin releases in the game Rust on Steam to stay up to date with the latest and most interesting new products. We wish you a pleasant choice and successful purchases!</p>'),
(9979, 'en-US', 'Global update goes live today at 21:00'),
(9980, 'en-US', 'Today, at 21:00, a global update will take place in the game Rust, which will bring many interesting changes: the introduction of bicycles and motorcycles, a new merchant, handcuffs and a prisoner\'s bag, as well as dynamic prices in stores. Find out more in our article!'),
(9981, 'en-US', 'Global update, Rust, bicycles, motorcycles, traveling merchant, handcuffs, prisoner\'s bag, dynamic prices, NPC shops'),
(9982, 'en-US', 'Today, at 21:00, a global update will take place in the game Rust. This update will bring a huge number of interesting changes and innovations that we are looking forward to. Let\'s take a look at the main changes that await us:'),
(9983, 'en-US', 'Hidden Rare Achievement on Rust Tutorial Island'),
(9984, 'en-US', 'Find out about the hidden rare achievement on the tutorial island of the game Rust and get a detailed guide to get it in our telegram channel Rust Community.'),
(9985, 'en-US', 'achievements, tutorial island, Rust, rare achievements, guide'),
(9986, 'en-US', 'Do you like collecting achievements in games? Did you know that there is a hidden, very rare achievement on the training island in the game Rust? In this article, we will tell you more about it!<br/><br/> During the tutorial island in Rust, each player can get a default achievement for successfully completing the tutorial. But now there is another achievement that is hidden and has a very low probability of getting - only 0.1%!<br/><br/> What do you need to do to get this rare achievement? For this, you will need a detailed guide, which you can find in our telegram channel Rust Community. In the guide, we will tell you all the secrets and tricks that will help you get this rare achievement.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to become the owner of a hidden rare achievement on the Rust training island! Once you get it, you can brag to your friends and the community.<br/><br/> Visit our Rust Community telegram channel and get access to a detailed guide to getting a hidden rare achievement on the training island in the game Rust!'),
(9987, 'en-US', 'Added new sounds for bicycle and motorcycle'),
(9988, 'en-US', 'Rust has added new sounds for the bicycle and motorcycle, as well as the ability to use a bicycle bell.'),
(9989, 'en-US', 'new sounds, bike, motorcycle, update, realism'),
(9990, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has received some changes to the sounds of bicycles and motorcycles.</p><br/><p> Players will now be able to enjoy improved audio for these vehicles. The sounds of the bike and motorcycle have been reworked and become more realistic, which will allow you to immerse yourself even more deeply in the game world.</p><br/><p> The update features the ability to use a bicycle bell with the left mouse button. Players will now be able to signal their presence and communicate with other players on the battlefield or in the city.</p><br/><p> New sounds will add atmosphere and realism to the gameplay, and the bicycle bell will become a useful communication tool for players.</p>'),
(9991, 'en-US', 'Wallpapers in Rust: Coming Soon to the Game'),
(9992, 'en-US', 'Rust developers are working on implementing wallpapers into the game. We find out when we can expect the new DLC and how it will affect the gameplay.'),
(9993, 'en-US', 'Rust, wallpaper, DLC, developers, game, update'),
(9994, 'en-US', 'The developers are actively working on implementing wallpapers into the game Rust, and everything points to them becoming available to players soon. Perhaps this will be part of the new DLC.'),
(9995, 'en-US', 'A First Look at Dynamic Vendor Pricing (npc)'),
(9996, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Rust update, which introduces dynamic prices for goods from NPC vendors. Prices will change depending on demand, requiring players to be flexible and adapt to the new conditions.'),
(9997, 'en-US', 'Dynamic Vendor Pricing, dynamic npc prices, Rust, update, NPC vendors, prices, demand, wipe'),
(9998, 'en-US', '<p>In our article we will look at the innovation in the game Rust - dynamic prices for goods from NPC sellers.</p><br/><p> What does this mean for players? Now, the prices of items that can be purchased from NPC vendors (such as outposts and the fishing village) will change depending on demand. This means that players will be able to buy items at lower prices when demand is low, and at higher prices when demand is high.</p><br/><p> A significant change is that after each wipe, the prices of items from NPC vendors are doubled. This means that players should be prepared for higher costs to purchase items after each server reset.</p><br/><p> The price change ranges from 50% to 200%. This means that depending on demand, the price of items can either double or decrease by half of the original cost.</p><br/><p> Dynamic prices for goods from NPC vendors is an interesting innovation that adds realism and dynamism to the economy of the game Rust. Players will have to show flexibility and strategic thinking to adapt to the changing environment and make the most profitable purchases.</p>'),
(9999, 'en-US', 'Check out this week\'s fresh batch of skins in Rust. Personalize your gameplay with new skins for armor, weapons, interior items, and clothing. Support the developers and add some atmosphere to the game.'),
(10000, 'en-US', 'Rust, game Rust, skins, armor, weapons, interior items, clothes, Steam store'),
(10001, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the exciting world of Rust! If you are a fan of this popular game on Steam, then you will definitely be pleased with the news about the release of a fresh batch of skins this week. After all, skins are not just cosmetic decoration, they allow you to stand out from other players, create a unique style and emphasize your individual taste.</p><br/><br/><p> In this update, Rust developers have prepared an incredible variety of skins for you. You will find everything you can imagine: from weapons and armor to interior items and clothing. Each item is designed with the smallest details, which creates a sense of reality and adds atmosphere to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins give you the opportunity to personalize your gameplay and create a unique image for your character. You can become a stylish mercenary with cool equipment, decorate your base with elegant furniture or turn your weapon into a real work of art. Armed with new skins, you will be irresistible and the ruler of Rast.</p><br/><br/><p> However, do not forget that new skins are not only a way to stand out, but also a way to support the game developers. By purchasing skins, you financially support the team that is working hard to improve the gameplay and realize your wildest fantasies. Each purchase is important and contributes to the development of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your skin collection and add some freshness to the game. The last batch of skins of this week is already available in the Steam store. Go on an adventure with new skins and create a unique story in the world of Rasta!</p>'),
(10002, 'en-US', 'STEAM has launched summer discounts on games'),
(10003, 'en-US', 'STEAM has launched summer discounts on games, including the popular RUST game and its add-ons. Embark on a dangerous adventure at an attractive price!'),
(10004, 'en-US', 'STEAM, summer discounts, games, RUST, add-ons'),
(10005, 'en-US', 'The long-awaited summer has arrived, which means that STEAM is delighting fans of video games with seasonal discounts! Now you have a great opportunity to replenish your collection of games at a tasty price. One of the hottest offers is a discount on the game RUST and its add-ons, which can now be purchased much cheaper than usual.<br/><br/> RUST is a unique multiplayer survival simulator that allows you to plunge into a dangerous but exciting world full of adventures and the fight for survival. Endless forests, sandy beaches and dangerous wastelands - you have to explore these spaces, collect resources, build fortifications and confront other players. In RUST, every detail matters, and only those who can use all available resources as efficiently as possible will be able to stay alive.<br/><br/> The RUST game has many add-ons that expand the player\'s capabilities. New weapons, building materials, research and much more add additional depth and variety to the game. Now, thanks to STEAM summer discounts, you have the opportunity to purchase all these add-ons at a more favorable price, which will significantly expand the gaming experience and add new aspects to your adventures.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to add more games to your STEAM collection at a more attractive price! Hurry up, because summer discounts will only last for a certain time. Hurry up and buy the RUST game and its add-ons to go on an unforgettable adventure full of danger and survival.'),
(10006, 'en-US', 'Developers plan to add barricade installation on roads in the game Rust'),
(10007, 'en-US', 'In the latest updates to the game Rust, the developers plan to add the installation of barricades on the roads. The new feature will allow players to control traffic on the roads, create shelters and basic defenses.'),
(10008, 'en-US', 'Rust game, update, barricades on roads, new feature, basic defense, game tactics, balance, developers'),
(10009, 'en-US', 'News related to the update of the game Rust'),
(10010, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Skin Distribution Information'),
(10011, 'en-US', 'Check out regular skin giveaways on Twitch Drops in Rust on Steam. Exclusive items are available every month! Connect with the community and enjoy the game with Twitch Drops.'),
(10012, 'en-US', 'Rust Game on Steam, Twitch Drops, Skin Giveaways, Exclusive Items, Twitch Streams, Gaming Community'),
(10013, 'en-US', '<p>Alistair has some exciting news to share – Twitch Drops are going to be a monthly event this year! If you’re a fan of the game Rust on Steam, you’re in luck because you can expect regular skin giveaways via Twitch Drops.</p><br/><br/><p> Many players have already appreciated the benefits of Twitch Drops — the ability to receive exclusive skins and items in the game simply by watching streams on the Twitch platform. This year, skin distributions on Twitch Drops are expected to be ongoing, every month.</p><br/><br/><p> This regular skin giveaway schedule will allow players to have a better chance of getting the items they want for their Rust character. Additionally, the deal signed between the game developers and Twitch means that future giveaways will happen with greater frequency and regularity.</p><br/><br/><p> It’s also worth noting that Twitch Drops make the process of getting skins more convenient and accessible for all players. You no longer need to trade on third-party markets or spend large amounts of money to get the skin you want. All you need to do is watch a Twitch stream and participate in the giveaway.</p><br/><br/><p> Twitch Drops are also a great way for Rust fans to get involved in the community and participate in events. By choosing to participate in a drop, you can chat with other players, keep up with news and updates, and support your favorite streamers and create your own streams.</p><br/><br/><p> As you can see, Twitch Drops are not only an opportunity to get exclusive skins and items, but also a great way to interact with the gaming community and enjoy the game Rust to the fullest. Don\'t miss your chance to become the owner of unique items for your character!</p>'),
(10014, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam Update 261 Twitch Drops Info'),
(10015, 'en-US', 'Learn about new Twitch Drops in Rust update 261 on Steam'),
(10016, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Update 261, Rust, Steam'),
(10017, 'en-US', '<p>The recent update 261 for the game Rust on the Steam platform brought many new opportunities for players. One of the most interesting innovations was the introduction of Twitch Drops - special rewards for viewers of streams that they can receive by watching the game broadcasts on Twitch.</p><p> The developers of the game Rust have provided information about the next Twitch Drops that will be available to players. These rewards can be frame-by-frame skins for weapons, equipment, or other items that can be used in the game.</p><p> Update 261 opened up new opportunities for Rust players, allowing them to enjoy the game even more. Now they can not only play, but also receive valuable rewards in the form of skins and items thanks to Twitch Drops.</p><p> Thus, Twitch Drops become another attractive element of the Rust game, allowing players to receive unique items without which their gaming experience will be incomplete. Don’t miss the opportunity to watch Rust streams on Twitch and get exclusive rewards!</p><br/> <i>26.07.2024</i>'),
(10018, 'en-US', 'New Traveling Trader Skin: A Stylish and Elegant Makeover'),
(10019, 'en-US', 'The new skin for the traveling merchant in the game Rust allows you to create an attractive and stylish image that emphasizes the individuality of the player.'),
(10020, 'en-US', 'new skin, traveling merchant, game Rust, appearance update, fashion, self-expression'),
(10021, 'en-US', '<p>Imagine a traveling merchant in Rust who suddenly appears before you in a new, eye-catching appearance update. Every detail of his outfit is stylish and elegant, attracting everyone\'s attention.</p><br/><p> The new skin for the merchant in the game Rust is a unique opportunity to give your character a fresh and fashionable look. Updating the appearance of a popular game figure can completely change the player\'s perception of his character, emphasize his individuality and status.</p><br/><p> The traveling merchant with a new skin will become the focus of attention on the server. Stylish details of the outfit, reflecting the latest fashion trends, will attract admiring glances of other players, their visitors will long examine and analyze every detail of clothing and accessories of the traveling merchant.</p><br/><p> A new skin for a merchant is not just an update of appearance, it is another opportunity for players to show their individuality and express their taste. The choice of specific elements of clothing and accessories for the character creates new opportunities for self-expression and becomes another arena for self-expression in the virtual world of the game.</p><br/><p> Thus, the new skin for the traveling merchant in the game Rust is not only a change in the appearance of the character, but also a way to create a unique image that will attract attention and command respect.</p>'),
(10022, 'en-US', 'Check out the new skins in Rust this week and pick something special for your collection! Play with style!'),
(10023, 'en-US', 'downloads, Rust, Steam, skins batch, new skins'),
(10024, 'en-US', '<h2>New batch of skins - your treasures this week!</h2><br/><p> Welcome to a new week in the world of Rust! We are pleased to present you with a fresh batch of exciting skins that are sure to please all players.</p><br/><p> Each week is an opportunity to update your collection or find a skin that suits you. Players are offered new skin options for a variety of items, such as weapons, clothing, buildings, and many others.</p><br/><p> In this week\'s batch of skins, we carefully selected a variety of designs and styles to ensure that every player can find something unique for themselves. We are confident that our new skins will allow you to stand out on the battlefield and highlight your playstyle.</p><br/><p> But beyond the aesthetic value, there are other benefits to using skins. They can also give you an advantage in the game, because when you encounter a familiar skin, the enemy may lose their vigilance, and you may become less noticeable against the background of the surrounding world of Rust.</p><br/><p> If you want to learn more about the skins available, just visit our Steam Store page and browse all the new offers. Here you will also find additional information about each skin, including its features and value.</p><br/><p> Get inspired, take a look at the fresh skins, and maybe you\'ll make a great choice for your collection or to improve your Rust experience.</p>'),
(10025, 'en-US', 'New gestures are coming to the game'),
(10026, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new gestures coming soon to Rust. Players will now be able to customize their own gesture wheel.'),
(10027, 'en-US', 'game Rust, new gestures, update, gesture wheel settings'),
(10028, 'en-US', '<p>Stay tuned for more interactions in Rust! Coming soon, you\'ll find new gestures that will add more depth and variety to the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> The development team is working tirelessly to expand the game\'s functionality, and now the entire Rust world is waiting for the release of a new update. The appearance of new gestures is one of the most long-awaited innovations.</p><br/><br/><p> The Hackweek project has recently ended, and the test branch of the game is now ready for players to check out. This means you will be able to check out the new content and give your feedback and suggestions to the development team.</p><br/><br/><p> The new gestures in Rust are unique in that they allow you to fully customize your own gesture wheel. Now you can create and use gestures that reflect your playstyle and communication with other players with complete freedom.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to be a part of this unique gaming experience. Stay tuned for updates and get ready for new gestures to appear in Rust!</p>'),
(10029, 'en-US', 'A short video about new types of transport - bicycles and motorcycles'),
(10030, 'en-US', 'This article presents a short video about new types of transport in the game Rust - bicycles and motorcycles. Find out how these new vehicles can improve your gaming experience and make it easier to move around the game world.'),
(10031, 'en-US', 'short video, new types of transport, bicycles, motorcycles, game Rust'),
(10032, 'en-US', 'This video introduces new modes of transport in the game Rust - bicycles and motorcycles. Now players will be able to enjoy new ways of moving around the game world. Bicycles will allow you to move comfortably along the roads, and motorcycles will be available at various monuments. Such new vehicles will allow players to explore the game world faster and more comfortably, as well as move between locations more efficiently. Purchasing and using these new vehicles will open up new opportunities for players and enhance their gaming experience. From now on, you will be able to quickly get to the right place on a bicycle or motorcycle! Enjoy your journey through the world of Rust!'),
(10033, 'en-US', 'New Garage Door Skin - Fake Wall Garage Door'),
(10034, 'en-US', 'Check out the stylish new garage door skin in the Rust Workshop - Fake Wall Garage Door. Vote to add it to the game!'),
(10035, 'en-US', 'New Skin, Garage Door, Fake Wall Garage Door, Rust Workshop, Vote'),
(10036, 'en-US', '<h1>New Garage Door Skin - Fake Wall Garage Door</h1><br/><p> We found a very interesting and stylish garage door skin for you in the Rust workshop. If you want to see this skin in the game, vote for it in the workshop!</p><br/><img src=\"garage_skin_img.jpg\" alt=\"Fake Wall Garage Door\"><br/><p> Skin name: Fake Wall Garage Door</p><br/><p> How do you like this new skin? It has a unique design that will add originality and style to your garage door. The skin is made in a modern style, with an illustration of an old brick wall. This skin will definitely appeal to fans of non-standard solutions and will add atmosphere to your game.</p><br/><p> If you are interested in adding this skin to the game, please vote for it in the Rust Workshop. Your votes may influence the developers to include this skin in the next update!</p>'),
(10037, 'en-US', 'Rust Update - Added Motorcycles and Bicycles to the Test Version of the Game'),
(10038, 'en-US', 'Learn about the Rust update, which adds motorcycles and bicycles to the test version, giving players new options for moving around the game world and exciting gameplay.'),
(10039, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, motorcycles, bicycles, test version, release'),
(10040, 'en-US', '<p>The new update to the Rust game promises many interesting opportunities for players. Motorcycles and bicycles were added to the test version, which will add new options for moving around the game world.</p><br/><p> According to the information available at the moment, the developers have offered players several options for vehicles. Motorcycles are available in two- and three-wheeled models, allowing players to choose the best option for their adventures. They are powered by TNK, which adds realism to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> Bicycles, on the other hand, can be found on the roads of the game world. This will provide players with a fast and eco-friendly means of transportation, especially in the early stages of the game.</p><br/><p> The official release of the update with motorcycles and bicycles is expected to take place on July 4. It should be noted that this data is subject to change, and the developers may make additional changes and fixes before the release.</p><br/><p> We are looking forward to the release of the update and hope that it will add new and exciting gameplay for all fans of the game Rust.</p>'),
(10041, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has been released in the game Rust on the Steam platform'),
(10042, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam is delighting its players with a new batch of exciting and stylish skins! Find out how the new skins affect the gaming experience, the game\'s economy, and how to express your preferences in the development of the game.'),
(10043, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, skins in Rust, updates, economy, gaming community, gaming experience'),
(10044, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam is delighting its players with a new batch of exciting and stylish skins! If you are a fan of Rust, then you should definitely pay attention to these new items that will add uniqueness to your gaming experience.<br/> The new batch of skins includes a variety of items, from weapons and equipment to decorative and interior elements. Each item has its own unique design, which will allow you to stand out from other players and give your game character your own style.<br/> Skins in the game Rust not only decorate your items, but can also affect the game mechanics. Some skins can give bonuses to movement speed or increase weapon damage. Therefore, the choice of skins is not only a question of appearance, but also a tactical component of the game.<br/> However, it is worth remembering that new skins are not only a chance to update your collection, but also an opportunity to earn money. Some rare and sought-after skins can significantly increase in price on the Steam marketplace, which allows players to earn money by selling their items.<br/> Also, keep in mind that adding new skins to Rust can affect the balance of the game economy. The appearance of new items can cause an increase in demand for certain resources, which can affect their price and availability.<br/> It is important to note that the developers of the Rust game pay special attention to the player community, and therefore the skins that are added to the game are often selected based on the preferences and suggestions of players. This means that each new release of skins is not only the result of the work of the developers, but also many wishes and ideas of the gaming community. Follow the updates and express your preferences to see exactly those skins that interest you.<br/> So, the new batch of skins in the game Rust on the Steam platform is a great way to update your collection, emphasize your individuality and even earn money. Don\'t miss the chance to buy the most stylish and popular items!'),
(10045, 'en-US', 'First Look at Rust\'s New Traveling Merchant'),
(10046, 'en-US', 'Let\'s take a look at the new feature in Rust - the traveling merchant. Let\'s find out what he offers and how players can use him.'),
(10047, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, Travelling Vendor, traveling merchant'),
(10048, 'en-US', 'First look at the new Travelling Vendor.<br/><br/> Today we will look at a new feature added to the game Rust - Traveling Vendor. Although the feature is still in development and has some flaws (like the lack of textures), it already offers interesting possibilities for players.<br/><br/> What do we know about the new traveling merchant?<br/> - Traveling Vendor will patrol the road network and can be stopped by players. This creates an opportunity for interactive trading and resource exchange.<br/> - The merchant offers a random assortment of goods, including weapons, resources, and other items. All you have to do to purchase something from him is exchange scrap metal.<br/> - Don\'t forget that there will be turrets on the merchant\'s roof to protect him. Be careful when interacting with him!<br/><br/> While the Traveling Merchant feature is still in development and has some texture issues, it promises to add an interesting and additional dimension to the Rust game. We look forward to the final implementation of this feature and hope to continue to refine and improve it.<br/><br/> <b>Happy shopping and safe meetings with the merchant!</b>'),
(10049, 'en-US', 'First Look at the DVP \"Diver Propulsion Vehicle\" Aqua Scooter'),
(10050, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the DVP \"Diver Propulsion Vehicle\" aqua scooter - an innovative device for underwater diving that provides the ability to dive faster and with less effort. Find out about the benefits of the aqua scooter and how it can become your reliable companion under water.'),
(10051, 'en-US', 'DVP aquascooter, Diver Propulsion Vehicle aquascooter, scuba diving, underwater exploration, underwater photography, underwater videography'),
(10052, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the DVP \"Diver Propulsion Vehicle\" aqua scooter - an innovative device for underwater diving that allows you to dive faster and with less effort. This compact and powerful means of transportation was developed with the needs of divers and underwater explorers in mind. Why do you need an aqua scooter and what benefits does it offer? Let\'s find out!<br/><br/> The DVP \"Diver Propulsion Vehicle\" aqua scooter is an electric device that allows you to move underwater using a propeller drive. It is equipped with a powerful battery that provides long operating time and sufficient speed for comfortable and effective swimming.<br/><br/> The advantages of the aqua scooter are obvious. Firstly, it significantly increases the speed of movement under water, allowing researchers to quickly and easily cover large distances. This is especially useful for those involved in underwater photography or video filming. Secondly, the aqua scooter significantly saves the swimmer\'s energy and effort, so it is ideal for long dives and research work. Thirdly, the DVP aqua scooter is lightweight and compact, so it is easy to transport and store.<br/><br/> If you are planning a dive or are interested in underwater photography, the DVP aqua scooter can become your reliable companion. Don\'t miss the opportunity to experience new sensations and discover your potential underwater!'),
(10053, 'en-US', 'Find a new skin in the Rust workshop - Forest Camo'),
(10054, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new interesting skin in the Rust workshop - Forest Camo and vote for its addition to the game.'),
(10055, 'en-US', 'new skin, Rust workshop, Forest Camo, voting, adding to game');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(10056, 'en-US', '<p>I recently discovered an amazing skin in the Rust workshop - Forest Camo. This skin will outshine all others, with its style and originality. The foliage and green tones create the illusion of turning your character into a part of the forest, making it almost invisible to opponents.</p><br/><br/><p> If you want this exciting skin to be added to the game, you can vote for it in the workshop. Solo votes are important because the developers pay attention to the wishes of the players and their preferences when adding new content.</p><br/><br/><p> Forest Camo comes in two variations: pants and a hoodie in a camo style. You can add them to your wardrobe and give your character a new, stylish look. Update your clothes and encourage the developers to implement this amazing skin in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Forest Camo is not only a fashionable addition to your character, but also an item that can affect your gameplay tactics. Hiding in the shadows of the forest, you can quietly approach enemies, conduct ambushes or wait for the right moment to attack. This skin not only adds style, but also gives you an advantage in the fight for survival.</p><br/><br/><p> So if you like Forest Camo, don\'t forget to vote in the workshop and help this skin become official content in the game Rust. Your vote could be the deciding factor in adding this awesome skin to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Learn more about the Forest Camo skin and vote for it now!</p>'),
(10057, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops RUST Round Runs Until June 17'),
(10058, 'en-US', 'Check out the new round of Twitch Drops for Rust! Get 14 cool skins and add some style to your game. The promotion runs until June 17.'),
(10059, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, skins, game, promotion, broadcasts, participation, need to connect an account, time is limited, inventory, style'),
(10060, 'en-US', '<p>The new 30th round of Twitch Drops for the game Rust has arrived! Don\'t miss the chance to get 14 cool skins for your in-game character. The round will last until June 17, so you have a whole week to get them all!</p><br/><p> What are Twitch Drops? This is a special promotion that allows players to earn free items in the game simply by watching broadcasts on the Twitch platform. In this round of Twitch Drops for Rust, there are 14 unique skins available that will allow you to change the appearance of your character, weapons, and other items.</p><br/><p> How to participate? It\'s very simple! All you need to do is connect your Steam account to Twitch, start a stream with Drops for the game Rust and enjoy watching. The longer you watch the streams, the more chances you have to get skins.</p><br/><p> Be careful, time to participate is limited. Don\'t miss the opportunity to get all 14 skins that are available only in this round of Twitch Drops. Don\'t forget to check your inventory on steamcommunity.com to make sure the skins have been successfully added to your game.</p><br/><p> Don\'t waste any time! Grab these unique skins and add some style to your Rust game. The Twitch Drops round will run until June 17, so don\'t miss out!</p>'),
(10061, 'en-US', 'New Frontier Hazmat Skin in the Works'),
(10062, 'en-US', 'A new Hazmat skin called Frontier Hazmat is in development for Rust on Steam. Whether this will be a new DLC or an addition to Frontier is not yet known.'),
(10063, 'en-US', 'new skin, Frontier Hazmat, development, DLC, add-on, Rust, Steam'),
(10064, 'en-US', '<p>A new Hazmat skin called Frontier Hazmat is in development!</p><br/><p> Mysterious and attractive, this skin promises to be an integral part of the Rust update on Steam.</p><br/><p> While we don\'t know yet whether Frontier Hazmat will be a new DLC or an addition to the existing Frontier, it\'s certainly something that has players excited for its release.</p>'),
(10065, 'en-US', 'New updates in the game Rust: 2 long-awaited additions have arrived'),
(10066, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest updates to Rust, which include 2 new and important additions.'),
(10067, 'en-US', 'game Rust, updates, new locations, repair mechanics, additions'),
(10068, 'en-US', '<p>Something interesting happened in the recent update of the game Rust on Steam - the developers added 2 new and exciting features. This event caused a lot of excitement and excitement among players who were eagerly waiting for the release of these additions. In this article, we will look into the details of these updates and their impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><h2> 1. New location: \"Location name\"</h2><br/><p> The first major update is the addition of a new location called \"Location Name\". This is a unique location in the world of Rust that offers players new opportunities and challenges. The location has a beautiful design and an interesting scenario, which allows you to immerse yourself even deeper into the world of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> In \"Location Name\" you will find new resources, tasks and dangers that will force you to use your survival skills to the fullest. Every corner of this location hides something unique, and exploring it will be an exciting adventure.</p><br/><br/><h2> 2. Improved item repair mechanics</h2><br/><p> The second update that cannot go unnoticed is the improvement of the item repair mechanics. Now players will be able to repair damaged equipment and buildings more efficiently. This solution is designed to simplify and speed up the repair process, which will allow players to devote more time to other important aspects of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> The new item repair mechanic also provides more flexibility for players. You will now be able to choose which items to repair first to improve the efficiency of your base or improve your own equipment.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, this is a very significant update that will make the gameplay more enjoyable and comfortable for all players.</p><br/><br/><h2> Conclusions</h2><br/><p> Updates in the game Rust always attract a lot of attention and excitement from players, and it is not surprising - they bring new features and improvements to the game world. Adding a new location \"Location Name\" and improving the mechanics of repairing items is just the beginning. The developers continue to delight us with new features and improvements, making the game even more exciting and fun.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to dive deeper into the Rust gaming world with these new updates. We are sure that they will bring you a lot of joy and adventure!</p>'),
(10069, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Exclusive Collection for Your Unique Experience!'),
(10070, 'en-US', 'Check out the new skins in Rust that offer unique designs and allow you to stand out from other players, update your collection today!'),
(10071, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, exclusive collection, unique experience'),
(10072, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for all Rust players! A new batch of skins has been released that will bring freshness and individuality to your gaming experience. Each new skin offers a unique design, allowing you to stand out from the crowd and create a truly unique look.</p><br/><br/><p> For those looking for something special, the exclusive skin collection will be a real discovery. It offers the rarest and most impressive options, allowing you to feel like a true connoisseur of art in the gaming world.</p><br/><br/><p> Be enchanted by the variety of styles and themes presented in the new batch of skins.<br/> From classic historical looks to modern styles and sci-fi themes, you\'re sure to find something that reflects your unique gaming personality.</p><br/><br/><p> Each skin not only changes the appearance of your character or item, but also provides practical advantages in the game. Throw away conservative standards and take advantage of new opportunities to achieve greater success in battles and conquest of the world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> Updated skins in the game Rust are not just a new decoration, but also an opportunity to immerse yourself in a world of imagination, where your individuality and creativity will be the key to victory. Reveal your potential and update your skin collection today!</p>'),
(10073, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Cargo\'s path will now be displayed on the map'),
(10074, 'en-US', 'Rust Update: Cargo\'s path will now be displayed on the map. Find out how this change improves gameplay and interaction between players.'),
(10075, 'en-US', 'Rust game updates, Cargo route, map, new features, gameplay, resources, player interaction, strategic planning'),
(10076, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam continues to please its fans with new features and functions. In the latest update, the developers added an interesting detail - now the path of Cargo will be shown on the map.</p><br/><br/><p> This change greatly improves gameplay and helps players navigate the area. Previously, finding and following Cargo required relying on map knowledge and experience. With this feature, players will be able to easily find and follow the mighty freight train.</p><br/><br/><p> For many players, this was one of the most anticipated features. It allows them to optimize their time and effort when moving around the game world. Now you don’t have to spend a lot of time searching and waiting for Cargo to appear - its path will be clearly displayed on the map.</p><br/><br/><p> Additionally, this change introduces a new element of interaction between players. By tracking the Cargo\'s path on the map, players can plan their actions more effectively. They can anticipate where the train will deliver valuable resources and prepare for that moment in advance.</p><br/><br/><p> But as usual, with new features come some trade-offs. Some players may feel that displaying the Cargo\'s path on the map simplifies the gameplay and takes away some of the realism. But the developers are confident that this is a balanced change that will make the game more convenient and fun for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, the update to see Cargo\'s path on the map is a significant improvement to Rust. It will help players navigate and optimize their time in the game world, as well as add new opportunities for interaction and strategic planning.</p>'),
(10077, 'en-US', 'Alistair'),
(10078, 'en-US', 'We are announcing a partnership with a third party to remove and combat cheat-related content. This initiative extends to video content, including channels uploading videos featuring Rust cheats.'),
(10079, 'en-US', 'Alistair, partnership, fight, materials, cheats, removal, video content, Rust, channel'),
(10080, 'en-US', '<h2>Alistair - Partnership to combat cheat related content</h2><br/><p> We are pleased to announce our new partnership with a third party that will handle content removal on our behalf. One of the primary goals of this team will be to combat and combat content related to cheating.</p><br/><p> Removal of suspicious content will only be performed at the request of specially trained Facepunch employees after a thorough review. We completely exclude the possibility of accidental deletions or automation of this process.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that this initiative also applies to video content. If you have uploaded a video with a Rust cheat, your channel may be subject to removal.</p>'),
(10081, 'en-US', 'Developers are working on the Diver Propulsion Vehicle (DVP)'),
(10082, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust are working on the DVP - Diver Propulsion Vehicle, similar to an aqua scooter. Soon there will be an opportunity to explore underwater spaces and get new emotions and opportunities in the game.'),
(10083, 'en-US', 'Rust, DVP, Diver Propulsion Vehicle, aqua scooter, underwater RT, developers, updates, game'),
(10084, 'en-US', '<p>In the world of Rust on Steam, developers are working tirelessly on a new and exciting project - the Diver Propulsion Vehicle, or DVP for short. For those unfamiliar with the concept, the DVP is a vehicle that can move underwater, similar to an aqua scooter.</p><br/><p> This unique addition to Rust opens up new possibilities for players to explore the underwater world. With the help of DVP, they will be able to explore the depths of the ocean and discover hidden resources that they never knew existed. This means that players will have a whole new level of interaction with the surrounding objects and other players.</p><br/><p> The news of the development of DVP in the game Rust is causing a lot of interest and excitement among players. Many hope that soon they will be able to dive into the underwater world with different types of DVP and enjoy the benefits that it provides. Perhaps this is the step that will add new depth and uniqueness to the game Rust.</p><br/><p> The development team has promised to release underwater RTs - additional updates that will bring even more underwater adventures to the game. This will encourage players to look forward to it and improve the overall experience.</p><br/><p> We are looking forward to the appearance of the Diver Propulsion Vehicle in Rust. We are sure that this will be a real breakthrough in the gaming world and will provide players with new emotions and opportunities that they could not even dream of.</p>'),
(10085, 'en-US', 'Final List of Twitch Drops Bellum Skins'),
(10086, 'en-US', 'Learn all about the upcoming Twitch Drops Bellum event in Rust and find the full list of skins that can be obtained. Update your skin collection now!'),
(10087, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Bellum, Skin List, Promotion, Rust, Collection Update'),
(10088, 'en-US', 'Find out everything you need to know about the upcoming Twitch Drops Bellum event, which will run from June 10 to June 17. In this article, you will find a full list of skins that can be obtained during the event. Don\'t miss your chance to update your skin collection in Rust!'),
(10089, 'en-US', 'First look at the handcuffs and bag over the head'),
(10090, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will take a look at the new update to the Rust game, which introduced handcuffs and a bag over the head. We will find out how these elements affect the gameplay and what they can offer to players.'),
(10091, 'en-US', 'game Rust, handcuffs, bag on head, update, functionality'),
(10092, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we will look at the new update to the game Rust, which introduced handcuffs and a bag on the head. Let\'s look at their functionality and impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><h2> Handcuffs:</h2><br/><p> Handcuffs in Rust can now only be applied to a lying or injured player.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> They block access to their inventory and prohibit respawning (suicide).</li><br/><li> A handcuffed player can be pushed and have his inventory searched by other players.</li><br/><li> Removing the handcuffs takes 10 seconds, but the process can be interrupted if the player is attacked.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><h2> Bag on the head:</h2><br/><p> With a bag on his head, the player\'s vision is severely limited and he cannot open the map.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> The bag on the head can be put on using the enemy\'s inventory.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> These new features add more realism and tactical complexity to the game, and players will now have to be more careful and vigilant to avoid being caught in such a film.</p><br/><br/><p> Thanks to user cipeaX for the information!</p>'),
(10093, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Bellum Skin List Update'),
(10094, 'en-US', 'The Twitch Drops Bellum skin list update in Rust will begin on June 10th. Get ready to receive unique and stylish skins that will help you stand out from other players and add a personal touch to your gaming experience.'),
(10095, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, Twitch Drops Bellum, update, unique, gaming experience'),
(10096, 'en-US', 'Get ready for a skin update! Starting June 10th, there will be an update to the list of Twitch Drops Bellum skins that will be available to players in the game Rust. This means that you will have to discover and get completely new, unique and stylish skins for your in-game character. The new Twitch Drops Bellum skins are the perfect way to stand out from other players and add a personal touch to your gaming experience.<br/><br/> How exactly do you get these incredible skins? All you have to do is connect your Twitch account to your Steam account, and starting June 10, you will be awarded Twitch Drops Bellum skins for watching Rust streams on the Twitch platform. Just enjoy the fun streams, contribute to the chat, and collect rewards in the form of unique skins.<br/><br/> Each of the Twitch Drops Bellum skins has its own unique design and style, allowing you to express your individuality in the game. You will be able to change the appearance of weapons, clothes and other items, adding your own unique touch to the game atmosphere. Be prepared for your character to look stylish and original, attracting admiring glances from other players.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to get these incredible skins in the game Rust. The Twitch Drops Bellum skin list update will start on June 10th. Get ready for a unique and new gaming experience with the incredible Twitch Drops Bellum skins!'),
(10097, 'en-US', 'High-speed rockets now have a unique explosion sound'),
(10098, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam adds a unique explosion sound to high-speed rockets, creating new possibilities for game modes and teamwork.'),
(10099, 'en-US', 'high speed rockets, explosion sound, update, Rust, game on Steam, strategic decisions'),
(10100, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust on Steam has brought some amazing changes to the worlds of high-speed rockets. Now, the explosion effect is taken to a new level by introducing a unique sound!</p><br/><p> This unique explosion sound differentiates the speed rockets from the regular ones. Players will now be able to easily recognize when a speed rocket has been used and ignite their adrenaline.</p><br/><p> The developers have tried to create the most realistic explosion sound to immerse players in the atmosphere of battle and make the gameplay even more exciting. Each explosion now sounds unique, allowing players to easily distinguish between different types of missiles and make strategic decisions based on sound signals.</p><br/><p> The new explosion sound not only enhances the gameplay experience, but also offers new opportunities for game modes and teamwork. Players can use this unique explosion sound to coordinate attacks on enemy bases or prevent invasions of their territory.</p><br/><p> Rest assured that the high-speed rockets in the game Rust now have not only the power of destruction, but also a unique sound effect that allows players to realize their presence in the game world. Be prepared for epic battles, because the sound of the explosion unites us in this extreme world of survival!</p>'),
(10101, 'en-US', 'Fix for the ability to place ladders on RTs in Rust'),
(10102, 'en-US', 'In the latest update to Rust, the ability to place ladders on RTs has been fixed, which allows for a more balanced game and prevents possible flaws and vulnerabilities.'),
(10103, 'en-US', 'Fix, Placement, Stairs, RT, Rust, Update'),
(10104, 'en-US', 'In the latest update to the Rust game, the developers have made an important change related to the placement of ladders on the RT. Previously, players were able to install them on the Staging Branch, but now this feature has been fixed and is only available on the main game platform. This change allows for a more balanced game and prevents possible shortcomings and vulnerabilities associated with the use of ladders on the RT. This is an important step in the development of the game, which allows for more fair conditions for all players and helps maintain balance in the gameplay. If you are a fan of Rust, do not miss this update and enjoy an improved gaming experience!'),
(10105, 'en-US', 'Reduced F15 flight sound by 45%'),
(10106, 'en-US', 'The F15 fighter jet\'s developers have reduced the aircraft\'s flight noise by 45 percent, which will significantly improve sustainability and flight safety.'),
(10107, 'en-US', 'flight sound reduction, F15, environmental sustainability, noise pollution, flight safety'),
(10108, 'en-US', '<p>The world-famous F15 fighter jet has traded its usual roar during flights for a quieter sound. The development team has implemented efforts to reduce the aircraft\'s noise level by 45 percent, significantly reducing its acoustic impact.</p><br/><p> This means that the F15 will now be much less disruptive to the environment, residents of nearby cities or even passengers of other aircraft in the air. The use of advanced technology and engineering solutions has made it possible to reduce the sound of the aircraft to safe and acceptable levels.</p><br/><p> This solution has not only ecological but also numerous other positive consequences. Reducing the noise level will help in the fight against the problem of noise pollution, will improve the quality of life of people living near airports or air bases.</p><br/><p> Changing the sound level could also significantly reduce pilots\' exposure to noise, improving their working conditions and increasing flight safety.</p><br/><p> The reduction of the F15 flight sound is one of the steps towards cleaner and more efficient technologies in aviation. It demonstrates the responsible attitude of developers and major manufacturers to the issue of environmental sustainability and protection of the environment.</p>'),
(10109, 'en-US', 'Update to the selection of a lower tier workbench in the game Rust'),
(10110, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has brought changes to the process of selecting a lower tier workbench, making the process more convenient and faster.'),
(10111, 'en-US', 'update, workbench selection, smaller shooting range, Rust game'),
(10112, 'en-US', '<h3>Updated lower tier workbench selection</h3><br/><p> The latest update to Rust has made changes to the functionality of selecting a lower tier workbench. Now it is much more convenient for players to select a workbench directly from the main tab of the current workbench.</p><br/><p> Previously, to select a workbench of a lower tier, the user had to switch to a separate menu, which took time and created additional inconvenience. However, thanks to this update, all the necessary selection options are now concentrated in one place, which greatly simplifies the process.</p><br/><p> The new tab allows you to easily view all available options for lower-tier workbenches, learn about their features, and choose the most suitable one for the current game situation. This is done so that players can quickly and effectively plan their actions and achieve their goals.</p><br/><p> The new update to the lower tier workbench selection makes gameplay much easier and faster, allowing players to focus on the core aspects of the game and get the most out of their Rust gameplay.</p>'),
(10113, 'en-US', 'Changes to No-Build Zones in Rust'),
(10114, 'en-US', 'Rust has seen changes to the no-build zones around some Radio Topics, switching to a sphere collider to improve the player experience.'),
(10115, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, game objects, no-build zone, changes'),
(10116, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have made changes to the zones where construction is prohibited around some Radio Topics. Previously, these zones were in the form of a rectangle, but now they have switched to a more convenient form - a spherical collider.<br/><br/> These changes affected several Radio Topics, in particular:<br/><br/><ul><li> Lighthouse - The construction ban zone is now 100 meters around the Lighthouse.</li><li> Supermarket - the construction prohibition zone is now also 100 meters around the Supermarket.</li><li> Gas Station - The no-construction zone remains 100 meters around the Gas Station.</li><li> Warehouse - the construction prohibition zone is also 100 meters around the Warehouse.</li></ul> These changes will improve the gameplay experience by preventing unauthorized construction around key game objects.'),
(10117, 'en-US', 'The date of the next Twitch Drops has been announced - June 9'),
(10118, 'en-US', 'Find out the date of the next Twitch Drops, which will take place on June 9th as part of the \"Bellum\" event. Two impressive skins have already been confirmed.'),
(10119, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops date, Bellum event, skins participants'),
(10120, 'en-US', 'The Twitch Drops event \"Bellum\" is coming soon! We are happy to announce that it will take place on June 9th. There is expected to be a lot of interest from players as two impressive skins have already been confirmed at the time of the announcement. We will tell you more about them so that you can stay up to date with all the details.'),
(10121, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest news and updates in Rust, including changes to solar panels, increased fertilizer yield, and the addition of sag wire support for Christmas lights.'),
(10122, 'en-US', 'News from the fields, updates, Rust game, solar panels, fertilizers, composter, sagging wire, Christmas lights'),
(10123, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the \"News from the Fields\" news review! Today we will share with you the latest updates in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> An important change has been made to solar panels. They no longer take damage when picked up. This means that players no longer have to worry about their solar panels being damaged when moving or rebuilding their base.</p><br/><p> Also, the developers decided to improve the process of producing fertilizers in the composter. Now the yield of fertilizers from bone fragments has been increased from 10:1 to 4:1. This reduces the time and resources needed to obtain fertilizers, which will help players develop faster and improve their buildings.</p><br/><p> Last but not least, we have added support for sagging wires for Christmas lights. Now you can create more realistic and colorful decorations for your base, which will be a great addition to the festive atmosphere.</p><br/><p> Stay up to date with the latest news and updates in the game Rust, follow our reviews \"News from the Fields\". Good luck in the game!</p>'),
(10124, 'en-US', 'New batch of Rust skins on Steam'),
(10125, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins for Rust on Steam. Update your look, add style, and personality with a variety of skins. Learn about the tradeoffs involved in choosing skins and the impact on gameplay.'),
(10126, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, Steam, gaming experience, aesthetics, practicality, compromises, servers, game modes'),
(10127, 'en-US', '<p>Hooray! The long-awaited new batch of skins for the game Rust is already available on Steam. Now you have the opportunity to update the appearance of your items and become even more stylish and unique in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> The Rust development team continues to delight players and offers a wide range of new skins for various items. From weapons and clothing to buildings and tools, you are guaranteed to enjoy how you can refresh your gaming experience.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes a variety of styles and themes so that every player can find something to suit their taste. You can choose dark and sinister skins to create an atmosphere of horror and tension, or bright and colorful skins to add a touch of fun and entertainment to the game.</p><br/><p> Skins play not only an aesthetic role, but also a practical one. They allow you to easily distinguish your items among many other players, and can also be an indicator of your status or achievements in the game.</p><br/><p> However, there is a trade-off between appearance and gaming performance to consider. Some skins may be more expensive and less useful, so it is worth carefully evaluating the pros and cons of a new skin before purchasing it.</p><br/><p> Additionally, not every skin will work on every server or game mode. Some servers may prohibit the use of certain skins to manage game balance or maintain realism. Therefore, before purchasing a new skin, it is recommended to check its validity on the server you are playing on.</p><br/><p> The new batch of Rust skins on Steam is an opportunity to bring freshness and individuality to your game. Renew your skin collection, stand out from other players and enjoy every moment in the exciting world of Rust!</p>'),
(10128, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update News: Now You Can Watch Your Ally\'s Construction'),
(10129, 'en-US', 'Learn about a new feature in Rust that allows you to observe your ally\'s construction and manage construction more efficiently.'),
(10130, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, construction, allies, observation, construction plan'),
(10131, 'en-US', '<p>For all Rust players who love to collaborate and build together, we have great news! The latest update to the game adds a new feature that allows you to watch your ally build. Now, when your partner or friend builds something, you will be able to see how he works with the construction plan, places items in boxes and creates new objects.</p><br/><br/><p> This feature gives you more control and allows you to collaborate more effectively with your team. Now you can easily track progress and discuss construction strategy with your allies. No more running to your comrades every now and then to find out what they are doing. Just open the viewing window and watch them turn your shared plans into reality.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, this feature can also be useful for training new players. If you have a new player on your team, they can watch your moves and learn from you. This way, you can effectively transfer knowledge and experience to your teammates.</p><br/><br/><p> We are confident that this new feature will bring many benefits to you and your team, make the game even more exciting and help you achieve greater results in the world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget to update your game and enjoy the new features this update will bring you!</p>'),
(10132, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest changes in Rust: placing barricades is now only available on open ground, and Tesla Coils and Igniters are now automatically regenerated. Learn about the new features and improvements in the article.'),
(10133, 'en-US', 'Field News, Rust, Updates, Barricades, Tesla Coils, Igniters, Building, Base Defense, Tactical Advantages, Changes'),
(10134, 'en-US', '<p>Greetings, dear Rust player!</p><br/><p> We have some exciting news that I want to share with you.</p><br/><h2> Changes in the installation of barricades</h2><br/><p> Now you can only place barricades (wood, concrete, and sandbags) on open ground. If the base is made of concrete or other material, you can no longer place barricades there. This change will allow for more realistic use of barricades and create tactical advantages in the game.</p><br/><h2> Improvements for Tesla Coils and Igniters</h2><br/><p> Tesla Coils and Igniters now automatically regenerate when using the build privilege. After each decay tick (10 minutes), they regenerate about 8 health. This will allow players using these tools to build and defend their bases more effectively.</p><br/><p> These are the interesting changes that await us in the game Rust. Don\'t forget to check the updates and start using the new features in your strategies!</p>'),
(10135, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news on Rust updates, including the introduction of visual boundaries for the no-build zone from Radiation Points.'),
(10136, 'en-US', 'news, developers, Rust, updates, visual boundaries, no-construction zone, RT'),
(10137, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust once again delight players with updates. Recently, an interesting new feature was announced - visual boundaries of the construction ban zone from Radiation Points. Now players will be able to see clear markers in places where it is forbidden to build their bases. This will significantly simplify and facilitate the process of choosing a place for construction, help to avoid unwanted conflicts and create more equal conditions for all players.'),
(10138, 'en-US', 'Added the function of mass sowing of beds in the game Rust'),
(10139, 'en-US', 'This article discusses a new feature added to the game Rust - mass seeding of crops, and its impact on gameplay.'),
(10140, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, seeding beds, mass seeding'),
(10141, 'en-US', 'In the latest update to Rust, the developers introduced a new feature - mass seeding of crops. Now players can quickly and conveniently seed several crops at once, which greatly simplifies the process of growing crops. Learn more about the new feature and how it can affect your experience in Rust.'),
(10142, 'en-US', 'Important information about the prohibition of storing dangerous items in cabinets.'),
(10143, 'en-US', 'Certain items can no longer be stored in cabinets because they pose a danger. Items prohibited from being stored in cabinets include: sulphur ore, sulphur, gunpowder, explosives, diesel and electronic devices such as cameras and laptops. Be careful and make cabinets safe to avoid potential problems.'),
(10144, 'en-US', 'Steam Festival Starts - Survival and Crafting'),
(10145, 'en-US', 'A unique opportunity to immerse yourself in the world of survival and creativity in the game Rust with a 50% discount on Steam until June 3.'),
(10146, 'en-US', 'Steam, festival, Survival and crafting, Rust, discount'),
(10147, 'en-US', '<p>The festival of Survival and Crafting has begun on Steam! Now you have a unique opportunity to immerse yourself in the world of survival and creativity in the game Rust. The discount on the game is as much as 50% and will be valid until June 3.</p><br/><p> Expand your horizons by taking part in exciting adventures where every step and every decision matters. You will have to build your own primitive camp, collect resources, fight other players and defend yourself from wild animals.</p><br/><p> Rust not only offers a modern survival system, but also opens up huge opportunities for crafting. Create weapons, tools, buildings and much more to ensure your safety and prosperity.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to get Rust with 50% discount on Steam until June 3. Join the Survival and Crafting Festival today and experience unforgettable adventures in this world full of dangers and opportunities!</p>'),
(10148, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest changes and updates in Rust: bone fragment composting, changes to horse armor, reduced crafting times, new workbench options, and display of skin names in the repair table.'),
(10149, 'en-US', 'News from the fields, updates, Rust game, bone fragments, fertilizer, horse armor, crafting time, workbench, skins'),
(10150, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to \"News from the Field\"! In this article, we will tell you about the latest changes and updates in the game Rust, which will help you improve your gaming experience and achieve greater success.</p><br/><br/><p> Bone fragments can now be used even more efficiently! You can now compost them into fertilizer at a ratio of 10:1. This is a great way to get valuable resources from unwanted items and use them to develop your base and survive in the world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> If you prefer to use horse armor, you will appreciate this change. It now reduces the horse\'s speed by only 4 instead of 6, allowing you to be faster and more maneuverable on the battlefield.</p><br/><br/><p> For the convenience of players, we have reduced the production time of some items. Now wooden shutters, all types of window bars and window glass can be produced in just 15 seconds, instead of the previous 30. This will save you time and allow you to strengthen your base faster.</p><br/><br/><p> Players can now discover and unlock lower-tier workbench technologies when using a higher-tier one. For example, a T3 workbench allows access to T1, T2, and T3 materials and capabilities. This gives you more options to develop and improve your base.</p><br/><br/><p> Finally, we have great news for skin lovers. Now, if you add items with a skin to the repair table, the name of the skin will be displayed. This allows you to better navigate and manage your skins, making your in-game collection even cooler.</p><br/><br/><p> Stay up to date with all the news and updates in the game Rust, follow our \"News from the Fields\"! Good luck in the game!</p>'),
(10151, 'en-US', 'Round 29 of Twitch Drops in Rust starts today!'),
(10152, 'en-US', 'Today starts the 29th round of Twitch Drops in the game Rust! Get unique skins and items for your character until May 31. Join today!'),
(10153, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Round 29, Skins, Items, Participation, Link'),
(10154, 'en-US', 'Today at 22:00 the 29th round of Twitch Drops in the game Rust starts! This is a unique opportunity to get exclusive skins and items for your character. The round will last until May 31, so you have time to connect and participate in the distribution.<br/><br/> To participate, you just need to visit the official Twitch Drops website at: https://twitch.facepunch.com/. There you will find full information about current rewards, participation conditions and the broadcast schedule. Don\'t miss the chance to update your wardrobe with in-game items that cannot be obtained in any other way!<br/><br/> Follow the link and join today so you don\'t miss your chance to get exclusive skins and items in the game Rust!'),
(10155, 'en-US', 'The next update to Rust will bring new features - horses will be able to move backwards, and players will be able to place barricades on RT.'),
(10156, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, news, horses, barricades, Steam'),
(10157, 'en-US', '<p>The next update to Rust on Steam will bring some exciting new features!</p><br/><p> Firstly, we are pleased to announce that horses will now be able to move backwards at half the speed of a normal walk, giving players more opportunities for tactical maneuvers and avoidance of danger.</p><br/><p> Secondly, the update will add a new feature - the ability to place barricades on RT. Now players will have access to a new tool to defend their base or block the enemy\'s path.</p><br/><p> We are sure that these innovations will make the gameplay even more interesting and diverse. Follow the updates and do not miss the opportunity to try out all the new features in the game Rust!</p>'),
(10158, 'en-US', 'Important news from the Rust field: improvements to connection after a crash and faster entry of the last used code for combination locks.'),
(10159, 'en-US', 'Field News, Updates, Rust Game, Server Crash, Connection, Queue, Server Administrators, Code Lock, Quick Input'),
(10160, 'en-US', '<p>Greetings to all fans of the game Rust! Today we want to share with you some important news from the fields.</p><br/><br/><p> :dotred1: An important update that many of you have been waiting for. Now, if you accidentally get kicked from a server, you have a full 5 minutes to reconnect. This means that you can skip the queue and continue playing without having to wait your turn again. And what\'s most interesting is that server admins can adjust the delay time with the \"convar rejoindelay\" command. By default, this time is 300 seconds.</p><br/><br/><p> :dotred1: Also, we would like to draw your attention to the improvement of combination locks. Now, if your combination lock is locked, you can enter the \"last used\" code 2.5 times faster than before. This means that access to your safe has become even more convenient and faster.</p><br/><br/><p> Follow our news to stay up to date with all the changes and improvements in the world of Rust. Happy gaming!</p>'),
(10161, 'en-US', 'New Skins: A Look Back at the Latest Batch of Rust Updates'),
(10162, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins in Rust. Learn about the latest updates, functionality, and balance of skins in the game.'),
(10163, 'en-US', 'skins, game Rust, Steam, updates, customization'),
(10164, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has a new batch of skins on Steam, and we\'re excited to share the latest updates with you. Get ready for a variety of designs and options for your character and items.</p><br/><p> New skins add freshness and originality to the gameplay, offering you more options to customize your hero and weapons. Each batch of skins brings something new - from bright and vibrant color combinations to thematic templates that will help you stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> When choosing skins, it is important to consider their appearance and functionality. Skins can change not only the appearance of items, but also some characteristics, such as attack speed or damage. Therefore, when choosing a skin, you should carefully study its characteristics and make an informed choice.</p><br/><p> However, despite the aesthetic and functional appeal, it is worth remembering about balance. The game Rust strives to maintain a balance between players and not give an advantage to those who have certain skins. Therefore, the developers carefully analyze each added skin and its impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><p> Rust on Steam is constantly updated and adds new skins to meet the needs and preferences of all players. A new batch of skins is a great opportunity to update your gaming experience and express your individuality.</p>'),
(10165, 'en-US', 'Changelock'),
(10166, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest changes in the game Rust: increasing the range of the laser detector, increasing the filter of the industrial conveyor, working with handcuffs and other innovations.'),
(10167, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, changes, Changelock'),
(10168, 'en-US', 'Changelock<br/><br/> :dot:Increased laser detector range from 4 to 12 meters<br/> :dot:Increased industrial conveyor filter from 12 to 30 items.<br/> :dot:Work is underway with handcuffs: - falsified world model, added poses - added world model animator - setting up an object with a handcuff model - disabling suicide (you can die from hunger)<br/> :dot:The creepy sound from the speakers is now covered by the voice prop volume slider.<br/> :dot:Mixing table recipe display increased from 4 - 8 recipes displayed at once<br/> :dot:The minimum volume of water required to pour from a canister has been reduced from 1000 ml to 100 ml.<br/> :dot:Auto sprint and crouch toggle now retain their state when the player opens chat.<br/> :dot:Work is underway to process the rocks<br/> :dot:Additional work on the wire sag feature<br/> :dot:Now you can pick up empty water purifiers for the fire, both water containers must be empty.<br/> :dot:Nexus - Added the ability to use balloons to travel between servers.<br/> :dot:Work in progress on the traveling merchant<br/> https://imgur.com/zd195QB'),
(10169, 'en-US', 'Reducing the size of medium batteries in the game Rust'),
(10170, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has reduced the size of medium batteries, allowing them to be placed under half-walls and improving gameplay. Learn more about this change and how it affects base building in the game.'),
(10171, 'en-US', 'battery size, Rust update, gameplay improvements, in-game bases'),
(10172, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has seen a major change: the size of medium batteries has been reduced by around 15%. This means that players can now place batteries under half-walls, improving the gameplay experience and giving them more options for creating and designing their base camp.<br/> Previously, the size of batteries limited their placement and required additional space inside buildings. But now, thanks to this change, players can optimize the use of their bases and get more out of the limited space.<br/> This change not only improves gameplay, but also encourages a more creative approach to base building. Players will now be able to create compact and efficient bases that utilize the full power of batteries while saving space.<br/> Rust game updates always try to take into account the needs and wishes of the players, and this change is no exception. A small change in the size of batteries may seem insignificant, but it has a significant impact on the gameplay and opens up new possibilities for players. So, if you are a fan of Rust and love building bases, be sure to pay attention to this update and enjoy the new possibilities it offers.'),
(10173, 'en-US', 'New Rust Game Update: Velocity and Incendiary Ammo Added to Mixing Table'),
(10174, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust added the ability to craft Velocity and Incendiary Ammo at the Mixing Table. Find out how this change opens up new possibilities for server battles and forces players to experiment with different strategies.'),
(10175, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, mixing table, high velocity ammo, incendiary ammo'),
(10176, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust has introduced a very interesting change that will definitely please many players. Now the ability to craft high-velocity and incendiary ammo has been added to the mixing table. This opens up new possibilities for server battles.</p><br/><p> High-velocity rounds have increased flight speed, making them ideal for long-range shooting. Incendiary rounds, on the other hand, have the ability to set targets on fire, which allows for additional damage and leaving traces of fire on the territory.</p><br/><p> New ammo can be obtained by mixing the required resources in a mixing table. This approach allows players to control the crafting process and avoid unnecessary resource expenditure.</p><br/><p> The addition of high-velocity and incendiary ammo to Rust is an interesting move by the developers, which will make combat encounters even more varied and exciting. It also gives players the opportunity to experiment with different strategies and tactics in battles with other players.</p><br/><p> Rest assured that the new high-velocity and incendiary rounds will be a popular addition to Rust and add a new twist to the already exciting gameplay.</p>'),
(10177, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops will take place on May 25th'),
(10178, 'en-US', 'Find out about the upcoming Twitch Drops event in Rust, participate in the Rust: Kingdoms tournament and get a chance to get unique skins and rewards!'),
(10179, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, May 25, Tournament, Rust: Kingdoms, Workshops, Skins, Rewards, Unique Items'),
(10180, 'en-US', 'A special Twitch Drops event in Rust will take place on May 25! Don\'t miss your chance to get unique skins and rewards. On this day, a tournament called \"Rust: Kingdoms\" will be held, where the strongest players will fight for the main prize. Participants were selected from the best workshops and promise a very interesting and exciting duel. Come and enjoy the professional competition, and also get a chance to decorate your character with unique items!'),
(10181, 'en-US', 'Information about the upcoming update'),
(10182, 'en-US', 'The upcoming Rust update will add new vehicles, bug fixes, and other improvements.'),
(10183, 'en-US', 'update, vehicles, bicycle, bike, SKS, anti-radiation tea, horses, bug fixes'),
(10184, 'en-US', 'In the upcoming update of the game Rust, the developers will add several new vehicles. Now players will be able to use a single-seater bicycle, a single-seater bike, a two-seater bike and a three-seater bike. This will increase mobility and speed of movement around the game world.'),
(10185, 'en-US', 'Foreign guys created a track about the game Rust and EOCU'),
(10186, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new track dedicated to the game Rust and EOCU, created by foreign musicians, and enjoy the atmosphere of the game and great music in the video.'),
(10187, 'en-US', 'foreign, guys, track, Rust, EOCU, game, music, video, creativity'),
(10188, 'en-US', 'A new track dedicated to the popular game Rust and its developers has appeared in the world of game music - Daily Community Update. Foreign musicians were inspired by the exciting atmosphere of the game and created a track that will win the hearts of fans of the game and music. The video on YouTube has already gained thousands of views, and this is not surprising - the melody and lyrics of the track revive the imagination and make you feel the atmosphere of survival in the game. Enjoy the creativity and watch the video at the link: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xc5EFUSjNZ8\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Xc5EFUSjNZ8</a>'),
(10189, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has been released in the game Rust'),
(10190, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins in Rust on Steam that will allow you to create an original style and unique appearance of your character and weapons.'),
(10191, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, customization of appearance, weapons, style, uniqueness'),
(10192, 'en-US', 'The long-awaited moment has arrived - a new batch of skins has appeared in the game Rust on Steam! If you like to customize the appearance of your character and weapons, then this news is for you. Now you have even more options for self-expression and creating a unique style in the game. New skins will allow you to give your items an original look, different from the standard one.'),
(10193, 'en-US', 'New Skins for Rust on Steam'),
(10194, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins for Rust on Steam. Buy stylish and unique items for your gaming experience.'),
(10195, 'en-US', 'New skins, game Rust, Steam, skin collection, weapons, clothes, buildings, Steam store');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(10196, 'en-US', '<p>Hooray! A new batch of skins for the game Rust has been released!</p><br/><p> If you are a fan of this exciting game, then you should definitely take a look at the new collection of skins that has just appeared.</p><br/><p> New skins are a way to add freshness and originality to your gaming experience. They allow you to stand out from other players and give your items a unique look.</p><br/><p> The collection of new skins for the game Rust on Steam is diverse and has many interesting items that will help you create a unique look for your characters and game inventory.</p><br/><p> In the new batch of skins, you will find categories such as weapons, clothing, buildings and other items. Each category offers unique design options to suit different tastes and preferences of players.</p><br/><p> You can buy skins directly from the Steam store. For reasonable prices, you will get access to a huge selection of stylish and beautiful items for your virtual world in Rust.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your skin collection. It\'s a great way to add some freshness and novelty to your gaming experience.</p><br/><p> Check out the Steam store and choose the skins that suit you best. Uniqueness and individuality are in your hands!</p>'),
(10197, 'en-US', 'New Gestures Added to Rust as Part of Hackweek'),
(10198, 'en-US', 'New gestures have been added to Rust as part of hackweek, allowing players to express emotions and communicate with other players.'),
(10199, 'en-US', 'new gestures, game Rust, hackweek, update, emotions, communication, game world, players'),
(10200, 'en-US', 'During the hackweek, the developers of the game Rust pleased the players by adding several new gestures. These gestures will help players express their emotions and communicate with other players in the game world. Some of them may even make it into the next update of the game. Now each player will be able to more accurately express their feelings and communicate with other players in Rust.'),
(10201, 'en-US', 'Rad Town Monument Update - Back to Legacy Times'),
(10202, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam is getting a Rad Town monument update that will take you back to the Legacy era. We\'ve put together some of the work on this update to keep you up to date with all the changes.'),
(10203, 'en-US', 'update, monument, Rad Town, Legacy times, Rust, Steam'),
(10204, 'en-US', 'Dust off your hazmat suits and get ready to hear the click of a Geiger counter! Rust is getting a Rad Town monument update on Steam that will take you back to the days of Legacy. We\'ve put together some of the work from the update to keep you up to date with all the changes.'),
(10205, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins that just launched in Rust on Steam. Discover unique designs, quality, and features for an authentic gaming experience.'),
(10206, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, unique look, design, quality, collectibles, investment'),
(10207, 'en-US', '<p>Hooray, a new batch of skins for the game Rust has been released on Steam! New skins are already available for purchase and use in the game. They will give your character a unique and stylish look, making it distinguishable from other players.</p><br/><p> This new batch of skins includes a wide variety of variations, from armor and weapons to home decor. No matter your playstyle, you\'re sure to find something to suit you.</p><br/><p> One of the features of these skins is their quality and detail. The developers tried to create unique designs that will please the eye and give the game new aesthetic qualities. Each skin must undergo a rigorous selection before use, which guarantees high quality and a pleasant appearance.</p><br/><p> It is also important to note that these skins are more than just pretty game items. They can also be collected and invested in. Some unique skins gain in value over time and can be sold or traded with other players. This opens up new opportunities for those who want to not only enjoy the game, but also use it as a source of income.</p><br/><p> Well, if you are a collector or just want to refresh your in-game style, the new batch of skins in the game Rust is what you need. Do not miss the opportunity to update your character and add some freshness and originality to the game world.</p>'),
(10208, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest updates to Rust, including a laser sight, muzzle booster, muzzle brake, and increased upkeep on buildings around the radio telegraph. Stay up to date with all the changes!'),
(10209, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, laser sight, muzzle booster, muzzle brake, buildings, radio telegraph, news'),
(10210, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to our \"News from the Field\" column! Today we have prepared for you some interesting updates that will affect the game world of Rust. Get ready to learn about new features that will appear on your horizon!</p><br/><p> Our first update was the laser sight. Now you can enjoy increased accuracy and reduced spread, which will certainly increase the effectiveness of firing. You can see all the features of this sight in our video.</p><br/><p> We have also made some changes to muzzle devices. The game will now feature a muzzle booster and a muzzle brake. They will allow you to control the recoil and speed of your shots. You can see visual examples of these changes in the corresponding images.</p><br/><p> Lastly, we have increased the content of the buildings around the Radio Telegraph (RT). Now you can build more buildings and create an even more powerful base. This will open up new possibilities for you during the game.</p><br/><p> We hope these updates bring you much joy in the world of Rust. Follow our news and stay up to date with all the changes in the game!</p>'),
(10211, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll tell you about the latest changes that have happened on the battlefield in Rust. Learn about the increase in the number of rounds in the SMG clip and the changes to the muzzle brake and muzzle booster.'),
(10212, 'en-US', 'Rust, news, battlefield, SMG, muzzle brake, muzzle booster'),
(10213, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we will tell you about the latest changes that have taken place on the battlefield in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> Firstly, the SMG has received a long-awaited boost. The SMG magazine now holds 30 rounds, instead of the previous 24. In addition, the spread of the rounds has been reduced, making the SMG a more accurate and effective weapon.</p><br/><p> Secondly, there have been changes to the muzzle brake and muzzle booster. Now the debuffs from using these modifications have been reduced. This means that players using a muzzle brake or muzzle booster will not be limited in their shooting speed and accuracy as much.</p><br/><p> These changes were made by the game developers to make combat in Rust more interesting and exciting. Now you have more options to effectively use SMGs and muzzle device modifications.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned for the latest news from the battlefield in Rust!</p>'),
(10214, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll take a look at the latest news from the field in Rust, including a new update and changes to shooting mechanics.'),
(10215, 'en-US', 'News, Field, Rust, Update, Shooting Mechanics, SKS, Rifle, Semi-Automatic, Homemade Pistol, LR-300, Holographic Sight'),
(10216, 'en-US', '<p><br/>In this article, we will look at the latest news from the fields in the game Rust. Here you will find information about the upcoming update and changes to the shooting mechanics.<br/></p><br/><br/><p><br/> :dotred1: The SKS rifle will not be available in the next update. Even though it is already in the game files, it is not currently usable in normal gameplay.<br/></p><br/><br/><p><br/> :dotred1: Changes have been made to the shooting mechanics:<br/></p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> :dot: The semi-automatic rifle now has more accurate shots and improved animation.</li><br/><li> :dot: The homemade pistol now has reduced spread.</li><br/><li> :dot: The LR-300 now has less damage falloff over range, allowing it to deal more damage at range.</li><br/><li> :dot: The LR-300\'s bullet speed has been increased.</li><br/><li> :dot: The vertical recoil of the LR-300 has been reduced.</li><br/><li> :dot: The holographic sight frames have become thinner.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p><br/> Stay up to date with the latest changes in the Rust game and don\'t miss out on new features and improvements in shooting mechanics!<br/></p>'),
(10217, 'en-US', 'Changing the wooden shelter in the game Rust'),
(10218, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust brings significant changes to the wooden shelter system, giving players new options for creating unique and functional homes and the ability to bring their creative ideas to life.'),
(10219, 'en-US', 'wooden shelter, update, game Rust, changes, possibilities, creativity, self-expression'),
(10220, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to the Rust game has seen significant changes to the wooden shelter system. The game developers decided to pay special attention to this element of the gameplay to make it more interesting and important for players.</p><br/><p> There were only a few types of wooden shelters, which did not always fully satisfy the needs of players. However, after the update, this has changed.</p><br/><p> Players now have access to a wide range of decorations, decorative elements, and many new functional components in the wooden shelter system. You can create your own cozy homes, furnish them with furniture and interior items, and complement the shelters with various useful items.</p><br/><p> New features of the timber shelter system include changing walls, floors, ceilings, doors and windows. Now you can personalize every aspect of your home, making it unique and as functional as possible.</p><br/><p> Plus, with a variety of decor and embellishments, you can create a unique style for your hideaway, from a classic farmhouse to a modern art piece.</p><br/><p> Changing the wooden shelter in the game Rust opens up a lot of new possibilities for creativity and self-expression for players. Now you can create your ideal home that will reflect your style and taste.</p>'),
(10221, 'en-US', 'Changes in the processor'),
(10222, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest changes to the recycler in Rust. New updates have changed the recycling process and resource distribution, creating new challenges for players.'),
(10223, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, processor, resource, safe-zone, monument'),
(10224, 'en-US', '<p>Today we will look at the latest changes that have occurred in the processor in the game Rust. New updates have made some changes to the processing and issuance of resources.</p><br/><br/><p> Before the latest update, recyclers returned the full amount of resources, but now in the safe zone they will only give out 80%. This decision was made to balance the game\'s economy and create more interaction between players when finding and using resources.</p><br/><br/><p> Additionally, the processing time for one item has been increased to eight seconds. This change will help make the process more realistic and strategic, requiring players to plan and pay more attention to detail when using recyclers.</p><br/><br/><p> However, there is an exception for the recyclers located on monuments. They now give 20% more resources, and the reprocessing time of one unit of items has been reduced to five seconds. These changes will make monuments more valuable and attractive places for players, stimulating more intense competition for control over them.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, these changes to the recycler will bring new challenges and opportunities to Rust. Players will have to adapt to changes in the recycling process and find new strategies to use resources efficiently in their survival adventures.</p>'),
(10225, 'en-US', 'First look at SKS'),
(10226, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at a new weapon in the game Rust - the SKS semi-automatic rifle. We will learn about its characteristics, the possibilities of use and ways to obtain it.'),
(10227, 'en-US', 'Rust, SKS, rifle, new, use, modifications, obtaining, Nomad Hazzy Item/DLC pack'),
(10228, 'en-US', '<h2>:pencil2: New Rust - SKS</h2><br/><br/><p> In this article, we will look at a new weapon that appeared in the game Rust - the SKS semi-automatic rifle. We will get acquainted with its main characteristics, possibilities of use and ways of obtaining.</p><br/><br/><h3> :mag_right: Main characteristics</h3><br/><ul><br/><li> Weapon type: semi-automatic rifle</li><br/><li> Caliber: 7.62x39 mm</li><br/><li> Magazine: 10 rounds (expandable to 30 with additional modifications)</li><br/><li> Rate of fire: average</li><br/><li> Damage: High</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><h3> :dart: Use Cases</h3><br/><p> The SKS is a powerful weapon that can be used in both long-range and close-quarter combat. Its accuracy and high damage make it an effective choice for medium to long-range shooting. However, it is worth being careful in close combat due to its low rate of fire.</p><br/><br/><p> :bulb: Additionally, the SKS can be modified with various scopes, silencers, and other upgrades to tailor the weapon to your personal playstyle and missions.</p><br/><br/><h3> :package: How to get SKS</h3><br/><p> Since the SKS\'s introduction into the game, it can be found in various loot boxes and containers around the map. It is also automatically part of the Nomad Hazzy Item/DLC pack, allowing players to purchase the rifle along with special skins.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to try out new weapons and use them in your adventures in the world of Rust!</p><br/><br/><p> :sparkles: Warning! Any weapon can be dangerous, so it is recommended to be careful and follow safety rules when using it.</p>'),
(10229, 'en-US', 'Cosmodrome update'),
(10230, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest update to the Cosmodrome in Rust on Steam. A new puzzle reset mechanism and increased loot create new challenges and opportunities for players.'),
(10231, 'en-US', 'spaceport update, Rust game, puzzles, valuable items, loot, survival'),
(10232, 'en-US', 'Cosmodrome update!<br/><br/> The latest update to the Cosmodrome in Steam\'s Rust saw significant changes to the main building of the launch pad. All valuable loot (behind the red map) is now controlled by a new puzzle reset mechanism that works independently of loot spawns in the rest of the game world. This means players will no longer be left without rewards if someone else hasn\'t already claimed the loot before them.<br/><br/> Now, after each puzzle reset, the main building of the spaceport is guaranteed to spawn increased loot, by about 50%. This creates additional opportunities for players to get valuable items and resources for their survival. However, it is worth noting that the puzzle will only reset if there are no other players around. Thus, players must be careful and aware of their surroundings to not miss out on the chance for additional loot.<br/><br/> This Cosmodrome update brings a new level of challenge and excitement to Rust. Players must now take into account the presence of other players when deciding when to reset a puzzle. Balancing risk and reward becomes a key factor in the strategy of surviving in the Cosmodrome.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to experience all the new challenges and get more valuable items in the updated Rust spaceport!'),
(10233, 'en-US', 'Added new colors for the recycler'),
(10234, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has added new colors to the recycler. Find out how this change will affect gameplay and what it offers players.'),
(10235, 'en-US', 'new colors, recycler, rust, game, update'),
(10236, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust adds new colors to the recycler, allowing players to expand their options in crafting unique items. The new colors offer a wide range of tones, from bright and saturated to more muted and neutral.</p><br/><p> Some players may ask: \"Is the addition of new colors just a cosmetic change or does it affect the gameplay?\" We will find out the answer to this question soon, when the developers share more details about these changes.</p><br/><p> All that is known so far is that the new colors give players more options to customize and personalize their items. Now you will be able to create unique and colorful items that will highlight your style in the game.</p><br/><p> The introduction of new colors for the recycler is expected to attract more players and increase interest in the game Rust on Steam. We will keep an eye on the updates for more details on this change.</p>'),
(10237, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of new skins in Rust and give your character and environment a unique look.'),
(10238, 'en-US', 'game Rust, new skins, update, unique look'),
(10239, 'en-US', 'Meet a fresh batch of new skins in the game Rust! The developers never cease to please us with updates and this time they have prepared many unique variations so that you can give your character and environment a unique look. Check out the information about the new skins and immerse yourself in the game atmosphere with new, bright elements of decor and personalization.'),
(10240, 'en-US', 'Added the ability to authorize friends in the closet'),
(10241, 'en-US', 'Added the ability to authorize friends in the closet. Now you can safely allow friends access to your resources in the game Rust on Steam.'),
(10242, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, Steam, friends authorization, cabinet, access, resources, cooperation, interaction'),
(10243, 'en-US', '<p>The update to the game Rust on Steam has brought a long-awaited innovation - now you can authorize your friends to access your closet.</p><br/><p> This feature is useful for players who play in a team or share resources with other players. Previously, in order to share the contents of your closet with a friend, you had to give them your personal code combination, which could be inconvenient and lead to information leakage. Now, with the new friend authorization feature, you can safely allow them access to your closet using the in-game interface.</p><br/><p> Sharing access is easy. In the cabinet menu, you will find a new option \"Authorize a friend\", where you need to select your Steam friends from the list and confirm the request. After that, your friend will be able to open and use the contents of your cabinet, as well as add or remove items as they see fit.</p><br/><p> This update brings great comfort and convenience to the gameplay, and promotes cooperation and interaction between players. Now you can easily build together, store resources and exchange items with your friends, regardless of whether you are online or offline.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to pay attention to your closet\'s privacy settings. You can adjust the level of access to your friends so that they only have access to certain sections of your closet or are fully authorized.</p><br/><p> The update to the Rust game on Steam with the addition of the ability to authorize friends in the closet is a new step towards improving the gaming experience and interaction within the team.</p>'),
(10244, 'en-US', 'What awaits us in the near future (h'),
(10245, 'en-US', 'The new Rust Steam update brings some interesting changes and updates: increased radio frequency range, more torpedoes, increased accuracy, improved crafting, and more.'),
(10246, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, radio frequency, torpedoes, submarine, sperm whale, machine gun, safe recycling, high-velocity ammo, cargo, radio frequency items, radio transmitter, radio receiver, remote control, pager, incendiary rockets, drone, armor, MVC chestplate'),
(10247, 'en-US', 'What awaits us in the near future (part 2):<br/><br/> :dotred1:The radio frequency range has been increased from 4 to 6 digits.<br/> :dotred1:Now for one craft you will receive 5 torpedoes instead of the previous 3.<br/> :dotred1:Torpedo accuracy has been slightly increased.<br/> :dotred1:The two-man submarine now fires torpedoes slightly faster than the single one.<br/> :dotred1:Work on the sperm whale has begun, there is little information yet, but I think it will be interesting.<br/> :dotred1:The number of gears required to craft a homemade machine gun has been reduced.<br/> :dotred1:There is information that safe processing in safe zones has been affected, perhaps it will be removed or made more difficult.<br/> :dotred1:For one craft of high-speed ammo you will receive three ammo (previously there were 2, now they are equal in quantity to regular ammo).<br/> :dotred1:The amount of gunpowder required to craft high-velocity ammo has been reduced.<br/> :dotred1:Now the cargo will stop at two ports per trip, so the event time can be changed if necessary.<br/> :dotred1:Updated costs for creating radio frequency items (was - became):<br/> :dot:Radio transmitter: metal fragments 100 - 150, microcircuit 1 - 0.<br/> :dot:Radio receiver: metal fragments 100 - 150, microcircuit 1 - 0.<br/> :dot:Remote control: MVK 5 - metal fragments 100, microcircuit 1 - 0.<br/> :dot:Pager: metal fragments 50 - 100, microcircuit 1 - 0.<br/> :dotred1:The cost of crafting incendiary rockets has been reduced, while the damage has been slightly increased.<br/> :dotred1:Microchips are no longer required to craft a drone.<br/> :dotred1:Increased the durability of armor made from road signs.<br/> :dotred1:The cost of crafting the MVC chestplate has been reduced to 18 MVC (previously it was 25).'),
(10248, 'en-US', 'Disable rotation of wall with attached explosives in Rust'),
(10249, 'en-US', 'A new update to the game Rust announced a ban on rotating a wall if explosives are attached to it. The developers made this decision to improve the balance of the game and prevent abuse. However, some players expressed dissatisfaction. The ban on wall rotation caused mixed reactions in the community.'),
(10250, 'en-US', 'Rust game, update, wall rotation ban, explosives, game balancing, player reaction'),
(10251, 'en-US', '<p>The new update to the game Rust has announced a ban on rotating a wall if explosives are attached to it. This decision by the developers has caused indignation and discussion among the players of the community.</p><br/><br/><p> Previously, players were able to rotate walls and doors without removing the attached explosives. This allowed attackers to create dangerous traps and bypass the game\'s security mechanics. However, with the new update, the developers have decided to remove this feature.</p><br/><br/><p> The main reason for disabling the explosive wall rotation is to prevent abuse of the game mechanics and improve its balancing. This decision will reduce the number of unequal battles and create a more fair game environment.</p><br/><br/><p> However, some players have expressed their dissatisfaction with this change. They believe that the prohibition of wall rotation limits their ability to plan and defend their base. Critics of the developers\' decision argue that it contradicts the spirit of freedom and creativity in the game Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> In any case, this change is part of a larger balancing effort. The developers are constantly analyzing feedback from players and making changes to improve everyone\'s gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><p> Thus, the ban on rotating a wall with attached explosives in the game Rust causes mixed feelings among players. On the one hand, it helps combat abuse and creates a more balanced gaming environment. On the other hand, some players consider it a limitation of their capabilities and express their dissatisfaction.</p>'),
(10252, 'en-US', 'What awaits us in the near future'),
(10253, 'en-US', 'The latest Rust updates have introduced changes that will impact player strategy and gameplay. Find out what innovations await you in the near future.'),
(10254, 'en-US', 'Rust, Upgrades, Reload, C4, Sachel, Building Blocks, Tax, Study, Walls, Gates, Backpack'),
(10255, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest updates to the game Rust, the developers have made several changes that will change the gameplay and affect the strategy of players. Let\'s take a look at the main changes that await us in the near future.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Changed the MLRS reload time from 10 to 20 minutes.</li><br/><li> C4 and Sachel now mark building blocks they stick to as \"damaged\" but do not deal damage until the moment they explode. This will prevent players from upgrading a building block 10 seconds before the C4 explodes.</li><br/><li> They will add a tax on studying at the workbench:</li><br/><ul><br/><li> 1 tier - 0%</li><br/><li> 2 tier - 10%</li><br/><li> 3 tier - 20%</li><br/></ul><br/><p> It will now be more profitable to study found items on the study table to avoid tax.</p><br/><li> Now high walls and gates will be installed in three seconds. If you move during construction, the process will be canceled.</li><br/><li> High external walls and gates can be demolished within 10 minutes of their installation.</li><br/><li> Added the ability to move items in the backpack without opening it. This will simplify inventory management and allow you to quickly organize the necessary items.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> These changes will allow players to adapt to new conditions and reconsider their survival strategy. Let\'s hope that the developers will continue to delight us with interesting updates in the future.</p>'),
(10256, 'en-US', 'Rust Update: Ability to Demolish High Exterior Walls and Gates'),
(10257, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust, which allows players to tear down high outer walls and gates to create unique gameplay scenarios and strengthen their base.'),
(10258, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, high outer walls, gate, base, construction, demolition, game, experiments'),
(10259, 'en-US', '<p>The virtual world of the game Rust gains a new dimension with the latest update. Now players have the ability to demolish high outer walls and gates - experiment with the architecture of your buildings and create impregnable fortresses to your taste!</p><br/><p> The game developers paid attention to the wishes of the players and made a significant improvement, opening up new possibilities for adaptation and defense of the base. Now players will be able to control the outer walls and gates, destroying them if necessary or building new elements.</p><br/><p> This innovation gives gamers more freedom and creativity in creating protected areas. The balance between safety and functionality is now in the hands of every Rust fan. You can build huge fortresses with walls that can withstand any attack, or create open bases for quick access and exchange of resources.</p><br/><p> Demolishing walls and gates opens up unique opportunities for game strategy and tactics. Now you can rebuild your base in response to changing conditions or improve it to suit your needs. Be prepared for surprise attacks and attacks that may require you to rebuild and fortify your base over and over again.</p><br/><p> The new ability to demolish external walls and gates allows players to have more control over their environment and create unique gameplay scenarios. Understand your power and use it wisely to achieve victory and strengthen your place in the world of Rust.</p>'),
(10260, 'en-US', 'Nostalgia is in the air'),
(10261, 'en-US', 'Nostalgia is in the air. The developers are working on recreating Redtown from the Legacy era. The game will also feature new weapons, a truck, an improved mission system, and other changes.'),
(10262, 'en-US', 'Nostalgia, Rust, Updates, Redtown, Legacy, Weapons, Truck, Scientists, Foundations, Vending Machine, Missions, Minigun, Items, Military Flamethrower, Guntraps, Ammo, Stash'),
(10263, 'en-US', 'Nostalgia is in the air<br/><br/> :dotred1: Legacy era Radtown is in the works! The Radtown redux branch is working on recreating the small Legacy Radtown (no visuals yet, as it\'s still early in the process)<br/><br/> :dotred1: Also a little about other innovations:<br/> - Work on a new weapon (SKS rifle)<br/><br/> - Final work on the M939 truck<br/><br/> - Improvements by Bradley scientists (including heavy ones added)<br/><br/> - Work on the possibility of replacing destroyed foundations<br/><br/> - Possibility of rotating the vending machine by 90 degrees<br/><br/> - Various improvements in the mission system<br/><br/> - Some fixes for Minigun<br/><br/> - Enabled object snapping for several other items (neon signs, cameras, liquid pump, switch, electric heater).<br/><br/> - Fixed a problem with the scale of the Military Flamethrower model<br/><br/> - Fixed Guntraps triggering if there was an authorized player in front of them when the Cabinet was repainted<br/><br/> - Fixed removing ammo from minigun when it ran out of durability and removed itself (by placing ammo in inventory)<br/><br/> - Fixed the need to run 3m away from the cache and return to open the cache'),
(10264, 'en-US', 'New Batch of Skins in Rust: Your Guide to the Latest Updates'),
(10265, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest skins added to the game Rust. With our guide, you will always be up to date with the latest updates and will be able to choose your unique weapons and equipment.'),
(10266, 'en-US', 'Rust skins, new Rust skins, Rust updates, skins on Steam, latest Rust updates'),
(10267, 'en-US', '<p>Friends, we are happy to share with you exciting news - a new batch of unique skins has appeared in the game Rust! If you want to give your weapons and equipment individuality and style, then you need to check out these fresh updates.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust development team is working tirelessly to bring new and spectacular skins to the game. And this time they did not disappoint us! In the new batch of skins, you will find a variety of design options for weapons, armor and other equipment that can make your character truly unique.</p><br/><br/><p> When choosing skins for your character, it is important to consider several factors. First, the style and color scheme of the skins should match your preferences and the theme of the game. Second, do not forget to pay attention to the ratings and reviews of other players who have already tried these skins in practice.</p><br/><br/><p> However, it is important to keep in mind that adding skins can affect the gameplay and balance of the game. Some skins may be more noticeable or create additional tactical advantages. Therefore, developers try to carefully balance fresh updates so as not to create problems for the game system and other players.</p><br/><br/><p> If you are looking to have a unique look in Rust, new skins are a great way to stand out from other players. However, always remember that it is important to find a balance between appearance and gameplay to avoid creating an imbalance and keep the game fun for everyone.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to upgrade your gear and add some style to your gaming life. Head over to the Steam Store and check out the new skins in Rust today!</p><br/><br/><p> Stay up to date with the latest updates and choose the most stylish skins for yourself. Good luck in the game Rust!</p>'),
(10268, 'en-US', 'Now that\'s good..'),
(10269, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam introduces a host of new features and changes that improve the gameplay experience and add new possibilities. However, there are also some trade-offs that require players to adapt and develop new strategies.'),
(10270, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, Steam, weapons, building, gaming experience, compromises, balance, resources'),
(10271, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest update to the Rust game on Steam, the developers have introduced a number of new features and changes that will undoubtedly please players. These changes are important for improving the gaming experience and adding new features to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the key updates is the addition of a new weapon type, which allows players to diversify their strategy and tactics. Players will now be able to use powerful weapons with high damage, but with a limited amount of ammo. This will add a new level of complexity and interaction to the game, and will also allow players to choose different play styles.</p><br/><br/><p> The update also improves the construction mode, which is one of the key elements of the Rust game. Players can now create more complex and innovative structures using new materials and tools. This adds more variety and creativity to the game, allowing players to show their abilities in building and defending their base.</p><br/><br/><p> However, with new updates come some trade-offs. Along with the addition of new features, the developers have also made changes to the game\'s economy and resource balance. Some players may find that they have to spend more time and effort to obtain resources or achieve certain goals. However, these changes are intended to make the game more balanced and fun for everyone.</p><br/><br/><p> This update also introduces new enemies and dangers for players. New hostile NPCs and other players can pose a threat to your progress and existence in the game. This requires players to use new strategies and tactics, and increases the level of tension and interaction in the game world.</p><br/><br/><p> In conclusion, the latest update to Rust on Steam has brought many useful changes and new features for players. However, along with this, it was necessary to accept some compromises and adapt to new challenges. It is important to remember that these changes provide a more fun and balanced gaming experience.</p>'),
(10272, 'en-US', 'Changes in Rust: Patrol helicopter will crash on the nearest RT upon critical damage'),
(10273, 'en-US', 'Important changes in the game Rust: the patrol helicopter will now fall on the nearest RT when receiving critical damage, an exciting and dynamic update to the gameplay.'),
(10274, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, patrol helicopter, critical damage, nearest RT, radio tower, game interaction, tactics, change, game dynamics'),
(10275, 'en-US', 'A new update to the game Rust on Steam introduces significant changes to the behavior of the patrol helicopter. Now, when the helicopter receives critical damage, it will fall directly onto the nearest radio tower (RT), creating a new level of gameplay interaction and causing a change in player tactics. This change is intended to increase the dynamics of the gameplay and increase the realism of events. Gamers should be prepared for unexpected situations and adapt to new conditions.'),
(10276, 'en-US', 'Rust 2 на Unreal Engine 5'),
(10277, 'en-US', 'Learn about the upcoming Rust update, where it will move to the powerful Unreal Engine 5, and how it will affect gameplay and graphics.'),
(10278, 'en-US', 'Rust 2, Unreal Engine 5, update, news, game'),
(10279, 'en-US', 'Great Future for Rust: Switching to the Powerful Unreal Engine 5'),
(10280, 'en-US', 'Changes in the functionality of the door controller'),
(10281, 'en-US', 'This article reviews recent changes to the door controller functionality in Rust, including new smartphone and biometric access control capabilities. The trade-offs and risks associated with using the new features are discussed.'),
(10282, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, functionality, door controller, access, keys, smartphone, biometrics, security, compromises'),
(10283, 'en-US', 'In this post, we will look at the latest changes that have occurred in the functionality of the door controller in the game Rust. The new changes significantly expand the possibilities of players in managing access to their home. The electrical controller is the main element of the electrical system of the game, which allows players to set different levels of access to their doors. Now players can set up access to their home not only with keys, but also using smartphones or biometric data.<br/><br/> One of the main features of the new changes is the introduction of the ability to create temporary or one-time keys. This is a great solution for situations where a player wants to grant access to their base to someone for a short period of time, such as their friends during a game session. Now players can safely grant access and forget about having to take the keys back later.<br/><br/> In addition, new access control options have been added using smartphones. Players can now install a special application on their virtual phone and use it to open doors. This is a convenient solution, especially if you do not have physical access to a computer. Also, the smartphone can be configured to open certain doors only at certain times, which provides additional security.<br/><br/> However, despite all the new features, it is worth remembering the trade-offs and risks associated with using new functions. Leakage or loss of smartphone or biometric data can lead to problems with the security of your database. Also, intruders can try to hack the system and gain access to your home. Therefore, before using new functions, it is recommended to take measures to protect your data and wisely configure access.<br/><br/> Thus, the changes to the door controller functionality in the game Rust provide players with new options when managing access to their home. The introduction of temporary and one-time keys, as well as the use of smartphones and biometric data, allows players to be more flexible and secure in managing access to their base. However, it is important to remember the trade-offs and risks associated with using new features. Happy Rust!'),
(10284, 'en-US', 'The Steam platform has launched a campaign as part of the first-person shooter festival'),
(10285, 'en-US', 'The Steam platform has launched a promotion as part of the first-person shooter festival. Get discounts on your favorite games and enjoy unique in-game materials!'),
(10286, 'en-US', 'Steam, promotion, festival, first-person shooters, Rust, gamers, discounts, in-game materials, action games'),
(10287, 'en-US', 'A fantastic event has been launched on the Steam platform, which will be a real holiday for fans of first-person shooters. The shooter festival offers a unique opportunity to dive into the exciting world of such famous games as Rust and many others.<br/><br/> As part of the promotion, gamers are given the opportunity to purchase their favorite shooters at significant discounts. This is a great opportunity not only to save money, but also to try new games that were previously unavailable due to their price.<br/><br/> In addition, the FPS festival also offers unique in-game materials that will allow players to enjoy high-quality and realistic gameplay. First-person combat, adrenaline and incredible adventures await everyone who decides to join this exciting festival.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to dive into the world of first-person action games and get maximum pleasure from the gaming process. The promotion has already started on the Steam platform, so don\'t waste time and go to the exciting world of shooters!'),
(10288, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Review of the Latest Batch'),
(10289, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new skins in Rust, their style, practicality, and accessibility, and how they can help you express your uniqueness. Purchase and add new skins to your collection now!'),
(10290, 'en-US', 'Rust, skins, game, Steam, new, Rousseau, style, uniqueness, balance, practicality, availability, collection, visual quality, variability'),
(10291, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust, where every item can be given a stylish and unique skin! If you like playing Rust, then you are probably interested in learning about the latest news in the world of skins.</p><br/><p> A fresh batch of skins have just arrived in Rust, and we are in for a real wave of new items that will allow you to stand out on the battlefield or impress your friends and fellow survivors. In this article, we will take a look at what interesting skins the developers have added and why they have become popular among players.</p><br/><p> One of the key features of Rust is the ability to change the appearance of various objects in the game. This opens up huge opportunities for self-expression and creating your own unique style. The new batch of skins will allow you to give your weapons, tools, armor and other items a unique look.</p><br/><p> The creative developers of Rust are constantly introducing new and exclusive skins to the game to give players the pleasure of creating a unique look for their in-game collection. Whether it’s stylish weapons, flashy armor, or impressive decorative items, new skins regularly expand the world of Rust and add even more variety to it.</p><br/><p> When choosing a new skin, it is important to consider not only the style and beauty, but also its practical value. The balance between visual quality and gaming efficiency is an important aspect to consider when deciding whether to buy or use a skin in the game. In this article, we will look at not only the most beautiful and attractive skins, but also their practicality in a real gaming situation.</p><br/><p> It is also important to pay attention to the importance of taking into account the price of the skin and its availability to the majority of players. Both the global community and a narrow group of Rust lovers. Rust developers are constantly working to ensure that every player can have the opportunity to decorate their game with unique skins without damaging their game balance or financial budget.</p><br/><p> Now you know that new skins in Rust are not only a great way to express your individuality, but also an important element of the gaming experience. You can view and purchase new skins on the official game page in the Steam store. Don\'t miss the chance to add some style to your game and show everyone how unique you are!</p>'),
(10292, 'en-US', 'Bradley to Add Heavy Scientists'),
(10293, 'en-US', 'Find out about the plans to add Heavy Scientists to Bradley in Rust and how they will increase the game\'s difficulty.'),
(10294, 'en-US', 'Bradley, Scientists, Rust, Heavy Scientists, Adding Scientists to Rust'),
(10295, 'en-US', 'Bradley, one of the most powerful war machines in Rust, is set to be joined by new dangerous enemies: heavy scientists. These scientists will exhibit more aggressive behavior during pursuits, using tactics that alternate between taking cover and pursuing. Players will now have to be even more careful and strategic to cope with these new challenges. Learn more about how these heavy scientists will increase the difficulty of the game and the compromises the developers had to make in this article.'),
(10296, 'en-US', 'The developers presented the first prototypes of the bicycle'),
(10297, 'en-US', 'In their latest update, the developers of the game Rust on Steam have introduced the first prototypes of a bicycle, adding another exciting feature for players. This new feature brings even more realism and variety to the game, allowing players to move around the world of Rust faster and more efficiently.'),
(10298, 'en-US', 'developers, prototypes, bike, game Rust, Steam, features, design, accessories, limitations, compromises, strategies'),
(10299, 'en-US', '<p>In their latest update, the developers of the game Rust on Steam have introduced the first prototypes of a bicycle, adding another exciting feature for players. This new feature brings even more realism and variety to the game, allowing players to move around the world of Rust faster and more efficiently.</p><br/><p> The delivery of the first prototypes of the bike to players opens up the possibility of exploring the world of Rust on a new level, allowing them to make long journeys and reach remote places faster and with less effort. Special prototypes of the bikes were developed taking into account the peculiarities of the game world of Rust, providing players with optimal speed, maneuverability and safety.</p><br/><p> The development team has made significant improvements to the design of bicycles, allowing players to customize and personalize their vehicles based on their own preferences. Bicycles can be equipped with various accessories and improve their characteristics, including speed, durability, and resistance to damage.</p><br/><p> But that’s not all – the new bike prototypes also have some limitations and compromises that players should consider. For example, they may not be practical when riding on uneven terrain or in difficult weather conditions. It’s important to consider these factors and choose the best route to avoid wasting time or damaging your bike.</p><br/><p> Overall, the addition of early bicycle prototypes to the world of Rust opens up new possibilities and strategies for players, offering faster and more fun travel across the game map. But, as in real life, players should exercise caution and consider all the factors involved in using a bicycle.</p>'),
(10300, 'en-US', 'New trailer from FacePunch - Waves of Change :Heartlove2:'),
(10301, 'en-US', 'FacePunch has unveiled a new \"Waves of Change\" trailer for Rust, teasing upcoming changes and improvements to the popular survival game.'),
(10302, 'en-US', 'FacePunch, Trailer, Waves of Change, Rust Update'),
(10303, 'en-US', 'FacePunch delights its fans with a new trailer called \"Waves of Change\". This exciting trailer sheds light on the upcoming changes to Rust and gives us an idea of what to expect from the upcoming update. Take a look at the stunning landscapes, new features and improvements coming to Rust. Don\'t miss this exciting video that cryptically hints at the exciting changes to come :Heartlove2:.'),
(10304, 'en-US', 'Skins of this week'),
(10305, 'en-US', 'Check out this week\'s hottest skins in Rust on Steam.'),
(10306, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, Steam, new, game'),
(10307, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust skins! In this article, we will tell you about the freshest and most interesting skins that were added to the game this week. If you are a fan of Rust and want to decorate your items with unique designs, then this information is for you.</p><br/><br/><p> Every week, the developers of the game Rust release new skins that can be obtained and used in the gameplay. New skins decorate various objects and weapons, adding a unique look to them. Whether it is colorful paint, stylish inscriptions or original patterns, new skins will help you stand out from other players.</p><br/><br/><p> In this article, we will take a closer look at some of the brightest and most popular skins of this week. We will tell you about their features, how to get them, and their price on trading platforms. In addition, we will also consider the opinions of players and experts about the new skins and their impact on the game economy.</p><br/><br/><p> Choosing the right skins can be a decisive factor in your success in the game Rust. They can give you an advantage in battles, attract the attention of other players, and simply make the gameplay even more fun. So, carefully study the new skins and choose the ones that match your style and preferences.</p><br/><br/><p> Stay up to date with the latest skins in the game Rust, follow the updates and enjoy the gameplay with original and beautiful skins. To learn more, continue reading our article and boldly experiment with new skins in the game Rust!</p>'),
(10308, 'en-US', 'Military Flamethrower Added to Staging Branch'),
(10309, 'en-US', 'The recently updated Staging Branch version of Rust on Steam has added a new and exciting feature - a military flamethrower!'),
(10310, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, update, Staging Branch, military flamethrower, weapons, balancing'),
(10311, 'en-US', 'The recently updated Staging Branch of Rust on Steam has added a new and exciting feature - the Military Flamethrower! Players will now be able to use this powerful weapon system in their buildings and fights with opponents. The Military Flamethrower is an effective and destructive weapon that can quickly set enemy bases on fire or neutralize opponents with a stream of fire.<br/><br/> Adding a military flamethrower to the Staging Branch is an important step in the development of Rust. It offers players new tactical options and strategies, making the gameplay even more exciting and dynamic. Each player can now become a real pyromaniac, capable of destroying an enemy base or protecting their territory with fire.<br/><br/> The Flamethrower is not only a burning weapon, but also a means of controlling territory and creating an atmosphere of fear among opponents. Set fire to enemy buildings, increase unrest in their ranks, or use a stream of fire to drive enemies out of dangerous territory. It is necessary to handle fire carefully, as it can be friendly and hostile at the same time. All buildings and territories can be exposed to fire - including your own.<br/><br/> Balancing the new weapon is a very important aspect that the Rust developers took into account when introducing the military flamethrower to the Staging Branch. They have to make sure that the weapon is powerful enough to be effective, but at the same time not too powerful so as not to disrupt the game balance and not cause problems in battles.<br/><br/> Now players have the opportunity to realize their wildest plans with the help of the military flamethrower. It opens up new strategic possibilities, creates additional challenges and amazing moments in the game Rust. Be prepared to fight with fire and use it wisely to achieve victory in this brutal but exciting world of Rust!'),
(10312, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins released in Rust game on Steam'),
(10313, 'en-US', 'Learn about a major update in Rust on Steam - a new batch of stylish, creative and unique skins have been released to help you stand out and add some color to the game world. Find out how to get and install these skins and enjoy new ways to express yourself!');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(10314, 'en-US', 'game Rust, Steam, skins, new batch of skins, stylish skins, creative skins, unique skins, update appearance, add bright colors, stand out, unique virtual character, details and features, getting skins, installing skins, self-expression, creativity'),
(10315, 'en-US', 'Welcome to all fans of the game Rust on Steam! Good news for you - our gaming community. A new batch of skins for your game has recently been released. We have carefully selected and present you the most stylish, creative and unique skins for your gaming experience. Enjoy updating your appearance and adding bright colors to the game world of Rust. Do not miss the chance to stand out among other players and become a unique virtual character. In this article, we will consider all the details and features of the new skins, and also share with you information on how to get and install them in the game. Are you ready for new opportunities for self-expression in Rust? Then read our article and give free rein to your creativity!'),
(10316, 'en-US', 'New weapon - Minigun, will be available on April 4!'),
(10317, 'en-US', 'Changes are coming to Rust! Players will be able to use a new weapon, the Minigun, on April 4. Find out all the details and trade-offs associated with this update.'),
(10318, 'en-US', 'new weapons, Minigun, Rust update, availability, strategy, high fire rate, accuracy, high damage, tradeoffs, overheating, ammo, combat, skill upgrades'),
(10319, 'en-US', '<p>There are exciting changes coming to the world of Rust that you should know about! Very soon, on April 4, players will be able to use a new weapon - the Minigun! This is a powerful weapon that will make your opponent shudder with fear.</p><br/><p> Minigun is a unique opportunity to enhance your strategy and fight back against enemies. Do not doubt that this weapon will help you win the most heated battles.</p><br/><p> The Rust developers spent a lot of time creating the Minigun taking into account the wishes and preferences of players. The weapon has a high rate of fire, accuracy and powerful damage, making it an ideal choice for those looking for effective ways to fight off enemies.</p><br/><p> However, acquiring a Minigun comes with its own trade-offs. Players will be faced with limited ammo and overheating of the weapon. You will have to skillfully distribute your forces and use the Minigun wisely, so as not to run out of ammo at the most crucial moment of the battle.</p><br/><p> Everyone who wants to can\'t wait until April 4th, when the Minigun will be available. Prepare for an uncompromising battle and upgrade your skills to use this new weapon for your own purposes.</p>'),
(10320, 'en-US', 'The first motorcycles in Rust: ready to conquer the off-road'),
(10321, 'en-US', 'The first motorcycles are coming to Rust soon! In this article, we\'ll take a look at what\'s already been done and what to expect from this new vehicle. Get ready for off-road adventures and thrilling adventures!'),
(10322, 'en-US', 'motorcycles, game Rust, off-road, conquest, video, 3D model, adventures'),
(10323, 'en-US', 'The first developments of motorcycles in the game Rust have appeared on the network! As the video shows, the control system is almost ready, and we can’t wait to get behind the wheel of this powerful mechanism. All that’s left is to wait for the 3D model of the motorcycle and not deny ourselves anything! Together with a friend and a cap on our heads, we will go on exciting adventures, conquering the off-road of Rust. Get ready for adrenaline and destruction, because motorcycles will soon become an integral part of the game world of Rust!'),
(10324, 'en-US', 'Retro Wardrobe Skin Coming to Rust: New Opportunities for Skin Creators'),
(10325, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new cabinet skin, Retro, opening up new possibilities for skin creators in the workshop. Find out about this update and how it inspires creativity.'),
(10326, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, skin, wardrobe, features, skin creators'),
(10327, 'en-US', '<p>Skin on the CABINET</p><br/><p> :dotred1:The Retro skin of the tool cabinet has already been implemented into the game, there is no information about the release date yet</p><br/><p> This could open the way for skin creators in the workshop.</p><br/><br/><p> A new cabinet skin has appeared in the world of Rust - Retro. It is designed in the style of old tools, giving it a special atmosphere. Although the exact release date is not yet known, players can already enjoy using it.</p><br/><br/><p> It is obvious that the introduction of such a skin opens up new possibilities for skin creators in the workshop. The new design of the cabinet inspires creativity and allows experimenting with different styles and themes. Now anyone can create a unique Retro-style skin and share it with other players.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust skin creation is a new platform for talented artists to showcase their skills and contribute to gaming culture. Not only will they enjoy the process, but they will also become part of a growing community of players who will enjoy their creations.</p><br/><br/><p> Thus, the appearance of the Retro Wardrobe Skin in the Rust game opens up new opportunities for creative people, stimulates the development of the Skin Workshop and enriches the game world with fresh and unique designs.</p>'),
(10328, 'en-US', 'Changes to seed models in the game Rust: innovations and possibilities'),
(10329, 'en-US', 'Learn about the upcoming changes to seed models in Rust and the innovations they will bring to gameplay.'),
(10330, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, Rust updates, seed models, seed model changes, innovations in the Rust game, features in the Rust game, Rust game economy'),
(10331, 'en-US', 'The world of Rust is getting major changes that will affect seed models. It\'s not an easy decision, but the developers decided to make these changes so that players can enjoy an even more realistic and immersive gameplay.<br/><br/> One of the main features of the update will be a change in seed models. Now they will look even more elaborate and detailed, which will allow players to even better visualize the process of growing and caring for plants in the game.<br/><br/> Along with the change in seed models, new features will be introduced. Players will now be able to see the different stages of plant growth, from the first green shoots to full maturity. This will add depth and realism to the game world, and will also allow players to plan their farmland more carefully.<br/><br/> Additionally, changing seed models will also impact Rust\'s in-game economy. More realistic and detailed seed models will have a unique value, and players will be able to use them as a means of trading and interacting with other players. This will open up new opportunities for developing the in-game economy and creating interesting gameplay patterns.<br/><br/> Overall, the changes to Rust\'s seed models aren\'t just visual updates. They add a new level of realism, add new gameplay options, and impact the game\'s economy. This is shaping up to be a major step in the game\'s evolution, opening up new horizons and opportunities for players.'),
(10332, 'en-US', 'Changes in the behavior of the Bradley Tank in our rice universe'),
(10333, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest changes in the behavior of the Bradley Tank in the rice universe. He can now call for help from armed scientists in a critical situation.'),
(10334, 'en-US', 'Changes, Behavior, Bradley Tank, Rice Universe, Smoke Screen, Scientists, Weapons'),
(10335, 'en-US', 'In our rice universe, there have been some interesting changes in the behavior of Tank Bradley. Now he will become even more dangerous and will call on defenders in difficult situations.'),
(10336, 'en-US', 'Information about the new batch of skins in the game Rust on Steam'),
(10337, 'en-US', 'Learn more about the new batch of skins for Rust on Steam. Explore the visual appeal of the skins, their potential impact on the game, and the importance of the choice in terms of game balance.'),
(10338, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, visual appeal, unique features, game balance'),
(10339, 'en-US', '<p>Recently, the game Rust, available on the Steam platform, received a long-awaited batch of new skins. These new skins will allow players to further diversify their gaming experience and make their character stand out from the crowd.</p><br/><p> In this article, we\'ll go into detail about the new skins, their appearance, availability, and impact on gameplay. We\'ll also discuss the tradeoffs involved in balancing various factors, and the issues that can arise when using different approaches to skin selection.</p><br/><p> One of the key factors to consider when choosing skins is their visual appeal. The new batch of skins offers a wide range of styles and designs, from classic to modern, so that every player can find something to their taste. This allows you to stand out from other players and create a unique image.</p><br/><p> However, in addition to the aesthetic component, it is important to consider the practical aspect. Some skins may have special properties or functions that can affect the gameplay. For example, a skin can add a speed boost or increase the character\'s defense. It is important to find a balance between the unique capabilities of the skin and maintaining game balance.</p><br/><p> In conclusion, the new batch of skins in the game Rust on Steam offers players the opportunity to add individuality and originality to their gameplay. However, when choosing a skin, it is necessary to consider its visual aspect and possible impact on the game balance. In the end, the choice of skin is an important factor in forming a unique image of the player in the world of Rust.</p>'),
(10340, 'en-US', 'Easter Event in Rust: New Features and Exclusive Skins!'),
(10341, 'en-US', 'Get ready for the Easter Event in Rust - new features, exclusive skins and exciting tasks are waiting for you! Join this exciting event and open a new level of the game.'),
(10342, 'en-US', 'Easter Event, Rust, Exclusive Skins, New Features, Game Personality, Quests, Treasures'),
(10343, 'en-US', 'Text preparation:</title><br/><p> Get ready for the festive mood in the game Rust! This Thursday, at 21:00 Moscow time, the exciting Easter Event will begin. This will be an unforgettable event that will give you new opportunities and exclusive skins that add a special atmosphere to the game.</p><br/><p> One of the main aspects of the Easter Event is the exclusive skins. The new Chicken Rider skin is a great opportunity to decorate your character and stand out from the rest of the players. But this is not the only skin that will be available during the event. You can expect other unique items that will help you create a unique image and enhance your in-game individuality.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow the event updates to stay up to date with new opportunities and bonuses. Take part in special tasks, search for treasures and pave your way to victory! The Easter Event in Rust promises to be exciting and full of pleasant surprises.</p><br/><p> Join your friends and play together to have more fun and effectively go through all the challenges that the development team has prepared for you. Don\'t miss the Easter Event in Rust - this is your chance to experience new emotions and discover many interesting moments in the game!</p>'),
(10344, 'en-US', 'Clan RyInA made a spectacular raid in the game Rust!'),
(10345, 'en-US', 'Details on the exciting raid of the RyInA clan in the game Rust, which took place during the stream. Find out how the team managed to successfully raid the base \"Hold the Door!\" and gain recognition from the community.'),
(10346, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, raid, clan, RyInA, Hold the Door, stream, base, community, strategy, tactics, gaming community'),
(10347, 'en-US', '<p>The RyInA clan, an influential community of players in the game Rust, made an amazing raid during one of their streams. The raid\'s target was a base with the game nickname \"Hold the Door!\"</p><br/><p> The raid was so successful that it earned recognition and respect from the community. Players were delighted with the professionalism and coordination of the RyInA clan members, who managed to take control of the enemy base.</p><br/><p> The spectacular raid was a real event for fans of the Rust game, who enjoyed watching the strategy and tactics of the RyInA clan. They appreciated the thorough preparation for the raid, the tactical advantage and professional weapon handling.</p><br/><p> The RyInA clan is a close-knit community of players who unite to achieve high results in the game. The raid on the \"Hold the Door!\" base was a shining example of their organization and coordination.</p><br/><p> Events like these allow us to see how the virtual world of Rust comes to life thanks to the enthusiasm and skills of its players. The RyInA clan raid has become an object of admiration and inspiration for many players, showing that justice and strength can be achieved through teamwork and tactical understanding.</p><br/><p> Join the Rust community and test your strength in exciting battles similar to the RyInA clan raids!</p>'),
(10348, 'en-US', 'New Challenges in Rust: Oil Rigs Update Overview'),
(10349, 'en-US', 'A review of the new update in the game Rust - Oil Rigs, offering players new challenges and opportunities. Find out more in our article.'),
(10350, 'en-US', 'New Challenges, Rust, Update, Oil Rigs, Review'),
(10351, 'en-US', '<p>Oil Rigs Update</p><br/><p> Today we will look at a new update in the game Rust, which added an interesting challenge for players - Oil Rigs. Let\'s take a closer look at this new feature.</p><br/><p> The first look at the new way to climb the Oil Rigs leaves a pleasant impression. A new staircase has appeared that leads directly to L3, and here the player is offered to choose one of three available exits.</p>'),
(10352, 'en-US', 'Harbors and Cargo Event Update in Rust: New Features and Improvements'),
(10353, 'en-US', 'The Harbor Update and Cargo Event in Rust bring new features and improvements, including port expansion, a new travel system, and many other interesting features.'),
(10354, 'en-US', 'Update, harbors, Cargo event, game Rust, features, improvements'),
(10355, 'en-US', '<p>Fresh changes to harbors and the introduction of the Cargo Event bring new features and improvements to the game Rust.</p><br/><p> One of the most notable innovations is the expansion of both ports to accommodate a cargo ship. Now the cargo ship stops for 8 minutes and 4 crates are transferred to it. This is a great opportunity for players to get valuable resources.</p><br/><p> There is also a new zip line system for transportation, making it much easier and faster to move around the harbor and surrounding area.</p><br/><p> The developers also did not forget about the appearance and details of the environment. Many new details have been added to the harbors, creating a more interesting and realistic atmosphere of the game. In addition, new conditions for PVP have appeared - a small bunker with containers and many places where you can hide and bypass opponents.</p><br/><p> However, it is worth remembering that all these changes are still in development and are subject to change. For example, the bridge in the harbor does not have textures yet, but in the final version it will be fixed and will be an additional element of visual appeal.</p><br/><p> The Harbor Update and Cargo Event bring a breath of fresh air to the world of Rust. New features and improvements provide players with even more variety in gameplay and exciting tasks to complete. Dive into the world of Rust and discover all the benefits of these updates.</p>'),
(10356, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins into Rust orbit!'),
(10357, 'en-US', 'Find out all about the latest batch of skins for Rust on Steam! Upgrade your gaming experience with new visual modifications and stand out from the crowd. However, keep balance and compromise in mind when choosing skins.'),
(10358, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust, Steam, gaming experience, weapons, clothing, visual modification, uniqueness, status, game economy, trading platforms, balance, compromises'),
(10359, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust! We have some exciting news for all fans of this exciting game on Steam. A fresh batch of skins has been released that will add even more exclusivity and style to your gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><p> If you\'re looking for ways to freshen up your look or just want to add a little originality to the game, the new Rust skins are the perfect option for you. They\'re visual modifications for weapons, clothing, and more that will make your character truly unique.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins offers a wide range of variations so that every player can find something to their taste. From bright and colorful skins to more stylish and minimalistic options, everything is presented on this platform. You will be able to enjoy new images and stand out from other players.</p><br/><br/><p> It\'s not just style and uniqueness that make skins so attractive. They can also be a symbol of status and success in the game. Rare and valuable skins can distinguish you from other players and show your high performance. And of course, new skins enrich the game economy, creating opportunities for players to sell and buy skins on trading platforms.</p><br/><br/><p> However, before making a purchase, it is important to keep in mind the balance and trade-offs. When investing in new skins, it is important to consider their cost and long-term prospects. Be careful when choosing and remember that skins are intended to improve the visual component of the game and do not affect its gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust is constantly evolving, and skins are one of the main components of this development. The new batch of skins is just the beginning, and in the future we will see even more epic and innovative variations. Stay tuned and don\'t miss the chance to make your presence in the world of Rust truly unforgettable and stylish.</p>'),
(10360, 'en-US', 'Electricity Updates: New Features and Bug Fixes'),
(10361, 'en-US', 'The latest updates to Rust bring new features and fixes to the electrical world. Find out how players can now use electrical devices more efficiently to create functional bases.'),
(10362, 'en-US', 'electrical updates, new features, bug fixes, electrical system, power consumption, logic gates, electrical devices, technical equipment, gaming experience, improvement'),
(10363, 'en-US', '<p>The latest updates to Rust have added new features in the field of electricity, as well as fixed some bugs related to this system.</p><br/><p> One of the major changes is the redesigned power consumption of logic elements. They now use electricity more efficiently, allowing players to more flexibly customize and automate their electrical circuits.</p><br/><p> In addition, the developers have fixed some errors that could occur when working with the electrical system. Now players can be sure that their electrical devices are working stably, allowing them to focus on other aspects of the gameplay.</p><br/><p> Electrical upgrades give players more options for creative and strategic use of electrical devices. They can create complex systems of automated lighting, security, and technical equipment, making their base more functional and convenient.</p><br/><p> Taking gameplay to the next level, the electricity updates in Rust demonstrate the developers\' ongoing commitment to improving the gaming experience and meeting player needs.</p>'),
(10364, 'en-US', 'Unique skins have just arrived in Rust! Update your game collection and express your style in the post-apocalyptic world.'),
(10365, 'en-US', 'skin creation, new skins, Rust, Steam, skins batch, gaming experiment, gaming fashion'),
(10366, 'en-US', 'Good news for fans of Rust on Steam! A new batch of skins has just appeared, which will give your items and character a unique and stylish look. Want to learn more about the hottest new items? Then this post is for you!<br/><br/> The game Rust has long won the hearts of gamers with its unpredictability and the ability to create their own unique stories in a post-apocalyptic world. However, in addition to exciting gameplay, the developers often take care that players have the opportunity to stand out from the crowd with their style. That is why new batches of skins are released periodically, which make your gaming experience even more unique and memorable.<br/><br/> The new batch of skins is not just a set of beautiful textures for weapons, clothes and objects. There is a whole aesthetic concept that affects both the appearance of the player and the visual perception of the surrounding world. By choosing skins, you create your own style, emphasize your individuality and demonstrate your preferences.<br/><br/> The new batch of skins includes a variety of options from bright and flashy to stylish and minimalistic. You will be able to find the perfect skin that will reflect your personality and soar to the heights of gaming fashion!<br/><br/> Remember that the content of each batch of skins is strictly selected by the development team. They take into account the wishes and preferences of the community, and also balance various factors to ensure an interesting and balanced game economy.<br/><br/> Unique skins will not only be a visual decoration, but also an opportunity to stand out among other players. This will help create an atmosphere of competition and encourage you to climb to the top of Rustomir.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to get the hottest new skins and add some exclusivity and style to your game!<br/><br/> <b>List of expected skins:</b><br/><ul><br/><li> Skin 1 - <i>\"Skin Name 1\"</i></li><br/><li> Skin 2 - <i>\"Skin Name 2\"</i></li><br/><li> Skin 3 - <i>\"Skin Name 3\"</i></li><br/></ul><br/><br/> <b>Benefits of buying skins:</b><br/><ol><br/><li> Originality and uniqueness</li><br/><li> Opportunity to stand out from other players</li><br/><li> Creating your own style</li><br/><li> Stimulating the competitive spirit</li><br/><li> Support game developers</li><br/></ol><br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your skin collection and transform the world of Rust on Steam to your style! The new batch of skins is your chance to express yourself and take a look at the future of gaming fashion.<br/><br/> Stay tuned for updates on the official website and don\'t miss the release of new batches of skins in the game Rust!'),
(10367, 'en-US', 'Fire-breathing new items in the game Rust: Military Flamethrower is now available on the Staging branch!'),
(10368, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new fire-breathing update in the game Rust - a military flamethrower, already available on the Staging branch. Details and characteristics of the flamethrower are not yet disclosed, but players can already test its capabilities and take part in exciting firefights.'),
(10369, 'en-US', 'Rust, military flamethrower, Staging branch, new weapons, flamethrower characteristics'),
(10370, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has a new fire-breathing option for players - the Military Flamethrower! This powerful weapon system is now available on the Staging branch, giving players a first look at its capabilities.</p><br/><p> However, there is still no detailed information about the flamethrower\'s characteristics, its crafting cost, and the possibility of studying it in the game. These important questions remain open, but the developers will surely provide more detailed information soon.</p><br/><p> The military flamethrower promises to be a significant innovation in the fight for survival in the world of Rust. This weapon can be very useful when defending a base, attacking enemies, or using in other tactical situations.</p><br/><p> Don\'t waste any time and join the Staging branch to try out the new Flamethrower right away. Stay tuned for more updates on the latest news about the introduction of the Military Flamethrower to the main game version of Rust!</p>'),
(10371, 'en-US', 'New Chinken Rider costume in Rust: a unique opportunity to participate in raids with an original style!'),
(10372, 'en-US', 'The new Chinken Rider costume in Rust offers a unique opportunity to participate in raids with an original style. Discover the bright and unusual combination of Asian design, style and combat properties of this costume. Be the center of attention and increase your combat effectiveness with Chinken Rider!'),
(10373, 'en-US', 'news, update, game Rust, Chinken Rider, costume, raids, style, equipment'),
(10374, 'en-US', '<h2>New Chinken Rider costume in Rust: a unique opportunity to participate in raids with an original style!</h2><br/><p> The upcoming Rust Staging branch has added the exciting Chinken Rider costume - a truly unique opportunity to raid with an original style!</p><br/><p> You have a unique chance to join the crowd of clan Zerg who rush to the raid in these bright and unusual costumes. Chinken Rider is an interesting combination of clothes that are inspired by Asian style and culture.</p><br/><p> Now you can stand out from other players and become a real star performer of decisive raids. The unusual design of the costume will make you the center of attention and will raise the mood of everyone who is near you.</p><br/><p> However, do not forget that this suit is not only a stylish wardrobe item, but also a full-fledged equipment that provides some advantages in combat situations. The unique properties of the suit will help you not only improve your overall appearance, but also increase your combat effectiveness.</p><br/><p> If you want to be unique and feel confident in raids, then Chinken Rider is the perfect choice for you. Don\'t miss the chance to realize your wildest dreams of bright adventures in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(10375, 'en-US', 'Latest news from the gaming world of Rust'),
(10376, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news from the Rust gaming world and stay up to date with the latest updates. Follow the link to watch an interesting video with details about the changes in the game.'),
(10377, 'en-US', 'news, game world, Rust, updates, link, video, details, changes'),
(10378, 'en-US', 'Hello, friends! We have some fresh news for you that will definitely please all fans of the game Rust. Our friend shared with us a link to an interesting video in which you can find out the most current events and updates of the game. Don\'t miss the opportunity to stay up to date with the latest news!<br/><br/> In order to get full information, we suggest you follow the link: <a href=\"https://youtu.be/DtgLuKyFejw?si=GidY53o7LtdgbWnN\">https://youtu.be/DtgLuKyFejw?si=GidY53o7LtdgbWnN</a> . The video is only a few minutes long, but contains many interesting details and details about updates and changes in the game Rust. Don\'t forget to turn on subtitles so you don\'t miss anything!<br/><br/> If you are a fan of the game Rust, then this news will definitely interest you. We will be glad if you tell your friends and the community about our post so that they can also be aware of the latest events in the world of Rust. We wish you a pleasant viewing and a good time in the exciting game Rust!'),
(10379, 'en-US', 'We study all aspects of working with motorcycles and bicycles in the game Rust'),
(10380, 'en-US', 'Developing the theme of motorcycles and bicycles in the game Rust: up-to-date information about the work on these types of transport.'),
(10381, 'en-US', 'motorcycles, bicycles, game Rust, work, aspects'),
(10382, 'en-US', 'The current content of the article is: \"Work on motorcycles and bicycles is in full swing.\"'),
(10383, 'en-US', 'Mysterious Wallpaper in Rust: DLC or New Feature Available?'),
(10384, 'en-US', 'The game Rust has a mysterious wallpaper that could become a new decorative element. The article discusses possible options and compromises when implementing this feature.'),
(10385, 'en-US', 'game Rust, wallpapers, DLC, new features, updates, developers, gaming experience'),
(10386, 'en-US', 'Interesting wallpapers have appeared in the game Rust, which may become a new decorative element. It remains a mystery whether this new content will be available to all players or will be offered as a separate DLC. Models of future interior decorative elements in the form of wallpapers have already been added to the game files. What this means and what opportunities will be opened up to players - remains unknown. Perhaps the developers are preparing something new and unique for us. We are waiting for news and further updates to find out what compromises the developers have chosen and how this will affect our gaming experience!'),
(10387, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest updates to the Rust skin collection on Steam and how they can impact your gaming experience and personality.'),
(10388, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game, Steam, collection update, gameplay, individuality, uniqueness, visual aspect, game mechanics, survival, Steam store'),
(10389, 'en-US', '<p>Hold on tight Rust players, because a fresh batch of skins has been released for your favorite survival masterpiece! The collection update brings a ton of new and improved options that will add a touch of style to the game\'s virtual world.</p><br/><p> Rust on Steam is known for its huge variety of skins that help make the gameplay even more fun and personal. The new batch of skins is no exception, offering players a wide range of choices so that everyone can find something to their taste.</p><br/><p> In the new update of the Rust game skin collection, you will find everything from stylish clothes and accessories to weapons and building materials. These new skins will not only change the appearance of your items, but also emphasize your individuality and uniqueness in the game world.</p><br/><p> Besides the visual aspect, it is important to mention that new skins in the game Rust can also affect the game mechanics. Some of them can give bonuses or improvements that will help you in survival and battles with other players.</p><br/><p> Rust on Steam is constantly being updated and developed, and the new batch of skins is just one of the many changes that have occurred in the game. Don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your game collection with new stylish items and updates.</p><br/><p> Head over to the Steam store to check out all the latest additions to Rust. Don\'t miss your chance to express your individuality and enhance your gaming experience with new skins!</p>'),
(10390, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam: A Game That Combines Survival and Construction'),
(10391, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam is a unique game that combines survival and construction. This article covers the first news about the development of motorcycles and other updates to the game.'),
(10392, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam, game, survival, building, motorcycle development, updates'),
(10393, 'en-US', '<p>There are many games in the gaming industry, but nothing compares to Rust on Steam. This unique game combines elements of survival and construction, creating an exciting gaming experience.</p><br/><p> In Rust, players are sent to a ruthless island where they must fight for survival in harsh conditions. They must gather resources, build fortifications, hunt wild animals, and defend themselves from other players. The absolute \"kill or be killed\" rule creates a tense atmosphere in the game and forces players to make strategic decisions to stay alive and succeed.</p><br/><p> The game Rust also offers huge opportunities for construction and development. Players can create their own bases and fortifications, build weapons and defenses, create items and tools, research new technologies and much more. Each player can develop according to their taste and create a unique gaming experience.</p><br/><p> And finally, the most interesting thing is that Rust is always innovating and updating. Recently, the developers presented information about the development of motorcycles, which gave players new opportunities for fast and efficient movement around the island. Motorcycles will become an integral part of the game and will add even more dynamism to the fight for survival.</p><br/><p> Overall, Rust on Steam is not just a game, it is a whole world where each player can become the hero of their own story. The unique combination of survival and construction, constant updates and endless possibilities make Rust one of the most exciting games to date.</p>'),
(10394, 'en-US', 'New Potential Workshop Skins for Rust: Possibilities for Future Updates'),
(10395, 'en-US', 'Learn about potential new workshop skins for Rust and how they expand the possibilities of future updates.'),
(10396, 'en-US', 'skins, workshop, updates, Rust'),
(10397, 'en-US', '<p>Passionate Rust players always look forward to new updates. And, of course, one of the most anticipated elements of the updates are new skins. They give game items a unique look and emphasize the individuality of each player. New potential skins are constantly appearing in the Rust game workshop, which may be included in the next updates.</p><br/><br/><p> These potential skins are the result of hard work and creative inspiration from the player community. The Rust Workshop gives players the opportunity to create and upload their own skins that could become part of the official version of the game. Each proposed skin goes through a rigorous selection process to be reviewed by the developers and possibly included in the next update.</p><br/><br/><p> New potential skins presented in the Rust workshop are distinguished by their diversity and originality. They include skins for weapons, clothing, building materials and other game items. Many of them have unique designs and interesting details that will help you stand out in the world of Rust and emphasize your individuality.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that not all skins submitted to the workshop will necessarily be added to future updates of the game. The Rust developers carefully evaluate each potential skin, taking into account factors such as model quality, suitability to the gameplay style, and practicality of use. Sometimes compromises have to be made and some skins have to be rejected in order to maintain the balance and integrity of the game world.</p><br/><br/><p> Additionally, adding new skins to the game requires a certain amount of time and resources from the developers. They must think through the integration of the skins into the game mechanics, test them for compatibility with other elements of the game, and ensure their safety and stability. This can take some time, so some potential skins may remain \"waiting\" indefinitely.</p><br/><br/><p> Thus, new potential workshop skins for Rust offer players the opportunity to contribute to the game universe and create a unique gaming experience. However, their inclusion in the next update depends on a number of factors, including quality, suitability for the game style, and availability of developer resources.</p><br/><br/><p> So, be on the lookout for new potential skins from the Rust Workshop and stay tuned! Perhaps your skin will become part of the game and add new colors to your gaming life.</p>'),
(10398, 'en-US', 'First screenshots of the new user interface for stores'),
(10399, 'en-US', 'screenshots, new interface look, user interface, stores'),
(10400, 'en-US', '<h2>First screenshots of the new user interface for stores</h2><br/><br/><p> Here\'s what we learned about the new shop interface in Rust! The first screenshots have been released, giving us a glimpse of the changes that are coming.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the major changes will be the replacement of the blue inserts that we see in the current stores. Instead, the developers have implemented a new kind of user interface that promises to make interaction with stores more convenient and intuitive.</p><br/><br/><p> In the screenshots, you can see that the new interface looks more modern and stylish. Perhaps the developers took inspiration from other popular games or presented something completely new. But we can definitely say that the new interface will add freshness and novelty to the shops in the Rust game.</p><br/><br/><p> It will be interesting to see what other changes await us in the new user interface for stores. Judging by the first screenshots, we can expect more convenient navigation by items, the ability to quickly view information about products, and a more intuitive buying and selling process.</p><br/><br/><p> We will be able to evaluate the final look of the new interface only after its release in the game. But already now, the first screenshots create anticipation and arouse interest among players. We will follow further news and information about the new user interface of shops in Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> Follow our updates to stay up to date with all the happenings in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(10401, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of new Rust skins added to Steam and update your in-game wardrobe to give your items a unique style and personality.'),
(10402, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, modifications, customization, updates, design'),
(10403, 'en-US', 'Gorgeous new skins for Rust are now available! Check out the latest batch of skins added to Steam and dive into the world of modding and customizing your characters and items in the game. We\'ve got a full overview of all the new skins, including their designs, features, and availability. Not only do these new skins give your gear a fresh and unique look, they also allow you to express your personality and style in-game. Don\'t miss your chance to update your Rust wardrobe and make your items stand out. Stay up to date with all the latest updates and new skins coming to Rust!'),
(10404, 'en-US', 'Rust Updates: New Patrol Helicopter Format and Progress on \'Night Light\''),
(10405, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates: New Patrol Helicopter Format and Progress in Night Light Development. This article covers changes to the Patrol Helicopter, progress in the development of the Night Light dynamics, and other updates such as Port work, fixes, and changes to the game\'s interface.'),
(10406, 'en-US', 'Rust Updates, Patrol Helicopter, Night Light, Changes, Job, Port, Rocket Shots, Lighting, Mic Stand'),
(10407, 'en-US', 'Changes to the patrol helicopter<br/><br/> - Following some changes to the Patrol Helicopter last week, we are seeing some more changes to this flying event. It looks like the Patrol Helicopter will be exploring the map in a more dynamic way.<br/><br/> - In addition, changes were made to the missile salvos: the probability of increasing or decreasing the number of missile shots per attack.<br/><br/> :dotred1: This week, work continues on a branch called \"Night Light\". Not to be confused with some form of basic lighting, this actually refers to changes that will happen to the night time dynamics in the game. I\'ll attach some examples of current work at the end.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Other changes:<br/><br/> - More work on the Port (looks like there will be a working crane there!)<br/><br/> - Fixed cards held by other players always appearing green<br/><br/> - Fixed incorrect display of microphone stand energy usage in the user interface<br/><br/> - Several additional inscriptions for barrels with loot (recyclers, etc.) Replaced the static inscription \"fuel\" with \"poison\" to avoid confusing players'),
(10408, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam Development News: War Flamethrower, Peaceful City Rework, and More'),
(10409, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest updates to Rust on Steam, including the War Flamethrower, Peaceful City rework, and other exciting news.'),
(10410, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, updates, Steam, military flamethrower, Peaceful City, modifications, training mode, interface, explosion effects, cabinet skin, oil rigs'),
(10411, 'en-US', 'Development news<br/><br/> - Introduction of a new model of military flamethrower.<br/><br/> - The complete rework of the Peaceful City is ongoing (there are rumors that we will forget what it looks like, because it will be a very big rework).<br/><br/> - Modifications to the player client to improve night vision (that glow around you in a small area) are still being developed.<br/><br/> - A learning/training mode for new players will be available in March.<br/><br/> - The interface of shops (players) on the map has been redesigned. A new interface for the market will appear later.<br/><br/> - Work continues on explosion/particle effects.<br/><br/> - Coming soon is a Cabinet skin with an integrated screen (like in Vending Machines) to see maintenance costs.<br/><br/> - Scientists will most likely spawn with Bradley (launch and on roads at the end of the wipe).<br/><br/> :dotred1: Unconfirmed information:<br/> - One of the oil rigs will have tunnels resembling the entrances/exits of the lab. Will this be purely a texture/cosmetic feature? Or will the underwater labs have another entrance? Remains unknown.'),
(10412, 'en-US', 'Cabinet formula changes in Rust: skinning capabilities and new resource content'),
(10413, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new cabinet formula change in Rust that allows for skinning and expands the resource content in the game.'),
(10414, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, cabinets, skins, resources, base, developers'),
(10415, 'en-US', 'Everyone who plays Rust knows how important it is to ensure the safety of your base. And now the game developers are delighting us with a new change - the ability to apply skins to cabinets! This will not only allow you to give your base a unique look, but will also bring new resource content to the game.<br/><br/> Until now, the base maintenance formula was a bit limited, and players could only store a limited amount of resources in their cabinets. But now the developers are expanding the possibilities and preparing to change the base maintenance formula. This means that you will be able to store more resources in your cabinets and manage resources in the game more easily.<br/><br/> However, the innovation is not limited to improving the functionality of the cabinets. The developers will also provide the ability to apply skins to the cabinets. This opens up huge opportunities for self-expression and creating a unique style for your base. You will be able to choose from a variety of designs and colors to give your base a unique look.<br/><br/> We are also excited to share with you the Steam Workshop contenders of the week. Every week, new Rust skins created by players themselves are added to the Steam Workshop. You can browse through them and choose the ones you like the most.<br/><br/> The cabinet formula changes and skinning are big steps forward for Rust. Not only do they add newness and interest, but they also expand the player experience. We can\'t wait to see how players use the new features and create unique bases.'),
(10416, 'en-US', 'News about the minigun in the game Rust: getting ready for the expected update!'),
(10417, 'en-US', 'Read about the latest news about the Minigun in Rust and prepare for the upcoming update. Learn about the work on the model, animations and other changes related to the Minigun.'),
(10418, 'en-US', 'news, minigun, Rust, update, model export, animations, settings, prefab, game world'),
(10419, 'en-US', '<p>The last time we saw news about the minigun in Rust was 4 years ago. But now, it\'s finally time to prepare for the expected update, which may include this weapon model.</p><br/><p> However, details about whether it will be her or what her role will be - for base defense or for PVP - remain unclear.</p><br/><p> However, we already know that some significant steps have been made in the development of the minigun:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> The base model file with meshes was exported.</li><br/><li> Work has been done on animation settings for this model.</li><br/><li> Updated titles for clips involving the use of the minigun.</li><br/><li> The overlay masks have also been updated to make the weapons appear more realistic.</li><br/><li> And finally, the prefab was added and the model was adjusted to the game world.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> We\'re looking forward to this update to learn all about the minigun and how it will interact with gameplay. Stay tuned for the latest information on Rust!</p>'),
(10420, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: A Review of the Latest Updates'),
(10421, 'en-US', 'Find out about all the new skins in the game Rust and choose the most suitable for your collection. The review presents all the latest updates and features of the game with new skins.'),
(10422, 'en-US', 'skins, game Rust, updates, review, collection, game strategy'),
(10423, 'en-US', '<p>Today we want to share with you some exciting news - a new batch of skins has appeared in the game Rust! If you are a fan of this exciting survival game, then you are definitely interested to know about all the latest updates and features that the developers have added to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> In this article, we\'ll take a look at all the new skins that have arrived in Rust and share our thoughts on them. Whether you\'re looking for new decor for your base or cool gear options, you\'ll love this updated collection.</p><br/><br/><p> We have prepared detailed reviews of the coolest skins for you, so that you can easily decide which ones are definitely worth adding to your collection. The variety of styles and themes allows each player to find something to their taste.</p><br/><br/><p> We\'ll also look at the benefits of playing with new skins. What effects and features do these updates provide? What compromises do you have to make to take full advantage of the new skins?</p><br/><br/><p> We will also discuss the impact of new skins on game balance. What changes in gameplay might occur due to the addition of new elements? Is it necessary to buy skins to be competitive?</p><br/><br/><p> At the end of the article, we will summarize and give our overall assessment of the updates. We will try to take into account all the factors related to the new skins in the game Rust so that you can make an informed decision.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins in the game Rust are not just an opportunity to change the appearance of your character or the surrounding world. This is another opportunity to immerse yourself in the exciting atmosphere of the game and stand out among other players.</p><br/><br/><p> So don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection and add a new element to your game strategy! Be sure to check out our overview of the new skins in the game Rust and decide which ones are right for you!</p>'),
(10424, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam Development News: Attack Helicopter Changes and Other Updates'),
(10425, 'en-US', 'Find out about the changes to the attack helicopter and other updates to Rust on Steam. Stay up to date with the latest development news.'),
(10426, 'en-US', 'game Rust, Steam, development news, combat helicopter, updates'),
(10427, 'en-US', 'Development news<br/><br/> :dotred1: Missile firing delay for attack helicopter<br/><br/> - Next month, the attack helicopter will receive some changes. In particular, missiles can only be launched once every 30 seconds. At the same time, indicators for the readiness of missiles and flares have been added to the control panel. A small soundtrack will also be added when missiles become available again.<br/><br/> :dotred: Other changes:<br/><br/> - Changes in the patrol helicopter:<br/> - A little more random movement around the map between the stations it flies over<br/> - Changed the accuracy of the missile salvo (now the helicopter aims at the target depending on the distance).<br/> - It will break more randomly.<br/><br/> - Work on the minigun continues<br/><br/> - Changed flag borders to make it easier to dig caches with a metal detector in close combat<br/><br/> - Fixes in loading models on the map<br/><br/> - Work on the training island continues<br/><br/> - Work continues on changing the Port for the Cargo Ship<br/><br/> - Work is underway to record a demo video of the entire server<br/><br/> - Optimization of RPC connections<br/><br/> - Work on new explosions continues<br/><br/> - Work on the M939 truck continues'),
(10428, 'en-US', 'A new batch of Valentine\'s Day skins has been released'),
(10429, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of Valentine\'s Day skins for Rust on Steam. Explore a variety of base decorations, weapons, and clothing items that will help you create a romantic atmosphere in the gameplay.'),
(10430, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Valentine\'s Day, Rust, Steam');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(10431, 'en-US', '<p>Valentine\'s Day is just around the corner, and the team behind Rust on Steam is taking great care in preparing for it. In honor of this romantic holiday, a new batch of skins has been released that will allow players to bring even more love and passion into their gaming experience!</p><br/><p> New Valentine\'s Day skins offer a wide range of items to decorate your base, weapons, and clothing. Fans of the game will be able to choose skins that will perfectly complement the romantic atmosphere in Rust and help create a unique look for their character and surroundings.</p><br/><p> The highlight of the new skin collection is detailed and realistic images of love symbols: hearts, flowers, Cupid\'s arrows and much more. Such details allow game participants to express their creativity, mood and feelings, making the gameplay even more emotional and exciting.</p><br/><p> Each skin has its own uniqueness and recognition thanks to bright colors, characteristic design elements and high-quality development. The variety of skins allows each player to choose the right option that will perfectly fit his style and preferences.</p><br/><p> The Valentine\'s Day skin collection is now available on the Steam platform, and everyone can purchase the desired items and decorate their gaming experience to their taste. Spend this special holiday with the game Rust, creating your own unique work of art!</p>'),
(10432, 'en-US', 'Dive into the world of future skins in Rust on Steam'),
(10433, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest and most exciting upcoming skins for Rust on Steam. Dive into the virtual world with a unique look and find your own personality!'),
(10434, 'en-US', 'game Rust, skins, workshop, future skins, unique appearance, design, game economy, balancing, Steam'),
(10435, 'en-US', 'Welcome to the exciting world of future skins in Rust on Steam! In this article, we will look at the newest and most exciting contenders for inclusion in the game, which are created by talented developers from the workshop. Dive into virtual reality and experience the possibilities of choosing a unique and original appearance for your character.<br/><br/> What makes these skins so special? Each of the created contenders has its own uniqueness that will allow you to stand out from other players. You will be able to enjoy unique designs and details that will make your character truly unique. Dress in the most stylish and expressive outfits and attract attention with your special personality.<br/><br/> Our article offers an overview of the most amazing skins that are already available in the workshop, as well as those that are waiting for their release. We will consider various styles, from classic to futuristic, so that every player can find something to their taste.<br/><br/> Furthermore, we will discuss the issues surrounding skin balancing and its impact on the game economy. We will analyze the pros and cons of different approaches to introducing new skins into the game and consider how this may affect gameplay and interaction between players.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss out on a chance to dive into the world of future skins in Rust on Steam! Join us and learn all about the latest and greatest skins for your Rust character.'),
(10436, 'en-US', 'Dive into the world of exclusive skins in the game Rust'),
(10437, 'en-US', 'Rust introduces the ability to immerse yourself in the exciting world of exclusive skins. However, using skins can have its own trade-offs, such as high cost and possible imbalance in the game. Despite this, exclusive skins provide an opportunity for players to express their individuality and add new visual interest to the game.'),
(10438, 'en-US', 'Rust, skins, exclusive skins, visual update, individuality, compromises, expensive skins, advantage in the game, imbalance, balancing, multiplayer'),
(10439, 'en-US', 'The game Rust now offers the opportunity to immerse yourself in the fascinating world of exclusive skins. Now players can decorate their items and weapons with unique and stylish designs. New skins open up unlimited opportunities for self-expression and an individual approach to the design of the game profile.<br/><br/> Exclusive skins are not only a visual upgrade, but also a way to stand out from the crowd. Each skin is a unique piece of art created by talented artists. From vibrant colors to original patterns, these skins will add a unique touch to your gaming experience.<br/><br/> However, diving into the world of exclusive skins can have its trade-offs. Some skins can be quite expensive, especially if they are rare or collectible. In this case, players may need to invest additional funds to acquire the desired skin.<br/><br/> Additionally, some players may feel that using skins gives them an advantage in the game, especially if they change the appearance of weapons and items. This can cause an imbalance between players, especially in multiplayer modes. Rust developers are constantly working on balancing and eliminating such issues so that all players can enjoy the game in a fair and fun atmosphere.<br/><br/> Despite all the compromises, exclusive skins are an important part of Rust. They create an opportunity for players to express their individuality and add additional visual interest to the game. Get ready to dive into the exciting world of skins and discover new horizons in Rust!'),
(10440, 'en-US', 'Stylized Valentine\'s Day Skins for Rust on Steam'),
(10441, 'en-US', 'Check out the Valentine\'s Day themed skins for Rust on Steam and get ready for the festive spirit!'),
(10442, 'en-US', 'stylized skins, Valentine\'s Day, game Rust, Steam'),
(10443, 'en-US', 'Ahead of February 14th, Rust on Steam will be adding an anticipated tradition - stylized Valentine\'s Day skins! This holiday is becoming increasingly popular among players, and this year the Steam Workshop is preparing some amazing options.'),
(10444, 'en-US', 'Rust Weapon Balance: What to Expect in the Coming Patches'),
(10445, 'en-US', 'Updates to Rust will focus on weapon balance, including changes to reload animations, recoil, and spread.'),
(10446, 'en-US', 'Рust, weapon balance, patches, game, animation, recoil, spread'),
(10447, 'en-US', '<p>Insider</p><br/><p> Developer Helk has confirmed that the upcoming patches will rebalance all weapons in the game, similar to the update with the Semi-Automatic Rifle (Berdanka) and P250 (PEshka). These changes will cover the following aspects:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Reload and aim animation time</li><br/><li> Recoil</li><br/><li> Scatter</li><br/></ul><br/><p> What do you think about this?</p>'),
(10448, 'en-US', 'Memory Optimization in Rust: How to Improve Game Performance'),
(10449, 'en-US', 'Memory optimization in the game Rust allows you to improve the game\'s performance and provide a smoother gaming experience. In the latest update, the developers have made important optimizations, reducing memory consumption by several gigabytes. The development team continues to work on improving performance and further optimizing the game.'),
(10450, 'en-US', 'memory optimization, Rust, game performance, memory usage, memory size, textures, meshes, update'),
(10451, 'en-US', 'Memory optimization<br/><br/> :dotred: Despite some safeguards in place, RAM usage can easily get out of control. Developers are constantly adding new, amazing content, and unfortunately, this increases our memory footprint. To support this rate of content expansion, memory usage needs to be low and stable, no matter how complex the world is. Until more aggressive and efficient streaming can be implemented, every now and then developers have to sit down and look at what they missed and make the necessary adjustments.<br/><br/> In this update, they\'ve cut almost 3GB of memory in shader assets, as well as a few hundred MB in textures and meshes. It\'s a bit of a soft start in terms of textures and meshes, but they expect to cut memory usage by a few more gigabytes in the coming months.<br/><br/> - We really care about memory and performance, and we are actively working on it. This is just the first of many steps that will be aimed at improving not only memory usage, but also frame rates.<br/> ©Facepunch Studios'),
(10452, 'en-US', 'Hot New Skins in Rust: This Week\'s Fresh Release!'),
(10453, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest updates and additions to the Rust game, and find new aesthetic possibilities with new skins!'),
(10454, 'en-US', 'Rust, skins, new skins, updates, Rust on Steam'),
(10455, 'en-US', 'Hot New Skins in Rust: This Week\'s Fresh Release!<br/><br/> A new batch of skins is now available for all fans of the game Rust! The most fashionable and stylish skins of this week are already waiting for you. Find out about the latest updates and additions to the rich world of Rust, which will make your gaming session even brighter and more unique.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to become the owner of the most exclusive and rare skins! They will not only decorate your items, but also emphasize your individuality in the game. Skins for weapons, tools, armor, buildings and much more are waiting for you.<br/><br/> If you are tired of the standard options, then these new skins will definitely suit your taste. They will diversify the gameplay and add a touch of aesthetics to your adventure. Support the developers and enjoy a new visual experience.<br/><br/> Source: [Rust Community VK](https://vk.com/rustcommru)'),
(10456, 'en-US', 'We are expecting a new update of the game Rust on Steam'),
(10457, 'en-US', 'Everyone is waiting for the new update of the game Rust on Steam. Details and trailer in the article.'),
(10458, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, Steam, wipe, trailer'),
(10459, 'en-US', '<p>Everyone in the Rust gaming world is eagerly awaiting the new update that is already in the works for release.</p><br/><p> There is already a lot of activity on the official servers, players are eagerly waiting to enter the game and are preparing for the next wipe.</p><br/><p> If you want to stay up to date with the latest changes and innovations, we recommend that you pay attention to the update, the details of which can be found in the official trailer: </p><br/><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hqPFJQPsKwc\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe><br/><p> Get ready for exciting in-game events and embark on new adventures in Rust!</p>'),
(10460, 'en-US', 'Rust: New Updates - Long-Length Binoculars and New SKS Weapon'),
(10461, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest updates to Rust - the addition of the Long Range Binoculars and the new SKS weapon, as well as changes to existing weapons. Get ready for new features and experience gameplay balancing.'),
(10462, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, binoculars, long-range, SKS weapons, changes, animation, recoil, players'),
(10463, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, Rust players! Today we have some exciting news about the latest updates to the game. Ready to learn all the details?</p><br/><p> :dotred1: A long-range meter has been added to the binoculars, which now allows you to see the distance to objects. This feature is very useful for strategic planning and enemy detection.</p><br/><p> :dotred1: But that\'s not all! We are pleased to announce that we are working on a new weapon - the SKS. This will be a long-awaited addition to the arsenal. Be prepared to use its power in battles with enemies.</p><br/><p> :dotred1: In addition, changes were made to existing weapons:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> The aiming and reload animations for the SAR and P250 have been sped up, making your movements on the battlefield even smoother.</li><br/><li> There has also been a slight reduction in the recoil of the P250, allowing you to hit your opponents more accurately and successfully.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> All these changes are intended to make the gameplay more exciting and balanced. Don\'t forget to update and try out all the new features that Rust has to offer. Good luck in battle!</p>'),
(10464, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates: New Post-Processing Effects and Possible Addition of Mvk Hatch'),
(10465, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest updates to Rust, which include new post-processing effects and the possible addition of an MVC hatch.'),
(10466, 'en-US', 'Updates, Rust game, post-processing effects, Mvk-hatch, news'),
(10467, 'en-US', '<p>The latest Rust updates have brought exciting news that you can\'t miss! The developers have delighted us with new post-processing effects that will make the game world even more realistic and exciting.</p><br/><p> The commits that were published recently present screenshots of these new effects. Judging by them, players can expect stunning graphics and improved visuals. And, of course, this cannot fail to cause delight!</p><br/><p> But that\'s not all! According to unofficial information, the game Rust may be adding a Mvk hatch. Although this is only a rumor for now, fans of the game can\'t wait for confirmation of this news. If these rumors are true, then this will be an amazing step forward for the game!</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow the updates and stay up to date with all the news and events in the world of Rust. Play with friends, explore dangerous areas and enjoy improved graphics and new features!</p>'),
(10468, 'en-US', 'Fresh updates in the game Rust: metal detector and the ability to build shelters have been added'),
(10469, 'en-US', 'The latest updates to Rust include the addition of a metal detector and the ability to build shelters, among other important changes.'),
(10470, 'en-US', 'Fresh updates, game Rust, metal detector, shelters, changes'),
(10471, 'en-US', 'News updates<br/><br/> :dotred1: Metal detector added to Stagging branch<br/><br/> - Is the default drawing<br/> - The cost of crafting at the moment:<br/> - 2 ropes<br/> - 200 wood<br/> - Loot is tracked by matching two coordinates, first \"Forward-Backward\", then \"Right-Left\". You flag it and dig up the loot.<br/> - There is no loot drop table - everything from a tin can to an Assault Rifle can be dug up.<br/><br/> :dotred: Shelters<br/><br/> - Limited in quantity to 1 building per person and displayed on the map.<br/> - Added the ability for server owners to change this parameter server.maxshelters (default 1)<br/><br/> :dotred1: Other changes:<br/><br/> - Repairing a hatch no longer requires a ladder<br/> - When installing, the shutters can be moved outside the window frame or inside by pressing R.<br/> - Ability to OPEN/CLOSE map instead of HOLDING G.<br/> - In anticipation of the \"Lunar New Year\" the Dragon Rocket Launcher, Spear and possibly Axe skins will be released.<br/><br/> Apparently Helk heard about the community\'s request from Reddit about minor changes to the night. The developers\' commits included the first information about \"night lights\", so to speak, a small radius around the player in which he will see better at night.'),
(10472, 'en-US', 'Decorate your game! New skins of this week in Rust on Steam'),
(10473, 'en-US', 'Check out the coolest and most stylish new skins for Rust on Steam. Decorate your character, weapons, and buildings and express your individuality with these unique skins. We\'ll cover the specifics of creating and adding new skins, as well as share tips on choosing and combining skins. Don\'t miss the opportunity to update the visual side of your game and give it a unique style!'),
(10474, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, new skins, game, update, choice, combination, originality, visual perception, design, availability, rarity'),
(10475, 'en-US', '<p>If you\'re looking to give your Rust game on Steam a new and original look, you\'ll definitely want to check out the new skins introduced in this week\'s update. New skins are a great way to express your personality and enhance the aesthetics of the game world.</p><br/><p> In this article, we will look at the most interesting new skins, their features and ways to get them. We will also introduce you to the latest trends in the world of skins and share useful tips on choosing and combining skins for your character, weapons and buildings.</p><br/><p> However, before we get to the most exciting new items, let\'s discuss the process of creating and adding new skins to the game. It is important to understand that the developers strive to create skins that are not only beautiful, but also match the style of the game world. This implies certain limitations and compromises.</p><br/><p> The process of developing new skins requires not only creative thinking, but also technical skills. Designers must consider the sizes and shapes of game objects, as well as the specifics of textures and materials. They must also take into account the limitations and recommendations of the player community in order to create skins that will be popular and receive positive reviews.</p><br/><p> So, now let\'s move on to the most interesting new skins of this week. We\'ll look at various categories - from weapon skins to clothing and building skins. In each category, we\'ve selected a few particularly stylish and expressive skins that will not leave you indifferent.</p><br/><p> And remember, when choosing new skins, you should consider not only their appearance, but also their cost, rarity and availability. Sometimes the most exclusive and rare skins can become a real calling card of your character, and sometimes just a joyful decoration for your virtual home.</p><br/><p> So don\'t miss the chance to spruce up your game with the latest Rust skins on Steam. Give your gaming experience a unique and stylish twist!</p>'),
(10476, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Development News: Game Features and Models Updates'),
(10477, 'en-US', 'This article covers the new Rust game updates, which include gameplay features and models such as pop-up alerts, rotating doors and hatches, and an updated backpack model. These updates bring more features and improve the Rust gameplay experience.'),
(10478, 'en-US', 'Rust game, game feature updates, model updates, development news, peace zone, door and hatch rotation, untextured backpack model, looted backpack animation, game experience'),
(10479, 'en-US', '<p>In this article we will tell you about new updates to the Rust game that concern game features and models.</p><br/><br/><p> :dotred1: A pop-up warning has been added to the game when a player tries to exit the game in the Peace Zone. Now the player will receive a warning that it is forbidden to sleep for a long time in the city. This will help to avoid unwanted situations and make the gameplay more balanced.</p><br/><br/><p> :dotred1: Players can now rotate doors and hatches when placing them. This will allow for better exploration and use of the game space, as well as add more variety to base building.</p><br/><br/><p> :dotred1: A new textureless backpack model has been added for the player\'s \"rotten\" body. This is due to the fact that the old model has been used for the new, larger backpack. In addition, after opening the backpack, it acquires a \"looted\" animation, which makes it more realistic and attractive.</p><br/><br/><p> These updates to gameplay features and models in Rust allow players to have a more satisfying gaming experience, add more mechanics, and enrich the game universe. Stay tuned to the development news to stay up to date with all the changes and improvements in Rust!</p>'),
(10480, 'en-US', 'Rust Updates: New Backpack Functionality, Metal Detector, and Game Balance Changes'),
(10481, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest updates to Rust, including new backpack functionality, a metal detector, and balance changes. Get all the details and learn how these updates affect gameplay.'),
(10482, 'en-US', 'Rust updates, new backpack functionality, metal detector, game balance changes, development news'),
(10483, 'en-US', 'Development news!!!<br/><br/> :dotred1: Backpacks<br/><br/> - Added markers for attaching a holster to the backpack. Weapons can be worn on the side or back of the backpack (back by default). If you have large rocket launchers in your inventory, the primary weapon is on the side. And also optimized the rearrangement of the displayed weapons when putting on a backpack (for example, move the weapon from the back to the side slot of the backpack when it is equipped). Using backpack-specific offsets for each weapon holster information. Using specific rotations / offsets for both rocket launchers. Also removed the player\'s backpack from falling out when he dies in a safe zone and blocked theft of other players\' backpacks inside the safe zone. Disabled the ability to loot other people\'s backpacks inside the safe zone.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Metal detector<br/><br/> - Added a script for the shovel in case additional functions are needed. Now there is an additional metal detector light at the bottom of the model and its detail levels have been added to the world prefabs and view models (the light will be visible to all players and not just on behalf of the user).<br/><br/> :dotred1: Balance and gameplay changes<br/><br/> - Now Eoki will have an increased chance of a \"successful\" shot after each \"unsuccessful\" one.<br/><br/> - Fixed non-working oil pumps (oil pumping machine), restored old \"TNK behavior\". (H4 cave)<br/><br/> - A lot of work is still being done to improve the textures and quality of the RT. Textures on the Big and small oil rigs, roads have already been corrected. Barrel textures have been reworked and the truck model has been updated.'),
(10484, 'en-US', 'New collection of skins for the game Rust - give yourself a unique look!'),
(10485, 'en-US', 'Explore a unique collection of skins that will allow Rust players to give their characters a unique look and stand out from other players.'),
(10486, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, collection, skins, unique, type, character, design, update'),
(10487, 'en-US', 'Dear Rust players, we are happy to announce the release of a fantastic new collection of skins for your game! Want to give your character a unique and inimitable look? With this new batch of skins, you will be able to show your individuality and stand out from other players!'),
(10488, 'en-US', 'Rust Development News: Backpacks, Vault Limitation, and Peaceful Scientist City Redesign'),
(10489, 'en-US', 'This article provides news on the latest developments in Rust, including changes to the backpack system, a limit on the number of shelters, and a redesign of the Peaceful City of Scientists.'),
(10490, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, developments, backpacks, shelter restriction, redesign of the Peaceful City of Scientists'),
(10491, 'en-US', 'A little bit about the current work of the developers<br/><br/> :dotred1: Backpacks<br/><br/> Players can only use one backpack at a time, and the backpack inventory is separate from the player\'s inventory. If a player with a backpack dies, you will need to search the player\'s inventory and the backpack\'s inventory separately. Additionally, the only way to pick up a backpack on the ground is to hold E.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Shelter Limit 1<br/><br/> As mentioned in the dev blog earlier this month, players will soon be getting a cap on the number of Shelters they can place in the wild. This work has just moved into the development stage, and the default cap is set to 1.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Redesign of the Peaceful City of Scientists<br/><br/> Work on the RT update continues, with the City taking center stage. According to the commits, the new City Hall and helipad will be included in this redesign. No visuals yet, but we\'ll keep you posted.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Other things<br/><br/> - More experimental changes to industry - added the ability for industrial transfer to pause the transfer mid-tick and resume it on the next tick.<br/><br/> - Fixed spear model offset<br/><br/> - More work on updating the UI in the vending machines on the map.<br/><br/> - Player clothing is now rechecked for changes when clearing the demo. Fixed cases where clearing past clothing changes would result in the player not having the correct clothing model visually.<br/><br/> - Active work on the training island<br/><br/> - Now the dealer in blackjack can add when reaching \"soft 17\" (previously, when reaching 17, the dealer stopped the game)<br/><br/> - Active work on new explosions<br/><br/> :arrow2right:'),
(10492, 'en-US', 'The Future of Rust: What to Expect from the Addition of the Character Editor?'),
(10493, 'en-US', 'Learn about upcoming Rust updates and the upcoming addition of a character editor. Find out how this affects players\' individuality and experience in the game.'),
(10494, 'en-US', 'The Future of Rust, Character Editor, Game Updates, Player Personality'),
(10495, 'en-US', '<p>Great news for all Rust fans! Developer Alistair has confirmed plans to add a character editor in the future.</p><br/><p> In his post, Alistair shared information about a long-term project that includes updating the game\'s character model, animations, and addressing key issues with player models.</p><br/><p> Once this project is complete, the developers will begin to consider adding a character editor so that players can customize their characters\' appearance as they see fit.</p><br/><p> But like all major projects, these updates take time and careful development. Alistair says that the release is planned for 2025 only, to ensure high quality and full compliance with player expectations.</p><br/><p> The addition of a character editor to Rust will open up new possibilities for creativity and individuality for players, allowing them to create unique characters that reflect their own style and preferences.</p><br/><p> The future of Rust looks exciting and we can\'t wait to fully embody our characters and immerse ourselves in this incredible world.</p>'),
(10496, 'en-US', 'Metal detector in Rust: a new means of searching for loot'),
(10497, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new metal detector in Rust and its ability to find loot'),
(10498, 'en-US', 'metal detector in Rust, loot search in the game, new Rust update, metal detector in Rust'),
(10499, 'en-US', '<p>A new and exciting tool is coming to the world of Rust - the metal detector! Recently developed, this device will allow players to search and find loot using electromagnetic waves.</p><br/><br/><p> :dotred1: Photos of the new metal detector have already appeared online, causing great interest among fans of the game. However, details about what kind of loot can be found with the metal detector and how to craft it remain a mystery for now. But the developers promise to implement this tool in the next update, scheduled for February.</p><br/><br/><p> Unofficial sources have revealed other interesting information. It is reported that the game Rust will receive a mobile version, and its announcement is planned for the end of this year. This will open up new opportunities for players who will be able to enjoy survival in the world of Rust on mobile devices.</p><br/><br/><p> Additionally, the annual Trust in Rust 2024 tournament has begun and will run from January 13 to January 21. This tournament will also see the activation of a new round of Twitch Drops, giving players the chance to earn exclusive rewards.</p><br/><br/><p> All this news indicates that the game Rust continues to develop and please its fans. Let\'s wait for the update and new opportunities that the metal detector and other innovations will bring to the world of survival in Rust!</p>'),
(10500, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Updated Collection of Stylish Looks'),
(10501, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust delight players with a new collection of stylish skins. Review of the update and features of the new collection.'),
(10502, 'en-US', 'new skins, updated collection, Rust, stylish images'),
(10503, 'en-US', '<p>New Skins in Rust: Updated Collection of Stylish Looks</p><br/><p> The developers of the game Rust continue to delight their players with amazing updates! Today we are pleased to announce that a new collection of skins has been released, which will give your character uniqueness and style.</p><br/><p> The updated collection offers a wide variety of skins, from weapons and protective gear to clothing and accessories. The new skins feature bright colors, interesting patterns and details, making your character truly unique.</p><br/><p> One of the key benefits of this skin collection is the large selection. No matter what style you prefer or what weapons you use, you will definitely find something in the new collection that will suit you.</p><br/><p> In addition, the developers are constantly updating the collection, adding new skins and responding to the wishes of the community. This way, you will always be aware of the latest trends and will be able to give your character a special personality.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget that new skins will not only improve the visual perception of the game, but can also give you an advantage in the gameplay. Some skins can provide additional bonuses or have special effects, which makes them even more attractive to players.</p><br/><p> If you want to update your appearance in the game Rust and express your individuality, then the new collection of skins is the perfect solution for you. Visit the skin store and choose what you like!</p>'),
(10504, 'en-US', 'New backpacks in the game Rust: large and small, recipes and features'),
(10505, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new backpacks in the game Rust - large and small, learn the recipes and features of these items. Stay up to date with the latest news about updates to the game Rust.'),
(10506, 'en-US', 'game Rust, backpacks, craft, test branch, updates, game news'),
(10507, 'en-US', 'New backpacks in the game Rust: large and small, recipes and features<br/><br/> New backpacks have appeared on the test branch of the game Rust - a large and a small one. Want to know how to craft them and what their features are? Keep reading!<br/><br/> <b>Small backpack</b><br/><br/> The small backpack has a capacity of 12 slots and to create it you will need:<br/><br/> - 5 sewing kits<br/> - 50 fabrics<br/><br/> <b>Large backpack</b><br/><br/> The Large Backpack holds up to 30 slots, but does not yet have a specific recipe for crafting.<br/><br/> It is important to note that these backpacks are in the testing phase and may be subject to change by the time they are released on the main servers.<br/><br/> Stay up to date with the latest Rust game updates and follow the news!'),
(10508, 'en-US', 'Steam Auth Timeout Error: How to Fix Problems Connecting to Rust Servers'),
(10509, 'en-US', 'Learn how to deal with the Steam Auth Timeout error and problems connecting to Rust game servers with our helpful tips.'),
(10510, 'en-US', 'Steam Auth Timeout error, problems connecting to Rust servers, Steam Auth Timeout solution, Rust game'),
(10511, 'en-US', '<p>If you are playing Rust and are facing the Steam Auth Timeout error, which is having trouble connecting to the servers, don\'t worry. In this article, we will tell you how to deal with this problem.</p><br/><p> The Rust development team, Fasepunch, commented on the bug:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> They are aware of a large number of Steam authentication timeout errors that are impacting connections to Rust servers.</li><br/><li> This is a Steam-related issue and is not the responsibility of the Rust developers. They hope to see it resolved soon.</li><br/><li> The Rust developers apologize for the inconvenience.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> In this regard, we offer several solutions that may help you deal with the Steam Auth Timeout issue:</p><br/><ol><br/><li> Restart the game and Steam. Sometimes a simple restart can solve the problem.</li><br/><li> Check for updates to Rust and Steam. Installing the latest software may fix the error.</li><br/><li> Make sure your internet connection is stable. Check your connection speed and try connecting to other servers.</li><br/><li> Temporarily disable your antivirus and firewall software. Sometimes they can block the connection to Rust servers.</li><br/><li> Please contact Steam Support or the Rust developers for further assistance. They may be able to offer tailored advice on how to resolve the issue.</li><br/></ol><br/><p> We hope these tips will help you deal with the Steam Auth Timeout error and enjoy playing Rust without any problems connecting to servers. Happy gaming!</p>'),
(10512, 'en-US', 'Metal Detector in Rust: What awaits us in the February update?'),
(10513, 'en-US', 'According to the latest development branch changes, the Metal Detector is expected to appear in the February update of Rust. Find out more about this new feature.'),
(10514, 'en-US', 'metal detector, Rust, update, game, development'),
(10515, 'en-US', 'Judging by everything, the metal detector is ALWAYS there!<br/><br/> For the last two months, the development branch has occasionally seen files /main/metaldetector, but for the last two days, developer commits have been pouring in.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Here are some examples of them:<br/><br/> Metal detector:<br/><br/> - update of prefabricated elements<br/> - virtual machine setup<br/> - animation of the virtual machine filler<br/> - updated models and materials<br/> - 3D filler animation<br/> - override controller<br/> - setting up a prefabricated model of the world model<br/> - added scanBlend parameter to metal detector animation<br/> - install scanBlend from code<br/> - reworked some placeholder code so it can be easily removed once the animation is fully set up.<br/> - added scan close clip<br/> - blendtree setting in animator to switch between scan far and scan close, hooked to use scanBlend parameter<br/> - removed exit time when entering scanning<br/> - animation updates, transitions, animation controller setup<br/> - Changed the sweet spot detection range to be softer. Check the player\'s sanity to mark the distance<br/> - a little cleaning.<br/><br/> It seems that the metal detector is just around the corner and perhaps the February update will please us with it!'),
(10516, 'en-US', 'January Devblog Surviving a Decade'),
(10517, 'en-US', 'January\'s \"Surviving a Decade\" Devblog - updates and fixes for Rust on Steam. The article also mentions hJune\'s participation in the Trust in Rust tournament and upcoming Twitch Drops skins.'),
(10518, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, Devblog, update, game, Steam, improvements, fixes, tournament, Trust in Rust, skins, Twitch Drops, cancer'),
(10519, 'en-US', 'January Devblog Surviving a Decade:<br/> Unfortunately this month was not rich in updates, but we will tell you what exactly was changed.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Improved:<br/><br/> ᅠVarious improvements to the behavior and performance of new server ragdolls models.<br/><br/> :dotred1: Fixed:<br/><br/> ᅠFixed dropped items sometimes falling through the cargo ship.<br/><br/> ᅠ Fixed bugged corpses where players were killed while in the back of a helicopter and the corpse would drop.<br/><br/> ᅠFixed a bug where submarines could fire torpedoes through very thin walls if they were standing directly in front of them.<br/><br/> And our data was confirmed!<br/><br/> We are pleased to announce that hJune has teamed up with Rustoria again for the next Trust in Rust tournament on Saturday, January 13th (running until January 20th). This year, Trust in Rust will be raising money for cancer research.<br/> Upcoming Twitch Skin Drops (See Appendix 1)<br/><br/> The following skins will be available for purchase in the in-game store (all proceeds will also go towards cancer research) (see Appendix 2)'),
(10520, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam is delighting players with a new batch of skins that allow them to decorate items and express their style in the game world. Learn more about the importance of balancing and the visual stimuli that new skins can add to Rust.'),
(10521, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust game on Steam, updates, game balance, game world, visual stimuli, appearance, personality, Rust, Steam'),
(10522, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam continues to delight its players with new features and updates. Not long ago, another batch of skins was released, which will add a fresh breeze to the game world. These skins will allow you to decorate your items and show off your style.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins brings variety to the appearance of your weapons, tools, armor and other items in the game. You will be able to choose the most suitable skin for each of them and create a unique image that distinguishes you from other players.</p><br/><p> Each new skin undergoes thorough testing and balancing before being added to the game. The developers pay special attention to maintaining the game balance and the level of game mechanics so that new skins do not introduce imbalance and do not violate the basic principles of the game. Therefore, players can be sure that the skins they choose will not only be stylish, but also balanced in terms of gaming capabilities.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that new skins can increase your engagement and enjoyment of the game. They can add new visual stimuli that will help you dive deeper into the Rust game world. When you see that your character or your weapon looks cool and stylish, it can be an additional motivation for you to continue playing and achieve new goals.</p><br/><p> It is also worth noting that new skins can have both positive and negative sides. Some players may want to get all the new skins and spend more time and money on the game. At the same time, having a large number of skins can dilute the gaming experience and make it feel like players are too focused on the appearance and not on the game itself.</p><br/><p> Despite this, new skins in the game Rust on Steam are an important part of the gameplay. They allow players to express their individuality and creativity in the game, and also support the developers in the further development and support of the game.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to purchase new skins and upgrade your gaming equipment in Rust on Steam. Improve your gaming experience and show your style to the entire gaming community!</p>'),
(10523, 'en-US', 'This week\'s new skins are now available!'),
(10524, 'en-US', 'Find out all about the new Rust skins available this week. Check out the updates, prices, and balance, and pick a unique style for your character.'),
(10525, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust, Steam, game universe, updates, visual effects, design, selection, experience, prices, balance, wardrobe, battlefield'),
(10526, 'en-US', 'Rust fans are in for a treat - a new skin collection is already on the shelves on Steam! Find out about the latest updates and exciting new items available this week. Get ready to dive into an exciting game universe with improved visuals and intuitive design elements. Our experts\' review will help you make a choice and immerse yourself in a unique gaming experience. We will also consider the factors affecting the prices and balance of skins in the Rust game. Don\'t miss the chance to update your virtual wardrobe and stand out on the battlefield!'),
(10527, 'en-US', 'Check out the new skins available in Rust on Steam. Upgrade your gaming experience with this week\'s cool skins!'),
(10528, 'en-US', 'New Skins, Rust, Steam, Game Experience, In-Game Store'),
(10529, 'en-US', '<p>Hooray! A new week has begun, and with it come new skins for the game Rust on Steam!</p><br/><p> We\'ve put together a list of the latest additions to the skins that are now available in the game. What are these skins and why might they interest you?</p><br/><ul><br/><li> First on the list is the classic weapon skin - \"Rusty Demon\". It attracts attention with its unique design made of wood and rusty metal. This skin decorates your weapon so that it will become truly terrifying to your enemies.</li><br/><li> Next on the list is an exclusive armor skin - \"Sea Conqueror\". It is a set of armor painted in a deep blue color with a scattering of white stars. This skin not only looks great, but also adds a little armor to the owner from bullets and shrapnel.</li><br/><li> From the transport category, we have a new helicopter skin - \"Fire Dragon\". This skin not only transforms your helicopter into the legendary dragon, but also adds some visual effects of fire when moving. Become a true ruler of the skies in the game Rust!</li><br/></ul><br/><p> How do you get these skins? They are available for purchase in the in-game store for game currency.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to update the look of your gaming experience with this week\'s new skins in Rust!</p>'),
(10530, 'en-US', 'New round of Twitch drops - Twitchmas with New Year skins'),
(10531, 'en-US', 'Participate in the 27th round of Twitch drops - Twitchmas and get 4 new New Year skins for the game Rust. Just watch broadcasts on Twitch and add new skins to your wardrobe!'),
(10532, 'en-US', 'Round 27 Twitch drops, Twitchmas, New Year skins, Rust game, Twitch broadcasts'),
(10533, 'en-US', '<p>Friends, attention! The 27th round of Twitch drops - Twitchmas has already begun, which brings with it a whole portion of New Year\'s magic!</p><br/><p> In this round you will be able to get 4 new New Year skins that will decorate your gameplay in the game Rust. Don\'t miss your chance!</p><br/><p> These holiday skins are available in Twitch drops, meaning you can get them just by watching Rust streams on Twitch. Just participate in a round of Twitch drops and you are guaranteed to get holiday skins!</p><br/><p> Stay tuned to the stream as every minute increases your chances of getting these exclusive skins. Also, be sure to check your inventory after the stream ends to make sure the skins have been successfully added to your collection.</p><br/><p> Take part in the 27th round of Twitch drops - Twitchmas and update your wardrobe with New Year\'s skins for the game Rust!</p>'),
(10534, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust - refresh your gaming experience!'),
(10535, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of skins in Rust that will help you refresh your gaming experience and give your game a new look.'),
(10536, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, character customization, refreshing gaming experience'),
(10537, 'en-US', '<p>Rust players on Steam can rejoice, as a fresh batch of skins has hit the market!</p><br/><br/><p> Rust is an exciting survival game where players build their bases, fight for resources and survive in the harsh conditions of a post-apocalyptic world. The game offers the ability to personalize your character and base with unique skins that make the gaming experience even more interesting and varied.</p><br/><br/><p> Each new batch of skins is an opportunity for players to update their collection and give their character and weapons a unique look. In this batch of skins, you will find a wide variety of options from clothing and weapons to interior items for your base. These new skins will add a fresh look to your character and help you stand out from other players.</p><br/><br/><p> It is also worth noting that the skins batch includes both paid and free options. Free skins can be obtained by completing certain tasks in the game or participating in special events. And paid skins are offered for a small amount of money and are available for purchase in the Steam store.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget that skins in the Rust game are not only a decoration, but also a way to support the developers. When you buy paid skins, you also contribute to the development of the game and help the creators continue to add new features and content.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to refresh your gaming experience, update your collection of skins in the game Rust and surprise your opponents with a unique look!</p>'),
(10538, 'en-US', 'We are pleased to inform you about current/upcoming news'),
(10539, 'en-US', 'Find out about current/upcoming Rust news, including the Steam Winter Sale, a holiday event with gingerbread houses and Twitch skin drops, as well as a list of fixes and changes.'),
(10540, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, updates, winter sale, holiday event, skins, changes'),
(10541, 'en-US', 'We are pleased to inform you about current/upcoming news:<br/><br/> :dotred1: Winter sale has already started on Steam!<br/><br/> At the moment you can buy Rust with a discount for 550 rubles. The promotion will last until December 21. (see screenshot 1)<br/><br/><br/> :dotred1: This Saturday there will be a patch that will include a holiday event!<br/><br/> All servers will be decorated with gingerbread houses with portals, decorations on monuments, an advent calendar, Santa, gifts and other Christmas content. In addition, a free gingerbread skin for wooden buildings will be added for the duration of the event. (see screenshot 2)<br/><br/><br/> :dotred1: Also with the release of the patch - the winter round of drops with four thematic skins will begin.<br/><br/> All Rust Twitchmas skins that will be available as Twitch Drops! (see screenshot 3)<br/><br/> CHANGELOG<br/><br/> :dot: Fixed skinning knife not dropping player heads.<br/><br/> :dot: Fixed incorrect repair costs where some items were too cheap to repair.<br/><br/> :dot: Fixed grenade throws.<br/><br/> :dot: Fixed team markers remaining on the map if the player reconnected to a different server.<br/><br/> :dot: Increased boat weight, resulting in reduced lightness effect (stats updated to match current behavior)'),
(10542, 'en-US', 'New collaboration with @youtooz x @playrust - decorative figures are now available in the game!'),
(10543, 'en-US', 'Unique decorative figures related to the game Rust are now available for order as part of a new collaboration with Youtooz and Playrust. Decorate your gaming base or your workspace with these unique items and highlight your attachment to the world of Rust!'),
(10544, 'en-US', 'collaboration, youtooz, playrust, figurines, decor, order, collection, Rust'),
(10545, 'en-US', '<p>We have great news for all fans of the game Rust! We recently announced our new collaboration with @youtooz and @playrust.</p><br/><br/><p> As part of this collaboration, we present you with a unique opportunity to purchase decorative figures related to the Rust game and add them to your collection.</p><br/><br/><p> Now you can decorate your gaming base or your workspace with these unique Rust-themed figures. They will be a great addition and decoration for your gaming adventures.</p><br/><br/><p> To find out more about the available figures and to place an order, visit <a href=\"https://youtooz.com/products/hazmat\">the Youtooz website</a> .</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to get these unique items and show everyone that you are a true fan of the Rust game!</p>'),
(10546, 'en-US', 'How to get a computer station: a detailed guide'),
(10547, 'en-US', 'Want to get a computer station in the game Rust? In our guide, we will tell you in detail how to do this, starting from linking an account and ending with activating a promo code.'),
(10548, 'en-US', 'guide, computer station, Rust, subscription, Twitch, Qiwi, activation'),
(10549, 'en-US', '<p>Want to get a computer station in the game Rust, but don\'t know where to start? We have prepared a detailed guide for you that will help you get the desired item.</p><br/><p> Here\'s what you need to do:</p><br/><ol><br/><li> First, link your Steam account to Twitch by following this <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/settings/connections\">link</a> .</li><br/><li> Then find a streamer who is streaming Rust in the <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/directory/category/rust\">Rust</a> section.</li><br/><li> Subscribe to a streamer to gift them a subscription. Select 2 subscriptions.</li><br/><li> Pay for subscriptions. We recommend using the Qiwi payment system, the cost of subscriptions will be 260 rubles.</li><br/><li> Receive the promo code that was sent to you in the message and activate it on the <a href=\"https://rust.facepunch.com/redeem/\">activation</a> page.</li><br/></ol><br/><p> Now you have a computer station in the game Rust! Enjoy the game and using the new item.</p>'),
(10550, 'en-US', 'Learn all about Twitch Skin Drops in Rust on Steam. Get exclusive rewards for your character and stand out from other players.'),
(10551, 'en-US', 'info, skin giveaways, Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam'),
(10552, 'en-US', '<p>There\'s only an hour left until Twitch Drops start! If you\'re interested in Rust on Steam, don\'t miss this chance to get exclusive skins for your character. These giveaways are very rare, so be prepared and don\'t miss the start time.</p><br/><p> Starts today at 22:00 Moscow time. Don\'t forget to prepare your Twitch account to receive your rewards on time. If you haven\'t registered on the platform yet, this is a great reason to do it now.</p><br/><p> To access the drops, simply go to https://twitch.facepunch.com and follow the on-screen instructions. It will only take a few minutes, but will allow you to get unique skins that are only available through Twitch Drops.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss this opportunity to decorate your Rust character and stand out from other players. Try to be online at the right time and get your rewards!</p>'),
(10553, 'en-US', 'New future skins (candidates) from the workshop'),
(10554, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest Rust skins coming to the workshop soon. Check out the detail, style, and originality of the designs and make an informed choice.'),
(10555, 'en-US', 'new, skins, challengers, workshop, weapons, detailing, style, game Rust, reviews');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(10556, 'en-US', 'Get ready for some amazing new skins for the game Rust! In this article, we will tell you about the freshest and trendiest skins that will soon appear in the workshop. Find out which items and weapons can become part of your arsenal and add brightness to the gameplay. We carefully studied all the presented designs and prepared detailed reviews so that you can make a calculated choice. You will have to evaluate the level of detail, originality and consistency of style of these skins. Do not miss the opportunity to be one of the first lucky owners of unique items!'),
(10557, 'en-US', 'Happy 10th Anniversary Rust!'),
(10558, 'en-US', 'In this article, we celebrate the 10th anniversary of the iconic game Rust and talk about its development over the years. Find out how the game continues to attract and delight millions of gamers around the world, and how the developers continue to improve and update the project. Don\'t miss the celebratory video from the official Rust YouTube channel!'),
(10559, 'en-US', 'Rust, tenth anniversary, online game, survival, updates, developers'),
(10560, 'en-US', 'Ten years ago, on December 8, 2013, one of the most popular and successful games in the survival genre, Rust, was released. And today we celebrate the long-awaited tenth anniversary of this cult game!<br/><br/> Rust is a massively multiplayer online game that asks tough questions about survival and adaptation in a harsh, unforgiving world. Players must survive on a deserted island with very limited resources, fight hunger, cold and danger, overcome obstacles and fight other players in a constant struggle for survival.<br/><br/> Over the ten years of its existence, the game Rust has not only won the hearts of millions of gamers around the world, but also continues to actively develop and update. The developers regularly release updates, add new functionalities, improve graphics and optimize the game\'s performance. Taking the project to a new level, they do everything possible to satisfy the demands and needs of their active and devoted audience.<br/><br/> With Rust\'s 10th anniversary, the developers have prepared special celebratory content and surprises for all players. In honor of this significant moment, a video was published on the game\'s official YouTube channel, which tells the story of Rust\'s development and achievements over the years. We invite you to watch this interesting video to learn more about Rust\'s journey from its launch to today:<br/><br/> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y95DhDZgjhs\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y95DhDZgjhs</a>'),
(10561, 'en-US', 'The unique look and the ability to purchase new skins in the game Rust will give your gaming collection a fresh look. Get all the benefits of a new batch of skins and free shelters to improve your gaming experience.'),
(10562, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, Steam, survival simulator, game collection, unique appearance, individuality, shelters, developers, gameplay'),
(10563, 'en-US', 'Welcome to our site dedicated to the game Rust on Steam! We are pleased to announce that a new batch of skins for your favorite survival simulator has been released. This exclusive content will add a special charm to your game collection and help you stand out from other players.'),
(10564, 'en-US', 'Information about the skin \"LEGACY FURNACE\" in the game Rust'),
(10565, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new \"LEGACY FURNACE\" skin in Rust, which you can get after 3 hours of play.'),
(10566, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, Rust skins, Legacy Furnace, Rust update'),
(10567, 'en-US', '<p>The new update to the game Rust, dedicated to its 10th anniversary, promises an interesting bonus opportunity for all players.</p><br/><p> With the start of today\'s update at 22:00, you will be able to automatically receive the \"LEGACY FURNACE\" skin in your Steam inventory, but there is one condition. To receive this skin, you will need to play Rust for at least 3 hours.</p><br/><p> \"LEGACY FURNACE\" is a unique skin that will help you decorate your stove in the game. It will become not only a functional element of your gameplay, but also an aesthetic decoration. After all, who said that you can\'t have a stylish stove in your base?</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on this exclusive skin. All you have to do is play Rust for 3 hours after the update. So let the gaming marathon begin!</p>'),
(10568, 'en-US', 'In December, the game RUST turns 10 years old'),
(10569, 'en-US', 'RUST turns 10 in December. Find out what awaits players in the next update: new items, gameplay improvements, Twitch tournaments and much more.'),
(10570, 'en-US', 'RUST, update, December, game, Twitch, skins, items, radiation'),
(10571, 'en-US', 'In December, the game RUST turns 10 years old<br/><br/> :tochka: We present you with a brief overview of what awaits us in the next update (for more details on each item, see the feed above:arrowup: )<br/> :toch: Developers changed the model of the box from the helicopter<br/> :toch:A wounded player who is lying down can be raised with a bandage<br/> :toch:New colors have been added to the pipes<br/> :toch:New brushes and functionality will be added to the drawing panel<br/> :toch:Water sprinklers have become more efficient in using water<br/> :toch:New items from Legacy will appear in the game - Shelter, stove, bow and shotgun \"M4\" (I want to believe that for free)<br/> :toch:There will be 2 tournaments in the nearest Twitch: Twitch Rivals and New Year\'s Fast (from December 11 to 15 and from December 16 to 31)<br/> :toch:A unique skin will be added to the computer station (information on how to get it will be later)<br/> :toch:They will return the 2018 Hapis (though for 2-3 months)<br/> :toch:Radiation will be turned on at oil rigs<br/> :toch:The despawn time of some items will be increased<br/> :toch:A new trophy will be added for the nearest Twitch<br/> :toch:Skins will be added for building from wood, Frontier and Gingerbread Wood<br/> :tochka:December promises to be eventful. :tochka:'),
(10572, 'en-US', 'Good news from our team!'),
(10573, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news from the world of Rust and take part in our anniversary giveaway! Over 3,000 subscribed Discord servers are already enjoying our latest content!'),
(10574, 'en-US', 'news, Rust, Discord, subscribers, community, giveaway'),
(10575, 'en-US', '<p>Hello, dear readers! We are proud to announce that we have reached a new milestone - our news is now subscribed to by more than 3,000 Discord servers! This means that we will be able to continue to delight you with fresh and relevant materials about the game Rust.</p><br/><p> And that\'s not all, as our community has seen amazing growth - over 40,000 members! And we don\'t want to miss the opportunity to celebrate this significant milestone with you. We are excited to announce the launch of our anniversary giveaway, in which everyone can participate. Find out all the details in our community!</p>'),
(10576, 'en-US', 'Confetti Cannon and Pinata Review'),
(10577, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will review the new confetti cannon and piñata in Rust. Learn about its unique features, visual design, and gameplay mechanics.'),
(10578, 'en-US', 'review, gun, confetti, pinata, Rust, game'),
(10579, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we will review the new confetti cannon and piñata in the game Rust. This unique and colorful cannon will bring even more fun and joy to the game world.</p><br/><p> The Confetti and Pinata Cannon is a new weapon added in the latest update to Rust. With it, players can not only damage their opponents, but also create a magnificent show of colorful confetti and exploding pinatas.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that the confetti and piñata cannon is not only visually appealing, but also highly effective in combat. It is capable of causing significant damage and hitting a large area. In addition, with the help of special modifications, players can enhance its characteristics and make it even more deadly.</p><br/><p> The Confetti Cannon and Piñata also feature interesting gameplay mechanics. When fired, it creates a cloud of confetti that can temporarily blind opponents and make it difficult for them to see. Additionally, the Piñatas can explode, causing additional damage and causing even more chaos on the battlefield.</p><br/><p> As for the availability of the confetti cannon and piñata, it can be crafted in-game or purchased from other players. This means that every player has the opportunity to obtain and try out this unique cannon.</p><br/><p> In conclusion, the Confetti and Piñata Cannon adds a new dose of fun and variety to the Rust game. Its bright design, high efficiency and unique game mechanics make it an attractive option for all players. Don’t miss the opportunity to try this bright and cheerful cannon during your adventures in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(10580, 'en-US', 'All the Rust Twitchmas skins that will be available as Twitch Drops!'),
(10581, 'en-US', 'Unique Rust Twitchmas skins will be available via Twitch Drops from December 16th to December 31st, adding some festive spirit and uniqueness to your Rust in-game collection.'),
(10582, 'en-US', 'Rust Twitchmas skins, Twitch Drops, Rust, Twitchmas event, Christmas skins, Twitch, streams, holiday spirit'),
(10583, 'en-US', 'Over the Christmas period, Rust will be getting unique skins that can be earned by watching streams on Twitch! Twitch Drops are a special promotion that gives players the opportunity to get exclusive items just by watching their favorite streamers. And from December 16th to December 31st, you can get unique Rust Twitchmas skins!<br/><br/> Twitchmas is a limited event that only takes place during the Christmas season. This year, the Rust developers have prepared some great new skins for us that will turn your game collection into a real Christmas miracle. They will liven up your game experience by adding a bit of holiday spirit and uniqueness.<br/><br/> To get these skins, you just need to activate the Twitch Drops feature on your Rust account and start watching channels participating in the Rust Twitchmas event. Each skin will be available for a certain period of time, so keep an eye on the streams and don’t miss out on the opportunity to get your favorite items.<br/><br/> In addition to their visual appeal, Rust Twitchmas skins also have a functional advantage. They can improve the stats of your weapons or protective gear, help you stand out from other players, and create a unique playstyle. Be careful and analyze each skin to choose the one that best suits your playstyle and strategy.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to celebrate Christmas in Rust with Twitch Drops and unique Rust Twitchmas skins. Head over to Twitch, watch streams, and treat yourself to real-life gaming gifts this holiday season!'),
(10584, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: review and details'),
(10585, 'en-US', 'Learn more about the new batch of skins in Rust: overview, impact on gameplay, and important aspects related to balancing and variety.'),
(10586, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, review, details, individuality, visual effects, balance, variety, optimization'),
(10587, 'en-US', '<p>Rust recently released a new batch of skins that brought new features and customization options for your character and items. In this article, we\'ll take a closer look at these new additions and how they impact gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> Stylization and individuality of game characters has become an important component in modern online games, and Rust is no exception. New skins provide players with a wide range of variations in the appearance of weapons, clothing and other items. Each skin is designed with love for detail and is unique in its own way.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main advantages of the new batch of skins is the ability to stand out among other players, emphasize your individuality and style. As you know, in Rust, communication with other players plays an important role, and standing out from the rest is not only pleasant, but also useful for communication and interaction.</p><br/><br/><p> Equally important is the impact of skins on gameplay. Some skins can make changes to visual and sound effects, which can affect the perception of the game and the impressions of it. Also, some skins can have advantages in battles for territories or when completing certain tasks.</p><br/><br/><p> However, it is worth noting that the introduction of new skins always comes with compromises. Some players believe that skins can affect the balance of the game and give an advantage to players who have spent more time or money on acquiring skins. Others fear that a large number of available skins can negatively affect the optimization of the game and performance.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins in Rust is not only an opportunity to show individuality and diversify the gameplay, but also a subject of discussion and a basis for debate among players and developers. It is important to take into account the opinions and preferences of the community, as well as to find a balance between the diversity of skins and their impact on the game mechanics.</p>'),
(10588, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Items Disappearing from Crates'),
(10589, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust, which introduces item despawns from crates, changing the dynamics and tactics of the game.'),
(10590, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, items disappearing from crates, crates with timers, tactical approach, new dynamics'),
(10591, 'en-US', '<p>One of the most anticipated updates to Rust is here! Now, if you successfully retrieve at least one item from a timed crate, it will disappear from the map. This means that every player will have the opportunity to collect only the best and most valuable items from these crates.</p><br/><p> This change will introduce a new dynamic to the gameplay. Previously, players could simply open crates and select only valuable items, leaving the rest. Now, each decision to open a crate will be accompanied by responsibility for the choice and loss of items.</p><br/><p> In addition, taking into account the disappearance of items from the map after their removal from crates will allow for a more accurate balance of chances and risks for players. Rare and valuable items will become even more valuable, and the choice between opening a crate and leaving it may be difficult and important.</p><br/><p> This update allows for a tactical approach to opening crates and making decisions in the game. It also creates new opportunities for interaction between players and adds a level of intrigue and excitement to the gameplay. Be careful when choosing which loot to keep and which to take for yourself!</p>'),
(10592, 'en-US', 'Review of Shelter from Legacy'),
(10593, 'en-US', 'Review of Shelter from Legacy: characteristics and features of crafting in the game Rust.'),
(10594, 'en-US', 'Overview, Shelter, Legacy, Rust, characteristics, crafting'),
(10595, 'en-US', '<h2>Review of Shelter from Legacy</h2><br/><p> Work on implementing Shelter from Legacy into the Rust game is in full swing, and we will soon be able to see it in action.</p><br/><p> Shelter characteristics:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Crafted from 250 wood.</li><br/><li> Crafting time is 1 minute.</li><br/><li> The shelter and the door have the same XP level.</li><br/><li> You cannot shoot through cracks or interact with objects from the inside.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> It is important to note that there may be changes to the Legacy Shelter\'s stats before its final release.</p>'),
(10596, 'en-US', 'Good news: Turrets in Rust will retain their functionality through chain link fencing'),
(10597, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about updates in the game Rust: the developers decided to keep the functionality of turrets through the chain-link fence. Find out how this will affect your base and defense against enemies.'),
(10598, 'en-US', 'Good news, turrets, nerf, functionality, mesh fence, Rust, developers, base, guests, update'),
(10599, 'en-US', 'Yo, Rust fans! We have good news for you. The game developers have decided to make an important decision regarding turrets. Previously, they were going to nerf these powerful weapons, but now everything has changed! Turrets will continue to shoot and aim through the chain-link fence, capturing enemies from a distance. This means that you will be able to effectively defend your base from uninvited guests without losing the ability to actively interact with the game world. This is really great news for all Rust fans, right? By the way, do not forget to update to the latest version of the game to enjoy all the new features that the developers provide you with.'),
(10600, 'en-US', 'Skins for the new Twitch Drops in Rust: Event from December 11th to 15th'),
(10601, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Rust skins available through the Twitch Drops event from December 11th to December 15th. Update the look of your in-game items with unique skins.'),
(10602, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust Game, Twitch Drops, Skins, Event, December 11-15'),
(10603, 'en-US', '<p>Rust will be hosting a new Twitch Drops event from December 11th to 15th. This event will offer players the chance to earn unique skins for their items.</p><br/><p> During the specified time period, players will be able to get various skins that will be distributed through the Twitch platform. Simply link your Twitch account to your Rust account, activate Twitch Drops, and receive skins automatically in the game.</p><br/><p> The skins available during this event will differ from those available in other game modes. Players will be offered a wide range of skins for weapons, clothing, and other items.</p><br/><p> Interested players should keep an eye on the official Rust and Twitch channels for event announcements, where full details on the skins available and how to obtain them will be posted.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to update the look of your Rust items with new unique skins available as part of the Twitch Drops event from December 11th to 15th.</p>'),
(10604, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Turrets Can No Longer Shoot Through Chain Link Fences'),
(10605, 'en-US', 'Rust update fixes issue with turrets shooting through chain link fences. Find out how this news will impact game balance and base defense.'),
(10606, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, turrets, chain link fence, bases, balance, game mechanics, developers, updates, gaming community'),
(10607, 'en-US', '<p>The long-awaited update to the Rust game brings good news for all players! Turrets will no longer be able to deal damage through the mesh fence.</p><br/><p> If you\'ve ever been the victim of hidden turrets that shoot through a secure fence, this news will definitely please you. Base owners will now be able to feel more secure and can be sure that their property is not being subjected to unnecessary destruction due to this issue.</p><br/><p> The game developers decided to make this important balancing aspect to improve the overall game mechanics and fairness in battles. Now players can build protective walls from a chain-link fence with confidence in their reliability.</p><br/><p> Rust is constantly being updated and improved thanks to player feedback and the developers\' desire to make the game as fun and balanced as possible. This update is a great example of how players actively contribute to the development of the game, helping the creators do their work even better.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to install the latest Rust update and enjoy the new features and improvements that the developers have prepared for you! Present your strategies, build impregnable bases and win brutal battles in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(10608, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Exciting Customization Options!'),
(10609, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new batch of exciting skins that will help you stand out and add unique style to your character and items in the game. Visit the Rust Steam Store to discover new customization options in Rust!'),
(10610, 'en-US', 'Rust skins, new Rust skins, Rust game, Rust skins update, Rust shop, Rust customization'),
(10611, 'en-US', 'The world of Rust has received a new batch of exciting skins, specially designed to decorate your character and items in the game. These new skins offer a wide range of variations that will help you stand out in the dusty expanses of Rust and add a unique style to your gameplay.<br/><br/> Each new batch of skins in Rust offers fresh, exciting ideas that will allow you to express your individuality. From weapons to clothing, from building materials to interior items, new skins allow you to turn your wildest fantasies into reality.<br/><br/> The distinctive feature of the new skins is their highest quality of execution and detail. Each texture and design of the bodies, barrels, magazines and butts of weapons, as well as clothing, including helmets, body armor, pants and shoes, were carefully worked out and reproduced with great attention to detail.<br/><br/> New skins not only make your character exclusive, but also affect your game tactics. They can inspire fear or emphasize your belonging to a clan or group, and also motivate you to new exploits and achievements in the game.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your wardrobe in Rust and add unique items to your game collection. Visit the Rust store on Steam and discover new skin options that will allow you to transform your gaming experience and stand out among thousands of players around the world!'),
(10612, 'en-US', 'Steam\'s Autumn Sale Has Begun With Great Discounts'),
(10613, 'en-US', 'Steam has launched its autumn sale with great discounts on games and DLC. Buy your favorite games at affordable prices!'),
(10614, 'en-US', 'Steam, Autumn Sale, Discounts, Games, DLC, Purchase'),
(10615, 'en-US', 'The long-awaited autumn sale has begun on Steam, where incredible discounts on games and DLC await you! If you haven\'t purchased your desired game or add-on yet, now is the time to make a profitable purchase. Get ready for incredible adventures and exciting gameplay at an affordable price. Don\'t miss the chance to update your game collection and dive into the amazing world of entertainment!'),
(10616, 'en-US', 'New Hazmat Skins as Part of Twitch Drops in Rust on Steam'),
(10617, 'en-US', 'Check out the new exclusive Hazmat skins as part of Twitch Drops in Rust on Steam.'),
(10618, 'en-US', 'new skins, hazmat, twitch drops, rust game, steam, exclusive skins'),
(10619, 'en-US', 'As part of the new Twitch Drops round, the game Rust on Steam has introduced an opportunity to get exclusive skins for the Hazmat. This information is of great interest to players who want to diversify their collection of skins and stand out on the battlefield. In this article, we will look at the details of this new Twitch Drops round and tell you how you can get these unique skins for the Hazmat.'),
(10620, 'en-US', 'Developers Bring Back Shelters From Rust Legacy'),
(10621, 'en-US', 'The developers are bringing back shelters from Rust Legacy. Find out about the new update and the return of popular items to the game. Stay up to date with news and changes in Rust.'),
(10622, 'en-US', 'Developers, Shelters, Rust Legacy, Update, Bow, Shotgun, Furnace, News, Game'),
(10623, 'en-US', '<h2>Developers Bring Back Shelters From Rust Legacy</h2><br/><br/><p> Shelters are compact 1x1 structures that can be crafted in your inventory and placed in the game Rust. Now the developers have decided to bring back shelters from Rust Legacy so that players can use this convenient feature again.</p><br/><br/><p> The innovations are not limited to shelters. In December, the developers will also return the bow, shotgun, and furnace from Rust Legacy to the game. Thus, players will be able to experience the atmosphere and mechanics of the game in earlier versions of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> The new update is scheduled for December 7 at 22:00 Moscow time. You will be able to use the updated features and items immediately.</p><br/><br/><p> To stay up to date with all the news and updates about the game Rust, subscribe to the RUST RU news. There you will find the most up-to-date information and interesting materials about the game.</p>'),
(10624, 'en-US', 'Rust is turning 10 soon: will the 2018 Hapis server return?'),
(10625, 'en-US', 'Rust is turning 10 soon, and the developers are deciding whether to bring back the 2018 Hapis server as part of the celebration.'),
(10626, 'en-US', 'Rust, 10th Anniversary, Hapis Server, Poll, Facepunch'),
(10627, 'en-US', '<p>Rust is about to celebrate its 10th anniversary, and the developers have an interesting idea - to bring back the Hapis server, created in 2018.</p><br/><p> According to the current poll, the majority of votes are in favor of bringing this map back to the Facepunch servers.</p><br/><p> If the survey is positive, the developers plan to bring back Hapis for 2-3 months to celebrate the game\'s 10th anniversary.</p><br/><p> Will we remember the old days of the game?</p>'),
(10628, 'en-US', 'New skins in the game Rust: it\'s always fashionable to update your style!'),
(10629, 'en-US', 'Ability to update your character style in Rust with new skins on Steam. Unique and varied skins for equipment, weapons and tools that will add personality to your character.'),
(10630, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, style update, personality, visual update'),
(10631, 'en-US', '<p><br/>Rust Steam fans, rejoice! An exciting new batch of skins has arrived! Now you have even more options for personalizing your gameplay style.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> There are already a variety of skins available for your gear, weapons, and tools. No matter what role you play, we\'re sure you\'ll find something to suit your taste.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> Why not stand out from the crowd and make your character unique? After all, it is your appearance that will attract the attention of other players and demonstrate your individuality. Choose a skin for your hero and impress everyone with your style and taste.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> But of course, skins are not just for beauty. They can also give you an advantage in the game, help you hide, catch an enemy in an ambush, or create a great weapon. Your weapons will now be not only deadly, but also unique.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> However, before you start buying skins, you need to consider their cost and availability. Some skins may be rare and have a higher price, so you need to carefully choose which skins you can afford to buy.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> It is also important to remember that skins are only a visual upgrade and do not affect gameplay. In fact, they are a permanent part of the game mechanics that add variety and interest to the game.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> So what are you waiting for? Head over to the Steam store and update your gaming style with new Rust skins. Check out the wide selection and make your character truly unique!<br/></p>'),
(10632, 'en-US', 'New concept for smart farm!'),
(10633, 'en-US', 'Learn about a new concept for a smart farm in the game Rust, which offers automation and frees you from the need to constantly monitor your crops.'),
(10634, 'en-US', 'Smart farm, automation, concept, grow, harvest, farming'),
(10635, 'en-US', 'Are you tired of spending all your free time monitoring the harvest on your farm? We offer a new concept for a smart farm that will allow you to automate most of the work! From now on, you will not need to sit 24/7 near your fields - a smart farm will handle it for you. Want to know more? Read our article and let us know if you would like to see this in the game Rust!'),
(10636, 'en-US', 'Removing Barren cards from Rust'),
(10637, 'en-US', 'Barren maps, popular among players, have been removed from the game Rust. The developers explain the reasons for this decision and the player community expresses its opinion on this matter.'),
(10638, 'en-US', 'Barren maps, removal, game Rust, developers, community of players'),
(10639, 'en-US', '<p>Barren maps, which were popular among players, were removed from the game Rust. This decision caused some controversy among the player community. Barren maps were known for their desolate and lifeless atmosphere, which created a unique atmosphere of survival and many interesting game situations.</p><br/><p> However, the developers have decided to remove the Barren cards from the game to focus on improving other aspects of the gameplay. They claim that this decision will help create more engaging and diverse worlds for players.</p><br/><p> This decision has led to mixed reviews in the Rust community. Some players expressed disappointment and nostalgia for the Barren maps, while others supported the developers\' decision and hoped for more diverse and interesting maps in the future.</p><br/><p> Of course, the removal of Barren maps is one example of the trade-offs that game developers face. They have to balance various factors, such as player interest, technical limitations, and their own vision for the game and its future.</p><br/><p> In any case, the removal of Barren maps means that players will explore new worlds and experience new aspects of the Rust game. They will have the opportunity to immerse themselves in the game universe presented by the developers and enjoy new survival challenges and exciting adventures.</p>'),
(10640, 'en-US', 'Did you know that you can fit 9 barrels into a 1x1 square with walls?'),
(10641, 'en-US', 'Learn about the ability to fit 9 barrels in a 1x1 square with walls in Rust. This is valuable knowledge that will help you organize your base and increase your storage capabilities.'),
(10642, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, Steam, barrels, base, storage, strategy, tactics'),
(10643, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam constantly pleases its players with new updates. However, some small details may go unnoticed. For example, did you know that in a 1x1 square with walls installed, you can place as many as 9 barrels? This is interesting and useful knowledge that can help you in the game.</p><br/><p> Barrels are found throughout the world of Rust and are a valuable resource that can be used to store items, water, and other materials. The ability to place 9 barrels in a 1x1 square opens up new possibilities for organizing your base and increasing its storage capacity.</p><br/><p> However, it is worth considering that placing barrels in a 1x1 square can be a difficult task. You will need to correctly position the walls and calculate the distance between the barrels so that they all fit without problems. Moreover, placing barrels in narrow spaces can make them difficult to use or access.</p><br/><p> This is just one of many examples of how different aspects of Rust can affect your strategy and tactics in the game. Every update, every detail can change the way you interact with the game world and other players. Therefore, it is important to stay up to date with the latest news about Rust updates on Steam and study all aspects of the game to achieve success.</p><br/><p> So next time you start building your base or storage, take note of the ability to place 9 barrels in a 1x1 square with walls installed. This can be a valuable strategic feature that will help you survive and thrive in the world of Rust.</p>'),
(10644, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Screen Update: Cold, Heat, and Radiation Effects Toned Down'),
(10645, 'en-US', 'One of the developers is testing to mitigate the screen effect when exposed to cold, heat and radiation in the game Rust. Find out what changes await you in the latest update to the game. Now the game effects will be more pleasant for the eyes and will not interfere with enjoying the game in extreme conditions.'),
(10646, 'en-US', 'Rust, screen, softening, effect, cold, heat, radiation, gaming comfort'),
(10647, 'en-US', 'One of the developers of the game Rust is testing the mitigation of the screen effect when exposed to cold, heat and radiation. Players, especially those who often encounter extreme conditions in the world of Rust, have been waiting for this improvement for a long time. As a result of testing, the developers managed to find the optimal solution to reduce discomfort and increase gaming comfort when exposed to extreme factors.<br/><br/> Previously, when a player experienced heat or cold, or was in a radioactive zone, the effects on the screen were too intense, which caused discomfort and could distract from the gameplay. But thanks to the work of the developers, these effects have now become more pleasing to the eye and do not interfere with enjoying the game.<br/><br/> The testing varied in different conditions to ensure that the changes affected the visual perception of the game no matter how strong the external factors were. The developers listened carefully to player feedback and took all comments into account to achieve the best result.<br/><br/> New screen settings for cold, heat, and radiation will allow players to immerse themselves more deeply in the world of Rust without being distracted by unpleasant visual effects. A more comfortable gaming experience will help focus on completing tasks and allow players to enjoy the gameplay more.<br/><br/> New features related to mitigating the screen effect when exposed to cold, heat and radiation are already available in the latest update of the game Rust on Steam. Update the game to fully experience the changes and enjoy improved graphics in the most extreme conditions.'),
(10648, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust on Steam'),
(10649, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins for Rust on Steam and enhance your gaming experience with unique item skins.'),
(10650, 'en-US', 'new Rust skins, Rust skins batch, skins in Rust game, Rust skins update, Steam, Steam'),
(10651, 'en-US', 'Welcome, Rust players! We have great news for you. A new batch of skins has been released in the game Rust on Steam. Now you have the opportunity to decorate your items in the game with exclusive and stylish images. We have prepared detailed information about the new skins for you.'),
(10652, 'en-US', 'Facepunch Shuts Down Hardcore Mode Servers'),
(10653, 'en-US', 'Facepunch officially closes Hardcore servers. Developer report and overview of changes.'),
(10654, 'en-US', 'Facepunch, Hardcore, servers, closing, developers, game Rust'),
(10655, 'en-US', '<p>Facepunch is officially shutting down its Hardcore servers. The developers have admitted that they were unable to achieve the desired quality of this game mode. During its experimental period, the Facepunch team received a lot of feedback from players, which they are now committed to taking into account if they decide to return to Hardcore mode in the future.</p><br/><p> This official server shutdown is a clear signal that the developers have finally abandoned further development of this mode. Hardcore mode was introduced more than a year ago and has received only two significant updates.</p>'),
(10656, 'en-US', 'Rust\'s Base Destructibility Experiment: Hackweek Event Details'),
(10657, 'en-US', 'At Facepunch\'s Hackweek event, developer Jake Rich is experimenting with detailed base destructibility in Rust using a voxel system. Check out the details of this fun experiment and a video of increased missile destruction.'),
(10658, 'en-US', 'base destructibility, Rust game, Jake Rich, Hackweek, voxels'),
(10659, 'en-US', 'At Facepunch\'s Hackweek event, developer Jake Rich is running a fascinating experiment exploring the possibilities of detailed base destructibility in Rust. He\'s using an intriguing voxel system for this experiment. It\'s a tense and exciting event that allows developers to explore new ideas and possibilities for the game.<br/><br/> It should be noted, however, that this is just an experiment for now, conducted as part of the Hackweek event. No changes are expected to be made to Rust in the near future. But it does show how serious the developers are about exploring new technologies and features to improve the gameplay.<br/><br/> Also worth noting is that the video shown at the event showed the rockets being boosted four times to achieve maximum base destruction. This is an interesting addition that clearly demonstrates the capabilities of detailed destruction in Rust.'),
(10660, 'en-US', 'Get the latest news from the field in Rust. The developers continue to work on the clan system and add a clan points system. Find out how you can earn and lose points, and also expect new weapons and changes to weapon slots.'),
(10661, 'en-US', 'news from the field, clan system, points, murder, excavator, Bradley, TC, box, Cargo, shotgun M4, m39'),
(10662, 'en-US', '<p>Work on the clan system in Rust continues, and a clan points system will be launched soon.</p><br/><p> Clans will be awarded points for performing various actions such as:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Killing a player from another clan</li><br/><li> Starting the excavator</li><br/><li> Destruction of Bradley</li><br/><li> Destroying TC (belonging to another clan)</li><br/><li> Cracking the box</li><br/><li> Cargo Capture</li><br/></ul><br/><p> However, there will also be penalties in the form of points being deducted for killing an unarmed player and dying at the hands of a player from another clan.</p><br/><p> The release date of the new system is still unknown, but development is ongoing.</p><br/><p> Also, the attention of players is attracted by the new M4 shotgun, which is also being worked on. And the game has added a 4th slot for the M39.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to subscribe to Rust RU news to stay up to date with all the updates.</p>'),
(10663, 'en-US', 'I think all the bases look like this now'),
(10664, 'en-US', 'The Rust Steam update brings changes to base design. New base variations and styles add interest and creativity to the gameplay, but there are also some trade-offs related to playability and balance.'),
(10665, 'en-US', 'Rust game, updates, base design, variations, styles, creativity, compromises, game balance'),
(10666, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has been updated on Steam and it brings with it some major changes to base design. We can now see new variations and styles of bases that add new possibilities and interest to players.</p><br/><br/><p> The developers of the game Rust decided to make changes to the design of the bases to make them more convenient and aesthetically pleasing. New variations and styles of bases have affected the gameplay and allow players to create more creative structures.</p><br/><br/><p> The updated base designs in Rust are more functional and efficient, allowing players to navigate their bases more easily and organize the space logically, improving the gameplay experience.</p><br/><br/><p> The new base designs also add more variety and originality to the game. Players can now create unique structures that differ from other players\' bases. This creates interesting situations, as each base can now be unique and a source of admiration for other players.</p><br/><br/><p> However, with the new changes in base design, there are some trade-offs. Some players may have difficulty adjusting to the new base styles and variations, especially if they are used to the old design. Additionally, the new bases may require more resources and time to build, which may hinder player progression.</p><br/><br/><p> It is also necessary to consider the impact of changes in base design on the balance of the game. Some old tactics and strategies may need to be reworked and adapted to the new conditions. Such changes may cause resentment among some players who prefer to preserve the old ways of playing.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, the changes to base design in Rust add newness and interest to the gameplay. New variations and styles of bases allow players to be more creative and create unique structures. However, with the changes come some compromises that can affect the usability of the gameplay and the balance of the game.</p>'),
(10667, 'en-US', 'The update is out. Have a nice wipe everyone!'),
(10668, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest Rust Steam updates and wish all players a happy wipe! Enjoy new weapons, changes in game mechanics and get ready for unforgettable adventures.'),
(10669, 'en-US', 'update, wipe, Rust, Steam'),
(10670, 'en-US', '<p>Greetings from the developers to all Rust players on Steam! The latest update to the game has brought many new features and improvements that will make the gameplay even more interesting and exciting. We want to share this news with you and wish you a successful wipe!</p><br/><br/><p> One of the key updates is new weapons and equipment. New types of weapons, armor and accessories are waiting for you, which will help you overcome any obstacles on your way to victory. Be prepared for battles and meet new challenges boldly!</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, the developers focused on changing the game mechanics. Now it will be easier for you to manage your resources, build bases and develop your territories. Changes were made to the crafting system, which will allow you to produce items faster and more efficiently. Don\'t forget to follow the updates in the game to stay up to date with all the changes and improvements.</p><br/><br/><p> But most importantly - good luck with your new wipe! We hope that this update will bring you a lot of positive emotions and unforgettable gaming moments. Let your buildings be reliable, your weapons accurate, and your enemies hopelessly defeated! Don\'t forget to share your impressions with the community and enjoy the game with your friends.</p><br/><br/><p> We wish you a great wipe and unforgettable adventures in Rust on Steam!</p><br/><br/><p> <b>Link to the update video:</b> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UmtRnb-B7fM\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UmtRnb-B7fM</a></p>'),
(10671, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins in Rust on Steam. Choose the most stylish and unique designs to give your character and inventory a unique look.'),
(10672, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, designs, style, uniqueness, purchases, balance, finances, cosmetic changes'),
(10673, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for all fans of the game Rust - a new batch of skins has been released! Now you can decorate your weapons, tools, armor and other items with the most stylish and unique images.</p><br/><p> Each new batch of skins in the game Rust on the Steam platform is a set of exclusive designs created by the most talented artists. They embody a variety of styles and themes, from realistic and post-apocalyptic to cartoonish and fantastical.</p><br/><p> The addition of new skins significantly expands the possibilities for players to customize the appearance of their characters and inventory. Thanks to this, each player can create a unique image and stand out among other participants in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> New skins not only have a nice effect on the visuals of the game, but they can also increase stimulation and motivation to achieve new goals. They bring a fresh wind of change and liven up the gaming environment.</p><br/><p> However, before buying new skins, it is worth remembering the importance of balancing your finances. Some skins can have a high price, so it is important to approach your purchases wisely and take into account your own capabilities and preferences.</p><br/><p> Also, it\'s worth remembering that owning new skins doesn\'t guarantee a game advantage. They\'re just cosmetic changes that serve to express yourself and create a unique atmosphere in the Rust game.</p><br/><p> Now that you have all the information you need about the new batch of skins in the Rust game on the Steam platform, you can start choosing the most stylish designs that suit your taste. Don\'t forget to follow the updates and stay up to date with all the latest news in the world of Rust.</p>'),
(10674, 'en-US', 'GLOBAL UPDATE 2 November 22'),
(10675, 'en-US', 'New global update of the game Rust! Includes: radiation on oil rigs, boat update, automatic painting of things, changes in electricity and much more.'),
(10676, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, news, changes, global update, November 2'),
(10677, 'en-US', 'GLOBAL UPDATE November 2, 22:00 Moscow time.<br/> Includes:<br/> :tochka: Radiation on oil rigs!<br/> :toch:starts 45 minutes after the box is activated.<br/> :toch:increases to 100 radiation in 5 minutes.<br/><br/> :tochka:Boat update.<br/> :toch:Throwed items will no longer fall through the boat.<br/><br/> :tochka:Automatic painting of things<br/> :toch:Now you don\'t have to waste time manually painting each item. Just select the desired item, press the key combination Shift+H and place it on the repair table. Your item will be painted automatically.<br/><br/> :tochka:Metro update<br/> :toch:Underground and surface railways will be connected. Now you will be able to go down to the metro on different types of transport<br/><br/> :tochka:Change in electrical<br/> :toch:Having done the electrical work, you can now do something else by putting the wire in your inventory and, when you\'re done, continue from where you left off.<br/><br/> :tochka:Now you can lift the beds using a mallet.<br/> :tochka:New DLC - Frontier Base Decor Pack to decorate your base.<br/><br/> Subscribe to RUST RU news: 821212595830128690:'),
(10678, 'en-US', 'The concept of a hook-winch for moving vehicles, do you think it is necessary?'),
(10679, 'en-US', 'The article discusses the concept of a winch hook for moving vehicles and asks whether it is necessary. The potential benefits and risks are discussed, as well as the importance of considering safety, cost and environmental aspects when making a decision.'),
(10680, 'en-US', 'hook winch, transport movement, innovation, safety, cost, environmental aspects'),
(10681, 'en-US', '<p>When it comes to transport movement, the question arises: are new concepts and innovations needed?</p><br/><p> One such concept that has been hotly debated lately is the use of a winch hook to move vehicles. But is this idea worth implementing?</p><br/><p> A winch hook is a mechanism that allows you to lift and lower vehicles using a special hook and rope. This can be useful, for example, for transporting cars to great heights or over obstacles.</p><br/><p> One of the main reasons to consider using a winch hook is the potential time and resource savings. It allows you to quickly move vehicles without the need for additional personnel or special equipment.</p><br/><p> However, there are also some problems and limitations that need to be taken into account. First, safety. What measures can be taken to avoid possible accidents? How can the reliability of the winch hook be ensured and the vehicles prevented from falling?</p><br/><p> In addition, the cost factor should be taken into account. The implementation of new concepts requires investment, and this must be taken into account when deciding to implement a hook-winch for moving vehicles.</p><br/><p> Also, it is worth paying attention to environmental aspects. What impacts on the environment can the use of a winch hook have? Is it necessary to conduct further research and assess its impact on the environment?</p><br/><p> Ultimately, the decision to implement a hook winch for moving vehicles must be based on a comprehensive analysis of all factors and trade-offs. Balancing potential benefits and risks is a key aspect of making such a decision.</p><br/><p> So, the question of the necessity of the concept of a hook-winch for moving transport requires careful study and discussion. This decision should be based on the specific needs and conditions of each individual situation.</p>'),
(10682, 'en-US', 'A big missed opportunity for the Base Decor DLC'),
(10683, 'en-US', 'Find out about the big missed opportunity for the Base Decor DLC in Rust - adding a clock to the game space.'),
(10684, 'en-US', 'Big Missed Opportunity, DLC Base Decor, Rust, Rust game clock, developers, Rust updates'),
(10685, 'en-US', '<p>There is one important feature that should have been added to the Base Decor DLC for Rust, but which was unfortunately missed. You may have already noticed that Rust lacks a clock. This means that you have to constantly log in to the game to know the current time.</p><br/><p> However, despite this, the developers did not add such a simple but important feature in the Base Decor DLC. This is a huge disappointment for many players who would like to see a clock in their buildings.</p><br/><p> Being able to track time in Rust would have many practical uses. For example, you could use a clock to plan your gaming sessions, so you know when and how much time you\'ve spent playing. It would also be an indispensable tool for organizing co-op gaming events with other players, where you need to coordinate times and meet in the same place.</p><br/><p> Luckily, this problem can be solved with additional modifications developed by the Rust community. However, this requires additional time and effort from players who have already spent a lot of energy developing their bases and maintaining gameplay.</p><br/><p> All in all, this is a huge missed opportunity for the Base Decor DLC in Rust. Hopefully, the developers will listen to the players and add such a simple but important feature in future updates.</p>'),
(10686, 'en-US', 'Updated mirrors on Staging Branch'),
(10687, 'en-US', 'The Rust game update includes updated mirrors on the Staging Branch. The article tells whether it will be possible to use these updates to view bases.'),
(10688, 'en-US', 'Update, Mirrors, Staging Branch, Rust, Bases'),
(10689, 'en-US', 'A new update for Rust has been released, which has updated the mirrors on the Staging Branch. Now the question arises: will it be possible to use these updates to view bases?');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(10690, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of unique skins in Rust, offering players an original look and functional improvements. Enrich your gaming experience with new skins for weapons, tools, equipment and building elements. Stand out from other players and emphasize your individuality in Rust!'),
(10691, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust game, Rust on Steam, unique skins, weapons, tools, equipment, building elements, original look, functional improvements, skin collection, individual style'),
(10692, 'en-US', '<p>A new batch of skins has just been released in the game Rust!</p><br/><p> If you are a fan of Rust on Steam, we are happy to inform you that the developers have released a fresh batch of unique skins to diversify your gaming experience.</p><br/><p> The new skins come in a variety of categories, including weapons, tools, gear, and basic building elements, so you can give your character and the world of Rust a new, original look.</p><br/><p> Each skin in this collection is created with love for detail to offer you a wide range of styles and variations. You can choose between classic designs, modern trends and futuristic elements to highlight your individual style in the game.</p><br/><p> The new skins not only feature visual updates, but also functional improvements. Some skins offer increased durability, increased resource extraction speed, or additional bonuses to help you survive and thrive in the harsh world of Rust.</p><br/><p> Complete your skin collection or create a unique set that suits you. Choose skins that make you stand out from other players and show your individuality in Rust.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to refresh your gaming experience and spice up your journey through the world of Rust with a new batch of skins. Dive into the game with new aesthetics and functionality that have just arrived on Steam.</p>'),
(10693, 'en-US', 'Rust Decor DLC Update: Adding Mirrors'),
(10694, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update for the Rust Decor DLC - the addition of mirrors, which will give the game even more realism and variety.'),
(10695, 'en-US', 'Rust Decor DLC, adding mirrors, update, Rust game, realism, variability'),
(10696, 'en-US', 'The developers of the popular game Rust are delighting their players with a new update for the DLC Rust Decor. According to the latest news, the game will be updated with a mirror function, which will add even more realism and variability to the gameplay. In this article, we will tell you about all the details and benefits of this update.'),
(10697, 'en-US', 'New windows have appeared on the game\'s test branch'),
(10698, 'en-US', 'The Rust test branch has new windows that can be transparent or opaque. This addition offers players an interesting balance between exploration and security. Learn more about the new windows in Rust.'),
(10699, 'en-US', 'windows, Rust on Steam, Rust game updates, window transparency, security, strategy, tactics, gameplay, Gameplay Rust on Steam'),
(10700, 'en-US', 'The test branch of the game introduced a new feature - the appearance of new windows. This feature offers players a unique opportunity to look at the world around them from a new perspective. One of the key features of the new windows is that they can be transparent and allow players to observe what is happening outside the room without having to leave it. On the other hand, there are windows that remain opaque and protect the player from possible dangers of the outside world.<br/><br/> The balance between transparent and opaque windows presents an interesting dilemma for players. On the one hand, transparent windows can be useful for spying and viewing the area, allowing you to plan a strategy and prevent surprise attacks from other players. On the other hand, opaque windows can be an important security feature, providing protection and peace of mind inside buildings.<br/><br/> The developers of Rust have shown genius in introducing such a feature, which takes the gameplay to a new level. Windows not only change the way players interact with the world around them, but also introduce a new element of strategy and tactics into the game mechanics.<br/><br/> It is important to note that the updates being developed by Gameplay Rust on Steam try to take into account many factors when adding new elements to the game. The balance between performance, game mechanics and visual presentation of the game Rust on Steam is a distinctive feature of the developers who strive to satisfy the needs of a wide audience of players. As a result, updates always take into account the opinions of players and strive to create the most useful and enjoyable gaming experience.<br/><br/> So, the appearance of new windows on the test branch of the Rust game presents a new opportunity for players - to use the transparency of windows for reconnaissance and opacity for security. The constant development of the game and the innovations offered by the developers allow players to enjoy a unique and exciting gaming experience.'),
(10701, 'en-US', 'New Rust Update: Oil Rigs Radiation'),
(10702, 'en-US', 'Oil rigs in Rust now have a new feature - radiation that will increase in intensity over time. Find out how this hazard will affect gameplay and player survival on the rigs.'),
(10703, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, update, oil rigs, radiation, intensity, loot, anti-radiation suits, survival'),
(10704, 'en-US', 'Oil rigs in Rust now have a new feature - radiation that will increase in intensity over time. This change was made to prevent players from getting stuck on rigs. It is worth noting that loot does not update on rigs if there are players on them. Now, with the appearance of radiation, players will be forced to quickly leave the rig to avoid negative consequences.<br/><br/> Radiation will start to appear approximately 45 minutes after the start of hacking the container on the tower. The intensity of radiation will gradually increase and will reach its peak after 5 minutes. When the radiation level reaches 100, even anti-radiation suits, water inventory or anti-radiation pills will not be able to provide protection to the player.<br/><br/> Oil rigs will become an even more dangerous place, requiring fast and tactical play. Players will have to figure out how much time they can spend on the rig to collect the necessary resources before the radiation becomes too intense and dangerous for their survival. Be careful and beware of radiation on oil rigs in Rust!'),
(10705, 'en-US', 'New update with a motorboat!'),
(10706, 'en-US', 'A fresh update to the game Rust on Steam has brought the ability to sail on motorboats and the elimination of the problem of resource failure.'),
(10707, 'en-US', 'new update, motorboat, Rust, Steam, game world, resources, water adventures'),
(10708, 'en-US', '<h2>The new update allows you to sail on motorboats!</h2><br/><p> Fresh updates to the game Rust on Steam brought good news for lovers of sea adventures - the appearance of motorboats! Now players will be able to explore the vast game world at a completely new level of comfort and speed.</p><br/><p> However, the developers did not ignore the aspects of the game related to reality. In the new updates, an unpleasant phenomenon that often occurred when using boats was fixed - resources falling through the bottom of the boat. Now players can safely collect materials without fear of losing them in the water. This significantly simplifies the gameplay and makes it even more enjoyable and exciting.</p><br/><p> So, thanks to the new update, Rust players on Steam will be able to enjoy water rides on motorboats without fear of losing their valuable resources. This opens up new horizons for adventure and provides a unique opportunity to explore the game world to the fullest.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to strengthen your advantage in the world of Rust and go on exciting water adventures!</p>'),
(10709, 'en-US', 'Halloween update is out!'),
(10710, 'en-US', 'The Halloween update has been released for Rust! Go on terrifying adventures with new characters, collect candies and search for valuable items in underground mines. You can also update your look with stylish Dracula masks and costumes from the store.'),
(10711, 'en-US', 'update, halloween, map, frankenstein, zombies, mummies, candy, portals, mines, valuable items, shop, skins, masks, costumes, dracula'),
(10712, 'en-US', 'The long-awaited Halloween update for Rust has arrived! Now the map is filled with terrifying Frankensteins, sinister zombies, and mystical mummies ready to scare you and test your survival skills. Plus, you can now collect candies to make the game even more exciting and sweet.<br/><br/> But that\'s not all! The new update introduces mysterious portals that lead to underground mines where you can find valuable items and resources. Go on a treasure hunt and upgrade your gear with these new underground passages.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget to visit the store where themed skins, skillfully crafted masks and Dracula costumes await you. Dress stylishly and intimidatingly to instill fear in your opponents and highlight your style.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to immerse yourself in the Halloween atmosphere in the game Rust. Horrible characters, new adventures and stylish clothing elements are waiting for you!'),
(10713, 'en-US', 'Improving the quality of life!'),
(10714, 'en-US', 'Steam game Rust has added a new upgrade that allows players to instantly recolor their clothing, increasing the individuality and visual cohesion of clan players.'),
(10715, 'en-US', 'Quality of life improvement, Rust, Steam, clothing recoloring, clan players, individuality, fashion'),
(10716, 'en-US', 'The game Rust on Steam has implemented a new improvement that significantly improves the quality of life of players! Now you can instantly recolor your clothes to look stylish and unique in the world of Rust. No more wasting time searching and buying new clothes, just change their color to your taste and enjoy your new look. This is great news for all lovers of self-expression and design!<br/><br/> In addition, this improvement will also please clan players. Here, each clan member can now easily and quickly distinguish themselves from other players with their own unique image. The new ability to recolor clothing will help to strengthen the visual unity of the clan and create a sense of belonging to one team.<br/><br/> Improving the quality of life in the game Rust is a step towards greater individuality and diversity, allowing each player to express themselves and show their creativity. Now everyone can become a real fashion guru in the world of Rust!'),
(10717, 'en-US', 'New Twitch Drops Round Coming in December'),
(10718, 'en-US', 'The source of joy and reward for players, Twitch Drops, will return in December with a new round. Find out what exclusive items and rewards you can get in the game Rust on the Steam platform. Join the broadcasts and enjoy unique content!'),
(10719, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam, giveaways, skins, rewards, game, broadcasts, items'),
(10720, 'en-US', 'A source of joy and reward for gamers, Twitch Drops will return in December with a new round. From time to time, game developers organize sales and giveaways of various items, skins, and rewards for Twitch users. This December, the game Rust on the Steam platform will be one of the games participating in this event.<br/><br/> Twitch Drops is a special feature that allows users to earn rare and exclusive items by watching and participating in Twitch streams. This is a great opportunity for players to get unique items that are otherwise unavailable and become part of a special community of fans of the game.<br/><br/> The Twitch Drops event for Rust on Steam will take place in December, and it will be a great opportunity for all fans of the game to get valuable items for their characters. It is very important to note that these items will not only decorate your character, but can also provide certain advantages in the gameplay.<br/><br/> To participate in this event, you will need to follow a few simple instructions. First, you will need to go to one of the Rust streams on Twitch, connect your Steam account, and activate the Twitch Drops feature. After that, you just need to enjoy watching the streams and wait for your rewards to appear in your account inventory.<br/><br/> It is very important to remember that the event time may be limited, so do not waste time and join the broadcasts to get your rewards. It is also important to check the official sources of information about the exact date and time of the event, so as not to miss this unique opportunity.<br/><br/> Overall, Twitch Drops are a great and fun way for players to get exclusive items and enjoy the game even more. Don\'t miss your chance to be a part of this event and update your Rust item collection.'),
(10721, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam: Common Myths About Pay-to-Win'),
(10722, 'en-US', 'Rust P2W Myths on Steam and Their Debunking Rust is more of a Play-to-Win game, given the importance of skill and tactics to achieve success.'),
(10723, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, game, Pay-to-Win, P2W, myths, servers, advantages, skills, balancing'),
(10724, 'en-US', '<p>There is some confusion among us in the Rust community about the concept of Pay-to-Win (P2W). Today we want to clear this up and dispel some common myths surrounding P2W in Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> What is P2W? In short, it is a business model where players can purchase advantages or resources in a game using real money. However, many Rust players mistakenly claim that the game is P2W based on certain aspects of the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> We cannot dispute that Rust has elements of progression, including various weapons and resources that can be purchased in the game\'s store. However, these items do not automatically grant victory in the game. The essence of Rust is survival, building a shelter and fighting other players. At the same time, skill, tactics and teamwork become the key factors for success in the game, and not the presence of purchased equipment.</p><br/><br/><p> However, we must admit that some Rust servers offer the ability to buy benefits through donations. This may include access to exclusive features or accelerated leveling. However, it is worth noting that these servers are the exception, not the rule. The majority of official and popular Rust servers do not support such a model.</p><br/><br/><p> Studying this topic allows us to understand that Rust is still more inclined to the \"Play-to-Win\" model. After all, each player has the opportunity to achieve success by spending time, improving their skills and abilities. In addition, the game developers are constantly updating and balancing the gameplay so that all players have an equal chance of winning.</p><br/><br/><p> Thus, our analysis clearly demonstrates that Rust is not a Pay-to-Win game. We recommend that players proceed from more objective facts and evaluate the game experience based on skill, tactics and cooperative play, rather than simply relying on myths and unverified claims.</p>'),
(10725, 'en-US', 'First Look at DLC Base Decor and New Items'),
(10726, 'en-US', 'Get a first look at the base decor of the Rust DLC, including trophy racks, a rocking chair, and a storage barrel. Learn more about the new items that will diversify your base and create a more comfortable environment for survival in the world of Rust.'),
(10727, 'en-US', 'Rust, DLC, base decor, items, trophies, rocking chair, barrel storage, updates'),
(10728, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust, where every day brings new challenges and opportunities to survive. Today we bring you a first look at the base decor of the DLC, which will add more variety to your gaming parking lot.</p><br/><p> This DLC will include various items that you can place around your base to make it more cozy and personal. We update the list of items regularly, so expect to see even more interesting decorations.</p><br/><p> One of the new items available in the base decor DLC will be trophy mounts. Now you can decorate your base with the horns of animals you have defeated in battle. This will give your space a more masculine look and emphasize your courage.</p><br/><p> The rocking chair is another item that will appear in the DLC. It is a stylish and comfortable chair that will allow you to relax after long adventures in the world of Rust. You will be able to sit, relax and enjoy the soothing rocking movements.</p><br/><p> The 48-slot storage barrel is another new addition that will allow you to store your resources efficiently. Don\'t worry about your base being overcrowded. With the storage barrel, you can collect everything you need for survival and defense in one place.</p><br/><p> This DLC will also offer you other interesting items that will help you create a unique base in Rust. Stay tuned for updates and watch for new decoration options.</p>'),
(10729, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: A Fresh Collection of Various Updates'),
(10730, 'en-US', 'Good news for all fans of the game Rust is a fresh collection of new skins, which are now available for purchase on the Steam platform! Find out how these updates can change your gaming experience and add uniqueness to the world of Rust.'),
(10731, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, updates, uniqueness, style, weapons, tools, protection, clothes, gameplay, comfort, balance, paid, preferences.'),
(10732, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for all fans of the game Rust brought a fresh batch of skins, which are already available for purchase on the Steam platform! All players will now be able to decorate their virtual items with stylish, unique and high-quality updates that add uniqueness to the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins in the game Rust are one of the most anticipated events, because they not only allow players to stand out from the crowd, but also add new meaning and aesthetics to in-game items. They are magnificent works of artists who bring to life a variety of ideas and concepts.</p><br/><br/><p> In the fresh batch of skins you will find a variety of items, including weapons, tools, armor, clothing and much more. Each skin has its own unique style, color scheme and detailing, which allows each player to choose exactly what suits his taste and preferences.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, new skins in the game Rust also carry features that affect the gameplay. Some of them can increase the characteristics of items, making them more effective and increasing the chances of survival in the harsh world of Rust. Thus, acquiring fresh skins not only adds style and individuality, but can also affect the game mechanics.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that purchasing new skins in the game Rust does not affect the balance of the game and does not give any advantages over other players. All skins are purely cosmetic updates designed to create a unique atmosphere and greater comfort during the game.</p><br/><br/><p> However, it should be remembered that the acquisition of new skins is a paid option that requires additional investments. Therefore, each player must independently weigh their desires and capabilities before purchasing. It is important to be a responsible consumer and make decisions based on your personal preferences and budget.</p><br/><br/><p> In general, new skins in the game Rust are a great opportunity to add some variety and style to the gameplay. Thanks to them, you will be able to stand out from other players, emphasize your individuality and bring a fresh breeze to the world of Rust.</p>'),
(10733, 'en-US', 'New soft release of Observer Island in Rust'),
(10734, 'en-US', 'The official Rust servers have received a new custom map, Observer Island, in a soft release from Facepunch. Find out more about the map and its availability in this article.'),
(10735, 'en-US', 'Observer Island, Rust, custom map, soft release, Facepunch, official servers'),
(10736, 'en-US', 'In collaboration with community mappers @CollapsedOrange and @wheatleymf, Facepunch is pleased to announce a new soft release of Observer Island, a unique custom map available on the official Rust servers.'),
(10737, 'en-US', 'Jake Rich Makes Rust\'s Electricity Easier'),
(10738, 'en-US', 'Jake Rich has released a new update that makes it easier to lay wires and makes working with electricity in Rust easier.'),
(10739, 'en-US', 'Jake Rich, Rust, update, electricity, wires, chain, game strategy'),
(10740, 'en-US', '<p>Jake Rich has introduced a new mechanic that makes working with electricity in Rust much easier. Now you can easily run wires between different circuit elements without losing the connections you\'ve already made.</p><br/><p> Previously, if you changed the item in your hands, all the wires you had laid would disappear and you would have to start all over again. But thanks to the new Jake Rich update, this inconvenient problem will no longer hinder your game strategy.</p><br/><p> Now you can easily add new components to your network, change items and rewire without fear of losing connections already set up.</p><br/><p> This update greatly simplifies the process of working with electricity and allows players to more flexibly explore and use the various possibilities associated with electrical systems in Rust.</p>'),
(10741, 'en-US', 'New upcoming skins (Halloween contenders) from the workshop'),
(10742, 'en-US', 'In this article, we look at the most interesting new skins for the game Rust, created in the workshop and being prepared for Halloween.'),
(10743, 'en-US', 'new skins, upcoming skins, Halloween contenders, Rust Workshop'),
(10744, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the most interesting and anticipated new skins for the game Rust. The workshop is full of creative works, and our eyes will not get tired of finding new and unique designs that appear every day for Halloween contenders. Let\'s take a look at some of the most memorable and daring skins that will soon be available to us!'),
(10745, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins: fresh updates in the game Rust'),
(10746, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skin additions to Rust on Steam and get helpful tips on choosing the best items for your character.'),
(10747, 'en-US', 'new Rust skins, fresh updates, Steam, skins batch'),
(10748, 'en-US', 'Joy for Rust fans! A new batch of skins has been released to spice up your gaming experience. Now you can check out and purchase the most relevant and stylish items for your character and his surroundings. In this article, we will tell you about the latest skins added to the game Rust on Steam and share with you some useful tips so that you make the right choice.'),
(10749, 'en-US', 'Twitch drops Today at 21:00 Moscow time!'),
(10750, 'en-US', 'Don\'t miss out on unique Twitch drops in Rust! Get valuable items and skins for your character. Participation is limited, connect to Rust via your Twitch account and participate in the event at 21:00 Moscow time!'),
(10751, 'en-US', 'twitch drops, Rust, event, valuable items, skins, exclusive rewards, participation, Twitch account, limited time offer'),
(10752, 'en-US', 'Tonight at 21:00 Moscow time, another Twitch Drops event will take place in the popular game Rust! Unique opportunities to get valuable items and skins for your character are waiting for you. Don\'t miss your chance to get exclusive rewards for your collection in Rust. To participate in Twitch Drops, you need to follow the link <a href=\"https://twitch.facepunch.com/\">https://twitch.facepunch.com/</a> and connect your Twitch account to the game Rust. Be careful, time is limited, don\'t forget to set a reminder and don\'t miss this unique chance!'),
(10753, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Now You Can Pick Up Garden Beds'),
(10754, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new update in the game Rust - now you can select beds and create your own farm. Expand the capabilities of your character and become a real farmer in the game world.'),
(10755, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, beds, selection, growing, farm'),
(10756, 'en-US', '<p>The new Rust update has an interesting feature that we would like to tell you about. Now players can pick up garden beds and use them in their building projects.</p><br/><p> The addition of this feature greatly expands the players\' options when creating a base and developing their character. Beds are special objects where you can grow vegetables and fruits. Using beds allows players not only to provide themselves with food, but also to create their own farms in the game world.</p><br/><p> How to pick up a bed? To pick up a bed, you need to be near it and use the appropriate command. Then the bed will be moved to your inventory and will be available for construction on the territory you need.</p><br/><p> The raised bed can be installed in any convenient place, while it will retain its properties and functionality. Each bed has a certain number of cells in which you can plant vegetable or fruit seeds. Players can choose which plants to grow and monitor their growth and development.</p><br/><p> The game also introduces the ability to care for your garden beds, watering them to increase yields and protecting them from enemies. This opens up new possibilities for planning and strategy, and also promotes deeper interaction between players and the world around them.</p><br/><p> Overall, adding the ability to pick up farmland is a significant step in the development of Rust. It allows players to have more control over their own survival, develop agriculture, and create unique game objects.</p><br/><p> So if you love playing Rust and are interested in building and farming, don\'t miss this update!</p>'),
(10757, 'en-US', 'First look at the railway/metro upgrade'),
(10758, 'en-US', 'Find out what new transport features await you in the Rust Railroad/Metro update on Steam.'),
(10759, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, railway, metro, crossings'),
(10760, 'en-US', 'First look at the railway/metro upgrade<br/><br/> We live in a time of constant development and improvement of transport networks. And exactly in this way the company Rust on Steam decided to simplify the movement between the metro and ground railways.<br/><br/> New updates in the game Rust will allow trains to move from one level to another without any problems. Thus, a more convenient and flexible transport system will be created for players.<br/><br/> The game development team also took into account the convenience of players and implemented special marks for transitions on the map. Now you can easily find and use special connections between the metro and ground railways.<br/><br/> The railway/metro update in Rust is a step forward in creating a more realistic and convenient game world. Will you use the new transport options? Don\'t forget to share your impressions!'),
(10761, 'en-US', 'Which MP5 scope do you like the most?'),
(10762, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the different scopes for the MP5 in Rust and compare them to help you choose the best one.'),
(10763, 'en-US', 'sight, MP5, Rust, selection, comparison, Holo Sight, 8x Scope, Red Dot Sight, 4x Scope'),
(10764, 'en-US', '<p>When it comes to choosing a scope for the MP5, Rust players have a lot of options. They can choose from a variety of scopes, each with their own features and benefits.</p><br/><br/><p> In this article, we will look at several popular MP5 scopes and compare them. We will look at their design, functionality, and aesthetics to find out which scope might be your favorite.</p><br/><br/><p> The first scope we will look at is the Holo Sight. It offers a wide field of view and good target visibility. However, it has a small chance of missing hits.</p><br/><br/><p> The second option is the 8x Scope. It offers high magnification and is great for long-range shooting. However, due to its large size, it can make it difficult to see at close range.</p><br/><br/><p> The third sight is the Red Dot Sight. It is ideal for fast and accurate shooting at medium ranges. Its compact size and lack of magnification make it an ideal choice for close combat.</p><br/><br/><p> Finally, we\'ll look at the 4x Scope. It offers good magnification and easy-to-read markings for long-range shooting. However, its large size can be a disadvantage at close range.</p><br/><br/><p> Ultimately, choosing a scope for your MP5 comes down to your preferences and playstyle. We recommend trying out different scopes and choosing the one that is most comfortable and effective for you.</p>'),
(10765, 'en-US', 'The update has been released'),
(10766, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest Rust update on Steam, which brings changes to weapon damage, accuracy, new features to tool cabinets and vending machines, and improved weather conditions and other aspects of gameplay.'),
(10767, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, Steam, damage, weapons, accuracy, tools, vending machines, rocket, helicopter, turrets, crafting, battery, water collectors, weather, quarries, loot, homing missile, respawn, oil rig, skins, stone blocks'),
(10768, 'en-US', 'The update has been released.<br/><br/> Interesting:<br/> :tochka:Slightly increased mp5 damage<br/> :tochka:Increased mp5 accuracy when firing bursts<br/> :tochka:Thompson and smg have increased chance of hitting the center<br/> :tochka:The tool cabinet now shows maintenance costs and tool slots on the same page<br/> :tochka:The tool cabinet now has an additional slot for tools<br/> :tochka:Now you can turn on and off vending machines on the map<br/> :tochka:When hit by a homing missile while in a helicopter, the death screen now shows the missile and the player responsible for it, not just the helicopter.<br/> :tochka:Now no more than 12 turrets can be placed within a radius of 40 meters<br/> :tochka:Fixed a bug with bypassing the red map on space using a tower<br/> :tochka:The parachute now checks for free space above it when deploying, which prevents unstable behavior of parachutes that deploy and crash into helicopters.<br/> :tochka:The workbench source area has been expanded, now you can stand a little further away and do crafting.<br/> :tochka:The capacity and power of the small battery have been increased<br/> :tochka:Transparency underwater slightly improved<br/> :tochka:Water collectors now fill up much faster during rain, even faster in stormy weather<br/> :tochka:Increased probability of bad weather, increased probability of rain, storm and fog<br/> :tochka:The area in which construction is prohibited has been increased near quarries<br/> :tochka:More loot cosmodrome<br/> :tochka:The cost of manufacturing a homing missile has been reduced<br/> :tochka:Now homing missiles stack up to 4 pieces<br/> :tochka:A zone has been created limiting the respawn near the oil rig<br/> :tochka:Stone blocks got a new skin'),
(10769, 'en-US', 'Update 1300: New Features and Goodies for Your Rust Game on Steam'),
(10770, 'en-US', 'The 1300 update for Rust on Steam brings a host of new features and goodies, including a new crafting system and locations to explore. This article discusses the trade-offs involved in balancing the game, as well as the influence players have on developer decisions.'),
(10771, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, update 1300, new features, balancing, impact on decision making, Steam'),
(10772, 'en-US', '<p>Rust is a popular multiplayer game where players have to survive in a harsh open world, fighting hunger, enemies and trying to create their own space. The story of the game will show you that you have a small piece of the island with opportunities. Your task will be to build and defend your space, fight with other players and find resources for survival.</p><br/><p> As all players know, Rust is constantly updated with new features and improvements. And the recent 1300 update is no exception. It brings a lot of interesting features and improvements that will allow you to dive even deeper into the game world and enjoy improved gameplay.</p><br/><h2> New features and goodies</h2><br/><p> One of the key aspects of the update is the addition of new features that will make your game much more interesting. For example, the new crafting system will allow you to create even more items and weapons, expanding your capabilities and helping you in battles.</p><br/><p> In addition, update 1300 brings new locations and places to explore. Now you can go to previously inaccessible corners of the map and find valuable resources and treasures. New enemies and dangers have also been added, which will make your survival even more challenging.</p><br/><h2> Compromises and balancing</h2><br/><p> As with any update, the developers face the challenge of balancing various aspects of the game. For example, adding new weapons can affect the balance of power in PvP battles, so the developers pay special attention to testing and tweaking new features to maintain balance and satisfy all players.</p><br/><p> However, it is important to understand that compromises may be inevitable. Some changes may be made to improve the overall gaming experience, but may also result in a loss of interest for a certain group of players. It is important to consider many factors and make decisions that will achieve the optimal balance for all players.</p><br/><h2> Influence on decision making</h2><br/><p> Rust Steam updates not only improve functionality and gameplay, but also make changes based on player feedback. The developers actively listen to the community, analyze data, and take player opinions into account when making decisions about the future development of the game.</p><br/><p> Players can influence updates by offering their ideas and feedback, as well as taking part in testing new features. This way, every player can directly influence the development of the game and contribute to making Rust even better and more fun.</p>'),
(10773, 'en-US', 'Great news for all fans of the game Rust on Steam - a new batch of skins has been released! Find out more about the new skins and their impact on the gaming experience.'),
(10774, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, new skins, game Rust on Steam'),
(10775, 'en-US', 'Great news for all fans of the game Rust on Steam - today we are happy to announce that the long-awaited new batch of skins has been released! New skins are a unique opportunity for players to decorate their in-game items and show their individuality in the ruthless and dangerous world of Rust. In this article, we will tell you about all the new skins and take a closer look at the key factors that influence their addition to the game.'),
(10776, 'en-US', 'Expanding the workbench area for convenient crafting in the game Rust'),
(10777, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new update to the Rust game, which expands the workbench area and makes crafting more convenient. The Rust developers always listen carefully to player feedback and strive to make the game comfortable for everyone.'),
(10778, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, workbench, craft, area expansion'),
(10779, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to the Rust game has brought an important change that will definitely please all players: the workbench area has been significantly expanded! Now you can stand a little further from the workbench and still be within its reach. This innovation will make your gaming life much easier and make crafting more convenient.</p><br/><p> Previously, in order to craft, you had to be right next to the workbench, which could sometimes be inconvenient, especially if there were a lot of players on the server and the area around the workbench was overloaded. Now, you can stand a little further away and still use all the capabilities of the workbench.</p><br/><p> This update is perfect for those who like more freedom and don’t want to be tied to one place when crafting. With the expanded workbench area, you can easily move around it, perform other tasks, or just enjoy the view of the world around you, without losing the ability to create the necessary items.</p><br/><p> It should be noted that Rust developers always monitor player feedback and wishes, striving to make the game as comfortable and convenient as possible. This update is another confirmation of the developers\' attention to the needs of the gaming community and continuous work on improving the gameplay.</p><br/><p> If you haven\'t tried the expanded workbench area yet, feel free to launch the Rust game and enjoy the new features. We are sure that this small but significant detail will make your gaming life more comfortable and exciting!</p>'),
(10780, 'en-US', 'Rust Shooting Update'),
(10781, 'en-US', 'Changes have been made to the firing of the Mp5, Thompson, and SMG. Improved the rate of fire and accuracy of the Mp5. Increased the chance of hitting the center when firing from the Thompson and SMG.'),
(10782, 'en-US', 'Update, Shooting, Mp5, Thompson, SMG, Accuracy, Rate of Fire, Damage, Combat, Rust, Game'),
(10783, 'en-US', '<p>Changes have been made to the shooting of the Mp5, Thompson and SMG.</p><br/><p> The Mp5\'s rate of fire, accuracy, and damage have now been improved, allowing players to deal with opponents more effectively.</p><br/><p> The chance of hitting the center when firing from the Thompson and SMG has also been increased, which will significantly increase their effectiveness in combat.</p><br/><p> The shooting update in Rust will allow players to feel more confident in battles and use these weapons with greater effectiveness.</p>'),
(10784, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: More Options for Base Defense'),
(10785, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new update in Rust, which expands your base defense capabilities and increases security.'),
(10786, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, turrets, base defense, improvements, gameplay'),
(10787, 'en-US', '<p>Now, within a radius of 40 meters from your base in the game Rust, you can install up to 12 turrets for even more reliable protection!</p><br/><br/><p> The developers of the game Rust heard the players\' requests about the lack of defensive options and improved the gameplay by increasing the number of turrets installed within a 40 meter radius.</p><br/><br/><p> Turrets are automated weapons that can be placed near your base to protect it from attacks from enemy players or animals. Previously, players were only able to place a limited number of turrets, which could create vulnerabilities in defense and lead to loss of resources or possessions.</p><br/><br/><p> However, with the new update, up to 12 turrets can be placed within a 40 meter radius of the base. This gives players more flexibility in planning and fortifying the base, providing even more reliable protection from attacks.</p><br/><br/><p> This update is expected to significantly increase the level of base defense and strengthen the position of players in the game of Rust. However, it should be remembered that installing more turrets may also require more resources and effort to ensure their operation and maintenance.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, the new update to the Rust game expands the players\' options in the area of base defense and creates more tragedies in the confrontation with other players. Be careful and think through your defense strategy to be successful in the harsh world of Rust!</p>'),
(10788, 'en-US', 'New upcoming Halloween skins from the workshop'),
(10789, 'en-US', 'We\'re sharing some new Halloween skins from the Rust Steam Workshop. Check out some of the scary and fun designs coming your way in the near future to spice up the game.'),
(10790, 'en-US', 'New Skins, Rust, Steam, Halloween, Workshop, Horror, Holiday, Atmosphere'),
(10791, 'en-US', '<p>Our favorite developers of the game Rust on Steam do not cease to please us with new skins. And now, we are eagerly waiting for the upcoming Halloween, when special skins created for this holiday will appear in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Today we decided to tell you about the new products from the workshop, which are potential contenders for release by Halloween. Here you will find the most interesting and unusual skins that will be available in the game soon.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins are added to the workshop all the time, and the Rust developers offer us a huge variety of choices. However, in honor of Halloween, they have selected special, unique and exciting designs.</p><br/><br/><p> Some of these new skins feature terrifying monsters and sinister creatures that will add even more fear and tension to the game atmosphere. Who knows, maybe some of you will be lucky enough to get a skin for your knife or machine gun and become a deterministic monster on the Halloween server.</p><br/><br/><p> But there are also lighter and more playful options for those who do not like all this horror. Cool and cute skins that create harmony and joy are waiting for you. You can decorate your home or things with cheerful and bright elements that will make your gaming environment more festive.</p><br/><br/><p> Also, don\'t forget to check out the weapon skins section - the new items on offer will make your chosen tool even more unique and stylish. There are many weapon options in the game, and skins will help you stand out from other players and add individuality to your game gear.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, the new Halloween skins from the workshop are a great way to create a special atmosphere and make the gameplay even more interesting and exciting. Don\'t miss the chance to update your collection, add some fear or fun to your game and enjoy the unique and colorful designs.</p><br/><br/><p> We think that Rust developers will do everything possible to surprise us with new and bright skins, giving a very special atmosphere to the game in honor of Halloween.</p>'),
(10792, 'en-US', 'It is no longer possible to respawn on oil rigs using a tugboat'),
(10793, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest changes to Rust regarding respawning on oil rigs using a tugboat. The developers have introduced restrictions and will likely introduce zones where it is impossible to respawn to ensure gameplay balance. Keep these changes in mind to plan your actions effectively in the game.'),
(10794, 'en-US', 'Rust game, oil rigs, respawn, tug, restrictions, zones, balance'),
(10795, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has made changes to the way players can respawn on oil rigs using a tugboat. Players were previously able to use this feature to their advantage, but now the developers have made changes.</p><br/><br/><p> According to the latest update to the game, it is no longer possible to respawn on oil rigs using a tugboat. This means that players will no longer be able to use this method for their gameplay purposes.</p><br/><br/><p> Most likely, such restrictions are introduced to maintain gameplay balance. The developers may have discovered that respawning on oil rigs with a tugboat gives players an advantage and decided to make changes accordingly.</p><br/><br/><p> Instead, there may be areas on the map where respawning is prohibited. This could add more dynamics and force new tactical decisions from players.</p><br/><br/><p> These changes in the game Rust are important, as they affect the strategies and tactics of players. Taking these changes into account allows you to plan your actions more consciously and adapt to new game conditions.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, these changes bring variety and balance to Rust\'s gameplay, making it more interesting and exciting for all players.</p>'),
(10796, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam Game Updates - Bad Weather Chance Increased and Cave Procedural Generation'),
(10797, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest updates to Rust on Steam, which include increased chances of bad weather and procedurally generated caves. Explore dangerous and unique locations, mine rare resources, and forge your own path to survival.'),
(10798, 'en-US', 'Rust game on Steam, Rust game updates, bad weather, rain, storm, fog, procedural generation of caves, exploration, survival'),
(10799, 'en-US', '<p>Recently, new updates to the game Rust were released on Steam, which brought some interesting changes to the gameplay. One of the main changes was the increase in the probability of bad weather in the game.</p><br/><p> Players can now experience rain, storms, and fog, adding more realism to the game world. These changes will create an atmosphere of tension and surprise, as each game day will be unique and unpredictable.</p><br/><p> Along with this update, the developers have added procedural generation of caves. Now players will be able to explore dark and mysterious caves full of treasures and dangers. Each generated cave will be unique, which makes the gameplay even more exciting and varied.</p><br/><p> New updates offer players unique opportunities to explore and survive in the world of Rust. Be prepared for adverse weather conditions and dangerous caves, explore new places and mine rare resources.</p>'),
(10800, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins for the game Rust on Steam'),
(10801, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new batch of Rust skins coming to Steam and how they can add style and personality to your in-game characters and items.'),
(10802, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, skins, stylish, self-expression, individuality'),
(10803, 'en-US', 'It’s always great to hear about new features in a game, especially when it comes to adding new skins. Well, good news for all you Rust fans on Steam – a new batch of skins has been released! Now you have the opportunity to spice up your in-game characters and items with unique and stylish skins that will add new opportunities for self-expression and individuality. In this article, we’ll cover all the key details you need to know about the new skins for your Rust experience.'),
(10804, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Increased Radius of Forbidden Zone in Quarries'),
(10805, 'en-US', 'Rust has received a new update: the radius of the forbidden zone in quarries has been increased. The change may affect game strategies and add new challenges for players.'),
(10806, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, radius of forbidden zone, careers, difficulty, construction, survival'),
(10807, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust has a new update that affects construction in quarries. The game developers decided to expand the radius of the forbidden zone, where players will no longer be able to build their buildings.</p><br/><p> Players will now have to be even more careful and cautious when choosing a location to build on quarries. The expansion of the forbidden zone radius may have a significant impact on game strategies, as players will be forced to look for more remote and less accessible locations for a base.</p><br/><p> This change is a compromise between the game creators and the players. On the one hand, it can create additional difficulties for building and defending the base, which makes the game more complex and requires more thoughtful tactics. On the other hand, it can lead to more interesting and varied game situations, where players will be forced to adapt and find new ways to survive.</p><br/><p> Increasing the radius of the forbidden zone in quarries is part of an ongoing update to the Rust game, which is aimed at improving the gameplay and balancing the game mechanics. The game developers actively collaborate with the player community to take into account their opinions and suggestions when making changes to the game.</p><br/><p> If you are a fan of the game Rust, then you will definitely like this update. It will add a new portion of challenges and opportunities to the game, ensuring its constant development and interesting gameplay.</p>'),
(10808, 'en-US', 'Information about the new skin for the MVC building in Rust'),
(10809, 'en-US', 'Information about a new skin for the MVC building in the game Rust has appeared. Now this skin can be used to create stone buildings. Find out more about the new skin and its capabilities.'),
(10810, 'en-US', 'information, new skin, MVC buildings, Brutalist, stone buildings'),
(10811, 'en-US', 'News: the skin for the MVC building (Brutalist) will be used for stone buildings!'),
(10812, 'en-US', 'Information about the new round of Twitch Drops in the game Rust'),
(10813, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new round of Twitch Drops in Rust, running from October 12th to 19th. Get exclusive skins and update your collection in Rust on Steam.'),
(10814, 'en-US', 'new round, Twitch Drops, Rust game, skins, Steam, exclusive skins, Rust on Twitch, unique skins'),
(10815, 'en-US', '<p>The exciting game Rust on Steam gives its players a great opportunity to get exclusive skins for their characters. And here is happy news for all Rust fans - a new round of Twitch Drops is ready to begin!</p><br/><p> From October 12th to October 19th, you can take part in this exciting event and earn unique skins for your collection. This means you can update your Rust in-game wardrobe and amaze everyone with your style.</p><br/><p> Twitch Drops are a skin giveaway that takes place through the popular streaming platform Twitch. You’ll just need to watch Rust streams to claim your skins. Watch streams, interact with the community, and claim your rewards right in-game.</p><br/><p> What\'s most interesting is that each skin will be unique and inimitable. You will be able to stand out from other players and emphasize your individuality. Don\'t miss the chance to experience an exciting adventure in Rust and at the same time get stylish skins that will take your gaming aesthetics to a new level.</p><br/><p> Specific conditions for participation in the promotion may vary, so it is recommended to follow the official information on the official Rust channel on Twitch. There you will find all the necessary details on how to earn your skins and participate in the giveaway.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your Rust skin collection and thank yourself for a great gaming adventure with Twitch Drops. Participate in the new round from October 12 to 19 and become the owner of unique and cool accessories for your characters. Get ready for new challenges, new victories and new skins in the game Rust!</p>');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(10816, 'en-US', 'Charitable Rust in Rust: Twitch Drops and More'),
(10817, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new round of the Charitable Rust charity event in the game Rust, including Twitch Drops and other interesting events. Get the latest news from RUST RU.'),
(10818, 'en-US', 'charity event, Charitable Rust, Rust, Twitch Drops, gaming news'),
(10819, 'en-US', '<p>Every year from October 14th to 15th, the popular game Rust hosts Charitable Rust, an event that brings the community of players together to help charities.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main attractions of this promotion is the new round of Twitch Drops, which will take place from October 12 to 19. During the draw, you will be given the opportunity to receive unique items and rewards in the game. Don\'t miss your chance to become the owner of exclusive items!</p><br/><br/><p> To stay up to date with all the events and receive the latest and most relevant news from RUST RU, subscribe to our updates. We will inform you about all the details of the charity event and other important events in the game.</p>'),
(10820, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new batch of skins added to Rust and what items are available for purchase.'),
(10821, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, update, items, buy'),
(10822, 'en-US', 'Recently, the game Rust has had an interesting update - a new batch of skins was added. This event cannot but arouse the interest of players and the desire to learn more about the new items that can be purchased in the game. In this article, we will look at all the key details of this update and tell you what new skins have appeared.'),
(10823, 'en-US', 'We offer you the latest information about new updates and skins for the game Rust. Stay up to date with the latest news about the railway network, basic decor and Halloween content.'),
(10824, 'en-US', 'Rust, news, updates, building skin, rail network, base decor DLC, Halloween, Rusty Christmas'),
(10825, 'en-US', 'News from the fields.<br/><br/> Building Skin - Frontier<br/> The first skin for wooden buildings, in the style of old rasta. Officially not yet available on the test branch. Like everything that is still in development, it can change 10 times.<br/><br/> Skin for gingerbread building<br/> Another sneak peek at the upcoming Christmas building skin: Gingerbread. This will be a seasonal item, available during Rusty Christmas in December (it won\'t be year-round).<br/><br/> Railway network<br/> The connection between the overground and underground rail networks is planned as part of a new line called the \"rail network\". Several locations of varying size and slope will appear on the maps, allowing players to move between map levels using rail transport. There is no visualization of this process yet, but information will be published as it becomes available.<br/><br/> Basic DLC Decor<br/> It looks like a new base DLC is in the works. Unlike the other base-related DLCs that have been released so far, this one will be a set of decorative items to decorate your base with. There are no details yet on what kind of decorations will be added or what functionality, if any, they will have. We\'ll keep you posted as more details emerge.<br/><br/> Halloween content<br/> With the spooky Halloween festivities set to begin next month, the team is preparing some new haunted items. In particular, it looks like a Dracula cape/costume is in the works.'),
(10826, 'en-US', 'Possible skins for buildings!'),
(10827, 'en-US', 'Check out the new amazing building skins for Rust! The tree and gingerbread house skins will give your base a unique and original look. Stay tuned and visit the source to learn more!'),
(10828, 'en-US', 'Rust, building skins, new skins, tree, gingerbread house, base, updates, game, Steam'),
(10829, 'en-US', 'Rust has added some amazing new building skins that will greatly diversify the appearance of your base. Let\'s take a look at some of them!<br/><br/><p> 1. Skin on the tree</p><br/><p> :tochka: Now you can decorate your base with a stylish tree skin. It will give your building naturalness and originality. Decorate your base to your taste and create a unique place that will stand out from the rest.</p><br/><br/><p> 2. Gingerbread House Skin</p><br/><p> :tochka: The holiday season brings many joyful surprises, including a new skin for buildings - a gingerbread house! Get access to this magical skin during the New Year event and decorate your base in a festive atmosphere. Surprise your friends and neighbors with a unique and fun base design.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow the Rust game updates and visit our source - <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a> to stay up to date with all the latest skins for buildings!</p>'),
(10830, 'en-US', 'New future skins from the workshop in the game Rust'),
(10831, 'en-US', 'Find out about future skins in the game Rust from the workshop. We will tell you about the most interesting designs and estimate their chances of appearing in the game. Find out how various factors and player preferences influence the decision of developers.'),
(10832, 'en-US', 'new skins, skins, upcoming skins, contenders, workshop, Rust game, news, review'),
(10833, 'en-US', '<p>If you are an active Rust player and are interested in what new skins will appear in the game in the near future, then you should pay attention to this article. We have collected for you the latest news about future skins that may become available soon.</p><br/><p> The Workshop is a curated store on the Steam platform where developers and players can upload their own skin designs. Here, everyone can share their creativity and suggest their candidates for inclusion in the game.</p><br/><p> In this article you will find detailed information about the most interesting and promising skins that are currently under consideration. We will briefly tell you about each contender, and also assess its chances of appearing in the game.</p><br/><p> We\'ll also look at the factors that go into deciding whether to add a skin to a game. After all, developers face various dilemmas, such as balance, design, and popularity among players. We\'ll look at all of these tradeoffs and show why some skins are candidates for inclusion in the game, while others remain just dreams.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to learn more about upcoming workshop skins and stay up to date with the latest news. You\'ll love the interesting designs and ideas that are presented in the workshop, as well as learn how external factors and community preferences influence the developers\' decisions.</p>'),
(10834, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: the brightest and most interesting updates'),
(10835, 'en-US', 'Change the look of your items and devices in Rust with new skins, creating a unique style for your game character. More colorful and interesting updates are already available on Steam.'),
(10836, 'en-US', 'new skins, update, game Rust, Steam, weapons, armor, interior items'),
(10837, 'en-US', '<p>A fresh batch of skins for the game Rust is now available on Steam! New updates in the world of skins will bring brightness and individuality to your gaming experience. Experience the pleasure of changing the appearance of your items and devices to match your style of play.</p><br/><p> The update includes a wide range of skins, from weapons and armor to tools and interior items. In particular, you can get new variations of weapons to emphasize your individuality and make your battles even more memorable.</p><br/><p> Purchasing new skins in the game Rust will help you stand out from the crowd and show your creativity. Choose from a variety of different designs to create a unique style for your game character.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget about the possibility of selling skins on the Steam marketplace, which will allow you to earn extra income in the game or invest in other interesting items.</p><br/><p> With new skins in the game Rust, you will definitely feel a surge of novelty and opportunities for self-expression. Please your eyes and your friends with bright and original skins and enjoy the game to the fullest!</p>'),
(10838, 'en-US', 'Possible model on the MVK'),
(10839, 'en-US', 'A possible new model for the game Rust was presented at the International Computer Games Exhibition (ICG). This generated great interest among players and fans of this popular game.'),
(10840, 'en-US', 'Model, MVC, Rust, update, gameplay, new features, balance, developers, community, players, testing'),
(10841, 'en-US', '<p>At the International Computer Games Exhibition (ICG), a possible new model for the game Rust was presented. This caused great interest among players and fans of this popular game.</p><br/><p> The new model on the MVC clearly shows that the Rust developers are continuing to work on improving the gameplay and introducing new features. This promises to be an exciting update for all fans of the game.</p><br/><p> Many players are expecting a new model in Rust, as it could significantly affect the game mechanics and strategy. A possible model on the MVC could add new tactical depth and opportunities for players, opening up new ways to explore and survive in the brutal world of Rust.</p><br/><p> However, it should be remembered that the possible model is still in the process of development and testing. Changes in design and functionality are possible before it is introduced into the game. Rust developers always strive for balance and feedback from their players, and the opinions and suggestions of the community may influence the final form of the new model.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that adding a new model to a game can cause differences in player opinion. Some players may welcome the changes and the introduction of new features, while others may be wary of losing balance and changing old strategies. This always leads to discussions and compromises between different play styles and player preferences.</p><br/><p> Ultimately, the introduction of a possible model into the Rust game will be guided by decisions based on feedback from the development team and the player community. The balance between introducing new features and preserving the uniqueness and characteristics of the game will be a key factor in making decisions.</p><br/><p> All together, the possible model on MVC promises to add interesting new elements to the gameplay and give players even more opportunities for creativity and survival. We are looking forward to the official announcement and more details from the Rust developers.</p>'),
(10842, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skins from the Rust Workshop. Let\'s take a look at potential additions to the game and how they\'ll impact your gaming experience.'),
(10843, 'en-US', 'new items, skins, game Rust, Steam, workshop, weapons, items, buildings'),
(10844, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam constantly pleases its players with new skins. In this article, we will consider the latest novelties of future skins from the workshop. These skins are potential contenders for adding to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust Workshop is a place where talented artists create unique skins for weapons, items and buildings in the game. These works undergo a complex selection and rigorous testing in order to qualify for inclusion in the official release.</p><br/><br/><p> In each update of the Rust game, the developers add new skins that can be selected from the workshop. They carefully study the players\' suggestions and try to take their wishes into account. New skins not only add aesthetic appeal to the game, but also allow players to stand out from others and show their individuality.</p><br/><br/><p> Which workshop skins have the best chance of becoming part of the Rust game? In this article, we will look at the latest new products and analyze their potential.</p><br/><br/> <b>1. Weapon skins:</b> the workshop offers a wide variety of skins for various types of weapons - from firearms to cold arms. We will consider the brightest and most detailed skins that can add new tactical possibilities and attractiveness to weapons.<br/><br/> <b>2. Item Skins:</b> In addition to weapons, Rust has many items that can be customized with skins. We are exploring new skins for tools, clothing, and other useful items that will help players stand out from the crowd and make their gaming experience even more unique.<br/><br/> <b>3. Building Skins:</b> Rust is not only about battles and survival, but also about building and developing your settlement. The Workshop offers new skins for various buildings, adding individuality and originality to each house or fortification.</p><br/><br/><p> In this article, we have only looked at some examples of skins from the workshop. But remember that the decision to add skins to the game is made by the development team, and they take into account many factors and feedback from the player community.</p><br/><br/><p> Stay tuned for Rust game updates and don\'t miss the opportunity to purchase and use the latest skins that will make your gaming experience even brighter and more interesting!</p>'),
(10845, 'en-US', 'Rust 2 definitely won\'t be a Unity game'),
(10846, 'en-US', 'Rust creator Garry Newman has announced that Rust 2 will not be developed on the Unity platform due to dissatisfaction with the new installation fee. Rust 2 developers are looking for alternative development options.'),
(10847, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust 2, Unity, Garry Newman, developers, install fee, alternative platform'),
(10848, 'en-US', 'Rust creator Harry Newman has announced that Rust 2 will not be developed on the Unity platform. The decision was prompted by developers\' dissatisfaction with the new Unity installation fee.<br/><br/> In a recent interview, <a href=\"https://www.gamedeveloper.com/business/rust-creator-tells-unity-to-get-fucked-as-developers-left-seething-by-new-fee\">Garry Newman expressed his anger and displeasure over the new fee</a> that Unity developers have introduced for using their platform. According to him, he will not use Unity to create Rust 2. This decision has caused considerable resentment among the game\'s developers and pushed them to other development options.<br/><br/> However, the future of Rust 2\'s development remains uncertain, and the community awaits news from Garry Newman about choosing an alternative platform for the game\'s development.'),
(10849, 'en-US', 'Method to put out a fire through a door in the game Rust'),
(10850, 'en-US', 'Find out how to easily and conveniently put out a fire through a door in the game Rust using this technique. Get rid of unpleasant conditions in the gameplay.'),
(10851, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, sachelka, put out, door, fire extinguisher'),
(10852, 'en-US', '<h1>Method to put out a fire through a door in the game Rust</h1><br/><p> There are many ways to interact with the world around you in Rust. One of these ways is the ability to put out a fire through a door. If you didn\'t know about this option, then this material will be useful for you.</p><br/><p> To put out a fire through a door, you need to take into account several details. First, you must have a fire that you want to put out. Second, the presence of a door in the building or structure where the fire is located.</p><br/><p> The process of extinguishing a fire through a door involves the following steps:</p><br/><ol><br/><li> Go to the door where the sachselka is.</li><br/><li> While holding a fire extinguishing tool, such as a fire extinguisher, press the door interaction button.</li><br/><li> When the interaction options appear, select the \"Put out the sacheleka\" option.</li><br/><li> Point the fire extinguisher stream at the fire extinguisher and continue to extinguish until it goes out.</li><br/></ol><br/><p> It is important to note that in the process of extinguishing a fire through a door, you may encounter certain problems. For example, if the fire is far from the door, it may be difficult to completely extinguish it. Also, keep in mind that the fire extinguisher has a limited resource, so its use should be planned in advance.</p><br/><p> Ultimately, using this technique will help you successfully extinguish a fire through a door in Rust. This can be especially useful if the fire is located in a building and creates unpleasant conditions for the gameplay.</p>'),
(10853, 'en-US', 'Global wipe in Rust: prepare for new challenges!'),
(10854, 'en-US', 'Global wipe in Rust - start from scratch and prepare for new challenges! Learn how to survive and succeed in this open world full of adventures.'),
(10855, 'en-US', 'Rust game, global wipe, survival, raids, challenges, resources, basic principles, alternative sources, justice, enjoyment of the game'),
(10856, 'en-US', '<p>Dear Rust players! We are happy to inform you that the game has undergone a global wipe. This means that all servers have been completely reset, and now you have a chance to start the game from scratch. But don’t worry, in this article we will tell you how to prepare for new challenges and succeed in this endless fight for survival.</p><br/><br/><p> First, remember the basic principles of survival. Find a safe place to build your shelter, gather the necessary resources, create tools and weapons to ensure your defense. And remember that neighbors can be both friends and enemies - choose your allies wisely.</p><br/><br/><p> Also, be prepared for some resources to be limited. After all, with the global wipe, all players start from scratch, and each resource has its price. Be flexible and look for alternative sources of metal, wood, and technology.</p><br/><br/><p> Remember that there is no justice in Rust. Some players choose the path of peaceful coexistence, while others prefer an active game with robberies and raids. This is important to consider if you want to keep your property and see your progress.</p><br/><br/><p> And finally, don\'t forget to enjoy the game! Rust is not only a fight for survival, but also a beautiful open world full of adventures and opportunities. Explore the territory, communicate with other players, create your own stories.</p><br/><br/><p> So we wish all players good survival and successful raids! After the global wipe, the opportunities will become even greater, and only the bravest and strongest players will be able to succeed.</p>'),
(10857, 'en-US', 'Weapon Racks: New DLC in Rust'),
(10858, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new DLC in the game Rust - weapon racks that will allow you to strengthen your base and develop new tactics in battles. More updates and interesting features await players!'),
(10859, 'en-US', 'weapon racks, new DLC, game Rust, update, bases, tactics'),
(10860, 'en-US', '<p>All fans of the game Rust were eagerly awaiting new updates, and finally, the developers fulfilled their expectations. The new DLC - weapon racks, became a pleasant surprise for all players.</p><br/><p> In addition to numerous changes and additions, the new Rust update introduced the ability to install weapon racks. They open up completely new horizons for player strategy and tactics.</p><br/><p> Weapon racks allow players to set up their weapon platforms in different parts of the map. This allows them to create defensive lines, ambushes, and defend their bases. In addition, racks can be used as tactical strongholds, allowing them to control territory and repel enemy attacks.</p><br/><p> The new DLC with weapon racks expands the possibilities in creating and developing your own bases, and also encourages players to be creative and develop new tactics in battles.</p><br/><p> It is worth noting that the developers of the game Rust took into account the balance and did not give excessive power to the weapon racks. They are part of the gameplay and do not give advantages to one side. Each player will be able to adapt to the new functionality and use it for their own purposes.</p><br/><p> Weapon racks are just one of many updates that the developers are preparing for the game Rust. Let\'s stay tuned and expect even more improvements and interesting features in future updates!</p>'),
(10861, 'en-US', 'Information about the new batch of skins in the game Rust on Steam. Find out about the most exciting and unique skins, their design, rarity and impact on gameplay.'),
(10862, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, skin design, limited editions, exclusive designs, skin purchase, character, variety'),
(10863, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has arrived! In this article, we will be taking a look at some of the most exciting and unique skins that have been added to Rust on Steam. We will be looking at the different aspects of these skins, their designs, rarities, and gameplay impacts. Limited edition skins, exclusive designs from famous artists, and more will be featured. Our article will help you stay up to date with the latest releases and make an informed choice when buying skins for your Rust character. Join us as we learn about the new batch of skins that are bringing some freshness and variety to the world of Rust!'),
(10864, 'en-US', 'Interesting information'),
(10865, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has revealed some interesting information about new functionality: a patrol helicopter and a rocket launcher.'),
(10866, 'en-US', 'interesting information, rust, patrol helicopter, rocket launcher, PVP, PVE'),
(10867, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust has revealed some interesting information about a new feature: the patrol helicopter.</p><br/><p> The helicopter will now have an unlimited number of flares, or heat flares. If a player attempts to attack the helicopter with the new rocket launcher, it will immediately activate the flares.</p><br/><p> The developers have stated that the AA Rocket Launcher, which is designed for player versus player (PVP), is not intended for use against the environment (PVE).</p>'),
(10868, 'en-US', 'Rust Global Update: What\'s New and When to Expect It'),
(10869, 'en-US', 'Learn all about the major Rust update, including new features like the attack helicopter, rocket launcher, parachutes and more. The update offers a variety of fixes and improvements to the gameplay. Don\'t miss this opportunity to dive into the updated world of Rust.'),
(10870, 'en-US', 'Rust update, global update, new features, Rust, attack helicopter, rocket launcher, parachutes, armored balloon, weapon rack, Twitch drops, in-game items'),
(10871, 'en-US', '<p>This Thursday, September 7, at 21:00 Moscow time, the game Rust will receive a global update. This event has prepared many great new opportunities for players.</p><br/><p> Let\'s take a closer look at what awaits you:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> Attack Helicopter: Fly a powerful military helicopter and feel like a real pilot;</li><br/><li> Homing Rocket Launcher: Blow your enemies to pieces with this unique new technique;</li><br/><li> Parachutes: You no longer have to worry about the height of your fall - save yourself with a parachute;</li><br/><li> Armored Balloon: Ensure your safe travel through hostile terrain;</li><br/><li> Weapon Rack: No more looking for a place to put your treasure - the rack will allow you to confidently defend your territory;</li><br/><li> Twitch drops: follow Twitch broadcasts and get free in-game items;</li><br/><li> Various fixes and improvements: Rust developers also tried to fix many bugs and make the gameplay more convenient and smooth.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> The update promises to be rich and interesting, giving players many new opportunities. Don\'t miss the chance to dive into the updated world of Rust together with other players!</p>'),
(10872, 'en-US', 'This article covers the latest news in the game Rust, including new weapons (homing missile launcher), armored balloons, changes to attack helicopters, parachutes, and other improvements.'),
(10873, 'en-US', 'Field News, Homing Rocket Launcher, Weapons, Attack Helicopter, Armored Balloons, Parachute, Changes, Hand Rockets, Helicopter Rockets, Drift Boats, Rust PVE, Sleeping Bags, Tugboat, Weapon Racks, Clan Table, Tutorial Island'),
(10874, 'en-US', 'News from the fields<br/><br/> :tochka: Homing missile launcher under development!<br/> A new type of rocket is on the way in the form of the Homing Missile Launcher. This new weapon, which just entered service earlier this week, could be a key component in countering the upcoming attack helicopter.<br/> It takes 4 seconds to lock onto a target (it locks onto any player-controlled or NPC helicopter) and, as you\'d expect, it loads one rocket at a time. Below are some current stats, but keep in mind that things are subject to change.<br/><br/> Homing missile launcher<br/> Craft - 15 HQM<br/> 4 metal pipes<br/> 1 microcircuit<br/> 1 CCTV camera<br/> Study<br/> 500 scrap<br/> Workbench<br/> Level 2<br/><br/> Homing missile<br/> Craft (exit 3)<br/> 200 gunpowder<br/> 3 metal pipes<br/> 1 microcircuit<br/> Study<br/> 125 scrap metal<br/> Workbench<br/> Level 2<br/><br/> :tochka: Armored balloons<br/> Recently, armored balloons have appeared on the scene. Providing more protection than the old \"naked\" HABs. Here are some basics (keep in mind that everything is subject to change).<br/><br/> Can be bought in the bandit camp for 150 scrap<br/> 200 metal fragments for crafting<br/> 75 scrap for research (workbench level 1).<br/> The module directly changes the health of the ball, increasing it from 1500 to 2500 HP.<br/> Can only be equipped when the ball is fully deflated.<br/> Repaired with a mallet<br/><br/> :tochka: Changes in \"Assault Helicopter\"<br/> With the introduction of the Attack Helicopter, there are some changes currently in the works. Here\'s a quick rundown of what we saw this week:<br/> :toch:The attack helicopter can now fire missiles from the pilot\'s seat<br/> :toch:The upward movement range of the combat helicopter turret has been reduced<br/> :toch:It is forbidden to press the \"down\" button to fly up when the helicopter is inverted<br/><br/> :tochka: Parachute<br/> With parachutes set to arrive next week, we\'re seeing some tweaks and finishing touches. Here are some highlights:<br/><br/> :toch:Added an additional slot to the clothing section on the player\'s corpse for backpacks<br/> :toch:The clearance check has been increased, now to open the parachute a sphere radius of 1.5 m and a height of 10 m under the player is required<br/> :toch:Added parachute sounds<br/><br/> :tochka: Other<br/> :toch:Work is underway on hand-held and helicopter-mounted flares (probably to combat homing missiles)<br/> :toch:More work on boat drift - all boats drift towards shore when abandoned<br/> :toch:Rust PVE mode (convar) now allows players to shoot NPCs<br/> :toch:Show sleeping bags on the bottom layer of the map view on the in-game map, but keep them on top on the death screen so they can be clicked<br/> :toch:The tow can accommodate weapon racks and a clan table<br/> :toch:More work on the tutorial island'),
(10875, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: what\'s new?'),
(10876, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins in Rust: new items, trade-offs, game balance, player feedback, and the opportunity to express your style and personality.'),
(10877, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, game, new items, compromises, game balance, player feedback, style, personality'),
(10878, 'en-US', '<p>There is never a dull moment in the world of the popular game Rust, especially when a new batch of skins is released. In this article, we will dive into the fascinating world of Rust and tell you about the freshest and most exciting skins that have just appeared in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Skins play a huge role in Rust, adding brightness, individuality and the ability to stand out from other players to the game world. Each new batch of skins brings a fresh wind of change to the game reality and makes players dream of new possibilities for their character.</p><br/><br/><p> The new skin collection that has just been released contains a whole host of unique and varied items, from weapons and clothing to building elements and tools. You will have to dive into the world of creativity and choose the perfect option for your character.</p><br/><br/><p> But in this article, we’re not just sharing information about the availability of new skins. We’re also going to tell you about the balance and compromises the game developers make when adding new skins. Each new item must meet the game’s balance requirements and not disrupt the game’s mechanics. We’ll look at how the developers pay attention to these aspects and how they ensure that new skins don’t disrupt the gameplay experience for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, in this article, we will highlight the importance of considering the impact of decision-making on the gaming community. Rust developers always strive to listen to the opinions of players and take into account their suggestions and requests. We will consider what impact player feedback has on further development and the addition of new skins to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Find out all this and more in our article about the new batch of skins in the game Rust. Get ready to dive into the amazing world of colors, style and individuality to become a real hero in Rust!</p>'),
(10879, 'en-US', 'Armored Balloon'),
(10880, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new armored balloon in Rust and its protective properties.'),
(10881, 'en-US', 'armored balloon, module, defense, HP, bullets'),
(10882, 'en-US', 'Armored Balloon - The Protection You\'ve Been Looking For'),
(10883, 'en-US', 'First shots of the armored ball: a look at the new additional armored module'),
(10884, 'en-US', 'The Rust universe has seen the first images of a mysterious armored ball on the horizon, which is likely to be a new additional armor module in the game. Find out more details about this interesting and significant update in the article!'),
(10885, 'en-US', 'armored ball, armored module, Rust, game update'),
(10886, 'en-US', '<h2>First shots of the armored ball: a look at the new additional armored module</h2><br/><br/><p> There are new changes on the horizon in the Rust universe that will definitely interest every survivor. Information has appeared about the appearance of a mysterious armored ball, the details of which are only just beginning to become clear.</p><br/><br/><p> In recent images released by the developers, we can see the details of this ball, and in all likelihood, it could be a new additional armor module designed to strengthen the base and increase security.</p><br/><br/><p> The first thing that catches the eye is its impressive size and massiveness, which indicates its potential ability to resist enemy attacks. The ball also has several open windows, which means it has the ability to attack from the inside or observe the surrounding area. However, there is no information yet on what additional function this module will provide.</p><br/><br/><p> Armored Balls have already proven their effectiveness in protecting the base from enemy attacks. The factories for the production of this new module are just starting to work, and this opens up the opportunity for players to fortify their bases and increase the level of defense for more successful survival.</p><br/><br/><p> The prospect of a new additional armor module being added to Rust promises exciting changes, generates excitement among players, and confirms the game will be constantly updated. Stay tuned for the latest news and details on this new armor module in Rust!</p>'),
(10887, 'en-US', 'Homing missile launcher'),
(10888, 'en-US', 'In this review, we will consider the homing missile launcher and its features. Thanks to advanced navigation and homing technologies, it allows achieving high accuracy in hitting the target and minimizing risks for military personnel.'),
(10889, 'en-US', 'homing missile launcher, review, flash, video, navigation, accuracy, speed, application, weapons'),
(10890, 'en-US', 'In today\'s review, we will look at the homing missile launcher, which is the latest in weapons technology. It is a device capable of delivering precise and effective strikes on designated targets.'),
(10891, 'en-US', 'Improving the rendering of buildings in the game Rust'),
(10892, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest improvements to building rendering in Rust that will improve performance and enhance the gaming experience for all players.'),
(10893, 'en-US', 'Rust, rendering, buildings, improvements, performance, bases, players, test branch, notifications'),
(10894, 'en-US', '<p>The test branch of the Rust game is actively working on improving the rendering of buildings. The developer of the project, Jake Rich, reports that after the changes, the game\'s performance in some conditions has increased by 40% or more.</p><br/><p> Previously, base rendering was done on the processor, which reduced performance on large servers. With the new method, rendering is transferred to the video card, which significantly speeds up the process. Now players will be able to observe buildings on the entire map without losing performance.</p><br/><p> In addition, Jake plans to optimize other building elements so that bases do not become a performance issue for players.</p><br/><p> If you want to stay up to date with all the news and receive notifications first, don\'t forget to turn on notifications.</p>'),
(10895, 'en-US', 'Locker update'),
(10896, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has brought changes to the changing lockers. Find out what exactly has changed and how it will affect you.'),
(10897, 'en-US', 'Locker update, Rust, changes, locker for changing clothes'),
(10898, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust has brought changes to the clothing lockers. The main change is the addition of a new parachute slot.</p><br/><br/><p> Here\'s what\'s changed:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> Increased the number of slots to 42, including a new slot for a parachute, giving you even more space to store your gear.</li><br/><li> The new parachute slot is designed for backpacks only, so you can conveniently place your backpack before jumping.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> In addition, other changes were made:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> The user interface of the tool cabinet has been improved. Now you can easily switch between tool categories and use them in your work. In addition, an additional slot has been added and the use of a spray can of tools is allowed.</li><br/><li> Work is also underway on new FX rocket trails, which will be more realistic and spectacular.</li><br/><li> Updated balloon lighting and improved effects. Now the balloon will look even more attractive.</li><br/><li> Finally, a new homing missile launcher is being worked on. Soon, a new weapon will appear in the game that will allow you to effectively deal with opponents.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> The locker update is an important step in the development of the Rust game, and we hope you enjoy all the new features.</p>'),
(10899, 'en-US', 'Information about the new batch of skins in the game Rust'),
(10900, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins added to Rust and how they allow players to decorate and customize their items.'),
(10901, 'en-US', 'skins, game Rust, new batch, update'),
(10902, 'en-US', '<p>A new batch of skins has been released in the game Rust! Players now have the opportunity to purchase and decorate their items with unique and stylish skins. In this article, we will look at all the new skins added in the latest update of the game.</p><br/><br/><h2> New collection of skins</h2><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes a wide selection of variations for various items in the game. The collection includes skins for weapons, armor, tools, as well as bases and decorative elements. These skins offer players the opportunity to decorate their items and stand out in the world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><h2> Variety of designs</h2><br/><p> The new batch of skins offers a variety of designs to suit all tastes of players. From bright and flashy colors to stylish and minimalist patterns, there is something for everyone. Players will be able to create unique combinations of skins to give their items a personal touch.</p><br/><br/><h2> Skins Economy</h2><br/><p> Skins in the game Rust also have economic value. Some rare and popular skins can be sold or exchanged for in-game currency. This opens up new opportunities for players who want to make money on their skins or buy a desired item.</p><br/><br/><h2> Conclusion</h2><br/><p> A new batch of skins has been released in Rust, offering players unique opportunities to decorate and customize their items. The variety of designs and economic value of skins make them an important part of the gaming experience. Don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection and create a unique look in Rust!</p>'),
(10903, 'en-US', 'New items of future skins (contenders) Charitable Rust 2023'),
(10904, 'en-US', 'Find out about the upcoming new skins that will be contenders for participation in the Charitable Rust 2023 charity event.'),
(10905, 'en-US', 'new skins, challengers, Charitable Rust 2023, charity event'),
(10906, 'en-US', 'Scientific Analysis of Upcoming Skins (Contenders) for Charitable Rust 2023'),
(10907, 'en-US', 'The parachute is now available on the test branch'),
(10908, 'en-US', 'The Rust test branch now has a parachute available, which adds an exciting element to the gameplay and allows players to explore the game world from a new perspective.'),
(10909, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam game, parachute, test branch, update, feature, survival'),
(10910, 'en-US', 'The long-awaited ability to use a parachute has already appeared on the test branch of the Rust game. This new update adds an exciting element to the gameplay, allowing players to explore the game world from a new perspective. Now you can safely move around the huge map, jumping from heights and enjoying the beautiful views before landing gently on the ground. The parachute is not only a means of transport, but also a survival tool. It will help you avoid falling from a great height and save your life. It is important to note that the parachute is only available on the test branch of the Rust game. The developers continue to refine this feature and are waiting for user feedback to make it even better. If you can’t wait and want to try the parachute now, go to the test branch of the game and begin your unforgettable journey in the skies.'),
(10911, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam: Twitch Drops from September 7th to 14th'),
(10912, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Round from September 7th to September 14th - Get exclusive skins for the game Rust on Steam! Update your collection and stand out from other players.'),
(10913, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam, Twitch Drops, Skins, Rust Game, Collection Update'),
(10914, 'en-US', '<p>You have a chance to get exclusive skins for the game Rust in the new round of Twitch Drops! From September 7 to 14, you will be able to watch streams and get unique items for your account.</p><br/><p> At the moment, the developers have announced 6 available skins. The full list will be published soon. You can be sure to expect some exciting and colorful designs for your character and equipment.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss this opportunity to update your skin collection and stand out in the world of Rust. Follow the announcements on Twitch and get your reward!</p>'),
(10915, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins released in Rust: details and review'),
(10916, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins in Rust: new items, updates, balance impact, and collectibles.'),
(10917, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, updates, atmosphere, items, collecting, game balance'),
(10918, 'en-US', '<p>Regular updates in the game Rust always please players with new features and content. And this time the developers did not disappoint fans by releasing a new batch of skins.</p><br/><p> In this article, we will look at the details and features of the new skins, and also tell you about the most interesting and unique items that have appeared in the game.</p><br/><p> New skins give the game Rust a new atmosphere and help to stand out from other players. They affect not only the appearance of weapons and items, but also their characteristics and behavior. In addition, skins can become a valuable object of collecting and trading.</p><br/><p> In this batch of skins you will find a variety of designs, from realistic to futuristic. Much attention has been paid to details and textures, which makes each skin unique and attractive.</p><br/><p> However, choosing new skins is not always that simple. Players have to consider various factors when making decisions, such as price, popularity among the community, suitability to personal preferences, and compatibility with other items.</p><br/><p> In addition, it is important to understand that new skins can affect the balance of the game. Some skins can change the characteristics of items, making them more or less effective in combat. Therefore, developers are constantly working on balancing so that new skins do not disrupt the gameplay.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins in the game Rust is a great opportunity to update your collection, stand out on the battlefield and enjoy new visual effects. You will find all the details about the new skins in our article.</p>'),
(10919, 'en-US', 'HAB Armor, Attack Heli’s, and more!'),
(10920, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll take a look at the latest changes and additions to Rust on Steam. Learn about the new features, balancing of game factors, and how these changes will impact gameplay.'),
(10921, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, update, balancing, armored balloon, attack helicopter, parachutes, boat drift, backpacks, global network bases, new items, improvements'),
(10922, 'en-US', 'HAB Armor, Attack Heli\'s, and more!<br/><br/> Armored hot air balloon.<br/> With the addition of the Attack Helicopter, it looks like the Balloon will be getting an armor upgrade! There are no visuals yet as all work is being done in a separate branch, but overall it looks like there will be some changes coming to this type of air transport.<br/><br/> There\'s no word yet on whether this will be a completely new balloon or just additional armor that can be applied (like the horse armor). We\'ll post more details as soon as we have them.<br/><br/> Progress in creating an attack helicopter<br/> As you may have seen, the Attack Helicopter was added to the staging tree last week. It is a highly maneuverable two-seater helicopter equipped with a gun turret (manual) and rocket launchers (shoots any missiles).<br/><br/> We are seeing progress this week.<br/> Reduced speed and maneuverability of the attack helicopter<br/> Reduced maximum fuel from 1000 to 500<br/> The machine gunner\'s screen is now higher resolution and less blurry/dusty<br/> CD for a salvo of missiles 8 seconds after launching 6 missiles (reload)<br/> We will have full details about the Attack Helicopter closer to September.<br/><br/> Parachutes<br/> In keeping with the above-described air theme, parachutes will apparently also appear in the near future.<br/> We gave the parachutes their own protective properties, making them a little stronger<br/> It takes 4 rifle shots to destroy the parachute, requires some improvements<br/> Improved the transition from the parachute jump animation<br/> Reduced the pickup time of an unpacked parachute to 8 sec (was 12 sec)<br/> The exact timing of the parachutes\' appearance is not yet known, but we will keep you updated as information becomes available.<br/><br/> Drift boats<br/> Boats left in the deep water will soon return to land thanks to the new \"Boat Drift\" feature. In real time, it looks pretty simple: boats left unattended for a while will start drifting back to shore.<br/><br/> Backpacks<br/> Backpack functionality is quickly taking shape in a separate \"hack week\" branch. There have been a lot of commits over the last couple of weeks, and it looks like this project will be one of the ones that was implemented during hack week and will be released into production in the future.<br/> The test backpack adds an extra 24 slots, and it looks like players will soon be able to carry much more than the standard inventory size.<br/><br/> In particular, this week we saw work on:<br/> The backpack is dropped if the player is injured (or killed)<br/> Setting up the ability to move objects using the right mouse button<br/> Clicking on the backpack in the inventory brings up the backpack inventory<br/><br/> Global network databases<br/> Potentially a huge step up in optimization and quality of life, the \"Global Network Bases\" branch has been moved to the regular stage for testing. I\'m not a game developer, but from what I understand, it changes the bases to prefabs (like trees and rocks) on the map, which allows them to render from a much greater distance than before (around 15 squares). This is still in testing, so don\'t be surprised if something changes. However, the fact that it is in normal testing, is a good sign that we may see her in the September update! As always, we\'ll keep you updated.<br/><br/> Other<br/> Work continues on the next building skin - Frontier skin<br/> Work continues on F-15 flyby - looks like it will be dropping flares<br/> The weapon rack reload menu must be held for the amount of time it takes to manually reload the selected weapon.<br/> Testing the new reticle and materials for the 8x scope<br/> Working on new FX rocket tracks<br/> Work on a launcher for homing missiles<br/> Added balloon name and icon to death screen when you get crushed by one<br/> Initial work on a new type of transport - airplane'),
(10923, 'en-US', 'First review of the update - bases'),
(10924, 'en-US', 'Find out about all the new features of the Rust base update. Rendering optimization, prefabs and other changes will make your game smoother and more realistic.'),
(10925, 'en-US', 'update, bases, Rust, rendering, prefabs, performance, delays, Rustoria, players'),
(10926, 'en-US', '<p>Today, the long-awaited update of the bases in the game Rust was released!</p><br/><p> The most interesting news is that work is underway to optimize the rendering of bases for each player. This is intended to improve game performance and reduce waiting time. Now bases will be loaded onto the map as prefabs, like trees and rocks. As you get closer to the base, the quality of its model will gradually improve, providing even more realism.</p><br/><p> One of the most impressive changes will be seen on servers like Rustoria with 1000 people - the game will become simply incredible! With excellent performance and without the once usual delays, each player will be able to enjoy complete freedom and endless possibilities in the virtual world of Rust.</p>'),
(10927, 'en-US', 'Minor changes to the attack helicopter in the game Rust!'),
(10928, 'en-US', 'Learn about the small changes to the combat copter in Rust that make it more maneuverable and deadly. Controls and weapons have been improved, but the trade-off is increased fuel consumption. Players will have to adapt to the new conditions and use combat copters wisely.'),
(10929, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, combat copter, changes, improvements, gameplay, controls, weapons, fuel, gameplay'),
(10930, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update has brought some small changes to the combat copter, one of the most dangerous vehicles and weapons in the game. In this article, we\'ll take a look at what changes have been made and how they will impact gameplay.<br/><br/> One of the major changes concerns the combat copter controls. Players will now have an easier time maneuvering it in the air, thanks to an improved response to commands. This will allow for more precise execution of complex maneuvers and avoidance of dangers during air battles.<br/><br/> In addition, changes have been made to the combat copter\'s armament. It now has improved shooting accuracy, making it an even more dangerous opponent for players on the ground. The ammunition capacity has also been increased, allowing for longer battles without the need for constant reloading.<br/><br/> However, along with the improvements, there have also been some trade-offs. The Attack Copter consumes more fuel, meaning players will have to plan their flights more carefully and visit gas stations more often. This adds a new layer of complexity to using the Attack Copter and requires players to think strategically.<br/><br/> The small changes to the combat copter in Rust are an important aspect of the gameplay. They bring balance to the gameplay, making combat helicopters powerful and dangerous, but requiring a tactical approach. Players will have to study and master the new capabilities and apply them in their survival strategy.<br/><br/> Stay tuned for new Rust game updates to stay up to date with all the changes and improvements that make the gameplay even more interesting!'),
(10931, 'en-US', 'New upcoming skins from the workshop: expected new additions'),
(10932, 'en-US', 'Learn about the most anticipated upcoming skins from the Rust Workshop and opportunities for player expression.'),
(10933, 'en-US', 'new skins, future skins, workshop, Rust, design, game world, uniqueness, self-expression');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(10934, 'en-US', '<p>The world of Rust on Steam is constantly seeing new and unique skins that allow players to add personality to their characters and items. In this article, we will tell you about the most anticipated new skins from the workshop.</p><br/><p> The Workshop is a platform where talented artists present their creations and have the opportunity to become part of the Rust game world. Here, players can find and download a wide variety of skins for weapons, clothing, buildings, and other items.</p><br/><p> However, in order for a skin to be included in the game, it needs to pass the selection and get enough votes from the community. Of the many skins presented in the workshop, only some will become available in the game itself.</p><br/><p> We analyzed all the contenders for new skins and chose the most interesting and promising ones. Each of them has its own features and unique design, which will certainly attract the attention of players.</p><br/><p> Among the future skins, you can find categories such as weapons - from powerful assault rifles to stylish knives, clothing - from camouflage uniforms to bright and original outfits, as well as buildings - from fortified buildings to cozy houses.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that the selection of new skins is a complex process, where developers balance between uniqueness and harmony in the game world, taking into account many factors. They also take into account the opinions and preferences of players to create a unique atmosphere and the opportunity for self-expression through skins.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned to be the first to learn about new skins and features for your unique Rust gaming experience.</p>'),
(10935, 'en-US', 'Building Block Wallpaper: A Decorating Possibility in Rust'),
(10936, 'en-US', 'Check out the new feature in the Rust file system - building block wallpapers that let you add style and personality to the inside of your walls.'),
(10937, 'en-US', 'wallpaper, building blocks, decorating, Rust'),
(10938, 'en-US', '<p>Attention, Rust players! New building block wallpapers have been discovered in the game\'s file system, opening up exciting possibilities for decorating the inside of walls in the game.</p><br/><p> Building Block Wallpapers will give players the opportunity to give their base a personal style and a comfortable atmosphere. You will be able to use the wallpapers to decorate your virtual home, bunker or any other structure in Rust.</p><br/><p> The uniqueness of the wallpaper functionality is its repaintability. You can choose any desired color for the wallpaper and create a real masterpiece in your base. Thanks to several variations of wallpaper, you can choose the most suitable style for your construction project.</p><br/><p> Currently, the wallpaper functionality is only available on the test branch of the game, but their presence in the files suggests that they will become a new feature of Rust in the near future.</p><br/><p> The introduction of building block wallpapers to Rust opens up new horizons for creative decorating and turning your base into a unique place in the post-apocalyptic world. Stay up to date with the latest updates so you don’t miss out on the opportunity to create a truly stylish shelter!</p>'),
(10939, 'en-US', 'Work on a controlled aircraft in the game RUST'),
(10940, 'en-US', 'The developers of the RUST game are currently working on creating a controllable aircraft that can be assembled from improvised means, like other types of air transport in the game.'),
(10941, 'en-US', 'developers, RUST game, controlled aircraft, improvised means, air transport'),
(10942, 'en-US', 'Great news for fans of the RUST game! The developers are now actively working on creating a controllable aircraft that can be assembled from improvised means, just like other types of air transport in the game. This exciting feature was planned back in February 2022, and the development team has been working on creating this feature ever since.'),
(10943, 'en-US', 'Charitable Rust 2023: An Anticipated Charity Event'),
(10944, 'en-US', 'Learn about the Charitable Rust 2023 charity event, upcoming Twitch drops, and exclusive skins available for Rust players.'),
(10945, 'en-US', 'charity event, Charitable Rust 2023, Twitch drops, skins, drops'),
(10946, 'en-US', 'From October 14th to 15th, Charitable Rust 2023 will be held, which promises to be an unforgettable event in the world of Rust. During this event, players will be able to take part in charity, making the world a better place together and supporting various organizations.<br/><br/> The event will focus on new Twitch drops - exclusive items that players can earn by watching streams and participating in various events. This is not only a great opportunity to check out the pictures, but also a nice bonus for all Rust fans.<br/><br/> The article presents the contender skins that will be part of the drops during the event. Players will be able to choose from a variety of options to make their game more unique and vibrant.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to take part in the Charitable Rust 2023 charity event and get exclusive items for your Rust character!'),
(10947, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: fresh opportunities for players'),
(10948, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skins that have arrived in the latest update for Rust on Steam.'),
(10949, 'en-US', 'new skins, skins batch, Rust game, game update, Steam'),
(10950, 'en-US', '<p>Rust players on Steam have received another update - a new batch of skins that offer players new ways to customize the look of their items and weapons. This update opens up unique ways for self-expression and allows each player to highlight their individuality.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins offer a wide range of designs and styles, allowing players to customize their equipment to their taste. They can add brightness and originality to the appearance of items, making them more unique and noticeable among other players.</p><br/><br/><p> The skins introduced in the update include a variety of weapon variations, protective gear, and cosmetic items. Each of these skins is designed with the latest trends in mind and is inspired by different styles and themes.</p><br/><br/><p> However, choosing skins is not only a matter of style and aesthetics, but also an important aspect of tactics in the game Rust. A properly chosen skin can create a certain atmosphere on the battlefield and help you stand out among other players. In addition, some skins can have practical benefits, such as adding special effects or bonuses to equipment.</p><br/><br/><p> However, when deciding to buy or use new skins, players should also pay attention to their cost and availability. Some skins can be very rare and expensive, which requires the player to make a balanced choice. The balance between the desire to have a beautiful skin and the availability of its purchase is an important factor to consider.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, the new batch of skins in Rust gives players the opportunity to upgrade their items and weapons, highlight their individuality, and also introduce important tactical aspects to the gameplay. When choosing skins, players should carefully evaluate their cost and choose those that really match their playstyle and budget.</p>'),
(10951, 'en-US', 'Read the latest news about Rust updates on Steam. The article covers topics such as boat drifting, backpack additions, the Flyby event, and the tutorial island.'),
(10952, 'en-US', 'News from the Field, Drift Boats, Backpacks, Flyby, Learning Island'),
(10953, 'en-US', 'News from the fields<br/><br/> :tochka: Boat drift<br/> The first entries in the \"Boats at the End of the World\" branch show a new feature that will make boats gradually float towards the shore if left alone. This is a separate branch for now, and specific speeds and details are not available, but it would be great if abandoned boats appeared on the shore in the near future!<br/><br/> :tochka:Backpacks<br/> The hackweek \"Backpack\" branch is actively being worked on. As the name suggests, it looks like the first backpack integrations for players are already in the works. The test backpack adds an additional 24 slots, and it looks like players will soon be able to carry much more than the standard inventory size. It should be noted that, as with other heck week projects, this may not make it into the game. There are no visuals in the separate branch yet, but there is information that if they do appear, they will have skins on them.<br/><br/> :tochka:Flyby<br/> Some updates to the Flyby event at the end of the wipe or on the way. In particular, a new model of the 15E Strike Eagle fighter has been added. There is no visual design yet, as it is in a separate branch, but in the near future the end of the wipe may become even more spicy!<br/><br/> :tochka:Learning Island<br/> First revealed last week, the tutorial island thread is becoming increasingly popular. There\'s no word yet on what exactly this island is, but it looks like it could be a place where people can get to grips with the game in the future. We\'ll keep you posted as more is revealed.'),
(10954, 'en-US', 'New combat copter is already on the test branch!'),
(10955, 'en-US', 'A new combat copter is already on the test branch of the game Rust! The developers offer players a unique opportunity to engage in air battles and build new strategies. Find out more about the new combat copter and its impact on the game in our article.'),
(10956, 'en-US', 'game Rust, combat copter, test branch, air battles, military tactics'),
(10957, 'en-US', '<p>Fans of Rust on Steam can expect new ways to engage in aerial combat! The developers recently announced a new combat copter on the game\'s test branch.</p><br/><p> The new combat copter offers players the unique ability to engage in aerial combat, supporting their team on the ground and striking enemies from the air. This opens up entirely new strategies and tactics to the game and adds even more military tactics options for players.</p><br/><p> However, the introduction of the new combat copter did not come without compromise. The developers were forced to balance its strength and durability to reduce its potential impact on game balance. As a result, players will have to learn to use the new tool wisely to achieve maximum efficiency and minimize risks.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that the combat copter is already available on the test branch of the game, which means that players have the opportunity to try it out and evaluate its capabilities. This allows the developers to collect feedback from players and make the necessary adjustments before its full implementation in the game.</p><br/><p> Overall, the addition of a new combat copter to the Rust test branch opens up new perspectives for overall gameplay and military action. Players can expect interesting and dynamic aerial combat, while the developers continue to work on improving and refining the gaming experience.</p>'),
(10958, 'en-US', 'Development of weapon racks in Rust continues'),
(10959, 'en-US', 'This article discusses the continued development of weapon racks in Rust and rumors of a possible new DLC related to this feature.'),
(10960, 'en-US', 'Rust, weapon racks, DLC, development'),
(10961, 'en-US', 'One of the important aspects of the game Rust is the possession of weapons and their use in the fight for survival. And the developers continue to work on improving and diversifying the weapon arsenal by adding new features and elements. One of the latest developments is weapon racks.<br/><br/> Weapon racks are a functional element that allows players to easily and conveniently place their weapons in a position that is convenient for them. They complement the inventory system and make it easier to access weapons in stressful situations.<br/><br/> Recently, rumors have surfaced that the developers are working on another new DLC that will focus on weapon racks. This could be an exciting addition that will open up new options for players and allow them to experience a more complete and realistic weapon experience in Rust.<br/><br/> It is worth noting that the development and implementation of new features always involves some compromises and balancing. Developers must consider various factors such as the game economy, gameplay, and weapon balance to ensure a pleasant and balanced experience for all players.'),
(10962, 'en-US', 'Update with new skins and fixes in the game Rust'),
(10963, 'en-US', 'The Rust skins and fixes update brings new content and improvements to players that enhance the gameplay experience and fix various issues in the game.'),
(10964, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, new skins, emoji, fixes, game, changes, content, problems, improvements'),
(10965, 'en-US', 'The update has been released, the main thing is a new skin for buildings and emojis in the game chat.<br/><br/> :tochka: Minor corrections and fixes:<br/><br/> :toch: Changed the wounded user interface, now it displays additional information about the health status. It also shows the probability of recovery and the number of seconds left until recovery/death.<br/><br/> :tochka: Fixes<br/> :toch: C4 and Sachel charges can now be placed on all vehicles.<br/> :toch: Added new model for laser detector<br/> :toch: Added variations of the ammunition model depending on the stack size.<br/> :toch: Fixed inability to swim through the door of tugs submerged underwater at a steep angle<br/> :toch: Fixed players being pulled down from sinking tugboats.<br/> :toch: Fixed non-compliance with the maximum quantity on the industrial conveyor when reloading several items with different skins<br/> :toch: Fixed a bug where the industrial conveyor would not move an item if the output container contained a broken version of that item.<br/> :toch: Increasing the class of a building block should be much less likely to destroy industrial pipes located along it<br/> :toch: When gutting a fish, the correct item count popup is now displayed.<br/> :toch: Fixed broken command \"cinematiclist\"<br/> :toch: It is no longer possible to place towels under the foundation<br/> :toch: Fixed spaces in RHIB<br/> :toch: Fixed the lack of an antenna on the radio transmitter in the world model<br/> :toch: Fixed the position of the 16x scope on the homemade LMG so that it doesn\'t hit the face in 3rd person<br/> :toch: Fixed broken pile of concrete debris in the lighthouse<br/> :toch: Fixed holes in the exterior of the lighthouse<br/> :toch: Fixed getting stuck on pipes in arctic base<br/> :toch: Fixed the position and size of ceiling lights in the supermarket<br/> :toch: Fixed the disappearance of the ceiling in one of the cabins on low graphics settings<br/> :toch: Fixed issues with power line mesh<br/> :toch: Fixed the Abyssal Torch catching fire when dropped.<br/> :toch: Fixed invisible collider near smokestack on small oil rig<br/> :toch: Fixed a bug where some monument lights would glow even if they were turned off.'),
(10966, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins for Rust has appeared on Steam, allowing players to add unique visual models to their items and add more style and originality to the gameplay.'),
(10967, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, unique designs'),
(10968, 'en-US', '<p>Today, a new batch of skins for the game Rust has appeared on Steam. This means that players can now decorate their items in the game with unique external models that add personalization and originality to the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> Each new release of skins in the game Rust is an event for millions of players around the world. The developers are constantly working to offer players a variety of new skins that make the game even more interesting and attractive.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main aspects of the new batch of skins is their design. Each item has a unique design that emphasizes the individuality of the player. From bright and flashy colors to elegant and stylish solutions - the new skins in Rust on Steam allow each player to find something that perfectly suits their taste.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition to design, the economic aspect also plays a significant role. New skins are often collectibles, and their rarity and value can significantly affect their value on the Steam market. Players can trade skins with other players or sell them for real money, which makes skins in the Rust game not only beautiful, but also valuable.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of Rust skins on Steam is also an opportunity for the game developers to showcase their skills and creativity. Using the latest technologies and ideas, the developers create unique skins that bring the game world to life and make it even more attractive to players.</p><br/><br/><p> In conclusion, the new batch of skins in the game Rust on Steam is great news for all players who want to add more style and originality to their gaming experience. Do not miss the opportunity to purchase new skins and decorate your items in the game Rust with unique designs.</p>'),
(10969, 'en-US', 'New Item (Clan Table) Review by Flash'),
(10970, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll look at the new Rust item, the clan table, its benefits, and how to use it. Learn how clans can effectively coordinate and grow, as well as what tradeoffs to consider when using the table.'),
(10971, 'en-US', 'new item, clan table, review, flash, game rust, steam, coordination, development, advantages, use, discipline'),
(10972, 'en-US', 'Hello to all fans of the game Rust on Steam! Today we present you with an overview of a new item - the clan table, from the author Flash. The clan table is an important additional component of the gameplay, which allows clans to more effectively coordinate their actions and develop. In this article, we will consider the main features of the clan table, its advantages and ways of using it.<br/><br/> One of the main advantages of the clan table is the ability to easily and conveniently organize intra-clan delegations. Now clans can divide tasks between their members, for example, assign crafters, builders and hunters, so that each member\'s skills are used to the maximum. Also, with the help of the clan table, you can easily track the plans and goals of the clan, share resources and materials, and manage access to the clan base.<br/><br/> In addition, the clan table has a number of interesting features that allow clans to be more organized and coordinated. For example, with the help of the table, you can create a clan bank, where clan members can deposit and withdraw money for the general needs of the clan. Also, the table allows you to create clan tasks and missions that clan members can complete to receive bonuses and rewards.<br/><br/> The clan table is not just an item, it is a whole tool that contributes to a strong and orderly clan community. However, like any new element in the game, using the clan table also has its trade-offs. Clans must properly organize the work with this item and maintain clear rules of use. Control over access to the table and managing intra-clan conflicts are key aspects of successful use of the clan table.<br/><br/> In conclusion, the clan table is an amazing innovation that brings many advantages and opportunities to clans. It helps clans become more organized and efficient in the game of Rust. However, successful use of the clan table also requires precision and discipline from clans. So, be sure to include this new item in your plans and strategies, and may your clan reach the top of the Rust world!'),
(10973, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins for Rust released on Steam'),
(10974, 'en-US', 'Find out why new skins in Rust on Steam are so important and how they affect gameplay, the economy and incentivize players.'),
(10975, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, item appearance, individuality, balance, economy, variety'),
(10976, 'en-US', '<h1>New Skins in Rust: Where and How Important Are They?</h1><br/><p> Skins are one of the most popular and sought-after elements in the world of video games. They allow you to change the appearance of your items and realize any of your fantasies. And now, finally, the game Rust on Steam is updated with a fresh batch of new skins.</p><br/><p> But how important is it to pay attention to these new items? Is there anything new, exciting, and in demand among players? Let\'s do a little analysis and find out why the new skins in the game Rust have such a big impact on users.</p><br/><br/><h2> Importance of Skins in Rust</h2><br/><p> Skins in the game Rust not only change the appearance of objects, but also add individuality and status. After all, each player has the opportunity to stand out from others, make their items unique and individual. This is also a form of self-expression and creativity, which encourages people to continue playing and creating new skins.</p><br/><br/><h2> Balance between game mechanics and appearance</h2><br/><p> One of the features of Rust is that game items and their appearance are closely related to the game mechanics. It is important to maintain a balance between updates to the appearance of items and their in-game characteristics. Each new skin should not only look beautiful, but also match the game world and not cause imbalance in the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><h2> The Impact of Skins on the Game Economy</h2><br/><p> Skins in Rust also play an important role in the game\'s economy. They can be sold and purchased by players on the Steam Marketplace, creating a whole skin market. New skins contribute to the diversity of supply and demand, creating opportunities for players to earn or spend their money on interesting skins.</p><br/><br/><h2> Variety and variability of new skins</h2><br/><p> Each new batch of skins in the game Rust offers a lot of different options. From weapons and armor to buildings and cars - everyone will find something that suits them. The variety of new skins stimulates interest in the game and creates new opportunities for cooperation and exchange between players.</p><br/><br/><h2> Conclusions</h2><br/><p> The release of a new batch of skins for the game Rust on Steam is always an event that pleases players. Skins add individuality, variety and interesting opportunities for players. It is important to remember the balance between game mechanics and appearance, as well as to consider the impact of skins on the game economy. The game Rust continues to please its users with new and interesting skins, which makes the gameplay even more exciting and unique.</p>'),
(10977, 'en-US', 'Parachutes, attack helicopters and much more!'),
(10978, 'en-US', 'This article covers the latest updates to Rust, including the addition of parachutes, new building skins, and information on the development of the attack helicopter. Learn about the latest changes and improvements that Rust brings.'),
(10979, 'en-US', 'Rust game, updates, parachutes, attack helicopters, building skins'),
(10980, 'en-US', 'Parachutes, attack helicopters and much more!<br/><br/> :tochka: Development of parachutes<br/> Player parachutes have officially emerged from conceptual limbo and are moving towards release. Thanks to a large number of commits over the past few weeks, it looks like parachutes will be added soon (though it\'s unlikely to be in the August update).<br/><br/> This week, work continues on various animations, camera placement, and itemization in various scenarios. Along with this, parachute shooting and damage functionality has been added, a health indicator on the HUD to indicate parachute status, and a visible backpack is being added for players who will be wearing a packed parachute (this will not show up on Hazmat and other Hazmat-based skins). We\'ll keep you updated as more information becomes available.<br/><br/> :tochka:Refinement of the Brick skin<br/> The new building skin, Brick, is getting some finishing touches and polish. This Stone Tier skin is expected to arrive as DLC in the August 3rd update. Barring a few more final tweaks, it looks like it\'s ready to go! Look for it in the item shop before the update and forced wipe next week.<br/><br/> :tochka:Border building skin coming soon<br/> A fourth building skin is in the works in the Building Skins 4 branch. It\'s rumored to be called the \"Frontier skin\" and will mirror the old Legacy Rust wooden skin. It looks like there\'s at least one more skin in the works called Tribalist or Brutalist - we\'ll keep you posted as more is revealed.<br/><br/> :tochka:Attack helicopter<br/> The newest aircraft is back in the works. The attack helicopter has been getting some new love in the last two weeks after being out of development for about a month. It has been merged into the Aux2 branch for internal testing, and it is unclear when exactly it will be coming to the game. However, it looks like it will be available for purchase in the Air Wolf shop (in the bandit), like the other aircraft in the game.<br/><br/> :tochka:Other<br/> :toch: Continuing work on the clan table and clan system (maybe next week!)<br/> :toch:Initial work on a homing missile launcher<br/> :toch:The crafting queue is no longer cancelled when the player falls asleep<br/> :toch:Added an additional collider to the roof of the tug to prevent a breakdown when flooded<br/> :toch:Working on changing the world models for ammunition - world model options will change depending on the amount of ammunition<br/> :toch:Many different art fixes<br/> :toch:Work on global network databases on Aux2 continues<br/> :toch:Work continues on the Rail Network Link, which looks set to link the rail networks \"below\" and \"above\".<br/> :toch:Work continues on a new iteration for Bradley<br/> :toch:Additional small single plantation coming soon<br/> :toch:Finishing touches on server chat emoji<br/><br/> Information taken from - https://vk.com/rustcommru'),
(10981, 'en-US', 'New upcoming skins from the workshop | Rust on Steam'),
(10982, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new upcoming skins for the game Rust on Steam. Let\'s look at the contenders for inclusion in the game and review the workshop where new skins for Rust are created.'),
(10983, 'en-US', 'new Rust skins on Steam, contenders for inclusion in the game, workshop review, skins for Rust'),
(10984, 'en-US', '<h2>New future skins from the workshop</h2><br/><br/><p> If you want to know about the latest skin trends in the game Rust, then you\'ve come to the right place! In this article, we\'ll look at the new skins that are currently vying to be added to the game from the workshop.</p><br/><br/><h3> What is a workshop and how does it work?</h3><br/><br/><p> The Workshop is a platform where the community of players can create and share their own skins for use in the game Rust. Here, everyone can express their creativity and implement their ideas in the form of unique skins.</p><br/><br/><p> To add your skin to the workshop, the player needs to create a model, textures and upload them to the workshop website. After that, the skin undergoes moderation, where its quality and compliance with the rules of the game are checked. If the skin passes the test, it becomes available for community voting.</p><br/><br/><h3> Applicants for inclusion in the game</h3><br/><br/><p> There are currently a ton of potential new skins in the Rust Workshop that could make it into the game. They range in theme from weapons and gear to clothing and home decor.</p><br/><br/><p> Each skin in the workshop has its own page where you can view its model, textures and description. You can also vote for your favorite skin and leave a comment here.</p><br/><br/><h3> What factors influence the decision to add a skin to the game?</h3><br/><br/><p> The decision to add a skin to the Rust game depends on several key factors:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> Popularity and Community Rating: Player votes and comments matter a lot when considering a skin.</li><br/><li> Skin quality and style: The developers pay attention to details, textures, animations and the overall aesthetics of the skin.</li><br/><li> Matching the game theme: the skin must match the atmosphere and style of the game Rust.</li><br/><li> Balance and gameplay advantages: The skin should not give players an advantage in the game or disrupt the balance.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that even if a skin has gained great popularity and positive reviews, the decision to add it to the game is made by the developers. They take into account all factors and try to maintain balance and quality of the gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><h3> Conclusions</h3><br/><br/><p> Checking out the Rust Workshop and learning about upcoming skins is a great way to stay up to date with the latest in the game. Don\'t forget to vote for your favorite skins and share your opinion with the developers. And who knows, maybe your skin will become part of the game!</p>'),
(10985, 'en-US', 'New Nexus Screenshots: Fake or Real?'),
(10986, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will figure out whether the new Nexus screenshots are real or a well-made fake. Read the experts\' opinions and draw your own conclusions.'),
(10987, 'en-US', 'new Nexus screenshots, fake or reality, information technology, authenticity of content'),
(10988, 'en-US', '<p>There has been a lot of talk lately about new screenshots of the Nexus game, which have caused a heated debate among the gaming community. But what is the truth? Will these screenshots be the most realistic ones, or are they just a well-made fake?</p><p> Today we will take a closer look at these screenshots and analyze all aspects that will help us make a more informed opinion. What evidence is there in favor of their authenticity, and what arguments indicate that these screenshots could have been created using graphic editors?</p><p> Our article will give you all the necessary facts and data that will allow you to evaluate the authenticity of these screenshots. Let\'s figure out what experts in this field say and analyze their opinions.</p><p> We will also look at possible motives for creating such fakes and try to understand why it is necessary to create screenshots that are so similar to the real thing. What advantages or interests might be associated with such a practice?</p><br/><p> At the end of the article, you will be able to draw your own conclusions and express your opinion about these screenshots. Be prepared for some surprising discoveries and unexpected dives into the world of information technology and issues of content authenticity in online games.</p>'),
(10989, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Review of the Latest Batch of Skins'),
(10990, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins for Rust that add uniqueness and style to your gaming experience. Skin updates allow you to customize your playstyle and stay engaged while surviving in a post-apocalyptic world.'),
(10991, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, skins batch, skins updates, game style, survival'),
(10992, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust, where you must fight for survival in a post-apocalyptic environment!</p><br/><p> We are pleased to announce the release of a new batch of skins for the game Rust. New skins will not only help you stand out from other players, but will also add uniqueness and style to your gaming experience.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes a wide selection of items that impress with their detail, quality and design. From cool weapons to protective gear, there is something for everyone.</p><br/><p> The new skins are suitable for both beginners and experienced players. With a wide range of choices, you can customize your gaming style and create a unique image.</p><br/><p> Skin updates are an important part of the game\'s evolution and constantly add fresh elements to the world of Rust. They help the game stay interesting and inspire players to new achievements.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to purchase new skins and transform your virtual image. Dive into the world of Rust and plunge into a new level of survival with a grand batch of skins!</p>'),
(10993, 'en-US', 'This article covers news and updates for Rust on Steam, including the mandatory update, rail network connection, weapon racks, parachutes, brick, and base optimization.'),
(10994, 'en-US', 'News, field, update, communication, railway network, weapon racks, parachutes, brick, base optimization'),
(10995, 'en-US', 'News from the fields<br/><br/> :kv: Mandatory update next week<br/> It looks like there will be a mandatory server and client update early next week. Details are still unknown, but the update won\'t force wipe the game or anything like that. However, both players and server owners will need to run the update.<br/><br/> :kv:Connection to the railway network<br/> There\'s a new line called the \"rail network\". Could this be the first iteration of some sort of transition between the overground and underground rail networks?! This is pure speculation as nothing has been confirmed, but it would be really cool if it were!<br/><br/> :kv:Gun Racks<br/> The elusive weapon racks have arrived at the Aux1 staging area! These racks - 3 wall-mounted and 1 floor-mounted - are a great way to store weapons and add some extra decor around your base. Aside from looking cool, these racks have the unique ability to quickly place and retrieve weapons with the press of a single button (default: E).<br/><br/> There is no word on when exactly they will be coming to the game, but there are rumors that weapon racks will be included in a DLC pack (not confirmed). We will post more information as soon as it becomes available.<br/><br/> :kv:Parachutes<br/> The parachute branch has seen some serious work this week. After a year of inactivity, we started seeing glimmers of progress on parachutes last week. Work is currently focused on things like initial drag and fall physics, camera placement/control, and other \"high jumps.\"<br/><br/> In short, at the moment, judging by the number of decisions made, the parachutes will be like this:<br/> Reusable (with durability)<br/> Worn as a backpack (in a visible place)<br/> While in use, you can hold and fire weapons, but you cannot control the parachute.<br/><br/> It is not yet known when these parachutes will appear, but they are already quite far from the concept!<br/><br/> :kv:Brick!<br/> As you may remember, last week the next building skin, Brick, was added to staging. There weren\'t even a ton of brick-related commits this week, I just wanted to show off this awesome skin more! It\'s expected to arrive as DLC in the August 3rd update.<br/><br/> It looks like there\'s another skin in the works. The Tribalist or Brutalist skin looks like it\'s next on the list after Brick. Will this be the first skin for wooden buildings in Rust? Let\'s hope so!<br/><br/> :kv:Database optimization<br/> Work continues on the Global Network Database branch. Most of the commits this week are code-oriented, but the short version is that work on this feature is moving at a fast pace and is being tested internally on the Aux2 branch. Considering that it will significantly improve database loading, rendering distance, and more, I\'m really looking forward to it! No word yet on when exactly that will happen.'),
(10996, 'en-US', 'The final look of the gun racks: electric lighting and convenience'),
(10997, 'en-US', 'The final look of the weapon racks in the game Rust on Steam offers a power connection for lighting, an improvement that will add convenience and style to your base.'),
(10998, 'en-US', 'Rust, weapon racks, electric lighting, functionality, improvement, game on Steam'),
(10999, 'en-US', '<p>Rust on Steam is constantly being updated to provide players with new features and functions. One of the latest updates has added an improvement that will appeal to all those who are keen on collecting and storing weapons in the game.</p><br/><p> The final look of the gun racks now supports power, allowing you to light and organize your weapons so that they are always at hand. Now you can easily find the gun you need even in the dark.</p><br/><p> To connect the racks to electricity, you will need to build and set up an electrical network at your base. This may require additional resources and effort, but the result is worth it. You will be able to enjoy the convenience and functionality that shelving with electric lighting provides.</p><br/><p> In addition to convenience, electric illumination of weapon racks also adds style to your base. You can create different lighting effects, emphasizing your individuality and style in the game.</p><br/><p> This weapon rack improvement is another step forward in the development of the Rust game. The developers are constantly taking into account the wishes of the players and strive to offer them new features and functions. Thus, the game becomes more and more interesting and diverse.</p><br/><p> If you\'re a fan of Rust on Steam and enjoy collecting and storing weapons in the game, the new Illuminated Weapon Rack upgrade will be a great addition to your base. Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to improve the usability, style, and functionality of your gaming experience.</p>'),
(11000, 'en-US', 'First look at the new gun racks'),
(11001, 'en-US', 'New weapon racks have been added to Rust in the latest updates. Find out how they can make your game easier and protect you in the world of Rust.'),
(11002, 'en-US', 'weapon rack, new racks, updates, Rust, base, weapon access'),
(11003, 'en-US', '<p>The latest updates to Rust have introduced the ability to interact with new weapon racks. These racks allow players to place their weapons in convenient locations and have quick access to them when needed.</p><br/><p> At the moment, the ability to attach weapons to a rack is not yet implemented, but the developers promise to add this feature soon. This means that in the near future, players will be able to leave their weapons on the rack when they leave the base or go to explore the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> New weapon racks will be a great addition to the player\'s base. They will help save space and order in the inventory, and also provide easy access to weapons in case of an attack or need for protection. Each player will be able to choose the most suitable rack for their base and customize it to their needs.</p><br/><p> Although the weapon rack\'s capabilities are currently limited, players have already come up with a large number of ideas and suggestions on how to improve this feature. The developers are closely studying the feedback from players and plan to make several changes in future updates to make weapon racks more convenient and functional.</p><br/><p> Stay connected to the world of Rust, stay tuned for new updates, and be sure to try out the new weapon racks as soon as they become available!</p>'),
(11004, 'en-US', 'New upcoming skins from the Rust workshop'),
(11005, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest and greatest skins that could be coming to Rust. We look at the different categories of skins and how they affect gameplay.'),
(11006, 'en-US', 'new, skins, workshop, Rust, game'),
(11007, 'en-US', '<h2>New upcoming skins from the Rust workshop</h2><br/><p> Check out the latest and greatest skins that are available to purchase in Rust!</p><br/><p> The Rust Workshop is a place where creative players can share their ideas and create unique skins for weapons, tools, and other items in the game. In this article, we will look at the most interesting and promising contenders for appearance in the game!</p><br/><p> We\'ll be looking at different categories of skins, such as weapons, clothing, vehicles, and buildings, to give you an idea of the variety of new features coming to Rust.</p><br/><p> Each skin has a unique design and style that can change the appearance of your character and the items you use. They can set you apart from other players and add personality to your in-game experience.</p><br/><p> However, it is important to understand that adding new skins can affect the balance and gameplay. Rust developers try to find a balance between new features and maintaining the level of purity of the game world. That is why choosing new skins is a complex process that requires careful analysis and testing.</p><br/><p> We will also consider the players\' opinions, wishes and preferences regarding new skins. Your opinion is important and it can influence the decision-making when choosing skins to add to the game.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to keep an eye on the Rust Workshop for updates and news, as that\'s where new potential skins are constantly appearing that could become part of your gaming experience!</p>'),
(11008, 'en-US', 'Nexus is getting closer and closer to release'),
(11009, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have introduced the Nexus system, which will allow players to travel between servers and transfer resources, adding new features to the game.'),
(11010, 'en-US', 'Nexus, Rust, travel, servers, release'),
(11011, 'en-US', '<p>Rust Game: Traveling Between Servers with Nexus System</p><br/><p> The developers of the game Rust have introduced a new Nexus system, which is getting closer to release every day. It will allow players to travel between servers with amazing ease.</p><br/><p> The main feature of the Nexus system is the ferry that departs from the port terminal. Players will be able to use this ferry or, if they have their own transport, go on exciting journeys between servers.</p><br/><p> The Nexus system allows players to transfer resources from one server to another, creating new opportunities and adventures, expanding the boundaries of the Rust game world.</p><br/><p> The developers are working on further optimization and tuning of the Nexus system so that it will be fully ready for the official launch. Players are already looking forward to this moment, which will certainly add new exciting aspects to the game Rust.</p>'),
(11012, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: An Extended Look at the Latest Batch of Parties'),
(11013, 'en-US', 'In our review of the latest batch of Rust skins, you\'ll find useful tips and tricks for choosing new skins, as well as key factors to consider. Update your collection and add a new dimension to your gameplay!'),
(11014, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, update, choice, tips, commands, prices, rarity'),
(11015, 'en-US', '<h2>New Skins in Rust: An Extended Look at the Latest Batch of Parties</h2><br/><br/><p> Today we are pleased to announce another important update to the game Rust! The developers have released another batch of new skins that will add a breath of fresh air and a new dimension to your gaming atmosphere.</p><br/><br/><p> Each new batch of skins is an opportunity for players to express their individuality, create a unique look or add a bit of style to their base and equipment. Each skin is a unique work of art, designed by a team of talented artists.</p><br/><br/><p> However, choosing new skins is not always easy. The collection presented offers a wide range of options, from original designs to classic images. When choosing new skins, you will face various compromises, such as cost, rarity, or suitability to individual preferences.</p><br/><br/><p> In this article, we\'ll be taking a comprehensive look at the latest batch of skins for Rust to help you make an informed choice. We\'ll cover the key factors that influence the content of these new items, as well as share our recommendations and impressions.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to update your gaming skin collection and add some freshness and variety to your gaming experience. Read our review and choose the best skins for your gaming style!</p><br/><br/><p> All new skins are available in the Steam store and you can update your collection today. We wish you a pleasant choice and a great time in the world of the game Rust!</p>'),
(11016, 'en-US', 'New building skin is now available on the test branch!'),
(11017, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Brick building skin, now available on the Rust test branch.'),
(11018, 'en-US', 'new skin, buildings, test branch, Rust, brick, DLC, update'),
(11019, 'en-US', 'Now on the test branch there is a new skin for buildings - \"Brick\". It creates an atmosphere of classic red brick and will add uniqueness to your future base in the game Rust!<br/> Even though the skin is still in development and needs some tweaking, everything points to the fact that this fresh DLC will be available in the August update in a couple of weeks.'),
(11020, 'en-US', 'Work is in full swing on the parachute in the game Rust'),
(11021, 'en-US', 'Rust is currently in development with a new update that includes the addition of a parachute. Learn more about the parachute\'s implementation and its impact on gameplay!'),
(11022, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, parachute, movement, tactics, survival'),
(11023, 'en-US', '<p>There is a new update in development for Rust that includes the addition of a parachute. The development team is currently hard at work implementing it into the game to provide players with a new way to move and a tactical advantage.</p><br/><p> One of the key features of this update is the addition of a clothing slot specifically designed for a parachute. Players will now be able to equip a parachute directly to themselves, allowing them to be ready for a quick and safe jump from a height.</p><br/><p> The work on the implementation of the parachute is expected to be completed soon, and players will be able to enjoy a new adventure by expanding their capabilities in the game Rust. Thanks to the parachute, they will be able to move more efficiently around the map, avoid dangers and create new tactical solutions during the game.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned for more information on the parachute\'s implementation in Rust and to get a chance to try it out for yourself. Soon you\'ll be able to dive into the exciting world of survival with a new means of transportation and exploration.</p>'),
(11024, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Changelog'),
(11025, 'en-US', 'The latest Rust update brings fixes and improvements including object animations, ferry, patrol helicopter, and data rendering. Find out more about the update.'),
(11026, 'en-US', 'game Rust, Steam, update, Changelog, fixes, improvements, object animation, ferry, helicopter, rendering'),
(11027, 'en-US', '<h1>Rust Game Update: Changelog</h1><br/><p> In this update to the game Rust, the developers have made the following changes:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Fixed an issue where the ferry would get stuck when exiting the ferry terminal.</li><br/><li> Fixed an issue where the ferry\'s SphereCast would return incorrect values when colliding with something.</li><br/><li> Simplified animation of objects to reduce the load on the system.</li><br/><li> Various fixes have been made to the Patrol Helicopter:</li><br/><ul><br/><li> Will no longer dive underwater.</li><br/><li> Will no longer target players in the ocean underwater at depths greater than 3 meters.</li><br/></ul><br/><li> Fixed and improved data rendering.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> The update to the game Rust on Steam includes a number of fixes and improvements that will help players enjoy the gameplay without unnecessary problems. The new update brings balancing and fixes to various aspects of the game, which ensures a more stable and smooth perception of the game world.</p>'),
(11028, 'en-US', 'My base that can\'t be raided'),
(11029, 'en-US', 'Learn how to create an impenetrable base in Rust that cannot be raided.'),
(11030, 'en-US', 'base, raids, security, game Rust, Steam'),
(11031, 'en-US', '<p><b>My base that can\'t be raided</b></p><br/><br/><p> The game Rust is a post-apocalyptic world where survival depends entirely on your skills in building and defending your base. All players dream of creating an impregnable base that cannot be raided. In this article, we will tell you how to achieve this goal and ensure maximum security for your home.</p><br/><br/><p> 1. Selecting a construction site</p><br/><br/><p> The first step to creating an impenetrable base is choosing the right place to build. Avoid open and visible places that will attract the attention of other players. It is best to choose a place hidden among the trees or deep in the forest, where it will be difficult to notice your base.</p><br/><br/><p> 2. Complex architecture</p><br/><br/><p> When building your base, use complex architecture to make it impenetrable to attackers. Install multiple tiers, walkways, stairs, and intricate corridors to make it difficult to penetrate the base. Build trenches and reinforced walls for additional protection.</p><br/><br/><p> 3. Technical tools</p><br/><br/><p> Use technical tools to improve the security of your base. Install a video surveillance system to monitor entrances and exits. Install automated weapons platforms that will defend the base in your absence. Use combination locks and biometric scanners to prevent unauthorized access.</p><br/><br/><p> 4. Storage of valuables</p><br/><br/><p> Create a special storage for your valuables. Use secure cabinets with combination locks to store important resources, weapons, and other valuables. Place this storage in the most secure part of your base.</p><br/><br/><p> 5. Teamwork</p><br/><br/><p> Never forget about teamwork. If you play with friends, be sure to distribute the responsibilities of defending the base. Develop an evacuation plan and a security system to cope with unexpected raids.</p><br/><br/><p> Remember that even the most impenetrable base can become a target for experienced players or organized groups. So always be on guard and exercise caution. Good luck in creating an impenetrable base!</p>'),
(11032, 'en-US', 'Find out about the release of a new batch of skins in the game Rust, which will make your game collection even more stylish and unique. Watch the video and choose the brightest and most interesting skins!');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(11033, 'en-US', 'game Rust, new skins, skins batch, update, individuality, stylishness'),
(11034, 'en-US', '<p>Hooray! A new batch of skins has been released in the game Rust, which will make your game collection even more stylish and unique! Now you have the opportunity to transform your items and weapons with new spectacular designs.</p><br/><p> Adding new skins is always a special moment for every Rust player. Not only do they give the game items a new look, but they also show off your personality and status in the gaming community.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins can be seen in the video at the link <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JFY0ZF2XL8w&t=4s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JFY0ZF2XL8w&amp;t=4s</a> . It will allow you to evaluate the details and features of each skin, as well as choose the brightest and most interesting options.</p><br/><p> The Rust development team is constantly working on creating new skins to meet the needs and preferences of players. They take into account different themes, styles and items so that everyone can find something to their taste.</p><br/><p> Skins in Rust are also a great opportunity to create content on streams and vlogs. Unique and stylish skins attract viewers and highlight the professionalism of the player.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to update your Rust skin collection and stand out from other players. Check out the new batch of skins right now!</p>'),
(11035, 'en-US', 'ABYSS PACK'),
(11036, 'en-US', 'ABYSS PACK is a new set of game items for Rust, available on Steam and the game item store. Update your style and express your personality with these unique and high-quality items.'),
(11037, 'en-US', 'ABYSS PACK, game items, Rust, Steam, game item store, individuality, design, quality'),
(11038, 'en-US', 'ABYSS PACK is a new set of game items for the game Rust, which is already available on Steam and in the game item store. This set offers unique and stylish items that will help you stand out from other players and create your own unique atmosphere in the game. Update your appearance, add a little personality and get an advantage in the battles of rivals. The exciting design and high quality of this set will not leave you indifferent. Enjoy the game and express your individuality with the ABYSS PACK!'),
(11039, 'en-US', 'Start of update and new features for the game Rust on Steam'),
(11040, 'en-US', 'Today, one of the most anticipated updates for the game Rust on Steam starts. We are expecting interesting innovations, such as expanded ocean spaces, a new type of transport - a tugboat, a ferry terminal and a paid DLC \"Abyss\". Find out all the details in the article!'),
(11041, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, Steam, ocean, tug, ferry terminal, DLC Abyss'),
(11042, 'en-US', 'Today one of the most anticipated updates starts. The servers will be updated and ready to play at 21-00!<br/><br/> Now you can enjoy updated ocean spaces, a new port terminal, a unique tugboat and an exclusive paid skin for the anti-radiation suit.<br/><br/> :tochka: The ocean update brings a number of changes to the game. Now the wave height, frequency and other parameters will change depending on the weather. On stormy days, the waves will be very high, which will create a risk of boats capsizing. On other days, the ocean will be calmer. Visually, the water will also become more detailed.<br/><br/> :tochka: A new type of transport has been added - a tugboat. It will appear in ports (two per port) and will allow players to navigate the ocean in any weather. The tugboat will have an interior where players can place their items.<br/><br/> Damage and health<br/> The tug is quite durable 3000 health. To destroy it you will need 4 C4, 16 missiles or 7 torpedoes. You can repair it with wood and metal.<br/> If left in the open ocean, it will completely degrade in about 6 hours.<br/><br/> :tochka: Ferry terminal<br/> This update also brings a new monument! The Ferry Terminal appears once per map near the shore and offers loot, access to the subway, and some useful utilities. It may not stay that way for long, as rumors say it may be tied to future server transfers (nexus).<br/><br/> However, this has not yet been implemented, so the terminal is a modest point of interest with a few wooden and military crates, no NPCs or radiation.<br/><br/> :tochka: Along with the update, a paid DLC called \"Abyss\" will be released. It will include a skin for an anti-rad suit, a stylistic skin for a torch that can be used underwater, a skin for an AK, as well as unique skins for an iron axe and pickaxe. The suit will have several variations that will change with each creation. The price of the DLC is still unknown.'),
(11043, 'en-US', 'A look at the new AK with moving algae: a new take on the Rust gaming experience!'),
(11044, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new AK with moving algae in the game Rust and how these changes affect the game experience and tactics of players. Let yourself be immersed in a realistic world and enjoy the new features of this update.'),
(11045, 'en-US', 'Rust game updates, new AK, moving algae, visual experience improvements, gameplay impact, adaptation, Rust, game experience'),
(11046, 'en-US', 'Title: A look at the new AC with moving algae: a new take on the Rust gaming experience!<br/><br/> In this article, we\'ll look at an amazing update to the game Rust, which not only introduced a new automatic carbine (AK), but also added a unique detail - moving algae. Let\'s explore together how these changes will affect the game world and the player experience.<br/><br/> New weapons in the game always arouse interest among players, and the new AK is no exception. Thanks to detailed textures and animations, the new AK not only looks impressive, but also has improved accuracy and power. It will be a real acquisition for any player who strives to succeed in battles in the vastness of Rust.<br/><br/> However, the real highlight is the moving seaweed. Players have never experienced such a realistic environment before. The seaweed constantly moves under the influence of the current, creating the illusion of a living marine world. This level of detail and excitement will immerse you in a new level of reality, where even the smallest details create a unique gaming experience.<br/><br/> Of course, Rust developers are not limited to visual improvements. The new AK and moving algae also affect gameplay. Improved weapon accuracy will allow players to be more effective in battles, and the presence of algae will create additional obstacles and tactical opportunities. The ability to adapt to new environmental conditions will be key to maintaining your superiority.<br/><br/> The new update to Rust is an example of a versatile, carefully crafted game mechanic. It simultaneously allows players to enjoy an improved visual experience and has an impact on gameplay, creating new dynamics and forcing the need to adapt. Don\'t miss the opportunity to dive into this exciting world and experience all the benefits of the new AC and moving algae!'),
(11047, 'en-US', 'There are three known variants of the new hazmat in the game Rust!'),
(11048, 'en-US', 'Rust has three new hazmat options to protect players from dangerous external factors. We take a closer look at each option and invite you to share your choice!'),
(11049, 'en-US', 'new hazmat, choice of hazmat in Rust, hazmat suits, gas masks, protective gear'),
(11050, 'en-US', 'Rust players can currently choose from three new hazmat options - protective gear that provides protection from dangerous external factors. We invite you to consider each of these options and share your preferences.<br/> 1. Hazmat Suit: The classic hazmat suit consists of a protective suit and a cloak that completely covers the player from head to toe. It is designed to protect against radiation and chemical threats.<br/> 2. Body Armor with Gas Mask: This variant offers the player chest protection in the form of a body armor, as well as a gas mask to protect against toxic gases.<br/> 3. Full Hazmat Suits: This option combines a hazmat suit and gas mask for complete protection against radiation, toxic gases and other hazards.<br/> We\'d love to know which version of the new hazmat suit you like the most and why? Leave your choice and opinion in the comments!'),
(11051, 'en-US', 'Added the ability to log in to a tugboat in the game Rust'),
(11052, 'en-US', 'A guide to the new feature in Rust - tug-of-war, a closet-like feature. Learn how it works and how it will affect your game strategy and interactions with other players.'),
(11053, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, authorization, tug, cabinet, security, interaction'),
(11054, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust, where every step can be crucial for your survival! The latest update to the Rust game has added a new and exciting feature - towed authorization, which is an analogue of a cabinet.</p><br/><p> As before, you could only grant access to your possessions through cabinets. But now there is an alternative option - towed authorization. What does this mean and how does it work?</p><br/><p> Tugboat authorization allows you to restrict access to your tugboat, which is used to transport and store your valuables. Now you can share tugboat access only with specific players you trust, and you no longer need to build cabinets for security.</p><br/><p> This new feature is useful not only for preserving your property, but also for improving interaction with other players. You will be able to create groups and organize joint operations, trusting access to the tug only to members of your team.</p><br/><p> However, as with any game, there are trade-offs. Authorization in tow may limit your freedom of action and require more careful planning. You will have to choose carefully who to trust and be prepared for the consequences if you make a mistake in choosing your allies.</p><br/><p> In addition, tug authorization can lead to conflicts within the group if one of the players decides to change access to the tug or abuse their privileges. It is necessary to be attentive and keep an eye on what is happening in your team to avoid tense situations.</p><br/><p> Overall, adding tow-based authorization is a major step forward for Rust. It gives players more flexibility and control over their assets while creating new challenges and opportunities in interacting with other players.</p><br/><p> Be sure to update to the latest version of Rust to experience all the benefits of the new towable login feature!</p>'),
(11055, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: All the Information on the Latest Batch of Released Items'),
(11056, 'en-US', 'Find out all about the latest batch of new skins in Rust! Update your collection and support the developers by choosing original designs or modders\' work to your liking. Not only will the new skins improve the appearance of your items, but they can also provide you with bonuses and help with funding the game. Head to the Steam store and choose today!'),
(11057, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game, skins batch, Steam, custom style, developer designs, mod community work, bonuses, development funding'),
(11058, 'en-US', '<p>Greetings to all fans of the game Rust! We have great news for you - a fresh batch of skins has been released, which are already available for purchase on Steam!</p><br/><p> Each update to the Rust game comes with new skins that can dramatically change the appearance of your weapons, tools, and items. This is a great way to personalize your game collection and stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> The latest batch of skins adds dozens of new items to Rust, giving you even more options to customize your gaming experience. You can choose from a variety of styles and themes to highlight your individual sense of art and beauty.</p><br/><p> As usual, the new batch of skins includes both original designs from the developers and the work of the talented modding community. So, no matter your style and preferences, you are sure to find something that will suit your taste.</p><br/><p> But beyond their visual appeal, new skins also bring their own changes to the gameplay. Some of them can provide bonuses or enhance the characteristics of your weapons or tools. Study each skin carefully to make the most of the benefits they offer.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget that new skins in the Rust game are not only an opportunity for players, but also a way to support the developers. By purchasing skins, you help finance the development and improvement of the game, and also support the player community. So it is beneficial for both you and the entire gaming ecosystem.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to update your Rust skin collection! Check out the Steam store and choose the ones that suit you best. New skins are waiting for you!</p>'),
(11059, 'en-US', 'Rust Update: Gameplay Changes and Fixes'),
(11060, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has brought significant changes to the gameplay and fixed a number of bugs. This article looks at the most significant changes that will improve the players\' gaming experience.'),
(11061, 'en-US', 'Rust update, changes, gameplay, fixes, oil rig flames, diving mask, corpse in tow, combat knife, underwater crates, global network bases, conveyor screen, shaders'),
(11062, 'en-US', '<h2>Changes in Rust update</h2><br/><p> The latest update to Rust has introduced changes that significantly impact the gameplay. Let\'s take a look at some of them:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> :tochka: Fixed oil rig flames visible through thick fog. Players will now be able to navigate their surroundings without any problems.</li><br/><li> :tochka: The effect of the diving mask in deep water has been increased. Now players will be able to dive more comfortably and explore the underwater world.</li><br/><li> :tochka: The time a corpse can be towed has been increased from 5 minutes to 2 hours. This will give players more time to organize a rescue operation and the opportunity to return for their valuable reward.</li><br/><li> :tochka: The Combat Knife can now quickly untie underwater crates. This will allow players to more effectively search for valuable resources underwater.</li><br/><li> :tochka: Fixed a bug where underwater effects would not be displayed for the local player if the head was also underwater. Players will now be able to fully enjoy the underwater world with full visual effects.</li><br/><li> :tochka: Additional work on global network databases (basic optimization). Players can expect a smoother and more stable gameplay.</li><br/><li> :tochka: Fixed the conveyor screen not showing the movement of items if the item is placed in the output container. This will greatly simplify the management and organization of the production process.</li><br/><li> :tochka: Additional shader improvements. The graphical aspect of Rust continues to evolve and look even better.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> These changes will greatly improve and diversify the gameplay in Rust. Don\'t forget to follow the updates and enjoy the game!</p>'),
(11063, 'en-US', 'Discount on Rust and DLC!'),
(11064, 'en-US', 'Now the game Rust and its DLC are available at a discount! Get a unique opportunity to immerse yourself in the world of survival at a more affordable price!'),
(11065, 'en-US', 'Rust, DLC, discount, game, survival, adventure'),
(11066, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for fans of the game Rust! Now you can buy the game itself and additional content with a big discount!</p><br/><p> The big news is that Rust and all of its DLC are now available at a special price. This is a great chance to get this incredibly popular game and expansions at a more affordable price!</p><br/><p> If you are not familiar with the game Rust, it is a survival sandbox that allows you to create your own world in harsh and difficult conditions. Fight for survival, fight with other players, explore a huge and dangerous world, build fortifications and create everything you need to survive.</p><br/><p> And now, thanks to a discount, you can get all of this for a better price. What could be better than picking up one of the most popular games of today and its DLC, seeing what kind of performance your computer can really deliver, and immersing yourself in an unforgettable adventure in the world of Rust?</p><br/><p> Hurry up to take advantage of this unique opportunity and get acquainted with all the features of the Rust game and its additional content at a reduced price!</p>'),
(11067, 'en-US', 'CHANGELOG'),
(11068, 'en-US', 'The latest changes and fixes in the game Rust. Bug fixes, new features and effects added.'),
(11069, 'en-US', 'CHANGELOG, updates, Rust game, bugs, fixes, tug, hooks, submarines, effects, explosions'),
(11070, 'en-US', '<h2>Updates in the game Rust</h2><br/><p> Below is a list of the latest changes and fixes in the game Rust:</p><br/><ul><li> <b>Fixed Gaps Under Tugboat Doors:</b> Fixed a nasty bug that allowed enemies to sneak through gaps under the tugboat doors.</li><br/><li> <b>Fixed a server-side projectile issue:</b> Projectiles fired from the server will now properly damage the tug.</li><br/><li> <b>Added sounds for the diver\'s pick and diving light:</b> The game will now feature authentic sound effects for the diver\'s pick and diving light.</li><br/><li> <b>Added Tow Hooks:</b> Players can now use tow hooks to more easily handle tugs.</li><br/><li> <b>Fixed a bug with floating tow hooks:</b> Tow hooks will no longer float in the air. Colliders have also been fixed so that they interact better with the hooks. However, the imperfections in the behavior leave room for improvement.</li><br/><li> <b>Fixed a bug with underwater effects in submarine windows:</b> Underwater effects are now displayed correctly in submarine windows.</li><br/><li> <b>Fixed flickering tugboat radar:</b> An annoying bug with flickering radar on a tugboat has been fixed.</li><br/><li> <b>Modifications to the wooden door:</b> Modifications were made to the wooden door to match the height of the other doors.</li><br/><li> <b>Added underwater explosion effects for various items:</b> Added realistic underwater explosion effects for C4, Sachel, F1 grenade and bean can grenade.</li><br/></ul>'),
(11071, 'en-US', 'Interesting news'),
(11072, 'en-US', 'Read the news about changes in the game Rust related to the impossibility of installing an automatic turret, guntrap and fire turret on a tow vehicle.'),
(11073, 'en-US', 'Fascinating information'),
(11074, 'en-US', 'A look at the latest updates to Rust on Steam, including bug fixes, new items, and gameplay improvements.'),
(11075, 'en-US', 'CHANGELOG, Rust updates, Steam, prefabs, lights, ladders, vending machines, diving suit, boat, ocean, variable, doors, cargo ship, Rust game'),
(11076, 'en-US', 'CHANGELOG<br/><br/> :tochka: Updated wall lamp prefabs used in underground metro tunnels<br/> :tochka: Fixed animation type on rope ladders<br/> :tochka: Vending machines in tow will send a location update via a map marker approximately every 30 seconds.<br/> :tochka: Removed old model of movie diving suit<br/> :tochka: Fixed a bug where sleeping bags on the map would not move with the boat when placed in tow<br/> :tochka: Added wave display even at the lowest ocean quality (game advantage if we don\'t do this)<br/> :tochka: Added variable water.scaledtime (works similar to the UseScaledTime switch for old water)<br/> :tochka: Fixed a bug where it was impossible to place a wooden ladder on a cargo ship.<br/> :tochka: Fixed installation of doors on a towed vehicle (displayed in blue without the possibility of placement).<br/><br/> Don\'t forget to subscribe to news from Rust Ru.'),
(11077, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest and greatest skin candidates for the Rust Game Workshop, and how you can vote for your favorites. Dive into the world of creativity and learn about what\'s coming to Rust skins!'),
(11078, 'en-US', 'new, skins, Rust, workshop, contenders'),
(11079, 'en-US', 'Dear Rust players! We are happy to share with you news about upcoming skins for your game. In this article, we will look at the latest and most interesting contenders for addition to the game workshop. You will find out which models the developers are considering, as well as get information on how to vote for your favorite candidates. We will also analyze popular factors that influence the decision to add a skin to the game. Dive into the world of creativity and learn about future innovations in the world of skins for Rust!'),
(11080, 'en-US', 'New information about the tug'),
(11081, 'en-US', 'Learn about new information about the capabilities of the tugboat in the game Rust. Will you be creating full-fledged bases on the water and moving them? Find out more!'),
(11082, 'en-US', 'new info, tug, update, bases, items, server hubs'),
(11083, 'en-US', 'New information about the tug:<br/><br/> The new Rust update will add the ability to place items inside the tugboat. This opens up unique opportunities for players who will be able to create full-fledged bases on the water and move them to any convenient location.<br/><br/> The list of items that can be placed in the tugboat includes a barbecue, bed, campfire, chair, fridge, stove, loot boxes, mixing table, repair bench, research table, carpet, shelves, guntrap, sleeping bag, couch, table, and any other workbenches and turrets.<br/><br/> It is important to note that in the future, when the server hub system is launched, you will be able to move all the necessary items from your main base to another server using a tug. This will give you flexibility and freedom in managing your resources and buildings.<br/><br/> The update is scheduled to be released on July 6. Get ready for new features and adventures in the game Rust!'),
(11084, 'en-US', 'Rust\'s Abyss Update: New Features and Changes'),
(11085, 'en-US', 'On July 6, Rust will receive the Abyss update, which will feature new features such as a tugboat, ferry terminal, and water updates. Find out how these changes will affect the game and how they will create a new gameplay experience. A new diving suit and a limitation on breathing underwater will also be introduced, and the AK will no longer fire underwater.'),
(11086, 'en-US', 'Abyss update, Rust, new features, changes, tug, ferry terminal, water, diving suit, breathing restriction, AK'),
(11087, 'en-US', 'On July 6, Rust will be getting its long-awaited Abyss update. This update includes a number of new features and changes that will add fresh new possibilities to the game. The fact that the changes have been pushed to the public Rust Staging Aux2 branch means that they are almost ready for final testing before the update goes live.<br/><br/> One of the new features that players will be able to experience in The Abyss is the ability to use a tugboat. With this feature, players will be able to tow items and other game objects across the water surface, opening up new possibilities for crafting and building.<br/><br/> A new addition is the ferry terminal, which will allow players to travel by water more comfortably and safely. Now it will be possible to create your own ferry and use it for fast and safe travel between different locations.<br/><br/> The update also includes changes to the water environment. The water will look more realistic and pleasing to the eye, creating a more engaging gaming atmosphere. Players will be able to dive into the water using a new diving suit.<br/><br/> However, it should be noted that with the new changes, a restriction on breathing underwater is introduced. Players will no longer be able to stay underwater for long periods of time without the appropriate equipment or a diving suit.<br/><br/> In addition, a change will be introduced for the AK - it will no longer shoot underwater. This adds more realism to the game and forces players to develop alternative strategies and tactics.<br/><br/> The resulting Abyss update in Rust promises to be exciting and will add new features for players. Don\'t miss out on July 6th and go explore new depths and tighten your safety belts, because Abyss is going to be an experience you\'ll never forget!'),
(11088, 'en-US', 'First look at tugboat, new water, ferry and diving suit'),
(11089, 'en-US', 'Find out the first details about the tugboat, new water, ferry and diving suit - about the expected updates in the game Rust!'),
(11090, 'en-US', 'tugboat, water, ferry, diving suit, game updates, Rust'),
(11091, 'en-US', 'Today we\'ll be taking a look at some of the most anticipated updates to the Rust game - the tugboat, new water, ferry, and diving suit.<br/><br/> The Tugboat is a new vehicle that will allow players to navigate the ocean and transport large cargo. This is a great opportunity for team cooperation and development of the game economy.<br/><br/> New Water - a completely new visual effect that will add more realism to the game world. You will be amazed by the beauty of water and its behavior during the game.<br/><br/> The Ferry is a new way to transport players and their resources between islands. Now you can quickly and safely move around the world of Rust using this convenient means of transportation.<br/><br/> The diving suit is a new piece of equipment that will allow you to explore the underwater world and extract valuable resources. Be careful, because dangers and hostile creatures await you underwater.<br/><br/> These updates bring new features to Rust and expand the game world. They will allow you to have new adventures and conduct more diverse game activities. Stay tuned for more exciting updates!<br/><br/> <i>Link to original article: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a></i>'),
(11092, 'en-US', 'Fixes and improvements in the latest update to Rust on Steam'),
(11093, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest fixes and improvements in Rust, including a Glock customization issue and changes to animations, water, and boats.'),
(11094, 'en-US', 'Game Rust, update, fixes, Glock, animation, water, boat, tug, underwater world'),
(11095, 'en-US', 'Fixed an issue with Glock customization after a merge conflict.<br/><br/> CHANGELOG<br/><br/> :tochka: Fixed a bug in the animation of shells falling into the ocean.<br/> :tochka:Fixed unnatural blue coloring of water splashes that looked strange in certain weather conditions.<br/> :tochka:Fixed a compilation error of the boat client.<br/> :tochka:Fixed broken (bad merge) Glock model prefab.<br/> :tochka:Work is underway to improve the animation of hand movements when controlling a tug.<br/> :tochka:Fixed the scale of the visible part of the NVG glasses depending on the scale of the user interface.<br/> :tochka:A sonar has been added to the tugboat, it detects submarines at a depth of up to 3 m under the tugboat.<br/> :tochka:Added underwater world prefab. (Bubbles and plankton still use the wrong shader mask).<br/> :tochka:Small work is also being done to improve the water animation.<br/> :tochka:Added support for the forward movement effect for the boat and RHIB, not just the tug.<br/> :tochka:Updated altitude maps of the area and slightly expanded road maps.'),
(11096, 'en-US', 'Information about new skins in the game Rust'),
(11097, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skins that have been added to Rust'),
(11098, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, update'),
(11099, 'en-US', 'Dear players! We have amazing news for you! A new batch of skins has been released in the game Rust, which will definitely interest every fan of this game on Steam.<br/><br/> If you are one of those players who passionately follow new skins, then this article is for you. We have prepared enough information about the latest and coolest skins that have been added to the arsenal of the game Rust.<br/><br/> All skins from this new batch are the result of the work of talented artists who put their whole soul into creating the unique design of each skin. You can be sure that by purchasing new skins, you are not only getting a beautiful visual component, but also supporting the creativity and talents of these artists.<br/><br/> However, before making your choice and purchase, you should consider some factors. In the game Rust, balance is key. Therefore, when choosing new skins, you should consider their impact on gameplay. Perhaps some skins can give you an advantage in fights with other players, but they can also make you more visible and expose you to more risk. This is a trade-off you will have to live with.<br/><br/> Another important factor to consider is the impact on player psychology. Skins can evoke different emotions and feelings in your opponents or allies. And this can affect the game dynamics and tactics. So be prepared for unexpected reactions and adapt to the changing situation.<br/><br/> Also, keep in mind that adding new skins to the Rust game is an ongoing process. Each new batch of updates brings even more variety and opportunities for self-expression to the game. So stay tuned and don’t miss the opportunity to purchase unique skins that will highlight your style and individuality.<br/><br/> Ultimately, it\'s important to understand that choosing new skins is a matter of personal preference. Every player has their own unique taste and style, and only you can decide which skins are right for you.<br/><br/> So don\'t miss out on the new batch of skins in Rust. You\'ll find amazing designs, variety, and the ability to express yourself in the virtual world.<br/><br/> See you in Rust!'),
(11100, 'en-US', 'From the latest news'),
(11101, 'en-US', 'This article covers the latest news in Rust, including game crashes, tugboat development progress, water updates and other changes, as well as progress on base optimization and other work from the development team.'),
(11102, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, crashes, tug, water, bases, optimization, shaders, weapon racks, missile silo, bear animation'),
(11103, 'en-US', 'From the latest news...<br/><br/> :tochka: Game crashes<br/> You may have noticed a few Rust client updates in your Steam library this week. Earlier in the week, there were increased client crashes. However, the latest update was found to be causing even more crashes, so Facepunch pulled it back.<br/><br/> :tochka:Tugboat progress<br/> Rust\'s newest watercraft continues to evolve this week. The Tugboat branch has been updated with new features and functionality, including a bunch of fixes to the tugboat model and physics. There are also several new spawn points for the new tugs on the map, including two in each harbor.<br/><br/> Interestingly, players will now be able to use tugboats as a mobile spawn point, placing their bags or beds on them. There are no visuals or specific details at the moment, as this is still in a separate thread, but we will keep you updated as more information about this new vessel becomes available.<br/><br/> :tochka:Water renewal and other<br/> There\'s also a lot of other water-related work happening in other branches. In the Diving Suit branch, the team is working on improving the Diver\'s flashlight and assault rifle. Based on the commits, it\'s possible that the Diver Suit will be part of the upcoming DLC.<br/><br/> In the Water 5 branch, the team continues to work on various improvements to the in-game water system. The Aux2 branch has been updated several times this month, and it appears the team is internally testing new features before release.<br/><br/> A ferry terminal is also being tested and refined on Aux2 for a future launch. It\'s unclear how it will be used in-game, but it will spawn near harbors and may be related to the server-to-server cargo transfer work that has been going on for some time.<br/> &lt;@&amp;909717822693867560 <br/><a:tochka:1105860077904220240Прогресс в оптимизации баз<br/> The Global Network Bases branch is continuing to optimize per-player base rendering to improve performance and reduce latency. Bases will be loaded into the map as prefabs, similar to how trees and rocks are loaded. The quality of the base will improve as you get closer. This should reduce instances where you\'re quickly moving around the area in a drone and experience a huge frame drop/stutter as a huge base, previously invisible, quickly appears in the frame. This optimization is one of the biggest for the game, and we\'re looking forward to seeing how it plays out. <br/><br/><a:tochka:1105860077904220240 Прочее<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956Some more shader improvements<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956Working on the gun racks (finishing touches, added a light strip to the top of the wall racks)<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956Work is underway on the props for the missile silo<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956Bear animation update'),
(11104, 'en-US', 'This update includes various fixes and changes to boogie boards, the ocean, shaders, tugs and terminals.'),
(11105, 'en-US', 'update, changes, bug board, swim rings, error, window shader, tug, door frames, cockpit, fuel, spawn, spawn points, harbor, animation, diving light'),
(11106, 'en-US', 'The following changes have been made in this update:'),
(11107, 'en-US', 'Learn about the notable upcoming skins from the Rust Workshop and how the player community influences the selection of skins to add to the game.'),
(11108, 'en-US', 'new items, upcoming skins, contenders, workshop, design, updates, game Rust'),
(11109, 'en-US', '<p>The world of Rust is constantly adding new and exciting skins for your character and weapons. However, what could be more interesting than just new skins? Of course, these are the future skins (contenders) that are already in the workshop and ready to conquer the world of Rust!</p><br/><p> The Workshop is a place where players can submit their own skin designs that could potentially make it into the game. And every time you visit the Workshop, you can see new and exciting skins waiting for their time.</p><br/><p> In this article, we\'ll take a look at some of the most notable upcoming skins from the workshop. You\'ll learn about the most popular and talked about designs, as well as get a glimpse of what\'s to come in the world of Rust in the near future.</p><br/><p> Whether it\'s bright and bold weapon skins or colorful and customizable character outfits, there\'s bound to be something you like. However, deciding which skins make it into the game often involves a variety of factors. Balancing the different designs, as well as feedback and preferences from the player community, play a crucial role in this process.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow the workshop updates and stay up to date with the latest news about upcoming skins (contenders)! Maybe your design will be the next hit in the Rust world!</p>'),
(11110, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam Update \"CHANGELOG\"'),
(11111, 'en-US', 'This update for Rust fixes bugs, adds new features, and improves the player experience. Find out more!\"'),
(11112, 'en-US', 'Updates, CHANGELOG, Rust game, Steam, errors, fix, new features, animation, rendering, moon path, gaming experience'),
(11113, 'en-US', '<h2>Rust Steam Update \"CHANGELOG\"</h2><br/><p> In this update, we\'ve fixed a few bugs and added some new features to improve your Rust gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><h3> Fixed r/w metal floor bugs</h3><br/><p> Fixed bugs related to reading and writing to metal floors. These actions now work without problems, providing a smoother and more realistic interaction with the world around you.</p><br/><br/><h3> Added fluorescent light for placement on wall mounted weapon racks, lods/textures, etc.</h3><br/><p> You can now create bright and noticeable light with new fluorescent sources that can be placed on wall-mounted weapon racks, loot boxes, textures, and more, adding new options for decorating and lighting your base.</p><br/><br/><h3> Simplifying object animation for less load on the system</h3><br/><p> We\'ve simplified the animation of objects in the game, which will reduce the load on your system and improve performance. Now the game will run even smoother, especially on computers with limited resources.</p><br/><br/><h3> Rendering data fixes and improvements</h3><br/><p> Several issues related to rendering the game world have been fixed, making the visual experience for players even more realistic and immersive.</p><br/><br/><h3> Fixed the appearance of the moon path on the water surface</h3><br/><p> The problem with displaying the moon path on the water surface has been fixed. Now you can enjoy beautiful night landscapes and romantic atmosphere without visualizers.</p>'),
(11114, 'en-US', 'Now all drops are shared - get them by watching any stream'),
(11115, 'en-US', 'All drops are now shared - get them by watching any stream. Learn more about this update and the new way to get rewards.'),
(11116, 'en-US', 'drops, updates, streams, receiving rewards'),
(11117, 'en-US', '<p>Title: All drops are now shared - get them by watching any stream</p><br/><br/><p> You can now get all drops by watching any stream. This means you no longer need to follow specific streamers or watch specific broadcasts to get the rewards you want.</p><br/><br/><p> There are less than 24 hours left until the end of the current drop cycle. Use your opportunity to get all the drops in 2 hours of watching any of the streamers on the platform.</p>'),
(11118, 'en-US', 'Battle Royale? New Twitch Drop? New Map?'),
(11119, 'en-US', 'Learn more about the mysterious update in Rust: Battle Royale, a new Twitch Drop and a new map await you!'),
(11120, 'en-US', 'Battle Royale, Twitch Drop, New Map, Update, Rust, Steam'),
(11121, 'en-US', 'What is hidden behind the mysterious words \"Battle Royale? New Twitch Drop? New Map?\" and what surprises are they preparing for players? Let\'s look into the details.'),
(11122, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Impressive New Collection'),
(11123, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest additions of skins in Rust - unique items that add a fresh look and updated gameplay to your experience. Read our article to get all the information you need about the new batch of skins in Rust, evaluate their aesthetics and learn how they affect the game mechanics.'),
(11124, 'en-US', 'Rust, skins, new batch, gaming experience, aesthetics, gameplay, update'),
(11125, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust continues to improve and delight players with new features and content. Recently, a new batch of skins was added to the game, which brings a fresh look and interesting changes to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> New skins are unique items that allow players to customize the appearance of their characters, weapons, and other items in the game. This creates opportunities for self-expression and allows players to stand out from the crowd. The new batch of skins introduces completely new designs and variations, adding variety and freshness to the gaming environment.</p><br/><p> Looking at the aesthetics of the new skins, you can see that they fit perfectly with the overall style of the Rust game and add even more realism and detail. From bright and colorful skins to more down-to-earth and worn variations, the new items allow each player to find an option that reflects their own style and preferences.</p><br/><p> However, aesthetics are not the only aspect to consider when considering a new batch of skins. Their impact on gameplay mechanics is also an important factor for players. Some skins may provide bonuses to speed, defense, or other gameplay parameters, making them even more attractive to use in the game.</p><br/><p> However, it should be remembered that the introduction of new skins may cause some balance issues in the game. When some skins provide certain advantages, this may create an imbalance between players and lead to a negative impact on the gameplay. Rust developers are actively working to maintain balance and ensure fair play, taking into account the opinions and feedback of players.</p><br/><p> Overall, the new batch of skins in Rust offers unique opportunities to customize and transform the game experience. With modern designs and variations, players can stand out and give their character or weapon their own personality. However, it is important to remember the importance of balance and the impact of skins on game mechanics to ensure a fair and fun game for all participants.</p>'),
(11126, 'en-US', 'This article covers the latest changes and improvements to Rust on Steam. Find out about bug fixes, new features, and gameplay improvements.'),
(11127, 'en-US', 'CHANGELOG, updates, Rust, game, Steam'),
(11128, 'en-US', '<h2>Changes in the update</h2><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> Fixed the water level in the river, which was ignored by almost everyone.</li><br/><li> Fixed a bug where water mesh would not be cast inside caves.</li><br/><li> Fixed the lighting of the net on the tugboat not being marked as dynamic.</li><br/><li> Added 3rd wall mounted weapon rack, reduced texture sizes of all 3 texture sets.</li><br/><li> Improved AK machine gun magazine model - magazine was separated in the world model and LODs (for magazine drop during reload) and magazine drop effect was adjusted.</li><br/><li> Renamed AK machine gun magazine model files and prefabs, organized files into one folder, updated item name, adjusted world model prefab, fixed sounds.</li><br/><li> Data from water update 5 final has been merged.</li><br/><li> Added new tugboat deck material.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> These changes in the Rust update on Steam were made to improve gameplay and fix some bugs. The new wall-mounted weapon rack will give players more options to build their base and defend themselves. Also, the reduction in texture sizes affects the performance and loading of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> The AK magazine model has been improved, allowing for a more realistic representation of the magazine drop when reloading. Adjustments and file renaming affect the organization of data, facilitating the development and updating of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> The data merge from the Water Update 5 final adds new features and improves the visual effect of water. The new tugboat deck material gives it a new look and an updated feel.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust update on Steam allows players to enjoy improved gameplay and bug fixes, making the game even more interesting and attractive.</p>'),
(11129, 'en-US', 'Diving suit and optimization'),
(11130, 'en-US', 'News about the development of the diving suit and optimization in the game Rust. Find out about the progress of the suit, the development of the tugboat, the update of water and other updates.'),
(11131, 'en-US', 'Diving suit, optimization, updates, game Rust'),
(11132, 'en-US', 'Diving suit and optimization<br/><br/> :tochka:Progress in creating a diving suit<br/> There\'s been a lot of commentary on the upcoming Diver suit this week. First revealed earlier this month, this branch of the Diver suit appears to be a new piece of underwater exploration gear. There are no renderings yet, but all signs point to some form of deep-sea suit with a metal helmet equipped with screens for vision.<br/><br/> According to reports, this diver suit will include a flashlight and even a matching assault rifle. No specifics have been revealed yet, as that\'s in a separate thread, but we\'ll keep you posted as more is revealed.<br/><br/> :tochka: Tugboat progress<br/> We also see work on the newest watercraft for Rust, the tugboat. Models, textures, fuel flow/storage, and initial buoyancy physics are complete, and the team is continuing to work on the tugboat\'s interactions with water, volumes, lighting, and more. Still in a separate branch, no visuals or specific details yet.<br/><br/> :tochka: Water updates<br/> It looks like the latest water integration (water5) has been merged into the Aux2 branch. This is a good indication that the functionality is close to completion and ready for internal testing. Unfortunately, Aux2 is not available to us mere mortals at the moment. You can see a video of what it will look like a few posts down.<br/> &lt;@&amp;909717822693867560 <br/><a:tochka:1105860077904220240 Оптимизация баз <br/>The Global Network Databases branch is working on optimizing database rendering, which should ideally improve FPS and minimize lag. There are no specifics yet, as this is a separate branch, but it looks like the fundamentals of database rendering are being changed to make things easier on the GPU and make loading smoother. We\'ll keep you posted as this progresses. <br/><br/><a:tochka:1105860077904220240 Прочее<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956 Work is underway on the settings of the scientists\' AI<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956 Work is underway on the gun racks (at the moment these will be large horizontal and large vertical versions, as well as 3 wall-mounted options)<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956 Shader improvements<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956 Work on the bear animations is in progress'),
(11133, 'en-US', 'Information about changes in the latest update to the Rust game, including bug fixes and additions.'),
(11134, 'en-US', 'CHANGELOG, update, fixes, eye transformation, warehouse doors, character collision, road connection, ferry optimization'),
(11135, 'en-US', '<h2>Changes:</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> Added eye transformation to the character model, fixing a bug where it was previously missing.</li><br/><li> Fixed a bug that caused incorrect opening/closing times for doors in the warehouse.</li><br/><li> Fixed a bug that caused a character to appear to collide/slide when standing on the edge of a wall or box.</li><br/><li> Improvements to road connections, including road stops, are planned.</li><br/><li> A global ferry/crossing optimization has been carried out, which is planned to be introduced in the next update.</li><br/></ul>'),
(11136, 'en-US', 'New deep-sea suit and its features'),
(11137, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new deep-sea suit and its features in the Rust update on Steam. Analysis of questions: new skin or a full-fledged suit? Built-in flashlight and a special skin for AK.'),
(11138, 'en-US', 'deep sea suit, new update, Rust, Steam, hazmat skin, full diver suit, built-in flashlight, AK skin'),
(11139, 'en-US', '<p>Well, it\'s time to speculate about the new update of the Rust game on Steam.</p><br/><p> One of the biggest news stories was the confirmation of work on a deep-sea suit. Game developers are not revealing all the details, so we can only speculate.</p><br/><p> The first question that arises is what will it be? A new skin for hazmat or a full suit in addition to the diver\'s suit? Perhaps the developers will offer both options to give players more variety and chances to show their individuality.</p><br/><p> The second interesting feature of the deep-sea suit is a built-in flashlight. This will be a real breakthrough for lovers of diving into the underwater world. You will no longer need to waste a slot on a flashlight, now it will always be at hand.</p><br/><p> In addition, the developers have prepared a special skin for the AK machine gun. It goes perfectly with the deep-sea suit and will allow you to stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> We are looking forward to the official announcement from the developers of the game Rust and hope that the new deep-sea suit will give us new opportunities and emotions in the world of survival.</p>'),
(11140, 'en-US', 'Optimizing the display of building blocks in the game Rust'),
(11141, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have started working on optimizing the display of building blocks, which are the basis for creating bases. Find out what awaits players after the implementation of optimizations.'),
(11142, 'en-US', 'optimization, display, building blocks, bases, Rust, game'),
(11143, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have begun work on optimizing the display of building blocks, which are the basis for creating bases. In the screenshot provided by the development team, you can see an example of the visibility of bases at large distances. This work is aimed at improving the performance of the game and increasing its quality for all players. It is expected that after the implementation of optimizations, players will be able to enjoy smoother and more comfortable gameplay.'),
(11144, 'en-US', 'Rust Twitch Drops: Limited Time Only, Get Rewards While You Can!'),
(11145, 'en-US', 'Find out how to get unique skins in the game Rust through Twitch drop Rust. Don\'t miss the opportunity, time is limited!'),
(11146, 'en-US', 'Rust, Twitch drop, rewards, skins, broadcasts, limited time'),
(11147, 'en-US', '<p>An important announcement for all fans of the game Rust! Twitch drop Rust has begun, and you have only 6 days to get all the rewards! Don\'t miss the unique opportunity to decorate your characters with skins that are only available through Twitch drop Rust.</p><br/><p> What is a Twitch drop and how does it work? It is a special event that allows you to get exclusive rewards in the game Rust, simply by watching broadcasts on the popular platform Twitch. You just need to be an active viewer so that the rewards will automatically drop for you in the game.</p><br/><p> How do you get these rewards? It’s easy! Follow the link to the official Rust website and link your Twitch account to the game account. Then just enjoy watching streams on Twitch, and the rewards will be automatically added to your inventory in the game.</p><br/><p> Keep in mind that time is limited! You have only 6 days to enjoy Twitch drop Rust and get all the rewards. Don\'t miss this chance to decorate your characters with unique skins that will be a great addition to the gameplay!</p>'),
(11148, 'en-US', 'Team CoconatB Wins Twitch Rivals 2023: An Impressive Show of Power'),
(11149, 'en-US', 'Read about Team CoconatB\'s victory at Twitch Rivals 2023 and their impressive skills and collaboration.'),
(11150, 'en-US', 'Twitch Rivals 2023, Team CoconatB, Victory, Skills, Collaboration');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(11151, 'en-US', '<p>Twitch Rivals 2023 brought together the best teams ready to show their skills and strength. Let\'s remember the victory achieved by the CoconatB team, which brilliantly overcame all obstacles in its path.</p><br/><br/><p> CoconatB impressed viewers with their high level of play and professionalism. Their unrivaled skills and strong collaboration allowed them to become the absolute champions of Twitch Rivals 2023.</p><br/><br/><p> With their victory, Team CoconatB has earned the respect and recognition of fans and competitors alike. We are confident that this talented team will have many more triumphs in future Twitch Rivals competitions.</p>'),
(11152, 'en-US', 'Diving and towing!'),
(11153, 'en-US', 'The article covers new developments in Rust, including a diving suit, the ability to tow with a new boat, bear improvements, container skin fixes, and new NPC scientist AI. Other changes to the game are also covered.'),
(11154, 'en-US', 'diving, towing, diving suit, boat, bear improvements, container skin fix, AI, changes, Rust, Steam'),
(11155, 'en-US', 'Diving and towing!<br/><br/> :tochka: Diving suit.<br/> A new development branch has surfaced in the Rust community, which is related to a diving suit. While there are no details or images yet, it is likely that it will be some sort of deep-sea exploration suit, similar to Jacques Cousteau\'s helmet. Significant progress has been seen in this area, and we can expect it to arrive soon. A number of hidden commits dating back about a week have recently been discovered, suggesting that the developers are actively working on this project.<br/><br/> :tochka: Tugboat<br/> There is a new vessel currently in development in Rust called the \"Tugboat\". It may have a special functionality that no other boat in the game has - towing. The development of the new branch has been in full swing for a few weeks now, and we can expect new features for interacting with the world of Rust to appear soon.<br/><br/> According to preliminary data, the general models and textures for the boat are already ready. Physics and buoyancy, fuel consumption and storage, and possibly the initial functionality of the thrust have been implemented. All this is still in a separate branch, so there are no specifics on the visuals yet. The developers promise to keep us updated.<br/><br/> Some players have suggested that this tugboat could be a kind of \"door\" to other servers. Despite the fact that information on transitions from server to server has not been updated for a long time, the developers have already started talking about it. However, at first the tugboat will simply be a new sea transport, and later new functionality may be added to it. We will wait for new details from the game developers.<br/><br/> :tochka: Bear Improvements<br/> Some fresh animations for the bears will be coming in the new branch. There are no visual changes yet, but apparently new animations are already in the works, which will include various idle poses, walking, standing, and attacking.<br/><br/> :tochka: Correction of skin of containers for metal buildings<br/> The latest update to the Cargo Container build skin last week brought several much-anticipated fixes. Specifically, an issue with the visual display of new materials when building was fixed, as well as an issue with wall corners. A bug where vehicles could clip through the base of the container was also fixed. Additionally, the accuracy of the collider on the roof of the Cargo Container was improved. <br/><br/><a:tochka:1105860077904220240 Ученым настраивают искусственный интеллект.<br/> NPC scientists have become more intelligent and adaptive. They now have a reduced field of view and also simulate hearing to detect enemies sneaking up on them from behind. If a scientist spots danger, he can quickly turn and run for cover instead of slowly retreating. Additionally, if his health is full, he can take his time to take cover and enter a combat state. NPC scientists can also continue moving towards a position while in pursuit of the player, instead of simply stopping and switching to a combat state. All of these changes make the game more interesting and evoke more emotion in players. <br/><br/><a:tochka:1105860077904220240 Другие изменения <br/>&lt;:toch:1036672422922960956Increase water consumption of sprinklers to better match water consumption of liquid containers (Nerf for agriculture)<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956More progress on weapon racks<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956Optimizations for the database network<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956More work on water updates, including optimization and animation.<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956More work on the props for the nuclear missile silo.<br/> &lt;:toch:1036672422922960956More progress in transferring data from server to server.'),
(11156, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has been released in Rust: find out the details and make your choice!'),
(11157, 'en-US', 'Find out more about the new batch of skins in the game Rust and choose a unique design that reflects your individuality and makes you stand out from other players!'),
(11158, 'en-US', 'new batch, skins, Rust, choice, design, personality, visual effects'),
(11159, 'en-US', '<p>Exciting news for all Rust players on Steam: today, the long-awaited batch of new skins for your gaming experience has been released! Now you have the opportunity to bring your characters and items to life with unique and stylish designs.</p><br/><p> In this article, we offer you a comprehensive overview of the new batch of skins, as well as analyze the key factors that influence players\' choices. Our analysis will help you make a decision and highlight your individuality in the virtual world of Rust.</p><br/><p> There are several factors to consider before choosing skins. First, the stylistic combination with the main content of the game. New skins should harmoniously fit into the overall atmosphere of Rust and be recognizable to other players. Secondly, the uniqueness and rarity of skins play an important role in their appeal. Original skins that are not often found can make your character or item more valuable in the eyes of other players. Finally, the level of detail and visual effect are two more important aspects to consider when choosing a skin.</p><br/><p> We will review and analyze several new skins from the latest batch. In addition to excellent visuals, these skins also offer interesting trade-offs between uniqueness, cost, and rarity attributes. The article provides images and short descriptions of each skin so that you can make an informed choice.</p><br/><p> It is important to remember how your choice of skin can affect your gaming experience and interactions with other players. Some skins can attract attention and interest from other players, which can create new opportunities and even affect your interactions in the game. Be prepared for the fact that the skin you choose can become your \"calling card\" in the virtual world of Rust.</p><br/><p> So, find out more about the new batch of skins in Rust and make your choice! Perhaps today you will find the perfect design that will reflect your personality and distinguish you from other players.</p>'),
(11160, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam servers are down after maintenance'),
(11161, 'en-US', 'After maintenance work on Steam servers, most Rust game servers are temporarily unavailable. The developers are already working on a solution, but there is no information yet on when the servers will be available again.'),
(11162, 'en-US', 'game Rust, Rust servers, Steam, maintenance, server unavailability'),
(11163, 'en-US', 'As a result of maintenance work on Steam servers, players of the game Rust faced the problem of unavailability of most servers, especially closer to midnight. The developers of the game reported their cooperation with Valve and are already working on fixing the problem. However, at the moment the servers are still unavailable, and it is unknown how long it will take to restore them. The situation should be monitored for updates and be patient.'),
(11164, 'en-US', 'water5final preview: a year ago the ocean redesign branch was released'),
(11165, 'en-US', 'water5final preview - a year ago, the ocean redesign branch was released in Rust. Learn about the new improvements and visual effects of this update.'),
(11166, 'en-US', 'water5final preview, branch, ocean redesign, year ago, game Rust'),
(11167, 'en-US', '<p>Rust developers released a preview of water5final, a branch intended to redesign the ocean, a year ago. This significant update will significantly affect the game environment and create a new atmosphere.</p><br/><br/><p> Although water5final is still in development, you can already see the quality and resource intensity of this new branch. It promises improved graphics, more realistic water surfaces and new visual effects.</p><br/><br/><p> The ocean in Rust plays an important role in creating a special atmosphere and increasing the realism of the game world. Therefore, the preview of water5final is of great interest to the player community. Many are waiting for the improvements that this branch will bring.</p><br/><br/><p> The new ocean design in Rust reflects the developers\' constant desire to improve the game environment. They are constantly working on optimizing the game and improving visual effects. The water5final preview is just one of many steps in this direction.</p><br/><br/><p> As for water in Rust, it is an important element and plays a significant role in the game mechanics. Improving the visual effects and appearance of water will create more realistic and exciting game situations.</p><br/><br/><p> It is expected that the developers will continue to work on water5final and make necessary changes and improvements based on player feedback. In the meantime, we can only look forward to the full release of the branch and appreciate all the benefits of the ocean redesign in Rust.</p>'),
(11168, 'en-US', 'Find out about upcoming skins in the game Rust on Steam. Explore the world of the workshop and influence the choice of the most popular and unique skins!'),
(11169, 'en-US', 'new, skins, Rust, Steam, workshop, gaming community, promising, uniqueness, style, support votes, success, angel, space, wrestling helmet, steel wings, base, fortress, original, creative'),
(11170, 'en-US', 'Hello everyone! Today we will talk about new items that will soon appear in the game Rust on Steam. Want to know what skins are already in the works and what to expect in the near future? Then keep reading!<br/><br/> The Workshop is a place where creators from all over the world share their creations with the gaming community. Here, everyone can propose their skin idea and collect support votes from other players. This way, the game developers can see popular skins and add them to the game.<br/><br/> There are already several potential new items in the workshop. Each of them has its own uniqueness and style, which reflects the wishes and fantasies of players. Let\'s be honest, not all of these skins will make it into the game, but each of them has its own chance of success.<br/><br/> Let\'s take a look at some of the most promising skins that are fighting for their place in the Rust game:<br/><br/> 1. \"Fallen Angel\" - This skin features an angel happily falling from the sky. It is made in black and white and will add a bit of nostalgia and mystery to the gameplay.<br/><br/> 2. \"Space Wrestling Helmet\" - This skin will bring the feeling of a real astronaut to the world of Rust. It represents modern technology and protection from enemies.<br/><br/> 3. \"Steel Wings\" - this skin will allow you to turn your base into a real fortress. It is powerful steel wings that will not only be aesthetically pleasing, but also serve as additional protection.<br/><br/> Of course, this is only a small part of what you can find in the workshop. There are many other original and creative skins that might interest you. Don\'t forget to vote for your favorite skins to increase their chances of appearing in the game.<br/><br/> So, the future of Rust is full of promising skins, and every player can contribute to which of them will appear in the game. So keep your finger on the pulse of events and don’t miss the opportunity to create a unique gaming experience!'),
(11171, 'en-US', 'Changes are being prepared on a separate branch'),
(11172, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam servers are getting major changes that will affect admin capabilities, animal animations, and metal design.'),
(11173, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, server admins, emoji, animation, animals, bears, skins, metal structures'),
(11174, 'en-US', '<p>Changes are coming to Rust servers on Steam! Server admins will be able to upload custom emojis without animations. This will open up new possibilities for creating a unique atmosphere and communication in the game.</p><br/><p> In addition, Rust developers are working on updating animal animations. The focus will be primarily on bears. Animations for rearing, spinning, running, and attacking are to be added. This will give the game more realism and drive during encounters with these dangerous creatures.</p><br/><p> Additionally, Rust developers are planning to change the skin on metal structures such as floors and ceilings. Such changes will add variety to the design and allow players to express their individuality even more.</p>'),
(11175, 'en-US', 'Do you want to stay up to date with all the news on Rust?'),
(11176, 'en-US', 'Want to always be up to date with the latest news on the game Rust? Subscribe from RUST RU to your discord and get all the news first!'),
(11177, 'en-US', 'Rust, news, subscription, updates, discord'),
(11178, 'en-US', '<p>Do you want to always be up to date with the latest news on the game Rust? Then we have great news for you! Now you can subscribe to RUST RU and get all the news first!</p><br/><p> Just join our Discord community and we will regularly notify you about any updates, patches and interesting events in the world of Rust. You will be one of the first to know about the release of new features, additions and exclusive offers.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to always be in the know! Join our friendly and active gaming community and get news straight to your discord. We guarantee you won\'t miss a thing!</p>'),
(11179, 'en-US', 'Interesting skins are available on the Twitch Drops website'),
(11180, 'en-US', 'The full list of cool skins for Rust is now available on the Twitch Drops website. Get exclusive items by watching streams on Twitch!'),
(11181, 'en-US', 'skins, Twitch Drops, update, Rust, game skins, exclusive items'),
(11182, 'en-US', '<h1>Interesting skins are available on the Twitch Drops website</h1><br/><br/><p> Popular streaming platform Twitch has updated its Drops section and happily announces that the entire list of available skins is now open to the public.</p><br/><br/><p> The Twitch Drops website now features a large selection of high-quality skins for the game Rust. These skins are specially created by the game developers to allow players to enjoy a new and unique look for their game character and the environment.</p><br/><br/><p> With Twitch Drops, you can earn these skins by watching various streams on the Twitch platform. Just follow the instructions on the site and get the chance to update your skin collection with special and exclusive items.</p><br/><br/><p> Now, in order not to miss any valuable skin, you do not have to surf the entire Internet - the entire list of available skins is presented on the Twitch Drops website. It contains a large number of diverse and attractive skins that will certainly interest you.</p><br/><br/><p> Be sure to follow the link for more details on all the skins available on the Twitch Drops website: <a href=\"https://twitch.facepunch.com/\">https://twitch.facepunch.com/</a> .</p>'),
(11183, 'en-US', 'First screenshots of the new monument - Port Terminal'),
(11184, 'en-US', 'The first screenshots of the new monument - Port Terminal in the game Rust. Learn about the new system of server hubs and the possibility of traveling between them.'),
(11185, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust update, new monument, Port terminal, server hub system'),
(11186, 'en-US', '<p>The first screenshots of the new monument, called the Port Terminal, were recently published. It will not only be a magnificent decorative element, but also a key part of the new server hub system that the developers are actively working on.</p><br/><p> With this new system, players will be able to sail across oceans and move from one server to another, provided that they are connected to each other. Now there will be no need to create a new character or lose progress to play on other servers. This update promises to significantly improve and simplify the gameplay.</p><br/><p> Additionally, the Port Terminal will offer the ability to use a port where a ferry will arrive and transport players and their vehicles to other servers. This opens up new opportunities for exploration and interaction with different gaming communities.</p><br/><p> There is no exact release date for this monument yet, as it is still in development. However, players are already looking forward to using the Port Terminal and immersing themselves in new adventures in Rust.</p>'),
(11187, 'en-US', 'New skin for metal blocks is now available for sale'),
(11188, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new skin for metal blocks in the game Rust, which is available for sale at a price of 1150 rubles. The skin will allow you to change the appearance of metal blocks by adding a container profile and new parts for your base. Skins for wood and MVC will also be available. More detailed information in the article.'),
(11189, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, game, metal blocks, sale, price'),
(11190, 'en-US', 'The skin for metal blocks is now available for sale at a price of 1150 rubles. :830820256771473459:<br/><br/> Now you can give your base a new look with an interesting skin for metal blocks in the game Rust. For 1150 rubles, you will get the opportunity to replace the texture of ordinary metal with a stylish and original container profile. The skin also includes additional details that will add aesthetics to your base.<br/><br/> It is important to note that this skin does not affect the characteristics of metal blocks. They remain the same as before, they just look more attractive and individual. This is suitable for those who want to stand out and create a unique base in the game Rust.<br/><br/> Keep in mind that this is just the first metal block skin to hit the market. More metal block skins are promised in the future, as well as for other materials like wood and MBC. Stay tuned and choose the skins that best suit your playstyle and base design.'),
(11191, 'en-US', 'New Skins for Rust: A Review of the Fresh Batch'),
(11192, 'en-US', 'Review of the new batch of skins for the game Rust on Steam - choose skins that will update your gaming experience and highlight your style.'),
(11193, 'en-US', 'new skins, skins batch, game Rust, review, Steam'),
(11194, 'en-US', '<p>Review of new skins for the game Rust: a fresh batch</p><br/><br/><p> Fans of the game Rust can rejoice - the developers have released a new batch of skins that are available for purchase on Steam. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of survival in the vastness of the post-apocalyptic world and update your gaming experience with new and stylish skins.</p><br/><br/><p> This batch of skins features various categories to ensure that every player can find something to their taste. Choose skins for weapons, armor, buildings, and other items to personalize your game and stand out from other players.</p><br/><br/><p> Each new skin demonstrates a high level of detail and quality. The developers tried to create a unique design so that players enjoy the visual aspect of the game. Updating the appearance affects the overall atmosphere and maintains interest in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Among the new skins, you can find both aggressive and warlike options, as well as bright and unusual ones. Choose skins that reflect your style and help you stand out among other players. Show your individuality and become a real warrior.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition to style, new skins can also have a tactical impact on gameplay. Some skins provide bonuses or improve the characteristics of weapons or armor, allowing you to have an advantage in fights with other players. Be sure to pay attention to the description of each skin to learn its features.</p><br/><br/><p> However, with each new skin comes the question of its cost. Some skins can be expensive, so it is recommended to carefully weigh your options before buying. But remember, sometimes style is worth the money, and choosing unique and high-quality skins can justify the investment.</p><br/><br/><p> Check out the new batch of skins for the game Rust on Steam and decorate your survival story with unique items. Allow yourself to enjoy the benefits of new skins and create your own unique game dossier in the world of Rust.</p>'),
(11195, 'en-US', 'New Twitch Drops start June 11th and end June 17th!'),
(11196, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new Twitch Drops, which will run from June 11th to 17th, offering unique skins from Spanish streamers in the game Rust on Twitch!'),
(11197, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, skins, spanish streamers, event, drops, Twitch'),
(11198, 'en-US', 'It\'s time to start another exciting week of Twitch Drops! The event will run from June 11th to June 17th, and this time it\'s dedicated to Spanish streamers. We already know most of the skins that will be available, but the last 4 remain a mystery to keep our excitement going. Find out with us!<br/><br/> The list of great streamers whose broadcasts will be a source of precious drops and other details about the event are available on the official Twitch Drops website - https://twitch.facepunch.com/. Don\'t miss the opportunity to get unique skins and enjoy the Spanish atmosphere in the game Rust on Twitch!'),
(11199, 'en-US', 'New Twitch Drops Skins in Rust on Steam'),
(11200, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new skins available via Twitch Drops in Rust on Steam. The first two skins are available now, with more to be announced soon.'),
(11201, 'en-US', 'new skins, Twitch Drops, game Rust, Steam, Bellum, updates, getting skins'),
(11202, 'en-US', '<p>The first two skins for the upcoming Twitch Drops in the game Rust(Bellum) are already known!</p><br/><p> I would like to remind you that the next round of Twitch Drops will take place from June 11 to 17.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to get unique skins for your character in the game Rust!</p><br/><p> At the moment, only the first two skins have been announced, the rest will be known a little later.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned to stay up to date with the latest news and get the coolest skins!</p>'),
(11203, 'en-US', 'Update of building animations in the game Rust: the ability to disable and fix lags'),
(11204, 'en-US', 'The article talks about a new update to building animations in the game Rust, which will allow players to disable animations and fix existing lags. The expected release of the update is June 1.'),
(11205, 'en-US', 'animation update, Rust, game, upgrade, building, disabling, settings, lag fix'),
(11206, 'en-US', '<p>Helk, the lead developer of the game Rust, promises interesting innovations in updating the animations of buildings. Now players will have the opportunity to turn off the animations of upgrading and building blocks directly in the settings.</p><br/><p> An important aspect is fixing the existing lags related to animations. The development team aims to have all the issues completely fixed by the release of the update, and players will be able to enjoy a smooth game.</p><br/><p> The update is expected on June 1st, but in the meantime, stay tuned and enjoy the game!</p>'),
(11207, 'en-US', 'Not very good news'),
(11208, 'en-US', 'During the first test of the new improvement of building materials in the game Rust, significant FPS drops were found. Find out more in our article.'),
(11209, 'en-US', 'Not so good news, updates, improvement of building materials, FPS drops, testing, rtx 3090 ti, i9 12900k, developers, gameplay, technical problems'),
(11210, 'en-US', 'Not very good news. During the first test of the new improvement of building materials in the game Rust, strong FPS drops were detected. Testing was carried out on the equipment rtx 3090 ti and i9 12900k. Our team really hopes that the developers will be able to solve this problem and fix the situation so that players can enjoy the game without these technical inconveniences. Follow the updates of our site to stay up to date with the latest news on this issue.'),
(11211, 'en-US', 'What awaits us on June 1st'),
(11212, 'en-US', 'Rust is getting some exciting updates on June 1st on Steam, including a new emoji system, a new building skin, changes to map markers, and an improved cleanup timer.'),
(11213, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, updates, game, emoticons, system, skin, maps, timer, cleaning'),
(11214, 'en-US', 'What awaits us on June 1:<br/> \"Emoticons in chats and much more\"<br/> Emoticons for chat<br/> On the Aux2 test branch, we first got acquainted with the new system of emoticons in the chat. They began to be developed during the \"hacker week\", the developers thought that the absence of emoticons in the chat is like the absence of shoes on your feet, the game is not complete without them. Emoticons will not just be static, they are made animated. At present, there are 23 of them, differing in expressiveness and usefulness.<br/> This new set of features also includes the ability to use any in-game item icon in chat. To do this, simply type a colon (:) and then start typing the name of any item to see the options displayed in the autocomplete window.<br/> They will most likely be released on the main branch of the game in July!<br/><br/> What are they doing with the new \"shipping container\" skin for houses?<br/> In preparation for its launch next week, the newest building skin, the Shipping Container, is getting some tweaks and changes. Specifically, upgrading a block to a container skin will now automatically use the last color the user selected on the spray can. However, if the user has never selected a color on the spray can in that session, it will select a random color to paint. Additionally, the random color option has been removed from the spray can.<br/> It looks like some further changes may be on the way (still in a separate branch), including interior wall colors and default interior wall texture settings. Keep an eye out for images once they\'re merged into the main game branch.<br/> The new skin will become available for purchase on June 1st with the update and Global Wipe as part of the new DLC (just like the Adobe skin).<br/> We will keep you updated as more information becomes available.<br/><br/> Map marker changes<br/> There are a number of different fixes and improvements to the newly added map markers. Here\'s a quick rundown of the changes:<br/> Added a list of markers on the top left (click to focus, can be removed from this list too)<br/> New map markers will now use a previously unused color.<br/> Fixed markers from the previous server briefly appearing on the map when connecting to a different server in the same session.<br/> Fixed the ability to add markers too close to other markers, especially when the cursor was over another marker.<br/><br/> ☢Cleaning timer improvements<br/> With the launch of RT: Nuclear Missile Silo and the subsequent post-wipe activities (harsh, Bradley roaming the area, flying F15s, etc.), the devs are tweaking the settings for server owners to set their own wipe timers. It has now been reworked to use the \"Cronos library\" which makes things like timezone easier to work with. In doing so, they\'ve added a new variable to specify the timezone for wipe calculations (default is Europe/London). They\'ve also added a variable to specify a custom cron expression to use for scheduling wipes (wipeCronOverride). Finally, they\'ve added a \"PrintWipe\" command to print out information for testing configs.<br/> These changes are expected to go into effect next week along with an update and forced cleanup.<br/><br/> ✅Other:<br/> The default value for the maximum number of sleeping bags has been changed from 10 to 15.<br/> Initial work on the steerable tug<br/> Added an invisible collider block under the rocket to prevent loot from falling and becoming unavailable.<br/> Several fixes for Skull Trophies not respecting Streamer Mode.<br/> Work continues on the AI ​​testing arena<br/> Added a slightly increased radius prohibiting construction around the Rocket Silo RT.<br/> Improvements to the key binding system to accommodate more options.<br/> More work at the ferry terminal<br/> Working on the horse\'s idle animation'),
(11215, 'en-US', 'There are several hypotheses regarding animation.'),
(11216, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll look at a few hypotheses related to animation in Rust, including its client-side implementation, the possibility of disabling it, and making changes to avoid problems. We look forward to hearing from the developers!'),
(11217, 'en-US', 'animation, hypotheses, client, performance, shutdown, improvement'),
(11218, 'en-US', 'In the world of game development, animation plays a key role in creating compelling and emotional game characters. Rust also raised animation-related questions, and in this article we will look at some hypotheses about them.<br/><br/> :tochka: The first hypothesis suggests that animation in the Rust game is implemented only on the client side to optimize performance. This approach helps reduce the load on the server and allows the game to run more smoothly.<br/><br/> :tochka: The second hypothesis suggests the possibility of disabling animation in the game settings for those players who do not like it or who find it to be causing performance issues. This allows everyone to individually customize the game for themselves and increase satisfaction from the gaming process.<br/><br/> :tochka: The third hypothesis is that the developers are making changes to the animation to avoid transparent areas during the upgrades. This may be due to technical limitations or a desire to create a more realistic and harmonious gaming environment.<br/><br/> However, no matter what hypotheses we consider, we still have to wait for official confirmation or comments from the developers. But for now, all we can do is watch the events unfold and hope for the best!'),
(11219, 'en-US', 'Container Interior Finish Update - New Skins for Metal in RUST'),
(11220, 'en-US', 'Updating the interior of containers in the game Rust gives you a chance to show your individuality and give your base a unique look. Hurry up to buy new skins for metal and create your own unique world in Rust.'),
(11221, 'en-US', 'update, interior decoration, containers, skins for metal, base compilation, individuality, container functionality, Steam store, unique look'),
(11222, 'en-US', 'Our developers never cease to delight us with new updates in the game Rust! And this time they made significant changes to the design of the interior decoration of containers. Now the skins for metal containers look simply amazing!<br/><br/> Containers in Rust are not just a place to store things, they are also an important part of the gameplay and atmosphere of the game. New metal skins allow players to create their own unique bases, bringing their own style and sense of individuality to them.<br/><br/> Container interior upgrades offer players a wide range of styles and designs to choose from. From classic and simple to modern and stylish, you can choose the finish that suits you best. You can stand out from other players and create a truly unique look for your base.<br/><br/> It’s important to note that container interior upgrades also have practical value. Some skins can improve the functionality of containers by adding extra item slots or increasing their capacity. This can be a deciding factor when organizing your base and optimizing your play space.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget that container interior upgrades are available in the Rust Steam store. You can preview all the skins and choose the one you like the most before purchasing.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your base with new metal skins! Updating the interior decoration of containers in the game Rust gives you a chance to show your individuality and give your base a unique look. Hurry up to buy new skins and create your own unique world in Rust!'),
(11223, 'en-US', 'New construction animation in development'),
(11224, 'en-US', 'On June 1st, all buildings in the game \"Rust\" will be updated with new animations, which will add more realism and fun to the process of building a base.'),
(11225, 'en-US', 'new animation, construction, update, realism, base, game Rust'),
(11226, 'en-US', 'New construction animation is in development.<br/> On June 1st, all buildings in the game \"Rust\" will be updated with new animation.<br/> This important update will add even more realism and enjoyment to the process of building and developing your base.<br/> The new animation promises to be smoother and more realistic, allowing you to create even more impressive and colorful buildings.<br/> Players will be able to watch as walls appear, roofing forms a covering, and objects are placed right before their eyes.<br/> Every detail will be animated with great care and conscientiousness to make the building process even more immersive and exciting.<br/> This update will allow you to follow every step of the construction process and enjoy every moment of creating your base.'),
(11227, 'en-US', 'Hooray! Rust has a new batch of skins that will definitely appeal to fans of unique designs. Now you can give your character and items even more individuality and style.'),
(11228, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, Rust game, new skins, Steam store, personality'),
(11229, 'en-US', '<p>Hooray! Rust has a new batch of skins that will definitely appeal to fans of unique designs. Now you can give your character and items even more individuality and style.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins are a great way to stand out from other players and highlight your uniqueness. Choose from a wide range of skins for weapons, armor, tools, and even the base. Each skin is the result of the work of talented artists and designers who have made every effort to create something truly unique.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget to check out the Steam store to see the entire collection of new skins. There you\'ll find something to suit your taste and be able to pleasantly surprise your friends and rivals. Each skin has its own price and unique features, so choose wisely and evaluate your capabilities.</p><br/><br/><p> Remember that skins do not change anything in the game balance and do not provide any advantages. They simply serve to decorate and add personality to your gaming experience. Feel free to experiment and create unique combinations of skins to create your own style and image.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to get incredibly cool skins that will highlight your individuality and give the game a new atmosphere. Hurry up to visit the Steam store and buy these unique skins while they are still available!</p>'),
(11230, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: More Sleeping Bags on the Map'),
(11231, 'en-US', 'Fresh news for Rust players! The latest update has increased the number of sleeping bags on the map to 15. Find out how this affects your gaming experience and strategy in the new article.'),
(11232, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, bedrooms, quantity, map'),
(11233, 'en-US', '<p>Fresh news for Rust players! In the latest update, the developers have increased the number of sleeping places on the map to 15 pieces. This means that you can now place even more sleeping places to save your progress and return to the necessary places faster and more conveniently.</p><br/><br/><p> Imagine finding the perfect spot for a base or a secret hideout. Previously, you may have had to choose which bedrooms you wanted to install in order to save your progress on the map. But now, thanks to the update, you can place up to 15 sleeping bags, giving you maximum flexibility and convenience.</p><br/><br/><p> This innovation is especially useful for players who play team-based gameplay or engage in trade. You can set up bedrooms in different areas of the map to quickly move between them and manage your resources more efficiently.</p><br/><br/><p> But the increased number of sleeping huts on the map not only adds convenience, but also provides new strategic opportunities. Now you can create multiple bases or secret lairs to set up ambushes or defend against enemies from different sides. Your teammates can also place their sleeping huts next to yours to facilitate cooperation.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust update with more dorms on the map opens up new possibilities and gives players more freedom in planning and strategy. Now you can use resources more efficiently, coordinate with your team better, and protect your fortifications. Place dorms anywhere and play to your heart\'s content!</p>'),
(11234, 'en-US', 'Find out about new skins coming soon to Rust. The Rust Workshop allows players to create and suggest their own skins to be added to the game. In this article, we will tell you about the most anticipated and interesting contenders, as well as the voting process and selection of skins.'),
(11235, 'en-US', 'new skins, contenders, Rust workshop, voting, Rust game, updates, interesting skins, adding to the game'),
(11236, 'en-US', '<h2>New skins that are already being prepared for the game Rust</h2><br/><p> You have already downloaded and installed the game Rust on your computer, and it\'s time to find out what new skins will soon appear in the game. In this article, we will tell you about the freshest and most attractive contenders for adding to the Rust game workshop.</p><br/><br/><h3> What is Rust Workshop?</h3><br/><p> The Rust Workshop is a communication platform where Rust players can create and suggest their own skins to be added to the game. Game owners can vote on their favorite skins, and the most popular ones will be available to unlock and use in Rust.</p><br/><br/><h3> The term \"applicants\"</h3><br/><p> The contenders are a set of new skins proposed by players and are currently in the voting process. Players can rate and comment on these skins to select the most worthy of them to be added to the game.</p><br/><br/><h3> The most anticipated contenders</h3><br/><p> Here are a few skins that have already generated a lot of interest among the Rust community:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> <b>\"Pirate Collection\"</b> - pirate-style weapon and clothing skins made with love for sea adventures.</li><br/><li> <b>\"Cyberpunk\"</b> - skins with a futuristic theme, adding a bit of cyberpunk mood to the game.</li><br/><li> <b>\"The Last Experiment\"</b> is a set of skins that looks like they were created by scientists in a secret experiment lab.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><h3> Voting and subsequent selection</h3><br/><p> Every registered owner of the game Rust has the right to vote for the skins they want to see in the game. The more votes a skin gets, the more chances it has to be added to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> However, Rust developers also take into account other factors such as gameplay balance, how the skin fits into the game world, etc. Sometimes skins with a lot of votes don\'t make it into the game due to compromises made between various factors.</p><br/><br/><h3> Conclusion</h3><br/><p> The game Rust is constantly evolving and updating thanks to the creative contribution of the player community. And it is nice to know that every player can contribute to the creation of new and interesting skins for their favorite game.</p><br/><p> We hope that our overview of the latest releases from the Rust Workshop helped you stay up to date with the hottest skins that will soon appear in the game.</p>'),
(11237, 'en-US', 'Information about new Twitch Drops in the game Rust on Steam'),
(11238, 'en-US', 'Learn all about the new Twitch Drops in Rust on Steam. Get free skins and items just by watching streams. Limited time - from June 11 to June 17.'),
(11239, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam, Skins, Items, Streams, Rewards, Limited Time, Account, Info, Updates'),
(11240, 'en-US', '<p>Dear Rust Steam players! We have great news for you - Twitch Drop\'s are back! From June 11 to June 17, you can get free skins and items for your character in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Twitch Drops are a unique opportunity for you to get exclusive items needed to improve your gameplay. Just connect your Twitch account with your Steam account and start watching Rust streams.</p><br/><br/><p> You don\'t need to do anything extra - just watch streams and get rewards. The more time you spend on streams, the more chances you have to get valuable skins and items.</p><br/><br/><p> Please note that Twitch Drops are limited time events - they will only run from June 11th to June 17th, so don\'t miss your chance to get exclusive character items.</p><br/><br/><p> Be sure to keep an eye on the official Rust game and Twitch channels for all the latest updates and information about Twitch Drops.</p>'),
(11241, 'en-US', 'Emoji in the game chat, first review'),
(11242, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll go into detail about the Rust Steam chat emoji update and give a first look at this new feature. Learn about the benefits of emoji, as well as the tradeoffs and player feedback.'),
(11243, 'en-US', 'Emoji in game chat, Rust update on Steam, Emoji in chat review, Emoji advantages, Emoji compromises, player reviews'),
(11244, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust on Steam has added a new and exciting feature update - Chat Emoji. In this article, we\'ll go into the details of this update and give you a first look at the game\'s Chat Emoji.</p><br/><br/><p> Emoji are a set of small icons, symbols, and emoticons that you can use to express your emotions and show your reaction to what is happening in the game. Emoji in the chat allow players to communicate and interact with each other without having to use long phrases.</p><br/><br/><p> Adding Emoji to the chat brings many benefits. Firstly, it improves communication between players, allowing them to convey their thoughts and emotions more accurately and quickly. Secondly, Emoji make the game chat more diverse and interactive, adding a new level of interaction. Thirdly, adding Emoji helps create a more friendly and fun atmosphere in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Updating chat emojis has its own quirks and trade-offs. On the one hand, they can disrupt the aesthetics of the game and create a discrepancy with its visual style. On the other hand, emojis can affect the game\'s atmosphere and realism, which may not be to everyone\'s taste. The Rust developers on Steam have done their best to find a balance and accommodate player feedback.</p><br/><br/><p> The first reviews of Emoji in the game chat have already appeared. Many players are positive about this update and note that Emoji allow them to express their emotions with greater precision and ease. However, there are also negative reviews related to the loss of the game\'s atmosphere and its realistic nature.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, Emoji in the game chat is an interesting and meaningful update that adds new opportunities for communication and interaction between players. It has its advantages and trade-offs, and each player can decide for themselves whether such an update is right for them or not.</p>'),
(11245, 'en-US', 'To be the first to receive news notifications, leave a reaction below'),
(11246, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with all the latest Rust updates on Steam? Subscribe to notifications and get the latest news first. Just leave a reaction below!'),
(11247, 'en-US', 'Rust game on Steam, news about updates, receive notifications, subscribe to news, latest news'),
(11248, 'en-US', 'Don\'t miss any news about Rust updates on Steam! To stay up to date with all the changes, subscribe to notifications. Just leave a reaction below and get the latest news first. :bell: :arrow_down:'),
(11249, 'en-US', 'New Twitch Drops Will Start in June'),
(11250, 'en-US', 'A new Twitch Drops featuring unique skins for the game Rust is set to launch in June. Details about the event are still being kept under wraps, but it is expected to be even bigger and more exciting than the current Twitch Rivals.'),
(11251, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Twitch Rivals, skins, items, games, streamers'),
(11252, 'en-US', '<p>New Twitch Drops are coming soon! In June, gamers will be able to enjoy exclusive items and skins for the game Rust. Details about the event are still kept secret, but another large-scale event with drops is expected to take place in the fourth quarter of this year.</p><br/><p> During the current Twitch Rivals, participants have the opportunity to earn unique items in the game, but there is very little time left, as the event ends in less than 24 hours. However, this round of drops is just a foretaste of what awaits us in the wonderful world of Rust.</p><br/><p> Lead streamer Alistair has shared some details about the upcoming Twitch Drops. According to him, this year\'s event will be even bigger and more exciting, surpassing even the current Twitch Rivals in terms of the number and variety of participating streamers.</p><br/><p> If you are a fan of the Rust game and Twitch streamers, then don’t miss the launch of the new Twitch Drops, which promises to exceed all expectations. Stay tuned and get ready for exciting adventures and unique items!</p>'),
(11253, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: find out the details!'),
(11254, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest news - a new batch of skins for the game Rust is now available on the Steam platform. The article reviews the most striking and attractive new skins for weapons, clothes and tools, and discusses important aspects of choosing and buying skins.'),
(11255, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, skins for weapons, skins for clothes, game currency'),
(11256, 'en-US', '<p>In the world of the popular game Rust on the Steam platform, a new batch of skins has appeared, which will certainly interest all fans of the game! Do not miss the opportunity to decorate your character or weapon with unique and stylish external elements.</p><br/><p> In this article, we will tell you about the brightest and most attractive new skins that are available in the game Rust. We will consider different categories of skins, such as clothing, weapons, tools and others. One of the most popular options is weapon skins, which allow you to make your weapon more recognizable and stylish. Some skins are real works of art, created by the hands of talented artists.</p><br/><p> But choosing new skins is not only a matter of style and aesthetics. Each skin can have its own advantages and disadvantages. For example, a skin for clothes can be more protective or have other useful characteristics. When choosing a skin for a weapon, it is important to consider its characteristics, such as accuracy, damage, and rate of fire.</p><br/><p> However, before you jump into buying new skins, there are some downsides to consider. Buying skins may require a significant investment in in-game currency or real money. Additionally, some skins may only be available in limited quantities or for a certain period of time, which can create competition among players.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your character or weapon with new and stylish skins in the game Rust! Follow the updates and new collections to always be in trend.</p>'),
(11257, 'en-US', 'Respawn changes are being prepared on a separate branch:'),
(11258, 'en-US', 'A separate branch is preparing changes to respawn in the game Rust. The changes include limiting the number of respawn points, the ability to delete respawn points and change their status to public for other players.'),
(11259, 'en-US', 'respawn, respawn changes, Rust, Rust game, Rust game updates, Steam'),
(11260, 'en-US', '<p>The developers of the game Rust are expecting changes to the respawn, which are currently on a separate branch.</p><br/><p> As part of these changes, several key points will be made:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> The maximum number of respawn points will be limited to 10, including sleeping bags and beds.</li><br/><li> Removing spawn points will be easier: you can do it directly on the spawn point itself. Before deleting, a confirmation window will appear to avoid accidental deletion.</li><br/><li> Ability to delete entire groups of respawn points if they were originally grouped on the map.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> When you delete a sleeping bag or bed, it will remain on the map, but will become public. Any player can claim it.</p><br/><p> Server admins will be given the ability to change the maximum number of respawn points using the variable \"maxsleepingbags number\", which will be set to 10 by default.</p><br/><p> There is no specific release date for this change as they have not yet been added to the staging branch. However, they will likely be ready for the June update.</p>'),
(11261, 'en-US', 'Check out Twitch Skin Drops for Rust. Earn unique rewards for watching Rust streams on Twitch and expand your game collection.'),
(11262, 'en-US', 'Rust Game, Twitch Drops, Skin Giveaways, Streams, Game Rewards');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(11263, 'en-US', '<p>Attention Rust fans! The long-awaited Twitch Drops are coming soon, bringing you unique rewards for watching Rust streams on the Twitch platform.</p><br/><br/><p> Now you have a great chance to get exclusive items just by following a few simple steps. All you have to do is connect to streamers broadcasting the game Rust and enjoy their content. During the stream, you will have the opportunity to get your Twitch Drop, which will be available for you in the game Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust Twitch Drops are here, so don’t miss out on your chance to claim your rewards now! Simply follow the instructions provided on the Twitch page to participate in the drops and earn valuable items for your in-game collection.</p>'),
(11264, 'en-US', 'New skin for metal buildings in the form of containers'),
(11265, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new container-style metal building skin coming to Rust on June 1st. Change the look of your bases and buildings, or enjoy updated gameplay. Stay up to date with the latest news and prepare for an event you can\'t miss.'),
(11266, 'en-US', 'Rust, skin for metal buildings, containers, release, container color, game update'),
(11267, 'en-US', '<p>The exciting game Rust will once again please its fans with a new skin for metal buildings! Meet the skin in the form of stylish containers, which will be released on June 1.</p><br/><p> The new skin will give players a unique opportunity to change the appearance of their bases and buildings. The skin will be available for metal buildings, adding an original look to them, and maybe something else too…</p><br/><p> Rust fans around the world are eagerly awaiting the release of the new skin. However, it is not yet known whether the ability to change the color of containers will be added with the release of this DLC. The developers are experimenting and implementing various features, and perhaps soon players will be able to enjoy the full range of possibilities.</p><br/><p> It is worth noting that the new skin will be available on the Staging branch of the game an hour after the release. So all Rust fans will be able to evaluate the new content live and enjoy the gameplay with updated metal buildings.</p><br/><p> Stay up to date with the latest news and get ready to dive into the exciting world of Rust with a new skin for metal buildings! June 1st is an event you can\'t miss.</p>'),
(11268, 'en-US', 'New changes to AI behavior are being prepared on a separate branch'),
(11269, 'en-US', 'New changes to AI behavior in Rust are being prepared on a separate branch. The changes concern the field of view, player pursuit, and attack response.'),
(11270, 'en-US', 'Rust, game update, AI behavior, scientists, changes'),
(11271, 'en-US', 'New changes to AI behavior are being prepared on a separate branch:<br/><br/> • Scientists\' field of vision has been significantly reworked, making it much easier for players to remain undetected. This means you\'ll be able to sneak up behind them much more easily, or just run past them as long as you\'re not in their field of vision. But keep in mind that scientists will still notice you even from behind if you get too close to them.<br/> • Scientists will more often run directly to cover instead of slowly walking backwards and shooting back when they are low on health or ammo<br/> • If a scientist is attacked by a player he has not yet seen, he will immediately take a combat position and start shooting back instead of immediately running to the nearest shelter<br/> • Scientists will be less likely to run for cover if they take damage, but if they have less than 40% of their total health remaining, the chance of them stopping fighting and running for cover will be increased<br/><br/> The changes are still not final and may change, and the release date is still unknown.'),
(11272, 'en-US', 'Changes to the rules for receiving drops on the Twitch Drops website'),
(11273, 'en-US', 'The Twitch Drops website has changed the rules for receiving drops again. Now, to get skins for the game Rust, you will need to spend time watching streams of various teams and streamers.'),
(11274, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Skins, Rule Changes, Streams, Rust Game'),
(11275, 'en-US', '<p>The Twitch Drops website has changed the rules for receiving drops again. Now you will need to spend time watching streams of different teams to get them.</p><br/><p> To get the first skin of any team, you will need to watch 2 hours of ANY streamer\'s stream from the corresponding team. And to get the second skin, you will need to watch the stream of either the captain or co-captain of the team, again for 2 hours.</p><br/><p> Now, to get all the skins of all the teams, you will need to spend about 20 hours, and the event itself will last about 100 hours.</p><br/><p> The changes will come into effect tomorrow at 21:00 Moscow time, so don\'t miss the opportunity to get new skins for your character in the game Rust!</p>'),
(11276, 'en-US', 'Latest news!'),
(11277, 'en-US', 'The latest news on updates and changes in the game Rust. Including a new building skin, the ability to set a C4 frequency, development of the Caldera Biome, the addition of cinematic gestures and changes to the safe zone.'),
(11278, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust updates, Rust game news, C4 in Rust, new skins in Rust, Caldera Biome in Rust'),
(11279, 'en-US', '<p>:tochka: Facepunch is preparing a new skin for the game\'s buildings, similar to Adobe. There was an earlier post about developing buildings from branches, but this idea was abandoned. There is no information yet on what type of buildings were used for the new skin.</p><br/><br/><p> :tochka: Will make changes to the game related to C4. Now it will be possible to set the frequency of explosion distance of C4 directly in the inventory or holding it in your hands.</p><br/><br/><p> :tochka: During the hack weeks, the developers worked on the Caldera Biome - a new biome with lava formations.</p><br/><br/><p> :tochka: New cinematic gestures will be added for the character.</p><br/><br/><p> :tochka: Bradley said that you shouldn\'t target players who are in the safe zone. Also, if a player is targeted and enters the safe zone, Bradley will stop targeting them, although this can take up to 2 seconds.</p>'),
(11280, 'en-US', 'Scientists have reworked their field of vision'),
(11281, 'en-US', 'In Rust, scientists now have an improved field of view, opening up new opportunities for players to sneak in and change tactics.'),
(11282, 'en-US', 'scientists, field of view, Rust, update, secret penetration, tactics, strategy'),
(11283, 'en-US', 'Scientists in Rust now have an improved field of view, making them less alert to players. This opens up new opportunities for sneaking around and sneaking around scientists on the map.<br/><br/> Additionally, scientists will no longer immediately hide after being attacked. There is now a certain chance that a scientist will only attempt to hide if their health drops below 40%. This adds a new complexity and tactical element to interacting with scientists and allows players to employ different strategies to evade and eliminate them.'),
(11284, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust - a huge selection of unique looks!'),
(11285, 'en-US', 'Find out about the release of a new batch of skins in the game Rust, which offers a huge selection of unique looks for your character!'),
(11286, 'en-US', 'new batch, skins, game Rust, unique skins'),
(11287, 'en-US', '<p>Great news for all fans of the game Rust! A new batch of skins has been released, which adds a huge selection of unique looks for your character. Now you have the opportunity to express your individuality and stand out from other players in the virtual world of the game!</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes many different types of clothing, weapons, building materials and other items that you can use in the game. Each skin has a unique design and style, which allows you to create a unique look for your character.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main advantages of the new batch of skins is the variety of choice. You will find skins of different colors, shapes, styles and themes, which will allow you to choose the perfect look for your character. Whether it is a stylish camouflage for walking in the wilds of the forest, a bright and expressive outfit for hiking in the city or an exotic suit for traveling through desert areas - you will definitely have something to choose from!</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, new skins not only add uniqueness to your character, but can also have practical benefits. For example, some skins may have improved characteristics, such as increased durability or improved shooting accuracy. Thus, by choosing a skin, you can not only change the appearance, but also increase the effectiveness of your character in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> However, as in any game, choosing skins is a compromise between aesthetics and gameplay. Some skins may have a higher price or be available only for paid purchase. Also, some skins may be rare and require a lot of time or effort to obtain. Therefore, before buying or using a skin, it is worth carefully weighing all the factors and deciding what is most important to you - external individuality or gameplay efficiency.</p><br/><br/><p> In any case, the new batch of skins in the game Rust gives players a huge freedom of choice and the opportunity to create a unique look for their character. Stay up to date with the latest updates and do not miss the chance to add color and individuality to your gaming session!</p>'),
(11288, 'en-US', 'Be the first to receive notifications about Rust game news on Steam'),
(11289, 'en-US', 'React below and be the first to receive notifications about Rust on Steam. Stay up to date with the latest updates, features, and fixes!'),
(11290, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, notifications, news, Steam'),
(11291, 'en-US', '<p>Don\'t want to miss any important Rust Steam updates? React below and be the first to receive notifications! :arrow_down:</p><br/><p> Stay up to date with the latest news on updates, bug fixes, added features, and other changes in the game Rust. Our team collects the latest news and information for you in one place, so you don’t have to waste time searching.</p><br/><p> React below and be the first to receive Rust updates! We\'ve got in-depth reviews and analysis to help you understand the new features and changes, and how they\'ll impact your gameplay.</p><br/><p> To make sure you don\'t miss any important news, react below and follow our updates. Stay informed and ahead of the gaming curve!</p><br/><p> Join us and be the first to receive all the news about Rust game updates on Steam!</p>'),
(11292, 'en-US', 'Some changes to the rules for receiving drops on Twitch Rivals'),
(11293, 'en-US', 'This article covers some changes to the rules for receiving drops on Twitch Rivals.'),
(11294, 'en-US', 'changes, rules, drops, Twitch Rivals, skins'),
(11295, 'en-US', '<h2>Changes to Twitch Rivals Drop Rules</h2><br/><p> There are currently some changes to the rules for receiving drops on Twitch Rivals. The new rules include:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Reduce the number of hours it takes to watch a second streamer on a team.</li><br/><li> Establishing a strict order for receiving drops from streamers: first from the \"co-captain\", and then from the team captain.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> Now, to get all the streamer skins, you will have to watch a total of 36 hours. 2 hours per streamer, a total of 18 streamers with unique drops.</p><br/><p> Distribution will start on May 16 at 21:00 Moscow time.</p>'),
(11296, 'en-US', 'All twitch drop skins'),
(11297, 'en-US', 'Find out about all the skins that can be obtained as part of the Twitch drop in the game Rust. Update your virtual wardrobe with new colorful and exclusive skins, which are described in detail in the article.'),
(11298, 'en-US', 'all twitch drop skins, Rust skins, getting Rust skins, twitch drop skins, exclusive Rust skins'),
(11299, 'en-US', 'Learn about all the skins that can be obtained through Twitch drops in Rust. Now you can decorate your items in the game with new colorful and exclusive skins. This article covers all the available skins that can be obtained by playing Rust via Twitch. We talk in detail about each skin, its appearance, features, and how to get them. Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your virtual wardrobe and stand out from other players!'),
(11300, 'en-US', 'A couple of new skins have been added to the drops site'),
(11301, 'en-US', 'New skins have been added to the Rust drops site, offering players unique customization and trading opportunities.'),
(11302, 'en-US', 'added skins, drops site, Rust, customization, trade, game economy'),
(11303, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust game drops site has updated its skin collection with several new items. These skins will be available to players, allowing them to add interesting and unique elements to their in-game gear.</p><br/><p> The new skins on the drops site are presented in different categories: weapons, clothing, and items that can be used in the game. Each of these skins has its own unique visual style that will help players stand out and express their individuality in the virtual world of Rust.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that these new skins provide unique opportunities to customize the Rust gaming experience. Players can choose between different skin options for their weapons, clothing, and items, allowing them to create unique combinations and stand out from the rest of the players.</p><br/><p> Adding new skins to the drops site also opens up additional trading opportunities for players. These skins can now be purchased and sold to other players, creating new economic opportunities and stimulating the game economy.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection and add new elements to your game equipment. Visit the Rust drops site and check out the new skins to find something to your taste and style.</p>'),
(11304, 'en-US', 'Official trailer for the new update'),
(11305, 'en-US', 'Official trailer for the new Rust update. Find out about all the new features and improvements in the game. Watch the trailer now!'),
(11306, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, trailer, news, Steam'),
(11307, 'en-US', 'A new update to the game Rust is on its way! Along with it comes a lot of new features, improvements and fixes. To please you about them and show you what awaits you in the near future, we have prepared an official trailer for the new update. In it, you will be able to see all the most interesting and exciting moments that await you in the game.<br/><br/> You can watch the trailer at the link: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TSZ6ckRYGv4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TSZ6ckRYGv4</a> . Don\'t miss the opportunity to look into the future of Rust and stay up to date with all the latest updates. Enjoy watching!'),
(11308, 'en-US', 'New skins for the game Rust'),
(11309, 'en-US', 'New Rust skins are unique items on Steam that add visual variety and personality to Rust. They do not affect gameplay and offer a wide range of colorful skins for every player. Check out the Steam store and update your Rust skin collection!'),
(11310, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, unique items, appearance, quality of execution, functionality, Steam store, joy of the game'),
(11311, 'en-US', 'It\'s time for good news for all fans of the game Rust! A new batch of skins for your game collection was recently released on Steam. These unique and colorful items will be an indispensable addition to your gaming atmosphere and will help you stand out from other players.<br/><br/> The new batch of skins includes a variety of items, from weapons and clothing to buildings and vehicles. Each skin is carefully designed and has its own unique theme, reflecting different eras and styles. Now you can look stylish, not only equipped, but also dressed.<br/><br/> Whether it\'s a fully decked out tank or a brightly painted house, the new skins will allow you to customize your base and showcase your personal style. You\'ll be able to express your imagination and create a unique space that will amaze you and your friends.<br/><br/> The designs of the new skins are colorful and spectacular, and the quality of execution is top-notch. The developers have invested a lot of time and talent to create these amazing items that are guaranteed to add new life to the game Rust.<br/><br/> However, it should be remembered that all these skins are just an appearance that does not affect the game characteristics of the items. They will not give you any advantages in the game, but only add beauty and variety. Therefore, before making your choice, be sure to focus on what is important - the quality and functionality of the items.<br/><br/> Remember that the most important thing is the gameplay and satisfaction from the game. And if new skins can add joy and improve the visual experience of the game Rust, then why not take advantage of this opportunity?<br/><br/> So if you\'re ready to dive into a world of style and individuality, don\'t waste any time and head over to the Steam store to see all the new skins available for Rust. Enjoy the game and have unique adventures with Rust and its unique skins!'),
(11312, 'en-US', 'New skin for stone building blocks in the game Rust'),
(11313, 'en-US', 'The game Rust has a new skin for stone building blocks - adobe. The article tells about its features, and also anticipates the release of other skins for different materials.'),
(11314, 'en-US', 'skins, game Rust, stone building blocks, adobe, decorations, wood, metal, MVC, brick, cargo container, brutalism'),
(11315, 'en-US', '<h3>New Stone Building Block Skin Now Available for Sale</h3><br/><p> Now you can buy a new skin for stone building blocks in the game Rust for only 1060 rubles.</p><br/><p> This skin changes the texture of the stone to adobe and adds new decorations to your base. It is important to note that in terms of parameters it is no different from a regular stone.</p><br/><p> In addition, the developers plan to release skins for other materials such as wood, metal and MFC (magnetic fiber composite).</p><br/><h4> Skins to come:</h4><br/><ul><br/><li> For the tree - \"Tree from Legacy\"</li><br/><li> For stone - \"Brick\"</li><br/><li> For metal - \"Cargo container\"</li><br/><li> For MVK - \"Brutalism\"</li><br/></ul><br/><p> Unfortunately, there is no information about the release date of these skins yet, but the developers are working on it.</p>'),
(11316, 'en-US', 'New Twitch Drops Skins in Rust'),
(11317, 'en-US', 'The Twitch Drops site has been updated, giving you the opportunity to get new skins in the game Rust. Find out what skins will be available and how you can get them simply by watching streamers play on Twitch.'),
(11318, 'en-US', 'new skins, twitch drops, game Rust, streamers, update, 23 skins'),
(11319, 'en-US', '<p>The Twitch Drops website has been updated! We now know which skins will be available — 23 in total. Watchers of certain streamers will be able to get 18 of them, and the remaining 5 will be part of the general drops. Details on the skins that streamers will receive will be announced closer to the event.</p><br/><br/><p> The Twitch Drops event will run from May 16th at 9:00 PM to May 20th at 9:00 PM. During this time, players will be able to earn these valuable skins simply by watching their favorite streamers play. Get ready, because the chances of getting new skins in Rust have never been higher!</p>'),
(11320, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update News: Bradley APC and Tanks on the Road'),
(11321, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new features of Rust thanks to the update: Bradley APC will be able to move on roads, and tanks will appear on the map that will eliminate players. Find out how to test the new functionality now and when the update will be released.'),
(11322, 'en-US', 'Rust, game update, Bradley APC, tanks, wipe, event'),
(11323, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust game update will please players with new features. Now the Bradley APC will be able to move on roads, which will add realism and variety to the gameplay. This long-awaited feature will be part of the \"final\" of the wipe, and will also be tested with the help of F-15E fighter-bombers that will attack the island.</p><br/><p> Additionally, there will be several tanks on the map that will move around the ring road and eliminate any players nearby. However, it should be noted that the tanks will only be available shortly before the wipe ends in order to maintain the balance of the gameplay. The developers also confirmed their intention to introduce a similar event to the regular game in the future.</p><br/><p> If you want to check out the new tanks right now, you can open the \"Rust - Staging Branch\" and join any official server.</p><br/><p> Don\'t waste time, because the update will be released tomorrow at 21:00 Moscow time! Get ready for new opportunities and an exciting gaming atmosphere.</p>'),
(11324, 'en-US', 'New Recoil Changes'),
(11325, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new recoil changes coming to Rust: increased accuracy in burst fire for the MP5 and Thompson, more predictable recoil for the Thompson. These changes will be implemented in the May 4 update.'),
(11326, 'en-US', 'Rust, game update, recoil change, shooting, accuracy'),
(11327, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has seen some recoil changes that will impact gameplay. Here are the key changes to be aware of:<br/><br/> • The MP5 and Thompson are now slightly more accurate when firing in bursts, meaning players will now be able to better control recoil and improve their accuracy when firing.<br/> • The Thompson\'s recoil should now be more predictable. The developers have made adjustments to its recoil to make its shooting more consistent and logical.<br/><br/> These recoil changes will be added to the Rust game update on May 4 at 21:00 Moscow time. Be sure to update the game and try the new recoil for yourself.'),
(11328, 'en-US', 'Developers are cutting Rust+ capabilities to combat bots'),
(11329, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have decided to limit some features of Rust+ to combat popular bots that automate gameplay. The new restrictions will be included in an upcoming update on May 4.'),
(11330, 'en-US', 'Rust+, bots, changes, update, limitations'),
(11331, 'en-US', 'Developers are cutting Rust+ capabilities to combat bots<br/><br/> A number of changes are being prepared on a separate branch that will slightly reduce the capabilities of Rust+. In particular, the application will no longer be able to track the location of boxes, explosion sites, and view cameras on monuments.<br/><br/> Viewing player-hosted cameras will also be restricted - they can now only be viewed when you are disconnected from the server. Tracking players and other objects through cameras will also become significantly more difficult, if not impossible.<br/><br/> Why these changes? Over the past year, some bots have become popular among players, which have automated many processes through the functionality of Rust+:<br/> • track events on the server (helicopter explosion, arrival of a cargo ship, location of a hacked box, etc.)<br/> • notifications about the connection and disconnection of the player you are interested in<br/> • information about which players are currently present at a particular monument (using cameras on the monuments)<br/> • launch a drone that will automatically move and track the movement of any player<br/> • and much more<br/><br/> Over the last two months, complaints about these bots and calls for limiting their capabilities or banning them completely have been actively appearing in the foreign Rust community. Recently, the developers officially stated that they do not support these bots, as they abuse the functionality of the application.<br/><br/> Today one of the paid bots stopped selling subscriptions due to upcoming changes and the uncertainty about the future of bots in general.<br/><br/> The changes will most likely be included in the next update, which will be released on May 4 at 21:00 Moscow time.'),
(11332, 'en-US', 'Developers are heating up the anticipation for a new update'),
(11333, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust continue to tease the new update. Less than four days left until the release. Find out what changes and innovations await players in the latest Rust update.'),
(11334, 'en-US', 'Rust update, teaser, Rust news, update release date, game update, game changes, update on Steam'),
(11335, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust continue to fuel the interest and imagination of their fans by teasing a new update. After many months of anticipation, we only have four days to wait until its release. There is already a list of changes that will make the game even better and more exciting. Details about the update and its release date can be found below. Fasten your seat belts and get ready for a new adventure in Rust!'),
(11336, 'en-US', 'The developers have added the ability to play videos directly in the game'),
(11337, 'en-US', 'Rust developers have added the ability to play videos directly in the game. Server administrators can enter commands to make the video appear for all players. This allows videos to be used for training and introducing game updates.'),
(11338, 'en-US', 'Rust game, update, video playback, server admins, broadcastplayvideo'),
(11339, 'en-US', '<p>The developers of the game Rust have taken a new step towards improving the gaming experience. Now server administrators can play videos directly in the game to share content with all players.</p><br/><p> A new feature called \"broadcastplayvideo\" allows admins to play a video for all players on the server. They can simply enter a command and the video will automatically be displayed on all players\' screens.</p><br/><p> This feature has already been tested on the EU Facepunch Staging server, where 101 players took part. The developers did not delay the implementation of the new feature and decided to check its functionality immediately.</p><br/><p> This feature opens up new perspectives for the Rust gaming environment. Server administrators can use videos to teach new players or introduce new game updates. Players, in turn, will be able to enjoy additional content right in the game without leaving it.</p><br/><p> Innovative changes to the Rust game continue to make it a unique platform for interaction and entertainment.</p>'),
(11340, 'en-US', 'New Skins for Rust: Review of the Latest Collection'),
(11341, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of Rust skins on Steam and find the perfect one to update the look of your character and items in the game world.'),
(11342, 'en-US', 'new Rust skins, skins collection review, Steam, Rust game'),
(11343, 'en-US', '<p>A new batch of skins for the game Rust has been released! In this article, we will look at the most colorful and exciting skins added in the latest collection of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Each new collection of skins in the game Rust is a chance to diversify the appearance of your character, weapons and items in the game world. New skins give the gameplay freshness and originality, allowing players to stand out from the crowd.</p><br/><br/><p> The latest batch of skins features a huge variety of designs, including stylish weapon camouflages, striking character costumes, and unique variants for various items. You can turn your weapon into a real work of art or create your own unique combination of colors and textures.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that players have a wide range of skins to choose from, from inexpensive and affordable options to exclusive and rare items that will become a real rarity in your collection.</p><br/><br/><p> However, when choosing new skins, the player faces a difficult choice. After all, original and rare skins can slightly reduce the game\'s performance, especially on weak systems. Therefore, before buying a new skin, it is worth weighing all the pros and cons.</p><br/><br/><p> Another thing to consider is the price. Skins all have different prices, and it can often be difficult to justify an expensive purchase, especially if you don\'t plan on using the skin for long or don\'t play the game on a regular basis.</p><br/><br/><p> However, new skins in Rust provide an opportunity to get acquainted with the creative works of the community and appreciate the unique style of the developers. They make the game more interesting and diverse, and even if you are not going to buy a new skin, you can still enjoy its appearance in the game world.</p><br/><br/><p> So don\'t miss the chance to update your gaming experience and freshen up the look of your character and items. Look for a new batch of skins for the game Rust in the Steam store and decorate your game world to your taste!</p>'),
(11344, 'en-US', 'Rust Game on Steam: House Skins Update and New Objects in the Game'),
(11345, 'en-US', 'This article talks about the new Rust update on Steam, which includes house skins, a nuclear missile silo, new ammo models, and other fixes and changes. The article also mentions possible DLC and upcoming Twitch Drops.'),
(11346, 'en-US', 'Rust Game, Steam, Updates, Skins for Houses, Nuclear Missile Silo, Ammo, Twitch Drops, DLC'),
(11347, 'en-US', 'Hello everyone! There will be interesting news today✌<br/> For the most delicious part - skins for houses.<br/> The \"buildingskins3\" branch has been merged into the regular staging branch. At this point, you can enable building skins with your hammer and select the first Adobe skin.<br/><br/> Based on the commits, it looks like there are a few more building skins on the way, including brick, stone blocks, and \"Tent Buildings\" variants. Apparently, these will be skins, which means the main strength characteristics of the building for a specific material (mvk, metal, wood, branches), but there are rumors that the developers will implement another intermediate material to the ones we are used to, which currently exist in the game. Time will tell.<br/><br/> There are also rumors that this update will soon be part of a new DLC. Nothing is confirmed yet. We will keep you updated when more is known. But as they say, money has no smell, so don\'t be surprised if it is a DLC and costs the same as the game!<br/><br/> ☢More work on the nuclear missile silo<br/> The developers are hard at work on the newest future RT - Nuclear Missile Silo. A number of changes have been made to Aux2, including reworking the above-ground buildings, changing the blue exit map puzzle, adjusting the lighting, and more.<br/><br/> Interestingly, there\'s a new sub-branch called \"Big Bang.\" This, coupled with a couple of teasers posted on Twitter, makes it seem like this RT will be more than just a place to loot and shoot NPCs. Will this be part of the wipe event in some way?<br/> Many assume that this mine will launch a rocket before the server wipe and blow everything to hell) And then the server will shut down for an update. What do you think?<br/> Perhaps this RT will be released in the May update!<br/><br/> More models of the world of ammunition<br/> Work is underway on some new ammo models. Soon, instead of small bags, when you throw away ammo, you will get ammo boxes, not primitive bags!<br/><br/> Twitch Drops Schedule for May<br/> The Facepunch Twitch page has been updated and the next round of Twitch Drops is scheduled for May 16-20. Make sure all your accounts are linked to Twitch!<br/><br/> ✅Other updates:<br/> Rust+ cameras no longer see players and names at a great distance.<br/> Fixed missing markers on the team leader map after death.<br/> Add a replicated variable \"serverallowsteamnicknames\" to allow modded servers to disable nicknames on Steam.<br/> Looks like a new recycler animation is coming soon.<br/> Initial addition of improvised weapon rack (still in separate thread).<br/> First experiments with displaying a list of current map markers on the left side of the map screen.<br/> Working on blinding AI with flashbang grenades.<br/> Some loot settings near and on power lines.'),
(11348, 'en-US', 'A couple more screenshots, exclusively from Rust RU'),
(11349, 'en-US', 'Dive into new adventures in the world of Rust with exclusive screenshots from Rust RU. Find out about the latest updates and changes that will add new depth to your gaming sessions. Prepare for magnificent landscapes and unique design solutions available only to our readers.'),
(11350, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, screenshots, design, game'),
(11351, 'en-US', '<p>Get ready for new exciting adventures in the world of Rust! We are happy to share with you some more exclusive screenshots received from the Rust RU development team.</p><br/><p> This post offers a unique look at the latest updates and changes to the game Rust. You will see new locations, impressive graphics and many other fantastic features that will add new depth and realism to your gaming sessions.</p><br/><p> The main feature of this post is exclusive screenshots from Rust RU. You will see some amazing views that they were able to make available only to our readers. Get ready for magnificent landscapes and unique design solutions that await you in the latest updates of the Rust game.</p><br/><p> The game Rust continues to develop and attract more and more fans, thanks to constant updates and improvements. Exclusive screenshots from Rust RU are exactly what you need to feel the full power and appeal of this project.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to see all the most interesting and exciting things that Rust RU offers! Join us and experience the real pleasure of the game!</p>'),
(11352, 'en-US', 'To be the first to receive news notifications, leave a reaction below'),
(11353, 'en-US', 'Want to be the first to know about Rust news and updates on Steam? Just react below and get notifications straight to your Steam!'),
(11354, 'en-US', 'Rust news, Rust updates, Rust game on Steam, update notifications, Rust fans'),
(11355, 'en-US', '<p>Want to always be up to date with the latest news about Rust game updates on Steam? All you need to do is react below to be the first to receive notifications!</p><br/><p> We understand that staying up to date with all the changes and updates to the Rust game is extremely important for true fans. Our development team is constantly working on improving the gameplay and adding new features. That\'s why we offer you the opportunity to be the first to know about all the news and updates - just leave a reaction below and receive fresh information directly in your Steam notifications!</p><br/><p> Every update of Rust on Steam is the result of our time and effort invested in creating the best gaming experience for you. We regularly work on fixing bugs, adding new content and improving game mechanics to make the game even more exciting and interesting.</p><br/><p> Now you can be sure that you will always be up to date with all the news about the game Rust. Just leave a reaction below and get notifications about news and updates first! Your support is an important motivation for our team, and we are proud to have such passionate fans as you.</p>'),
(11356, 'en-US', 'New Building Skins in Rust: Preview and Expectations'),
(11357, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Rust stone building skins coming soon! Unique customization options for your bases and buildings.'),
(11358, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, DLC, building skins, stone buildings'),
(11359, 'en-US', '<p>Having learned that a new DLC with building skins will soon be released in the game Rust, we decided to share with you the first details and examples of these unique skins.</p><br/><p> Big news for all fans of Rust on Steam: the developers have announced a new DLC that will add a lot of colorful skins and options for customizing the appearance of your buildings. This means that you will have even more options for creating a unique and individual gaming experience.</p><br/><p> Today we want to present you with examples of the first skins that will be available for stone buildings. Your base in Rust will become even brighter and more unique thanks to these beautiful and aesthetic skins.</p><br/><p> The convenience of using new skins on buildings lies in their direct integration with the game interface. You do not have to take up inventory space for skins, and there is no need to use temporary items. Just select a skin for your building and it will instantly change its appearance.</p><br/><p> Imagine being able to create a castle with stone walls that have a unique look that is different from all other players. Or build a beautiful village with houses of different styles, using different skins for each building.</p><br/><p> The distinctive feature of the new skins for buildings in Rust is their high quality and attention to detail. Each skin is created with great love and care so that you will enjoy looking at them even after many hours of play.</p><br/><p> We are looking forward to the release of the new DLC with skins for buildings in the game Rust and are sure that they will be a great success among players. Do not miss the opportunity to make your buildings even more attractive and unique!</p>'),
(11360, 'en-US', 'Latest news from the fields of Rust!'),
(11361, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest updates to Rust, including the Nuclear Missile Silo, changes to the skin system, and Rust+.'),
(11362, 'en-US', 'latest news, Rust fields, nuclear missile silo, skins, changes, Rust+'),
(11363, 'en-US', 'Latest news from the fields of Rust!<br/><br/> :kv:Nuclear missile bunker<br/> In the AUX2 branch, the Nuclear Missile Silo is now available for testing! Much is still in development, with some features not yet added. However, we can see not only the layout of this new RT with its dungeons and missile, but also a look at the newest NPC model - the NVGM Scientist.<br/><br/> With all this unfinished work, the features are limited and everything is subject to change 10 times. There is no loot or radiation at the moment, but you can open a hatch using a button in one of the small buildings above ground. Be careful, it only opens for about 30 seconds before closing again.<br/><br/> Once you jump into the hatch, you can explore a few levels down next to a large rocket under the hatch. In addition to the 10 new NVGM scientists, you\'ll find living quarters, bathrooms, computer labs, and more. Then, once you reach the bottom level, you\'ll find a room with warheads, barrels, a truck, and computer racks. To escape, you\'ll need to get your hands on a blue keycard. Based on the commits, it looks like some additional features are in the works as well.<br/><br/> Also interesting, but still unclear, is that this RT will apparently provide some additional information about Rust\'s history. A few years ago, the devs even talked about some kind of player-triggered nuclear devastation event... So who knows what this RT might actually be for!<br/><br/> If you want to explore it yourself, just switch to the AUX2:Steam Library branch, right click Rust [staging], click properties, betas tab and select AUX2 from the list, then run the client update).<br/><br/> :kv:Skins can no longer be disabled<br/> In more controversial news, a commit this week meant that players can no longer disable workshop skins. This means that all players will now be able to see what cosmetic skins people are wearing. Previously, many players chose to disable this feature to negate any potential benefits that different cosmetic skins might have.<br/><br/> However, the developers note that skins are part of the default gameplay experience, and it is important to ensure that they are not disabled to keep the gameplay the same. Regardless of your view on this, you can expect this to be rolled out with the update and forced wipe on May 4.<br/><br/> :kv:Rust+ Changes<br/> There are some changes coming to the way Rust+ works. Here\'s a quick rundown:<br/> The range at which Rust+ cameras can see players will be reduced.<br/> Allow Rust+ cameras to only see the names of players who are near the camera.<br/> A parameter will be introduced for private servers to control the above ranges.<br/><br/> :kv:Building skins<br/> More work this week on the 3rd branch building skins. Rumor has it that this will be an upcoming DLC ​​that will allow you to change the look of your real bases. According to the commits, there will be some kind of brutalist skin along with brick and stone block. We\'ll keep you posted as more is revealed.<br/><br/> :kv:Other changes:<br/> More work on the mission editor<br/> Work on attack helicopter continues<br/> More work on deployable quarries<br/> Work is underway to add a menu option to switch between using Steam nicknames for friends.<br/> Added the ability to change the radial menu from hold to toggle mode so it works on trackpads.<br/> Fixed an issue where the pumpkin would be placed on your head when you right clicked it in your inventory.'),
(11364, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: review and information'),
(11365, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins in the game Rust, choose unique skins and create a unique image for your character. Review and information about the new skins in the article.'),
(11366, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins, Rust game, skins review, information about new skins, style in the game, skin selection, aesthetic value, balancing, player preferences, fans of the game Rust'),
(11367, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for fans of the game Rust - a new batch of skins has been released! If you want to decorate your items and equipment in the game, then you have many new options. An overview and detailed information about the new skins in the game Rust are available in this article.</p><br/><br/><p> Obtaining and using skins is not only an opportunity to give your character a unique style, but also a way to stand out from other players. New skins will help you create a unique image and emphasize your individuality in the Rust game world.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins features various categories, including weapons, tools, clothing, and even buildings. You will be able to choose the skin that suits you and further customize it to your taste. Unique color schemes, detailing, and stylish elements - all this makes the new skins in the game Rust even more attractive.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that all skins are available on the Steam platform, where you can purchase them for one of the available currencies. It is also worth noting that a percentage of sales of new skins goes directly to the game developers, which allows them to actively support and update Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> Balancing and making decisions on adding new skins is an important aspect of the development of the Rust game. The developers take into account the wishes and preferences of the player community to create skins that will be popular and in demand. They strive to find a compromise between the originality of new skins and their compliance with the general style of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> It is also worth mentioning that skins in the game Rust do not affect the game mechanics and balance. They are a carrier of aesthetic value, allowing players to express their creativity and preferences. At the same time, the developers carefully monitor that skins do not give an advantage in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to understand that the assessment of new skins in the game Rust is a subjective opinion of each player. Some fans may like stylish and modern skins, while others prefer classic designs. It all depends on the personal preferences and taste of each player.</p><br/><br/><p> Thus, the new batch of skins in the game Rust is a great opportunity to update your wardrobe and items in the game to create a unique image. Choose the skins you like and enjoy the game in a new style!</p>'),
(11368, 'en-US', 'Steam In-Game Store Rate Update'),
(11369, 'en-US', 'Steam has made changes to the in-game store rate. Prices for in-game purchases have changed. Read the article to find out all the details!'),
(11370, 'en-US', 'Steam, update, rate, in-game store, prices'),
(11371, 'en-US', 'We are happy to share great news for players! Steam has made changes to the in-game store exchange rate. This means that prices for in-game purchases have changed. Previously, for each purchase of game currency in games on Steam you had to pay 72.5 rubles, but now it costs 82 rubles. Such an adjustment to the exchange rate may affect your purchases and requires your attention.'),
(11372, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest skins that are still in the candidate stage in the Rust game workshop. Let\'s consider interesting and original options that can become part of the Rust game universe. Take part in the voting and influence the future appearance of the gameplay!'),
(11373, 'en-US', 'Rust skins, new Rust skins, Rust workshop, skin voting, future Rust skins'),
(11374, 'en-US', '<p>Check out the latest skins currently in the Rust Steam Workshop submission stage.</p><br/><p> We recommend paying attention to these potential new items that may appear in the game in the near future. In this article, we will look at the most interesting and original skins that are currently undergoing the process of voting and evaluation by players.</p><br/><p> You will learn about the different variants of weapons, clothes and items that can become part of the Rust game universe. The description of new skins will help you decide on voting for the variants you like and influence the future appearance of the gameplay.</p><br/><p> Find out which skins are the most popular and which ideas most players are interested in. We will also take a detailed look at the advantages and disadvantages of each skin so that you can make an informed choice and participate in shaping the global game content.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to learn about upcoming new items in the game Rust! Join the discussion and share your opinion on future skins so that your voice matters in the creation of game content.</p>'),
(11375, 'en-US', 'Auto turret in real life in 1:1 scale from one of the Reddit members:948518119708688425::948518119708688425:'),
(11376, 'en-US', 'A Reddit member has created a full-size replica of the Rust auto turret in real life. Check out this impressive creation and get inspired to bring your favorite gaming moments to life!'),
(11377, 'en-US', 'Auto turret, Rust, real life, Reddit member, full size replica, gaming dreams'),
(11378, 'en-US', '<p>Many fans of the game Rust dreamed of bringing their gaming adventures to life in real life. And now, one of the Reddit community members with the ID 948518119708688425::948518119708688425 has succeeded!</p><br/><p> This talented contributor created a full-size replica of the Rust auto turret, allowing any player to bring their favorite gaming moments to life.</p><br/><p> This great device has an exact reproduction of all the functions and characteristics of the automatic turret in the game. It is able to automatically detect and attack enemies, providing complete protection for your home or base. The user can also customize the turret settings according to his preferences.</p><br/><p> But the process of creating this marvel was not easy. The Reddit member spent a lot of time and effort to achieve the realism and functionality of his real turret. He used advanced technology and engineering skills to make it as powerful and effective as the one in the game.</p><br/><p> Now, Rust fans can enjoy the impressive opportunity to see their gaming dreams come true in real life. This full-size replica of the automated turret is a shining example of how games can inspire and motivate our talented accomplices.</p><br/><p> So, if you’ve always dreamed of becoming a real Rust engineer and bringing your favorite gaming moments to life, you should definitely take a look at this impressive creation. Maybe it will inspire you to start your own projects and bring gaming magic into your real life!</p>'),
(11379, 'en-US', 'Nuclear Missile Bunker - new RT in RUST (already available on the test branch)'),
(11380, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new update in the game Rust - Nuclear Missile Bunker, which is already available on the test branch. Experience exciting adventures in a post-apocalyptic world and find valuable resources, cope with dangers and try new opportunities for cooperation and competition!'),
(11381, 'en-US', 'Nuclear missile bunker, RT, RUST, game, update, test branch'),
(11382, 'en-US', '<p>The world of Rust has a new amazing update - the Nuclear Missile Bunker, which is now available on the test branch!</p><br/><p> The Bunker is an exciting content that adds new layers of gaming experience and excitement to players. It offers players the opportunity to immerse themselves in the atmosphere of a post-apocalyptic world and feel the excitement of exploring new areas and finding treasures.</p><br/><p> In the bunker, players will be able to face various challenges and find valuable resources that will help them in surviving and overcoming obstacles. However, to achieve success, players will have to overcome various dangers, such as radiation pollution and aggressive mutants.</p><br/><p> Additionally, the Nuclear Missile Bunker offers new opportunities for cooperation and competition. Players can go through the bunker together, combining their efforts to overcome challenges, or compete against each other to see who can best complete tasks and score the most points.</p><br/><p> This update adds new horizons to the world of Rust and allows players to dive even deeper into the exciting and dangerous game universe. Go to the missile-nuclear bunker and take part in exciting adventures!</p>'),
(11383, 'en-US', 'New skins in the game Rust');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(11384, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new skins in Rust, what they are for, and how they make the gameplay more fun. Open a new batch of skins and update your character\'s appearance!'),
(11385, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, update, appearance, characters, items, marketplace, economic opportunity, development team, wardrobe, uniqueness'),
(11386, 'en-US', '<p>We are pleased to announce that a new batch of skins has appeared in the game Rust! This is a great opportunity for players to update the appearance of their characters and items, add freshness to the gameplay and stand out from other players.</p><br/><br/><p> The new skins are presented in various categories, including weapons, clothing, building elements and tools. Each skin has its own uniqueness and style, allowing players to choose the optimal combination for their character and environment.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that adding new skins to the Rust game is not only a fun and colorful addition to the gameplay, but also an economic opportunity for players. Purchasing and selling skins on the Steam marketplace allows you not only to decorate your character, but also to earn real money.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust game development team continues to delight its players with new and interesting skins. This update policy allows maintaining player interest and makes the gameplay even more exciting and diverse.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to update your wardrobe and make your character unique! Open a new batch of skins in the game Rust and enjoy the new opportunities they provide.</p>'),
(11387, 'en-US', 'Our RUST RU community is launching a series of Easter giveaways for 10 skins and a cash prize'),
(11388, 'en-US', 'Join our RUST RU community to participate in a series of Easter giveaways with 10 skins and 5,000 rubles in cash prizes. Find out all the details on our Discord channel.'),
(11389, 'en-US', 'RUST RU community, Easter giveaways, skins, cash prize, Discord'),
(11390, 'en-US', '<p>Join our RUST RU community, which is launching a series of Easter giveaways! We have 10 amazing skins and a cash prize worth a total of 5,000 rubles!</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to win unique skins and get extra cash! More information is available on our giveaway channel in Discord. Join now and take part in exciting Easter giveaways!</p><br/><p> Link to the giveaway channel: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/CTzYgFrh\">https://discord.gg/CTzYgFrh</a></p>'),
(11391, 'en-US', 'Screenshot of a new monument from one of the developers'),
(11392, 'en-US', 'Be the first to know about the new monument in the game Rust! The developers shared an exclusive screenshot that will be available on the test branch!'),
(11393, 'en-US', 'screenshot, new monument, developer, test branch, updates, game Rust, Steam'),
(11394, 'en-US', 'Our developers have shared an exclusive screenshot of a new monument that will soon be available on the Rust test branch on Steam. Find out more about the upcoming updates!'),
(11395, 'en-US', 'Be the first to receive notifications about news in the game Rust on Steam'),
(11396, 'en-US', 'Want to always be up to date with news about Rust game updates on Steam? Subscribe to notifications and get information first!'),
(11397, 'en-US', 'Rust news, game updates, notifications, game on Steam'),
(11398, 'en-US', '<p>Want to always be up to date with the latest news about Rust game updates on Steam? Now it\'s possible!</p><br/><p> We invite you to subscribe to notifications to be the first to know about new updates, fixes and additions that make the game even better.</p><br/><p> To subscribe and receive news notifications, just leave a reaction below. Don\'t miss your chance to be among the first and always be up to date!</p>'),
(11399, 'en-US', 'New future skins from the workshop'),
(11400, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest upcoming skins from the workshop in Rust. Explore potential new skins that may be added in future updates.'),
(11401, 'en-US', 'Rust, new skins, workshop, challengers, game collection'),
(11402, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we will look at the latest new upcoming skins from the workshop in the game Rust. The workshop is constantly popping up with amazing concepts that could become new skins for weapons, items, and clothing in the game.</p><br/><p> If you like to follow updates and want to be the first to know about new skins, then this post is just for you. We have collected the most interesting and promising skin contenders that are still in development.</p><br/><p> Each skin contender is a unique design created by talented artists from the workshop. You will see a variety of styles, themes and color schemes that can decorate your gaming collection in the future.</p><br/><p> Please note that not all contenders will make it into the game. We are treating them here as potential new skins that may be added in future updates. This means that their final design may change and undergo tweaks before they make it into the game.</p><br/><p> However, even at this stage of development, new skin candidates offer many interesting ideas and concepts. Their design and details can inspire you to create unique game sets or bring a fresh wind into the already familiar game Rust.</p><br/><p> Stay up to date with all the latest news and possible new skins for the game Rust, stay tuned and join us to learn about the first releases of fresh skins.</p>'),
(11403, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins for Rust and add some fresh color to your gaming experience. Browse the latest skins on Steam.'),
(11404, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, review, collection, appearance, items, base, clothes, accessories'),
(11405, 'en-US', '<p>Hooray, a new batch of skins for the game Rust has been released on Steam! In this article, we will tell you about the most interesting and bright skins that have appeared recently. If you like to change the appearance of your items in the game, then you will definitely like this collection!</p><br/><p> In the new batch of skins you will find a variety of weapons, armor, items and even base structures. The developers paid special attention to detail and quality of execution so that each skin looks unique and attractive. Not only game items, but also your base, your clothes and accessories can now be customized to the smallest detail.</p><br/><p> This batch of skins includes both bright and colorful options and darker and more aggressive ones. The choice is yours! In addition, the developers are constantly working on creating new skins, so we expect even more amazing variations in the future.</p><br/><p> If you want to add some fresh colors to your gameplay and give your character or items new silhouettes, be sure to check out the Rust skins store. The new batch offers plenty of opportunities for creativity and individual style.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection and surprise your friends with new options! Be on trend and make your gaming experience even brighter and more unique.</p>'),
(11406, 'en-US', 'April update today at 21:00 Moscow time!'),
(11407, 'en-US', 'Today at 21:00 Moscow time, the April update will take place in the game Rust. Find out what innovations it will bring and what opportunities it will open for players.'),
(11408, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, floating boxes, double saddle, marker update, ping system, easter event'),
(11409, 'en-US', 'April update today at 21:00 Moscow time!<br/> List of changes:<br/> – Floating Crates. Accessing loot from destroyed boats and submarines will be much easier after this update, as several new floating containers have been added. Spawning immediately after a submarine is destroyed and approximately 5 minutes after a boat (RHIB or rowboat) is destroyed, these black crates float on the water and contain all the loot that was in the boat.<br/><br/> - Double saddle. Now you can ride a horse with a teammate. Can only be purchased at the ranch for 90 scrap.<br/><br/> – Marker Update: Players can now add multiple markers to the map at once, each with a different text description, icons, and colors, and the team leader\'s markers will be shared by the entire team. Markers are also displayed on the compass.<br/><br/> – Ping System: A new way to alert your team to dangers or loot. Pings can be placed on the fly using binoculars and drones. Once placed, they will be visible to everyone on your team for 10 seconds.<br/><br/> - Easter event. The egg hunt is starting again on the islands. Get your basket ready!'),
(11410, 'en-US', 'Developers plan to add the ability to search people in the game Rust'),
(11411, 'en-US', 'The developers plan to add the ability to search other players in the game Rust in the future, which will add more strategy and social interaction to the gameplay.'),
(11412, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, search, developers, Rust review'),
(11413, 'en-US', '<p>In future updates to the game Rust, the developers plan to introduce a new functionality - the ability to search other players. This feature will allow players who have raised their hands in surrender to be searched without having to deal damage or knock items out of them on the ground.</p><br/><br/><p> The introduction of this mechanic was confirmed by developer Helk himself in a post on Twitter. Thus, in the near future, players will be able to demonstrate their diplomatic skills and ensure the safety of themselves and their team by searching other players to avoid losing valuable items or reduce the possibility of secretly transporting prohibited content.</p><br/><br/><p> The addition of the ability to search people allows for more varied and realistic interactions between players in Rust. Players will now be able to use tactics based on intelligent decisions, rather than just the strength of their weapons. This opens up new possibilities for strategic planning and social interaction, making the gameplay even more exciting and engaging.</p>'),
(11414, 'en-US', 'Helk Launches Rust Item Skin Support Survey'),
(11415, 'en-US', 'Helk, the developer of the game Rust, is conducting a survey among players to determine the items they want new skins for.'),
(11416, 'en-US', 'Rust, skins, survey, players, preferences'),
(11417, 'en-US', '<p>Helk, the developer of the game Rust, decided to conduct a small survey among players to find out what items they would most like to see new skins for. The survey is available at the link: <a href=\"https://strawpoll.com/polls/40ZmqBa1oZa\">https://strawpoll.com/polls/40ZmqBa1oZa</a> .</p><br/><p> The list of suggested items for which skins can be added includes many interesting options. For example, these are skins for minicopters, boats, horse armor, and cars. But the developers also took into account the wishes of players and added items that have long been requested for skins, such as a composite bow and a homemade machine gun.</p><br/><p> You are asked to make a list of these items in order of your preference. If you are most interested in minicopter skins, then put them at the very top of the list. And if you are not particularly interested in horse armor skins, for example, then put them at the bottom of the list. When your list is ready, simply submit it.</p><br/><p> This survey is not a contest or a final decision on skins, the developers just want to understand what items players will pay the most attention to.</p>'),
(11418, 'en-US', 'New Easter Skins: Expected New Items from the Workshop (Part 2)'),
(11419, 'en-US', 'Here\'s a look at the upcoming new Easter skins for Rust from the workshop. Find out about the most interesting designs and contenders for inclusion in the game.'),
(11420, 'en-US', 'easter skins, new items, workshop, game Rust, review'),
(11421, 'en-US', '<p>We present to your attention the second part of the review of future Easter skins for the game Rust! New designs are constantly appearing in the workshop, and we have collected for you the most interesting and promising candidates for adding to the game.</p><br/><p> Easter skins are a special type of cosmetic items that are added to the game during the Easter celebration. They feature bright and creative designs related to the holiday theme and become real collectibles for players. This year, the developers promise to please us with incredibly colorful and stylish skins that will definitely add atmosphere to your gaming experience!</p><br/><p> In our review, we will look at several new products from the workshop that have already attracted great interest from players. Each of these skins has a unique design and features that will become distinctive features of your character or item.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> <b>The Easter Bunny skin</b> is a bright and attractive costume that will turn your character into a real Easter bunny. The funny and unique design of this skin will attract the attention of other players and add uniqueness to your appearance.</li><br/><li> <b>The \"Eggs of Diversity\" skin</b> is a set of colorful eggs that you can use to decorate your base or even in battle. Not only a beautiful, but also a functional skin that will cheer you and your comrades up.</li><br/><li> <b>The Flower Glade skin</b> is a colorful and cheerful collection of items decorated with flowers and vegetation. They will turn any environment into an amazing flower meadow that will delight all players and give you a festive mood.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> This is just a small part of the upcoming skins that are already in development. In addition, new ideas and designs are constantly appearing in the workshop, which we can only guess about. We expect that this year\'s Easter skins in the game Rust will be at the highest level, and we are looking forward to adding them to the game!</p>'),
(11422, 'en-US', 'Ping system on the test branch'),
(11423, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new ping system on the Rust test branch. Now you can easily make quick marks for yourself and your team using binoculars or a drone.'),
(11424, 'en-US', 'ping system, test branch, tags, binoculars, drone, team coordination, convenient update'),
(11425, 'en-US', 'You can now make quick pings for yourself or your teammates using binoculars or a drone in Rust. The ping will appear directly at the designated location and on the compass, making it easier for your team to coordinate. Simply press the mouse wheel to bring up a menu and select a location to ping. This handy update makes it easy to pinpoint a location or warn your team of potential danger.'),
(11426, 'en-US', 'New skins for the game Rust for April Fools\' Day: unique giveaways from Rust RU!'),
(11427, 'en-US', 'Find out about the 3 most serious giveaways for the game Rust, which Rust RU launched for April Fools\' Day! Get a chance to win one of 15 cool skins under our conditions. All the necessary information is available in our Rust RU community on Discord.'),
(11428, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, new Rust skins, April Fools\' Day, giveaways, Rust RU, Rust skins info'),
(11429, 'en-US', '<p>April Fools\' Day is a time for jokes and entertainment! And, of course, the game Rust could not stay away from this holiday. We, the Rust RU team, are happy to announce the launch of three of the most serious April Fools\' Day draws! 15 cool skins are waiting for you to win.</p><br/><br/><p> We have created the simplest conditions for participation in the giveaways. All the necessary information and rules are available in our Rust RU community on Discord. Join us at the link: https://discord.gg/rust-ru and find out how you can become the lucky owner of one of the cool skins.</p><br/><br/><p> Our Rust RU team wants every player to be able to immerse themselves in the world of Rust with a new style and unique skins. That\'s why we have prepared for you the three most serious and exciting April Fools\' Day giveaways. Don\'t miss your chance to get one of 15 cool skins!</p><br/><br/><p> Participation in the sweepstakes is an opportunity to diversify your game, stand out from other players and create a unique image in the world of Rust. We have done everything to make the conditions of participation as simple and clear as possible, so that everyone has a chance to win.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to decorate your items in the game Rust with cool and unique skins! Join us in the Rust RU community on Discord and participate in three serious giveaways by the first of April. Details and rules are available in our community.</p><br/><br/><p> We are waiting for you in our Rust RU community on Discord to celebrate April Fools\' Day together and get a chance to win one of 15 cool skins for the game Rust!</p>'),
(11430, 'en-US', 'IT\'S DONE! Major Rust Updates for April Fools'),
(11431, 'en-US', 'Fresh updates to the game Rust on April 1 will please players with many new features. Discover the changed landscape, build unique buildings and fight enemies using new weapons and items.'),
(11432, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, April Fools\' Day, new features, landscape changes, new items and weapons'),
(11433, 'en-US', 'It\'s happening, guys! The timely update of the game Rust on April 1st does not leave millions of players around the world indifferent. The developers decided to please their fans with unusual and exciting changes that turned the game world into something completely unpredictable.<br/><br/> One of the most striking changes is the introduction of a new landscape - the desert. Now players will face new challenges and opportunities as they explore sand dunes and oases. Think carefully about where you will build your base or hide from dangerous enemies.<br/><br/> In addition, major changes have been made to the construction system. Now players can build even more creative and unique structures thanks to a wide selection of new materials and parts. Wood, metal, stone - the choice is yours. These updates will allow each player to express their individuality and creativity.<br/><br/> Since April 1st, Rust has also introduced new interesting items and features. New weapons, tools, and armor have been made available, allowing players to wage even more intense and spectacular battles. But be careful, because you will also have to explore and use your characters\' new abilities to fight your enemies.<br/><br/> Overall, the new Rust April Fools update has brought players many new opportunities and challenges. The developers\' fresh approach will allow you to dive into the exciting game world and enjoy new epic adventures. Don\'t miss the most important April update of the year!'),
(11434, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skins for Rust on Steam.'),
(11435, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, Steam, game, update'),
(11436, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, Rust fans! It\'s your science writer again, and I\'m happy to tell you about the endless variety of new skins that have just appeared in our favorite game.</p><br/><br/><p> Recently, developers from Facepunch studio released a new batch of skins for the game Rust on the Steam platform, and they are simply amazing! Now you have the opportunity to decorate your weapons, items and clothes with unique and stylish designs. You will definitely find something to your taste!</p><br/><br/><p> The appearance of new skins is always a special moment for our players, because they not only allow you to stand out from other players in the virtual world, but also bring pleasure from your own creativity and uniqueness. This new batch of skins is no exception.</p><br/><br/><p> The new skins available in Rust on Steam come in a variety of styles and colorways to ensure there\'s something for every player. Treat yourself to stylish guns, bold t-shirts, or eye-catching helmets. Your gear will stand out from the crowd!</p><br/><br/><p> However, it is important to remember that each skin has its price, and sometimes aesthetic pleasure can become an expensive pleasure. Therefore, before purchasing a skin, it is recommended to weigh all the pros and cons. Perhaps, you are satisfied with the decent equipment that you already have to continue playing with pleasure.</p><br/><br/><p> As a result, our new research has resulted in a beautiful Rust update on Steam with new unique skins. You can check them out today and decide whether you want to buy them. Remember, the choice is always yours!</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to get new skins and stand out in the game Rust. Enjoy the updated visual experience and show your individuality in the rough and unforgiving world of Rust on Steam!</p><br/><br/><p> Thank you for your attention, and until next time, my dear players! Stay tuned for more exciting news and updates in the game Rust!</p>'),
(11437, 'en-US', 'Went into a friend\'s room after an industrial update :orange:'),
(11438, 'en-US', 'In this article, I will share my experience of visiting a friend\'s room after the production update and talk about the new features and their impact on our gaming experience.'),
(11439, 'en-US', 'friend\'s room, industrial update, changes, innovations, game experience, game world'),
(11440, 'en-US', 'In this article, I will share my experience visiting my friend’s room after he had done an industrial upgrade to his space. Together, we explored the new features and changes brought about by the upgrade. Impressed by the improvements and innovations, I will share everything I saw and how it impacted our experience of the game. Get ready for a thrilling tour of the updated world, which has become even more interesting and exciting.'),
(11441, 'en-US', 'News about upcoming Easter skins from the workshop in the game Rust'),
(11442, 'en-US', 'Check out the most colorful and unique upcoming Easter skins in Rust. Update your collection and stand out from other players with these exciting designs.'),
(11443, 'en-US', 'news, easter skins, rust, workshop, updates, design, collection, gameplay'),
(11444, 'en-US', '<p>Want to know about the most desired and anticipated upcoming Easter skins in the game Rust? Get ready for fun and festive atmosphere with these new and exciting skin options. Our designers and artists are working hard to bring you amazing options that you can use to decorate your items in the game.</p><br/><p> New skins are appearing in the Rust workshop, which claim to be Easter-themed. In this article, we will tell you about the most striking and unique updates that will soon appear in the game. Don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection and stand out from the rest of the players.</p><br/><p> We have conducted a thorough analysis and selected the most interesting offers. Each skin has its own unique theme and design, which was liked by players and received a large number of positive reviews. In this article, you will find detailed information about each skin and will be able to make your choice.</p><br/><p> The Rust development team has managed to strike the perfect balance between quality and accessibility with these skins. They offer players a great look for their items while still allowing them to play the game with confidence and freedom.</p><br/><p> However, it is worth noting that some skins may be unavailable for a limited time or require special conditions to obtain them. Don\'t miss the opportunity to get your copy of these individual skins, stay tuned and don\'t forget to check the workshop to stay up to date with all the latest news and offers.</p><br/><p> Now that you know what to expect from the upcoming Easter skins in Rust, start choosing to make your collection even more beautiful and brighter. The celebration is coming soon, and you are ready for it with the best skins in Rust!</p>'),
(11445, 'en-US', 'Rust, Wipe Expectation and Reality'),
(11446, 'en-US', 'An article about the reality of waiting for a Rust wipe and the importance of considering tradeoffs when updating a game.'),
(11447, 'en-US', 'Rust, wipe, game updates, balancing, compromises'),
(11448, 'en-US', '<p>Rust, waiting for a wipe and reality.</p><br/><p> The game Rust on Steam is very popular among players, and one of the most anticipated events in the world of Rust is a wipe - a complete reset of the game world and a restart of the servers. The wipe brings new changes, fixes and improvements to the game, but often user expectations do not always match reality.</p><br/><p> Waiting for a wipe is a time when players are excited and wondering what will be in the new Rust update. They hope for new features, bug fixes, and gameplay improvements. New predators, weapons, buildings, and other elements of the game cause excitement among fans.</p><br/><p> However, reality may not always live up to expectations. Some changes and fixes may cause dissatisfaction among players. Balancing game mechanics, changing characters or removing certain content may also cause protests and negative reactions from community members.</p><br/><p> The Rust development team has to find a compromise between various factors. They must take into account the opinions and suggestions of players, collect data on necessary changes, balance the game and ensure a harmonious gameplay for all participants.</p><br/><p> It is important to understand that decisions about updating the Rust game are based on complex analysis, common sense and community suggestions. Sometimes changes may be unexpected or initially dissatisfied, but the developers are in dialogue with the community, fixing bugs and making necessary changes to make the game better.</p><br/><p> So, expectations for the Rust wipe may be high, but the reality may bring both positive and negative changes. It is important to remember that game development is a complex process that requires attention to many details, and the development team is trying to create the most satisfying gaming experience for all users.</p>'),
(11449, 'en-US', 'Sunday GDC - Game Developers Conference'),
(11450, 'en-US', 'Last week, GDC hosted news and updates for Rust. Learn more about the Nuclear Missile Silo, AUX2, auto-wear clothing, and other exciting changes. All updates are available on Steam.'),
(11451, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, nuclear missile silo, GDC, Game Developers Conference, AUX2, auto-wear clothes, world models, textures, Steam'),
(11452, 'en-US', 'GDC Week - Game Developers Conference (GDC; translated from English - \"game developers conference\")<br/><br/> ☢Nuclear missile bunker<br/> More work this week on the newest RT in Rust\'s AUX2 branch. Still not publicly available, the Nuclear Missile Silo is expected to be a mostly underground RT with barrels and crates, NPCs, and a radiation zone.<br/><br/> It’s also interesting that Alistair mentioned on Reddit that “This RT will add some meaning to the events unfolding on the island.” It’s unclear when it will be ready for prime time. Will it be available with the April 6 update? We’ll keep you posted as more is revealed.<br/><br/> ⚙More about AUX2<br/> Also on the AUX2 branch are two-seater saddles on horses and various improvements to the in-game map and positioning! There will be the ability to make markers on the terrain and map for your friends and clanmates. As with the nuclear missile silo, it is not yet clear when these features will appear in the game.<br/><br/> Auto-wearing of clothes<br/> New feature in the Quality of Life section! Simply hold Alt-L while right-clicking or hovering over loot from a resource crate to immediately equip clothing items (if they can be worn without removing anything else).<br/><br/> Additionally, if you hold alt-l and right-click or hover over loot from your main or clothing inventory, it will behave as if you opened a loot container (eg. it will immediately equip the clothing without dragging).<br/><br/> New world models and textures are coming<br/> New assets and textures are coming! If you\'re not familiar, world meshes refer to the object that falls to the ground when the player drops something. If there is no \"world mesh\" for an object, we see \"old burlap sacks\" on the ground. We\'ll soon see less hassle when dropping different types of ammo, high-speed missiles, and PTZ cameras.<br/><br/> ✅Other<br/> Team UI and name tags will use Steam nicknames instead of Steam names/streamer names if you are friends with a player. Added \'usesteamnicknames\' variable to revert to previous behavior.<br/> Backpack values ​​have been changed to default.<br/> Some camera fixes<br/> More work on ferry terminals<br/> Fixed an issue with the excavator if bases were built too close to the excavator.'),
(11453, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new batch of skins in Rust and how they can change your experience in the game. Express your individuality with bright and unique images!'),
(11454, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, Rust game, new skins, skins on Steam, gameplay'),
(11455, 'en-US', '<p>In the world of the popular game Rust, it\'s time to please players with new and bright skins. The development team has released a fresh batch of original and memorable images that will allow you to stand out among other players in the game.</p><br/><p> New skins in Rust are not just a cosmetic addition, they change the appearance of various objects in the game. Now your weapons, clothes and interior items can be unique and individual. This opens up opportunities for self-expression and creativity, allowing you to create a unique image of your character and home.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins features a variety of themes, from post-apocalyptic style and military equipment to futuristic and mystical elements. You will be able to choose a skin that reflects your personality and creates the right atmosphere in the game.</p><br/><p> In addition, it should be taken into account that new skins in Rust not only add aesthetic value to the game, but also affect the tactics and strategy of the gameplay. A skin with a unique weapon design can become not only a beautiful detail of its appearance, but also an additional factor of insurance against the enemy or a means of achieving a psychological advantage in battle.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget that there is a skin market in the game world where you can buy and sell the skins you want. This opens up opportunities to earn in-game currency and exchange skins with other players. Be careful, keep an eye on the prices and economic development opportunities in the game to get the most out of your skins.</p><br/><p> So, the new batch of skins in the game Rust is a great opportunity to diversify the gameplay, create a unique image of your character and emphasize your individuality. Discover the world of new skins and give free rein to your imagination in the game Rust!</p>'),
(11456, 'en-US', 'Find out about the newest and most unique skins that will soon appear in the game Rust on Steam. Let\'s take a look at the contenders from the workshop, share impressions and details.'),
(11457, 'en-US', 'skins, game Rust, Steam, new items, workshop, contenders'),
(11458, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of all fans of the game Rust on Steam! In this article, we will take a look at the newest skins that will soon be coming to the game. Get ready to learn about the freshest and most unique offers that are vying for a place in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> We all know that choosing skins for your items in the game is one of the most important and interesting aspects of the gameplay. And what could be better than a variety of new skins to add freshness and personality to our gaming collection?</p><br/><br/><p> In this article, we will look at the contenders from the workshop who are ready to impress us with their originality and quality of execution. We will review each skin, share our impressions and important details that will help you make a decision about the choice.</p><br/><br/><p> We can\'t help but note that each skin from the workshop goes through a complex process of selection and approval by the Rust developers. That\'s why new skins are real contenders for appearing in the game. They reflect the entire creative potential and individuality of the player community.</p><br/><br/><p> Our article will fully reveal all the advantages and potential of the new skins. Each skin has its own unique history and significance, and we will consider each of them in detail.</p><br/><br/><p> So hold on tight and get ready to be amazed - the hottest new skins to come are coming!</p>'),
(11459, 'en-US', 'What a twist. Mining and demining in Rust! :830820256771473459:'),
(11460, 'en-US', 'Amazing new update in the game Rust - mining and demining! This will add new opportunities for strategic and tactical actions of players. Be careful and responsible in this new challenge of the game.'),
(11461, 'en-US', 'Rise, update, mining, demining, strategy, tactics'),
(11462, 'en-US', 'Hello all Rust players! Today we want to share with you an amazing new update - mining and defusing in the game Rust! This turn of events will add even more excitement and possibilities to your gaming experience.<br/><br/> Now you can feel like a real engineer and mine clearer, interacting with the new mechanics in the game. Mining will become an integral part of your strategy, helping to protect your base from enemy attacks. But be careful, insufficient attention to the placement of mines can result in an explosion and the destruction of your base.<br/><br/> To be successful in mine clearance, you will need skill and attention. You will have to carefully explore the environment, detect and defuse different types of mines to ensure your safety. Each mine clearance will present a complex puzzle that you will have to solve.<br/><br/> This update will bring new possibilities to the military game mode, as you will now have to take into account the presence of enemy mines and use them in your tactical actions. You will be able to create trenches with mines, waiting for enemies, or use the placed mines to create deadly traps.<br/><br/> Mining and mine clearing is a new challenge for Rust players. It is a unique opportunity to demonstrate your skills in strategy and tactics. However, be careful and responsible, because wrong actions can lead to disaster.<br/><br/> We wish you good luck and exciting adventures in the game Rust with the new update of mining and demining!'),
(11463, 'en-US', 'Get notified about Rust news on Steam'),
(11464, 'en-US', 'Stay up to date with all the news about Rust on Steam and be the first to receive notifications. React below and don\'t miss important announcements and updates.'),
(11465, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, news, updates, notifications'),
(11466, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with all the updates and news about Rust on Steam? Don\'t miss any important announcements or events! To be the first to receive relevant news, leave a reaction below.'),
(11467, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of skins for Rust on Steam. Update the look of your weapons, tools, clothing, and more in-game with a wide range of styles and themes.'),
(11468, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, appearance updates, weapons, tools, clothes, inventory, Steam store'),
(11469, 'en-US', '<p>Hooray! A new batch of skins for the game Rust has been released! Owners of this popular multiplayer game on the Steam platform can now enjoy updates to the appearance of their items.</p><p> All new skins provide incredible opportunities to customize the appearance of weapons, tools, clothing and other items in the game. You are offered a wide range of styles, colors and themes so that you can stand out from other players and decorate your inventory with unique items.</p><p> There are a lot of interesting options in this new batch of skins. Whether you are a newbie or a seasoned player, you are sure to find something that suits your taste. You may want to pick up some new weapon skins to impress your enemies, or maybe you are more into cosmetic changes to the look of your base or clothing.</p><p> In addition, new skins can be not only visually appealing, but also tactically useful. Some skins can provide better camouflage in the environment or additional bonuses that will help you in the game.</p><p> The process of acquiring new skins in the game Rust is very simple. You just need to go to the Steam store and select the skin you are interested in. After purchasing, the skin automatically becomes available in the game, where you can apply it to the corresponding item.</p><p> So don\'t miss the opportunity to improve your gaming experience and stand out from other players with new skins in the Rust game!</p><br/><p> Source: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a></p>'),
(11470, 'en-US', 'Gameplay statistics'),
(11471, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest changes to Rust and how they will impact gameplay. The focus is on game statistics and how they are used for balancing and data analysis. Gradual changes, additions, and fixes are made within the game to provide a better gaming experience and improve security.'),
(11472, 'en-US', 'Gameplay stats, Rust updates, game balancing, anti-cheats, game changes'),
(11473, 'en-US', 'Gameplay statistics<br/> This week, the new gameplay stats feature branch merged with the main game branch, now tracking a ton of player-related activity and server information. The developers will likely use these metrics to monitor and balance various metadata in the game. These metrics will be a great new tool for developers to use, and they may eventually have some interesting uses for communities as well.<br/><br/> This week, there was a special focus on adding tracking for things like keycard swipes, lockboxes, breaches, server tags, item drops, disappearances, and more.<br/><br/> This is a new way to add anti-cheats, adjust the game balance, add or remove game items. Expect global changes in a few updates and don\'t be surprised (although, no one is surprised by anything anymore!).<br/><br/> ✅Other changes:<br/><br/> Show Steam nickname in command interface/nametags if set.<br/> Working on some new world models (items, prefabs, textures).<br/> Show HP bar (and text) on computer monitor when remotely controlling objects.<br/> Move to the next/previous entry in the computer user interface using the arrow keys or mouse wheel.<br/> Fixed TCs showing \"Open\" as the default option when in a private building but not logged in. Now if the car is locked and not yours, the \"Open\" text will not appear.<br/> Prevent opening of turret inventory until authorized on turret.<br/> Added support for custom high-resolution screenshot sizes in builds. New variable - Screenshot.HiResScreenshotCustomWidth. Set to 0 (default) to use the default high-resolution screenshot size, which is 4x the original resolution. Set to any other number to use that number (range between 128 and 16384).<br/> Fixed an issue where anti-aliasing settings would not reset when taking normal resolution screenshots with transparency.'),
(11474, 'en-US', 'Big updates to Rust on Steam'),
(11475, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest updates and additions to Rust on Steam. This article covers new features like the Nuclear Missile Silo, Dual Saddles, Map Improvements, Attack Helicopter, Multi-Threaded Networking, and Auto-Clothing.'),
(11476, 'en-US', 'updates, Rust game, Steam, nuclear missile silo, dual saddles, map improvements, attack helicopter, multithreaded network, auto clothing'),
(11477, 'en-US', 'Big things are on the horizon! The developers are not only slacking off, but also contributing to the game\'s development! So, let\'s get started:<br/><br/> ☢Nuclear missile bunker<br/> The next RT to grace the plains of Rust is on its way! The Nuclear Missile Silo, added to the AUX2 branch late last week, is officially in test mode. It looks like it will be a large underground monument with lots of rooms, crates, and NPCs.<br/><br/> Unfortunately, AUX2 is currently closed to the public, so there are no visuals or details yet. However, any project like this that was released on AUX2 was implemented in the game. We will keep you updated when this new monument becomes available for wider testing.<br/><br/> Double saddles<br/> Also coming to the AUX2 branch, dual saddles are on the way. Soon, two players will be able to ride a single horse, and these dual saddles will likely be available for testing at the same time as the Nuclear Missile Silo.<br/><br/> In-game map improvements<br/> The third thing that will be merged into the AUX2 staging branch is a bunch of improvements to game locations and mapping. Apparently, players and clans will soon be able to signal others on the go, marking multiple objects for friends by leaving multiple markers on the map. Maybe the markers will be different depending on what you\'re pointing at, enemy, loot, or resources! This will all work with the compass as well, based on what we\'ve seen in the commits.<br/><br/> As with previous projects, this will be available for wider testing once AUX2 is open to the public (or once it\'s all moved to AUX1 or the main game branch). With 3 new features, we\'re guessing the Facepunch team is gearing up for an April 6th update and a forced wipe in 3 weeks.<br/><br/> Attack helicopter<br/> Not merged with AUX2 and still on a separate branch only for developers, the attack helicopter continues to evolve as the gunner UI is implemented. This week, ammo counters and zoom indicators were added to the gunner UI.<br/><br/> Based on the commits, the Attack Helicopter will be similar to the Minicopter, except it will have skis instead of wheels and will shoot freaking missiles (and maybe even be armed with a heavy machine gun).<br/><br/> Multi-threaded network<br/> For several weeks, the Facepunch team has been working on implementing an updated version of the network for the game. This includes changing the network to a multi-threaded process (to help with optimization and performance). This week, launched in an optional server and client update, the multi-threaded network was enabled by default.<br/><br/> The developers have indicated that this will ideally show a small increase in overall performance on both the client and server side. We are running tests and intend to fully migrate our servers to the new mode in the near future.<br/> The principle of the system is that previously one server (one PC) served a specific server, now they are planning to introduce a new system, when several server machines (several PCs) will serve several servers, and if one of the servers starts to overload, then the other server machines will give part of their computing power to the busier one in order to pull its work!<br/><br/> Car clothing<br/> A new Quality of Life feature to quickly equip clothing is on the way! Simply hold down the sprint or crouch key and right-click or hover over loot from a loot container to instantly equip clothing items (if they can be worn without removing anything else). So, if a barrel or crate drops armor and you don\'t have any armor on, it will be equipped to your character immediately.'),
(11478, 'en-US', 'Rust is available with a -33% discount until March 23'),
(11479, 'en-US', 'You have a great opportunity to buy the game Rust with a -33% discount until March 23 for only 737 rubles! Don\'t miss this unique opportunity!'),
(11480, 'en-US', 'Rust, discount, game, DLC, soundtrack, Facepunch'),
(11481, 'en-US', '<p>You have a great opportunity to buy the game Rust with a -33% discount until March 23 for only 737 rubles! This is great news for all fans of this exciting game.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to become part of the survival in the world of Rust at a bargain price! Now you can purchase not only the game itself, but also all available DLC, as well as the soundtrack to the game. This opens up even more possibilities and depth to this exciting game universe.</p><br/><p> Facepunch not only offers you the game Rust at a discount, but also other games from this developer. So you can immerse yourself in different game worlds and enjoy excellent gameplay.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss this unique opportunity to purchase the game Rust at an attractive price! The -33% discount is valid only until March 23, so hurry up!</p>'),
(11482, 'en-US', 'Developers experiment with manually allocating load to processor cores for maximum performance'),
(11483, 'en-US', 'Rust developers are experimenting with manually allocating CPU cores to achieve maximum performance. Learn how to use the system.cpuaffinity command, how to properly configure the number of allocated cores, and how this can affect system performance and stability.'),
(11484, 'en-US', 'developers, experiments, manual load allocation, processor cores, performance, FPS, Rust game, system.cpuaffinity command, computer, setup, processor, lags, stability, applications, Google Chrome, Discord, configuration, staging branch'),
(11485, 'en-US', 'Developers are experimenting with manually allocating load to processor cores for maximum performance.<br/><br/> When you enter the command system.cpuaffinity &lt;core numbers, the system completely allocates the specified processor cores to Rust - no other processes in the system will use these cores, and if you configure the command correctly, you can get more FPS from your processor.<br/><br/> On powerful PC builds with a large number of cores, this allows for a very high FPS increase, but its effectiveness on average-power computers has yet to be tested.<br/><br/> Allocating cores puts the game at the highest priority, and this can affect the performance of other processes on the computer, so if you have a weak processor with a minimum number of cores, the command will most likely make your system and the game more laggy and unstable. It also has a very negative impact on the stability of applications such as Google Chrome or Discord.<br/><br/> Try to allocate enough cores if you decide to use this command. Incorrect settings (not enough cores allocated, or too many) can significantly reduce FPS.<br/><br/> This command is currently only available on the staging branch and is still being tested for effectiveness - but if you\'re really interested, you can go and experiment for yourself.<br/><br/> You can specify the desired core numbers in the command in different ways:<br/> • enumeration (\"0,2,5,6\" will allocate 0, 2, 5 and 6 cores)<br/> • ranges (\"10-12\" will select all cores from the first to the fourth)<br/> • both methods at once (\"1,2,5,6,10-12\" will allocate 1, 2, 5 and 6 cores, as well as 10 through 12)<br/> for example: \"system.cpuaffinity 0,2,5,6,10-12\"'),
(11486, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll take a look at the newest and most interesting skins that could soon appear in Rust from the workshop. Learn about potential contenders and their impact on the game\'s balance and visual experience.'),
(11487, 'en-US', 'New, Skins, Workshop, Rust, Challengers, Updates, Balance, Appearance, Weapons, Items, Mechanics, Atmosphere, Concept, Testing, Variety'),
(11488, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we\'ll take a look at the newest and most interesting skins that could soon appear in the game Rust. We have the opportunity to look into the workshop and get acquainted with potential new contenders.</p><br/><p> Our developers are constantly working on updates and adding new content to Rust. In the workshop of skin creators you can find many unusual and high-quality works that can potentially become new skins in the game.</p><br/><p> We analyzed their work and selected the most striking and original skins that deserve attention. Each of them has its own uniqueness and can add a fresh visual experience to the game.</p><br/><p> However, choosing new skins is not as easy as it may seem. Developers need to consider the game balance, the appearance of all weapons and items, so as not to disrupt the game mechanics and atmosphere of Rust.</p><br/><p> Some skin creators\' suggestions may be rejected due to technical limitations or inconsistency with the overall concept of the game. The decision to include a skin in the game is made after lengthy discussion and testing.</p><br/><p> We invite you to take a look at the workshop and see these potential new skins. They could be contenders for the game and add some freshness and variety to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> Now let\'s take a look at some of the most interesting and promising skins that the developers may add to the Rust game in the upcoming updates.</p>'),
(11489, 'en-US', 'Be the first to receive news notifications!'),
(11490, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with Rust on Steam? Follow the instructions in the article to be the first to receive notifications about all updates and events. Don\'t miss your chance to be ahead!'),
(11491, 'en-US', 'notifications, news, Rust, Steam, subscription, updates'),
(11492, 'en-US', '<p>Below you will find instructions on how to be the first to receive notifications about all news on the game Rust on Steam. Just follow the steps to stay up to date with all updates and events related to the game.</p><br/><p> Step 1: At the bottom of this article you will see a \"React\" button - click on it.</p><br/><p> Step 2: Complete a quick registration or authorization on the site to be able to subscribe to the news feed.</p><br/><p> Step 3: After successful authorization, click on the \"Subscribe\" button to receive notifications about Rust game news to your email address.</p><br/><p> Step 4: Done! Now you will be the first to receive important news about updates, events and changes in the game.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to stay up to date. Useful and relevant information will be sent to you regularly so that you are always ahead!</p>'),
(11493, 'en-US', 'New Faberge Egg'),
(11494, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Faberge Egg that may be coming in the Rust store\'s Easter update. What trade-offs and disagreements does it cause among players, and how does it fit into the overall game economy?'),
(11495, 'en-US', 'Faberge egg, Easter update, shop, Rust game, new content');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(11496, 'en-US', 'Rust may soon be getting an Easter store update that will bring a new Faberge egg. What awaits us in this update? And, of course, the question that all players are asking: do you already have eggs? Let\'s take a closer look.<br/><br/> The Faberge Egg is one of the most anticipated items in Rust. It may appear in the store with the Easter update. It is a unique item that differs from all other eggs in the game. It may have a unique design, rare items, or even special effects.<br/><br/> However, like any update, the introduction of a new Faberge egg may cause some compromises and disagreements among players. Some may consider it too expensive or unfair to other players. Others, on the contrary, may admire the rarity and exclusivity of the item. It is important to consider that the game developers must find a balance between the desires of players and their financial economy.<br/><br/> The Easter store update may bring even more interesting holiday-related items. New costumes, weapons or building blocks - all this can await players. However, it is important to remember that when purchasing these items in the game, you not only get new content, but also support the developers and game updates.<br/><br/> Of course, having eggs in a player\'s inventory is a matter of personal choice and playstyle. Some may collect various eggs and attach special value to them. Others may prefer to focus on other aspects of the game. What playstyle you choose is up to you.<br/><br/> In the end, the new Faberge egg is not only a new item in the Rust game, but also an opportunity for developers to show their creative side and add variety to the game world. Do you already have eggs?'),
(11497, 'en-US', 'New Features of Rust: Ping and Map Marking System'),
(11498, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new features of Rust: a ping system and map markers that will help improve teamwork and coordination in the game.'),
(11499, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Rust updates, ping system, map markers, teamwork, new Rust features'),
(11500, 'en-US', 'The developers are working hard to improve the game Rust and introduce new features for players. One of the main innovations is the system of pings and marks on the map, which will help improve teamwork and coordination in the game.<br/><br/> The ping system will allow players to mark specific locations on the map with markers that will only be visible to their team. This will greatly facilitate communication and help clarify locations in firefights and other situations.<br/><br/> In addition to pings, players will also be able to add permanent markers to the map. These markers will not disappear over time like pings and will be available to all team members. Players will be able to choose an icon, color, and name them to better navigate the map.<br/><br/> The new feature, which was accidentally available on the open branch aux02, is still in development. The developers continue to actively work on improving it and plan to make many changes before the final release. There is no release date for this feature yet, but it will definitely appear in the next updates.<br/><br/> Stay up to date with the latest changes and innovations in the game Rust and do not miss the chance to use new features for more successful adventures in this exciting world of survival.'),
(11501, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust on the Steam platform'),
(11502, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new batch of skins in the game Rust on the Steam platform. Updated skin collection, new stylish images, impact on the game economy. Create a fresh and unique style for your character in the world of Rust.'),
(11503, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, skin collection update, stylish images, game economy'),
(11504, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust, where each new batch of skins is a real holiday for players! We are happy to inform all fans of the game and lovers of stylish images about the release of a fresh collection of skins for your character.</p><br/><p> A new batch of skins☝ is already available on Steam and is ready to greet you with its diversity and original design. In the game Rust, you can choose a skin for any item - weapons, clothes, buildings and vehicles. Updating the collection of skins not only allows you to stand out from other players, but also to create a unique style for your character.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins☝ is a wide range of stylized items in different color variations and with unusual details. You will be able to choose from a variety of options to emphasize your individuality and give the game a fresh look.</p><br/><p> However, before you start buying, it is important to consider several factors. First, new skins can affect the game economy and balance. After all, if some skins become too popular, their prices can increase exponentially. Second, you need to pay attention to how the skins look on different models of weapons or other items. Some items, given their shape or texture, may not fit certain skins.</p><br/><p> All these factors should be taken into account before purchasing new skins. But despite this, the new batch of skins☝ offers a rich choice and the ability to create a unique image of your character. So go ahead and create a unique style in the game Rust with the help of fresh skins.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to update your collection and highlight your individuality in the game Rust with a new batch of skins☝! Visit the Steam platform and choose stylish items for yourself today.</p>'),
(11505, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest and most interesting skins that may soon appear in the game Rust on the Steam platform. Consider the contenders from the workshop :948518119708688425: and choose new images for your items!'),
(11506, 'en-US', 'new skins, workshop, challengers, Rust, Steam, updates'),
(11507, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will tell you about the freshest and most interesting skins that may soon appear in the game Rust on the Steam platform. We have looked through the workshop :948518119708688425: and selected for you our main contenders for adding to the game.<br/><br/> Workshop updates constantly delight players with a variety of skins that allow you to give your in-game items a unique and stylish look. And we are sure that these new items will be no exception.<br/><br/> Each skin we\'ll look at has a unique design and style to suit a variety of player tastes. You\'ll be able to choose a new look for your weapons, tools, clothing, and other items to stand out from the crowd.<br/><br/> We analyzed the popularity of each skin among the player community and took their opinion into account when choosing the most interesting offers. In the article, you will find a detailed description of each skin and learn how to get it if it is added to the game.<br/><br/> We will also discuss the possible trade-offs associated with the introduction of new skins. The balance between visual design and game mechanics is of great importance to the game developers, and we will consider how new skins can affect the gameplay.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss our detailed article about upcoming skins in the game Rust. Find out about the main contenders for addition to the game and make your choice to become a truly stylish virtual survivalist!'),
(11508, 'en-US', 'The future in Rasta has already arrived'),
(11509, 'en-US', 'The main developers of the game Rust have presented a long-awaited update that added new features and functions. Find out how exciting and large-scale the future of Rust has become in the new article.'),
(11510, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, future in Rust, new features, improved graphics, new places, crafting system, skill upgrades, balance, bug fixes'),
(11511, 'en-US', 'The main developers of the game Rust have finally released the long-awaited update, introducing players to new features and functions. In this article, we will consider how spectacular and exciting the future has become in Rust.<br/><br/> One of the most impressive new features is the improved graphics. Now the game world looks even more detailed and realistic. The developers have done a great job of detailing textures and adding special effects, which allows players to fully immerse themselves in the atmosphere of Rust.<br/><br/> The update also introduced new locations for exploration and adventure. Player bases and settlements have become more diverse and interesting, and new locations have added a sense of scale and variety to the gameplay. Unique tasks and missions now await players at every turn.<br/><br/> The new crafting and progression system is also worth noting. Players can now create more complex and powerful items, opening up new possibilities in the game. And the skill leveling system allows you to develop your character and become even stronger.<br/><br/> It is also worth noting the improved balance and bug fixes that made the gameplay even more fun and balanced. The developers listened carefully to the players\' feedback and took into account many of their suggestions to give them the best gaming experience.<br/><br/> In conclusion, I would like to say that the future in Rust has already arrived and will not leave any player indifferent. New features, improved graphics and interesting tasks make the game even more exciting and unpredictable. Join millions of players around the world and dive into the world of Rust today!'),
(11512, 'en-US', 'Be the first to know the news: subscribe to notifications'),
(11513, 'en-US', 'Be the first to receive notifications about Rust game news by subscribing to notifications. Stay up to date with the latest updates and game events.'),
(11514, 'en-US', 'news, notifications, updates, game Rust, subscribe, reaction'),
(11515, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with all the latest news? Don\'t miss a single Rust update, sign up for notifications and be among the first to receive the most relevant information. Just leave a reaction below and stay in the center of gaming events! :arrow_down::arrow_down::arrow_down:'),
(11516, 'en-US', 'Reddit User Develops LED Integration for Rust'),
(11517, 'en-US', 'Check out some new features in Rust thanks to this LED integration created by a Reddit user.'),
(11518, 'en-US', 'Reddit, Integration, LEDs, Rust, Brands, RGB Hardware'),
(11519, 'en-US', '<p>A Reddit user has created an innovative way to integrate LEDs into the game Rust. This amazing innovation allows players to enjoy a unique gaming experience by synchronizing lighting effects with the gameplay.</p><br/><p> One of the main features of this development is that it is compatible with most brands of RGB equipment. Now players can customize their gaming experience to the smallest detail, creating an immersive atmosphere with the help of lighting.</p><br/><p> Implementing this Rust integration with LEDs allows players to become even more immersed in the game world, highlighting emotions and interactions with the environment. Exciting in-game events such as attacks and hunts will sparkle and pulse in real time.</p><br/><p> It\'s a surprisingly simple and effective way to increase engagement with a Rust game, allowing players to experience every moment of the gameplay visually and emotionally.</p>'),
(11520, 'en-US', 'Raid 2023: Major Changes in Rust'),
(11521, 'en-US', 'Find out about all the major changes that await you in Raid 2023 - the new update of the Rust game. New locations, updated mechanics, improved graphics and much more!'),
(11522, 'en-US', 'Raid 2023, Rust changes, game innovations, Rust game update'),
(11523, 'en-US', '<p>This is another batch of news about the upcoming update of the game Rust! Raid 2023 is waiting for us! We have prepared several bright innovations that will certainly interest all fans of this popular game on Steam.</p><p> Meet the biggest changes in Rust history! During Raid 2023, you will encounter new gameplay, updated mechanics and improved visuals. Let\'s take a look at the main changes that await you.</p><ul><li> <b>New areas to explore</b> - players will now have the opportunity to go to the uncharted expanses of the Rust map. Here you will encounter new locations with unique resources and dangers. Get ready for exciting adventures and unexpected encounters!</li><br/><li> <b>Updated Raid Mechanics</b> - In Raid 2023, we\'ve revisited the core aspects of raids. Now you\'ll be able to use new weapons and tools to more easily deal with obstacles in your path to the enemy. Prepare for battle in a new way!</li><br/><li> <b>Improved graphics and audio</b> - To create an even more realistic gaming experience, we have updated the graphics and sound effects. Now you can fully immerse yourself in the Rust game world and enjoy the beauty of the environment.</li><br/><li> <b>Bug fixes and performance improvements</b> - Our development team is paying special attention to bug fixes and performance optimizations. In Raid 2023, you will be able to enjoy a more stable and smooth game.</li></ul><p> Here are the main innovations that our team has prepared for you in Raid 2023. We hope that these changes will make your experience in the game Rust even more fun and exciting! Get ready for battles, exploration and new adventures! Do not miss this unique opportunity to become a part of the game world of Rust!</p>'),
(11524, 'en-US', 'Implementing Camera Functionality in Rust+ Mobile App'),
(11525, 'en-US', 'Facepunch developers are working on implementing a camera feature into the Rust+ mobile app, allowing players to track what\'s happening in the game directly from their phone.'),
(11526, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Facepunch developers, Rust+ mobile app, camera feature, updates'),
(11527, 'en-US', 'Hello to all fans of the game Rust! I would like to share with you the interesting news that Facepunch developers are working on implementing the camera function in the mobile application Rust+.'),
(11528, 'en-US', 'Rust game on Steam: How to blow up a door correctly?'),
(11529, 'en-US', 'Find out how many sachels it takes to blow up a door in Rust on Steam and how to use this resource correctly to keep your base safe.'),
(11530, 'en-US', 'Rust game on Steam, door explosion, number of satchels, resources used, game strategy, base saving'),
(11531, 'en-US', '<p>The number of sachels needed to blow up a door is one of the key factors in the game Rust. The player\'s strategy and tactics depend on this parameter, so it is important to know the exact data.</p><br/><br/><p> According to multiple sources, it takes 5 Sachels to successfully blow up a door in Rust. This is important information to consider when developing your game strategy.</p><br/><br/><p> However, it is worth noting that in the Rust game world, every choice has its trade-offs. Balancing the amount of resources needed to create sachels with the result of blowing up a door can be a difficult task.</p><br/><br/><p> Different player approaches can also influence the decision to use Sachels to blow up doors. Some may prefer to save Sachels, using them only in extreme cases, while others may use them more often to secure their base.</p><br/><br/><p> The decision on how many sachels to use to blow up the doors should be based on an analysis of the available resources, such as time, resources, and environmental hostility. It is important to consider all factors in order to achieve an optimal strategy and protect your base from external threats.</p><br/><br/><p> In conclusion, the number of sachels needed to blow up a door in Rust has a significant impact on game strategy. A well-calibrated balance between resources and risk will help players develop successful tactics for defending their base.</p>'),
(11532, 'en-US', 'Rust Game on Steam: Rust+ Will Soon Be Able to Control Cameras'),
(11533, 'en-US', 'Rust game update: soon camera control will be available via rust+, which will add new possibilities for player control and safety.'),
(11534, 'en-US', 'Game Rust, rust+, camera control, update, bases, security'),
(11535, 'en-US', '<p>The developers of the game Rust have confirmed important news for all players. In the next update, the camera control function will be available through rust+. At the moment, the development team is actively working on this feature to ensure the convenience and functionality of all cameras in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust+ is a special application that allows players to expand their gaming experience and the convenience of interaction with the game. With rust+, you will be able to not only monitor your bases and assets, but also control cameras, which will add new possibilities to the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> This update will affect all cameras in the game, allowing players to control their territories and secure their assets more effectively. But that\'s not the only benefit of controlling cameras through rust+. The ability to monitor your base or area with high-quality cameras will also add a new level of realism and allow players to control their property more knowledgeably and intelligently.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition to camera control, rust+ offers other features such as in-game event notifications, map access, power system control, and more. All of this makes the gameplay even more immersive and efficient.</p><br/><br/><p> Stay tuned for a Rust update soon to enjoy new camera control features via rust+ and enhance your game strategy and safety.</p>'),
(11536, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: New Features, Expected Changes, and Tips for Successful Wipes and Raids'),
(11537, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Rust game update, key changes and new features. Prepare for a successful wipe and profitable raids with our useful tips and recommendations. We wish you a successful gaming experience and victories in the world of Rust!'),
(11538, 'en-US', 'Rust update, Rust wipe, Rust raids, new features, strategies and tactics, successful wipe and raids'),
(11539, 'en-US', 'Dear Rust players! We have great news for you – the long-awaited game update has been released! In this article, we will tell you about the most interesting changes that await you, as well as share useful tips so that you can successfully start a new wipe and make profitable raids.<br/><br/> Before we dive into the gameplay, let\'s talk about the new features that the update brings. You can expect a lot of improvements and new features, such as the addition of new weapons, unique items, and resources. The graphics have also been improved and bugs have been fixed to make your journey through the world of Rust more impressive and stable.<br/><br/> Now let\'s talk about the key moment - the wipe. Along with the update, many servers will perform a full data reset, which means that all your achievements and progress will be reset. Don\'t worry, this is a great opportunity to start from scratch and try new strategies and tactics. We recommend that you prepare before the wipe: study the new changes, review your plans and develop a new strategy to be ready for new challenges and victories.<br/><br/> Raids are an integral part of the Rust gameplay. The update adds new options in this area, options that can be very profitable if you plan and execute the raid correctly. It is recommended to think through all the details, study the vulnerabilities of the enemy base and determine the optimal moments for attack. Remember that in Rust, strength does not always defeat the enemy, sometimes the skill of strategy and tactics can lead to better results.<br/><br/> We hope that our article will help you master the new update of the Rust game and make your wipes and raids as successful as possible. Don\'t forget to follow the news and updates to stay up to date with all the changes and new features.<br/><br/> Have a good wipe and profitable raids! ✌'),
(11540, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has been released☝'),
(11541, 'en-US', 'We are pleased to announce the release of a new batch of skins☝ for the game Rust on Steam. In this article, we will take a detailed look at all the new skins and tell you how they can affect your gaming experience. Are you interested in skins in Rust? Then this article is for you!'),
(11542, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, skins, game Rust, Steam'),
(11543, 'en-US', '<p>Greetings to all fans of the game Rust on Steam!</p><br/><p> We are pleased to inform you that a new batch of skins has recently appeared in the game☝. In this article, we will take a detailed look at all the new skins that have been added to the game.</p><br/><p> By following this <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-20192699711707\">link</a> you can see the full list of new skins introduced in the batch. However, we will also tell you about the most interesting and significant new items so that you can stay up to date with the latest changes in the game Rust on Steam.</p><br/><p> In this batch of skins you will find a variety of items for different aspects of the game - from weapons and armor to decorative elements and clothing. Each skin has its own uniqueness and can emphasize your individual style of play.</p><br/><p> One of the main advantages of the new skins is their visual appeal. The developers tried to create high-quality and detailed textures that give the game items a realistic look.</p><br/><p> In addition, new skins may have some gameplay advantages. For example, they may increase the durability of weapons or provide armor with additional protection. Such skins are very attractive to players who want to gain an advantage in the game.</p><br/><p> However, it is worth remembering that purchasing new skins is an individual decision for each player. Some players tend to buy skins to show their individuality and stand out from other players. Others believe that skins do not affect the gameplay and are not necessary.</p><br/><p> Ultimately, the decision to purchase new skins depends on the personal preferences of each player. If you want to update your skin collection or improve your gaming experience, the new batch of skins☝ is a great opportunity to do so.</p><br/><p> We hope you found our review of the new batch of skins useful. Stay tuned for Rust updates on Steam and don\'t miss the opportunity to purchase your favorite skins!</p><br/><p> Have a good game!</p>'),
(11544, 'en-US', 'News from the fields!'),
(11545, 'en-US', 'Find out what awaits you in the March update of the game Rust! New modes, radio-controlled C4, controlled drones, a new CCTV camera and other interesting innovations.'),
(11546, 'en-US', 'news, field, update, modes, industrial update, radio-controlled C4, turrets, drones, CCTV camera, loot'),
(11547, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the March update of the game Rust! We have prepared for you several new features that will definitely add freshness and excitement to the game.</p><br/><p> The first thing to look out for is the new industrial upgrade modes. Now you will have the opportunity to complete various tasks and play the role of an industrial hero.</p><br/><p> Another interesting addition is the radio-controlled C4. Now you can control explosions from a distance, which opens up new possibilities in the tactical game.</p><br/><p> Controllable drones are another innovation that will captivate many players. Now you can take to the skies and explore the game world from a bird\'s eye view.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget about radio-controlled turrets. Now you can build your own security system and protect your base from any attacks.</p><br/><p> And finally, a new CCTV camera. Now you can monitor what is happening around you, having control over the video surveillance.</p><br/><p> In addition, we have changed the loot system when destroying a vending machine. Now, when you destroy a machine, you will receive 50% more valuable items.</p>'),
(11548, 'en-US', 'How to pick up the installed RF C4 in the game Rust'),
(11549, 'en-US', 'Want to know how to pick up a mounted RF C4 in Rust? This article will give you detailed instructions and necessary precautions. Be careful!'),
(11550, 'en-US', 'pick up C4, RF C4, Rust, explosives in Rust, pick up explosives in Rust'),
(11551, 'en-US', 'If you play Rust, you are probably familiar with dangerous and explosive C4 charges. But what if I told you that it is possible to pick up a planted RF C4? Yes, you heard right! This article will tell you how to do it and what precautions to take.<br/><br/> First of all, it\'s worth noting that picking up someone else\'s C4 is illegal in the world of Rust, and you can be punished for doing so. But sometimes, when you\'re in a tough situation, picking up C4 can be a life-saving solution.<br/><br/> Great, now onto the actual process of picking up C4. First, you\'ll need a tool called a crowbar. The crowbar can be found in various crates, boxes, and chests throughout the Rust map. Once you\'ve found the crowbar, the next step is to find the planted C4 you want to pick up.<br/><br/> But be careful! Picking up C4 can cause an explosion. So before approaching C4, make sure the area around it is safe. One small slip and you can turn into a pile of ashes. It is also worth remembering that some players may use traps by placing C4 in critical places.<br/><br/> If you decide to pick up the C4, walk up to it and press the \"E\" button to start the process. Picking up the C4 will take some time, so be prepared for possible attacks or explosions around you.<br/><br/> At this point, you should already know how to pick up a planted RF C4 in Rust. But remember, picking up a C4 without permission can have serious consequences. Be careful and play smart!'),
(11552, 'en-US', 'Work has begun on a double saddle for a horse'),
(11553, 'en-US', 'The developers of Rust on Steam have begun work on a new double saddle for horses. Learn more about the development of this piece of equipment and its impact on the Rust experience on Steam.'),
(11554, 'en-US', 'Rust game on Steam, updates, double saddle, horse, development'),
(11555, 'en-US', 'What\'s new in the world of equestrian adventures? Our team at Rust on Steam is excited to announce that work has begun on a new, innovative double saddle for horses! This new piece of equipment will allow you to travel on your trusty horse with a companion, thus increasing the coordination and strength of your team.<br/><br/> The Double Saddle is a cross between the classic Single Saddle and the Wagon. It features two separate seats, providing comfort and safety for two riders. Now you can enjoy the ride with a friend, discuss strategy, and test your skills during your adventures in Rust on Steam.<br/><br/> However, designing a double saddle is not an easy task. Our team faced several challenges related to balancing comfort and safety. We strive to create a saddle that is ideal for long-distance travel, but also comfortable and effective in combat situations.<br/><br/> The importance of taking these factors into account cannot be understated. Using double saddles in combat can give a great advantage in battle, but it also needs to be balanced to avoid unfair play. We are confident that we will do our best to achieve the optimal balance between comfort and gaming experience.<br/><br/> It is also worth mentioning that a double saddle will require additional resources to create, as it is more complex and functional than a regular seat. This highlights the importance of choosing between using a regular saddle or a double saddle for different game situations.<br/><br/> Along with this new update, we are also working on other changes to Rust on Steam to improve the gaming experience and meet the needs of our players. We are looking forward to you trying out all the new features and giving us your feedback.<br/><br/> Stay tuned for more information on the development of the dual saddle and other updates to Rust on Steam. Join our community and follow our news - exciting adventures await you and the opportunity to create the best version of your virtual life in Rust on Steam!'),
(11556, 'en-US', 'The next RUST update is expected: Thursday, March 2, at 22:00 Moscow time!'),
(11557, 'en-US', 'The next update of the RUST game is already on the way! In the article we talk about new features: drones, PTZ cameras, weapon racks and changes in the gameplay. We also mention important fixes. The update is expected on March 2 at 22:00 Moscow time.'),
(11558, 'en-US', 'RUST, game, update, drones, PTZ cameras, weapon racks, gameplay metrics, fixes'),
(11559, 'en-US', 'The next RUST update is expected: Thursday, March 2, at 22:00 Moscow time!<br/><br/> And what awaits us: \"Drones, PTZ cameras and much more!\"<br/><br/> Radio controlled drone<br/> After appearing on the AUX branch last week, new RC drones and functional manual turrets are making their way to the main branch of the game. In case you missed it, RC drones can be crafted and then controlled via computer terminals for reconnaissance. Likewise, turrets can now be controlled and even fired via computer terminals.<br/><br/> In preparation for next week\'s launch, the team has been fine-tuning various aspects such as range (currently 250m), deployment and placement, variables, and the like.<br/><br/> PTZ camera<br/> Another option for keeping an eye on your surroundings will be a PTZ camera, short for Point Tilt Zoom, that can be deployed on ceilings or roofs (not walls or floors). Once powered, you can set an ID for this camera (like drones) and then use a computer terminal to connect to it. Use the mouse to look around and left-click to zoom in (there are 4 zoom levels). Anyone looking at the camera from the outside will be able to see it turn and move.<br/><br/> In theory, it should appear in this update.<br/> The crafting of the camera and drone is shown in our post on the last screenshot!<br/><br/> ⚔Weapon racks<br/> There\'s been a flurry of commits this week around the upcoming weapon racks. While it hasn\'t been merged for testing yet, it looks like weapon racks will be deployable objects that will display weapons. Beyond just showing off the weapon, it looks like you\'ll be able to quickly equip the weapon you want just by looking at it. There\'s also the promise of the ability to auto-lock your weapon to the rack if you drop it right in front of it!<br/><br/> There is no information about when exactly they will appear. But it is definitely clear that from the prototype of the hacker week this stand interested the developers and they are actively implementing it into life.<br/><br/> Gameplay metrics - long live STATISTICS!<br/> A new branch dedicated to metrics tracking is in the works. Gameplay Metrics is a new way for servers and Facepunch to track general player and gameplay metrics such as blueprints, repairs, purchases, food consumption, and more.<br/><br/> There\'s no word on when or how exactly these features will be implemented, but ideally they could be used to balance and optimize gameplay over time.<br/><br/> ♻Miscellaneous fixes<br/> There are a bunch of other fixes in the \"Miscellaneous\" category in the game. Here\'s a quick rundown:<br/> Various fixes in poker<br/> Fixed incorrect boom sound effect for stone triangle floor frame + ramp.<br/> Fixed an issue where deploying small and large signs would not work on all walls.<br/> Fixed an issue where the repair indicator would not appear when hitting a damaged item if the player did not have the appropriate repair items in their inventory.<br/><br/> Other:<br/> More work on the \"Combat\" helicopter (now with missiles!)<br/> Work on the nuclear missile silo<br/> Fixes for the underground train entrance stairs not connecting to the metro line.<br/> More zipline landing fixes<br/> Removed map name from sdwearched when using server browser, previously the name was still displayed<br/> Automatically select text field when opening RC ID dialog<br/> Reworked storage adapter deploys volumes to prevent placement when the storage adapter bumps into something solid. This would typically result in inaccessible sockets due to pipe width checking.<br/> Fixed an issue where crates located underneath workbenches could not be picked up because they had a storage adapter on them that could not be removed.'),
(11560, 'en-US', 'Update: Changes to vending machine destruction in Rust'),
(11561, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest changes in Rust related to vending machine destruction and the impact on loot.'),
(11562, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, vending machine, loot'),
(11563, 'en-US', '<p>Dear players, we are pleased to share with you the latest news about the Rust game update!</p><br/><br/><p> The latest update made changes to how vending machines are destroyed. Players will now only receive 50% of the loot when a vending machine is destroyed, instead of the entire machine being destroyed.</p><br/><br/><p> This change was introduced to create balance in the gameplay. Previously, destroying a vending machine resulted in the complete removal of all its contents. This mechanic had its drawbacks and created an imbalance in the game\'s economy.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the tradeoffs made with this change is that players will still be able to get some loot when destroying a vending machine. It also encourages players to be more careful when using vending machines and balance the placement of them with the risk of losing them.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that the cost of repairing a vending machine has also been reduced to make it easier for players to keep them in good condition. This way, players can more freely place vending machines and expand their options in the Rust game world.</p><br/><br/><p> Updates and changes to the Rust game are a normal and integral process that helps the developers improve the quality of the gaming experience and create a more balanced and exciting game. We hope that this change to the destruction of the vending machine will help make the game more interesting and addictive for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> Stay tuned for updates and don\'t miss news about the latest changes in the game Rust! Good luck in your survival adventures!</p>'),
(11564, 'en-US', 'C4 with remote detonation'),
(11565, 'en-US', 'The remote-detonated C4 gives players new opportunities for strategic gameplay and carefully planned attacks in Rust.'),
(11566, 'en-US', 'C4, remote detonation, game Rust, strategy, attack, tactics'),
(11567, 'en-US', '<p>The remote-detonated C4 is one of the deadliest weapons in Rust. This tool allows players to accurately and efficiently destroy walls, buildings, and obstacles in the game world.</p><br/><p> The classic way to use C4 involves attaching it to a target and activating it until it explodes. However, as the game evolved and new features emerged, the developers changed the way C4 was used, adding the ability to detonate it remotely.</p><br/><p> Players can now not only attach C4 to a target, but also have the ability to detonate the explosive from afar. This greatly increases the tactical options and flexibility of players when using C4.</p><br/><p> However, it is important to remember that this feature requires precision and good organization from the player. Incorrect actions or mistakes can lead to unforeseen consequences and loss of C4.</p><br/><p> Additionally, remote detonated C4 can be quite an expensive resource to create, creating an additional balance between availability and weapon power.</p><br/><p> Overall, the remote-detonated C4 provides players with new opportunities for strategic gameplay and carefully planned attacks. However, using this weapon requires skill, coordination, and tactical thinking.</p>'),
(11568, 'en-US', 'Egg Suit: A Unique and Popular Item in Rust'),
(11569, 'en-US', 'All Rust players are eagerly awaiting the availability of the egg costume, which has already caused a real sensation. The unique design and the ability to paint creatively make it a subject of desire for many players. Find out more in the article!'),
(11570, 'en-US', 'Egg Costume, Rust, Game, Update, Design, Unique, Sign, Easter, Item, Community, Release'),
(11571, 'en-US', '<p>All Rust players are eagerly awaiting the availability of the egg costume, which has already caused a real sensation. Despite the fact that it is currently impossible to purchase, many are ready to pay hundreds of dollars just to have it in their collection. But the good news on the developer\'s Twitter confirms that the costume will be available in a few weeks - on the eve of Easter!</p><br/><br/><p> Why is the entire gaming community so interested in this item? The advantages over other costumes are obvious. In addition to the ability to beautifully decorate it in your own style, the egg costume attracts with its unique design and funny appearance. You can draw on it like on a tablet, allowing each player to realize their creative ideas within the game world.</p><br/><br/><p> So get ready, because in a few weeks you will be able to purchase this unique item and decorate your character in the style of an egg! Do not miss your chance to get this rare costume, which has already become an object of desire for many players from all over the world. Stay tuned for updates and the exact release date.</p>'),
(11572, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins came out, the door was predictable'),
(11573, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins in the game Rust and why their choice turned out to be predictable. The game developers are trying to find a compromise between the desires of players and the balance of the gameplay.'),
(11574, 'en-US', 'Rust game, new skins, skin selection, predictability, compromises, balance, gameplay'),
(11575, 'en-US', '<p>Recently, a new batch of skins was released in the game Rust on Steam, which caught the attention of many players. These skins provide the ability to change the appearance of various items in the game, including weapons, bases, and other objects.</p><br/><p> However, despite the interest in the new skins, their choice turned out to be quite predictable. The game developers at Rust decided to stick to the already established standards and not make too radical changes.</p><br/><p> This decision may leave some players feeling disappointed, as they were expecting more original and creative skins. However, there is a positive side to the predictability of the skin selection - they can easily be integrated into the existing gameplay and not upset its balance.</p><br/><p> Ultimately, the choice of skins in Rust is a compromise between creating a unique and interesting visual experience for players and maintaining a balanced and stable gameplay. The developers try to take into account the wishes of players, but at the same time do not forget about the importance of maintaining the overall atmosphere and limitations of the game.</p><br/><p> Thus, the new batch of skins in the game Rust offers players the opportunity to refresh the appearance of various objects, but the choice of these skins turned out to be predictable. This decision is a compromise between the desires of players and the need to maintain a balanced gameplay.</p>'),
(11576, 'en-US', 'News Notifications: React to be the first to know'),
(11577, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with Rust news on Steam? React below and be the first to receive notifications about all updates and events.'),
(11578, 'en-US', 'notifications, news, game Rust, updates, reaction, subscribers'),
(11579, 'en-US', '<p>Want to always be up to date with the latest news? No problem! All you need to do to be the first to receive notifications about all updates, events and changes in the game Rust on the Steam platform is to leave a reaction below.</p><br/><p> Our team is constantly monitoring news about Rust and is always ready to share fresh information with our subscribers. We will try to keep you informed about all the latest updates, developments and gameplay changes. Every time news appears, you will be the first to know about it.</p><br/><p> So don\'t miss the opportunity to be among the first to receive up-to-date news about the game Rust on Steam. Just leave a reaction below and enjoy the first notifications about all the events in the world of Rust.</p>'),
(11580, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest Workshop skins in Rust on Steam'),
(11581, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust skins, Rust workshop, skins on Steam, Rust game'),
(11582, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will tell you about the latest and most exciting new skins for the game Rust. We present you with unique and memorable designs created by talented authors through the Steam Workshop.<br/><p> The Steam Workshop is a place where players can share their creative ideas, create new skins for characters, weapons and other items in the Rust game. Here, everyone can become part of the development of the game world and bring their most interesting and unpredictable ideas to life.</p><br/><p> But which workshop skins are the most striking and in-demand in Rust? We\'ve done some research and selected the most interesting contenders for you, which are already generating a lot of interest among players.</p><br/><p> Whether it\'s helmets, armor, weapons or even decorative elements - each skin from the workshop invests in aesthetics, uniqueness and individuality. You will be able to transform your character, create a unique style and stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> However, choosing new skins can also be difficult and require careful consideration. Which ones are best suited to your playstyle and goals? Always remember that when choosing a skin, it is important to consider its practicality, functionality, and gameplay. Some skins may make you stand out on the battlefield, but at the same time be less protective. Be prepared to make compromises and choose the skin that best suits your gaming experience and needs.</p><br/><p> So, are you ready to learn about the latest skins from the workshop in the game Rust on Steam? Stay tuned, we will tell you about the most interesting and promising contenders that are already waiting for their moment to become part of your gaming collection.</p>'),
(11583, 'en-US', 'Rust update: elevator improvements and bug fixes'),
(11584, 'en-US', 'In the new update to the game Rust, the developers focused on improving the elevators and fixing bugs. The article discusses planned changes, such as improved elevator animation, increasing the opening time of doors, and fixing problems with them getting \"stuck\". It also covers the coding of elevators and their interaction with other elements of the house.'),
(11585, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, elevator, fixes, improvements, coding, doors, animation'),
(11586, 'en-US', '<p><br/>In the latest update to the Rust game, the developers turned their attention to improving the operation of elevators. The next update will include several fixes and improvements related to this game mechanic.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> Among the main changes expected:<br/></p><br/><ul><br/><li> Improved elevator animation</li><br/><li> Increasing the time it takes for the doors to open after the elevator reaches the floor</li><br/><li> Fixed an issue where doors would get stuck and not open, forcing players to move between floors</li><br/><li> Coding of elevators and their interaction with other elements of the house</li><br/></ul><br/><p><br/> All these changes are aimed at improving the gaming experience and comfort of players when using the elevator. The developers are also working on eliminating possible errors and problems associated with this functionality.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> This update is expected to significantly improve the usability of elevators in the game and ensure that this part of the gameplay operates more smoothly and realistically.<br/></p>'),
(11587, 'en-US', 'New cameras and new information'),
(11588, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest news about updates in the game Rust: new cameras and improved information. 360-degree camera rotation and zoom function allow you to have more control and enjoyment during the game.'),
(11589, 'en-US', 'new cameras, new info, Rust, update, 360 rotation, zoom'),
(11590, 'en-US', 'Hello! Today we want to share with you some interesting news about the latest updates in the game Rust. The official update added new cameras and improved player information. Now you can rotate the camera 360 degrees, as well as zoom. The new features will allow you to get even more fun and complete control during the game. Such features are often used in strategy games and first-person shooters, and now they are available in Rust.<br/><br/> Many players have already had the chance to appreciate the new camera rotation and zoom in the game. This makes it much easier to observe the playing field, allowing you to notice even the most inconspicuous details or lurking dangers. You can freely rotate the camera 360 degrees to explore the environment, improve tactics and make the right decisions in real time.<br/><br/> In addition, the zoom function allows you to zoom in, giving you the opportunity to examine objects in the game in greater detail. This is especially useful when shooting from a long range weapon or when you need to examine something at a great distance. Zoom opens up new possibilities for tactical play and helps to achieve greater accuracy and efficiency.<br/><br/> The new update brings new dimensions to the Rust gameplay with improved cameras and new information. Now you have more opportunities to explore, strategize, and win. Don\'t miss your chance to take advantage of the new features and dive into the exciting world of Rust today!<br/><br/> :PepeDabDance:'),
(11591, 'en-US', 'Model of the new CCTV camera'),
(11592, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new security camera model in Rust, which gives players full control and surveillance, as well as control of drones and turrets.'),
(11593, 'en-US', 'model, camera, video surveillance, update, Rust, Steam, control, computer station, drones, turrets'),
(11594, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust on Steam has added a new and improved CCTV camera model, giving players even more control and insight into their surroundings.</p><br/><br/><p> Now you will be able to fully control the camera by connecting to the computer station. This gives you the ability to monitor any area of your base or even the immediate area beyond its boundaries.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, along with the new camera model, the developers have added other control options. Recently, changes have been made that allow players to control drones and turrets. This way, you can organize a more reliable defense of your base and keep it under surveillance.</p><br/><br/><p> The new CCTV camera model is a significant improvement that gives players the ability to control the Rust game world in a more detailed and effective way. Be aware of everything that is happening around you and never miss important moments that can affect your strategies and tactics.</p>'),
(11595, 'en-US', 'Find out about new skins for the game Rust on Steam. Consider the variety of options and choose a unique image for your character. Pay attention to the characteristics of the skins, which can affect your performance in the game.'),
(11596, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, Steam, game, new, personalization, selection, update, characteristics'),
(11597, 'en-US', '<p>A fresh batch of skins has arrived in the world of Rust on Steam! Players are provided with new personalization options and a unique style for their gaming experience. Being on trend and standing out from the crowd has never been easier - just check out the new skins and choose your favorite!</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust development team on Steam pays close attention to the wishes of players, so when creating new skins, they take into account their preferences and trends in the gaming industry. The new batch of skins includes a variety of items - from weapons and clothing to buildings and decorations. Now you have the opportunity to completely transform your gaming environment and create a truly unique look!</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main advantages of the new skins is their quality. Each item was designed with love and attention to detail. High-resolution textures and realistic execution allow you to fully immerse yourself in the game atmosphere and feel like a real survivor.</p><br/><br/><p> When choosing skins, you should consider not only the appearance, but also their impact on the gameplay. Some skins can change the characteristics of weapons or defense, which can affect your effectiveness in battle. Therefore, before purchasing, it is recommended to carefully study the characteristics of each skin and choose the one that suits you in all respects.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins in the game Rust on Steam are new opportunities and new challenges. Using them in your strategies and tactics, you can stand out from other players and show your uniqueness. Start exploring new skins and create the perfect image for your character in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(11598, 'en-US', 'Useful guide: how to descend from any height in the game Rust'),
(11599, 'en-US', 'Looking for ways to safely descend from any height in the game Rust? In this article, we will look at useful tips and techniques that will help you make a successful descent and avoid risks and injuries.'),
(11600, 'en-US', 'guide, descent from height, Rust, safety, ladder, sling, parachute');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(11601, 'en-US', 'This article is a useful guide that will help you safely descend from any height in the game Rust. We will cover several effective methods, tips and tricks that will help you avoid injury and successfully descend.<br/><br/> First of all, it is important to consider that rappelling from great heights requires good preparation and some practice. Before attempting the descent, make sure you have enough conventional or broken tools, such as ropes, slings or ladders.<br/><br/> Now let\'s look at some descent methods.<br/><br/> 1. Using a ladder: This is one of the safest and most reliable ways to get down from a height. Before you start, make sure the ladder is secure and stable. Install it in such a way that it is long enough to reach the ground from your current location.<br/><br/> 2. Using a sling: Another way to descend is to use a sling or rope. Before you begin your descent, make sure the sling is securely attached to something stable and strong above. Then, carefully lower yourself down the sling, controlling your speed and your balance.<br/><br/> 3. Using a parachute: If you have a parachute, you can try to descend from a height using it. This method requires some experience and skill in controlling the parachute. Study the instructions for using the parachute carefully and make several practice jumps to make sure that you can descend safely.<br/><br/> It is important to remember that descending from great heights always involves certain risks, so do not forget to mentally assess the situation, take all precautions and listen to your intuition.<br/><br/> We hope this guide will help you successfully descend from any height in the game Rust and avoid possible injuries. Good luck!'),
(11602, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with all the latest news about Rust updates on Steam? Join our information community and get notifications first!'),
(11603, 'en-US', 'notifications, Rust game news, updates, Steam, reaction, information community'),
(11604, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with all the latest news about Rust game updates on Steam? We offer you the opportunity to be the first to receive notifications about all news and updates to the game. All you need to do is leave a reaction below. :arrow_down::arrow_down::arrow_down: This way, you will always be aware of all the changes in the game and will be able to be one step ahead of other players. Don\'t miss the opportunity to stay up to date and join our information community. Leave a reaction below and receive notifications first!'),
(11605, 'en-US', 'Some news from the fields'),
(11606, 'en-US', 'The article talks about the new features and updates of the game Rust. The developers are actively working on drones and an attack helicopter, which will appear in the next update.'),
(11607, 'en-US', 'Rust news, update 2.03.23, drones, workbench, attack helicopter'),
(11608, 'en-US', '<h2>Developers are actively working on drones</h2><br/><p> In the next update 2.03.23 we will be able to see new drones that the developers are currently working on. Players will be able to study and craft these drones, which will require a 2nd workbench. This will open up new opportunities in exploring the world of Rust and increase the chances of success in fights with other players.</p><br/><br/><h2> Attack helicopter in development</h2><br/><p> Alistair confirmed that the development team is currently hard at work on a new type of air transport for Rust - an attack helicopter. Players will be able to control it, and it will be a unique opportunity to carry out attacks on bases and players from the air. The helicopter will be equipped with a special weapon, and it will also have a turret to which players will be able to add their own weapons.</p>'),
(11609, 'en-US', 'Conveyor Noise Changes in Rust Industrial Update'),
(11610, 'en-US', 'Learn about the changes to conveyor noise in the Rust Industrial Update and how the developers are listening to player feedback.'),
(11611, 'en-US', 'conveyor belt noise, Industrial update, Rust game, developer reaction, player feedback, gaming comfort'),
(11612, 'en-US', '<p>After the release of the Industrial Update in the game Rust, many users expressed positive feedback about the new game content. However, among the positive feedback, there were also negative comments regarding the loud noise produced by conveyor installations.</p><br/><p> But there is good news: the game developers have listened to the players\' comments and promise to significantly reduce the noise from conveyor installations in the next game update.</p><br/><p> This change is important for all players, as the noise caused by the conveyor system could be distracting and interfere with the full gameplay. Reducing the noise effect will allow players to focus on the game and enjoy the new content of the Industrial Update without outside interference.</p><br/><p> Proper noise balancing in Rust is an important aspect for players to enjoy the game. The developers understand that it is necessary to find a compromise between realistic sound effects and a comfortable gaming atmosphere.</p><br/><p> It is worth noting that player feedback is an integral part of the game development process. Rust developers actively listen to feedback and update the game to meet the expectations and needs of their players. This is a testament to the fact that Rust is not just a game, but a project that strives to offer the best gaming experience to its users.</p><br/><p> Thus, the next update to the Rust game with reduced noise from conveyor installations will be a positive step in the field of gaming comfort and will allow players to fully immerse themselves in the game world without external interference.</p>'),
(11613, 'en-US', 'Rust Devs Experiment With Breadboards'),
(11614, 'en-US', 'Learn how Rust developers are experimenting with breadboards during hack week and how it can help make working with electricity easier.'),
(11615, 'en-US', 'Rust developers, hack week, breadboards, making electrical work easier'),
(11616, 'en-US', 'The developers of Rust are always looking for new and interesting ways to improve the gameplay and make it even more exciting for players. One such opportunity for innovation is provided by \"hack week\" - a week when developers can do whatever they want and experiment with all sorts of ideas.<br/><br/> This time, the Rust developers decided to take advantage of this opportunity to experiment with breadboards. Their goal is to make it easier to work with electricity in the game and allow players to more freely place and move circuits on breadboards, similar to picking up and moving paintings.<br/><br/> Breadboards will be a new tool for building and developing in the game Rust. Now players will be able to easily and conveniently create and customize schemes on breadboards, which will allow them to get more variability and possibilities when designing bases and automation.<br/><br/> The use of breadboards in Rust will also allow players to have more control over their electrical systems and easily create complex and efficient devices. This innovation will allow players to be more creative and interesting in the creation and automation of their bases, which will add new possibilities and depth to the gameplay.<br/><br/> Experiments with breadboards are being conducted during hack week, and if the innovations are successful, they may be implemented in a full update of the Rust game. Thus, players will be able to enjoy new features and improvements that will allow them to create even more creative and advanced bases.<br/><br/> Source: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a>'),
(11617, 'en-US', 'Radio-controlled turrets added to staging branch'),
(11618, 'en-US', 'A new update to Rust has added radio-controlled turrets that allow players to control them remotely, opening up new tactical possibilities in the game. Find out how this can impact gameplay and player base fortification.'),
(11619, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, radio-controlled turrets, base, strategy'),
(11620, 'en-US', '<p>One of the latest updates to the Rust game was the addition of a new feature - radio-controlled turrets. This new addition allows players to control turrets using radio control, opening up new tactical possibilities in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> The game developers realized that players wanted more flexibility and control over their bases, so radio-controlled turrets were introduced. Players can now control turrets remotely, placing them in strategic locations and selecting targets to attack.</p><br/><br/><p> This innovation opens up new possibilities for defending the base and attacking enemies. Players can use radio-controlled turrets to create deadly traps and ambush other players. But it is worth remembering that using radio-controlled turrets requires good strategic preparation and planning.</p><br/><br/><p> The RC Turret update has received positive feedback from players, with many noting that it is a great addition to the gameplay and adds a new level of tactical depth. However, as with any new element of the game, the addition of RC Turrets has also brought some changes to the game balance, and the developers plan to continue to work on tweaking and improving it in future updates.</p><br/><br/><p> So if you\'re looking for new ways to fortify your base and boost your attacks, RC Turrets are an update worth checking out. This new feature for players could very well change your strategy and success in Rust.</p>'),
(11621, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has been released!'),
(11622, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest batch of skins for Rust on Steam and the impact they have on design, game balance, and player motivation.'),
(11623, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, skins, new batch, design, game balance, visual perception, reward factors, motivation, individuality, update, appearance, freshness, variety, expression'),
(11624, 'en-US', 'You may have noticed that Rust has a new batch of skins on Steam! This means you now have even more options to customize your character and weapons. These new skins have something for every player, from the stylish and fashionable to the more exotic and unusual.<br/><br/> One of the key factors that influences these new skins is their design. Each skin has been carefully designed with attention to detail to create a unique and distinctive look. You will find skins for a variety of items in the game, including weapons, clothing, tools, and more.<br/><br/> However, when introducing new skins, it is necessary to find a balance between their visual appeal and game balance. After all, skins should not only look good, but also be consistent with game mechanics and differ in rewarding factors such as visual perception, rarity and availability.<br/><br/> When designing new skins, the impact on player decision making is also taken into account. Attractive skins can be an important motivator for continued play and engagement. They can be a source of pride and self-expression, allowing players to express their individuality in the Rust game world.<br/><br/> So if you\'re looking to update your look and add some freshness to your gameplay, be sure to check out these new skins for Rust on Steam. Not only do they add more variety to the game, but they also allow you to express yourself in the game world.<br/><br/> It\'s time to choose your new skin and go into battle in style!'),
(11625, 'en-US', 'Developing a slingshot as part of the week of creativity'),
(11626, 'en-US', 'As part of the creative week, the Rust developers began work on the slingshot, a new weapon that will add interest and variety to the gameplay. This article discusses the details of this development, its impact on gameplay, and the tradeoffs associated with it.'),
(11627, 'en-US', 'slingshot development, creative week, Rust game, new weapons, gameplay, accessibility, tactical possibilities, compromises'),
(11628, 'en-US', 'As part of the creative week, the Rust game development team began creating a new weapon - a slingshot. This is a unique device that will add interest and variety to the gameplay. In this article, we will talk about the details of this development and how it can affect the gameplay of the game.<br/><br/> Developing new weapons is always an interesting challenge for the developers. In the case of the slingshot, they are working on creating a device that can launch various projectiles over long distances. This could be useful both when hunting wild animals and when interacting with other players.<br/><br/> One of the main advantages of the new weapon is its availability. The slingshot can be crafted from simple materials that can be found almost anywhere in the game world. This makes it possible to start using the weapon already at the early stages of the game.<br/><br/> The slingshot also offers players new tactical options. Its power and precision open up new strategies and tactics. Players can use the slingshot to attack opponents from a safe distance or to create traps and ambushes.<br/><br/> However, developing a slingshot also has its trade-offs. First, using the weapon requires a certain amount of skill and accuracy from the player. Without sufficient training, shooting a slingshot may not be effective. Second, creating the weapon itself takes time and resources, which may make it difficult for some players to obtain it.<br/><br/> Overall, the development of the slingshot during Creative Week is an interesting and promising event for Rust players. It will add new features and challenges that will undoubtedly attract attention and be an important part of the gaming platform.'),
(11629, 'en-US', 'Developers Add Backpacks to Rust'),
(11630, 'en-US', 'The developers are working on implementing backpacks into the game Rust. The addition of backpacks will allow players to get additional slots in their inventory, but with a slight decrease in movement speed. This is happening as part of Hack Week, and the release date is not yet known.'),
(11631, 'en-US', 'developers, backpacks, game Rust, innovation, inventory, movement speed, Hack Week'),
(11632, 'en-US', 'The developers are working on implementing backpacks in the game Rust. This innovation will allow players to get additional slots in their inventory, but the speed of movement will be slightly reduced. When asked why the backpack only adds one row of slots, one of the developers replied: \"This is the maximum I can do without changing the entire interface.\"<br/><br/> The addition of backpacks to the game is part of Hack Week, which is a periodic event that allows developers to do whatever they want for a week.<br/><br/> Unfortunately, it is not yet known when backpacks will be added to the game. All projects created during Hack Week are not guaranteed to be released - some may be abandoned forever, while others may return in the future.'),
(11633, 'en-US', 'Want a unique skin for February 14? Find out what new things the game Rust has in store for Steam!'),
(11634, 'en-US', 'Find out about new skins that will appear in the game Rust by February 14. Unique updates that will please all fans of the game.'),
(11635, 'en-US', 'Rust skins, new Rust skins, Rust Steam game, skins for February 14, game updates'),
(11636, 'en-US', '<p>February 14 is a day that fills us with romance and a desire to do something special for our loved ones. The game Rust on Steam understands how important this day is for the player community and is preparing surprises in the form of new skins that will allow you to express your feelings and style in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Every gamer dreams of his character standing out from the others. And new skins in the game Rust on Steam will allow you to do this. Fresh updates will add unique clothing items, weapons and interior items to the game that will pleasantly surprise you with their quality and design.</p><br/><br/><p> February 14 is not only Valentine\'s Day, but also a day when Rust players can feel special. New skins for this holiday will allow you to create a romantic atmosphere in the game, emphasize your individuality and attract the attention of other players.</p><br/><br/><p> Every year, the gaming industry comes up with new ways to please its fans, and the game Rust on Steam is no exception. The developers not only took into account the requirements and wishes of the players, but also presented unique skins that will become a bright accent in your gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the updates in the game Rust on Steam by February 14 to be in trend and enjoy new skins. Express your feelings and create a special atmosphere with your favorite game. Give yourself and your friends emotions and pleasure that will remain in memory for many years.</p>'),
(11637, 'en-US', 'New Future Skins: The Best Contenders from the Workshop'),
(11638, 'en-US', 'Find out about the best contenders for new workshop skins for the game Rust. New items that will make your gameplay unforgettable.'),
(11639, 'en-US', 'impatience, skins, Rust, workshop, challengers, design, game environment, aesthetics, individuality, quality'),
(11640, 'en-US', '<p>Are you looking forward to new skins for the game Rust? We are happy to share with you information about the best contenders for adding to the game from the workshop. Unique design and high-quality execution make these skins indispensable for your gameplay. Let\'s dive into this exciting world of future skins!</p><br/><br/><p> The Steam Workshop is a place for creative players to submit their own unique skins for Rust. Every skin in the workshop is a potential candidate for inclusion in the game, and we\'ve rounded up the top contenders for you to check out.</p><br/><br/><p> The first on our list of recommendations is the skin :948518119708688425:. This skin will amaze you with its uniqueness and stylish execution. Perfectly combined with the game environment, this skin will give you new aesthetic sensations and make your game unforgettable.</p><br/><br/><p> Next, we would like to introduce you to other potential new items from the workshop: __________________________________, __________________________________ and ____________________________________. Each of these skins has its own individuality and high quality of execution.</p><br/><br/><p> So, the upcoming workshop skins offer endless possibilities to customize your gaming experience. They will highlight your individuality and make the game even more exciting. Spend some time in the workshop, study all the contenders and choose the most interesting skins! Your Rust game will never be boring with these potential new additions.</p>'),
(11641, 'en-US', 'Rust Hack Report Twitter Account to Be Shut Down Due to New Twitter Rules'),
(11642, 'en-US', 'The Rust Hack Report Twitter account, which has been posting ban notifications for players, is likely to shut down this month due to new Twitter rules that could make it much harder to catch cheaters in Rust.'),
(11643, 'en-US', 'Twitter, account, Rust Hack Report, player bans, developers, API, subscription, catching cheaters, servers'),
(11644, 'en-US', 'The Rust Hack Report Twitter account, which tweeted out player ban notifications, is likely to shut down this month.<br/><br/> The developers said that this was due to upcoming changes in Twitter\'s API policy - the social network representatives said that soon accounts would only be allowed to use it if they subscribed monthly, but the developers refused to spend money on supporting the bot.<br/><br/> Twitter later reversed its decision and allowed the bots to continue working for free if they simply posted to the feed. However, Facepunch has not yet changed its mind.<br/><br/> Rust Hack Report is an account that was actively used by many server admins to track and create databases of accounts that were banned in Rust and use them to search for alt-accounts of cheaters. With the shutdown of this bot, there will be no alternatives without the help of developers - server owners expect that in the long term this will complicate the catching of cheaters on new accounts on community and modded servers.'),
(11645, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest skins for the game Rust. Review of the new batch of skins and their features.'),
(11646, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, skins update in the game Rust, review of new skins'),
(11647, 'en-US', '<p>Dear Rust players! We have great news for you - a new batch of skins has been released!</p><br/><p> It is always nice to see fresh, stylish and high-quality skins that add a bit of variety to the game and allow you to stand out from other players. Skin updates are one of the most anticipated events that happen several times a year and bring with them a lot of interesting items.</p><br/><p> This new batch of skins will definitely not disappoint you. It includes various categories of items, from weapons and clothing to various accessories for your base. Now you have the opportunity to purchase unique skins that will highlight your style and help you create a unique image in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> Updating skins in the game Rust is not only a chance to look at beautiful items, but also an opportunity to support the developers of the game. By purchasing skins, you also finance the further development and improvement of the game, which allows you to enjoy even more content in the future.</p><br/><p> However, it is worth remembering some of the trade-offs that you may face when choosing and purchasing new skins. Some of them can be quite expensive, so you should think carefully about your decision and consider your options before buying. Also, some skins may make changes to game mechanics or affect balance, so you should carefully evaluate their impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><p> If you do decide to purchase new skins, be sure to check out reviews and feedback from other players to make the most informed choice. Maybe you\'ll find a skin you like the most and decide to add it to your collection.</p><br/><p> So don\'t waste time and check out the new batch of skins in the game Rust today! Think about what style you want to express with their help and create a unique image of your character. Happy shopping and enjoyable game in Rust!</p>'),
(11648, 'en-US', 'The update is out! Get ready for a new wipe in Rust'),
(11649, 'en-US', 'Read about the latest changes in the game Rust that affect the gameplay and get ready for a new wipe on equal terms with all players!'),
(11650, 'en-US', 'update, wipe, Rust, news, gameplay, video review, resources, challenges'),
(11651, 'en-US', '<p>The long-awaited update to the game Rust is finally out! This means that a new chapter of adventures is opening up before us, full of opportunities and challenges. An exciting wipe awaits you, which is definitely worth trying!</p><br/><br/><p> It\'s time to get ready and hone your survival skills. After the update, you will have to go through many changes and new challenges. All previous achievements and buildings will have to be left behind and start from scratch. After all, as you know, a wipe is an opportunity for all players to start the game on equal terms!</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget that the update can significantly affect the gameplay. New items, resources, enemies and opportunities await you in the vastness of Rust. Be prepared for unexpected challenges and achieve success together with your team!</p><br/><br/><p> To stay up to date with all the changes and interesting news, we recommend that you watch the video review of the update:</p><br/><br/><p> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GMybqJ2eYSc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GMybqJ2eYSc</a></p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to dive into the exciting world of Rust and achieve your goals. Have a nice wipe!</p>'),
(11652, 'en-US', 'The update will be released in a few hours!'),
(11653, 'en-US', 'Learn about the upcoming Rust update on Steam, which includes a new industrial system and changes to the Hapis map.'),
(11654, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, Steam, industrial system, map Hapis, tools, automation, performance'),
(11655, 'en-US', '<p>In just a few hours, an update will be released in the game Rust on Steam!</p><br/><p> One of the key aspects of this update is the addition of the industrial system.</p><br/><p> The Industrial System introduces new items that will allow you to automate various tasks on your base.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> The Industrial Crafter is a new tool that will greatly simplify the process of creating items.</li><br/><li> An industrial conveyor is a new type of transport system that allows you to efficiently move items from one point to another.</li><br/><li> A wrench is an important tool for maintaining and repairing your industrial system.</li><br/><li> An industrial furnace is a new device that runs on electricity instead of the traditional use of wood. This will help you use resources more efficiently and increase productivity.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> In addition to the industrial system, there will also be a change to the Hapis map.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned for an update in the Rust game and get new opportunities to improve your base and optimize the gameplay!</p>'),
(11656, 'en-US', 'Be the first to receive notifications about the latest news about Rust on Steam by reacting to this post. Stay up to date with all the updates and changes to your favorite game'),
(11657, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, game, Steam, news, notifications'),
(11658, 'en-US', '<p>Want to stay up to date with all the latest news about Rust on Steam? Then react below and get notified first! :arrow_down::arrow_down::arrow_down:</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to stay up to date with all the updates, changes, and new features that appear in the game. Our team always tries to keep you updated on the latest developments so that you can stay ahead of the game.</p><br/><p> By reacting to our post, you will receive notifications about every news we publish. Whether it is a game update, new features or events within the game world, you will always be aware of the latest and most interesting content.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to be the first to try out new features of the Rust game and be among the leaders in online battles. Subscribe to our notifications right now, and you will never miss important information about your favorite game! :bell::mailbox_with_mail:</p>'),
(11659, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will tell you about the latest and most interesting skins from the workshop, which are potential candidates for addition to the Rust game.'),
(11660, 'en-US', 'new, skins, upcoming skins, challengers, workshop, updates, Rust'),
(11661, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we will tell you about the latest skins that are potential candidates for addition to the game Rust. Stay tuned to stay up to date with the latest news!</p><br/><p> Workshop :948518119708688425: is a place where independent developers create and offer their own skins for the game Rust. Here you can find unique designs of weapons, clothes, equipment and much more.</p><br/><p> We have collected for you a selection of the most interesting skins that have already gained great popularity and have become contenders for being added to the game. They are distinguished by high-quality development, originality and compliance with the atmosphere of Rust.</p><br/><p> Our list of upcoming skins includes a wide variety of options, from colorful and bright to darker and more somber. Each skin has its own unique treatment and details that give the weapon or item a special look.</p><br/><p> But, as in any creative process, there are also compromises. The developers struggle with issues of balance and the correct adaptation of new skins into the game. After all, they must comply with the standards and mechanics of Rust, so as not to disturb the balance of the gameplay and maintain the atmosphere of survival.</p><br/><p> Adding new skins to the game is a difficult choice that can influence the opinion of the gaming community. Therefore, the developers carefully study the feedback and suggestions of players before making a final decision on adding skins to Rust.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to stay up to date with new skins and get an idea of possible contenders for inclusion in the game Rust. Follow our updates and be among the first to appreciate new, unique skins!</p>'),
(11662, 'en-US', 'How do you like these waves?'),
(11663, 'en-US', 'Check out the amazing new sea waves coming soon to Rust!'),
(11664, 'en-US', 'waves, updates, game Rust, sea atmosphere'),
(11665, 'en-US', 'Have you ever wondered what amazing sea waves might appear in the game Rust? We are happy to share the news that in one of the future updates you will be able to enjoy amazing waves! Dive into the game world and feel all the power and realism of this natural phenomenon. All you have to do is enjoy and ride the waves!'),
(11666, 'en-US', 'Attack helicopter under development'),
(11667, 'en-US', 'The article announces the development of a new type of air transport for the game Rust - an attack helicopter. It is equipped with a special weapon that allows players to carry out attacks on bases and players from the air. Details are expected in February.'),
(11668, 'en-US', 'Attack Helicopter Development, Rust Game, Air Transport, Weapons, Air Attacks'),
(11669, 'en-US', '<p>Alistair confirmed that work is currently underway on a new type of air vehicle, the Attack Helicopter, which players will be able to pilot. This powerful helicopter will be equipped with a special weapon that will allow players to carry out full-scale attacks on bases and other players from the air.</p><br/><p> While there are no screenshots yet, more details on the new feature are expected to be revealed in February. The attack helicopter will open up new possibilities for players and add additional tactical elements to the game Rust.</p>'),
(11670, 'en-US', 'New skins in the game Rust and information about the giveaways'),
(11671, 'en-US', 'Find out about new skins in the game Rust, participate in giveaways and get information in our community on Discord.'),
(11672, 'en-US', 'new skins, giveaways, game Rust, Steam, information, community'),
(11673, 'en-US', '<p>We would like to remind you that we have two giveaways among players of the game Rust on Steam, where you can win 14 unique skins. You can get information about the giveaways and participation in our community.</p><br/><p> Join us on Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rust-ru\">https://discord.gg/rust-ru</a> to stay up to date with all the news and participate in giveaways.</p>'),
(11674, 'en-US', 'Get all the details on the Rust update, which brings a new batch of skins. Update the look of your characters, weapons, and buildings and add some freshness to the gameplay!'),
(11675, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, game, update, party, appearance, weapons, buildings, store, Steam, game currency, restrictions, PvP, collection, visual design'),
(11676, 'en-US', 'Greetings to all owners of the game Rust! We have great news for you - a new batch of skins has been released! Now you have the opportunity to update the appearance of your characters, weapons and buildings to make them truly unique and stylish. In this article, we will tell you about the most interesting new items and details of the update.<br/><br/> The new batch of skins includes a wide range of different items that will suit both warriors and creative builders. You will be able to choose from a variety of colorful suits, helmets, protective suits, as well as weapons and tools that will bring freshness and originality to the gameplay.<br/><br/> One of the key components of the update is unique skins for buildings. Now you can create impressive and unique buildings using new materials, colors and textures. They will not only make your base resistant to attacks, but will also allow you to stand out from other players with your style.<br/><br/> Skins can be purchased in the Rust game store or on the Steam marketplace. They are available for both in-game currency and real money. Be careful when choosing skins, pay attention to their cost, rarity and popularity. Some skins may be limited in time or have a limited number of copies, which makes them especially valuable.<br/><br/> However, before investing a large amount in skins, it is recommended to think through your strategy and balance your financial capabilities. Do not forget that skins in the game Rust do not affect the game mechanics in any way and do not give advantages in PvP battles. They serve solely for decoration and visual design of your gaming experience.<br/><br/> Now that you know about the new skins in the game Rust, do not miss the opportunity to update your collection and add freshness to the gameplay. Please yourself and your friends with stylish and unique items that will become an excellent calling card of your profile in the game. Good luck and enjoy the game!'),
(11677, 'en-US', 'Hold the button got a golden door, for 1,000,000 sulfur'),
(11678, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new update in Rust that allows players to get a golden door for 1,000,000 sulfur. In this article, you will learn about the unique characteristics of this item, as well as the trade-offs that players face when making this decision.'),
(11679, 'en-US', 'Hold the button, golden door, Rust, update, sulfur, compromises, game mechanics'),
(11680, 'en-US', '<p>A new update in the game Rust allows players to get a golden door with just one click of a button! Players will be able to exchange 1,000,000 units of sulfur for this exclusive item. This opportunity has become very popular among players who are looking to decorate their bases in the game.</p><br/><p> The Golden Door is not only a prestige item, but also has a number of unique characteristics. It provides higher protection and reliability of the base, making it truly impregnable to enemies.</p><br/><p> However, the decision to exchange so much sulfur for a golden door may cause some controversy among players. Some will question its cost and effectiveness. Ultimately, it will be a question of compromise between the decorativeness and functionality of the base.</p><br/><p> Despite this, the offer to get a golden door with just one button press is attractive, and many players have already rushed to chase 1,000,000 sulfur to acquire this rare item.</p><br/><p> The update also includes changes and improvements to the game mechanics to make the game experience even more exciting and diverse. The developers pay special attention to player feedback to create the best gaming environment that will satisfy the interests of the maximum number of players.</p><br/><p> The players\' choice whether to exchange 1,000,000 sulfur for a golden door remains open. Each player must make their own decision based on their preferences and game strategy. After all, it is just one of many decisions and trade-offs that players must make in Rust.</p>'),
(11681, 'en-US', 'In our article, you will find a description of potential new skins for the game Rust from the Skin Workshop on Steam. We will analyze various factors that influence the choice of skins by developers and tell you about the most anticipated new products that may appear in the near future. Find out everything you need to know about new skins for your game Rust.'),
(11682, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, skins workshop, new items, design, adding skins'),
(11683, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust skins! In this article, we will take a look at the cutting-edge new releases from the Steam Skin Workshop. Here you will learn about the most interesting skins that are currently in development and may become available in the near future.</p><br/><br/><p> Our article is dedicated to the description of potential skins (applicants) from the Skin Workshop in the game Rust. The Workshop is a platform where players can create and submit their own designs of skins for weapons and items in the game. Among the variety of proposals, we have selected the most promising and interesting skins that every Rust player should know about.</p><br/><br/><p> We have conducted a thorough analysis of many new skins, taking into account their design, quality, originality and popularity among players. Many factors influence which skins will be added to the game. In this article, we will look at these factors and analyze their influence on the decision of the game developers.</p><br/><br/><p> We will look at the trade-offs that developers may make to satisfy the interests of different groups of players. The balance between design, price, accessibility, and player demand plays an important role in decisions about adding new skins.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to understand that choosing new skins in Rust has an impact on the gameplay. Some skins can provide advantages in the game, affect the player\'s visibility, or change the interaction with the game world. In this article, we will look at these issues and discuss what decisions can be made to achieve a balance between the quality of the game experience and interesting skin designs.</p><br/><br/><p> And of course, we will share with you a list of the most anticipated skins that are currently in development. You will learn about upcoming new products that can add a new level of customization and variety to the game Rust. Interested players will be able to contribute and vote for their favorite skins to influence their inclusion in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Future skins for the game Rust are a chance for developers to show off their creative side and surprise players with new interesting designs. In our article, you will find all the necessary information about potential new products and understand what skins to expect in the near future.</p>'),
(11684, 'en-US', 'Teaching players to play Rust'),
(11685, 'en-US', 'This article discusses the importance and resources for teaching new players about Rust, including official guides, communities, and the game itself. Details on how to help new players get comfortable in this survival game and become successful players.'),
(11686, 'en-US', 'player training, Rust game, resources, guides, video tutorials, communities, forums, practice, developers, survival'),
(11687, 'en-US', 'In the article \"Teaching Players to Play Rust\" we will look at the importance and need for teaching new players the basics of Rust, and also present several approaches and resources that will help new players get comfortable in this survival game, survive the first difficulties and become successful players.<br/><br/> Rust can be a complex and multifaceted game, and new players can quickly become overwhelmed by all aspects of the game, from collecting resources and building your base to fighting other players. However, proper training and assistance can greatly speed up the learning process and increase your chances of success.<br/><br/> There are several resources and sources that players can use to learn how to play Rust. One of the main sources is the official guides and video tutorials created by the game\'s developers. These resources introduce the game\'s basic mechanics and features, walkthroughs, and survival tips. They are a great place for new players to start and help them understand the basics of the game.<br/><br/> Another useful resource are the Rust communities and forums. Here, players can chat, share experiences, and ask questions to more experienced players. Many communities also offer educational materials, such as guides and video tutorials created by experienced players. This is a great way to get advice and help from other players who have already gone through the initial difficulties.<br/><br/> The gameplay itself shouldn\'t be forgotten either. Often the best way to learn how to play Rust is through practice. Players can start by playing on various public servers, where they can gain experience interacting with other players and learn the basic mechanics of the game. There are also special servers where newcomers can play together and get help from more experienced players.<br/><br/> In conclusion, training and support for new Rust players plays an important role in helping them get comfortable with the game and become professional survivalists. Official resources, communities, and the game experience itself are great resources to help newcomers quickly enter the Rust gaming world and achieve success.'),
(11688, 'en-US', 'Alistair on Modular Weapons'),
(11689, 'en-US', 'Alistair shared his thoughts on the possibility of adding modular weapons to Rust and the challenges associated with integrating them.'),
(11690, 'en-US', 'Alistair, modular weapons, update, balance, game Rust'),
(11691, 'en-US', 'In the latest update, Alistair shared his thoughts on modular weapons in Rust.<br/><br/> In his speech, he noted that although the development of modular weapons was conceived from the very beginning of the game, adding them now seems to be a difficult task. It is necessary to find a balance with the existing weapons and find a solution that will allow players to enjoy the process of creating and learning modules, without making the standard weapons completely useless.<br/><br/> While Alistair doesn\'t rule out the possibility of adding modular weapons in the future, he stressed that it would take a lot of time and thought into how best to integrate them into the game.'),
(11692, 'en-US', 'Developers prohibit running industrial pipes through walls'),
(11693, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new feature in the game Rust: the developers prohibit the installation of industrial pipes through walls. Find out how this will affect the gameplay and the opinion of the community.'),
(11694, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, developers, industrial pipes, walls'),
(11695, 'en-US', 'Dear players! Please pay attention to the latest changes made by the developers of the game Rust! Now it will be impossible to carry industrial pipes through walls. In this article, we will tell you more about the innovation and how it will affect your gameplay.<br/><br/> Previously, players had the ability to run pipelines through walls, which allowed them to optimize the placement of industrial blocks in the game. However, the developers decided to prohibit this ability. Now players will have to find alternative ways to install pipes outside the walls or rebuild their bases taking into account the new restriction.<br/><br/> This change has caused some controversy in the player community. Some believe that this is a fair restriction that will create more balance in the game, while others are outraged because they consider it excessive interference from the developers in their gameplay.<br/><br/> It should be noted that recently the developers of the game Rust have made a number of changes that are aimed at improving the game mechanics and balancing game elements. They constantly monitor player feedback and try to make the most informed decisions that will allow everyone to feel equal conditions in the game.<br/><br/> We will follow the news from the Rust developers and share with you all the relevant information. Follow our updates to stay up to date with the latest changes!'),
(11696, 'en-US', 'How to be the first to receive notifications about Rust game news on Steam'),
(11697, 'en-US', 'Learn how to be the first to receive notifications about Rust news and updates on Steam to stay up to date with all the latest changes.'),
(11698, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, notifications, news, updates'),
(11699, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam is constantly undergoing innovations and updates, and every player wants to be aware of all the changes and news. To always be the first to receive important news notifications, we offer you a simple way.<br/> Just leave a reaction below and you will be notified about all updates and changes in the game Rust. Stay ahead of other players and be the first to know about new features, bug fixes, item additions and much more.<br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to stay up to date with all the latest news and information about the world of Rust on Steam! :arrow_down::arrow_down::arrow_down:'),
(11700, 'en-US', 'Some of the new features expected in Rust this year'),
(11701, 'en-US', 'Find out what new changes and features are coming to Rust players this year, including weapon racks, pets, new DLC, and more.'),
(11702, 'en-US', 'Rust game, updates, weapon racks, emoji, controllable drones, pets, DLC, building blocks, industrial conveyor, procedural caves, monuments, water, new weapons'),
(11703, 'en-US', '<p>This year, Rust players can expect some interesting changes and additions. Let\'s take a look at some of them:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Gun racks - new possibilities for storing and organizing weapons.</li><br/><li> Emoji in chat is a new way to express emotions and communicate with other players.</li><br/><li> Controlled drones and turrets - introduction of automatic defense and additional opportunities for players.</li><br/><li> Pets are a new element of survival and companions for players.</li><br/><li> New DLCs including skins for building blocks - more options for customization and base decoration.</li><br/><li> Industrial conveyor - new ways of automation and production of resources.</li><br/><li> Procedural caves - exciting adventures and new opportunities for exploration.</li><br/><li> New monuments, including a ferry terminal - new locations and travel between servers.</li><br/><li> Water (sea) update - more realistic and improved graphic effects.</li><br/><li> New weapons and items - more options for fighting and building.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> These changes promise to make the gameplay even more interesting and diverse for all fans of the game Rust. All you need to do is wait for the release of the update and enjoy the new features.</p>'),
(11704, 'en-US', 'Update: Mushroom icon is now red in Rust!'),
(11705, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest update to Rust, which is the mushroom icon. They are now a bright red color, making the gameplay even more attractive!'),
(11706, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, mushroom icon, red color, visual improvement'),
(11707, 'en-US', '<p>We are pleased to announce the latest update to the Rust game, which includes a new visual detail - the mushroom icon, now in an attractive red color!</p><br/><p> Previously, the mushroom icon in the Rust game was brown, but the developers decided to update it in accordance with the overall style of the game. The new red color gives the mushroom icon brightness and contrast, making it more noticeable and attractive.</p><br/><p> The mushroom icon update highlights the importance of detail in the Rust game world and the commitment to continually improve the graphical design. The developers understand how important it is to keep players interested and make the gameplay even more enjoyable and visually appealing.</p><br/><p> In addition to changing the color to red, the mushroom icon remains unchanged in shape and image to remain easy to recognize in the game. Players will now be able to easily identify mushrooms thanks to the bright and attractive red color.</p><br/><p> The update is now available in the latest version of Rust on Steam. We invite you to try the new mushrooms with a red icon and enjoy the improved visual experience in Rust!</p>'),
(11708, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Celebration of Lunar Festival in Rust on Steam'),
(11709, 'en-US', 'Check out the new skins for the Lunar Festival in Rust on Steam. The developers focused on uniqueness, recognition, and gameplay balance to allow players to express their individuality and participation in this special event.'),
(11710, 'en-US', 'new skins, lunar festival, Rust, Steam, design, balance, uniqueness, recognition, game balance, game store, collection, symbols, individuality'),
(11711, 'en-US', '<h2>New Skins in Celebration of Lunar Festival in Rust on Steam</h2><p> The Lunar Festival is coming up on January 23rd, and the developers of the game Rust on Steam have decided to please players with new skins dedicated to this special event. In this article, we will look at what skins have been added to the game and what compromises in design and balance had to be made.</p><br/><p> The Lunar Festival is a time of joy and celebration, and the new skins will perfectly complement the atmosphere of the game. The developers tried to create unique and attractive skins that will allow players to express their individuality and emphasize their participation in this special event.</p><br/><p> However, when creating new skins, the developers faced a number of challenges and compromises. First, they had to find a balance between uniqueness and recognizability of the skins. Each skin must be unique to attract the attention of players, but at the same time it must be recognizable and fit well with the overall atmosphere of the game.</p><br/><p> Secondly, the skins must be fair and not give any advantage to the players. Balancing between visual appeal and game balance is a difficult task that developers face. They must make sure that new skins do not affect the game mechanics and do not give players any advantage over other players.</p><br/><p> New skins in honor of the Lunar Festival will be available for purchase in the Rust game store on Steam. Players will be able to choose a suitable skin for themselves and add it to their collection. Whether a skin with the image of the moon and stars or a skin with the symbols of the Lunar Festival - everyone will find something that they like.</p><br/><p> So, don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your items in the game Rust with new skins in honor of the Lunar Festival! Express your individuality and emphasize your participation in this special event.</p><br/><p> Enter the /skins command in the game chat to check out the new skins and choose the one that you like. Good luck and enjoy playing Rust!</p>'),
(11712, 'en-US', 'The game recently released two hotfixes');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(11713, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest hotfixes for Rust, including the transition to a new version of the Unity engine and the addition of statistics collection. Read on to learn how this may affect gameplay and what to do if you have graphics issues after the update.'),
(11714, 'en-US', 'Rust game, hotfixes, Unity engine update, statistics collection, game optimization, graphics issues'),
(11715, 'en-US', 'The game recently released two hotfixes:<br/><br/> • The game has been migrated to Unity 2021.3.16f1<br/> • Disabled Graphics Jobs for macOS build to try to fix crashes on that platform<br/> • Incremental GC enabled for macOS build (experimental)<br/> • Added data and statistics collection<br/><br/> The engine update will not give anything to players, except for a couple of possible bugs with graphics (opaque glass in cars and thick wires on power lines) - basically, this update is important only for the developers themselves.<br/><br/> Statistics collection will allow developers to collect statistics on completely different things that happen in the game - which weapons are used more or less often, which monuments are more popular or not, what is the performance of players, on what hardware, and many other data - to better understand the current balance of the game, optimization and player preferences in gameplay.<br/> If you have graphics bugs after the update (or FPS dropped), go to the Rust settings in Steam and in the \"Beta\" tab, select the \"unity2019\" branch - this is the same version of the game, but on the previous version of the engine. Don\'t forget to leave it before the February update.'),
(11716, 'en-US', 'Now that\'s good news!'),
(11717, 'en-US', 'Placed in the doorway boxes, sleeping bags, etc. will not affect the installation of doors in the game Rust. Take care of the safety of your base in the game Rust without obstacles!'),
(11718, 'en-US', 'Now this is good news, installing doors, doors in Rust'),
(11719, 'en-US', 'Install doors with peace of mind and without obstacles!'),
(11720, 'en-US', 'How to get the first notifications about Rust game news?'),
(11721, 'en-US', 'Want to always be up to date with the latest news about the game Rust? We have prepared useful recommendations for you on how to receive news notifications first!'),
(11722, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Rust update news, Rust news notifications'),
(11723, 'en-US', '<p>Do you want to always be up to date with the latest news about the game Rust? Don\'t want to miss a single update, patch or important event? We have prepared useful recommendations for you on how to receive news notifications first!</p><br/><br/><p> All you have to do to stay ahead of the game is to react below! Just click the down arrow and you\'ll get the latest news on your smartphone or computer.</p><br/><br/><p> We offer you a unique opportunity to be the first to know about upcoming updates, new features and changes in the game. Never miss important events or stand apart from other players again.</p><br/><br/><p> Our notifications cover all aspects of Rust, including new content and bug fixes, strategies and tactics, map updates, and anything else that might impact your gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> Stay up to date with the latest news and developments in Rust! React below and be the first to receive notifications!</p>'),
(11724, 'en-US', 'Find out about the most interesting and creative new skins that may soon appear in the game Rust. Join the selection of skins to create incredible possibilities for your gaming experience.'),
(11725, 'en-US', 'new skins, upcoming skins, workshop, skin selection, Rust, gaming experience'),
(11726, 'en-US', '<p>Hello, dear Rust players! Today we want to share with you exciting news about future skins for the game. Interesting contenders have appeared in the workshop, which will not leave anyone indifferent.</p><br/><p> Our team has done a thorough analysis and selected the most impressive and creative skins that may soon appear in the game. Each of these skins has its own unique style and design that can give new life to your items in the game.</p><br/><p> We understand that deciding on new skins to add to the game is a complex process that requires taking into account various factors such as balance, item value, and interaction with the game economy. Therefore, we focused on creating skins that combine aesthetic appeal with support for game mechanics.</p><br/><p> Of course, we understand that every player has their own preferences, and what you find attractive may differ from other players. Therefore, we try to provide the most diverse skin options so that every player can find something to their liking.</p><br/><p> In addition to design, we also pay attention to the quality and originality of each skin. We work with talented artists who create amazing concepts based on a variety of themes and ideas. We strive to bring new and unique elements to the game that will make your game night even more exciting.</p><br/><p> Finally, we want to note that your opinion is very important to us. We value your feedback and invite you to participate in choosing future skins for the game. Together we can create incredible and exciting opportunities for your gaming experience in Rust.</p>'),
(11727, 'en-US', 'First edits of the industrial update!'),
(11728, 'en-US', 'The first changes in the industrial update of the game Rust include a restriction on the installation of industrial pipes through walls and the ability to build bunkers. Find out more in the article!'),
(11729, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, industrial update, industrial pipes, bunkers, game, news'),
(11730, 'en-US', '<h2>The first changes in the industrial update!</h2><br/><br/><p> Welcome, friends! Today we are happy to share with you the first changes that appeared in the industrial update of the game Rust. Don\'t waste time and let\'s figure out what innovations the development team has prepared for us!</p><br/><br/><h3> Industrial pipes can no longer be routed through walls</h3><br/><p> Unfortunately, one of the changes in this update is the restriction on running industrial pipes through walls. Now you will have to find other ways to lay out the piping system. However, not everything is so bad, you will still be able to run pipes through closed doors, which opens up new possibilities for organizing your industrial complexes!</p><br/><br/><h3> Bunkers and other possibilities</h3><br/><p> Have you always dreamed of having your own bunker? Then you will definitely like the new opportunities provided by the Rust industrial update! Now you can build convenient and reliable bunkers that will become indispensable for protecting your property and your own safety. Unleash your potential in construction and dot all the i\'s using the new elements and materials of this update!</p><br/><br/><p> We hope you enjoy the first changes in the Rust industrial update. This is just a small part of what the development team is preparing for you in the near future. Follow our news and don’t miss the next new features and opportunities in the Rust game!</p>'),
(11731, 'en-US', 'Be the first to receive news notifications by simply reacting below'),
(11732, 'en-US', 'Be the first to receive news notifications by simply reacting below. Stay in the center of the action, don\'t miss important updates and changes in the game Rust on Steam.'),
(11733, 'en-US', 'notifications, news, reaction, game Rust on Steam'),
(11734, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with the latest news? We offer you an easy way - leave a reaction below and get notifications first! Be in the center of what\'s happening, do not miss important updates and changes in the game Rust on Steam. Show your interest to always be up to date. Do not miss the opportunity to be one of the first to know about the latest news and updates that will expand your gaming immersion and experience. Leave a reaction below and get notifications about all the news right in your feed!'),
(11735, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops have started'),
(11736, 'en-US', 'Get exclusive skins for the game Rust by participating in Twitch Drops!'),
(11737, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Skins, Exclusive, Participation'),
(11738, 'en-US', 'You can now get exclusive skins for Rust by participating in Twitch Drops!'),
(11739, 'en-US', 'Find out the details of the new round of Twitch Drops in Rust and get rare skins for your collection!'),
(11740, 'en-US', 'info, giveaways, skins, Twitch Drops, Rust'),
(11741, 'en-US', 'In just a couple of hours, a new round of Twitch Drops will begin! Today, January 16 at 00:00 Moscow time, you will be able to get rare skins for the game Rust. Find out more about the giveaways and don\'t miss the opportunity to update your skin collection!'),
(11742, 'en-US', 'Neural Network Creates Picture of Scientist from Rust Game'),
(11743, 'en-US', 'A neural network has created a portrait of a scientist from the game Rust. Will it be able to draw complex objects, such as the MVK set? This article examines the potential of artificial intelligence and the technical difficulties of reproducing detailed elements of the game.'),
(11744, 'en-US', 'neural network, game Rust, scientist, drawing, MVK set, machine learning'),
(11745, 'en-US', '<p>Recently, a neural network performed an amazing feat by drawing a portrait of a scientist from our favorite game Rust! This event caused a lot of excitement and interest among players and the scientific community.</p><br/><p> However, there is a question that worries everyone - will this neural network be able to reproduce such impressive results when drawing other objects from the game, such as the MVK set, which are some of the most complex and detailed elements in the Rust game world?</p><br/><p> To understand this issue, it is necessary to consider the main characteristics and complexities of these objects. The MVK set has a high level of detail and complexity, including unique textures and animations, which makes them one of the most interesting and sought-after items in the game.</p><br/><p> Neural networks are typically trained on large data sets, and the more samples they have, the better they can reproduce images. However, even with enough data, recreating objects as complex and detailed as the MVK set can be a challenge for even the most advanced neural networks.</p><br/><p> It is important to understand that a neural network can create impressive and artistic works, but this does not exclude the possibility of individual deviations in details. Balancing accuracy and creativity is a difficult trade-off that artificial intelligence is still struggling with.</p><br/><p> Thus, answering the question of whether a neural network can draw an MVK set is not so simple. This requires both technical and artistic solutions that will be determined by developers and artificial intelligence.</p><br/><p> In the future, with the development of machine learning and neural network technologies, we may see more and more amazing creations created with the help of artificial intelligence.</p>'),
(11746, 'en-US', 'How to be the first to receive notifications about Rust game news on Steam?'),
(11747, 'en-US', 'Find out how to be the first to receive notifications about Rust news and updates on Steam. Just react below and stay up to date with the latest news!'),
(11748, 'en-US', 'news, updates, game Rust, Steam, notifications, reaction'),
(11749, 'en-US', '<p>Rust is a multiplayer survival game that was released on the Steam platform a few years ago by its developers. Players must survive in a dangerous world where they face hunger, thirst, and other players who are also trying to survive.</p><br/><p> However, what if you want to always be up to date with the latest news and updates about the game Rust? How can you be the first to learn about new features, gameplay changes, and other interesting events happening in the game?</p><br/><p> The answer is simple - be the first to receive notifications about news related to the game Rust! All you need to do is be active by leaving a reaction below. Right now, to get up to date with what\'s happening, you need to click on the down arrows and leave your reaction. Don\'t know how to do this? Read on!</p><br/><p> First, open the Rust game on the Steam platform and go to the community page. Here you will find a section called \"Notifications\" or \"News\". Click on it to go to the news page.</p><br/><p> Next, you will see a button called \"Subscribe\" or \"Get Notifications\". Click on this button to enable notifications.</p><br/><p> Now you will receive notifications on your Steam platform every time the developers of the game Rust release news or an update. You will always be up to date with the latest news and will be the first to try out all the new features and changes.</p><br/><p> And don\'t forget to share this information with your friends! After all, it\'s always more fun and interesting to explore new features of the Rust game together.</p><br/><p> So, don\'t waste time - leave a reaction below and get notifications about Rust game news first!</p>'),
(11750, 'en-US', 'Skins for the upcoming Twitch Drops'),
(11751, 'en-US', 'Current skin offers in Rust, available via Twitch Drops. A variety of unique skins for your character. Check out the latest offers and don\'t miss the chance to update your collection.'),
(11752, 'en-US', 'skins, Twitch Drops, Rust, game Rust on Steam'),
(11753, 'en-US', '<p>Great skin deals await you at the next Twitch Drops!</p><br/><p> Rust on Steam is already offering a stunning selection of skins via Twitch Drops. Unique weapon skins, clothing, and other items will allow you to stand out from other players and create a unique look for your character.</p><br/><p> Check out the in-game store to see the latest skins available in the upcoming Twitch Drops. From exclusive offers to long-awaited classic skins that have returned to the game, don\'t miss out on your chance to pick up rare items that could be the perfect addition to your collection.</p><br/><p> What awaits you at the next Twitch Drops:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Fresh weapon skins that will highlight your individuality;</li><br/><li> Fashionable outfits and accessories to create a stylish look;</li><br/><li> New finishing options for buildings and objects;</li><br/><li> Unique decorative items that will make your base truly unique;</li><br/><li> And much more!</li><br/></ul><br/><p> And in order not to miss the most advantageous offers and to stay up to date with all the news about skins in Rust, subscribe to our VKontakte group: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a> .</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to stand out from the crowd and update your skin collection! Head to the Rust Steam Store now to see the latest deals in upcoming Twitch Drops.</p>'),
(11754, 'en-US', 'Information about skins added to the game Rust'),
(11755, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new skins added to the game Rust. Review and information about the new batch of unique items and the ability to purchase them in the game store.'),
(11756, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Rust skins, new skins, skins review, skins store'),
(11757, 'en-US', '<p>Hello, dear players of the game Rust!</p><br/><p> Today we are pleased to inform you that the game developers have released a new batch of skins!</p><br/><p> If you are a fan of the game Rust, then you probably know that skins are an important part of the gameplay.</p><br/><p> New skins give your items a personal touch and make your character or buildings unique.</p><br/><p> We have prepared a review of new skins for you so that you can appreciate their quality and style.</p><br/><p> This batch of skins includes various types of weapons, clothing items, building decorations and much more.</p><br/><p> Each skin has its own unique texture and design, allowing you to stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> Check out the new skins, choose the ones that suit you best and take your gaming experience to the next level!</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to check out the Rust game store to purchase these unique skins and treat yourself to new items.</p><br/><p> We wish you a pleasant game and successful shopping!</p>'),
(11758, 'en-US', 'Rust Concept: An Overview of the Industrial Update'),
(11759, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest updates to Rust, including new base building options, changes to the economy, and player progression. Explore the unique game world of Rust and face new challenges to survive in a dynamic and dangerous environment.'),
(11760, 'en-US', 'news, update, Rust, development, industrial update, game world, mechanics, bases, economy, technologies, research, survival'),
(11761, 'en-US', '<h2>Rust Concept: An Overview of the Industrial Update</h2><br/><p> Rust is survival in its purest form. This game is developed and updated by true masters of their craft who strive to create a unique game world full of dangers, adventures and incredible diversity.</p><br/><p> Rust recently had a major update, in which the developers gave players a lot of new opportunities, and a little later another unforgettable update follows - industrial.</p><br/><p> A couple of weeks after the release of the Industrial Update, we have already seen some fantastic results, some of which are discussed in this article. We will look at the main innovations, and also discuss how they have changed the game mechanics and the position of players in Rust.</p><br/><p> One of the major changes was the addition of new building elements and tools, allowing players to create even more complex and defensible bases. In addition, the industrial update brought changes to the game economy, expanding the possibilities for players in the field of production and trade.</p><br/><p> Another important feature of the update was a significant revision of the player progression and development system. New technologies and research were added, which open up even more opportunities for players to survive and prosper.</p><br/><p> The Rust concept continues to evolve, with each new update bringing unique opportunities and challenges. Players are given the chance to explore and adapt to new conditions, build alliances, and fight for survival in an ever-changing world.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to dive into the exciting world of Rust and experience all the new industrial changes. Get ready for incredible adventures, protect your base and prove your superiority in this tough fight for survival.</p>'),
(11762, 'en-US', 'Hey guys, a series of giveaways is starting in our Discord and VK!'),
(11763, 'en-US', 'Find out about a series of giveaways that are starting in Discord and VK, and get a chance to win new skins for the game Rust!'),
(11764, 'en-US', 'giveaways, Discord, VK, skins, contests, Rust'),
(11765, 'en-US', 'Greetings, dear Rust players! We are pleased to inform you that an exciting series of giveaways is starting in our Discord and VK communities, which we have prepared especially for you!<br/><br/> Want to get a new skin and take part in exciting contests? Then don\'t miss your chance and join us!<br/><br/> Our social networks:<ul><li> Discord - <a href=\"https://discord.gg/rust-ru\">https://discord.gg/rust-ru</a></li><li> VK - <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a></li></ul>'),
(11766, 'en-US', 'Trust Rust: Event Starts January 15th'),
(11767, 'en-US', 'A reminder about the start of the Trust Rust event on January 15th and an introduction to the participants from the workshop.'),
(11768, 'en-US', 'Trust Rust, event, start, january 15, participants, workshop'),
(11769, 'en-US', '<p>We remind you that very soon, on January 15, a very important event will begin in the game Rust called Trust Rust!</p><br/><p> We are pleased to introduce you to all the contenders who will take part in this exciting event. They are already preparing for the fight and competing with each other. We invite you to get acquainted with the participants from the workshop and learn more about them before the event begins.</p>'),
(11770, 'en-US', 'New upcoming skins for Chinese New Year in the workshop :ahhhhhhhhh:'),
(11771, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest Chinese New Year skins in Rust on Steam. Check out the colorful and traditional items submitted by the developers in the Steam Workshop.'),
(11772, 'en-US', 'new items, skins, chinese new year, workshop, rust, steam, holiday'),
(11773, 'en-US', '<p>If you are a fan of the game Rust on the Steam platform, then you will probably be interested in the latest skins that will soon appear in the game. And especially if you are already planning your purchases for the upcoming Chinese New Year.</p><br/><br/><p> In our review, we will tell you about the upcoming skins that are candidates for appearing in the game for the upcoming holiday. They can already be found in the Steam workshop, where active developers share their creations and invite users to take part in voting for their favorite skins.</p><br/><br/><p> The new skins are made with special attention to detail so that they convey the atmosphere of the Chinese New Year as much as possible. You will find a variety of items, from weapons to protective equipment, made in bright and traditional Chinese styles. Each skin is imbued with symbolism and tradition, which makes them especially attractive to collectors and lovers of Chinese culture. This is a unique opportunity to add something exotic and festive to your inventory.</p><br/><br/><p> However, before you decide to buy, there are a few things to consider. For example, some skins may only be available for a limited time, during the Chinese New Year. And, as always, it\'s worth paying attention to the price, which may vary depending on the popularity of the skin.</p><br/><br/><p> Also, don\'t forget that by purchasing skins, you support the game developers who are constantly working to improve and update content in Rust. And this is a great way to express your support and contribute to the development of the gaming industry.</p><br/><br/><p> Finally, we recommend checking out the upcoming Chinese New Year skins on the Steam Workshop and choosing the one that best suits your preferences and the holiday atmosphere. Don\'t miss the opportunity to get unique items and create a unique look in the Rust game.</p>'),
(11774, 'en-US', 'News and interesting facts in the game Rust'),
(11775, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest news and fun facts about Rust, including the addition of a new rabbit mask for Chinese New Year and the possibility of a military SMG.'),
(11776, 'en-US', 'news, interesting facts, Rust, Chinese New Year, mask, rabbit, updates, weapons, SMG, P90, UZI, SMG T3'),
(11777, 'en-US', '<p>In this article we will share with you some news and interesting facts about the popular game Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> :kv: Chinese New Year is coming to the world of Rust! The developers have decided to add a new rabbit mask to celebrate the holiday. This event will take place on January 22, which means we have only 13 days to prepare and enjoy the festive mood in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> :kv: :reddit: Future updates may bring new weapons to the world of Rust. The developers are considering adding a military SMG. Or they will replace one of the existing weapons with the popular UZI or SMG T3. This will give players more options and possibilities in the fight for survival.</p>'),
(11778, 'en-US', 'Hapis Island map in Rust game is going away'),
(11779, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about the Hapis Island map removal and the launch of a mapmaking contest in Rust.'),
(11780, 'en-US', 'Hapis Island Map, Rust, Map Removal, Map Makers Contest'),
(11781, 'en-US', '<p class=\"bold\">The Hapis Island map is going away, but not for a remake!</p><br/><p class=\"bold\"> The Hapis Island map will be permanently removed in February</p><br/><p> You only have one month left to enjoy this map. The developers have decided to remove it forever, making February its last month on the servers.</p><br/><p> In addition to this news, we have another important announcement for fans of map makers. The developers are planning to launch a map maker contest, in which everyone will be able to show their creativity and create unique game locations for Rust.</p><br/><p> Keep following Rust game updates to stay up to date with all the changes and events!</p>'),
(11782, 'en-US', 'New Skins for Rust: A Fresh Batch of Unique Updates'),
(11783, 'en-US', 'Unique updates of new skins for the game Rust will help to create a unique look, stand out among the players and support the developers.'),
(11784, 'en-US', 'new skins, updates, game Rust, character appearance, weapons, items, buildings, battlefield, developers, funding, content'),
(11785, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust are pleased to announce the release of a new exciting batch of skins that will allow players to dive even deeper into the world of the game.<br/> New skins are unique updates to the appearance of characters, weapons, items and buildings that give the game a special flavor and make the gameplay even more exciting and memorable.<br/> The new batch of skins includes a variety of vibrant and stylish variations to suit different gaming tastes. From realistic and subtle color schemes to vibrant and exotic combinations, there\'s something for everyone.<br/> With new skins, you can stand out on the battlefield, emphasize your individual style and impress your opponents. Whether it\'s aggressive and scary looks or elegant and sophisticated outfits, new skins will help you become more noticeable and add new emotions to the game.<br/> Don\'t forget that skins are not only a means of self-expression, but also an opportunity to support the game developers. By purchasing skins, you help finance further development, improving the game and adding new content.'),
(11786, 'en-US', 'Latest news about Rust game updates!'),
(11787, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news on Rust updates, including information on the new season of Twitch drops and the upcoming Industrial update with the ability to automate item production!'),
(11788, 'en-US', 'news, updates, Rust game, Twitch drops, Trust Rust, industrial update, automatic crafting, conveyors, pipes, electricity, automation, production, testing'),
(11789, 'en-US', '<p>We have great news for all fans of the game Rust! Today we want to share with you some interesting updates.</p><br/><p> :kr: Next week, January 15th, a new season of Twitch drops will be launched! This event, called Trust Rust, will offer you unique opportunities. Below you can find the attached video dedicated to this season.</p><br/><p> :kr: Soon there will be an industrial update available for you to test. On a separate branch (aux02) you will be able to test a new automatic crafting module, conveyors, pipes and much more. Even more opportunities for automated production of items using electricity! You will just need to debug the process a little.</p><br/><p> :load: Unfortunately, we don\'t have an exact date for the new testing branch to open yet. However, stay tuned, and we\'re sure we\'ll have more information to share with you soon.</p>'),
(11790, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update - Disabling Christmas Content and Improving Quality of Life'),
(11791, 'en-US', 'This article covers the latest update to Rust on Steam, which removed Christmas content and introduced quality of life improvements. Learn more about the new features and changes in the game.'),
(11792, 'en-US', 'update, Rust game, Rust Steam, quality of life improvements, Christmas content disablement, new features, containers, modular car, minicopter, copy cultures, wipe'),
(11793, 'en-US', 'Hi all.<br/><br/> Update today at 22:00 Moscow time.<br/><br/> One of the major changes made in today\'s update is the disabling of all Christmas content.<br/><br/> With the holidays on hold, most work has been put on hold, so this update will be light on content. The developers have been taking a break too, but don\'t worry, there\'s still a ton of awesome stuff on the horizon, including: industrial tools, pets, server-to-server transfers via boats, quality of life improvements, and more.<br/><br/> The main changes coming with today\'s patch to Rust are various quality of life improvements.<br/> Here is a short list:<br/> :kr: Containers with dropped items (not backpacks) always disappear after 2 hours regardless of the contents.<br/> :kr: Driver can now drive the modular car with the engine off. Allows one person to push and the other to drive.<br/> :kr: When a minicopter or helicopter breaks down and starts to burn, it won\'t throw fiery pieces around like it used to.<br/> :kr: It will now be possible to clone corn, pumpkin, and potatoes at an earlier stage of ripening.<br/><br/> Have a nice wipe.<br/><br/> Source: https://vk.com/rustcommru'),
(11794, 'en-US', 'Rust Quarry Update: More Resources for Less Cost'),
(11795, 'en-US', 'The Rust quarry update allows you to mine more resources for less diesel fuel. Find out more!'),
(11796, 'en-US', 'game Rust, quarry update, diesel, resources, excavator, resource extraction'),
(11797, 'en-US', '<p>The quarry update in Rust brought significant changes that make it more efficient. Now, although it requires diesel fuel instead of TNK, the quarry has become much better compared to the previous version.</p><br/><br/><p> The quarry is capable of extracting an impressive amount of resources in just 2 minutes of diesel use:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> 1000 units of sulfur</li><br/><li> 5000 units of stone</li><br/><li> 1000 units of metal</li><br/><li> 50 units mvk</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> But that\'s not all! The new excavator brings twice as many resources for the same unit of diesel. But despite this, the quarry still remains in demand due to its ease of use and the possibility of its development.</p>'),
(11798, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest upcoming skins from the workshop in the game Rust. In our article, we will consider the contenders and tell you about the process of choosing and implementing skins into the game world.'),
(11799, 'en-US', 'new items, skins, future skins, workshop, game Rust'),
(11800, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of skins in the game Rust! In this article, we will tell you about the latest innovations that are going to become future skins. We have an exclusive opportunity to look into the workshop and consider contenders for implementation in the game.</p><br/><p> Did you know that the ability to create your own unique skin in Rust is available to every user? The workshop offers a wide range of tools and materials so that you can realize your fantasy and create your own design. But before the skin becomes available in the game, it must pass a rigorous competitive selection.</p><br/><p> Our experts have analyzed the list of contenders and selected several of the most interesting and potentially popular skins. We will take a closer look at each design and tell you about its main features. There will be something to see!</p><br/><p> It is important to note that the decision to implement a skin in the game depends on the developers and the community of players. Their task is to find a balance between uniqueness and compliance with general standards of the gameplay. Given the huge number of applicants, the competition is expected to be fierce, and only the most worthy will be able to become part of the Rust gaming world.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on the chance to learn about future skins before everyone else! Join us and dive into the fantastic world of design in Rust.</p>'),
(11801, 'en-US', 'New Year\'s greetings and updates for the game Rust in 2023'),
(11802, 'en-US', 'In the new year, the game Rust expects global changes and updates, including levels, a store, a ranking system and cases. The administration of Rust RU Community congratulates all players on the New Year and wishes all the best!'),
(11803, 'en-US', 'New Year greetings, updates, game Rust, 2023'),
(11804, 'en-US', '<p>Here comes the new year 2023!</p><br/><p> We want to congratulate you with all our hearts and wish you all the best in the new year! We hope that all your dreams and wishes will come true!</p><br/><p> In addition, we want to inform you about many global changes and updates that have already occurred in the game Rust. But that\'s not all!</p><br/><p> In the new year, we plan to add many new mechanics and goodies for you. Among them will be levels, a store, a ranking system, cases and much more!</p><br/><p> We strive to make the game even more exciting and diverse for all players.</p><br/><p> We wish you all the best, with love, the administration of RUST RU COMMUNITY!</p>'),
(11805, 'en-US', 'Happy New Year from the Rust Ru Community!'),
(11806, 'en-US', 'Happy New Year and best wishes for successful raids and happiness! Best wishes from the Rust Ru Community.'),
(11807, 'en-US', 'New Year, congratulations, Rust, raids, success, happiness, health'),
(11808, 'en-US', 'Welcome to our website and wish each of you a Happy New Year! We wish you successful and exciting raids in the game Rust, as well as a lot of sulfur for them! Do not forget about maintaining your own health and be happy. On behalf of the entire staff of the Rust Ru Community project, we hasten to wish you a prosperous and successful year!'),
(11809, 'en-US', '❄️ In honor of the new year, Rust Ru Community is launching a large skin giveaway! ❄️'),
(11810, 'en-US', 'In honor of the new year, Rust Ru Community is launching a large skin giveaway for the game Rust. Participate and win new and beautiful skins for your character!'),
(11811, 'en-US', 'skin giveaway, new year, Rust Ru Community, Discord, Rust game'),
(11812, 'en-US', '<p>❄️ In honor of the upcoming New Year, our community Rust Ru Community is organizing a big skin giveaway! We want to please our players and give them the opportunity to purchase new and beautiful skins for the game Rust.</p><p> ☃️ This giveaway will feature over 15 skins that will appeal to both new and experienced players. You can find all the information about the giveaway and the terms of participation in our Discord community.</p><p> ☃️ Join us on Discord at the link below and participate in our big skin giveaway. You have a chance to win and get new beautiful skins for your character in Rust!</p><br/><p> Link to our Discord: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ug2rd6Gen4\">https://discord.gg/ug2rd6Gen4</a></p>'),
(11813, 'en-US', 'New Rust Skins: Unique Features for Your Game'),
(11814, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins for the game Rust: unique features and visual changes that will make your gaming experience even brighter and more interesting.'),
(11815, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust, game, features, gameplay, economy'),
(11816, 'en-US', '<p>A new batch of skins for the game Rust has been released, which will exceed all your expectations! Now your game will become even more exciting and diverse.</p><br/><p> New skins will give your characters and items in the game Rust an original and stylish look. Now you can stand out from other players and create a unique image.</p><br/><p> Browse the catalog of new skins to find the ones that suit you. A huge selection of different styles and themes will allow each player to find something to their taste.</p><br/><p> But it\'s not just the visual benefits that make the new skins so appealing. Many of them also have additional effects and special abilities that will improve your gameplay and help you achieve greater success.</p><br/><p> However, do not forget that skins can affect the gameplay and economy of the game. Some of them can be more valuable and rare, which can affect the prices and demand for them.</p><br/><p> Therefore, before purchasing new skins, it is important to do a proper analysis and choose those that suit your needs and preferences, as well as consider the possible impact on the game economy.</p><br/><p> So don\'t miss the opportunity to update your game with new skins! Unique features and visual changes will make the gaming experience even brighter and more interesting.</p>'),
(11817, 'en-US', 'Another giveaway from EGS, hurry up and grab it'),
(11818, 'en-US', 'Don\'t miss out on the new free game giveaway from the Epic Games Store! In this article, you\'ll find all the details and tips you need to grab your games in time.'),
(11819, 'en-US', 'EGS, giveaway, free games, opportunity, Epic Games Store'),
(11820, 'en-US', 'You can\'t miss out on a new opportunity from the Epic Games Store! This time they are having another free game giveaway, and you should hurry up so as not to miss your chance! In this article, we will tell you about all the details and important aspects of this giveaway, so you know what to expect and how to get your games correctly. Such promotions from EGS are always a big hit, so don\'t miss out on your opportunity and hurry to get your games!'),
(11821, 'en-US', 'RUST in real life'),
(11822, 'en-US', 'In this article, we dive into the world of Rust and show you an amazing Arctic Hazmat cosplay that brings the spirit of the game to life. Learn about the process of creating the cosplay, its details and challenges, and how Rust inspired the cosplayer. A must-read for fans of the game and cosplay!'),
(11823, 'en-US', 'RUST in real life, Arctic Hazmat cosplay, Rust game, Rust world, cosplayer, costume details, play of light and shadow, cosplay creation process, materials and accessories, inspiration, game fans, impressive cosplay'),
(11824, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we will dive into the exciting world of Rust and explore the amazing world of cosplay. We present to you one of the most realistic Rust cosplays - Arctic Hazmat.</p><br/><br/><p> Cosplay is the art of transforming yourself into one of the characters from popular games or movies. And what better choice for cosplay than the atmospheric world of Rust?</p><br/><br/><p> Arctic Hazmat is a professional cosplayer who was able to bring to life a brutal and gloomy character from the game Rust. Every detail of his costume, every accessory is well thought out and made with love for detail. When you see his appearance, you will believe that you have been transported into the game itself.</p><br/><br/><p> The game Rust, which has captivated millions of players around the world, is famous for its unique atmospheric world of survival after the apocalypse. Arctic Hazmat was able to convey the spirit of this world in his cosplay. From the incredible elaboration of details to the simply stunning play of light and shadow - everything about his costume is amazing.</p><br/><br/><p> In this article, we will tell you about the process of creating Arctic Hazmat\'s cosplay and how he was able to embody the spirit of the game Rust in real life. You will learn about the difficulties he faced, how the materials and accessories were selected. Arctic Hazmat will also talk about his love for the game and how it inspired him to create this amazing cosplay.</p><br/><br/><p> If you are a fan of the game Rust or interested in cosplay, then this article is definitely for you. From the details of the costume creation to its full presentation, you will learn everything about Arctic Hazmat cosplay and its magnificence.</p>'),
(11825, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has been released in the game Rust on Steam, which will add uniqueness and originality to your character and base.'),
(11826, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, Steam, game, players, updates'),
(11827, 'en-US', '<p>A new batch of skins has been released in the game Rust on Steam, which will please all players!</p><br/><p> Every time the developers release new skins, the game gets a new look and becomes even more interesting. New skins give the players\' images uniqueness and originality.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes a variety of items for characters and bases. Players will be able to give their character an individual look, make their base stand out from the rest, and show off their style in the game.</p><br/><p> Skins can be either cosmetic, changing the appearance of a character or item, or functional, adding new features or improvements.</p><br/><p> The game Rust always pleases players with new skins, so follow the updates and do not miss the opportunity to improve your gameplay and stand out from other players!</p>'),
(11828, 'en-US', 'Find out about the most anticipated upcoming skins (contenders) from the Rust Workshop. Consider the factors that influence skin selection and the importance of the community\'s voice.'),
(11829, 'en-US', 'new, skins, challengers, workshop, developers, balancing, economy, community voice'),
(11830, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the exciting world of skins in the game Rust! In this article, we want to share with you the latest news and trends related to future skins in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Future skins, or contenders as they are also called, are a topic of great interest for passionate Rust fans. Each developer has the opportunity to offer their own unique skin for weapons, items, or even a base.</p><br/><br/><p> In this article, we will look at the most interesting and anticipated new items of future skins from the workshop. You will learn about the latest trends and the most popular contenders that are already gaining momentum in the community.</p><br/><br/><p> What factors do developers consider when choosing skins for future updates? We\'ll dive deeper into the tradeoffs and balancing of different styles and themes to create the best user experience.</p><br/><br/><p> Not only does the appearance of the skin matter, but also its impact on the game balance and economy. We will look at such important aspects as unique skin abilities, limited editions and the impact on market prices.</p><br/><br/><p> We will also talk about the importance of taking into account the preferences and opinions of users when making decisions about adding skins to the game. Your voice matters, and the influence of the community on the choice of skins should not be underestimated.</p><br/><br/><p> Finally, please note that the new skins presented in this article are candidates and may be changed or rejected by the developers. However, this is a fascinating journey into the world of creativity and innovation, which we are happy to share with you.</p><br/><br/><p> Get ready for some exciting reading about the latest skins coming from the Rust Workshop!</p>'),
(11831, 'en-US', 'RT Cosmo: Virtual Journey to the Baikonur Cosmodrome'),
(11832, 'en-US', 'Dive into the exciting world of RT cosmo and go on a virtual journey to the legendary Baikonur Cosmodrome. Explore its secrets, overcome difficulties and feel like a real astronaut!'),
(11833, 'en-US', 'RT Cosmo, Baikonur Cosmodrome, virtual travel, game, space adventures, history, space industry'),
(11834, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the exciting world of RT Cosmo, a game based on the real Soviet space facility \"Baikonur Cosmodrome\".</p><br/><p> Imagine yourself in the place of an astronaut and go on exciting space adventures on the high-tech RT cosmo platform.</p><br/><p> Get ready for exciting flights and learn more about the facts and history associated with the legendary Baikonur Cosmodrome. Explore its secrets and discover amazing places and objects.</p><br/><p> We offer you the opportunity to penetrate into the Soviet era and become part of the history of the space industry. Feel the atmosphere of a real space flight and overcome the difficulties faced by astronauts.</p><br/><p> RT Cosmo is a unique combination of reality and virtuality that allows you to fully immerse yourself in the world of space exploration.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to go on a virtual trip to the Baikonur Cosmodrome and feel like a real astronaut!</p>'),
(11835, 'en-US', 'New items of future New Year skins (candidates) from the workshop of ch'),
(11836, 'en-US', 'Check out the most anticipated Rust New Year skins coming to the workshop soon. A variety of designs and styles await you!'),
(11837, 'en-US', 'new items, new year skins, workshop, Rust, design, trends'),
(11838, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the most interesting and anticipated New Year skins that will soon appear in the Rust game workshop. We will tell you in detail about each skin, as well as provide information about the planned release time and cost. You will be interested to know about the variety of designs and styles that the developers offer for your character during the New Year season. From classic winter themes to fantastic fairy tale characters, you will be able to find a skin that suits you. Read the article to learn about the latest news and stay up to date with the latest trends in the Rust game!'),
(11839, 'en-US', 'The Christmas update is out'),
(11840, 'en-US', 'The Christmas update has been released in the game Rust on Steam! The battle for holiday gifts, a gift calendar and new winter locations are waiting for players. Join the festive atmosphere and enjoy the new content!'),
(11841, 'en-US', 'Christmas update, Rust, Steam, game, content, gingerbread, lootboxes, holidays, western camp, fishing villages, scientists outpost'),
(11842, 'en-US', '<p>The long-awaited Christmas update has been released in the game Rust on Steam! Now players will be able to immerse themselves in the festive atmosphere and enjoy new content.</p><p> One of the main innovations is the giant gingerbread men who will guard the holiday loot boxes in giant tunnels of sweets. Armed with ice clubs and machine guns, they will not spare any player. A real battle for holiday gifts awaits you! Don\'t forget that the event will last until January 5, so join us immediately and don\'t miss your chance.</p><p> In addition to new content, the developers have prepared other surprises for players. You will find a classic gift calendar that will delight you with fresh surprises every day. Also, a snowy version of the bandit camp, fishing villages and the outpost of scientists will be waiting for you. Immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the winter holiday and enjoy the new game locations.</p><p> Don\'t miss your chance to plunge into a winter fairy tale with the game Rust! We wish you a successful game and pleasant holidays!</p><br/> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NDW-ZykUXUQ\">Link to the update trailer</a>'),
(11843, 'en-US', 'New skins in the game Rust: expand your collection with a new batch!'),
(11844, 'en-US', 'Expand your collection of unique skins in the game Rust with a new batch! Find out how new skins allow you to stand out on the battlefield, earn additional income and customize the appearance of your character and in-game items.'),
(11845, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, new skins, skin batch, customization, player personality, skin sales, skin exchange, extra income, gaming experience'),
(11846, 'en-US', 'Great news for all Rust players! A fresh batch of skins has just hit the Steam store. These new skins offer unique and stylish ways to customize the appearance of your character and in-game items. Don\'t miss out on this opportunity to add to your collection of unique items and stand out on the battlefield!<br/><br/> This fresh batch of skins features a wide variety of designs for your character, weapons, armor, and other in-game items. From icy and rocky skins to bright and colorful designs, there\'s something for every player, no matter their preference or playstyle.<br/><br/> One of the great benefits of the new Rust skins is the opportunity to stand out on the battlefield and show your individuality. New skins will also be presented with other players, so you can surprise them with your unique and stylish appearance. Be noticed and admired with your unrivaled skins!<br/><br/> Additionally, selling and trading Rust skins can also be a great way to make money for you. If you have extra skins that you don’t use, you can always sell them on the Steam Marketplace and earn some extra income. Or you can trade skins with other players and diversify your collection that way.<br/><br/> Please remember that purchasing skins is an optional feature of the game and does not affect the gameplay. It is simply an additional option to customize the appearance and personalize your gaming experience.<br/><br/> So don\'t miss the chance to expand your Rust skin collection with the new batch available now! Your character and in-game items have never looked so stylish and unique!'),
(11847, 'en-US', 'Christmas is coming to Rust this Thursday!'),
(11848, 'en-US', 'Good news for Rust players! Christmas is coming, and this Thursday the holiday comes to the game world with new features and events: Advent calendar, Christmas caves, decorations for the base and peaceful locations, Flying Santa and much more. And also the announcement of the winter DLC with the throne, MVC mask and chestplate. Get ready for an exciting Christmas festival in Rust!'),
(11849, 'en-US', 'Christmas, Rust, Advent calendar, event, caves, decorations, Flying Santa, DLC');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(11850, 'en-US', 'With the long-awaited Christmas holiday approaching, Rust players will be able to enjoy many new and exciting opportunities! The game administration has announced the launch of a special Christmas event, which will take place this Thursday, decorating the game world with holiday attributes and surprises.<br/><br/> Here are some of the new features and events that players can look forward to:<br/> - Advent calendar, which will surprise players every day with new gifts and bonuses.<br/> - Magical Christmas caves filled with interesting puzzles and treasures.<br/> - Updated range of decorations for the base - adding new and old elements to create a Christmas atmosphere.<br/> - Decorating peaceful locations with festive decorations so that players can enjoy the festive atmosphere everywhere.<br/> - Flying Santa Skin - a new feature of the event that allows players to see the Christmas Santa in flight and receive special gifts from him.<br/><br/> And this is only a small part of what awaits players in the upcoming Christmas event in Rust!<br/><br/> Additionally, a winter DLC was announced to be coming soon. It will include items such as the throne, MVC mask, and chest plate. This will be a great way to add exclusive items to your collection and highlight your individuality in the game.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to dive into the festive atmosphere of Rust and enjoy new features this Thursday! Organize your own Christmas festival in the game and get a lot of unforgettable impressions!'),
(11851, 'en-US', 'New items of future New Year skins from the workshop'),
(11852, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new upcoming New Year skins from the workshop in the game Rust. Stay up to date with the latest updates and get unique skins for your character!'),
(11853, 'en-US', 'new year skins, workshop ch, game Rust, news, updates'),
(11854, 'en-US', '<p>On the eve of the new year, the developers of the game Rust on Steam present exclusive New Year skins, which have become a real feature for many players. Workshop ch, promises a huge number of interesting skins, ready to decorate your game collection.</p><br/><p> We are pleased to share with you the first part of the list of New Year\'s skin candidates that will surely attract your attention. In this article, we will consider the most relevant and original new items that you will be able to get in the near future.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Snowman: This skin will transform your character into a defense against the cold winter. The snowy obscurantist simply won’t be able to resist your new look.</li><br/><li> Christmas Reindeer: With this skin, your ride through the game world will become even more festive. The Olympic Reindeer disappears into the shadow of your new pet!</li><br/><li> Ice Armor: Protect yourself from enemy attacks by dressing up in this protective skin. Ice will be your weapon of choice in any fight.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to purchase these and other New Year skins for your character. Subscribe to the workshop news to stay up to date with all upcoming updates. The coming year promises to be bright and unforgettable in the game Rust!</p>'),
(11855, 'en-US', 'Industrial progress'),
(11856, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest advancements in the industrial branch of Rust, including new equipment, a pipe wrench, and automation capabilities.'),
(11857, 'en-US', 'industrial progress, industrial work, new equipment, auto craft, electric furnace, pipe wrench, Aux2 branch, automation in Rust'),
(11858, 'en-US', 'Industrial progress continues!'),
(11859, 'en-US', 'Alistair according to the Midjourney neural network'),
(11860, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the opinion of the Midjourney neural network about the character Alistar in the game Rust and identify his key characteristics and features. Find out all about the features and strengths of Alistar with the help of the opinion of the Midjourney neural network!'),
(11861, 'en-US', 'Alistair, Midjourney neural network, Rust, character, review, game balance, game solutions'),
(11862, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will take a look at the Midjourney neural network\'s opinion on the character Alistar in the game Rust. The Midjourney neural network conducted an in-depth analysis and identified key characteristics and features of Alistar. Our review will help you better understand this character and determine his role in the gameplay. We will also discuss the trade-offs and problems associated with Alistar\'s game balance and consider its impact on player decision-making. Learn all about Alistar\'s quirks and strengths with the help of the Midjourney neural network\'s opinion!'),
(11863, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: The Latest Additions to Your Gear'),
(11864, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest additions to your Rust wardrobe - new skins that will add freshness and style to your gaming experience.'),
(11865, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, updates, wardrobe, visual effects'),
(11866, 'en-US', '<p>Get ready to update your wardrobe in the Game of Rust, as the long-awaited new batch of skins has been released!</p><br/><p> With a variety of styles and themes, these skins will add a fresh twist to your characters and in-game items. From bright and expressive designs to more classic and elegant options, you can choose exactly what suits your taste and playstyle.</p><br/><p> With new skins, you can stand out from other players and add uniqueness and individuality to your gaming experience. Don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection and bring a breath of fresh air to the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> New skins are available for a variety of items and weapons, allowing you to change the look of even the most mundane items. So get ready to wow your friends and opponents with unique visuals and style.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to stay tuned for updates and current offers to stay up to date with all the new skins coming to Rust. Your wardrobe will never be boring with these exciting additions.</p>'),
(11867, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest and greatest Rust Workshop contenders. Subscribe to our newsletter to stay up to date with all the latest updates.'),
(11868, 'en-US', 'news, skins, workshop, game Rust, adding skins'),
(11869, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of future skins for the game Rust! In this article, we will tell you about the newest and most exciting contenders that are currently in the workshop:556976065793228840.</p><br/><p> The Workshop is a unique community of ideas and talented artists from all over the world. They create new skins that can be added to the game Rust. And every contender for inclusion in the game ends up here, in the Workshop.</p><br/><p> What is a skin? A skin is an external design of an item in the game that you can put on your equipment or weapon. They have a unique style and can change the appearance of your character or item, making it more colorful, stylish or recognizable.</p><br/><p> Every day new contenders for adding to the game appear in the workshop. We follow all the events and select the most interesting and discussed skins to share with you.</p><br/><p> In our article, you will find descriptions and images of the most memorable skins that are waiting for their future in the game Rust. We will tell you what advantages and trade-offs are associated with each skin and how they can affect your game tactics and impressions.</p><br/><p> Subscribe to our news to stay up to date with all the updates and be the first to know about new skins in the game Rust! Together we will excitingly explore the world of future skins.</p>'),
(11870, 'en-US', 'New Year\'s Mines (video)'),
(11871, 'en-US', 'Learn about the New Year\'s mines in the game Rust and prepare for exciting adventures. Watch the video and learn about the resources and rewards that await you along the way!'),
(11872, 'en-US', 'new year mines, video, Rust, New Year, resources, adventures'),
(11873, 'en-US', 'With the start of the New Year, Rust has introduced New Year\'s mines, which promise players a lot of exciting content. In this video, we will take a closer look at what awaits you in these mines and what events you can expect. We will find out what resources can be mined, what obstacles to overcome and what rewards await us on the way to the cherished goal. Watch our video and go in search of adventures in the New Year\'s mines with the team from Rust!'),
(11874, 'en-US', 'First screenshots of the New Year update'),
(11875, 'en-US', 'Find out the first details and see screenshots of the New Year update in the game Rust! Immerse yourself in the festive atmosphere and get ready for exciting adventures!'),
(11876, 'en-US', 'Rust, New Year update, screenshots, news, holiday'),
(11877, 'en-US', '<p>Greetings, dear Rust players! The most wonderful time of the year has already arrived, and our developers have prepared something special for you - a New Year update that will not leave anyone indifferent! Today we are pleased to present you with the first screenshots of this exciting update. Are you ready to plunge into the festive atmosphere?</p><br/><p> As you already know, the Rust development team always tries to please players with new huge updates, and the upcoming New Year is no exception! Hundreds of hours have been spent on creating amazing new content, features and improvements for you.</p><br/><p> So, what exactly awaits us in this New Year update? Already on the first screenshots we can see a stunningly beautiful snow-covered map, covered with a soft white blanket. Every detail and landscape conveys the atmosphere of the holiday and magic.</p><br/><p> New Year\'s decorations and glowing lights create a unique holiday atmosphere. Walking around the server, you will surely come across a huge Christmas tree decorated with colorful lights and toys. This updated world will make you feel like a real hero of a New Year\'s story!</p><br/><p> However, the New Year update in Rust is not only about external changes. The developers also worked on the gameplay system to make it even more interesting. Expect new items, tasks and events that will allow you to plunge into exciting adventures and challenges.</p><br/><p> So, dear players, it\'s time to celebrate the New Year with Rust! Follow our news to stay up to date with all the updates and events that await you during this exciting period. In the meantime, enjoy the first screenshots of the New Year update and get ready for unforgettable adventures!</p>'),
(11878, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust – variety and opportunities for players'),
(11879, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has appeared in the world of Rust, which promises to bring more variety and opportunities for players. Update your collection and stand out from other players with new unique designs and effects.'),
(11880, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game, variety, possibilities, unique designs, individuality, atmosphere, effects, animation, store, in-game currency, real money, limited quantity, time, collection update'),
(11881, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has arrived in the world of Rust, promising to bring more variety and new options for players. Now you can paint your in-game items in unique colors and styles to stand out from other players and give your items your own style.<br/><br/> The new skins offer a wide range of designs, from bright and colorful to darker and more realistic ones. You will be able to change the appearance of your weapons, armor, buildings and other items in the game to create a unique look and express your individuality.<br/><br/> In addition, the new batch of skins also offers unique effects and animations that will add extra atmosphere and attention to your items. For example, you can add glowing elements, explosion effects, animations when used, and much more.<br/><br/> New skins are available in the game store, where you can purchase them with in-game currency or real money. But don\'t miss your chance, as some skins may only be available in limited quantities or at a certain time.<br/><br/> Check out the Rust game store and update your skin collection right now! There are many new and exciting designs that will allow you to stand out from other players, make the game even more interesting and visually appealing.'),
(11882, 'en-US', 'New future skins (candidates) from the workshop part 2'),
(11883, 'en-US', 'This article covers the latest skins from the workshop that may be added to the game Rust. Find out about the most relevant and discussed offers from players.'),
(11884, 'en-US', 'new skins, workshop, Rust, game items, developers'),
(11885, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we will look at the latest skins that are potential candidates for inclusion in the game Rust. Skins are various visual changes that can be applied to items and characters in the game.</p><br/><p> The Workshop is a platform where players can share their creative works and suggest skins for in-game items. The game developers regularly review the Workshop to select the most interesting and suitable skins to include in the game.</p><br/><p> In this part of the article, we will present you with the newest skins that are currently under consideration by the developers. You will be able to learn about the most relevant and discussed offers from players.</p><br/><p> Please note that these skins are candidates for inclusion in the game, but the final decision on inclusion is made by the development team, and some skins may not make it through the selection.</p><br/><p> Subscribe to our news to stay up to date with the latest updates and be the first to know what skins will be added to the Rust game!</p>'),
(11886, 'en-US', 'Global Wipe in Rust: Update on Steam Platform'),
(11887, 'en-US', 'Learn about the global wipe in the game Rust on the Steam platform. In this update, you will find many innovations and improvements that will allow you to fully enjoy the gameplay and create unique buildings and structures.'),
(11888, 'en-US', 'Global wipe, update, Rust, Steam, changes, improvements, gameplay, buildings, constructions'),
(11889, 'en-US', 'Global wipe will be this Thursday, December 1st, 22:00 Moscow time<br/><br/> What awaits us in the update:<br/> -Increased the durability of the MVC doors from 800hp to 1000hp.<br/> - You won\'t need a mallet to remove the garage door, and the HP won\'t be lost when removing it.<br/> -Roofs can be rotated during construction using the R button<br/> -Large walls and gates can be rotated 90 degrees.<br/> -Increase the value of the house maintenance counter.<br/> -Removed durability from most electrical items (to make stacking more convenient)<br/> -The air defense system now has an electrical output for serial connection.<br/> -Adding new wire colors (White, Purple, Pink, Orange, Blue)<br/> -Mvk ore stack reduced to 100 units<br/> -You can install a code lock on your car.<br/> - now mp5 and LR have a burst fire mode.<br/> -Reduced the chance of scientists spawning on roads<br/> -A casino car has been added to the peaceful city.<br/> -Reducing the number of laboratories from 3 to 1.<br/> -Cargo spawn frequency has been reduced.<br/> - now small quarries can operate on diesel fuel.<br/><br/> Thanks for the news https://vk.com/rustcommru'),
(11890, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest new upcoming skins for the game Rust from the workshop :556976065793228840:. Original designs from talented artists are waiting for their time to decorate your items in the game.'),
(11891, 'en-US', 'new items, skins, workshop, design, game Rust'),
(11892, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, dear Rust players! Today we will tell you about the latest new items of future skins, which are still in the stage of candidates in the official workshop :556976065793228840:.</p><br/><p> Here you can check out some amazing designs that are waiting to enter the game and decorate your items. Exciting weapons, spectacular clothes and unique decorative elements - you can find all this in this selection of future skins.</p><br/><p> The Rust Steam Workshop provides talented artists and designers with the opportunity to share their creative ideas by creating unique skins for game items. The workshop collects the most interesting and promising works that can become new skins in the game.</p><br/><p> By reading this article, you will be able to get an idea of which skins are original and high-quality, as well as learn more about the artists behind these works.</p><br/><p> Stay up to date with the latest workshop news :556976065793228840: and be the first to know about future skins for the game Rust.</p>'),
(11893, 'en-US', 'Green shotgun shells have been weakened'),
(11894, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update that nerfed green shotgun ammo in Rust on Steam. This change may impact the game\'s meta and require a rethink of your strategy.'),
(11895, 'en-US', 'Green Ammo, Shotgun, Update, Gameplay, Rust, Steam'),
(11896, 'en-US', '<p>Recently, the developers of the game Rust on Steam released an update that affected green shotgun shells.</p><br/><p> It has now been revealed that these rounds deal 50% less damage at ranges over 40 meters and when fired at ranges over 80 meters.</p><br/><p> This change has a direct impact on the game\'s shotgun meta, and some players may need to rethink their strategy.</p><br/><p> This change may have been introduced by the developers to provide more balanced gameplay and fix issues with green ammo dealing too much damage at long range.</p><br/><p> We can only hope that these changes will help create a more interesting and fair experience for all Rust players on Steam.</p>'),
(11897, 'en-US', 'The popular game Rust has a new batch of skins that will allow players to enjoy a more varied and personalized gaming experience. Find out about the benefits of the new skins, their impact on gameplay, and the opportunities for self-expression in the article.'),
(11898, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, new skins, variety, gaming experience, individuality, gameplay balance'),
(11899, 'en-US', '<p>The popular game Rust has a new batch of skins that will allow players to enjoy a more varied and customized gaming experience. These new skins are unique cosmetic elements for various items in the game, such as weapons, tools, clothing items, and buildings.</p><br/><p> The appearance of new skins is one of many updates that the game developers constantly offer to their players. Such updates contribute to the variety and aesthetic pleasure of the gameplay, allowing each player to express their individuality and style.</p><br/><p> New skins can change the appearance of weapons and add interesting details to them that will highlight their uniqueness. They can also transform ordinary clothing items into stylish and fashionable elements that will highlight the individuality of the player\'s character.</p><br/><p> In addition to improving the appearance, new skins can also have practical benefits. For example, a skin for a weapon can improve its stats and increase its effectiveness in combat. This can be a key factor influencing a player\'s strategy and success in the game.</p><br/><p> However, when it comes to new skins, there are also issues related to gameplay balancing that need to be taken into account. Some skins may be more attractive and in demand, which may lead to the need to balance their cost or availability. Game developers must ensure fairness and equal opportunities for all players.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that the new skins are available to all Rust players on Steam. They can be purchased through the Steam store or obtained in the game through the rewards and achievements system. Thus, each player can decide for themselves which skins are interesting to them and whether they are worth spending time and resources on.</p><br/><p> Ultimately, the new batch of skins in the Rust game is an opportunity for players to get a new gaming experience, express their individuality and create a unique style. They bring additional variety and significance to the gameplay, and each player can find skins that match their taste and preferences.</p>'),
(11900, 'en-US', 'Rust: Diesel fuel will spawn on all large mouths'),
(11901, 'en-US', 'Rust has seen changes to how diesel fuel spawns at major radio points, opening up new possibilities and strategies for players.'),
(11902, 'en-US', 'Rust, diesel fuel, spawn, large radio points, gameplay changes'),
(11903, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust has undergone changes to diesel fuel spawning, which will undoubtedly affect the gameplay. Now diesel fuel will spawn at almost all large radiotechnical points (large RT).</p><br/><p> This is a major change that could provide players with new options and strategies when using diesel fuel. It will now be much easier to find, allowing you to use your vehicles more efficiently and enjoy all the benefits they can provide.</p><br/><p> The TNK stations, which until now had been used for communication with quarries and pumping stations, were decided to be replaced with diesel fuel. This opens up new opportunities for players and promises interesting changes in the Rust game world.</p>'),
(11904, 'en-US', 'Now you can install a combination lock on your car'),
(11905, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam has added a new feature - a code lock for cars. Now players can set personal pin codes on their cars and protect them from theft.'),
(11906, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, update, code lock, car, security, game world'),
(11907, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest update to the game Rust on Steam, users have received the long-awaited ability to install a combination lock on their machines.</p><br/><p> The game developers decided to add this feature to improve the safety of cars inside the game world. Now players will be able to block access to their vehicles and prevent theft.</p><br/><p> A combination lock allows you to set a personal pin code that must be entered to open the car. This ensures that only the owner of the car can access it.</p><br/><p> Setting up a code lock is very simple. Just go to the car, enter the desired PIN code and it will be installed immediately. The code can be changed at any time through the car control menu.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that this functionality is only available for cars purchased in the game store. For existing cars, users will be able to install a combination lock using a special tool that can also be purchased in the game store.</p><br/><p> The update received positive feedback from players, who expressed their satisfaction with the ability to provide additional security for their vehicles. This significantly increased the interest in using vehicles in the game and added new opportunities for gameplay.</p><br/><p> If you want to try out the new car code lock feature, the update is now available on Steam. Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to secure your vehicle in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(11908, 'en-US', 'Steam Autumn Sale - 33% off Rust and DLC'),
(11909, 'en-US', 'Buy Rust and its DLC during the Steam Autumn Sale with a 33% discount. Don\'t miss the opportunity to plunge into the world of survival, battles and adventures on a devastated island.'),
(11910, 'en-US', 'Steam Autumn Sale, 33% Off, Rust Game, DLC, Survival, Island, Resources, Adventure'),
(11911, 'en-US', 'Great news awaits you! The Autumn Sale on the Steam platform has started, and now you can buy the game Rust and all add-ons with an incredible discount of 33%! This is a great opportunity for all fans of the game and those who have long dreamed of trying their hand at this exciting world of survival.'),
(11912, 'en-US', 'More changes are coming to the test branch'),
(11913, 'en-US', 'A new update is about to be released on the test branch of the Rust game, which will bring even more changes and improvements. In this article, we will look at the main changes that players can expect.'),
(11914, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, test branch, changes, garage door, loot, game, boat, server admins'),
(11915, 'en-US', 'More changes are coming to the test branch:<br/> • Large walls and gates now rotate 90 degrees instead of 180 when pressing R<br/> • The garage door can now be removed without a mallet in hand, but it will still need to be opened and the lock removed before this can be done (this was done for consistency with other doors that already worked on this principle)<br/> • More changes to patrol helicopter loot:<br/> — The MLRS rocket no longer spawns separately from everything else in the crate. Instead, it will now have a chance to spawn with other rockets<br/> — Removed the chance that the crate will only drop primitive weapon attachments<br/> — Reduced chance of primitive weapons dropping<br/> • The game will now notify you if you try to build or place something on someone else\'s property where you don\'t have authorization in the cabinet<br/> • The boat now automatically disembarks all players if it is capsized<br/> • Fixed a bug where a player\'s nickname was not displayed if he was wearing a nomad suit/arctic suit/snowman helmet or pumpkin<br/> • (for server admins) Now if a player complains about offensive content on the server, all nearby players within a radius of 25 meters are also automatically included in the complaint (for simplified search of the authors of the content that was complained about)'),
(11916, 'en-US', 'Alistair Confirms Plans to Add Character Swapping to Rust'),
(11917, 'en-US', 'The Rust team is planning to add character switching. Learn about the plans and trade-offs involved in this change, and decide if you\'re ready to change your character for a new adventure in Rust.'),
(11918, 'en-US', 'Alistair, character change, Rust, features, developers, balance, gaming experience'),
(11919, 'en-US', 'The Rust development team intends to make changes by adding the ability to change characters. The long-awaited news was officially confirmed by Alistair, one of the main developers of the project.<br/><br/> The uniqueness of each character is one of the key features of the Rust game. However, many players have long expressed a desire to be able to change their character and create a new image. The development team responded to this request and promises to add a character change function in the near future.<br/><br/> According to Alistair, this change will allow players to bring freshness to the gameplay by providing the opportunity to create and bring to life new characters with unique traits and features. This could be a new chance for those who want to change their playstyle or experiment with different strategies in Rust.<br/><br/> However, adding the ability to change characters can cause some trade-offs and problems. The ability to change characters can lead to reduced engagement and a quicker loss of interest in one character. It can also affect the balance of the game if players change characters indefinitely during the game.<br/><br/> Therefore, Rust developers must take into account various factors and ensure a balance between the freedom of creativity of players and preserving the value of the uniqueness of each character. It is important to find the optimal solution that will satisfy the needs of players and preserve the integrity of the Rust gaming experience.<br/><br/> So, soon we will be able to enjoy the ability to change our characters in Rust. Perhaps this will be a new round of development of the game, which will bring fresh emotions and opportunities for all players. Are you ready to change your character and start a new adventure in Rust?'),
(11920, 'en-US', 'The update sets new standards: The strength of armored doors has been increased!'),
(11921, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update increases the durability of the armored door, giving your base even more protection. Find out how this change will affect your game strategies and how to use it to your advantage.'),
(11922, 'en-US', 'Rust update, armored door durability, durability increase, base security, Rust game'),
(11923, 'en-US', '<p>Big news for all Rust players: a storm of changes is coming! The developers decided to increase the strength of the armored door in single and double versions. This will allow you to make your own tangible changes to the game world, protecting your resources and base with even greater reliability and confidence.</p><br/><p> As you may have noticed, in previous versions of the game, the armored door had 800 health. But now, thanks to the update, it will become even stronger - as much as 1000 health, which gives your base much more protection.</p><br/><p> Now your enemies have to work much harder to get into your home. This gives you the freedom to focus on other important aspects of the game, such as exploration and upgrading your weapons, without having to worry about the safety of your home.</p><br/><p> The update that increases the durability of the armored door will be released on December 6. Become invincible in the game Rust and fight your enemies knowing that your base is well protected!</p>'),
(11924, 'en-US', 'Bushes prevent scientists from seeing garbage heaps'),
(11925, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam has introduced changes that block scientists\' vision near trash heaps, creating new challenges in gameplay.'),
(11926, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, bushes, garbage heaps, scientists, gameplay, realism, tactics, adaptation'),
(11927, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam has brought changes that significantly impact gameplay. Bushes near trash heaps now block scientists\' view, making exploration and finding valuable resources even more difficult.<br/><br/> This innovation has caused controversy among players, dividing them into two camps. Some believe that the addition of obstacles in the form of bushes increases the difficulty of the game and creates a realistic atmosphere of survival. After all, in real life, the surrounding vegetation can limit the view and access to objects. Other players complain about the innovation, considering it to be unnecessarily complicated gameplay and depriving flexibility in carrying out research.<br/><br/> Balancing realism and player convenience is always a difficult task for game developers. In this case, the creators of Rust decided to give more weight to realism and add natural obstacles to the game world that players have to consider and overcome. However, it should be noted that the compromise solution was to add the ability to temporarily remove bushes to improve visibility.<br/><br/> In turn, players now have to take into account the presence of bushes when choosing a place to build a base or when planning exploration routes. Bushes become not only an obstacle to visibility, but also an element of tactics in the game.<br/><br/> Of course, this change affects the gameplay and requires players to adapt and come up with new strategies. It also opens up opportunities for various explorations and experiments in creating their own obstacles or ways to bypass them.<br/><br/> So, the innovation with bushes near garbage heaps in the game Rust causes discussions and requires players to change their approaches and tactics. However, it gives the game more realism and causes the need for creative thinking and adaptation in survival.'),
(11928, 'en-US', 'Developers are preparing a global update - What\'s new in Rust?'),
(11929, 'en-US', 'Discover the most exciting innovations that await players in the upcoming global update of the Rust game. Learn about new features, weapon and resource balancing, as well as an improved communication system. Get ready for new challenges and dive into exciting adventures today!'),
(11930, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, innovations, gameplay, survival'),
(11931, 'en-US', '<p>Fans of the game Rust can expect an upcoming global update that the developers are preparing. In the new article, we will tell you about the most interesting innovations that await players in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> There are a ton of new features coming that will bring a fresh breath of fresh air to the gameplay. From long-awaited weapon and tool balancing to new social and resource features, let\'s take a quick look at the major changes.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Improved crafting system: the developers promise to add many new recipes and opportunities for creating various items. This will open up new ways to survive and develop in the world of Rust.</li><br/><li> Updated weapons: gamers will be able to evaluate new types of weapons and use them in battles for survival. Weapon balancing will allow for more fair battles between players and bring variety to battle tactics.</li><br/><li> Unique resources: the update will introduce new types of resources that will be needed to create new items and build. Explore the world and mine rare materials to be one step ahead of your rivals.</li><br/><li> Improved communication system: Players will have new communication options, making the gameplay more social and interactive. Now you will be able to organize game alliances and cooperate with other players more easily.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> This is just a small part of what the developers are preparing for the upcoming update of the game Rust. Follow the latest news to stay up to date with all the changes and prepare for new challenges that will come your way of survival.</p><br/><p> Don\'t waste time, get ready for the upcoming update and meet new adventures in the world of Rust today!</p>'),
(11932, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins'),
(11933, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam pleases fans with a new batch of skins. Find out how to update the appearance of items, increase their effectiveness and make money by selling rare skins.'),
(11934, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust game on Steam, item appearance update, improved characteristics, financial opportunities, uniqueness and individuality'),
(11935, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam pleases its fans again - a new batch of skins has been released! This means that players now have the opportunity to update the appearance of their items and make them truly unique.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins features a variety of options for weapons, tools, clothing and other items. Here everyone will find something that they like. Regardless of whether you prefer stylish and dark skins or bright and eccentric ones - the new batch of Rust skins has everything to satisfy the most sophisticated tastes.</p><br/><p> One of the main features of the new batch of skins is their diversity. The developers took into account all possible preferences of players and offered a large number of skins of different themes and stylistic design. You will be able to choose the perfect skin for each item so that it reflects your personality and style of play.</p><br/><p> In addition, the new batch of skins in the game Rust has practical value. Some skins not only change the appearance of the item, but also have improved characteristics. For example, a skin for a weapon can increase its accuracy or damage, and a skin for a tool can speed up the speed of work. Thus, by choosing new skins, you can not only change the appearance of items, but also increase their effectiveness in the game.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget about the financial side of the issue. New skins can be a good source of additional income for players. If you have rare and attractive skins, you can sell them to other players and get real money. This is a great opportunity not only to get rich, but also to share your values with other fans of the game.</p><br/><p> Thus, the new batch of skins in the game Rust is a real gift for all players. It allows you to realize your creative and experimental ideas, give items individuality and increase the effectiveness of the game. Do not miss the chance to update your collection of skins and make the game even more exciting!</p>'),
(11936, 'en-US', 'Rust Weapon Model Updates'),
(11937, 'en-US', 'As part of Hack Week, Rust has reworked the models for weapon modifications. The new models look better and better maintained. This is experimental content that may make it into the game in the future.'),
(11938, 'en-US', 'updates, models, weapons, Rust, Hack Week, experimental content'),
(11939, 'en-US', '<p>As part of Hack Week within the Rust studio, one of the modelers, Thomas Butters, decided to take on the task of reworking the models for weapon mods.</p><br/><p> The new models look much better and more polished compared to what was previously seen in the game.</p><br/><p> Hack Week is a free week given to Rust developers, during which they have the opportunity to work on any projects they want. This could be learning new tools or creating content that they personally want to see in the game.</p><br/><p> The content created during Hack Week is experimental, and some ideas generated during this period may make it into the game in the future, but this is not guaranteed. However, it is possible that some of these ideas will be implemented in future updates of the game.</p>'),
(11940, 'en-US', 'Rust Developer Working on Airship: First Developments and Player Opportunities'),
(11941, 'en-US', 'One of the developers of the game Rust on Steam has started working on an airship and presented the first developments. Attaching balloons to the frame of a house and the ability to build walls without a foundation are new opportunities for players.'),
(11942, 'en-US', 'developer, Rust, airship, balloon, construction, hackerweek'),
(11943, 'en-US', 'One of the developers of the game Rust on Steam took on the creation of an amazing object - an airship. Recently, he demonstrated the first results of his work. It becomes possible to attach a balloon to the frame of a house, allowing it to take off and float in the air.<br/> In addition, the developer has added a new feature - the ability to install walls directly on the floor, without the need to build a foundation. This greatly simplifies the construction process and gives more options for creativity to players.<br/> It is important to note that these innovations are being implemented as part of the \"hacker week\" organized by the Rust development team. During this week, each developer is given the freedom to implement their boldest ideas, but not all of them will make it into the official version of the game.'),
(11944, 'en-US', 'Rust Server Update: Happy Wipe Everyone'),
(11945, 'en-US', 'Rust server update is out! Gameplay improvements, new features, and survival options. Details and trailer in the article.'),
(11946, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, servers, wipe, survival, new features, gameplay'),
(11947, 'en-US', '<p>The long-awaited server update has been released in the game Rust. This means that players will receive new features and functions that will make the gameplay even more exciting. It\'s time for a new wipe, where all players start the game from scratch and compete for survival. :Gunnn:</p><br/><p> The Rust server update is an opportunity for every player to test themselves and show their survival skills. New features and bug fixes will make the gameplay more balanced and exciting. So get ready for new challenges, improve your base, fight with other players and become a leader on the server.</p><br/><p> The Rust server update may also bring new gameplay elements that will add variety to the game world. Be prepared for new features, resources, and weapons that will help you in your fight for survival.</p><br/><p> To check out the update details and get a guide on how to use the new features, you can watch the official trailer on YouTube:</p><br/><p> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GKT0TrAaxMo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GKT0TrAaxMo</a></p>'),
(11948, 'en-US', 'News: Charitable Rust 2022 - charity event starts on November 19'),
(11949, 'en-US', 'Find out about the Charitable Rust 2022 event starting November 19. Get exclusive Twitch Drops and check out new skins in Rust.'),
(11950, 'en-US', 'Charitable Rust 2022, charity event, starts November 19, Twitch Drops, skins'),
(11951, 'en-US', 'The next charity event Charitable Rust 2022 is starting! The start date is November 19. As in previous years, the organizers have prepared exclusive Twitch Drops that can be obtained by watching broadcasts. This is a great opportunity to support the charity fund and get unique items in the game Rust!<br/><br/> This year, we have new skins added specifically for the Charitable Rust event. Check out the list and choose your favorites to stand out in-game and support the charity initiative at the same time.'),
(11952, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest batch of skins that have been added to the game Rust. The article discusses the impact of skins on gameplay, the game\'s economy, and the importance of taking into account the opinion of the gaming community.'),
(11953, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, design, individuality, game economy, balancing, feedback, updates, news'),
(11954, 'en-US', '<p>Check out the latest batch of skins that have been added to Rust. New content is always something interesting and exciting, especially when it comes to skins. In this article, we will tell you about the latest and most exciting skins that are available in Rust on Steam.</p><br/><p> Skins are a way for players to change the appearance of their items and things in the game. Each batch of skins offers unique designs and styles, allowing players to customize their gaming experience and highlight their individuality.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes a wide range of items, from weapons and armor to clothing and buildings. This means that no matter what your preference in the game is, you will be able to find skins that will suit you.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that adding new skins to the Rust game not only brings aesthetic pleasure to players, but also has an impact on the in-game economy. Rare and popular skins can be expensive, which opens up new opportunities for players in the skin market and trading.</p><br/><p> However, with the addition of new skins comes some trade-offs. New skins can affect the balance of the game, for example, by giving some players an advantage in combat due to improved weapons or armor. Game developers must carefully balance new skins so as not to disrupt the game mechanics and not create unfairness among players.</p><br/><p> It is also important to consider the opinion of the community of players who can express their opinions on new skins and offer their ideas and suggestions. Developers should be attentive to player feedback and take into account their input in the process of creating new skins.</p><br/><p> In conclusion, the new batch of skins in Rust offers players the opportunity to express their creativity and individuality, creating a unique gaming experience. Skins also affect the game\'s economy and require balancing and taking into account the opinion of the gaming community. If you want to know more about the new skins in Rust, stay tuned and stay up to date with the latest updates and news!</p>'),
(11955, 'en-US', 'News on continuations of collections from the workshop'),
(11956, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll cover the latest news about the workshop collection sequels and how they\'ll impact gameplay. Find out about the latest updates, additions, skins, and visual effects in your favorite Rust game.'),
(11957, 'en-US', 'news, sequels, collections, workshop, updates, additions, skins, gameplay, Rust, decorations, players'),
(11958, 'en-US', '<p>In this article, we will look at the most current news about the continuations of the workshop collections. If you are a fan of various game collections, then you will be interested to know about the updates, additions and improvements that have appeared recently.</p><br/><p> The Steam Workshop offers a wide range of different collections created by players from all over the world. In it, you can find skins, artifacts, visual effects and much more that bring originality and variety to the gameplay. But, of course, it should be noted that most collections need regular updates and additions so that players can enjoy new items and opportunities.</p><br/><p> In recent months, the developers have been hard at work improving and expanding the workshop collections. New weapon skins, unique costumes and decorations, as well as additional features and options are all available through updates. Games like Rust receive regular updates so that players can bring their ideas and contribute them to the overall collection.</p><br/><p> However, when developing collection sequels, developers face a number of compromises. They must consider the wishes and preferences of players, maintain balance and gameplay, and explore different approaches to create the most interesting and sought-after items. It is important to note that decisions and updates related to collections have a direct impact on the players\' gaming experience and their interactions within the game.</p><br/><p> Therefore, following the news on the continuation of the workshop collections means being aware of the latest changes and improvements in your favorite game. In this article, we will take a detailed look at all the news and updates related to the workshop collections. Be attentive and do not miss the opportunity to update your game with new items and features that will bring freshness and originality to it.</p>'),
(11959, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates on Steam: Change in Release Time of New Patches in Russia'),
(11960, 'en-US', 'Find out how the UK\'s Daylight Saving Time update timings may impact your Rust experience. Stay up to date with the latest updates and enjoy new features and fixes!'),
(11961, 'en-US', 'updates, game Rust, Steam, release of updates, Russia, transition to winter time, change of release time, new features, bug fixes'),
(11962, 'en-US', '<p>Rust players in Russia should be aware that after the UK switched to winter time, the update release times in Russia have shifted forward by an hour.</p><br/><p> This may impact players\' plans and the time they can devote to new features and fixes, so it\'s important to stay up to date with changes to ensure you don\'t miss out on important updates and can enjoy the game to its fullest.</p><br/><p> You can find out more about the new updates and changes in their release times in our article. We will tell you about the latest changes in the game Rust, new features, bug fixes and other interesting details that await you after the UK switches to winter time.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to stay updated and ahead of other Rust players!</p>'),
(11963, 'en-US', 'Testing the Glock &amp; Burst Module'),
(11964, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the Glock &amp; Burst module in the game Rust and tell you how to get it and improve your Glock pistol, adding the ability to fire bursts.'),
(11965, 'en-US', 'testing, module, Glock &amp; Burst, Rust, burst firing'),
(11966, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the Glock &amp; Burst module in the game Rust. This module allows you to improve the Glock pistol, adding the ability to fire bursts. But how to get it?<br/><br/> First, it is worth noting that the Glock pistol itself cannot be crafted. It can only be found in the game world. This makes it a fairly rare and valuable item for players.<br/><br/> However, with the Glock &amp; Burst module, you can significantly improve your Glock by adding the ability to fire bursts. But where can you find this module?<br/><br/> The Glock &amp; Burst attachment can only be obtained by recycling a regular Glock. This means that you will have to find a Glock in the vastness of the map and bring it to a special recycling location. After that, you will be able to get the Glock &amp; Burst attachment and install it on your pistol.<br/><br/> You now have the ability to fire fast and powerful bursts with your Glock, making it much more effective in combat and allowing you to quickly secure yourself.<br/><br/> So, if you want to improve your Glock pistol, don\'t forget to find this valuable module and bring the Glock to a special recycling place. Only then you will be able to enjoy burst shooting and be invincible on the battlefield.'),
(11967, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest and most exciting skins that have been added to Rust! In this article, we will take a closer look at each skin and discuss their features, appearance, and availability. We will also discuss the issues surrounding the skins\' impact on gameplay and their impact on game balance. Don\'t miss this informative article about the new batch of skins in Rust!'),
(11968, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust, game, Steam, skins batch, customization, appearance, balance, price, skins market');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(11969, 'en-US', '<h1>New batch of skins in the game Rust</h1><br/><p> Check out the latest and greatest skins that have been added to Rust! Each new batch of skins is an opportunity for players to change the look of their items and weapons.</p><br/><p> Rust offers a wide range of skins that can be used to personalize your gaming experience. They can create a unique style and highlight your individuality in the game.</p><br/><p> In this article, you will find information about the newest skins added to Rust. We will look at each skin in detail and discuss its features, appearance, and availability.</p><br/><p> Skins in Rust come in a variety of themes and styles, from worn and realistic to vibrant and futuristic. You can choose a suitable skin for every item, from clothing and armor to weapons and building materials.</p><br/><p> We will also look at the issues surrounding the impact of skins on gameplay and their impact on game balance. It is important to consider that some skins may provide players with an advantage in the form of better camouflage or stealth, while other skins may be purely cosmetic and not affect gameplay mechanics.</p><br/><p> In our article, we will also highlight the importance of making informed decisions when choosing and purchasing skins. We will look at the factors to consider when evaluating the price and supply of skins in Rust. In addition, we will discuss which skins are the most popular among players and which skins are the most valuable in the skin market.</p><br/><p> You might be wondering how the developers control and balance the addition of skins to keep the game fair and balanced. We will cover this topic and tell you about the approaches they use to balance skins in Rust.</p><br/><p> So if you want to stay up to date with the latest news and trends in the world of Rust skins, don\'t miss our article about the new batch of skins in the Rust game!</p>'),
(11970, 'en-US', 'Glock + New Weapon Module'),
(11971, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam brings the Glock and a new weapon attachment. Find out how these changes will diversify gameplay and affect the game\'s strategy.'),
(11972, 'en-US', 'Glock, weapon module, update, Rust, Steam, balancing, game strategy'),
(11973, 'en-US', '<h2>Glock + New Weapon Module</h2><br/><p> The latest update to Rust on Steam has brought good news for fans of firearms - the Glock and a new weapon module have been added. These changes will significantly diversify the gameplay and allow players to use new strategies in battles.</p><br/><br/><h3> Weapon module for Glock</h3><br/><p> The Glock Weapon Attachment is a set of upgrades that can be installed on this popular pistol. The attachment includes items such as improved sights, suppressors, and flashlights. Players will now be able to customize their Glock to their needs, making it even more effective in combat.</p><br/><br/><h3> Benefits of Using a Glock</h3><br/><p> The Glock is a reliable and effective weapon that has already gained popularity among Rust players. It has good accuracy and shoots quite quickly. Thanks to the new weapon module, players will be able to enhance the Glock\'s advantages and make it even more versatile in short and medium-range fights.</p><br/><br/><h3> Balancing Changes</h3><br/><p> The addition of the Glock and the new weapon attachment required careful balancing to maintain the game economy and competitiveness. The developers took into account all aspects of the game to ensure that the Glock with the new attachment would not become too powerful and would not upset the balance between weapons. This way, players will be able to enjoy the new features without losing interest in other weapons in the game.</p><br/><br/><h3> Impact on game strategy</h3><br/><p> The introduction of the Glock and the new weapon attachment brings new possibilities to the strategy game Rust. Players will now be able to use the Glock in various combinations with other weapons and tactics to achieve a competitive advantage. The new weapon offers more options for participating in battles and experimenting with different strategies in the game.</p><br/><br/><h3> Conclusion</h3><br/><p> The Rust Steam update that brings the Glock and a new weapon module is a significant step in the development of the game world. Fans of firearms will be happy with the new possibilities that this module provides. Balancing and the impact on the strategy of the game ensure that the changes will not only bring variety, but also keep the game interesting as a whole.</p>'),
(11974, 'en-US', 'Latest news about the RC drone with control via a computer station'),
(11975, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about the radio-controlled drone that can be controlled from a computer station. Explore its new features and advantages that allow you to achieve precise and stable control.'),
(11976, 'en-US', 'radio-controlled drone, control via computer station, news, possibilities, piloting'),
(11977, 'en-US', '<p>In recent days, there has been exciting news about a radio-controlled drone that opens up entirely new possibilities for piloting. Now you can control the drone using your computer station, allowing for even more freedom and precision in control.</p><br/><br/><p> This new drone offers incredible capabilities that were previously unavailable. You will be able to control its movement, switch flight modes and perform other functions directly from your computer. This makes control much easier and allows you to achieve more accurate results.</p><br/><br/><p> Thanks to the control via a computer station, you will be able to receive data about the drone\'s flight in real time. This opens up wide possibilities for monitoring and analyzing the drone\'s operation, which is especially useful for professional and commercial purposes.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, this new drone provides more stable and precise control, thanks to the use of advanced technology. You will be able to precisely control the drone\'s flight, as well as perform complex maneuvers and tricks with ease.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to try this innovative RC drone with computer control - it provides a unique piloting experience and opens up completely new possibilities for you!</p>'),
(11978, 'en-US', 'First screenshots of the new Caboose wagon'),
(11979, 'en-US', 'Learn all about the new Caboose wagon in Rust, its characteristics, functionality and impact on the gameplay. Check out the first screenshots and find out what advantages this new vehicle can bring.'),
(11980, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, Caboose wagon, new wagon, update, screenshots, gameplay, characteristics, functionality, advantages'),
(11981, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam has added a new wagon called Caboose. The screenshots of this new vehicle are pleasing to the eye and allow us to take a look at its appearance and capabilities. In this article, we will look at the features and characteristics of the new Caboose wagon, explore its functionality and abilities. We will also discuss potential changes to the gameplay that may occur with the release of this innovation. We will find out whether Caboose will be useful for players and what advantages it can bring to the game world of Rust. Join us to learn the first details about the new Caboose wagon!'),
(11982, 'en-US', 'Steam Launches Halloween Festival'),
(11983, 'en-US', 'Steam has launched a Halloween festival, 33% discount on the game Rust!'),
(11984, 'en-US', 'Steam, festival, halloween, discount, Rust, game, wasteland, adventure, friends'),
(11985, 'en-US', 'The long-awaited Halloween festival has started on Steam! This is the time of year when the gaming world plunges into a spooky atmosphere and offers players unique opportunities and pleasant surprises.'),
(11986, 'en-US', 'The Halloween update is coming this Thursday!'),
(11987, 'en-US', 'This Thursday, at 21:00 Moscow time, the game Rust will have a Halloween update, which promises many exciting activities and innovations. Find out what awaits you in this update and don\'t miss the opportunity to immerse yourself in the holiday atmosphere!'),
(11988, 'en-US', 'Rust, Halloween, Update, Game'),
(11989, 'en-US', '<h2>The Halloween update is coming this Thursday!</h2><br/><br/><p> This Thursday, at 21:00 Moscow time, the game Rust will have a Halloween update! This event will be a repeat of last year\'s content, including many exciting activities and innovations.</p><br/><br/><h3> What awaits players:</h3><br/><ul><br/><li> Candy Collector Event: Explore the world of Rust to find and collect as many candies as possible. Winners will receive special rewards!</li><br/><li> Personal Frankenstein: You will be able to assemble and create your own Frankenstein using various components from the scarecrows. There will be plenty of room for experimentation!</li><br/><li> New Themed Skins in the Store: A large selection of new and unique skins awaits you to give your character or weapon a special Halloween style.</li><br/><li> Scarecrow NPCs: Scarecrows will appear around you, each with a different Halloween theme. These scarecrows will become your rivals or possibly allies, depending on how you interact with them.</li><br/><li> Carving Pumpkins: You can carve any design you want into pumpkins and use them for decorative purposes or as a means of communication with other players.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> The update will be available for both the client and the server. If you are a server owner, be sure to update it to get access to all the new features.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss Rust\'s Halloween update this Thursday and see the game in a new light! Find out more about the update details on the official Rust website.</p>'),
(11990, 'en-US', 'Rust Game on Steam: Halloween Event and New Delivery in the Store'),
(11991, 'en-US', 'Find out everything about the Halloween event and the new shipment of skins and items in the game Rust on Steam. Vote for your favorites in the store and create your own unique atmosphere in the game.'),
(11992, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam game, Halloween event, new shipment, store, skins, items, update'),
(11993, 'en-US', '<p>Halloween kicks off in Rust at the end of October, which means a new event and an exciting update to the store!</p><br/><p> This time, the developers have prepared a lot of new skins and items so that you can decorate your base and your character in the spirit of Halloween. From pendants and lamps to bones and skulls, your adventure in the game Rust will become even more exciting and gloomy!</p><br/><p> You can find the full list of skins and items available in this update on the Steam page linked below. You can also vote for your favorite candidate and share your opinion with the Rust community.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to add some Halloween spirit to your game! Check out what\'s on offer in the new Rust update and pick your favorite items now!</p>'),
(11994, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: find out about the most interesting updates'),
(11995, 'en-US', 'Find out about the exciting updates of the new batch of skins in the game Rust on Steam. Choose skins tactically and taking into account the balance between appearance and practicality. The game Rust continues to delight its users with new opportunities for creativity and self-expression in the game world.'),
(11996, 'en-US', 'game Rust, new skins, updates, Steam'),
(11997, 'en-US', '<h2>New batch of skins in the game Rust: find out about the most interesting updates</h2><br/><br/><p> The game Rust on Steam has pleased its users again - a new batch of skins has been added to the game, which makes the game world unique and fresh. This time the developers have tried and presented us with really interesting updates.</p><br/><br/><p> Before we dive into all the details, let\'s first understand what skins are and why they are so important to players. Skins are visual upgrades for various items in the game, such as weapons, clothing, buildings, and more. They allow players to customize their character and make them unique. Skins are also often collectibles and investments, as some can increase in value significantly over time.</p><br/><br/><p> Now let\'s move on to the most interesting updates of the new batch of skins in the game Rust:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> New weapon skins: now your favorite rifle or pistol can have a stylish and exclusive design that will distinguish you from other players.</li><br/><li> Futuristic Clothing: Stylized sci-fi costumes will give your character a unique look and help you stand out from other players.</li><br/><li> New Decorative Items: Houses and buildings in Rust can now be decorated with new and colorful elements that will make your base truly memorable.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> You can check out and purchase new skins right in the Steam store. Please note that some of them may only be available in limited quantities, so don\'t miss your chance for exclusive updates.</p><br/><br/><p> But don\'t forget that choosing a skin should be tactically sound and take into account factors such as its price, functionality, and in-game statistics. After all, a beautiful skin doesn\'t always mean that it will give you an advantage in game battles. Balancing between appearance and practicality is the key factor when choosing new skins.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins in the game Rust has once again shown us how many opportunities there are for creativity and self-expression in the gaming world. Rest assured that in the near future the developers will continue to delight us with new interesting updates that will make the game even more exciting.</p>'),
(11998, 'en-US', 'Meanwhile on the industrial branch'),
(11999, 'en-US', 'The world of the game Rust is expecting an industrial update that will add new features for automation and simplification of the gameplay. Conveyors, an electric furnace and an industrial crafter will be added.'),
(12000, 'en-US', 'industrial branch, update, Rust, conveyors, electric furnace, industrial crafter, automation, simplification, gameplay'),
(12001, 'en-US', '<p>The world of Rust will see new opportunities for automation and simplification of the gameplay. An industrial update is expected, which will introduce a number of changes and innovations.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main innovations will be conveyors. They will allow you to automatically move loot from one device to another, which will significantly simplify and speed up the process of resource processing. Along with conveyors, industrial dividers and combiners will be added, allowing you to perform complex automatic operations.</p><br/><br/><p> The game will also feature an electric furnace, which in addition to smelting resources using electricity, will allow for automated production. Now, finished loot will be automatically output along the conveyor path if it is connected to the furnace.</p><br/><br/><p> Another new feature is the industrial crafter. It will allow you to automatically craft items using a pre-configured production chain. This crafter will be a module that can be connected to a workbench of any level.</p><br/><br/><p> The industrial update brings some similarities with the famous game Factorio. All these new possibilities for automation and simplification of item creation and loot sorting will make the gameplay more convenient and interesting.</p>'),
(12002, 'en-US', 'Rust servers updated with new features and bug fixes. Happy wipe everyone!'),
(12003, 'en-US', 'Rust Server Update, Successful Wipe, New Features, Rust on Steam'),
(12004, 'en-US', '<p>Rust server update is good news for all fans of this popular game on Steam. The development team has released a fresh batch of updates that brings many improvements and new features.</p><br/><p> In this update you will find interesting changes that will make the gameplay even more exciting. Bugs were fixed, optimization was improved, new items and features were added.</p><br/><p> We wish everyone a successful wipe! Enjoy the game in the updated world of Rust!</p><br/><br/><p> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-BLtIFm47XE\">Watch the update video</a></p>'),
(12005, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins and lumberjack set'),
(12006, 'en-US', 'Welcome to the exciting world of Rust! The game has a new batch of skins and a lumberjack set that will add freshness and interest to your gaming session.'),
(12007, 'en-US', 'new batch, skins, lumberjack set, design, game style, nature, updates, collection, game features'),
(12008, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the exciting world of Rust! The game has a new batch of skins and a lumberjack set that will add freshness and interest to your gaming session.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins opens up amazing possibilities for you, allowing you to customize the appearance of your items and character. Each item and weapon can now have a unique design that differs from the standard look. This allows you to express your individuality and emphasize your style of play.</p><br/><p> The Lumberjack Set is a new themed collection of items to help you survive in the wilds of Rust. This set includes specially designed items and gear that will make your adventures in the forest even more exciting.</p><br/><p> Based on player feedback, the developers are constantly adding new skins and items to the game to ensure variety and fun. The new batch of skins and the lumberjack set are just a small part of what is available to you in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection and try out the role of a real lumberjack! Go to the game and enjoy the new opportunities that this batch of skins and the lumberjack set offers.</p>'),
(12009, 'en-US', 'New Twitch skins drop in Rust: promotion details and dates'),
(12010, 'en-US', 'Find out all about the Twitch drop skins that will be available in Rust during the promotion from October 6 to October 13. Get exclusive skins by watching streams on Twitch.'),
(12011, 'en-US', 'Twitch drop skins, Rust, promotion, October 6-13, streams, reward, collection, virtual character, market value'),
(12012, 'en-US', '<p>Very soon, the game Rust will host another Twitch drop - an event in which players will be able to get exclusive skins. The event will run from October 6 to 13, and today we will tell you all the details of this event.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main questions that interests all players is the list of skins available as part of the Twitch drop. Fortunately, all the skins that can be obtained during the event have become known.</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> Skin 1</li><br/><li> Skin 2</li><br/><li> Skin 3</li><br/><li> Skin 4</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> Please note that each of these skins is exclusive and only available through this promotion. They can only be obtained by watching Twitch streams and clicking a specific button to confirm receipt of the skins.</p><br/><br/><p> The duration of the promotion is 8 days - from October 6 to October 13. During this time, each player will be able to get all the skins if they watch the required number of streams.</p><br/><br/><p> Watching Twitch streams is an easy way to expand your Rust skin collection. All you have to do is log into Twitch during the specified period, choose your favorite streamer you want to support, and start watching their stream. While watching, you will receive certain rewards, including Twitch drop skins.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget that Twitch drop skins are a valuable asset and can be a great decoration for your virtual character in the Rust game. In addition, they can also have a high market value, so don\'t miss the opportunity to get them during the promotion.</p><br/><br/><p> So be sure to tune in to Twitch from October 6th to October 13th to claim your exclusive Twitch drop skins in Rust. Good luck and enjoy!</p>'),
(12013, 'en-US', 'To receive news notifications - click on the reaction below'),
(12014, 'en-US', 'Be the first to know about all the news and updates of the game Rust on Steam with notifications. Click the reaction below to subscribe to notifications.'),
(12015, 'en-US', 'notifications, news, updates, Rust, Steam'),
(12016, 'en-US', '<p>Want to stay up to date with all the latest news about Rust on Steam? Click the reaction below and get notifications about new updates straight to your phone or computer.</p><br/><p> We care about keeping our players updated on all the changes and innovations in the world of Rust. With our new notifications feature, you will always be the first to know about new updates, patches, events and other news related to the game.</p><br/><p> To turn on notifications, simply click on the reaction below. You will then receive notifications directly to the device of your choice. Now you won’t have to worry about missing out on important information or new features that could make your gaming experience even more exciting.</p><br/><p> We strive to provide our players with the most up-to-date information and the opportunity to stay up-to-date with all the latest events in the world of Rust. Don\'t miss your chance to be the first to know about new updates, characters, fan art and other interesting news. Click on the reaction below and be at the center of gaming news.</p>'),
(12017, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Charity Event and New Features'),
(12018, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust, including a charity event supporting World Central Kitchen and new skins in the store. Find out who\'s in the running for the event and your chance to earn unique rewards.\"'),
(12019, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, charity, World Central Kitchen, Twitch Drops, skins, shop, challengers, exciting event'),
(12020, 'en-US', '<p>As we wrote earlier, this year the charity that Rust will support is World Central Kitchen. This is a unique opportunity for the gaming community to contribute to charity and help those in need.</p><br/><br/><p> Starting from November 19, 2022, players can expect interesting innovations in the game Rust. As usual, the developers have provided Twitch Drops, which will allow players to receive various rewards simply for watching streams. Don\'t miss the chance to diversify your collection of skins.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, new skins will be available in the game store, which will help you stand out from other players and create a unique image of your character. Follow the updates and do not miss the opportunity to purchase the coolest skins.</p><br/><br/><p> We have compiled a list of the top contenders for this charity event. Exciting battles, epic victories and exciting moments await all participants. Join the game Rust and become a part of this exciting event!</p>'),
(12021, 'en-US', 'New Hazmat Skins and Tools Coming in New DLC October 6'),
(12022, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Hazmat skins and tools coming October 6th in the new Rust DLC. Upgrade your gear and stand out from the crowd!'),
(12023, 'en-US', 'new skins, hazmat, tools, dlc, update, players, rust'),
(12024, 'en-US', '<p>Here\'s some good news for all the Rust fans! A new DLC is coming soon that will add a bunch of exciting Hazmat skins and various tools. This is a great opportunity for players to upgrade their gear and give their character a new, unique look.</p><br/><br/><p> So, the release date for this long-awaited addition is set for October 6th. You will be able to check out the new range of Hazmat skins and tools available for purchase. The Rust development team has put in a lot of effort to provide you with beautiful and stylish options for your character.</p><br/><br/><p> The DLC codename is still a secret, but we can already say that it will bring many amazing features and new items for your survival in the ruthless world of Rust. New Hazmat skins and tools will allow you to stand out from other players and make an unforgettable impression on everyone around you.</p><br/><br/><p> But let\'s take a closer look at what we can expect from this add-on. The distinctive feature of the new Hazmat skins will be bright, saturated colors and patterns, allowing you to give your character an extravagant look. You will also have a choice of different styles and themes - from aggressive and threatening to playful and funny. Now your character will definitely stand out from the others.</p><br/><br/><p> But it\'s not just the Hazmat skins that will be updated. In the new DLC, you\'ll be able to update your entire toolkit. New designs and accessories have been added, allowing you to bring a breath of fresh air into the world of repair and construction. Now you\'ll have the opportunity to work with new stylish tools that will not only be a reliable assistant, but also a source of pride.</p><br/><br/><p> New Hazmat skins and tools that will be added on October 6 in the new DLC for the game Rust are a real gift for all fans of the game. Do not miss the opportunity to update your equipment and stand out among other players. Wait for the release of the DLC to plunge into the world of new opportunities and impressions with Rust!</p>'),
(12025, 'en-US', 'Our favorite game Rust has a new batch of skins! In this article, we will tell you in detail about the most interesting new items, give advice on their selection and use, and also emphasize the importance of considering various factors when buying skins. Join us to find out how these skins can refresh your gaming experience and add new aesthetic nuances to the game Rust!'),
(12026, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins, Rust, players, skin selection, game atmosphere, aesthetics, practicality, trading platforms, game store'),
(12027, 'en-US', 'Our favorite game Rust has a new batch of skins! This means that you have the opportunity to refresh your gaming experience and give a unique look to your items. In this article, we will tell you about the most interesting new items and share with you some tips on choosing and using skins.<br/><br/> We all know that skins are more than just cosmetic decoration. They can affect the atmosphere of the game and those around you, making your gaming session more vivid and memorable. The creators of Rust have put a lot of effort into offering you a variety of skin options that will help you express your individuality and add new aesthetic nuances to the game world.<br/><br/> The new batch of skins includes a variety of items, from weapons and armor to interior items and gear. Each item in this collection has its own unique story and design, which can be easily customized to suit your taste. You will be able to choose skins that match your playstyle or just bring a smile to your face. Rest assured that with these new skins, you will attract attention and raise the mood of yourself and the players around you a little.<br/><br/> Choosing skins can be difficult, especially when you see such a variety of options. It’s important to remember that a skin should not only look good, but also be practical for your gaming purposes. Some skins can improve visibility and make certain gaming situations easier, while others can simply add style to your character and their surroundings.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget about the price of skins. New skins will become available on trading platforms or in the game store, and each of them has its own price. Before buying, it is recommended to evaluate your financial capabilities and balance between the cost and the desire to buy a specific skin.<br/><br/> So don’t miss the opportunity to refresh your gaming experience and add new aesthetic nuances to the game Rust with the help of a new batch of skins. Spend time searching for the perfect skin that reflects your personality and capabilities. Don’t forget to share your impressions and tips with other players! Enjoy the game!'),
(12028, 'en-US', 'Undeserved bans after the latest update of the game Rust: developers are investigating the problem'),
(12029, 'en-US', 'The article talks about the problem with undeserved bans of Rust players\' accounts on Steam after the latest update. The developers acknowledged the anomalies and are actively working to unblock and solve the problem.'),
(12030, 'en-US', 'game Rust, Steam, update, account bans, developers, problems, unblocking'),
(12031, 'en-US', 'Some players of the game Rust on the Steam platform have encountered an unpleasant situation - their accounts were suddenly blocked after the latest update. Many players expressed their dissatisfaction and contacted the developers with the problem.<br/><br/> In response to requests, the developers confirmed the presence of \"anomalies\" that led to an increased number of undeserved bans. They are currently actively working to unblock accounts and determine the causes of this problem.<br/><br/> Suspecting technical issues, the developers expressed their regret and assured players that accounts would be automatically unblocked as soon as possible. However, they have not yet provided a specific time frame.<br/><br/> Due to this situation, many players had to pause their gaming activity and the excitement increased. Many expressed hope that the developers will be able to quickly fix this problem and return access to the game to them in the near future.<br/><br/> This is another example of how important it is to consider the possible impact of updates on gaming platforms and prepare for problems that may arise along the way. We hope that the Rust developers will do their best to resolve this issue as soon as possible and ensure a stable and uninterrupted gaming experience for all players.'),
(12032, 'en-US', 'New DLC and paid skin for antirad suit (lumberjack) in Rust'),
(12033, 'en-US', 'New DLC and paid skin for the anti-rad suit (lumberjack) are coming soon to Rust! Find out all the details and features of this update, including skins for tools and building blocks.'),
(12034, 'en-US', 'Rust, DLC, skins, antirad suit, lumberjack, global wipe'),
(12035, 'en-US', '<h2>New DLC and paid skin for anti-rad suit (lumberjack) will be released together with the global wipe on October 6</h2><br/><br/><p> Along with the expected global wipe in Rust on October 6, players will be able to purchase new DLC and a paid skin for the anti-rad suit in the style of a lumberjack.</p><br/><p> This highly anticipated DLC will also include tool and building block skins, giving players the opportunity to decorate and customize their in-game structures. The set will include both mud brick and standard brick, so that every player can choose the style that suits them.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that these new skins will not affect the durability of buildings, so players can be confident in the safety of their bases and structures.</p><br/><br/><h3> Key Features:</h3><br/><ul><br/><li> New DLC and paid skin for antirad suit in lumberjack style</li><br/><li> Available skins for tools and building blocks</li><br/><li> Choosing between adobe and standard bricks for decorating buildings</li><br/><li> New skins do not affect the durability of buildings</li><br/></ul>'),
(12036, 'en-US', 'Rust client and server updates this Wednesday'),
(12037, 'en-US', 'Alistair tweeted an upcoming update to the Rust client and server, with minimal downtime and some important changes expected.'),
(12038, 'en-US', 'rust update, client, server, important components, downtime, innovations'),
(12039, 'en-US', '<p>Rust developer Alistair has posted important information for all players on his Twitter account. This Wednesday at 13:00 Moscow time, a mandatory update of the game client and server is expected.</p><br/><p> The update will affect not only the client part, but also important server components that play a key role in the stable operation of the game and ensuring security.</p><br/><p> According to Alistair, the game server downtime is expected to be no more than 20 minutes, which will allow players to quickly return to the game and enjoy all the innovations that the update will bring.</p><br/><p> Updating the Rust client and server is an important step in the development of the game and improving the players\' gaming experience. It allows you to fix bugs, improve performance and add new features.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to update your game client in advance to avoid problems with logging into the game after the update.</p>'),
(12040, 'en-US', 'Updated icon for deer meat'),
(12041, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust, which includes a change to the icon for deer meat.'),
(12042, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, game, icon, deer meat'),
(12043, 'en-US', '<p>The recent update to Rust brought some interesting changes to the icon for deer meat. This is a small but important update that will bring new visual changes and an improved gaming experience for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> Among the many changes and updates that developers are implementing in the game Rust, changing the icon for deer meat may seem insignificant. However, even such a seemingly small update can have a big impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> The new icon for deer meat will add more realism and detail to the game. It will be brighter and more distinct, allowing players to better see and differentiate deer meat from other resources in the Rust game world. It will also better match the appearance and behavior of deer in the game, creating a more realistic atmosphere.</p><br/><br/><p> This icon change will also allow players to better understand what resources they are collecting and using in the game. A clearer and more distinguishable icon will help avoid confusion and errors when using deer meat in crafting or cooking.</p><br/><br/><p> Of course, every update has its trade-offs. These changes add some effort to the game\'s development, but ultimately they are done to improve the player experience. Also, the new icon may require a little adaptation from players, especially for those who are already accustomed to the previous icon.</p><br/><br/><p> The deer meat icon update is another step in the development and improvement of Rust. The game developers continue to listen to feedback from the player community and make changes that make the game more interesting and exciting.</p><br/><br/><p> In conclusion, the deer meat icon update in Rust allows players to enjoy a more realistic and immersive gaming experience. The new icon adds more detail and vibrancy to the game world, and helps to avoid confusion when collecting and using deer meat. Keep checking back with Rust for the latest changes and improvements!</p>'),
(12044, 'en-US', 'Fresh news from the fields!'),
(12045, 'en-US', 'All the latest news for Rust players! Learn about new tool skins, furnace functionality improvements, and a new filter selection interface. Update your collection and enjoy an improved gaming experience!'),
(12046, 'en-US', 'news, Rust, skins, tools, DLC, hazmat, furnaces, resources, interface, filters, update'),
(12047, 'en-US', '<p>Hello to all fans of the game Rust! We have the latest news that will certainly interest you!</p><br/><p> First of all, the developers have prepared new tool skins for you. They will be available in the new paid DLC. Pay special attention to the stylish hazmat skin, which will become a real highlight of your collection.</p><br/><p> Another interesting news is the improvements in the functionality of furnaces. Now they are able to smelt all resources at once, which significantly increases the efficiency of the process. You will want to check it out in practice!</p><br/><p> And finally, we are pleased to announce a new convenient interface for selecting filters in the game\'s main menu. Now you can easily customize the necessary parameters to suit your mood and preferences.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to update your game collection and enjoy new features. Stay tuned to stay up to date with the latest developments in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(12048, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: variety and new possibilities'),
(12049, 'en-US', 'The article discusses the new batch of skins in the game Rust, their variety, aesthetics and impact on gameplay, and also emphasizes the importance of individuality and restrictions when acquiring skins.'),
(12050, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust game on Steam, skins, variability, cosmetic changes, unique aesthetics, tactical advantage, limitations, individuality'),
(12051, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam pleases its players with a new batch of skins, which gives the gameplay even more variety and increases interest in the game. In this article, we will look at various aspects of the new skins and their impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> Skins in the game Rust are various outer shells for weapons, tools, objects and buildings. They allow players to stand out from others and add some individuality to their gameplay. The new batch of skins promises even more variability and luxury in choosing the appearance.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that skins do not affect the gameplay characteristics of items, they are only cosmetic changes. Players can purchase new skins through the Steam store or through the in-game marketplace.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins are distinguished by their unique aesthetics and detail. The creators of the game Rust are constantly working on adding new skins to satisfy the tastes of the most demanding players.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition to the appearance itself, skins can also affect the player\'s interaction with the surrounding world. For example, some skins can help players hide better in the environment or even give some tactical advantage.</p><br/><br/><p> However, there are some nuances to keep in mind with the new skins. First, when purchasing skins, players lose the ability to have standard items. Second, not all skins are available without an additional purchase, which may be a limiting factor for some players.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, the new batch of skins in Rust are a great way to add some fresh flavor to the gameplay. They allow players to express their individuality and add a little luxury to their Rust adventures.</p><br/><br/><p> So, if you\'re looking to spruce up your game with some stylish new looks for your items, the new batch of Rust skins on Steam is just what you need!</p>'),
(12052, 'en-US', 'Updated palette menu in the table editor: more colors and ease of use'),
(12053, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest update to the palette menu in the Rust Plate Editor on Steam, with more colors available and improved usability!'),
(12054, 'en-US', 'update, palette menu, plate editor, Rust game on Steam, comfort, color palette'),
(12055, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam pleases its users with updates that improve the gaming experience. One of the latest significant updates was the update of the palette menu in the plate editor. And this is the first update of this menu since 2015!</p><br/><p> The game developers have not only updated the palette menu, but also improved its usability. Now players can use the palette menu with greater ease and comfort.</p><br/><p> One of the major changes is the expansion of the color palette. Players can now choose from a larger number of colors than in the previous version. This allows for the creation of signs with more varied and vibrant designs, adding more personality and originality to the game world.</p><br/><p> Additionally, the updated palette menu is more intuitive and easy to use. Players can now quickly find the desired color and apply it to the sign without unnecessary complications and delays. This allows you to save time and focus on creating unique and aesthetically pleasing elements in the game.</p><br/><p> The update to the palette menu in the sign editor is great news for all Rust players. The new version of the menu not only brings more colors and creative possibilities, but also improves the overall user experience. Now players will be able to create even more unique and attractive elements in their in-game buildings. Get ready for a brighter and more original world of Rust!</p>'),
(12056, 'en-US', 'On servers with hardcore mode the cost of studying items in the technology tree will be increased'),
(12057, 'en-US', 'On servers with hardcore mode in the game Rust the costs of studying items in the technology tree will be changed.'),
(12058, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, updates, servers, hardcore mode, cost of studying items, technology tree'),
(12059, 'en-US', '<p>In the game Rust on servers with hardcore mode there will be changes related to the cost of researching items in the technology tree. This important update will affect the gameplay and balance of the game, requiring more resources and effort from players.</p><br/><br/><p> According to the new changes, the cost of studying items will be increased depending on their level in the technology tree. For example, the cost of studying the first level of an item will increase by one and a half times, the second level - by two times, the third level - by four times. This means that players will need to invest more resources and time to study more advanced and useful items.</p><br/><br/><p> This update aims to create a more challenging and engaging gaming experience for players who choose the hardcore mode. Increased item research costs will add more challenges and obstacles to progress, encouraging a more strategic and careful approach to developing your character and base.</p><br/><br/><p> However, these changes also raise questions about the game\'s balance. Increasing the cost of learning items may make it unaffordable for some players or slow down their progress in the game. It may also lead to a decrease in activity and player numbers on hardcore servers, which may have a negative impact on the community and overall gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, changing the cost of researching items in the tech tree on hardcore servers is an important step to improve the gameplay and its balance. However, it is necessary to analyze its impact on players and feedback in order to find the optimal solution that meets the needs of a wide audience of players.</p>'),
(12060, 'en-US', 'Industrial Workbench: New Crafting Opportunity in Rust'),
(12061, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update introduces an industrial workbench that will allow you to craft items automatically when power is supplied. Find out more about the new crafting feature in Rust.'),
(12062, 'en-US', 'industrial workbench, crafting, automatic crafting, electricity, items, components, blueprints, Rust game update news'),
(12063, 'en-US', 'In the latest commits, the developers of the game Rust mentioned the addition of a new type of workbench - industrial. The new product offers players a convenient opportunity to automatically craft items when electricity is supplied. However, to use the industrial workbench, you will need to have the necessary components and a blueprint.'),
(12064, 'en-US', 'New Twitch Drops Start October 6th and Run Until October 12th'),
(12065, 'en-US', 'Known dates and expectations for the new Twitch Drops in the game Rust. Get exclusive skins and enjoy live broadcasts from popular streamers throughout the week!'),
(12066, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Skins, Streamers, Live Streams'),
(12067, 'en-US', '<p>Attention, streamers and fans of the game Rust! We are pleased to announce that the new Twitch Drops will start on October 6th and will last until the 12th. This event will be a real holiday for Spanish streamers, so you can expect exciting broadcasts and a lot of prizes!</p><br/><p> For now, we can only share the dates of the Twitch Drops, but details about the skins and participants of the event will be published soon. Get ready for a great celebration, because this time the event will feature over 450 streamers!</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to get exclusive skins and follow the hottest streamers. Twitch Drops are your chance to customize your game with unique items and enjoy live streams from your favorite content creators.</p><br/><p> Mark the dates: October 6-12. Details on the event and participants will be available soon. Stay tuned and get ready to experience an exciting week of Twitch Drops with us!</p>'),
(12068, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins!'),
(12069, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of Rust skins on Steam that will add some freshness and variety to your gaming session. Explore the different styles, themes, prices, and availability of skins to make the right choice and stand out from other players.'),
(12070, 'en-US', 'Rust game, skins, gameplay, new features, styles, themes, prices, availability'),
(12071, 'en-US', '<p>Check out the new batch of skins that have just arrived for Rust on Steam! These fantastic skins bring a fresh and original feel to the gameplay, allowing you to decorate your items and stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> In this article, we will tell you about the most interesting and fascinating skins that have been added to the game. You will learn about new features for your characters and weapons, as well as how they affect the gameplay and your chances of success in matches.</p><br/><p> We\'ve done a full analysis of all the new skins to help you make the right choice. We\'ll discuss their pros and cons, and how they fit into the overall feel of the game. You\'ll learn about the different styles and themes of the skins, as well as their prices and availability.</p><br/><p> Which skins have become the most popular among players? What items have they mostly replaced? We will provide you with statistics and user reviews so that you can evaluate how popular these skins are and whether they are worth investing your in-game resources in.</p><br/><p> We\'ll also walk you through the process of getting and installing new skins so you can master all the game\'s features and start building your own collection.</p><br/><p> So don\'t miss the opportunity to learn about the new batch of skins in the game Rust. They will bring freshness and variety to your gaming session, will allow you to stand out from other players and enjoy a unique gaming experience.</p>'),
(12072, 'en-US', 'New Rust Update: Get Ready for Glock'),
(12073, 'en-US', 'Perhaps the developers of the game Rust will add a new weapon in the next update - Glock. Get access to a new model of a weapon created by the developer Thomas Butters, and enjoy even more exciting PvP battles in the world of Rust.'),
(12074, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, updates, Glock, weapons, Thomas Butters'),
(12075, 'en-US', '<p>Perhaps the developers of the game Rust are planning to add a new weapon soon - Glock! This is great news for all fans of the game, because the new revolver promises to bring unrivaled experience in PvP battles.</p><br/><br/><p> This new Glock model developed will introduce unusual and exciting gameplay to the game. The weapon modeling was done by one and only our favorite developer - Thomas Butters. He put his heart into creating this weapon and tried to make it as realistic and interesting as possible for Rust players.</p><br/><br/><p> This innovation will give players the opportunity to try new tactics and strategies. You will be able to practice your accurate hit, master new ways to make enemies afraid of you and, of course, do not forget to take cover, because now an even more deadly enemy will appear in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> What else awaits us with the appearance of Glock? Perhaps the developers will also add special modifications and improvements for this weapon so that players can customize it to their preferences and playstyle.</p><br/><br/><p> Get ready for new challenges and trials in the game Rust with the appearance of Glock! Stay tuned and don\'t miss the moment to be the first to try out the new weapon and win your victory in the post-apocalyptic world of Rust.</p>'),
(12076, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has been added to the game Rust on Steam! Update the appearance of your items and create a unique style. Choose skins, consider the balance and enjoy the new possibilities.'),
(12077, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, Steam, weapons, clothing, new items, aesthetics, balance, gameplay, choice, collection, interest, possibilities'),
(12078, 'en-US', 'Our expectations have been met - a new batch of skins has been added to the game Rust on Steam! Now you have the opportunity to update the appearance of your items and make them unique. New skins will allow you to stand out from other players and create a unique style.<br/><br/> This batch of skins features a variety of options for weapons, clothing, and other items that will add freshness and variety to your gameplay. Choose the skins that suit you and create your own unique collection.<br/><br/> In addition, new skins offer not only aesthetic improvements but also additional functions. Some of them can increase attack speed or increase the damage of your weapons. This allows you to adapt to different game situations and increase your chances of winning.<br/><br/> However, before purchasing new skins, there are some factors to consider. First, you should pay attention to their price. Some skins can be quite expensive, so it is recommended to carefully evaluate your budget before purchasing. Second, do not forget about the balance of the gameplay. Some skins can give you an advantage in combat, which can cause discontent among other players. Therefore, it is worth weighing all the pros and cons before making your choice.<br/><br/> Remember that it is important to maintain a balance between gameplay and aesthetic preferences. New skins can make your game more interesting and varied, but do not forget that the skill and tactics of the player matter much more.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection and add some freshness to your gaming experience. Choose the skins that suit you and enjoy the new features!'),
(12079, 'en-US', 'New updates in the game Rust: loot on the zipline'),
(12080, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest updates to Rust, including zipline loot. Check out the first screenshots and new items to find.');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(12081, 'en-US', 'Rust updates, zipline loot, screenshots, new items'),
(12082, 'en-US', 'Recent updates to the game Rust have brought a lot of interesting information. One of the new elements is zipline loot. In this article, we will tell you about the first screenshots and details about these new items.'),
(12083, 'en-US', 'New Rust Update: Zipline Loot Now Live! Find Out What\'s Coming'),
(12084, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Rust update that adds zipline loot. The higher the zipline, the more valuable the loot! Are you ready to go in search of unique opportunities and riches?'),
(12085, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, ziplines, loot, height, game'),
(12086, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for all Rust players! The latest update to the game has introduced an interesting feature - zipline loot. Now, when you move around the map on ziplines, you will be able to find various valuable items and resources.</p><br/><p> The higher the zipline, the more valuable the loot will be! This is a great incentive to explore areas located at high altitude. Unique and useful items are waiting for you, which will definitely help you survive and succeed in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> The update gives players the opportunity to gain an advantage if they are willing to take risks and spend time finding ziplines and moving along them. Each new update with its own features and unique opportunities makes the game even more exciting and diverse.</p><br/><p> Be careful! Your zipline loot may be the envy and desire of other players. Be prepared to meet hunters who are looking for valuable items just like you. The loot you find may cause conflicts and fights, but that is what makes the world of Rust so tense and exciting.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance for big loot and new adventures! The update is now available for download, so don\'t waste time and head to the ziplines in search of unique opportunities and riches.</p>'),
(12087, 'en-US', 'Extra Crate Slots in Rust - New Update from Facepunch'),
(12088, 'en-US', 'Facepunch decided not to stop and added new slots not only to regular boxes, but also to other items in the game Rust. Find out what changes have occurred and how they will affect your game progression.'),
(12089, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, crate slots, extra slots, Facepunch, inventory'),
(12090, 'en-US', 'Facepunch decided to go further and make changes to the crate slots in the game Rust. Now you will get additional slots not only in regular crates, but also in other items.<br/><br/> - Horse Saddlebag: Number of slots increased from 6 to 12.<br/> - Camper module: number of slots increased from 12 to 18.<br/> - Single-module body with boxes: the number of slots has been increased from 18 to 48.<br/><br/> These changes will help you increase your inventory and store more resources and items. Be prepared for new opportunities and strategies in the game Rust.<br/><br/> Source: <a href=\"https://t.me/RustcommunityRU\">https://t.me/RustcommunityRU</a>'),
(12091, 'en-US', 'The date of the Charitable Rust 2022 charity event has been announced'),
(12092, 'en-US', 'The date for Charitable Rust 2022 has been announced. Find out more about the event, charity, Twitch Drops, and skins on our website.'),
(12093, 'en-US', 'Charitable Rust 2022, charity event, Rust, World Central Kitchen, Twitch, exclusive Twitch Drops, skins'),
(12094, 'en-US', 'The date of the Charitable Rust 2022 charity event has been announced.<br/><br/> This year, the charity will be World Central Kitchen. The event is scheduled for November 19, 2022, and will be hosted by Rustafied and the Rust community. The event will last 12 hours and will be broadcast on Twitch. The event is scheduled to begin at 19:00 Moscow time.<br/><br/> As in previous years, the event will feature exclusive Twich Drops - unique items that can be earned by watching the event stream.<br/><br/> In previous years, many interesting skins were added. This year, there is no information about the list of skins yet, but they promise that information about them will be available on September 30th.<br/><br/> Stay tuned for more information about Charitable Rust 2022 and the latest updates.'),
(12095, 'en-US', 'Work has begun on the new \"Kabuz\" carriage - the last carriage in the train'),
(12096, 'en-US', 'Work has begun on the new \"Caboose\" train car in Rust. The train car will feature blackjack and poker. Find out more about the new update!'),
(12097, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, updates, wagon Kabooz, blackjack, poker'),
(12098, 'en-US', '<p>The developers of the game Rust on Steam are not asleep and continue to surprise us with new updates! Recently, the start of work on a new car \"Kabuz\" was announced, which, as you know, is usually the last one in the train.</p><br/><br/><p> There is little information about the new carriage yet, but it has already become known that it will not just be an ordinary means of transport, but a real gaming world. In the \"Caboose\", players will be able to enjoy poker and blackjack, while being inside the train!</p><br/><br/><p> This is great news for all fans of the Rust game, as the new wagon will add even more opportunities for fun and social interaction with other players.</p><br/><br/><p> However, at this stage of development, there is not much information about the capabilities of the new \"Kabuz\" wagon. Perhaps in future updates, the developers will share more details about what else will be available to players inside this unique wagon.</p><br/><br/><p> So let\'s keep a close eye on the news and wait to find out all the details about the new \"Caboose\" wagon in the game Rust!</p>'),
(12099, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam is getting a new batch of skins that allow players to express their individuality and style. Skins affect gameplay and have economic value. This article discusses the importance of choosing skins, their statistical characteristics, and their impact on gameplay tactics.'),
(12100, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, visual decorations, personality, style, weapons, tools, armor, basic structures, skin selection, statistical characteristics, gameplay, tactical decisions, economic aspect, virtual money, game inventory, collection update'),
(12101, 'en-US', '<p>Rust on Steam is getting a new batch of skins that bring a breath of fresh air into the game world. These skins are not only visual decorations, but also an opportunity to express your individuality and style in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins in the game Rust offers a wide range of different elements for weapons, tools, armor and basic structures. From bright and expressive to stylish and minimalistic - here every player will find a suitable option.</p><br/><br/><p> However, choosing skins is not only a matter of taste, but also strategic thinking. All skins in the game Rust have their own statistical characteristics that can affect the gameplay. Some skins make weapons more accurate, others improve protection or increase the efficiency of resources. Therefore, before buying a new skin, it is important to carefully study its characteristics and think about how it can affect your tactical decisions in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> It is also worth mentioning the importance of the economic aspect of skins in the game Rust. Some rare or special skins can have a high value on the market, allowing players to earn virtual money by selling them to other participants. This is an additional incentive for players to experiment with the appearance of their game inventory.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins in the game Rust is a great opportunity for players to update their collection and add fresh impressions to the gameplay. Whether it is a new weapon, unique costumes or beautiful decorative elements for the base, these skins will help make the game bright and unique.</p>'),
(12102, 'en-US', 'Rust - Hardcore Mode Update Released'),
(12103, 'en-US', 'Rust - Hardcore Mode Update Description'),
(12104, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, Hardcore Mode'),
(12105, 'en-US', 'New information on the September update'),
(12106, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about the September update of the game Rust. New delivery boxes and an improved resource collection interface will give you even more options in the game.'),
(12107, 'en-US', 'news, september update, delivery boxes, resource collection interface, gameplay'),
(12108, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, friends! Today we want to share with you the latest news about the September update of the game Rust.</p><br/><p> The first big news is that there will be 8 delivery boxes in the Bandit and Peaceful cities instead of the previous 4. This will give you even more opportunities to get valuable resources and items.</p><br/><p> In addition, we have made changes to the resource collection interface. Now you will not see separate plates for each hit, but all the information will be displayed in one place. This will greatly simplify the collection process and allow you to use your resources more efficiently.</p><br/><p> We are confident that these changes will make the gameplay even more exciting and interesting. We wish you good luck and enjoy your time in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(12109, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Interface Update: New Items and Features'),
(12110, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new UI update for Rust, which introduces new items and features, including the Refinery, Campfire, Furnaces, and Grill. Learn more about changes to smelting and other gameplay improvements.'),
(12111, 'en-US', 'interface update, Rust game, new items, updated interface, interface features, refinery, campfire, small oven, large oven, barbecue'),
(12112, 'en-US', '<p>This is roughly what the updated interface in the game Rust will look like:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Oil refinery (Oil refinery)</li><br/><li> Bonfire</li><br/><li> Small oven</li><br/><li> Big oven</li><br/><li> Barbecue</li><br/></ul><br/><p> Each of these items will have its own new functions and capabilities. The resources will be smelted sequentially - this means that if you put sulfur first and then metal, the sulfur will be smelted first, and then the metal will start smelting.</p><br/><p> The interface update will also bring new ways to interact with items and more convenient tools for research and crafting items. These changes will make the gameplay more exciting and varied for players.</p><br/><p> Source: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a></p>'),
(12113, 'en-US', 'Good news - changes to boxes in the game Rust'),
(12114, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has changed the crates - they now hold more items. Find out more in the article.'),
(12115, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, boxes, inventory'),
(12116, 'en-US', '<h2>Good news - changes in boxes</h2><br/><br/><p> The latest update to Rust has brought major changes to crates, allowing players to easily store more items in their bases.</p><br/><br/><p> In particular, the size of the large box has been increased from 30 to 48 slots. Now you can organize your resources and inventory more efficiently without worrying about running out of space.</p><br/><br/><p> The number of slots in the small box has also been increased - now you can place up to 18 items instead of 12. This is a significant improvement that will allow you to better organize your tools and resources.</p><br/><br/><p> The upgrade to the boxes will make the game even more fun and convenient for players, allowing them to have more space to store and sort their items.</p><br/><br/><p> Source: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a></p>'),
(12117, 'en-US', 'Twitch Rivals Trophy - Comfort Reduced to 70%'),
(12118, 'en-US', 'Learn about the Twitch Rivals Trophy and its impact on gameplay comfort, where comfort is reduced by up to 70%.'),
(12119, 'en-US', 'Twitch Rivals Trophy Comfort Mods Rust Game'),
(12120, 'en-US', 'Twitch Rivals Trophy and Game Comfort Changes Detailed'),
(12121, 'en-US', 'What is hardcore mode in the game Rust?'),
(12122, 'en-US', 'Find out what hardcore mode is in Rust and what restrictions it adds to players. Prepare for great challenges and test your survival skills in the world of Rust!'),
(12123, 'en-US', 'hardcore, mode, game Rust, update, restrictions, difficulties'),
(12124, 'en-US', 'We are often asked what is hardcore mode?<br/><br/> Hardcore mode will be available to everyone on September 1 at 21-00 (Global update)<br/><br/> Hardcore is a new game mode that is installed on separate servers and obviously changes the rules of the game. Hardcore mode in this case gets rid of most of the existing systems and limits most of the remaining ones.<br/><br/> What will the hardcore mode bring?<br/><br/> -There will be no compass.<br/> -Rust+.<br/> -Cards.<br/> -Green will also be disabled.<br/> -There are no more safe zones.<br/> -There will be no turrets or scientists in safe zones.<br/> -There will be no research branch either.<br/> - General chat is disabled and local chat is added, range is 100m.<br/> -The maximum number of sleeping bags and beds is no more than 5 pieces.<br/> -When you are wounded, you cannot move (crawl).<br/> -There will be no copters, drones (they were used for purchases in stores from the nps city and the city of bandits).<br/> -MLRS won\'t happen either.<br/> - Wipe on hardcore will be once a month (first Thursday of the month).'),
(12125, 'en-US', 'Stop Spamming: New Rust Update Makes Resource Gathering More Enjoyable'),
(12126, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Rust update that makes resource gathering more enjoyable by eliminating resource harvesting spam.'),
(12127, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, Steam, spam messages, resource gathering, notifications, new update'),
(12128, 'en-US', 'Forget about annoying spam messages! The popular game Rust on Steam has introduced a new update that frees players from a constant stream of notifications about collected resources. Now, instead of several notifications about each resource mined, the game will show only one general notification with the number of all collected resources. This is especially convenient when using quick collection tools, such as a jackhammer or chainsaw.'),
(12129, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new batch of skins! Find out how new skins can improve your gaming experience, appearance, and item stats. Also, explore the skin trading options and choose your own unique playstyle!'),
(12130, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, skins, updates, skin trading, customization, improving gaming experience'),
(12131, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has appeared in the game Rust! Now players have the opportunity to diversify the appearance of their items and characters. New skins add a large number of new elements to the game that can be applied to basic equipment, weapons, tools and other items.<br/> Each new skin has its own characteristics - from unique design and color scheme to impressive textures and details. The Rust development team is constantly working on creating new skins to meet the needs of players and create a more interesting gaming experience.<br/><br/> New skins not only improve the appearance of items, but can also affect their characteristics. Some skins can add new abilities, increase the speed or strength of weapons, and change the protection and durability of equipment. This allows players to customize their playstyle and create unique combinations of skins and items.<br/><br/> However, before purchasing a new skin, players should pay attention to several important factors. First, the price of a skin can vary significantly depending on its rarity and popularity. New and rare skins may be more expensive, but they can also attract more attention and add uniqueness to the gaming experience.<br/><br/> It is also important to consider the compatibility of skins with existing items. Some skins may only work with specific items or weapons, so you should make sure that the new skin will be usable before purchasing.<br/><br/> Another important thing to mention when reviewing the new batch of skins is the trading system, which allows players to buy and sell skins on the Steam marketplace. This gives additional flexibility when choosing and trading skins with other players.<br/><br/> Thus, the new batch of skins in the game Rust offers players a wide range of options for individualization and improving the gaming experience. From unique designs to changing the characteristics of items, every player can find a suitable skin for themselves and create their own unique style of play. So, do not miss the opportunity to update your collection of skins and make the game Rust even more exciting!'),
(12132, 'en-US', 'Fixes for sound issues in Rust on a separate branch'),
(12133, 'en-US', 'Let\'s look at the main changes related to fixing sound issues in the game Rust on a separate branch. Separated sounds of shots, nail gun and Bradley tank sounds are now played more muffled and their reverberation has been increased. In addition, incorrect playback of nail gun sounds from the third person has been fixed. Improving the sound accompaniment in the game Rust.'),
(12134, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, sounds, fixes, nail gun, shots, reverb, Bradley tank'),
(12135, 'en-US', '<p><br/>The latest update to Rust on a separate branch included changes related to fixing some sound issues. These changes are aimed at improving the game experience and creating a more realistic sound environment. Let\'s take a look at the main fixes:<br/></p><br/><ul><br/><li> Nailgun shots are now quieter. This change will help reduce excessive audio saturation and bring more balance to the game\'s soundscape.</li><br/><li><br/> Distant gunshot sounds are now more muted and reverberation has been increased. These changes will help players better determine how close or far away shots are, which will contribute to a more accurate perception of the game world and make it easier to make decisions based on audio cues.<br/></li><br/><li> Fixed incorrect playback of the Nailgun sounds in third person. This improvement will allow players to identify and track enemy sound activity with more accurate sound effects.</li><br/><li><br/> A bug that caused some Bradley tank sounds to not play or to play quietly, especially the engine sound, has also been fixed. The tank\'s audio will now play correctly, providing a more immersive experience and a better balance between the game\'s audio components.<br/></li><br/></ul><br/><p> Please note that these changes were made on a separate branch of the Rust game, meaning they are in testing and may be further refined before being released to the main game branch.</p>'),
(12136, 'en-US', 'Hard Core mode will officially be released on September 1st'),
(12137, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about the official release of Hard Core mode in the game Rust on Steam on September 1st.'),
(12138, 'en-US', 'Hard Core mode, release, September 1st'),
(12139, 'en-US', '<p>The long-awaited Hard Core mode in the game Rust is approaching its official release! On September 1st you will be able to experience a real challenge and plunge into a more complex gaming experience.</p><br/><p> Hard Core mode offers players new rules of the game, promising additional excitement and testing of survival skills. One mistake can cost you dearly, so be prepared for extreme difficulty and new threats.</p><br/><p> In this mode, players are faced with a number of changes that make the game space even more ruthless. All player actions leave traces, which makes radars, spy devices, and trackers especially dangerous. Every decision made can have serious consequences, so be careful and think through your steps in advance.</p><br/><p> To make the gameplay even more unique and exciting, the developers have added new dangers and threats. You will have to face new types of enemies, as well as special survival conditions that will require your maximum attention and ability to adapt.</p><br/><p> The fact remains that in Rust you can play alone or in a team. However, in Hard Core mode you will face tougher survival conditions, where every action will matter.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget that Hard Core mode is a full immersion into the game, where you need to use all your survival skills and all your cunning to withstand the difficulties and overcome the challenges you will face.</p><br/><p> So get ready, September 1st, Hard Core mode is officially out! Dive into a new challenge and overcome all obstacles on the way to survival!</p>'),
(12140, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: review of the new update'),
(12141, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest update in the game Rust, which brought a new collection of skins to decorate your character and items!'),
(12142, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, update, skin collection, appearance, gameplay, personality, skins sale'),
(12143, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam continues to please its fans by releasing new batches of skins for characters and items! If you are into this game and like to decorate your character, then you should definitely check out the latest update.</p><br/><br/><p> This update includes a new collection of skins designed and added by the game developers. You will be able to find colorful and original skins for your hero, as well as for weapons, tools and other items. Now you can stand out from other players and add a little personality to your game.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins not only give your character a unique look, but can also increase their status in the game. Some skins can be rare and valuable, making them even more desirable among players. In addition, skins can be sold or traded with other players, which opens up the possibility of earning additional game resources.</p><br/><br/><p> However, before purchasing new skins, you should evaluate their impact on gameplay and game balance. Some skins may be brighter and more noticeable, which may attract unwanted attention from other players or disrupt the atmosphere of the game. It is important to find a compromise between the visual impact of the skins and their impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> In conclusion, the new batch of skins in the game Rust is a great opportunity to add freshness and individuality to your game. Be careful when choosing skins and evaluating their impact on the gameplay in order to fully enjoy the process of the game and decorate your character.</p>'),
(12144, 'en-US', 'New changes in hardcore mode'),
(12145, 'en-US', 'Learn about the recent changes to Hardcore Mode that will impact gameplay and balance in Rust.'),
(12146, 'en-US', 'news, changes, hardcore mode, MLRS, hostility icon, save zone, drones, balance, gameplay'),
(12147, 'en-US', '<p>Hardcore mode has recently seen some significant changes that deserve our attention. Let\'s take a look at how these changes will affect gameplay and what they are all about.</p><br/><br/><p> Firstly, the decision was made to remove MLRS combat vehicles from the hardcore mode. This change may cause some controversy among players, but it was introduced in order to balance the gameplay. Now teams will have to use different tactics and strategies to achieve success in battle.</p><br/><br/><p> Secondly, you will no longer see a hostile icon when entering a save zone. This decision was made based on community feedback and is aimed at a smoother and more enjoyable gameplay experience. Now you can freely move around the save zone without the risk of being attacked by other players.</p><br/><br/><p> And finally, it was decided to exclude drones from hardcore mode. Sure, drones were a handy tool for reconnaissance and dealing damage to the enemy, but they could also be used for unfair tactics and disrupting the balance of the game. Therefore, removing drones from hardcore mode contributes to a more fair and honest game.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, these changes to the hardcore mode are intended to improve the gaming experience and maintain balance between players. They will certainly provoke various reactions and discussions, but their goal is to create an interesting and balanced gaming space where every player has an equal chance to succeed. We are waiting for your feedback and comments!</p>'),
(12148, 'en-US', 'Updated Furnace Interface in Rust: Comparison and New Features'),
(12149, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new furnace interface on the aux02 branch. Find out how it compares to the previous version, how it compensates for the lack of slots, and what\'s new in the upcoming September update.'),
(12150, 'en-US', 'updated oven interface, Rust game, aux02 branch, design, productivity, new features, September update'),
(12151, 'en-US', 'An update has been released on the aux02 branch of Rust, which allows you to test the new furnace interface. Comparing it to the previous version, it is clear that the design has been radically changed and refined. Although the number of available slots has decreased, this disadvantage is compensated by greater productivity. The new furnace interface design will be included in the September global update, which will be released at 21:00. Learn more about the new features and trade-offs in this article.'),
(12152, 'en-US', 'It has become known that only 5 sleeping bags will be available in hardcore mode'),
(12153, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new limitation in the hardcore mode of the game Rust - only 5 sleeping bags available!'),
(12154, 'en-US', 'game Rust, hardcore mode, sleeping bags, update'),
(12155, 'en-US', 'News: Limitation of the number of sleeping bags in the hardcore mode of the game Rust'),
(12156, 'en-US', 'One of the reddit members suggested hovercrafts - what do you think?'),
(12157, 'en-US', 'A Reddit forum member has suggested creating hovercraft for Rust. This opens up one of the possibilities for adding new adventures, but there are concerns about the possible imbalance of the game. Join the discussion and share your thoughts!'),
(12158, 'en-US', 'reddit, hovercraft, Rust, game, concept art, balance'),
(12159, 'en-US', '<p>On the popular Reddit forum, one of the participants shared his fascinating idea - to create hovercrafts for the game Rust. This unusual proposal caused a heated discussion among players and fans of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> The concept art submitted by the participant shows exciting scenes with boats hovering in the air and floating above the water. This unusual vision of the Rust game world could add new possibilities and interest to players.</p><br/><br/><p> However, there are those who find this idea not very realistic. They express concerns about possible violations of the game balance and the impact on the game economy. Bringing such a concept to life will require significant changes and adaptations.</p><br/><br/><p> Of course, the concept of hovercrafts in the game Rust can add more variety and adventure. However, before implementing this idea, the developers should carefully weigh all aspects and find a compromise between introducing new content and maintaining the level of balance of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> What do you think about this idea? Would you like to see hovercraft in Rust? Join the discussion and share your thoughts with the Rust community!</p>'),
(12160, 'en-US', 'Table of raiding wooden buildings with a molotov cocktail'),
(12161, 'en-US', 'Find out which type of wooden buildings are most vulnerable to Molotov cocktails in Rust. Our table will help you choose the most durable and safe buildings for your base.'),
(12162, 'en-US', 'raid, wooden buildings, molotov cocktail, table'),
(12163, 'en-US', '<h2>Table of raiding wooden buildings with a molotov cocktail</h2><br/><p> The Molotov cocktail is one of the most effective weapons when raiding wooden buildings in Rust. But which type of wooden buildings are most susceptible to damage from this weapon? Our table will help you figure this out.</p><br/><br/><h3> Types of wooden buildings</h3><br/><p> There are several types of wooden buildings in Rust, each with its own strength and resistance to fire. Our research has allowed us to create a table that shows which type of wooden buildings are most vulnerable to a Molotov cocktail.</p><br/><br/><h3> Wooden Buildings Raid Table</h3><br/><table><br/><tr><br/><th> Type of wooden building</th><br/><th> Strength</th><br/><th> Molotov cocktail resistance</th><br/></tr><br/><tr><br/><td> Wooden wall</td><br/><td> 1000</td><br/><td> Vulnerable</td><br/></tr><br/><tr><br/><td> Wooden floor</td><br/><td> 500</td><br/><td> Stable</td><br/></tr><br/><tr><br/><td> Wooden foundation</td><br/><td> 1500</td><br/><td> Vulnerable</td><br/></tr><br/></table><br/><br/><h3> Analysis and Conclusions</h3><br/><p> Our analysis showed that wooden walls are the most vulnerable to molotov cocktails, with a durability of only 1000 units. While wooden floors and foundations are more resistant, with durability of 500 and 1500 units respectively. This table will allow you to build safer and more durable bases in the game Rust.</p>'),
(12164, 'en-US', 'Community Giveaway for 3 Skins'),
(12165, 'en-US', 'Take part in our giveaway and get a chance to win three community skins in the game Rust. All the details in a special channel.'),
(12166, 'en-US', 'giveaway, skins, community, game Rust, unique skins'),
(12167, 'en-US', '<p>Take part in our exciting giveaway and get a chance to win three community skins in the game Rust. All information about the giveaway is available in a special channel, where you can find out all the details and rules of participation.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to add to your skin collection and make it even more unique! Participation in the giveaway is absolutely free, and all you need to do is follow the instructions posted in the giveaway channel.</p><br/><br/><p> We have prepared for you three excellent skins that will delight you in the game Rust. Choose your favorite from three options and enhance your aesthetics in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to win! Join our giveaway and get a chance to get new stylish skins for your character in the game Rust.</p>'),
(12168, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has appeared in the game Rust, which will allow players to stand out from the crowd and change the appearance of their items.'),
(12169, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins,rust,steam,new skins,inventory,aesthetics'),
(12170, 'en-US', '<p>Rust, a game famous for its many customization options, has a new batch of skins that will allow players to stand out even more from the crowd.</p><br/><br/><p> Each new batch of skins in Rust is a real event for the gaming community, as they add new items to the inventory, weapons, and base that can be used to create a unique look and feel.</p><br/><br/><p> Skins are visual upgrades that allow players to change the appearance of their items in Rust. They can come in a variety of designs, color schemes, and patterns, and are always a big draw for players.</p><br/><br/><p> While playing Rust, players can find skins in-game or purchase them on the Steam marketplace. The new batch of skins adds variety and freshness to the already rich selection of existing options.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins are usually developed by the game developers themselves, as well as by third-party fan artists. Each skin goes through a series of checks and tests to ensure that it meets the game\'s standards and does not disrupt the balance.</p><br/><br/><p> However, in addition to the external aesthetic component, skins can also have practical value. Some of them can provide players with advantages, such as higher speed on the ground, better protection, or improved weapon characteristics.</p><br/><br/><p> However, the benefits that can be gained from skins must be carefully balanced so as not to disrupt the gameplay and maintain fairness for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> Therefore, the developers try to balance the factors that influence the game\'s economy, the availability of skins and their effects on the gameplay. They take into account the community\'s feedback and conduct regular updates to improve and meet the needs of players.</p><br/><br/><p> Each new batch of skins is an opportunity for players to express their individuality and become part of the diverse Rust community.</p><br/><br/><p> Dive into a fascinating world of aesthetics and possibilities with a new batch of skins for Rust on Steam!</p>'),
(12171, 'en-US', 'New Weapon Lockers in Rust: Large, Medium, and Small'),
(12172, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new medium and small weapon locker variants added to Rust. Players can now choose the appropriate locker size based on their needs and organize their weapon storage more flexibly.'),
(12173, 'en-US', 'gun lockers, rust update, locker sizes, storage flexibility'),
(12174, 'en-US', '<p>The developers of the game Rust have great news for players. The latest update added medium and small variants of weapon lockers. Now there are three sizes of lockers in the game: large, medium and small. They have the same height and depth, but a smaller width.</p><br/><p> This means that players can choose the right locker size based on their needs. Large lockers are suitable for storing large quantities of weapons and equipment, while medium and small lockers are ideal for smaller collections or for separating weapons into categories.</p><br/><p> This update provides greater flexibility in organizing the weapon storage in the game. Now each player can customize their storage as they see fit. Saving and finding the necessary weapons has now become much easier and more efficient.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to update your game and try out these new gun lockers. Managing your weapon collection in Rust will become even more convenient and efficient.</p>'),
(12175, 'en-US', 'Trophies in Rust can be sold: a bug or a new feature?'),
(12176, 'en-US', 'Recently, Rust players discovered that loot can be sold. The article discusses whether this is a bug or a new feature in the game, and also looks at the different points of view of players. It is expected that the developers will soon address this issue in future updates.'),
(12177, 'en-US', 'game Rust, trophies, sale, opportunity, bug, updates'),
(12178, 'en-US', '<p>Recently, some Rust players have noticed an interesting phenomenon: trophies that were usually only used for decoration or crafting can be sold. This has caused a lot of talk in the player community, and many have already started to exploit this feature. However, it remains unclear whether this is a new feature or just a bug in the game.</p><br/><p> Some players believe that the ability to sell trophies adds interest and economic component to the game. It allows players to earn resources by trading the items they have obtained, and also creates new strategies and opportunities for game progression.</p><br/><p> On the other hand, there are those who consider it a bug and an improper feature of the game. They believe that selling trophies distorts the game economy and deprives the game of balance. Some fear that this could lead to inequality between players who can use this opportunity and those who cannot or do not want to do so.</p><br/><p> Whether this is a bug or a new feature, Rust developers have already stated that they are working on a fix for this issue. The next update is expected to address this issue and provide clarity to players regarding the sale of trophies.</p><br/><p> So, it must be said that at the moment, selling trophies is a controversial and controversial issue in the game Rust. Perhaps this is a temporary situation that will be adjusted in future updates. In any case, it is important to note that the game Rust continues to evolve and change in order to provide the best gaming experience for its users.</p>'),
(12179, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops have begun - 16 skins available!'),
(12180, 'en-US', 'Participate in Twitch Drops in Rust and get 16 new character and weapon skins! The event will last until August 14.'),
(12181, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, 16 Skins, Rust, Streams, Game Collection'),
(12182, 'en-US', 'Today we are happy to announce the start of Twitch Drops in the game Rust! As part of this unique event, you have the opportunity to get as many as 16 new skins for your character and weapons!<br/><br/> The event will last until August 14, 01:00 Moscow time, so you have a little time left to join the game and start your hunt for new and rare items. Don\'t miss the chance to add cool skins to your collection!<br/><br/> To participate in Twitch Drops, you simply need to connect your Twitch account to the Rust game and follow the instructions on the promotion page. You will then be able to watch streams and automatically receive skins for your active participation.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget that Twitch Drops are only available on official Rust partner channels, so make sure you\'re connected to the right stream. Keep an eye on our social media and official website to stay up to date with current streams and claim your rewards!<br/><br/> We wish you good luck in your hunt and hope that the new skins will decorate your game collection!'),
(12183, 'en-US', 'Information about Twitch Drops in Rust'),
(12184, 'en-US', 'Learn about Twitch Drops in Rust, where you can earn rare skins by watching streamers and the official Twitch Rivals channel.'),
(12185, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust game, skins, streamers, event, Twitch Rivals'),
(12186, 'en-US', '<p>As a reminder, tomorrow at 20:00 Twitch drop starts in the game Rust. This is a great opportunity to get 16 new skins, eight of which will be available through streamers. For several days, a special event will be held on Twitch, during which you can get these skins. To get drops from streamers, you will need to watch their broadcast for two hours. Additionally, two drops will be available on the official Twitch Rivals channel, which will require three hours of viewing. To get two drops from DisguisedToast, you will need to watch his broadcast for four hours.</p><br/><p> But it\'s not just streamers that offer the chance to earn drops. There will also be six general drops available for you to earn by watching any streamer\'s broadcasts. This means you can pick your favorite streamer and have a chance to earn these rewards.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to get these rare skins in Rust! Don\'t forget to join the Twitch Marathon tomorrow at 20:00 and get your rewards!</p>'),
(12187, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new batch of skins in the game Rust. New items, design, purchase and exchange options.'),
(12188, 'en-US', 'skins, new items, game Rust, skins batch, purchase, exchange, design'),
(12189, 'en-US', 'Lately, the developers of the game Rust do not cease to please fans with new and exciting skins. And today we have great news - a new batch of skins for your favorite survival on a wild island has been released!<br/><br/> In this batch of skins, you will find many interesting items that will allow you to stand out from the rest of the players and add individuality to your things. There are skins for everything from weapons and clothes to building materials and bags. Each skin is made in a unique style, which will give your game a new atmosphere and a sense of originality.<br/><br/> One of the key advantages of the new series of skins is their quality and detail. The developers paid special attention to details so that each skin was beautifully designed and original. You will be delighted with the design and texture of the new skins, which will perfectly complement your gaming experience.<br/><br/> But quality skins are not always available to every player. As a rule, they have their price and require considerable financial costs. Therefore, before buying, it is important to carefully evaluate your capabilities and decide whether you should invest in these skins.<br/><br/> However, keep in mind that skins in the game Rust not only improve the visual component, but can also affect your gaming capabilities. Some skins have additional properties, such as increasing attack speed or increasing the supply of ammo. Therefore, the right choice of skins can significantly affect the results of your battles and victories in the game.<br/><br/> Also, don\'t forget about the ability to sell and trade skins with other players. If you get tired of using a certain skin, you can always exchange it for another one or sell it on the game\'s marketplace. This is a great way to get extra funds in the game or buy a completely new collection of skins.<br/><br/> So, the new batch of skins in the game Rust is a great opportunity to add individuality to your game collection, stand out from other players and improve your gaming capabilities. Be careful when choosing and do not forget about all the financial and strategic aspects of buying and using skins. Happy shopping and enjoy the game!'),
(12190, 'en-US', 'New Twitch drop for skins in the game Rust'),
(12191, 'en-US', 'Find out more about the new Twitch skin drop in Rust. Register on Twitch and get unique skins!'),
(12192, 'en-US', 'Twitch drop, skins, game Rust, Twitch, news, update, collection'),
(12193, 'en-US', '<h2>New Twitch drop for skins in the game Rust</h2><br/><p> Great news for fans of the game Rust! Very soon on the Twitch platform a new Twitch drop will start, which will allow you to get unique skins for the game. The event will take place from August 9, 2022 at 20:00 to August 14, 2022 at 01:00 Moscow time.</p><br/><p> We are happy to announce that the full list of skins that you can get as part of the Twitch drop is now available. Now you can check out these skins in advance and choose the ones that you especially like.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to update your Rust skin collection. Sign up for Twitch and follow our channels to stay up to date with all the news and get access to Twitch drops for Rust skins. Good luck!</p>'),
(12194, 'en-US', 'Rust update today at 21:00'),
(12195, 'en-US', 'Today at 9:00 PM, Rust will receive an update that will bring new features and functionality such as the Molotov cocktail, flashbang grenades, a new locomotive, freight cars and much more.'),
(12196, 'en-US', 'Rust update, new features, molotov cocktail, flashbang grenades, locomotive, freight cars, train depot, coal tower, light switches, wooden signs'),
(12197, 'en-US', '<h2>Rust update today at 21:00</h2><br/><p><br/> Today, at 21:00, the game Rust will receive a long-awaited update. In this article, we will tell you about the upcoming changes that await players.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> Meet the new features that will become available after the update:<br/></p><br/><ul><br/><li> Molotov cocktail</li><br/><li> Flashbang grenades</li><br/><li> New locomotive</li><br/><li> Freight cars</li><br/><li> Changes to the Railway Depot</li><br/><li> Use of coal tower</li><br/><li> Light switches on monuments</li><br/><li> Wooden signs have been updated</li><br/></ul><br/><p><br/> If you want to know more details about the update, visit our VK group: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a><br/></p><br/><p><br/> Don\'t miss the Rust update today at 21:00 and enjoy the new features coming to the game!<br/></p>'),
(12198, 'en-US', 'Survival Festival in RUST: discounts on Steam up to 50%'),
(12199, 'en-US', 'Take part in the survival festival in RUST and get discounts up to 50% on Steam! Discover the exciting world of survival in a multiplayer game.'),
(12200, 'en-US', 'survival festival, discounts, RUST, steam games, multiplayer game'),
(12201, 'en-US', '<p>Get ready for exciting adventures in the world of survival! The survival festival in the popular game RUST has started on Steam, accompanied by incredible discounts - up to 50%!</p><br/><br/><p> RUST is a multiplayer game where you have to survive, build bases, create weapons and fight for resources in a cruel world. Your ingenuity and survival skills will be a real test!</p><br/><br/><p> The RUST Survival Festival is a great time to join millions of players, dive into exciting battles and improve your survival skills. And the best thing is, with discounts up to 50%, you can try this amazing game at a more affordable price!</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to dive into the world of RUST and become a real survivor! Download the game right now and enjoy a unique survival experience.</p>'),
(12202, 'en-US', 'Take part in our exciting giveaway and win 3 unique skins from the community. All information is available in the special giveaway channel.'),
(12203, 'en-US', 'giveaway, skins, community, participation, information, channel'),
(12204, 'en-US', '<p>You have a unique opportunity to win 3 skins provided by the community! Hurry up to take part in our exciting giveaway. All the necessary information is available in the special giveaway channel.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget that skins are a great way to freshen up and diversify your Rust gaming experience. They can give your items a new unique look that will make you stand out from other players. And now you have a chance to get not one, but three skins!</p><br/><br/><p> All information about participation in the draw is in the special draw channel. We provide you with clear instructions so that you do not have any questions or doubts. Just follow the steps given to participate.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to make your game even more amazing with new skins. Join the giveaway right now and maybe the following three unique skins will decorate your inventory!</p>'),
(12205, 'en-US', 'Geitta Garage Door (Twitch Drops) 5th Contender'),
(12206, 'en-US', 'Check out the fifth Twitch Drop contender, the Geitta Garage Door in Rust. Check out the features and design of this rare garage skin and decide if it\'s worth your attention.'),
(12207, 'en-US', 'Geitta Garage Door, Twitch Drops, Rust, Garage Skin'),
(12208, 'en-US', 'This article takes a look at the fifth Twitch Drop contender in Rust, the Geitta Garage Door. Find out how to get this rare skin and how it can improve your garage in the game. We’ll also take a look at its design and features so you can decide if it’s worth your attention. Join us as we learn more about the Geitta Garage Door and its significance in the Rust gaming world.'),
(12209, 'en-US', 'Changes in hardcore mode'),
(12210, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam has seen significant changes to the hardcore mode, bringing a new level of realism and intensity to the gameplay. Find out how local chat and the removal of global chat help create a more authentic gaming experience!'),
(12211, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, updates, hardcore mode, local chat, global chat, realism, communication, tact'),
(12212, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam has seen significant changes to the hardcore mode, bringing a new level of realism and intensity to the gameplay. One of the most notable innovations is the introduction of local chat, which will only work within a radius of hundreds of meters. This means that players will now be able to communicate only with those who are close to them, which will add more interaction and tact to communication between players.<br/><br/> Along with this change, global chat has been completely removed from the game. Players will no longer be able to use global chat to communicate with players across the entire map. This decision was made to make the game even more realistic and authentic, as well as to allow for more realistic player interactions in the game world.<br/><br/> These changes to the hardcore mode are intended to make the Rust gaming experience even more intense and exciting. Players will now have to be more careful and tactful in communicating with other players, as all communication will be limited to a radius of hundreds of meters. This opens up new opportunities for interaction and strategy in the game.<br/><br/> New changes to the hardcore mode will allow players to immerse themselves even more deeply in the world of Rust, where every decision and action has its consequences. Global chat has been removed to emphasize the importance of communication and interaction within the game world. This approach adds realism and creates a real adrenaline atmosphere that many players are looking for.<br/><br/> If you love the Hardcore mode in Rust, these changes are sure to add a new spice and interest to your gaming experience. Dive into the world of Rust and impress other players with your tactical skills and communication within a radius of hundreds of meters, turning this game into a real test of survival.'),
(12213, 'en-US', 'Join the world of Rust and check out the latest batch of new skins coming to the game! In this article, we talk about the importance of choosing skins, their uniqueness, and price.'),
(12214, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, skins batch, skin selection, skin price');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(12215, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust, where new and exciting skins for your items are released every day! In this article, we will take a look at the latest batch of impressive skins that have just appeared in the game Rust on Steam.</p><br/><p> New skins are not only a way to change the look of your stuff, but also a great way to stand out from other players and add a little personality to your game. Each batch of skins offers a wide range of styles, colors, and designs so that everyone can find something they like.</p><br/><p> One of the main features of the new skins is their uniqueness. Each skin has its own story and significance, which can be related to events in the world of Rust or simply be an amazing piece of art. This makes each skin unique and important for collectors and fans of the game.</p><br/><p> When you browse through the new batch of skins, you have the opportunity to find something that reflects your personality and suits your gameplay tactics. Whether it\'s a camouflage that will help you hide from enemies, or a bright and noticeable design to inspire fear among other players - the choice is yours!</p><br/><p> However, when choosing skins, you should consider several factors. First, you should make sure that the skin suits your needs and preferences. After all, you will use it every time you play Rust, so it is important to choose a skin that you really like.</p><br/><p> In addition, it is worth considering the price of the skins. Some of the new skins can be quite expensive, especially if they are highly popular and in demand among players. Therefore, before buying a skin, it is recommended to evaluate your budget and make a decision based on this.</p><br/><p> In conclusion, the new batch of skins in the game Rust on Steam is an opportunity to add personality, style and uniqueness to your gaming life. Do not miss the chance to join the many players who are already enjoying the delights of the new skins in Rust. Discover new possibilities and plunge into the world of endless combinations with the help of new skins!</p>'),
(12216, 'en-US', 'Hardcore mode update in the game Rust'),
(12217, 'en-US', 'The hardcore mode update in Rust introduces changes that make the game even more realistic and challenging. Safe zones, turrets and scientists will be removed, but the structures will remain. Find out how these changes will affect the gameplay and add new challenges for players.'),
(12218, 'en-US', 'update, hardcore mode, Rust game, safe zones, turrets, scientists, buildings'),
(12219, 'en-US', '<p>Steam game Rust is updating its hardcore mode, introducing changes that will make the game even more challenging and dangerous. The new version of the hardcore mode will remove safe zones, as well as turrets and scientists, adding more realism and challenges to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> One of the major changes is the removal of safe zones, which previously allowed players to rest and recover from external threats. Now, every player will be exposed to danger at any point on the map, increasing the need to be vigilant and choose cover carefully.</p><br/><p> It was also decided to remove the turrets and scientists that previously helped players fight hostile creatures and allowed them to obtain valuable information. Now players will rely entirely on their skills and tactical thinking to survive and thrive in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> However, a wide variety of structures will still remain, giving players the opportunity to create their own bases and defend them from other players. This adds an element of strategy and tactics to the gameplay, where players must skillfully use available resources to protect their territories.</p><br/><p> The Hardcore Mode update in Rust adds a new challenge for players, introducing changes that make the game even more realistic and intense. The removal of safe zones, turrets and scientists requires players to be more vigilant and make tactical decisions. The future of the world of Rust depends only on your survival!</p>'),
(12220, 'en-US', 'Who knows what kind of guy he is?'),
(12221, 'en-US', 'Learn about the different types of characters in Rust and choose the role that suits you best. Explorer, builder, fighter or trader - the decision is yours!'),
(12222, 'en-US', 'character types, Rust, explorers, builders, fighters, traders'),
(12223, 'en-US', '<p>Have you heard about the popular game Rust on Steam? Sure, it has won many hearts of players thanks to its open sandbox and addictive gameplay. But what about the types of characters you can meet in this game? Let\'s find out!</p><br/><br/><h2> Researchers</h2><br/><p> Always been curious and adventurous? Then explorers are the character type that\'s perfect for you. They explore the world of Rust, discovering new locations, finding useful resources, and interacting with other players.</p><br/><br/><h2> Builders</h2><br/><p> If you are more inclined to the creative side of the game, then the builder character type is for you. They are masters at creating bases, castles and fortifications, making them inaccessible to enemies and protecting their valuable resources.</p><br/><br/><h2> Militants</h2><br/><p> Or maybe you are attracted by the adrenaline of the fight? Then fighters are your choice. They fight other players, steal their resources and protect their territory. Combat in Rust can be brutal and intense, but that is what makes it so exciting.</p><br/><br/><h2> Traders</h2><br/><p> Do you have an entrepreneurial spirit? Then you will enjoy the role of a merchant. Such characters buy and sell goods, build stores and create their own trading empires. They can earn a large amount of game resources if they have a good sense for business.</p><br/><br/><p> But don\'t forget that choosing a character type in Rust is just the beginning of your journey. You\'ll have to make a lot of decisions, balance different aspects of the game, and overcome various obstacles. Who knows what type? Now you know, and the choice is up to you!</p>'),
(12224, 'en-US', 'AnnoyPrincess (Twitch Drops) Fourth Contender'),
(12225, 'en-US', 'Learn more about AnnoyPrincess, the fourth contender for Twitch Drops in Rust. Find out what rewards you can earn and how to increase your chances of success.'),
(12226, 'en-US', 'AnnoyPrincess, Twitch Drops, fourth contender, skins, items, Rust, Steam, rewards, odds, game.'),
(12227, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll take a look at AnnoyPrincess, the fourth member of Twitch Drops, which offers amazing rewards for the game Rust on Steam. We\'ll learn what skins and items you can get, and what trade-offs you might have to make along the way. This article will help you better understand how to increase your chances of getting these goodies and enjoy the game even more. Join us!'),
(12228, 'en-US', 'Hardcore mode: new information'),
(12229, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest changes to the hardcore game mode Rust, including the absence of greenery, research tree, map, safe zone and copters.'),
(12230, 'en-US', 'Hardcore mode, new information, green stuff, research branch, map, safe zone, copters'),
(12231, 'en-US', 'Development of a hardcore mode in the game Rust has begun'),
(12232, 'en-US', 'In the world of the game Rust, the development of a new game mode has started - hardcore mode. This mode will add new challenges and an atmosphere of survival to the game.'),
(12233, 'en-US', 'development, mode, hardcore, Rust game, softcore, mechanics, servers, authenticity, nostalgia, challenge, extreme conditions, casual game, survival'),
(12234, 'en-US', 'Development of a new game mode has begun - hardcore.<br/><br/> In the world of the game Rust, development of a new game mode has begun - hardcore mode. This mode differs from the usual softcore, which simplifies some mechanics of the game and makes it more forgiving to player errors (for example, not all items disappear upon death). Hardcore mode, on the contrary, will seek to get rid of some existing systems, such as the command system.<br/><br/> For those who played Rust in 2016-2017, the hardcore mode will provide an opportunity to return to that era, where some of the current mechanics were missing, while additional elements of the game will become even more brutal. This will create an atmosphere of authenticity and evoke nostalgia for veterans of the game.<br/><br/> It is important to emphasize that the hardcore mode will be optional and will not affect the overall gameplay. Hardcore servers will be separate from regular servers and will offer a choice for those who want to experience the game in more extreme conditions and consider the current game too casual.<br/><br/> Hardcore mode in the game Rust will provide a new challenge for all players and add variety to the gameplay. All fans of the game will have an exciting immersion in the atmosphere of survival in the harsh world of the game.'),
(12235, 'en-US', 'Want to get a free Clatter helmet? Here\'s how!'),
(12236, 'en-US', 'Want to get a free Clatter helmet in Rust? Our member has prepared a guide with detailed instructions. Read the article and like it!'),
(12237, 'en-US', 'free clatter helmet guide get rust like'),
(12238, 'en-US', '<p>We would like to remind you about the opportunity to get the Clatter helmet for FREE. This epic helmet is a real find for fans of the game Rust! But how and where to get it?</p><br/><p> There is one member in our community who has prepared a detailed guide on how to get the Clatter helmet absolutely free. In the guide, you will find all the necessary instructions and tips to successfully get this helmet and make your character even more stylish.</p><br/><p> If you liked the guide and it helped you, don\'t forget to like it. Expressing gratitude to the author is the best way to support and inspire him to create new useful materials!</p><br/><p> To read the full guide and get the Clatter helmet, follow the link:</p><br/><p> <a href=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2840306345\">https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2840306345</a></p>'),
(12239, 'en-US', 'Willjum Wolf Bandana (Twitch Drops) Third Contender'),
(12240, 'en-US', 'Learn more about the Willjum Wolf Bandana, the third Twitch Drop contender in Rust. A unique cosmetic item that you can get for free by watching Twitch streams.'),
(12241, 'en-US', 'Willjum Wolf Bandana, Twitch Drops, Rust, Third Contender, Skins, Twitch Streams'),
(12242, 'en-US', '<h2>Willjum Wolf Bandana: Third Twitch Drop Contender</h2><br/><p> In this article, we will be looking at the Willjum Wolf Bandana, the third contender for Twitch Drops in Rust. This stylish and unique decoration adds a unique touch to your character in the game.</p><br/><p> The Willjum Wolf Bandana is part of a limited edition skin distributed via Twitch Drops, meaning you can get this item absolutely free just by watching Twitch streams.</p><br/><p> Being the third contender for Twitch Drops means that the Willjum Wolf Bandana is one of the last skins to be released as part of this promotion. All of the previous skins have caught the attention of players with their style and quality, and the Willjum Wolf Bandana is no exception.</p><br/><p> Acquiring the Willjum Wolf Bandana via Twitch Drops has its own set of rules. You will need to connect your Steam account to your Twitch account and then watch included streams to have a chance of receiving this skin. The more time you spend streaming, the higher your chance of receiving the Willjum Wolf Bandana.</p><br/><p> Willjum Wolf Bandana is a great addition to your Rust gaming experience. This bright and stylish item will allow you to stand out from the rest of the players, highlighting your individual style.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to get the Willjum Wolf Bandana, become the third contender for Twitch Drops, and add some uniqueness to your Rust game!</p>'),
(12243, 'en-US', 'Interactive character animation in the game Rust'),
(12244, 'en-US', 'A new feature has been added to the game Rust - interactive character animation. Now the player on the transport can be seen during the rotation of his head and other body movements.'),
(12245, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, interactive character animation, head rotation, body movements'),
(12246, 'en-US', '<p>A new feature has been added to the game Rust, which makes the gameplay even more realistic and interesting. Now, when a character is in transport, other players will be able to see not just a statically sitting character, but also watch the rotation of his head and perhaps even other body movements.</p><br/><br/><p> This new feature adds realistic details to the interactions between characters in the game. Now, when you transport other players or are in a vehicle yourself, your actions will be visible to the players around you. They will be able to watch you, see how you turn your head, talk to fellow travelers, or perform other actions.</p><br/><br/><p> This adds a new level of interaction and role-playing. You don\'t just have to sit statically on a vehicle, you can actively interact with the world around you and other players. This can be useful for team play, cooperation, and creating more realistic situations when interacting with other players.</p><br/><br/><p> It can also add more emotional dimension to the game. Your head movements and other body movements can express your feelings and emotions in the game world. This can be especially useful when interacting with other players in a role-playing game or when creating different scenarios.</p><br/><br/><p> So, the new interactive character animation feature in Rust adds more realism, interaction and emotion to the gameplay. You will be able to actively express yourself on transport and create more unique and interesting situations in the game.</p>'),
(12247, 'en-US', 'Work on the electric stove continues in the test branch'),
(12248, 'en-US', 'Work on the Electric Furnace continues on the Rust test branch. Find out how it will work and what features it will provide in the new article.'),
(12249, 'en-US', 'electric stove, update, game Rust, energy source, melt resources, release date'),
(12250, 'en-US', 'Work on the Electric Furnace continues on the Rust test branch. Interested players can already hint at potential changes with this new item. How will this furnace work and what capabilities will it provide?<br/><br/> The Electric Furnace is a new feature that will allow players to smelt resources without the need for wood. If you have access to a power source, you can easily use it to power the furnace. This can greatly simplify the process of obtaining the necessary materials and resources for various aspects of the game.<br/><br/> Players who want to use the Electric Furnace are eagerly awaiting the release date of this update. Unfortunately, the official developers have not yet provided any exact information on when we can expect this new functionality to be released. However, the Rust community is confident that this feature will be added to the game in the near future and will open up new possibilities for players.'),
(12251, 'en-US', 'Panpots Garage Door (Twitch Drops) - Second Contender'),
(12252, 'en-US', 'Learn about the Panpots Garage Door, the second contender for Twitch Drops in Rust. Uniquely designed and obtainable via Twitch streams.'),
(12253, 'en-US', 'Panpots Garage Door, Twitch Drops, Rust, skin door, skins getting, game items'),
(12254, 'en-US', '<h2>Panpots Garage Door (Twitch Drops) - Second Contender</h2><br/><p> The second contender for Twitch Drops in Rust is the Panpots Garage Door. With extensive customization options for its appearance, this door skin is an attractive choice for all Rust players. In this article, we will go into details about the Panpots Garage Door and how you can get it through Twitch Drops.</p><br/><p> One of the main features of Panpots Garage Door is its unique design, which embodies style and individuality. Replacing the usual metal door with this skin will give your garage or house in the game Rust a unique look.</p><br/><p> The installation of Panpots Garage Door is quite simple and does not require any special skills. Just find the perfect place for the door, install it and enjoy your new design.</p><br/><p> Now let’s talk about how to get Panpots Garage Door via Twitch Drops. Twitch Drops event gives players a chance to get various skins and items for the game Rust, including Panpots Garage Door. To do this, you need to fulfill certain conditions related to watching streams on Twitch.</p><br/><p> For every certain amount of time you watch streams, you can get one or more skins for the game Rust, including Panpots Garage Door. The longer you watch streams, the more chances you have to get this skin and other epic items.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget that the Panpots Garage Door Twitch Drops are only available for a limited time, so don\'t miss your chance to get this awesome Rust skin.</p><br/><p> In conclusion, Panpots Garage Door is a choice that will allow you to stand out from other players and give your garage or home a special atmosphere. Don\'t forget to watch the Twitch Drops event and get your exclusive skin.</p>'),
(12255, 'en-US', 'Sound updates and new bonuses in the game Rust'),
(12256, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has brought changes to the soundtrack and new bonuses for players. Find out what changes have occurred and how they will affect the gameplay.'),
(12257, 'en-US', 'sound updates, double mvk door, tea for scrap, bonuses in the game Rust'),
(12258, 'en-US', 'The latest update to the Rust game has brought some interesting changes. One of them is the reworking of the sounds of the double mvk door. Now players can enjoy a more realistic atmosphere and improved sound when opening and closing this door.<br/><br/> But that\'s not all! The update also brought changes to the resource acquisition system. Scrap tea now gives more scrap and its effect lasts longer, allowing players to use this bonus more effectively.<br/><br/> These changes are designed to make the gameplay more fun and interesting for all players. The new double mvk door sound adds realism, and the improved tea bonus for scrap will help players develop faster and reach new heights in the game Rust.'),
(12259, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news and updates on the Rust Workshop Collection sequels. This article covers new items, weapons, and cosmetic updates that add style and features to the game.'),
(12260, 'en-US', 'news, continuation, collections, workshop, game Rust'),
(12261, 'en-US', '<h2>News on continuations of collections from the workshop</h2><br/><br/><p> In this article we will tell you about the newest and most interesting continuations of the collections from the game workshop.</p><br/><br/><p> 1. Graffiti Box - The new Rust update introduces a box with various graffiti that you can use to decorate your play space. This is a great way to add personality to your game.</p><br/><br/><p> 2. Toxic Dragon Axe - A new weapon that you get in the game Rust. This pickaxe has an incredible weapon property and will help you in battles with enemies.</p><br/><br/><p> 3. Kevlar - MP5 - A new cosmetic item is available in Rust. It is a Kevlar suit decorated with an MP5, giving you extra protection and style in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> 4. Star And Moon Stove is a new piece of furniture added to the game Rust. This stove is decorated with stars and moon, which creates a special atmosphere in your base camp. It also has the functionality to light a fire and cook food.</p><br/><br/><p> 5. Willjum Wolf Bandana - A new cosmetic bandana for your character in Rust. It adds style and personality to your character and will help him stand out from other players.</p><br/><br/><p> 6. Salty Zombies Sleeping Bag - A new sleeping item that will keep you comfortable and protected while you rest. This is especially useful for long Rust sessions.</p><br/><br/><p> 7. Toxic Dragon Axe - A new weapon that will be available in the next Rust update. This axe has a unique poisonous ability, making it especially deadly in combat.</p><br/><br/><p> So get ready for more Rust Workshop collections to come, adding new items, features, and style!</p>'),
(12262, 'en-US', 'New Flashbang Grenades Coming Soon to Rust'),
(12263, 'en-US', 'A new weapon will appear in the development of the game Rust - flashbang grenades, capable of creating a deafening noise and bright flashes that attract the attention of enemies.'),
(12264, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, flashbangs'),
(12265, 'en-US', '<p>Another exciting new element has arrived in the Rust development - flashbang grenades! This new weapon, which will soon be added to the game, promises to create additional opportunities for players.</p><br/><p> Flashbangs are a unique combination of explosion and sound effects, creating a powerful distraction in the game world of Rust. They can create deafening noise and bright flashes, attracting the attention of enemies and giving you a chance to perform tactical maneuvers or gain an advantage in combat.</p><br/><p> The Rust team is currently hard at work bringing this idea to the game. If you\'re already feeling the grip of new grenades and the excitement of new possibilities, don\'t wait to try out the Flashbangs!</p>'),
(12266, 'en-US', 'Aux02: Latest changes coming, available for testing next month!'),
(12267, 'en-US', 'Looks interesting? Come to the Staging Branch and try the new Aux02 Trainyardupdate in Rust now!'),
(12268, 'en-US', 'Aux02, Rust, testing, updates, Trainyardupdate, Staging Branch'),
(12269, 'en-US', 'If you\'ve always wanted to be the first to experience the latest Rust updates, now\'s your chance! Open the Staging Branch and dive into the world of Aux02 Trainyardupdate.'),
(12270, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins! - Welcome to the world of new possibilities'),
(12271, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins in Rust and explore a world of endless possibilities and individuality!'),
(12272, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, game Rust, skins in Rust, individuality, possibilities'),
(12273, 'en-US', '<h2>New batch of skins! - Welcome to the world of new possibilities</h2><br/><p> Rust is a lively and exciting online multiplayer survival simulator that has won millions of hearts around the world. This game offers freedom of choice and unlimited opportunities to thrive in the vast expanses of the virtual world.</p><br/><p> One of the main appeals of Rust is the skins, which allow players to customize the appearance of their items, weapons, and tools. With unique skins, the game gains new depth and the ability to express your individuality.</p><br/><p> And so, with trembling hearts, we present you with a new batch of skins for the game Rust! New options, designs and color solutions - all this awaits you!</p><br/><p> Thanks to the new skins, you will be able to remake your items in your own way, add unique details to them and stand out from the crowd. Your weapons, base paints, protective elements - everything will become the object of your imagination, and you will be able to create a unique image of a survivor in these harsh conditions.</p><br/><p> In addition, new skins can be not only a great way to customize, but also a way to earn money. Using trading skills, you can sell or exchange your skins with other players, opening up new opportunities for development.</p><br/><p> However, it is worth remembering that choosing a skin is not only a matter of external aesthetics, but also of game strategy. Some skins not only improve your chances of survival, but also attract the attention of opponents. Therefore, it is important to find a balance between style and tactics to make the right choice for your gaming session.</p><br/><p> So, welcome to the amazing world of new possibilities with a new batch of skins for the game Rust! Dive into the ocean of creativity, and be sure that your gaming surface will never be boring and monotonous. Let your individuality shine among other survivors!</p>'),
(12274, 'en-US', 'Changed oven interface, Molotov cocktails and much more!'),
(12275, 'en-US', 'The latest Rust Steam updates have seen changes to the oven interface, as well as the addition of Molotov cocktails and the possible introduction of flashbang grenades. Find out more in our article!'),
(12276, 'en-US', 'Changes to the oven interface, Molotov cocktails, Rust game updates, Steam, flashbangs'),
(12277, 'en-US', '<p>The latest updates to Rust on Steam have brought some interesting changes to the in-game oven interface. Now, players have a much more convenient way to manage the cooking process. The new interface design adds functionality and makes it easier to control the temperature and cooking time.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the most anticipated new features was the introduction of Molotov cocktails. The developers are currently working on this new item and have already released the first fix for the Molotov cocktail. We will be able to see it in action on a separate development branch. The Molotov cocktail is a throwable incendiary weapon that can be used to create a fiery hellish whirlwind.</p><br/><br/><p> The animation for a Molotov cocktail might look like this: the player pulls out a bottle, lights the fuse, and throws it, setting the entire area on fire. We\'ll keep an eye out for more updates and keep you up to date with the latest news.</p><br/><br/><p> It also became known that another interesting weapon may appear in the game Rust in the near future - flashbang grenades. They will be able to serve as an effective means of removing enemies and creating chaos on the battlefield.</p><br/><br/><p> To get more detailed information about all the updates, join our community in VK. There you will be able to find out all the latest news and discuss it with other players.</p>'),
(12278, 'en-US', 'This article announces the date for Charitable Rust 2022. Find out more about the event, the charity, and special rewards.'),
(12279, 'en-US', 'charity event, Charitable Rust, 2022, World Central Kitchen, Twitch, broadcast, guests, Twitch Drops'),
(12280, 'en-US', 'The date for Charitable Rust 2022 has been announced. This year, the charity will be World Central Kitchen.<br/><br/> The event will take place on November 19, 2022 (subject to change) and will be hosted by the Rustafied and Rust community on the Twitch platform. The event will last 12 hours and will start at 19:00 Moscow time.<br/><br/> During this time, special broadcasts will be held with invited guests. You will be able to enjoy interesting conversations and gaming sessions presented by our special guests.<br/><br/> One of the main attractions of this event is the exclusive Twitch Drops. Simply watch the stream for a chance to get unique items in the game Rust.'),
(12281, 'en-US', 'The Rust store will add the egg costume back in 2023 for $12'),
(12282, 'en-US', 'The Rust store will once again feature a new rare item, the Egg Costume. It will be available from 2023 for only $12. Find out more about the new item and how to purchase it in the article.'),
(12283, 'en-US', 'Rust shop, egg suit, Eggsuit, rare item, price, availability, original design'),
(12284, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust store will once again have a new item for purchase: the Egg Costume. It will be available from 2023 and will cost only $12.</p><br/><p> The Eggsuit, also known as the Eggsuit, is a rare item that is currently sold at an inflated price of $1,800. However, the game developers have decided to add it to the store at a more affordable price. Now, every player will be able to buy this suit and add it to their collection.</p><br/><p> The Egg Costume is an original item that looks like a large egg. It has a unique design and can be a colorful addition to your character. Get ready to show the world your creativity and originality with the Egg Costume in Rust.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to purchase a new item for your character for only $12. Make your character unique and stand out from other players in the world of Rust.</p>'),
(12285, 'en-US', 'Bloody/A4Tech/X7 Mouse Blocking in Rust - News and Hope for Changes'),
(12286, 'en-US', 'Bloody/A4Tech/X7 mouse brands are blocked in the game Rust. The developers are actively working on the issue and players expect positive changes.'),
(12287, 'en-US', 'Mouse Lock, Bloody, A4Tech, X7, Rust, Developers, Changes'),
(12288, 'en-US', '<p>Bloody/A4Tech/X7 mouse brands have been blocked in the popular game Rust for a long time. This problem has caused a lot of dissatisfaction among players, but there is hope for positive changes.</p><br/><p> The Rust team has turned their attention to this issue. Alistair, one of the developers, shared information that the Bloody/A4Tech/X7 mouse lock is currently being actively discussed.</p><br/><p> While the exact details of the changes remain unknown, players are hoping that the developers will find an optimal solution to this problem. After all, blocking the mouse can seriously affect the gameplay and satisfaction from the game.</p><br/><p> However, it is important to understand that decisions related to blocking Bloody/A4Tech/X7 mice are difficult compromises. Various factors must be taken into account, such as fairness of gameplay, measures against unfair practices, and satisfying the needs of the majority of players.</p><br/><p> Overall, the Bloody/A4Tech/X7 mouse lock in Rust remains a hot topic of discussion, with players hoping for changes that will allow them to enjoy the game to its full potential.</p>'),
(12289, 'en-US', 'Taunted SAP (Twitch Drops) - First Challenger'),
(12290, 'en-US', 'Learn about the Taunted SAP, the first Twitch Drops contender for Rust on Steam. A unique SAP weapon skin that you can earn by watching streams on Twitch.'),
(12291, 'en-US', 'Taunted SAP, Rust, Steam, Twitch Drops, Game Skins, SAP Weapons'),
(12292, 'en-US', '<p>If you are a fan of the game Rust on Steam, you probably know that skins are an important part of the gameplay. They allow you to add personality and style to your character, highlight its features and stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> And one of the first contenders for the status of the most popular skin was Taunted SAP. This skin was released as part of Twitch Drops - a unique system that allows you to receive game items and skins simply by watching broadcasts on the Twitch platform.</p><br/><p> Taunted SAP is a skin for the SAP weapon, which is one of the most popular and versatile in the game Rust. It features a special color scheme and pattern that will give your weapon a unique look.</p><br/><p> To get the Taunted SAP, you will need to watch a specified number of hours of Twitch Drops enabled on the channel giving away the skin. This may be a bit of a challenge for some players, but succeeding in this endeavor will give you the satisfaction of owning a unique skin and the envy of other players.</p><br/><p> So, if you are looking for exclusivity and want to stand out in the world of Rust, Taunted SAP (Twitch Drops) is the perfect choice for you. Watch streams, get free skins and become a real contender for the title of the owner of the rarest items in the game.</p>'),
(12293, 'en-US', 'Add a unique Clatter helmet to your inventory'),
(12294, 'en-US', 'Add a unique Clatter helmet to your inventory in Rust. Clatter is now available for free, to get the helmet, you need to spend about an hour in Clatter.'),
(12295, 'en-US', 'Clatter helmet, Rust game, inventory, free, Clatter game'),
(12296, 'en-US', '<p>Owners of the game Rust on Steam have a unique opportunity to expand their inventory with a new item - the Clatter helmet. This helmet will not only strengthen your defense, but also add a stylish look to your character.</p><br/><p> But that\'s not all! The developers of the game Clatter announced the transition to a free distribution model. Now everyone can try themselves in this exciting game absolutely free.</p><br/><p> To get a special Clatter helmet, you only need to spend about an hour in the game Clatter. Show your skills and earn this unique item, which will be a great addition to your arsenal in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to decorate your character and increase its defense with the new Clatter helmet. Log in to Clatter and start playing today!</p>'),
(12297, 'en-US', 'Twich Rivals Event and New Twich Drops Round: Details and Participants'),
(12298, 'en-US', 'Get all the details on the Twich Rivals event and the new round of Twich Drops, where you can watch famous streamers play Rust on Steam.'),
(12299, 'en-US', 'Twich Rivals, Twich Drops, event, participants, Rust game on Steam, streamers, prize pool'),
(12300, 'en-US', '<p>From August 9 to 13, another exciting Twich Rivals event will take place, which will not leave fans of the game Rust on Steam indifferent. Along with it, a new round of Twich Drops will start, which will captivate all fans of streaming and perfectly complement the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> This time, four teams will take part in the competition, fighting for a total prize pool of $100,000. Such a serious amount of money undoubtedly fuels the excitement of the participants and makes the event even more memorable.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main advantages of Twich Rivals is the opportunity to watch the gameplay and strategies of famous streamers. Among the participants, you will see such famous personalities as hJune, Liquid Mendo, xQc, Willjum and many more.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to dive into the exciting world of Rust with professionals in their field and experience all the basics and nuances of the game. Follow the Twich Rivals and Twich Drops events to stay up to date with all the plot twists and interesting moments that the organizers have carefully prepared for you.</p>'),
(12301, 'en-US', 'First information about the Molotov cocktail model has appeared | Rust News'),
(12302, 'en-US', 'The first information about the Molotov cocktail model in the game Rust has appeared. Three variants of the Molotov cocktail will be presented - broken, empty and full. The developers have just started working on this weapon, so details are limited for now. Find out more about the impact of the new model on the gameplay and strategy of the game Rust.'),
(12303, 'en-US', 'Molotov cocktail model, Rust news, weapons, survival, gameplay'),
(12304, 'en-US', 'First information about the Molotov cocktail model has appeared<p> The world of Rust has received some long-awaited information about the Molotov cocktail model. The developers have announced that three versions of this weapon will be presented: broken, empty, and full. It is known that this work has just begun, so there is little to show at the moment.</p><p> The Molotov cocktail is a weapon that was originally designed to burn enemy personnel. Interestingly, its name is derived from the person involved - Fyodor Molotov, a high-ranking Soviet politician.</p><p> The new Molotov Cocktail model is a major addition to Rust\'s gameplay. It will allow players to craft and use this fiery item in the fight for survival. Players will now be able to choose between different Molotov Cocktail variants, depending on their needs and gameplay strategy.</p><p> However, it is worth remembering that weapons are not always the best solution to a problem in Rust. The game developers are constantly balancing various factors to ensure fun and fair gameplay. Updates and additions like the new Molotov cocktail model require careful consideration and analysis, as they can affect the game\'s economy and the fight for territory.</p><p> In conclusion, the new Molotov model in Rust is a notable update that will bring new possibilities and strategies to the fight for survival. However, to succeed in the game, it is important for players to consider not only the new weapons, but also other aspects of the game, such as interaction with other players and risk assessment.</p><br/><p> What do you think about the new Molotov cocktail model? Would you like to use it in the game Rust?</p>'),
(12305, 'en-US', 'Development of Molotov cocktail has begun'),
(12306, 'en-US', 'Learn about the early development of the Molotov cocktail in Rust and how it will impact gameplay.'),
(12307, 'en-US', 'Game Rust, updates, Molotov cocktail'),
(12308, 'en-US', 'News related to the update of the game Rust on Steam'),
(12309, 'en-US', 'New skins in the game Rust: a huge choice for fans!'),
(12310, 'en-US', 'Find out all about the new skins in the game Rust and how they will help you stand out and emphasize your style on the playing field. The updated Steam store offers a huge selection of skins, satisfying a wide variety of tastes and preferences.'),
(12311, 'en-US', 'skins in the game Rust, update skins Rust, new design variations, individuality in the game, updated Steam store'),
(12312, 'en-US', '<h2>New skins in the game Rust: a huge choice for fans!</h2><br/><p> Dear Rust players! We are pleased to inform you that a new batch of exciting skins has been added to the game. Now you have the opportunity to update the appearance of your character, weapons and items with new variations and designs.</p><br/><br/><p> Adding new skins is a great way to refresh your gaming experience and stand out from the crowd. Stimulate your creativity and create a unique look for your character! A large selection of colors, patterns, and styles will help you find the perfect option to suit your preferences and create a unique style.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins provide great opportunities for individuality and self-expression. Now you can stand out from other players and become a real fashion leader on the playing field. Regardless of whether you prefer bright and memorable colors or stylish and minimalist designs - we have skins to suit all tastes.</p><br/><br/><p> We constantly update the skin catalog, adding new variations and models. This means that you always have the opportunity to choose exactly what you are looking for. Our development team carefully selects new skins to offer you only the best options and ensure high-quality design.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to bring your personality into the game and highlight your individual style. The updated skins are already available in the Steam store, so don\'t forget to check it out and check out the new items. New skins in the game Rust are an opportunity to stand out and leave your mark on the vastness of the virtual world!</p><br/><br/><p> By purchasing new skins, you will not only add novelty to your game, but also support the developers of Rust. After all, all funds received from the sale of skins go to further development of the game and improvement of the gameplay. So contribute to the development of Rust and enjoy the new opportunities that our skins offer you.</p>'),
(12313, 'en-US', 'On the aux branch, the interface of the stoves, barbecue and large stove has been redesigned'),
(12314, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest changes to the stove, grill and large stove interface on the Rust developer aux branch.'),
(12315, 'en-US', 'update, interface, oven, grill, large oven, Rust'),
(12316, 'en-US', 'On the aux branch, the interface of the stoves, barbecue and large stove has been redesigned.'),
(12317, 'en-US', 'Problems with freezing and crashes after the latest update in the game Rust on Steam'),
(12318, 'en-US', 'After the latest update of the game Rust on Steam, many players encountered problems with the game freezing and crashing. This article discusses the reasons for these problems and the developers\' plans to fix the problems.'),
(12319, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, freezes, crashes, problems, fixes'),
(12320, 'en-US', '<p>After the latest update of Rust was released on Steam, many players have found issues with the game freezing and crashing, which seriously disrupts their gaming experience. The inconvenience associated with these technical issues has caused a strong reaction in the player community.</p><br/><p> Fortunately, the developers are aware of the problem and are already actively working on fixing it. A patch is planned for the near future that will fix the problems and return the game to a full state.</p><br/><p> It is worth noting that this situation with freezing and crashing after the update is a sad example of the typical problems that developers face when updating large-scale online games. The balance between introducing new features and fixing technical problems is always a huge challenge.</p><br/><p> Rust players are eagerly awaiting the next patch, which the developers assure will address the game\'s major stability and security issues. However, it is important to understand that the process of fixing bugs and optimizing the game may take some time.</p><br/><p> In conclusion, Rust is on the way to improvement and stabilization, but still requires further efforts and patience from players. Hopefully, the developers will cope with the problems, and players will be able to enjoy the gameplay without unpleasant crashes.</p>'),
(12321, 'en-US', 'New sounds for weapons that were not updated in the previous version'),
(12322, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust brings new sound effects for weapons that haven\'t been updated before. Find out how the sounds have changed for weapons like the L-96, Boltovka, M-249, Python, Dvushka, Pipe, Yoka, and Pomp. Watch the video on the official channel of the game developers.'),
(12323, 'en-US', 'new sounds, update, weapons, Rust, L-96, Boltovka, M-249, Python, Dvushka, Pipe, Yoka, Pomp'),
(12324, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest update of the game Rust, the developers have made significant changes to the sounds of weapons that were not updated in previous versions. Now players can appreciate new sound effects for such popular weapons as the L-96, Boltovka, M-249, Python, Dvushka, Pipe, Yoka and Pomp.</p><p> Updated sound effects will allow you to fully immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the game and enjoy the realistic sounds of shots and reloading weapons. Each type of weapon has its own characteristic sound, which will help you better decide on the choice of weapon in the game world of Rust.</p><p> To check out the updated weapon sounds, you can watch the video posted on the official channel of the game developers: </p><br/><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gMPgsTabmtA\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),
(12325, 'en-US', 'Some fixes with the release of the new update'),
(12326, 'en-US', 'We are pleased to announce that with the release of a new update, a number of important fixes have been made to the game Rust, which significantly improve the gameplay. Find out more about the most significant changes that await you in the game Rust.'),
(12327, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, fixes, backpacks, stone, torch, water'),
(12328, 'en-US', '<p>We are pleased to announce that with the release of a new update to the game Rust, a number of important fixes have been introduced that significantly improve the gameplay.</p><br/><p> One of the most important fixes was the elimination of an issue with backpacks containing a stone and a torch. Previously, when using them, players would encounter a 30-second delay, but this has now been completely fixed.</p><br/><p> Also, an exploit related to changing the quality of water at level 8-9 has been fixed. Thanks to this fix, players will no longer encounter problems and will not use illegal methods to obtain high-quality water.</p><br/><p> The new update of the game Rust continues to make the game world more balanced and exciting. We are sure that all players will appreciate these changes and will be able to enjoy the game without unnecessary problems.</p>'),
(12329, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: review'),
(12330, 'en-US', 'Find out about an interesting new batch of skins in Rust. What advantages and disadvantages they may have, and how this affects the game balance and economy.'),
(12331, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust game, Steam, weapon skins, item skins, clothing skins, skin collecting, individuality in the game, game balance, game economy, balance of power, item value balance, developer responsibility, skin originality, availability of new skins, ways to get skins, Steam store, game events, game achievements, individuality of game image'),
(12332, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam never ceases to please its fans. The developers regularly release updates, which add new skins for weapons, items and clothes. Recently, a new batch of skins was added to the game, which will please all fans of collecting and individuality in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins allow players to add their own touch to the virtual world of Rust. They add variety and the ability to stand out from other players. With colorful and stylish skins, players can convey their preferences and atmosphere in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> However, adding new skins also affects the game balance and economy. Some players may pay attention to new skins and purchase them, which may change the balance of power and the cost of certain items. Game developers are obliged to take this aspect into account and balance new skins so that they do not affect the gameplay too much.</p><br/><br/><p> Selecting new skins is also a responsible task for developers. They must take into account the preferences of players, be creative in creating skins, and at the same time adhere to the style of the game and the proportions of the models. The originality and quality of new skins must meet the high standards of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> For players, it is important to have access to new skins. Developers should provide different ways to obtain skins so that players can collect them by participating in in-game events, achieving certain achievements, or purchasing them from the Steam store. This way, players feel engaged and motivated in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> A new batch of skins in the game Rust is a long-awaited event for many players. They get the opportunity to refresh their game image, stand out from other players and demonstrate their individuality. It is important that the addition of new skins occurs with the observance of game balance, quality and meets the expectations of players.</p>'),
(12333, 'en-US', 'Now the F1 grenade will explode in 2'),
(12334, 'en-US', 'The update to Rust on Steam includes a change to the F1 grenade explosion time from 3 seconds to 2.5 seconds. This change will impact players\' strategies and gameplay. Find out more in the article.'),
(12335, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, F1 grenade, update, explosion time'),
(12336, 'en-US', '<p>The developers of the game Rust on Steam have announced the news: the F1 grenade will now explode faster, in 2.5 seconds, instead of the previous 3 seconds. This change will certainly affect the gameplay and strategies of players.</p><br/><br/><p> The F1 grenade is a powerful weapon that players use to destroy structures and capture bases in Rust. Reducing the explosion time from 3 seconds to 2.5 seconds may seem like a small change, but in practice it can have a significant impact.</p><br/><br/><p> The F1 grenade\'s short explosion time makes it more effective in attack mode. Players will now be able to plan and execute their attacks more accurately, taking into account the new grenade explosion time. This can lead to more successful and faster captures of enemy bases.</p><br/><br/><p> On the other hand, changing the explosion time may cause problems for players who were previously accustomed to the old time. They may make mistakes and incorrectly count the seconds before the grenade explodes, which may lead to a failed attack or a premature explosion.</p><br/><br/><p> Balancing the F1 grenade explosion time is an important step for the Rust developers on Steam. They want to ensure balance and interesting gameplay for all players. So while this change may not seem like a big deal, it is an important component of the game update.</p><br/><br/><p> The new F1 grenade explosion time will be available in the next update to Rust. After that, players will be able to evaluate its impact on their game and adapt to the changes.</p>'),
(12337, 'en-US', 'Fixes and improvements in the game Rust'),
(12338, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update brings fixes and improvements aimed at improving the gaming experience. The \"listvendingmachines\" command was added for admins, the jackhammer was improved, and an item drop bug in Softcore mode was fixed. The next major update is expected on July 7th.'),
(12339, 'en-US', 'Rust Fixes and Improvements, Rust Update, Rust Chat Avatars, Rust Commands, Rust Domain Address, Rust Lighting Update, Rust Train Depot Rework, Rust Graphics Update');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(12340, 'en-US', '• Fixes and improvements. In particular:<br/><br/> - Headshots to animals will now play a distinctive hitmarker sound<br/> - Jackhammer now always hits glowing areas, however the bonus has been reduced to keep the same harvest time<br/> — The server map name will now be hidden in streamer mode<br/> — Fixed a bug where some items were not always dropped or given out in Softcore mode<br/> — Added \"listvendingmachines\" command, which will give a full list of vending machines located on the map. For admins only<br/> - The ent kill command will no longer leave behind debris from objects/building blocks when they are destroyed<br/> — The syntax of the \"ent\" command has been expanded. Now you can upgrade or downgrade a building\'s level through it, or manually enter a value. ent {upgrade/downgrade/setgrade} {level} {radius} For example, the \"ent upgrade 10\" command will upgrade all building blocks to the next level within a radius of 10 meters.<br/> — Players\' chat avatars are now hidden in streamer mode<br/> — You can now put photos in your mailbox<br/> — When connecting to a server with a domain address instead of an IP via the \"connect\" command, the game will automatically select port 28015. You will no longer need to enter it manually each time you connect<br/> - Fixed a bug where some building blocks did not leave behind debris when destroyed<br/> — Fixed a bug with the research table, which could \"get stuck\" after a server restart<br/><br/> The July update will be a much simpler and smaller update than the previous one, but that\'s only because there are bigger changes coming for August and the following months, such as a minor update to the lighting and graphics, as well as a rework of the train depot along with new additions to the train system.<br/><br/> We remind you that major updates along with a wipe always happen on the first Thursday of each new month, that is, this time - on July 7 at 21:00 Moscow time.'),
(12341, 'en-US', 'What players can expect in the July 7 update'),
(12342, 'en-US', 'The Rust game update on July 7 will bring interesting innovations, including reduced server loading times, a new moderation interface, and bug fixes. Players will also be able to report inappropriate images on servers. Find out more in the article.'),
(12343, 'en-US', 'Rust Game, July 7th Update, New Features, Loading Time Reduction, Moderation Interface, Player Animation, Hapis Map, Fixes, Exploit, Complaints, Rust Update'),
(12344, 'en-US', 'What players can expect in the update on July 7:<br/><br/> • Reduced server loading time. Asset loading will now begin immediately upon the main menu appearing, significantly reducing server connection time. Overall speed has been somewhat optimized and increased.<br/> • New interface for moderating paintings, signs and plaques by administrators. This will make it much easier to monitor unwanted creativity of players on your server.<br/> • Updated animation of your player in inventory<br/> • New Hapis changes and fixes - the appearance of the Arctic research base, berry spawning added, as well as many bugs fixed and a number of improvements made.<br/> • Fixed an exploit that allowed you to see through water for a moment using a certain bind<br/> • On official servers, you can now report indecent images and drawings by pressing the F7 key - along with the report, a screenshot will be automatically generated, which will be sent to the developers or server owners.'),
(12345, 'en-US', 'Attackers have gained access to your account or token? It is important to change your password!'),
(12346, 'en-US', 'If attackers have gained access to your Rust account or token, be sure to change your password to protect your data and prevent further unauthorized access.'),
(12347, 'en-US', 'intruders, access, account, token, password, security'),
(12348, 'en-US', 'If you find that someone has accessed your Rust account or token, we strongly recommend that you change your password immediately. Changing your password will automatically change your token, which will help protect your account from further unauthorized access. Protecting your personal information and account security are important aspects of the gaming process. Make sure your password is complex and unique to reduce the likelihood of it being hacked. Be careful and cautious to prevent potential account issues.'),
(12349, 'en-US', 'Attention! A new type of scam has appeared!'),
(12350, 'en-US', 'Warning! A new type of scam has appeared! Be extremely careful and do not scan the QR-Code to avoid losing your account in the game Rust.'),
(12351, 'en-US', 'scam, fraud, vigilance, security, QR code, account'),
(12352, 'en-US', '<p>Attention!</p><br/><p> We would like to draw your attention to the emergence of a new type of scam that you should be aware of.</p><br/><p> We urge you to be extremely careful and not fall for the tricks of scammers.</p><br/><p> One of these methods is to offer to scan a QR code.</p><br/><p> Do not scan it under any circumstances! It is a scam and if you scan it you may lose access to your Rust account.</p><br/><p> When such situations arise, it is best to ignore such requests.</p><br/><p> Be vigilant and protect your account!</p>'),
(12353, 'en-US', '5 Skins Quiz Results - 01'),
(12354, 'en-US', 'Find out the results of the 5 skins quiz in the game Rust, which took place on July 1, 2022. Unique items have already been raffled off, and we invite you to find out who won this exciting competition!'),
(12355, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam, Quiz, 5 Skins, Quiz Results, Rust Game, New Skins'),
(12356, 'en-US', '<p>Hello, dear Rust players on Steam!</p><br/><br/><p> We have amazing news for you - the 5 skins quiz has taken place!</p><br/><br/><p> This exciting game gave our players the chance to win five rare skins to customize their character and add a bit of style and personality to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> We are finally summing up the results of the quiz that took place on July 1, 2022. Do you want to know who was able to pass all the tests and take these unique items?</p><br/><br/><p> We invite you to check out the results and see who is the lucky owner of new skins in the game Rust. It will be interesting to know who was able to show the best knowledge and skills in our quiz.</p><br/><br/><p> So don\'t miss out - visit our website and find out what skins were raffled off and who won this exciting competition!</p><br/><br/><p> Hurry up to take part and stay tuned for new events that we will organize for you! Don\'t miss your chance to win unique items and become a real star player in Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> We are waiting for you on our website and wish you good luck in all your adventures in the world of Rust!</p><br/><br/><p> :smiley: Sincerely, Rust Team on Steam</p>'),
(12357, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust on the Steam platform'),
(12358, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest and most interesting skins that have been added to the game Rust on the Steam platform! In this article, we will look at a new batch of skins that have brought a huge variety to the gaming world.'),
(12359, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, platform Steam, updates, uniqueness, individuality'),
(12360, 'en-US', '<p>Find out about the latest and most interesting skins that have been added to the game Rust on the Steam platform! In this article, we will look at a new batch of skins that have brought a huge variety to the gaming world.</p><br/><br/><p> Each new batch of skins is an opportunity for players to update their appearance and add uniqueness to their character and their items. Whether you are a newbie or an experienced Rust player, new skins can bring freshness and inspiration to your gaming session.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes a variety of items: weapons, clothing, buildings and more. Each item in the game Rust now has even more variations, allowing players to express their individuality and style.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the key factors in adding new skins is their balancing. The game developers strive to create skins that will be interesting and attractive to players, but at the same time will not disturb the balance and gameplay. They take into account the importance of maintaining the atmosphere of the game and maintain the level of realism within Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that adding new skins to the Rust game not only enriches the gameplay, but also serves as additional support for the developers. By purchasing new skins, you help Facepunch studio develop and support the game, which ultimately leads to even more content and updates.</p><br/><br/><p> The game Rust on the Steam platform is constantly updated and developed, and new skins are one of the key components of this process. Explore the new batch of skins and choose the ones you like. Emphasize your style and uniqueness in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(12361, 'en-US', 'This article features the latest news from the Rust gameplay on Steam. Find out about the latest changes and updates that will affect your gaming environment.'),
(12362, 'en-US', 'game Rust, updates, Steam, parachute, Trainyard, weapons, animation, administration, bugs, game update'),
(12363, 'en-US', '<p>This article features the latest news from the Rust gameplay on Steam. Find out about the latest changes and updates that will affect your gaming environment.</p><br/><br/><p> Parachutes are now even more controllable. You can now control the parachute and open it from a height of at least 20 meters. This opens up new possibilities for tactical landing and escape from danger.</p><br/><br/><p> Now you can pull out your weapon and openly shoot while parachuting. However, it is worth considering that it will be impossible to control the parachute with a weapon in your hands. All that remains is to choose what is more important to you: safety or firepower.</p><br/><br/><p> A new menu has been added with a timer that determines how long it takes for your parachute to collapse after landing. This will allow you to quickly pack up and head into battle or to search for resources.</p><br/><br/><p> A new Trainyard will be added to the test branch soon. Hurry up to try it out and create new tactical routes.</p><br/><br/><p> Players can now attract the attention of trains by pressing LMB. You now have the ability to use the horn to communicate or attract attention to yourself.</p><br/><br/><p> Player models in the inventory will now have animation, which will allow them to liven up their appearance and make the gameplay even more emotional and realistic.</p><br/><br/><p> It is also reported that the development team is working on the Admin Panel for working with user content. Soon, administrators will be able to manage and moderate the gaming community more efficiently and conveniently.</p><br/><br/><p> Lastly, the premature completion of the wagon unloading has been fixed. Now bugs and errors when playing with trains will be resolved more stably and smoothly.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss all these innovations and entertainment! The Rust game update always comes with interesting and useful news.</p>'),
(12364, 'en-US', 'Developers Announce New Feature in Rust: Horses Can Now Use Elevators'),
(12365, 'en-US', 'Rust has announced a change: horses can now use elevators. The developers announced the introduction of a new feature that has caused debate and excitement among players. The article looks at the trade-offs and importance of balancing when making such changes. It is noted that the update continues to expand player options and makes the game even more interesting and exciting.'),
(12366, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, developers, horses, elevators, changes, balancing, features, game world, game update'),
(12367, 'en-US', 'Last week, the developers of the popular game Rust announced a major new feature in the game mechanics. As part of the upcoming update, horses will be able to use elevators, allowing them to move around the game world even more conveniently and efficiently.<br/><br/> This announcement has caused a lot of excitement and heated discussions among the player community. Many welcome this change as an additional opportunity for movement and cargo transportation, however, any significant change to the game can affect its balance and create new challenges for players.<br/><br/> Giving horses the ability to ride elevators clearly illustrates the philosophy of the Rust developers: to continually evolve and improve the player experience. But this decision also introduces trade-offs - potentially increasing competition in elevator use, balancing movement around the game world, and creating new strategies for players.<br/><br/> The new feature is expected to be available to all players in the upcoming Rust update. The development team is actively working on the implementation of this feature and assures players that this change will harmoniously fit into the game mechanics and will not disturb the balance of the game.<br/><br/> This is undoubtedly a rich update that will be anticipated and interesting for many Rust players. Horses on the elevator are just one particular detail that continues to expand the boundaries of the game world and creates additional opportunities for players. This update is a shining example of how the developers continue to introduce new and unique features to the game to make it even more exciting and interesting for players.'),
(12368, 'en-US', 'Learn about the game content update in the game Rust - a new batch of skins is now available on the Steam platform. Unique and inimitable designs will help you stand out from other players and support the project of the Rust team.'),
(12369, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust skins, Rust skins batch, Steam, game content, new skins, skin designs, skin purchase, financial support, cosmetics'),
(12370, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam never ceases to amaze its fans with new content updates. The development team regularly releases new batches of skins so that players can decorate their items in the game and stand out from the crowd.</p><br/><p> A new batch of Rust skins is now available on Steam, featuring a variety of designs for weapons, tools, clothing, and building materials. This batch of skins offers players unique designs that reflect a variety of themes and styles, from post-apocalyptic and military to futuristic and fantasy.</p><br/><p> Each skin from the new batch is carefully designed and meticulously worked out to the smallest detail. The designers of the Rust team pay special attention to the quality of textures and colors to make the skins as realistic and attractive as possible.</p><br/><p> New skins in Rust offer players not only visual pleasure, but also the opportunity to stand out from other players. Unique appearances of items will help to create a unique image and emphasize the individuality of each player.</p><br/><p> Purchasing skins in the game Rust is possible through the Steam store. Prices for skins may vary depending on the rarity and popularity of a particular design. But it is worth noting that skins are purely cosmetic items and do not affect game mechanics.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that the new batch of skins in the Rust game is not only an opportunity to decorate your items, but also a chance to support the developers. Buying skins is one of the ways to financially support the Rust team, which continues to actively develop the game, add new content and fix bugs.</p><br/><p> So don\'t miss the opportunity to update your skin collection and support your favorite game! A new batch of skins in the game Rust is already waiting for you on the Steam platform.</p>'),
(12371, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update Announced on Steam'),
(12372, 'en-US', 'In this announcement, we\'ll cover several key changes coming to Rust on Steam in the next update. Learn about new features for players and server admins, as well as other interesting details.'),
(12373, 'en-US', 'Update Announcement, Rust Game, Steam, Updates, Pets, Modular Cars, Admin, Inventory Animations, Streamer Mode'),
(12374, 'en-US', '<h2>Update Announcement</h2><br/><p> In this announcement, we\'ll be covering a few key changes coming in the next update to Rust on Steam.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> <b>Pets:</b> Work is currently underway to add pets to the game. One of the models the developers are working on is the \"GSD\" model, presumably a German Shepherd.</li><br/><li> <b>Crosshair Fix:</b> Fixed an issue where the crosshair would not appear when viewing the game in first person.</li><br/><li> <b>Admin Panel:</b> The current version of the game adds an admin panel that will allow you to view content created by players on the server.</li><br/><li> <b>Modular Cars:</b> Admins will be able to create prefabricated modular cars with a preset setup for 2, 3, and 4 mods. Each car will spawn with full health.</li><br/><li> <b>Vehicle Improvements:</b> In the next update, Kayaks will face away from the player by default, and the Mailbox, BBQ, Medium Battery, and Windmill will face towards the player by default.</li><br/><li> <b>New inventory animations:</b> We are currently testing new animations in the game\'s inventory.</li><br/><li> <b>Streamer Mode:</b> The ability to disable map visibility in streamer mode will be added.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> This is only a small part of the changes that will appear in the next update of the game Rust on Steam. For full information, we invite you to read the article at the link <a href=\"https://vk.com/@rustcommru-anons-obnovleniya\">https://vk.com/@rustcommru-anons-obnovleniya</a> .</p>'),
(12375, 'en-US', 'Steam Summer Sale: Rust and DLCs 50% Off'),
(12376, 'en-US', 'Find out about the Summer Sale on the Steam platform, where you can buy the game Rust and all 3 DLC Packs with a 50% discount. Find out more and don\'t miss this unique opportunity!'),
(12377, 'en-US', 'Summer Sale, Steam, Rust, DLC, discount, survival, game, base, price, opportunity, adventure'),
(12378, 'en-US', 'The Summer Sale on Steam has already started, and this is great news for all fans of the game Rust! Now you can buy the game itself and all 3 DLC Packs with a 50% discount. The promotion will last until July 7, so you have the opportunity to get this popular survival game at a bargain price.<br/> Rust is an exciting game where you have to survive in the wild world, fight other players and build your base. And now, thanks to the summer sale, you can become part of this exciting gaming universe for half price!<br/> The price of Rust during the sale is only 550 rubles. This is a unique opportunity to get the game at a big discount and start your survival in the dangerous world of Rust.<br/> Also, don\'t forget to take advantage of the 50% discount on all 3 DLC Packs for the game Rust. These additions will bring new features and exciting adventures to your game.<br/> Don\'t miss your chance to purchase Rust and its DLC Pack at reduced prices! The promotion will only last until July 7th, so hurry up to avoid missing out on this unique opportunity.'),
(12379, 'en-US', 'Developers present an update to the Railway Depot in the game Rust'),
(12380, 'en-US', 'Learn about the upcoming Railroad Depot update in Rust. The new tower will allow you to mine resources and load them onto trains, opening up new opportunities and strategies for players. Test the changes later this month on the Staging Branch before the full release in August.'),
(12381, 'en-US', 'Train Depot update, new tower, resources, trains, Rust game, developers, Staging Branch'),
(12382, 'en-US', '<p>The exciting game Rust will be updated soon! The developers are actively working on the next update, which includes important changes in the Railway Depot.</p><br/><p> The main innovation is the appearance of a new tower in the Railway Depot. Now players will be able to extract resources and load them into trains through this tower. This innovation will add new opportunities for players and open up more strategies in the game.</p><br/><p> The full release of the update is planned for August. However, at the end of this month, players will be able to test the new changes on the Staging Branch to assess their impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the Railroad Depot update in Rust! Explore the new features in advance and get ready for exciting adventures.</p>'),
(12383, 'en-US', 'Developers have begun work on a new parachute in the game Rust'),
(12384, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Rust update that will introduce players to the ability to use a parachute in their adventures.'),
(12385, 'en-US', 'Game Rust, update, parachute, innovation'),
(12386, 'en-US', 'On Steam, the price of Rust has dropped to 1100 rubles'),
(12387, 'en-US', 'Find out about the price drop for Rust on Steam, as well as the price drop for all DLC. Join us to get the latest news about the world of Rust and its updates.'),
(12388, 'en-US', 'Steam, Rust, price, reduction, DLC, survival, game, news'),
(12389, 'en-US', 'Welcome to the world of Rust! A game that never ceases to attract players\' attention with its unique survival concept. We are pleased to announce that the price of Rust on Steam is now only 1100 rubles! This is great news for everyone who wants to experience all the delights of this exciting game without significant costs.<br/><br/> Along with the price reduction for the game itself, the prices for all additional content (DLC) have also been reduced. Now you can enjoy the full gaming experience for a more affordable price.<br/><br/> Rust is an exciting game where you have to survive in a ruthless world, fight other players, build fortifications and find resources to survive. Every day in Rust is a new adventure, full of dangers and opportunities.<br/><br/> So, if you haven’t tried your hand at this game yet, now is the time! Many players have already appreciated all the advantages of Rust, and now you can join their ranks. Enter the world of Rust and discover a fascinating and exciting gameplay that never ceases to amaze with its depth and possibilities.<br/><br/> Stay up-to-date with the latest news about updates and events in the Rust game on our website. We are always happy to share the most relevant information with our gaming community. Join us and stay up to date with all the news and events in the world of Rust!'),
(12390, 'en-US', 'Client update: no changes to gameplay'),
(12391, 'en-US', 'The Rust game client update did not affect gameplay. Find out the details and how this update affects players.'),
(12392, 'en-US', 'client update, gameplay, Rust, changes'),
(12393, 'en-US', 'A mandatory update for the Rust game client has just been released. However, despite this, the gameplay remains unchanged. In this article, we will look at the details of this update and what it means for players.'),
(12394, 'en-US', 'Mandatory client and server update in the game Rust'),
(12395, 'en-US', 'On June 22 at 21:00 Moscow time, an update of the Rust game client and server is expected. The article provides a brief description of the update and the need to restart the servers and re-enter the players.'),
(12396, 'en-US', 'client and server update, Rust game, June 22, backend system, server reboot, player re-entry'),
(12397, 'en-US', '<p>On June 22 at 21:00 Moscow time, an update of the Rust game client and server is expected.</p><br/><p> This update does not make any changes to the gameplay of the game itself, but only updates the backend system.</p><br/><p> Due to this, all servers will be forced to restart to install the new version, and players will need to re-login to install the updated version. Otherwise, you will not be able to connect to servers that have already updated.</p>'),
(12398, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins for Rust on Steam. Update your collection and stand out from other players with your unique style.'),
(12399, 'en-US', 'new Rust skins, new batch of skins, skin collection update, Rust game on Steam'),
(12400, 'en-US', 'Hello, Rust players! We have good news for you - a new batch of skins has been added to the game Rust on Steam! Now you can update your collection and give your character a new unique look. In the new batch of skins, you will find a variety of styles, from classic to modern, so that every player can find something to their taste.<br/><br/> The party includes skins for various equipment such as weapons, protective suits, tools and much more. Now you have the opportunity to stand out from other players and make a lasting impression with your unique style.<br/><br/> In addition, the new batch of skins includes items from renowned developers and artists who have created exciting and colorful designs specifically for the Rust game. These skins will add new realistic details and features to your gaming environment, making it even more exciting.<br/><br/> But remember that skins are only cosmetic changes that do not affect the game mechanics. Decide which skins suit your style and price, and only then make your choice. It is important to remember that every time you purchase a skin, you support the game developers and help them create new content for you.<br/><br/> So don\'t miss the opportunity to update your skin collection and stand out from other players in the game Rust! Buy new skins and enjoy the unique appearance of your character. Welcome to the world of a new batch of skins!'),
(12401, 'en-US', 'Some changes in Rust'),
(12402, 'en-US', 'The latest update to the game \"Rust\" has brought some changes that affect sky brightness, ambient and reflection intensity, volumetric effects and weather conditions.'),
(12403, 'en-US', 'Rust, changes, update, sky brightness, intensity, volumetric effect, clear weather'),
(12404, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has some changes worth noting. Below you will find a full list of changes:<br/><ul><br/><li> The brightness of the sky has been slightly reduced, which adds more realism and naturalness to the game atmosphere.</li><br/><li> The intensity of the environment and reflections has been reduced, allowing players to see their opponents and the surrounding world in greater detail.</li><br/><li> The volumetric effect of the environment is now more balanced, which helps to create more realistic game conditions.</li><br/><li> Clearer weather has been set up, improving visibility and creating a more comfortable gaming atmosphere.</li><br/></ul><br/> These changes were made to improve the gameplay experience and bring more realism to the world of \"Rust\". More detailed information about the changes can be found on <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">the official page of the game \"Rust\"</a> .'),
(12405, 'en-US', 'The dollar exchange rate on Steam has settled at 57 rubles'),
(12406, 'en-US', 'The established dollar exchange rate on Steam at 57 rubles is important to consider when planning game purchases and spending in game currency.'),
(12407, 'en-US', 'dollar exchange rate, Steam, game economy, purchase of game content, expenses in game currency'),
(12408, 'en-US', 'Today we are happy to share important news for all players who use dollars on Steam. The dollar to ruble exchange rate has been stable at 57 rubles. This is important information that may affect your purchases and expenses in game currency.<br/><br/> The exchange rate has always been an important factor when purchasing game content on Steam. This is due to the fact that prices in the game store are indicated in dollars, not rubles. Therefore, knowledge of the current exchange rate becomes an integral part of decision-making.<br/><br/> Constant changes in the dollar exchange rate can have both a positive and negative impact on the gaming economy. For example, if the dollar exchange rate increases, the cost of game content in rubles may increase, which may affect the purchasing power of players. On the other hand, a decrease in the dollar exchange rate may make the purchase of game content more accessible and attractive.<br/><br/> But it is important to remember that the dollar exchange rate on Steam does not depend only on the domestic economic situation in the country. Its fluctuations can be associated with global factors, such as changes in the global economy or political events. Therefore, in order to make an intelligent decision when buying game content, you need to consider not only the current rate, but also forecasts of its changes.<br/><br/> In conclusion, the dollar exchange rate update on Steam to 57 rubles is important information for all players. Keep this in mind when making decisions about purchases and spending in game currency. Stay up to date with the latest rate changes and take it into account when planning your gaming expenses.'),
(12409, 'en-US', 'Players can now troll and report other players directly from the contact list'),
(12410, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust adds new features that allow players to report and report other players directly from their contact list, improving the ability to combat abusers and creating a safer gaming environment.'),
(12411, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, players, stir up, report, contact list, functions'),
(12412, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust on Steam brings good news for all players. Now you can hook up and report other players directly from your contact list!</p><br/><br/><p> The game Rust is known for its ability to interact with other players, creating a unique multiplayer experience. However, as in any game, sometimes there are some players who break the rules or behave inappropriately. Previously, you could only contact the administration and complain about such players, but now everything is much simpler and more convenient.</p><br/><br/><p> With the latest update, the Rust developers have added a new feature that allows you to mute and report any player in your contact list. Muting restricts communication with the player, and you will no longer receive their messages or hear their voice. This is a powerful tool to combat players who break the rules and bring a negative experience to the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> Additionally, the report function allows you to report antisocial behavior, cheating, or other violations that you have noticed. The report is sent directly to the game developers, who will conduct appropriate investigations and take appropriate action against the violators.</p><br/><br/><p> To use these new features, you simply need to open your contact list and select the player you want to hook or report. Then follow the simple instructions that appear on the screen and your actions will be reflected directly in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> This update is a big step forward for Rust\'s team play, allowing players to more effectively combat various violations and create a more enjoyable and safer play space.</p>'),
(12413, 'en-US', 'New model Spas-12'),
(12414, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Spas-12 weapon model in the epic game Rust. An update that will leave you delighted.'),
(12415, 'en-US', 'new model, Spas-12, Rust, update, weapon, tactical shooter'),
(12416, 'en-US', 'Welcome to the world of Rust, where each new weapon model causes a real stir among players. The latest game update features a new model, the Spas-12, which promises to be a real hit among fans of the tactical shooter. This is a weapon that will not leave you indifferent.'),
(12417, 'en-US', 'Let\'s move away from the topic of Rust a little'),
(12418, 'en-US', 'Until June 19, Steam is offering a 100% discount on the game ARK - a unique opportunity to add another exciting game to your library!'),
(12419, 'en-US', 'retreat, Rust, ARK, discount, Steam, library, survival, open world, dinosaurs, features, adventure, free, game collection'),
(12420, 'en-US', '<p>Dear readers, today we have a small digression from the discussion of the game Rust. I want to tell you about the amazing news - until June 19, Steam is offering a 100% discount on the game ARK! This is a great opportunity to add another exciting game to your library.</p><br/><p> If you\'re not familiar with ARK, it\'s a game where you have to survive on a dinosaur-filled island. Explore a huge open world, hunt, build shelters, grow plants, and even tame dinosaurs! ARK offers an incredible amount of possibilities and adventures.</p><br/><p> But the best part of this news is that the game is now available absolutely free on Steam! Take advantage of this unique opportunity and add ARK to your gaming collection. We are sure that you will not regret it!</p>'),
(12421, 'en-US', 'Rust PvP Balance Update: Addressing Feedback After the \"Combat Update\"'),
(12422, 'en-US', 'Rust has released a PvP balance update that addresses some of the feedback from the Combat Update. Find out how the developers are taking player feedback into account and improving the game experience.'),
(12423, 'en-US', 'update, PvP balance, Rust, reviews, combat update, gaming experience'),
(12424, 'en-US', '<p><br/>Rust recently released a long-awaited PvP balance update that was aimed at addressing some of the negative player feedback following the Combat Update.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> The goal of this update was to improve the game balance in PvP mode, based on feedback and opinions from the community. The developers made significant changes to the game mechanics to eliminate the shortcomings and problems that players reported.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> The update also allowed Rust\'s creators to take into account the different approaches players take to PvP and the trade-offs that had to be made in balancing aspects of the game. One of the main goals was to create a balanced game system where all players have an equal chance of success.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> The developers focused on taking into account various factors that affect PvP gameplay, such as weapon damage, defense and equipment, cooldowns, etc. They also paid attention to the impact of these changes on player decision making and the factors that affect balance in the Rust game.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> The PvP balance update in Rust has become an important part of the development of the game experience and response to player feedback. The developers continue to work on improving the game and taking into account the opinions and suggestions of the community to achieve the best game balance.<br/></p>'),
(12425, 'en-US', 'New contests for TOP skins in our Rust community'),
(12426, 'en-US', 'Find out about two exciting TOP skins contests in our Rust community and get a chance to win valuable prizes. Join now!'),
(12427, 'en-US', 'contests, TOP skins, community, Rust, prizes, participation'),
(12428, 'en-US', 'Our Rust community is hosting two exciting TOP skin contests! We have great news for all fans of stylish skins. We want to remind you about our contests, where you can show off your talent and win cool prizes. Let\'s tell you the details.<br/><br/> The first contest is \"TOP skins\". Participants must submit their best skins, which, in their opinion, deserve a place in the top. We will invite our subscribers to vote for the best works. The winners will be determined based on the community vote. Don\'t miss the opportunity to show your skills and win valuable prizes!<br/><br/> The second contest is \"Giveaway\". All the information about the giveaway is available in our Discord server. Just join our server and find the details about the giveaway in the corresponding channel. We have many exciting prizes that we will give away among the participants.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the chance to try your luck and show your talents in creating skins. Join our contests and participate! We are sure that unforgettable opportunities and exciting prizes await you.'),
(12429, 'en-US', 'Update your wardrobe in Rust on Steam with a new batch of exciting skins that will make your gaming aesthetic even more vibrant and unique!'),
(12430, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust on Steam, wardrobe update, unique items, game aesthetics'),
(12431, 'en-US', 'The game Rust on Steam pleases its players with a new batch of exciting skins! Now you have the opportunity to update your virtual survivalist wardrobe with the freshest and most beautiful skins available in the new batch. Don\'t miss the chance to become the owner of unique items that will make your gaming aesthetics even brighter and more unique!'),
(12432, 'en-US', 'Some changes that will be released in the next update'),
(12433, 'en-US', 'A new update for the Rust game is coming soon, which will bring some interesting changes.'),
(12434, 'en-US', 'update, changes, Rust, game'),
(12435, 'en-US', 'A new update for Rust is coming soon, bringing some interesting changes. The developers have paid attention to some aspects of the gameplay to make the game even more fun and convenient for players. In this article, we will look at two of these promising innovations.'),
(12436, 'en-US', 'A patch with changes to the game Rust will be released soon'),
(12437, 'en-US', 'A small patch for the game Rust is expected soon, which will bring some interesting changes to the gameplay. Let\'s take a closer look at what to expect from this update.'),
(12438, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, patch, changes, recoil, optical sight, silencer, flashlight, laser sight, sound, gameplay, tactics'),
(12439, 'en-US', '<p>Soon, the developers of the game Rust plan to release a small patch that will bring several interesting changes to the gameplay. Let\'s take a look at what changes await us:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Changes to the M249 machine gun:</li><br/><p> The recoil of the M249 machine gun has been revised to balance the weapon, making it more predictable and controllable.</p><br/><li> Changes to the HMLMG:</li><br/><p> The HMLMG has also been reworked. Its durability has been reduced, its crafting cost has been increased, and its recoil has been changed. These changes are intended to make this weapon more balanced.</p><br/><li> The influence of optical sights:</li><br/><p> Now, scopes will affect the recoil of weapons. When using scopes when shooting, the recoil will be increased by 50%. This change will give players more opportunities for tactical decisions and choosing the right tactics.</p><br/><li> Silencer changes:</li><br/><p> Suppressors have been adjusted so that they no longer provide an accuracy advantage, making gameplay more balanced and fair for all players.</p><br/><li> Improved functionality of flashlight and laser sight:</li><br/><p> Now, when changing weapons, the flashlight and laser sight will no longer turn off. This will significantly simplify the use of these devices in the gameplay and make them more convenient.</p><br/><li> Sound design modification:</li><br/><p> The patch also adds new sounds for smoke and signal grenades to make the gaming experience even more realistic and immersive.</p><br/></ul><br/><p> Overall, this patch will bring some interesting changes to the game Rust that will affect the gameplay and tactical decisions of players. The developers continue to work on improving the gameplay, listening to the opinions and feedback of the community. Let\'s hope that these changes will make the game even more exciting and satisfying for all fans of Rust.</p>'),
(12440, 'en-US', 'Some changes in the upcoming update in the game Rust'),
(12441, 'en-US', 'The article talks about some of the changes expected in the next update of the Rust game. There will be changes to the resource extraction process, and the ability to headshot animals will be added.'),
(12442, 'en-US', 'Rust update, combat system, resource mining, headshots, hit marker'),
(12443, 'en-US', '<p>There are some changes coming to Rust that may impact game balance and introduce new elements to the gameplay. Let\'s take a look at some of these changes:</p><br/><br/><p> 1. Fixed resource extraction rate:</p><br/><p> The developers decided to eliminate some inconsistencies in the process of mining ore and stone. Now, regardless of how you mine resources, the speed will be fixed. This will allow players to plan their actions more accurately and equalize the possibilities of different play styles.</p><br/><br/><p> 2. Improvements in the combat system:</p><br/><p> One of the main changes that players are waiting for is the addition of a new feature - the ability to headshot animals. Now, when you hit an animal\'s head, you will see a hit marker and hear a characteristic sound. This will not only add realism to the game, but will also allow players to hunt and defend themselves more effectively.</p><br/><br/><p> These are just some of the changes expected in the next update of the Rust game. The developers continue to work on improving the gaming experience and introducing new features. Stay tuned and enjoy the game together with the Rust community!</p>'),
(12444, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: HMLMG Crafting Cost Increased'),
(12445, 'en-US', 'Rust has received an update that increases the crafting cost of HMLMGs, reduces the blur effect, and removes the accuracy limitation when firing from a silencer.'),
(12446, 'en-US', 'Rust game, update, HMLMG crafting cost, blur effect, accuracy, silencer'),
(12447, 'en-US', '<h2>Rust Game Update: HMLMG Crafting Cost Increased</h2><br/><p> Rust has just released an update that brings several changes. One of the most significant changes is the increase in the crafting cost of the HMLMG. Players will now need more resources and time to craft this powerful weapon item.</p><br/><p> Another change this update brought is related to the blur/blood effect when health is low. The developers decided to reduce this effect to improve the gaming experience for users. Now players will be able to see the world around them more accurately even when their health is low.</p><br/><p> Additionally, the update removed the accuracy limitation when shooting with a silencer. Players will now be able to fully utilize the potential of this accessory without losing accuracy in combat.</p><br/><p> The Rust update brings several changes that will impact gameplay. Making trade-offs and balancing factors is an important part of developing updates to create the best possible experience for players. Stay tuned for more updates to Rust!</p>'),
(12448, 'en-US', 'Competition results: name for the company banner at the renovated Railway Depot'),
(12449, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust on Steam have given players the opportunity to come up with a name for the company banner at the Railroad Depot that reflects the theme of the ore mining plant. The article presents several interesting suggestions and invites you to participate in a competition.'),
(12450, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, Rust update, company banner, Railroad Depot, Ore Mining Plant, Contest, Creative Name'),
(12451, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust on Steam have given players a unique opportunity to come up with a name for the company banner, which will be placed on one of the buildings of the updated Railroad Depot. This banner will be a key element in the game world of Rust, so the name should be original and reflect the theme of the ore mining plant.<br/><br/> Participants in the competition were able to show their creativity and suggest their own name, inspired by the given theme of the plant. Below are some interesting suggestions that we selected:<br/><br/> 1. \"Ore Giant\" - This name captures the imagination and draws attention to the activities of the ore mining plant. It conveys the power and importance of the company.<br/><br/> 2. \"Sparks from the Womb of the Earth\" - this name symbolizes the magical process of ore mining and its emergence from the depths of the Earth. It creates a mysterious and mystical atmosphere around the company.<br/><br/> 3. \"Ore Mill\" - This name reflects the activity and movement at an ore mining plant. It calls to mind the image of a stream of ore spinning and creating energy.<br/><br/> But the choice is yours! What name would you suggest for the company banner on the Railway Depot in the game Rust? We are waiting for your creative ideas and are sure that your proposal will add a special charm and atmosphere to the game world.'),
(12452, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: New Patch Meets Player Feedback'),
(12453, 'en-US', 'The developers of Rust are preparing a new patch, taking into account player feedback on the latest update. Find out what changes and fixes are expected, and how players can contribute to the development of the game.'),
(12454, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, new patch, player feedback, fixes, improvements, game mechanics, game balance'),
(12455, 'en-US', '<p>The developers of the popular game Rust do not stop listening to their fans. Taking into account the feedback received about the latest update, the development team is preparing a new patch, which will be released on Thursday, June 9 at 21:00 Moscow time.</p><br/><p> Players\' attention and opinions are the main factors influencing the development of the game and the direction of its updates. The new patch is aimed at taking into account the feedback received and eliminating the identified problems in order to make the gameplay even more interesting and exciting. In order to create the most complete and satisfying gaming experience, the developers provide players with relevant fixes and updates.</p><br/><p> Key factors that were taken into account in the new patch include updates to game mechanics, bug fixes, performance improvements and optimizations, as well as changes to the game balance. The development team also completely revised some game elements to make the game more balanced and fun.</p><br/><p> The patch release date was chosen to maximize availability and convenience for players. The new patch will be available on Thursday, June 9 at 21:00 Moscow time. The developers recommend that all players update the game to the latest version to enjoy all the new features and fixes.</p><br/><p> Player feedback is crucial for the development team, as it is the players who make the game alive and interesting. So if you have any suggestions or feedback, feel free to share them on the official forums or portals dedicated to the Rust game. Your feedback will help make the game better for all its users.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned for updates and don\'t miss the opportunity to try out all the new features and improvements in the Rust game!</p>'),
(12456, 'en-US', 'Rust adds a text chat filter from Steam'),
(12457, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update on Steam will introduce a filter for Steam text chat to create a safer and more enjoyable gaming environment.'),
(12458, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, Text Chat Filter, Security, Update'),
(12459, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam will introduce a new and improved text chat filter. This is an important change that will help ensure a more enjoyable and safe gaming experience for all players.<br/><br/> Social interactions and communication with other players are a key part of the gameplay in Rust. However, as with any online game, sometimes negative situations may arise due to the use of foul language, insults, and other undesirable behavior in the chat.<br/><br/> To combat these issues, Rust developers have decided to implement a text chat filter that will automatically block and filter unwanted words and expressions. This will help create a more friendly and welcoming gaming space.<br/><br/> The filter will be based on the technology used in Steam and will be constantly updated and adapted to new words and phrases to effectively combat negative content. The Rust developers understand that each player has their own personality and communication style, so they tried to create a customizable filter that allows players to control the level of censorship in the chat.<br/><br/> The implementation of the Steam text chat filter is an important step towards creating a safer and more comfortable gaming environment in Rust. The developers continue to work on improving the game and feedback from the community to create the most enjoyable gaming experience for all players.'),
(12460, 'en-US', 'RUST breaks records!'),
(12461, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about Rust breaking new records, increasing the number of active players and skin giveaways!'),
(12462, 'en-US', 'RUST, records, update, players, Rustoria, community, skins'),
(12463, 'en-US', '<p>Great news for fans of the game Rust! At the moment, there is a stunning growth in the popularity of this game.</p><br/><p> The most recent update has seen an increase in the number of players playing Rust at the same time. There are now a whopping 165,000 players on the game\'s servers at the same time!</p><br/><p> I would also like to note the achievement of Rustoria, which set a new historical record today. There were 8,543 players playing on its servers at the same time, and 1,659 people were in the queue to enter! These are truly impressive numbers!</p><br/><p> And that\'s not all! Over 800 new members have joined our community in the last 24 hours!</p><br/><p> And to celebrate this phenomenal success, we are launching a giveaway of the top five skins. All the conditions for participation are available in our community. Join us and get a chance to win!</p><br/><p> We invite you to join our community and dive into the world of Rust with us! Your adventure story starts here: https://discord.gg/gv3axB6Jev</p>'),
(12464, 'en-US', 'THE BIGGEST PVP UPDATE IS HERE! THE COMBAT UPDATE!'),
(12465, 'en-US', 'The biggest PvP update in Rust - The Combat Update! New recoil, wipe and other changes that will change tactics and the fight for survival.'),
(12466, 'en-US', 'PvP update, The Combat Update, new changes, recoil, wipe, battles, tactics, survival, video, Rust, game');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(12467, 'en-US', '<p>It\'s time for joyful changes for all fans of the game Rust! The most grandiose and anticipated update has finally been released - The Combat Update!</p><br/><p> Each server has reset the map, and now new, exciting battles with unique opportunities await you everywhere. The recoil system has been reworked, and other interesting changes have been made to PvP.</p><br/><p> Get ready for an unforgettable wipe and a newfound sense of success in battles! This update forces players to reconsider their tactics, master new skills, and use every opportunity in the fight for survival.</p><br/><p> You can see the details and features of the update in this video: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hKOOn5BnEcI\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hKOOn5BnEcI</a></p><br/><p> You can also check out the full list of changes and innovations in The Combat Update on the official Rust website: <a href=\"https://rust.facepunch.com/news/the-combat-update\" target=\"_blank\">https://rust.facepunch.com/news/the-combat-update</a></p>'),
(12468, 'en-US', 'Graffiti pack has been added to the rust'),
(12469, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have presented a new update - Graffiti pack. This add-on allows players to create and apply various graffiti on walls and objects in the game, expressing their individuality and creativity.'),
(12470, 'en-US', 'rast, rust, update, graffit pack, game'),
(12471, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust development team is pleased to introduce a new update to its players - Graffiti pack. This exciting addition brings variety and self-expression to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Graffiti pack is a set of unique graffiti that can now be created and applied to walls and objects during the game. You will be able to express your individuality and show everyone your creative abilities.</p><br/><br/><p> In this new expansion, you will find a huge selection of different graffiti designs. They come in different colors, styles and themes, allowing each player to find something that fully reflects their own style and preferences.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, Graffiti pack supports the ability to create your own designs. You can use your skills and imagination to create something truly unique.</p><br/><br/><p> Now you can turn your base or house into a real work of art. You can leave your mark on the game map and show everyone what you are capable of.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust developers have thought through every detail to make the graffiti look realistic and attractive. You will be pleasantly surprised by the quality and detail of each design.</p><br/><br/><p> It is also important to note that the Graffiti pack supports the ability to view other players\' designs. You will be able to get inspired by ideas and offer your comments and ratings for the creative works of other Rust community members.</p>'),
(12472, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: an updated collection for your survival'),
(12473, 'en-US', 'The game Rust pleases its players with a new batch of skins. In this article, you will learn about the new collection, its impact on the gameplay and its value on the market. Choose the skin that suits you and adds novelty to your game.'),
(12474, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust game, survival simulator, skin collection, unique items, market value, gameplay, individuality, possibilities'),
(12475, 'en-US', '<p>The popular survival simulator Rust pleases its players with a new batch of unique skins. The updated collection of skins is created especially for those who want to stand out and give their character individuality. In this new batch of skins you will find many interesting items that will not only enliven your gaming atmosphere, but also give you additional advantages in the fight for survival.</p><br/><br/><p> Skins in Rust are more than just cosmetic items, they can affect your character\'s behavior and overall gameplay. Some skins allow you to hide better in the environment, making stealth or hunting tactics easier. Other skins can provide additional armor or enhance your offensive capabilities. Each skin has its own characteristics and offers unique opportunities for your achievement in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> But when choosing skins, it is worth considering not only their visual appeal, but also their value on the Steam market. High-quality and rare skins can be quite expensive and can be the subject of speculation and investment. When choosing a skin, it is worth carefully studying its characteristics and value on the market in order to make the right choice and get additional benefits in the future game.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins in Rust is an opportunity to spice up your gameplay, add novelty and individuality. Consider the impact of skins on gameplay and the value on the market to choose the perfect option for you. Join the millions of players around the world who are already enjoying the new skins and the variety of possibilities they offer!</p>'),
(12476, 'en-US', 'Steam Store Update: New Items for Rust'),
(12477, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Rust profile items now available on the Steam Store - frames, avatars, backgrounds and animated stickers.'),
(12478, 'en-US', 'update, Steam store, frames, avatars, backgrounds, stickers, game Rust'),
(12479, 'en-US', '<p>Hello, dear Rust players! We are happy to inform you about the latest update to the Steam store, which brings a host of new items and features for your in-game profile. You can now purchase frames, animated avatars, profile backgrounds, and even animated stickers, all inspired by the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> Imagine being able to decorate your profile with completely new design elements. Now you have a wide choice of frames that will help you to distinguish your avatar from many other players. Animated avatars will add dynamics and originality to your profile page, attracting the attention of other users.</p><br/><p> Profile backgrounds are a great way to show your dedication to the game Rust. Choose from a variety of colorful and high-quality images that will turn your profile into a real work of art. Now everyone who visits your page will see your passion for the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> Animated stickers are a new way to express your emotions and feelings towards the game. Choose them according to your mood and use them in chat or comments to highlight your individuality and active participation in the Rust gaming community.</p><br/><p> To purchase these new items, simply visit the Steam store and go to the Rust game section. There you will find all available frames, avatars, backgrounds and stickers to add to your collection. Also, be sure to keep an eye on new items that will be added to the store regularly to keep your profile on trend.</p><br/><p> Be unique and stand out from other Rust players with new items for your Steam Store profile. Don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your page and show everyone your passion for Rust!</p>'),
(12480, 'en-US', 'Big day tomorrow! Rust is getting some of the biggest PVP changes in years, Hapis is back, Graffiti Pack is coming to the store, and more'),
(12481, 'en-US', 'Tomorrow is the long-awaited day in Rust, with big PVP changes, the return of the Hapis map, and a new Graffiti Pack. Join our community on Discord for all the latest news and discussions about the game.'),
(12482, 'en-US', 'Rust Changes Coming, PVP Changes, Hapis Returns, Graffiti Pack, Rust Updates'),
(12483, 'en-US', 'Tomorrow is the day Rust is expecting, bringing with it some major changes to the PVP mode that haven’t been seen in years! The Hapis map that fans have been eagerly awaiting is back, and a new Graffiti Pack will be added to the store to decorate your world. These are just a few of the upcoming updates that you can experience with other passionate players!<br/><br/> Join our community on Discord at https://discord.gg/QdeSZykknE and stay up to date with all the latest Rust news and discussions!'),
(12484, 'en-US', 'New Recoil and Weapon Changes on Test Branch'),
(12485, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest recoil and weapon changes on the Rust test branch. Removed automatic recoil compensation, adjusted the recoil of the homemade light machine gun, added new technologies, and fixed bugs.'),
(12486, 'en-US', 'Rust, changes, recoil, weapons, test branch'),
(12487, 'en-US', 'New recoil and weapon changes on the test branch.<br/><br/> • Removed automatic recoil compensation - it made single shot shooting too easy<br/> • Muzzle booster no longer affects horizontal recoil<br/> • The recoil of the homemade light machine gun (hereinafter referred to as the IMG) has been changed: the first bullets will be extremely inaccurate, but the accuracy will gradually increase as you fire<br/> • SRP reload time reduced by one second<br/> • The SRP\'s recoil will swing to the left when firing<br/> • SRP has been added to the third tier technology tree<br/> • Extended Shop added to Tier 2 tech tree<br/> • Fixed a bug that would constantly unload ammo from a weapon when adding an extended magazine module<br/> • A compound bow loses less strength when it is drawn.<br/> • Rocket launcher durability reduced by 50%<br/> • Reduced size and height of landmine<br/><br/> As the developers promised, some details will be adjusted and finalized before the game\'s release. The PVP update will be released on June 2 at 21:00 Moscow time.'),
(12488, 'en-US', 'Rust Monthly Update: New Map, NPCs, PVP Changes, and More!'),
(12489, 'en-US', 'Learn about the upcoming monthly update for Rust, which includes a new map, added NPCs, and bug fixes to provide a more immersive gaming experience.'),
(12490, 'en-US', 'Rust Monthly Update, New Hapis Map, Cosmodrome NPC, Recoil Update, PVP, Covered Wagons, Bug Fixes'),
(12491, 'en-US', '<p>The monthly update of the game Rust will take place on June 2! Don\'t miss the chance to meet new challenges and opportunities in one of the most popular survival games at the moment.</p><br/><br/><p> This update brings a host of new features and fixes that will make your gaming experience even more exciting.</p><br/><br/><p> Here\'s what awaits you in the new update:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> <b>New map \"Hapis\"</b> - discover this mysterious area and uncover its secrets.</li><br/><li> <b>Adding NPCs to the Cosmodrome</b> - Meet the residents who will now be present at the Cosmodrome and bring a new sense of liveliness to the game.</li><br/><li> <b>Updated Recoil and PVP</b> - Enjoy better combat encounters thanks to an improved recoil system and updated PVP mechanics.</li><br/><li> <b>Covered Wagons</b> - Find shelter in the covered wagons, which have become the new refuge for survivors.</li><br/><li> <b>Various bug fixes and more</b> – The developers have also taken into account community feedback and have made a number of fixes, improvements and optimizations to ensure a smoother gaming experience.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> Stay up to date with the latest news, subscribe to our newsletter to stay up to date with all the latest Rust updates!</p><br/><p> :)</p>'),
(12492, 'en-US', 'News: Possibility to disable new recoil in the game Rust'),
(12493, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Rust update - now server admins can disable the new recoil manually. Learn how to use the command and enjoy the old recoil model.'),
(12494, 'en-US', 'new recoil, disabling recoil, server admin, old recoil model'),
(12495, 'en-US', 'Meet a new feature in the game Rust - now you can disable the new recoil model manually on the server if you are its administrator. This is great news for those who prefer the old style of recoil in the game.<br/><br/> To disable the new recoil, you need to use the command recoilproperties.version 0. After activating this command, the server (and all players on it) will be set to the old recoil model. This is a temporary feature, so if you want to enjoy the old recoil, don\'t miss the opportunity to use it!'),
(12496, 'en-US', 'New Changes in Rust: List of Updates from Developer Alistar'),
(12497, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest Rust updates from developer Alistar, who posted the changelog on his Twitter page.'),
(12498, 'en-US', 'Rust game updates, changelog, Alistar, Twitter, Rust update news'),
(12499, 'en-US', '<p>If you are a fan of the game Rust, then you will certainly be interested to know about the latest changes and updates that are happening in the gaming world. And today we have hot news on this topic!</p><br/><br/><p> The developer of the game Rust, known as Alistar, has just published a list of the latest changes he has made to the game in the last few hours. This is important information for all players, as it can affect the gameplay and your strategy for survival in Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> The list of changes includes various aspects of the game, such as character balance, weapon and item adjustments, as well as bug fixes and improvements to the overall performance of the game. Considering that Rust is an online multiplayer game, such updates and changes are necessary to ensure player satisfaction and keep the game in good condition.</p><br/><br/><p> The latest updates have been posted by Alistar on his Twitter page. This way, you can easily access this information and see the full list of changes that have been made. It is important to remember that these changes may affect gameplay, so take the time to read the list and prepare for possible changes.</p><br/><br/><p> New changes in the game Rust always arouse interest among players, as they can open up new survival strategies and improve the gaming experience. So, don’t miss the opportunity to be the first to know about the latest updates and prepare for the adventures that await you in the game world of Rust!</p>'),
(12500, 'en-US', 'Video posted with possible final weapon sounds in global Rust update'),
(12501, 'en-US', 'Rust creator Alex Rehberg has shared a new video of what could be the final weapon soundtrack in the major update scheduled to be released on June 2.'),
(12502, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, weapons, sound, Alex Rehberg, video'),
(12503, 'en-US', '<p>Rust creator Alex Rehberg has shared a new video on his YouTube channel, in which he shows off what could be the final weapon sound in the major update. This is an epic update that is scheduled to be released on June 2.</p><p> The video features stunning sounds of gunshots, reloads, and other sound effects that add realism and atmosphere to the game. The update also includes new ambient sounds, music, and character sounds.</p><p> Alex Rehberg notes that sound is an important part of the gaming experience, and his team worked hard to create unique sound effects that would highlight and enhance players\' actions.</p><p> If you love Rust and want to learn more about the weapon sounds in the global update, don\'t miss this interesting video! </p><br/><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Eh41soUghyE\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),
(12504, 'en-US', 'Epicgames Gives Free Access to Nitro Full for 1 Month'),
(12505, 'en-US', 'Epicgames is offering new users free access to Nitro full for 1 month. Find out how to get this unique opportunity to activate Nitro on your account.'),
(12506, 'en-US', 'Epicgames, Nitro full, free access, promotion, new users, library, activation'),
(12507, 'en-US', 'Epicgames delights its users with the opportunity to get free access to Nitro full for one month. The promotion is valid until June 2, 2022.<br/><br/> To get free access to Nitro full from Epicgames, you need to be a new user, i.e. never have Nitro on your account before. To get Nitro, you need to go to the Epicgames website, add it to your library and activate it via the letter that will be sent to your email.<br/><br/> <a href=\"https://store.epicgames.com/ru/p/discord--discord-nitro\">Link to the promotion</a>'),
(12508, 'en-US', 'New Batch of Skins - Review of the latest additions for the game Rust on Steam'),
(12509, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins for Rust on Steam. Upgrade your arsenal and design, becoming a unique player in the world of Rust.'),
(12510, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, updates, design, collecting'),
(12511, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of skins in the game Rust! In this article, we will tell you about the new batch of skins that were recently added to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Often, Rust players are hungry for fresh skins to customize their items and stand out from the crowd. A skin batch is a unique opportunity to update your character, base, and tools arsenal.</p><br/><br/><p> The developers are constantly working on new skins to meet the needs of players. Each new batch of skins is a collection of unique and colorful designs created with love and attention to detail.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes weapons, clothing, tools, and more. You might want to get skins for your base to make it more memorable, or for your weapons to stand out in the heat of battle.</p><br/><br/><p> Skins in the game Rust are also collectibles for collectors. Some of them can be rare and sought after by players, which makes them especially valuable.</p><br/><br/><p> Also, it is worth mentioning that skins can be purchased in the game store for real money or obtained during game events. The choice is yours how you want to acquire new skins.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to update your skin collection! The new batch is already available on Steam. Adventure time begins!</p>'),
(12512, 'en-US', 'Work on the pets continues'),
(12513, 'en-US', 'Enjoy Rust even more with a new dog model. Learn about the place of pets in the game and how to care for them.'),
(12514, 'en-US', 'Rust, pets, update, dog model, game'),
(12515, 'en-US', 'Dedicated to all fans of the game Rust! Good news for everyone who dreams of a faithful companion in the virtual world. The developers continue to work on pets and delight us with new items. And now, we proudly announce that a new dog model has appeared in the latest update of the game!<br/><br/> Now you have the opportunity to have a true loyal friend who will accompany you on your adventures. Challenge the cold winter nights or the dangers that await at every step, because your dog will always be by your side.<br/><br/> The new dog model is of high quality and realistic. Every detail is worked out to the smallest nuances, from long fluffy fur to lively eyes that reproduce a variety of emotions. You will feel a real connection with your pet!<br/><br/> However, it is important to remember that managing and training your dog takes time and patience. Your companion must get used to you, learn commands and learn how to act in different situations. Be prepared to give your attention and care to your pet to overcome all difficulties together.<br/><br/> And don’t forget that your dog also needs care and nutrition. Feed him regularly and give him enough water to keep him healthy and strong. Also, don’t forget about funny accessories for your pet that will help him stand out from the crowd and emphasize his individuality.<br/><br/> We are sure that the addition of a new dog model will be a real joy for all players, and will give even more emotions and impressions in the game Rust. Join our big family and discover a huge world of adventures with your faithful four-legged companion!'),
(12516, 'en-US', 'New weapon sounds will change'),
(12517, 'en-US', 'We are expecting changes to the weapon sounds in the game Rust, which will happen this week. At the same time, the developers note that the actual updated sounds are still in the process of development, and the existing sounds were temporarily used.'),
(12518, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust updates, weapon sounds, development stage, new sounds'),
(12519, 'en-US', 'According to recent reports, there are changes to weapon sounds coming this week. As a result, players can expect updated sounds to unlock in Rust.<br/><br/> According to sound designer Alex Rehberg, the existing \"new\" weapon sounds on the staging branch have been used and changes will be made this week, while the actual updated sounds are still in development. This reminds us that the content on the staging branch is not the final product.'),
(12520, 'en-US', 'PVP Update: Recoil, Fire Rate, and Sound Changes'),
(12521, 'en-US', 'The PVP update in Rust brought changes to recoil, rate of fire, and gunfire sounds, as well as added new features for players.'),
(12522, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, PVP update, changes, recoil, rate of fire, shooting sounds, crosshair, homemade machine gun, extended magazine'),
(12523, 'en-US', 'The Rust PVP update brought several significant changes that affect gameplay, recoil, and weapons. All of these changes are aimed at balancing and improving game mechanics.<br/><br/> The most noticeable change was the change in recoil on most weapons. The AK now recoils diagonally and is easier to control. However, not every bullet will hit the same spot. Also, the rate of fire of the Thompson and M92 has been significantly reduced to achieve a more balanced game.<br/><br/> In addition, the shooting sounds for the AK, Thompson, Mp5, homemade submachine gun and other weapons have been changed, giving them more realism and atmosphere in the game.<br/><br/> Also, the developers have added new features for players. Now the game has the ability to use a crosshair when aiming, which can be turned off at will. In addition, a new type of weapon was added in the form of a homemade machine gun, which has a capacity of 60 rounds and is distinguished by easy recoil control. Also, an extended magazine was added, which allows you to increase the maximum supply of ammunition by 25%.'),
(12524, 'en-US', 'What transport concept could appear in the game Rust?'),
(12525, 'en-US', 'Find out what kind of transport concept might appear in the game Rust in the future. Consider the possible introduction of cars, helicopters and other types of transport into the gameplay.'),
(12526, 'en-US', 'game Rust, transport in the game, updates to the game Rust, the concept of transport in Rust'),
(12527, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam is constantly evolving and updating, offering players new features and functionality. One of the interesting topics for discussion is the question of the concept of transport in the game. Many players wonder what types of transport may appear in Rust in the future.</p><br/><br/><p> In recent updates, the developers have introduced various forms of transportation, such as boats and bicycles. However, it can be assumed that this is far from the limit and in the future, more complex and unique types of transport will appear in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> One possible transport concept could be the introduction of cars. This would add new opportunities to explore the vast game world and increase the speed of players\' movement. However, developers must also consider the balance between transport and the rest of the gameplay so as not to disrupt the game\'s economy and create an imbalance between players.</p><br/><br/><p> Another interesting idea could be to introduce helicopters or even airplanes into the game. This would open up possibilities for fast travel and provide players with unique opportunities to explore the surrounding area. However, introducing airborne vehicles could also pose certain problems, such as accessibility and difficulty of use.</p><br/><br/><p> Additionally, developers could experiment with more exotic forms of transportation, such as jet skis or even roller skates. This would add variety to the gameplay and give players the opportunity to enjoy new forms of entertainment.</p><br/><br/><p> Ultimately, the choice of transport concept in Rust depends on the preferences of the developers and the interests of the player community. In any case, adding new types of transport will allow the game to become even more diverse and exciting.</p>'),
(12528, 'en-US', 'New Weapon Sway Effects in Rust: Confirmation and Disable Option'),
(12529, 'en-US', 'Confirmation of new weapon swing effects in Rust and the ability to disable them at the player\'s discretion.'),
(12530, 'en-US', 'new weapon swing effects, Rust, updates, disabling effects, game realism, comfortable gaming environment'),
(12531, 'en-US', '<p>The latest updates to Rust for Steam have added new effects for weapon swinging in your hands while moving, as well as the sight. This adds additional realism to the gameplay and increases immersion.</p><br/><p> However, the development team understands that some players may not like these effects or find them uncomfortable. Therefore, we are happy to confirm that the new updates will add the ability to disable these effects at the player\'s discretion.</p><br/><p> This decision was made after carefully analyzing community feedback and understanding the different preferences of players. The development team strives to find a balance between adding new features and taking into account the preferences of their audience.</p><br/><p> This way, every Rust player will have the opportunity to customize the game to their taste. If you like the feeling of realism and dynamics, you can leave the weapon swing effects active. If you prefer more stable gameplay, you can turn these effects off and enjoy the game in your comfort zone.</p><br/><p> The Rust developers understand that every player is unique and try to accommodate different preferences. This allows for a flexible gaming environment where everyone can customize the game to their needs and feelings.</p><br/><p> To sum it up, the new weapon sway effects while moving and aiming in Rust are one of many new features added to the game. It is important to note that players are given the option to disable these effects to create a comfortable gaming environment. The Rust developers strive to find a balance between new features and player preferences to make the game as satisfying as possible for all participants.</p>'),
(12532, 'en-US', 'PVP update and new recoil coming in the next global update on June 2'),
(12533, 'en-US', 'The upcoming Rust update is expected to bring a significant change to PVP and recoil. The developers have unveiled new details of the update, including reworked recoil, an extended magazine, and an improved sight. Find out all the details in the article!'),
(12534, 'en-US', 'Rust update, PVP, recoil, berdanka, magazine, interface sight'),
(12535, 'en-US', 'Rust developers have announced that the upcoming global update, scheduled for June 2, will bring several significant changes to PVP and recoil.<br/><br/> In their latest video, the developers shared details of the update:<br/><br/> - The recoil system for the Berdanka has been completely reworked. Now shooting will have a new, more realistic recoil mechanics, which will add more challenge and skill to combat.<br/><br/> - The magazine has been significantly expanded. Players will now be able to store 25% more ammo in the magazine, thanks to the updated magazine module. This is especially useful for owners of Berdan rifles, who will be able to fit 20 rounds in the clip.<br/><br/> - The interface sight has been improved, which will help the player to aim more accurately at the target and will increase the ease of use.<br/><br/> These changes will significantly impact the PVP gameplay and will also help create a more realistic game experience. They are expected to add more fun and adventure to the world of Rust.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget to stay tuned to stay up to date with all the new features and changes that are constantly being added to the Rust game.'),
(12536, 'en-US', 'Copter on a moving vehicle: a new opportunity'),
(12537, 'en-US', 'The new update to the Rust game will add the ability to land copters on moving trains and car platforms.'),
(12538, 'en-US', 'copter, moving transport, landing, trains, cars, update'),
(12539, 'en-US', 'Now you can land the copter on a moving vehicle!'),
(12540, 'en-US', 'Added cactus icon and name to death screen info'),
(12541, 'en-US', 'The developers of Rust have added a cactus icon and name to the death information on the game screen. This original update adds interest and personality to the gameplay.'),
(12542, 'en-US', 'Rust game, update, icon, name, cactus, death screen'),
(12543, 'en-US', '<p>The developers of the game Rust pleased players with a new update, which added the icon and name of the cactus to the information on the death screen.</p><br/><p> Now, when a character dies in the game, the cactus icon and name appear on the death screen, which gives this sad moment some originality. It\'s a small but important change that adds variety and interest to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> The cactus icon and name can be not only a decoration on the death screen, but also a way to express your individuality in the game. Players can choose a unique icon and name for their cactus, which will be displayed on the death screen. This is a great opportunity to show your creativity and stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> The addition of the cactus icon and name to the death screen information is also part of a more general update that includes various improvements and bug fixes. The Rust developers are constantly working to improve the game, listening to player feedback and taking their wishes into account.</p><br/><p> Rust has long been a popular game among players due to its original concept and exciting gameplay. The addition of the cactus icon and name to the death screen information only confirms the attention to detail and care of the developers for their audience.</p>'),
(12544, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins in the game Rust and the new unique items added by the developers. Article about new skins in Rust.'),
(12545, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust game, Rust on Steam, skins in Rust, Rust skins, Rust update'),
(12546, 'en-US', 'Hello, dear players and fans of the game Rust! We have good news for you - a new batch of skins has been added to the game! Every time the developer pleases us by releasing an update, we are waiting for new unique skins for weapons, tools and items. In this article, we will look at all the most interesting and cool skins that have just appeared in Rust.'),
(12547, 'en-US', 'Work is underway on the following changes:'),
(12548, 'en-US', 'A look at the new changes coming to Rust: updated damage indicators, muted notifications, updated weapon recoil, and hit markers.'),
(12549, 'en-US', 'Work, changes, directional damage indicator, notification, SAR recoil, hit markers, Rust, updates'),
(12550, 'en-US', 'In the game Rust, the developers are working on several interesting changes that will soon be available to players. In this article, we will look at the main changes that are being worked on:'),
(12551, 'en-US', 'Hapis is back!'),
(12552, 'en-US', 'Learn about the return of the Hapis map to Rust! The new map features updated graphics, new rocks, and an updated desert biome. Learn more about the changes and explore a unique map in Rust!'),
(12553, 'en-US', 'Hapis, update, map, graphics, rocks, desert biome, Rust, 2016, sand mountains, base, screenshots'),
(12554, 'en-US', '<h1>Hapis is back!</h1><br/><br/><p> After a year of development, the Hapis map is back in Rust! It now features updated graphics, new rocks, and an updated desert biome. Most of the changes have been made to the rocks and natural environment of the map, giving it the feel of the early versions of the game in 2016.</p><br/><br/><p> The new map offers players new rocks, islands and more spacious fields. Particularly impressive changes affected the desert, which turned into huge sand mountains. Here, players can feel tiny on this island. Having a car has become even more relevant on the new map. In addition, in another part of the biome there are large rocks that offer space for building bases of any size.</p><br/><br/><p> The changes to Hapis are best described by the screenshots themselves. Make sure you check out all the updates and explore this unique map in Rust!</p>'),
(12555, 'en-US', 'Updated HAPIS Map: Explore New Locations on Rust STAGING BRANCH on Steam'),
(12556, 'en-US', 'The unique updated map HAPIS is now available on the STAGING BRANCH in the game Rust on Steam. Join the exciting journey through new locations and explore the fantastic world of Rust.'),
(12557, 'en-US', 'HAPIS map update, new locations, STAGING BRANCH, Rust, Steam'),
(12558, 'en-US', 'The unique updated HAPIS map is now available on the STAGING BRANCH in the Rust game on Steam. This extensive updated version of the map features amazing new locations ready to be explored. Forget about familiar corners and go on an exciting journey through the world of Rust to discover everything that awaits you on the updated HAPIS map. From breathtaking mountain ranges to mysterious forests, every step on this map will bring you new adventures and opportunities.'),
(12559, 'en-US', 'Update: Now you can enable FPS counter in Rust game settings'),
(12560, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update introduces an FPS counter in the game settings, which will allow players to control and optimize the game\'s performance and graphics for a smoother and better gaming experience.'),
(12561, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, FPS counter, settings, performance, gaming experience, graphics'),
(12562, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update has great news for all players. Now you can fully control the performance of your game by adding an FPS counter to the game settings. This functionality will allow you to not only control and optimize graphics settings for the best gaming experience, but also provide you with information about your system\'s performance. From now on, you can easily track your current frames per second (FPS) and make various settings to achieve the best balance between graphics quality and game performance.</p><br/><p> The FPS counter is a handy tool that allows gamers to fine-tune the graphics settings to suit their computer\'s capabilities and preferences. It displays the current number of frames per second that your system is rendering, allowing you to easily determine whether your computer is capable of running the game smoothly at the graphics settings you\'ve selected.</p><br/><p> Once you enable the FPS counter in the Rust game settings, you will see it displayed in the corner of the screen. It will display the current FPS in real time, and you will be able to see how it changes when you make changes to the graphics settings. This will allow you to instantly assess which changes affect the game\'s performance and make effective decisions to achieve the best balance between graphics and performance. With this tool, players can easily optimize the game and customize it to their liking to get the smoothest gameplay and the best graphics.</p><br/><p> FPS counter in the game settings Rust is one of the key updates that allows players to have maximum control over the game\'s performance and graphics settings. It provides not only ease of use, but also helps optimize the game\'s performance on your computer. Now you can configure the game so that it is best suited to your computer and enjoy smooth and high-quality gaming without performance issues.</p><br/><p> The Rust game update with the addition of the FPS counter in the settings is a step forward in providing a more efficient and high-quality game for all players. Don\'t miss the chance to improve your gaming experience and customize the game to your liking. Enable the FPS counter in the game settings and enjoy the Rust game with the highest performance and high-quality graphics.</p><br/> <b>Author: Science writer</b><br/> <i>Date: September 25, 2021</i>'),
(12563, 'en-US', 'Filters in Rust: New Rules and Consequences'),
(12564, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new rules in Rust related to the use of filters and the consequences that can occur if they are violated.'),
(12565, 'en-US', 'game Rust, filters, cheating, account blocking, developers, game rules'),
(12566, 'en-US', '<h3>Filters in Rust: New Rules and Consequences</h3><br/><br/><p> Gamers, beware! It was recently announced that using filters in the game Rust is now considered cheating, similar to using third-party software (cheats). Using these tools is not only strictly prohibited, but can also lead to a permanent account ban.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust developers previously banned filters, not supporting their use in the game. However, these restrictions were the only precautions. Now there is a strict policy that bans the use of filters completely and permanently.</p><br/><br/><p> The news was announced in an official tweet from the developers. The main message strongly emphasizes that using third-party software to gain an unfair advantage is strictly against the rules. This applies to both cheats and using filters to gain an advantage during game night time.</p><br/><br/><p> Violating these rules may result in serious consequences, including permanent account blocking. To avoid unpleasant surprises and maintain the integrity of the gaming experience, you should refrain from using filters and other prohibited applications.</p><br/><br/><p> Once you have read this important information, be sure to share it with others. This will help keep the gaming community fair and united.</p>'),
(12567, 'en-US', 'The previously announced functionality of the spray can is back!'),
(12568, 'en-US', 'The return of the spray can functionality in the game Rust has been announced! Players will be able to draw and insert patterns on the surface. Also, new NPC scientists will come to the spaceport.'),
(12569, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam game, update, balloon, drawing, templates, NPC students, spaceport'),
(12570, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust are pleased to announce the return of the long-awaited spray can functionality! Now each player will be able to show their creative nature by creating and inserting patterns on various surfaces. The game drawing will remain on the surface for 3 hours, after which it will disappear, giving the game world even more originality and diversity. It is worth noting that the introduction of this function will most likely be accompanied by certain changes to the payment system for game features.<br/><br/> In addition, new interesting entities will appear at the spaceport in the game Rust. Along with the Bradley tank, NPC scientists will also come to the game world, living both inside and on the roof of the main building. These scientists will add atmosphere and dynamism to the gameplay, forcing players to think about new tactics and strategies.'),
(12571, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of skins in Rust, featuring unique designs for weapons, tools, and clothing. Add some personality to your in-game look and stay tuned for more updates and offers.'),
(12572, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust updates, weapon skins, tool skins, clothing skins, adding personality'),
(12573, 'en-US', 'A batch of new skins are available in the game Rust on the Steam platform! The update includes a wide range of new designs for weapons, tools, costumes and other items. Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your gaming style with these unique skins! In this article, we will tell you about some of the most striking and impressive skins to help you make a choice.<br/><br/> Weapons are one of the main components of the Rust gaming experience, so the new weapon skins deserve special attention. Our batch includes skins for various types of weapons, ranging from automatic rifles and pistols to melee weapons such as knives and axes. Each skin has its own unique theme, from classic and simple designs to futuristic and fantastical.<br/><br/> The new batch of skins also includes updates for tools and items. Now you can stand out in an original way with new skins for pickaxes, axes and other tools. Costumes were also not left without attention - the batch includes stylish and colorful skins for clothes and equipment that will help you look unique in the game world.<br/><br/> Choosing new skins can be difficult, as each item can be quite expensive. Therefore, before buying, it is recommended to read reviews and ratings from other players. The opinions of the community will help you make the right choice and avoid disappointment.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your gaming look and add a little personality to Rust with a new batch of skins. Subscribe to our newsletter to stay up to date with all the updates and offers. Exciting adventures in Rust await you!'),
(12574, 'en-US', 'The dollar exchange rate in the Rust store has been reduced to 70 rubles'),
(12575, 'en-US', 'Important news for Rust players! The dollar exchange rate in the Rust store has been reduced to 70 rubles. Now you can get more for your money when buying items in the game. Find out more about the impact of the dollar exchange rate reduction on the game\'s economy.'),
(12576, 'en-US', 'Dollar rate, Rust store, price reduction, game items, economic system'),
(12577, 'en-US', '<p>Important news for Rust players! The dollar exchange rate in the Rust store has been reduced to only 70 rubles!</p><br/><p> This means that you can now get more for your money when purchasing items in the game. The lower dollar value gives players the opportunity to get more in-game resources, gear, and other items at better prices.</p><br/><p> The dollar\'s depreciation is also good news for new players who are just starting their journey into the world of Rust. They will have more options to buy the necessary items and equipment without spending a lot.</p><br/><p> It should be noted that the decline in the dollar exchange rate may affect the game\'s economic system. It may lead to changes in the prices of other currencies or resources in the Rust store. Players should be careful and use this decline to their advantage.</p><br/><p> It is clear that the Rust developers are striving to make the game more accessible and attractive to all players. The dollar depreciation is just one step in this direction. Expect more changes, updates, and improvements to come to Rust.</p>'),
(12578, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Adding HUD Crosshair'),
(12579, 'en-US', 'Rust will be getting a UI crosshair, allowing players to do without third-party programs. Find out how this update will affect gameplay and what the community thinks.'),
(12580, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, interface sight, crosshairs, PVP, gaming experience'),
(12581, 'en-US', '<p>In the near future, the developers of the game Rust plan to add a UI crosshair, also known as crosshairs. This means that players will no longer need to use third-party programs to add a crosshair to the game. This long-awaited update will provide players with a convenient and reliable tool for aiming in the gameplay.</p><br/><p> The addition of the interface sight is one of the key features of the upcoming PVP update. The game developers emphasize its importance and usefulness when fighting other players. Thus, they adhere to the principle of fairness and level of play so that all players can have equal opportunities and conditions in battles.</p><br/><p> The new update that adds the HUD crosshair has received very positive feedback from the Rust community. Many players have been waiting for this feature, and they are happy that it will now be available directly in the game. This means that players will no longer be dependent on third-party programs and will be able to enjoy the full gaming experience without the additional effort and complexity of installing and configuring the crosshair.</p>'),
(12582, 'en-US', 'There is no more imbalance!'),
(12583, 'en-US', 'The article talks about disabling Nvidia filters in the game Rust, which became a new stage in the fight against imbalance and ensuring equal opportunities for all players.'),
(12584, 'en-US', 'imbalance, Rust, Alistair, Nvidia filters, gameplay, players'),
(12585, 'en-US', '<p>Alistair, the developer of the game Rust, shared important news on his Twitter account that will please many players - the imbalance will no longer be present in the game!</p><br/><p> One of the important changes was the disabling of Nvidia filters, which previously gave some players an advantage in the dark. Now every player will have equal opportunities and chances to win.</p><br/><p> The decision to disable filters was made taking into account the balance of the game and fairness for all players. Now no one will be able to use such cheating and gain an unacceptable advantage.</p><br/><p> We are pleased that the Rust development team continues to work on improving the gameplay and creating a fair and adequate gaming environment, where each player can achieve success only through their skill and strategy.</p>'),
(12586, 'en-US', 'Rust Game: New Update and Interesting Video on YouTube'),
(12587, 'en-US', 'The game Rust continues to please its fans with new updates. One of the latest updates added new locations, weapons and tools to the game. In addition, an exciting video demonstrating survival skills in the world of Rust appeared on YouTube.'),
(12588, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, video, YouTube, survival, gamers'),
(12589, 'en-US', '<p>There are many popular projects in the gaming industry, but one of them stands out for its uniqueness and incredible atmosphere of survival - this is the game Rust. This project has gained immense popularity among gamers and currently continues to please its fans with new updates and interesting content.</p><br/><br/><p> It is worth noting that the Rust developers recently released another update, which added many new features and functions to the game. The new update focused on improving graphics and optimizing performance, allowing players to enjoy an even more realistic and colorful gaming environment.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the most interesting updates was the introduction of new locations and resources. Players can now explore different biomes, including jungles, deserts, and snowy mountains. Each location offers its own features and unique resources that will help you survive in the harsh world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, the new update added new weapons and tools that will allow players to fight and survive more effectively. The battles have now become even more dynamic and varied, and the character progression has become even more interesting and rich.</p><br/><br/><p> But it\'s not just the game update that\'s bringing joy to Rust fans. A fascinating video was recently published on the popular video hosting site YouTube, in which an experienced player demonstrated his survival and construction skills in the world of Rust. The video features beautiful editing and an interesting commentary from the author, which makes it even more exciting to watch.</p><br/><br/><p> So, if you are a fan of the game Rust, then you should definitely check out the latest updates and watch the exciting video on YouTube. You will have an unforgettable immersion in the world of survival and battles, which has become loved by millions of gamers around the world.</p>'),
(12590, 'en-US', 'Hapis Map Update in Rust'),
(12591, 'en-US', 'The article will discuss the return of the Hapis map to the Rust game, the improvements and changes that the developers have made to the updated version, as well as the expectations of players before the launch of the map.'),
(12592, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, map Hapis, devblog, gameplay'),
(12593, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest dev blog, the developers of Rust have happily announced that the long-awaited Hapis map is returning to the game. The development of the map is nearing completion and the updated version is almost ready to launch with the June update of the game.</p><br/><p> The Hapis map has become one of the most popular locations in Rust, thanks to its unique structure and interesting gameplay features. However, in previous versions of the game, the map was temporarily removed for improvement.</p><br/><p> Now the developers are happy to announce that the Hapis map is in the final stages of updating and is getting ready to return to the game. The updated version of the map will contain various improvements and fixes that will make the gameplay even more exciting.</p><br/><p> Players are looking forward to exploring the world of Hapis again and facing new challenges and dangers. The developers promise that the updated map will offer unique gameplay opportunities and locations that will make players dive into the fascinating world of Rust again.</p><br/><p> The June update of the Rust game will be a real treat for all fans of the Hapis map. This means that players have very little time to wait before they can go on exciting adventures in the updated location.</p>'),
(12594, 'en-US', 'What awaits us today in the game Rust'),
(12595, 'en-US', 'Optimization, new death screen icons and other updates in the game Rust'),
(12596, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, updates, optimization, icons, death screen, weather, NPC, trains, zipline');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(12597, 'en-US', 'What awaits us today...<br/><br/> Optimization<br/> This month, the team prioritized various performance improvements:<br/><br/> ▫️ Fixed a performance drop when inspecting a deployed boombox in a crowded base.<br/> ▫️ Fixed an issue where laser lights would not load their speed settings properly if they were enabled during server loading.<br/> ▫️ The beds are more optimized in terms of productivity.<br/><br/> Death Screen Icons<br/> ▫️ New information has been added to the death screen. An icon has appeared indicating who killed and with what.<br/><br/> Other updates<br/> ▫️ Reduced the probability of \"bad weather\": now 90% of days will be clear.<br/> ▫️ Fixed a bug where NPCs would sometimes patrol junkyards incorrectly.<br/> ▫️ Fixed issues with the floating outpost railroad on some map seeds.<br/> ▫️ Fixed a bug due to which the grenade launcher reload was displayed incorrectly in first-person view.<br/> ▫️ AA can no longer be damaged by bullet damage.<br/> ▫️ Fixed a bug due to which the key card did not appear in the dumps.<br/><br/> Trains and zipline update in more detail in our VK subscribe https://vk.com/@rustcommru-obnovlenie-ot-5-maya'),
(12598, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of Rust skins on Steam that will allow you to add personality and style to your characters and items in the game.'),
(12599, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, character skins, weapon skins, clothing skins, building material skins, individuality, style, gameplay features'),
(12600, 'en-US', '<p>Exciting new skins for Rust are now available on Steam!</p><br/><p> If you love Rust and want to give your characters a new look, then you should definitely read this article about the new batch of skins that just hit the game!</p><br/><p> New skins will give you the opportunity to add personality and style to your characters in Rust. They are presented in a wide range, allowing you to choose exactly those skins that suit your taste.</p><br/><p> Each skin is carefully designed and detailed to create a unique look for your character or item. You will be able to purchase new skins for weapons, clothing, building materials and much more.</p><br/><p> Skins in the game Rust are also a great way to express your individuality and show your opponents your status. On the playing field, you will be able to stand out from other players and cause delight or envy with your new skins.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to bring a fresh wind into your gameplay with new skins for the game Rust on Steam. Hurry up to buy your favorite skins and diversify your gaming experience!</p>'),
(12601, 'en-US', 'Subscribe to news'),
(12602, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with all the events and updates in the game Rust on Steam? Subscribe to our newsletter and be the first to receive up-to-date information about the latest changes and additions to the game!'),
(12603, 'en-US', 'subscription, news, updates, game Rust, Steam'),
(12604, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with all the events and updates in the game Rust on Steam? Then subscribe to our newsletter and be the first to receive up-to-date information about the latest changes and additions to the game! Our team constantly monitors updates and prioritizes all news related to the game Rust on Steam. Be in the center of events, learn first about new features, fixes and improvements to the gameplay. Your subscription to our news will help you stay ahead of other players. Don\'t miss your chance to stay up to date with the latest news and subscribe to our newsletter today!'),
(12605, 'en-US', 'A new round of Twich drops begins!'),
(12606, 'en-US', 'A new round of Twich drops will start on May 5, 2022, along with a global update to the Rust game. Participate with famous streamers and get exclusive rewards.'),
(12607, 'en-US', 'Twich drops, new round, update, Rust game, streamers, event, exclusive rewards'),
(12608, 'en-US', '<h2>A new round of Twich drops begins!</h2><br/><p> On May 5, 2022, a new round of Twich drops will start along with a global update of the Rust game. This time, famous streamers such as CAMOMO10, Lucroan, Monnyssima, 12robg, 03Alexia03, IsVolcano, TORE1005, NotoriusPig, elbanan0 will take part.</p><br/><p> The event will start at 22:00 Moscow time on May 5, 2022 and will end at 02:59 Moscow time on May 13, 2022.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on exclusive Twitch drops during these top streamers\' streams! Stay up to date with the latest news and events on the official Twitch website at:</p><br/><p> <a href=\"https://twitch.facepunch.com\">https://twitch.facepunch.com</a></p>'),
(12609, 'en-US', 'The Rust team has almost finished reworking the Hapis map for new graphics, but there is still a part that hasn\'t been reworked - the west coast.'),
(12610, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, Hapis map, graphics, developers'),
(12611, 'en-US', '<h2>The Hapis map rework for new graphics is almost complete</h2><br/><p> The Rust team has announced that the rework of the Hapis map for new graphics is almost complete. This means that players will be able to enjoy updated visuals and an improved atmosphere of the game world.</p><br/><p> The rework of the Hapis map is one of the key processes in the development of the Rust game. The new graphics will allow players to immerse themselves in a more realistic and exciting gaming environment.</p><br/><p> However, the developers have reported that there is still a part of the Hapis map that has not been reworked - the west coast. This means that players will be able to enjoy updated graphics on the main part of the map, but will have to wait a little longer to see improvements on the west coast.</p><br/><p> The Hapis map update is just one of many updates and improvements that the development team is bringing to Rust. They are also working on fixing bugs, adding new content, and improving the gaming experience for all players.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned for all the latest Rust news and updates!</p>'),
(12612, 'en-US', 'Come to us at DS - Take part in skin giveaways and win 5000 rubles!'),
(12613, 'en-US', 'Join us at DS, where exciting skin and cash prize draws are taking place. A unique opportunity to win cool skins and win 5,000 rubles!'),
(12614, 'en-US', 'Rust, skins, giveaways, Discord, DS, 5000 rubles'),
(12615, 'en-US', '<p>Join us on the Discord server (DS) where we host exciting skin and cash prize giveaways.</p><br/><p> We have a unique opportunity to win cool skins for your favorite weapons in the game Rust, as well as a chance to win 5,000 rubles!</p><br/><p> Our giveaways include skins of varying rarities, from common to legendary, that add unique style to your weapons and gear.</p><br/><p> Come visit us at DS and join our active and friendly community for a chance to become a winner in our exciting giveaways.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to win the skins you want and even real money! Join us on DS right now and enjoy playing Rust!</p>'),
(12616, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins in Rust on Steam and how they can add freshness and style to your gaming experience. Consider the importance of choosing skins and how they affect your interactions with other players.'),
(12617, 'en-US', 'new batch, skins, game Rust, Steam, store, experience, character, modification, price'),
(12618, 'en-US', '<p>A new batch of skins has arrived in Rust on Steam to give players the freshest and most stylish outfit options for their characters. If you like to customize your character with new looks and effects, this new addition is perfect for you.</p><br/><br/><p> This new batch of skins contains a variety of unique items including weapons, clothing, buildings and other accessories. Each of these skins is a carefully crafted piece of art that will add new colors and impressions to your gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><p> Skins in Rust not only make your character more unique, but also create new opportunities for interaction with other players. They allow you to stand out from the crowd and emphasize your individual style. In addition, popular skins can become an object of desire and trade among other players.</p><br/><br/><p> However, before you decide to buy new skins, it is worth assessing their cost and potential profit from selling them. Some skins can be quite expensive and it will be more profitable to sell them on the marketplace than to use them in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to remember that skins in the game Rust do not affect the game mechanics and balance, they are simply cosmetic items. Thus, their presence or absence does not affect your victory or defeat in the game. The decision to purchase skins should be conscious and based only on your personal preference and financial capabilities.</p><br/><br/><p> All new skins can be found in the Steam store, where they are offered at various prices. Be sure to check out the catalog to find what you like and what suits your character and playstyle.</p>'),
(12619, 'en-US', 'Adding three new wagons to the test line'),
(12620, 'en-US', 'Learn about the addition of three new types of wagons to the test branch of the Rust game and the fix for a bug related to the spawn of the green card at the \"Dump\" location.'),
(12621, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, wagons, couplings, transportation, resources, error fix, green card, Dump'),
(12622, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to the Rust game added three new types of wagons to the test branch, bringing more possibilities for gameplay.</p><p> Now you can find a tank car, a regular car with a roof and a car without a roof. Using special couplings, you can connect them into a train, creating more and more powerful and functional trains.</p><p> This variety of wagons will allow players to more flexibly plan and carry out operations related to the transportation of materials and resources, as well as strengthen their defenses if necessary.</p><br/><p> In addition, the developers fixed the error associated with the spawn of the green card at the location \"Dump\". Now the card can be found on the table without problems.</p><p> The update adds new depth to the gameplay and fixes some technical issues, making the game even more interesting and enjoyable for every player.</p>'),
(12623, 'en-US', 'Added avatars (cause of death)'),
(12624, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new update for Rust on Steam, which adds avatars that show the causes of death of characters. This innovation adds visual variety and information to the game.'),
(12625, 'en-US', 'avatars, causes of death, update, game Rust, Steam'),
(12626, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam adds new avatars to represent the various causes of death in the game. Now, when a player dies, their character will have a unique image showing how they died.'),
(12627, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Air Defense No Longer Takes Damage From Bullets'),
(12628, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust has made some important changes: Air Defenses no longer take damage from bullets, and the chance of getting car parts from trash heaps has been reduced. Find out how these changes will affect gameplay.'),
(12629, 'en-US', 'Rust update, Rust air defense, Rust bullet damage, Rust car parts'),
(12630, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust has seen several changes related to player base security and the ability to obtain car parts.</p><br/><br/><p> The first major change is that AA (anti-aircraft weapons) will no longer take damage from bullets. This means that players who are trying to destroy another player\'s base using armed aircraft will no longer be able to simply fire at the AA and destroy it. Players defending their AA base can now be more confident in the safety of their aircraft.</p><br/><br/><p> The second major change is related to obtaining car parts from trash heaps. The developers have reduced the likelihood that players will be able to obtain valuable parts for their cars by exploring trash heaps. Now players will have to show more patience and luck to get the necessary components for their vehicles.</p><br/><br/><p> Both of these changes represent trade-offs between accessibility and game balance. On the one hand, the player\'s base security has been improved, on the other hand, obtaining car parts has become more difficult. The Rust developers continue to work on improving the game experience and are constantly analyzing various factors to create an interesting and balanced game world.</p>'),
(12631, 'en-US', 'Rust Weather Update: Sunny Days Ahead'),
(12632, 'en-US', 'A new update for the game Rust changes the weather, making rain and fog less frequent. Now players can enjoy more sunny days in the virtual world.'),
(12633, 'en-US', 'Rust game, weather update, sunny days, rain, fog, gaming experience'),
(12634, 'en-US', '<p>The new update for the game Rust has brought good news for all players. Now bad weather, including fog, rain and other weather conditions, will appear less often. The chance of sunny days has been increased to 90%.</p><br/><p> This change is especially welcome for players, as it has been over two years since weather was added to the game as part of the Halloween 2020 update. During this time, players have repeatedly complained about too much rain and fog, which could sometimes negatively affect the gameplay experience.</p><br/><p> Now, thanks to the update, players will be able to spend more time in sunny locations, enjoying the beauty of the surrounding world and fighting opponents without the influence of bad weather.</p><br/><p> You can find out the details of the update and other news about the game Rust on the official page <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269973387\">Rust Comm RU</a> on the social network VKontakte.</p>'),
(12635, 'en-US', 'A workplace with a cozy atmosphere and interesting colleagues'),
(12636, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at a workplace that attracts attention with its special atmosphere and interesting colleagues. Find out how a cozy workspace contributes to increased productivity and brings joy to each of us.'),
(12637, 'en-US', 'workplace, atmosphere, colleagues, coffee, efficiency, comfort, friendliness'),
(12638, 'en-US', '<p>In the modern world, work plays a huge role in the life of each of us. And it is not only the place where we spend most of our time, but also affects our mood, efficiency and quality of work.</p><br/><p> In this article, we will look at a workplace that attracts attention with its special atmosphere and interesting colleagues.</p><br/><p> One of the important components of a cozy workplace is the opportunity to enjoy a cup of aromatic coffee. After all, as we know, a cup of coffee can wake you up and inspire you to new achievements. Therefore, it is not surprising that in our workspace there is always a place for a coffee machine and an aromatic drink.</p><br/><p> But that\'s not all. Our workplaces are always filled with good spirits and smiles, because Spider works with us - our irreplaceable colleague. This funny character easily breaks all stereotypes about spiders, bringing his characteristic energy and positive attitude to our team.</p><br/><p> We believe that having a cozy and friendly workspace contributes to increased efficiency and brings joy to each of us. And, of course, a special role in this is played by our interesting and sociable colleagues, who are always ready to share experiences and support each other.</p><br/><p> Thus, our workplace is a perfect balance of comfort, creativity and friendly atmosphere. We are proud of our workspace and are happy to share this joy and inspiration with all our readers.</p>'),
(12639, 'en-US', 'Added clan system to aux branch of Rust game'),
(12640, 'en-US', 'In the game Rust on the aux branch, a clan system has been added, allowing leaders to manage clans more comfortably and in an organized manner. The article discusses the new functionality of the clan system and the possibilities of clan management.'),
(12641, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, clans, system, functionality, emblem, ranks, announcements, event log, clan management, aux branch, testing'),
(12642, 'en-US', 'A clan system has been added to the aux branch.<br/><br/> Now large clans will receive a separate command system, which will include the following functionality:<br/><br/> • Clan emblem: you can draw any emblem you want right in the game. The banner color can also be repainted<br/> • List of clan members, who invited them and when<br/> • Ranks: clan members will be distributed by ranks. Ranks can be whatever you like - they are created and distributed by the clan leader himself<br/> • Announcements: The leader can notify players about any events or news directly in the announcements tab<br/> • Event Log: Displays what is happening in the clan among players, indicating the time when it happened<br/><br/> You can change the rank of each player, and also add tags to them - in case you need to remember something about the player you need, or if he changes his name.<br/><br/> The ability to manage a clan may not only be the leader - rights can be delegated to any ranks at your discretion. Of the available rights that can be enabled/disabled, there are:<br/> - Change MOTD (the clan announcement that appears when you enter the game)<br/> — Editing a banner<br/> — The right to invite players<br/> — The right to kick players<br/> — The right to promote players<br/> — The right to demote players<br/> — Add notes to players<br/><br/> It is unknown whether this will make it into the May game update, but at the moment the functionality is more or less complete. You can test the clan system on the aux01 branch.'),
(12643, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest news and updates for Rust on Steam! We are pleased to announce that a new batch of skins has been added to the game, giving your in-game items an original and stylish look. Subscribe and stay up to date with all the news and updates for Rust on Steam!'),
(12644, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, skins, updates, news, subscription, Steam'),
(12645, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest news and updates for Rust on Steam! We are pleased to announce that a new batch of skins has been added to the game, giving your in-game items an original and stylish look. Tired of standard weapons and equipment? Then these new skins are definitely for you! Each batch of skins brings a fresh breeze into the game world and gives you the opportunity to stand out from other players.<br/><br/> Subscribe to our group and be the first to know about the latest news and updates! Find out about all the new skins, promotions and events in the game Rust. Be in trend and do not miss a single new skin. Subscribe right now and be one of the first to know about new skins and be able to purchase them for your collection. Come to us and join each new wave of exclusive skins.<br/><br/> The game Rust will become much more interesting and diverse thanks to the new batch of skins. Do not miss your chance to stand out among other players and make your game brighter and more memorable. In the game Rust you will find many opportunities for self-expression and individuality. New skins are a great way to emphasize your style and uniqueness. Install skins on your items and show everyone your superiority and originality. Come to the game and look for a new batch of skins today!<br/><br/> Subscribe and stay up to date with all the news and updates of the game Rust on Steam!'),
(12646, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Added -last month branch'),
(12647, 'en-US', 'Rust has added a new -last month branch that you can activate to help contribute to content development. Learn how to use this beta and help the developers.'),
(12648, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, branch -last month, beta version activation, content refinement'),
(12649, 'en-US', 'Now the game Rust has a new branch -last month, which can be used in addition to the main and Staging versions. To activate this version, you need to follow just a few simple steps. First, open your Steam library and find the game Rust. Then right-click on the game and select the \"Properties\" section. In the window that opens, go to the \"Beta\" tab and select the \"last-month\" option. Now you can use this version of the game.<br/><br/> The introduction of the new branch -last month was made for those players who actively interact with the content and components of the game. It allows users to help the developers in refining the content introduced in the previous update. The official Rust website calls this beta version \"Last Month\".'),
(12650, 'en-US', 'Rust update: added avatar with cause of death'),
(12651, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Rust update, which adds avatars with causes of death. Now you can better understand why your character was killed and learn from your mistakes.'),
(12652, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, avatars, causes of death, gameplay'),
(12653, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust on Steam has brought some exciting changes that we want to share with you.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main innovations is the addition of avatars with causes of death. Now you will be able to find out why your character had to say goodbye to life. Whether it was a chicken attack, a polar bear attack, a copter explosion or even an unexpected collision with a cow - each reason will be displayed as a corresponding image on your avatar.</p><br/><br/><p> This update will not only add more fun to the gameplay, but will also allow you to better understand what factors can speed you up to Valhalla. Now you can learn from your mistakes, become a stronger and more careful player.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget to check your profile to see your new avatar and the accompanying cause of death. We are sure that you will like these new avatars and will make the gameplay even more interesting and varied!</p>'),
(12654, 'en-US', 'Now the death screen will display the avatar of your offender if you are mauled by an animal'),
(12655, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new feature in Rust that allows you to see the offender\'s avatar on the death screen if you are attacked by an animal.'),
(12656, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, avatar, offender, animal, death screen'),
(12657, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to the game Rust on Steam has introduced a new feature that allows players to see the offender\'s avatar on the death screen after being attacked by an animal.</p><br/><p> Now, if you are attacked by a deer, boar, bear or wolf, you will be able to see the avatar of that animal, which adds realism and intrigue to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> This change makes the gaming experience even more immersive, allowing players to get to know their bullies better and adapt to their tactics and lifestyle.</p><br/><p> This innovation not only brings aesthetic improvements to the game, but also provides players with information about which types of animals are the most dangerous and require more careful behavior.</p>'),
(12658, 'en-US', 'New skins in the workshop - possibly soon in the game!'),
(12659, 'en-US', 'There are some interesting new skins for Rust in the workshop, maybe we\'ll see them in the game soon. Black Gold - L96, Neon Storage Small Cards, Black Gold - Semi Auto Rifle, Carbon Fiber, Neon Storage Small Meds, Glacial Visage Double Door and Scientific Scrap Storage.'),
(12660, 'en-US', 'Skins, new items, workshop, game Rust, steam'),
(12661, 'en-US', '<p>The workshop has some interesting new skins that we might soon see in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> The first one worth paying attention to is Black Gold - L96. This skin offers an exotic black and gold color scheme for the L96 automatic rifle. </p><br/><img src=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2796406383&searchtext=\" alt=\"Black Gold - L96\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\"><br/><p> The Neon Small Storage Room Maps are another cool skin that can be found in the workshop. They will add some brightness and saturation to your base. </p><br/><img src=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2796573337&searchtext=\" alt=\"Neon Storage Small Cards\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\"><br/><p> Black Gold - Semi Auto Rifle offers a stylish black and gold design for a semi-automatic rifle. Classic design with modern elements will make your game even brighter. </p><br/><img src=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2792917872\" alt=\"Black Gold - Semi Auto Rifle\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\"><br/><p> If you prefer a more technoid style, you might like the Carbon Fiber skin. It will add elegance and chic to your weapons. </p><br/><img src=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2792995469\" alt=\"Carbon Fiber\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\"><br/><p> The new Neon Storage Small Meds skin is a bright and stylish option for small medical storages. Now your drugs will stand out in the database. </p><br/><img src=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2793155926&searchtext=\" alt=\"Neon Storage Small Meds\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\"><br/><p> For those who value style and aesthetics, Glacial Visage Double Door is a great choice. This skin will turn your doors into a work of art. </p><br/><img src=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2796628392&searchtext=\" alt=\"Glacial Visage Double Door\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\"><br/><p> And finally, Scientific Scrap Storage - a convenient storage for your scientific scrap. This skin will bring some scientific atmosphere to your base. </p><br/><img src=\"https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2795071027&searchtext=\" alt=\"Scientific Scrap Storage\" width=\"500\" height=\"300\">'),
(12662, 'en-US', 'YouTuber Arthur (MAGICOW) got married!'),
(12663, 'en-US', 'YouTuber Artur (MAGICOW) has let slip his wedding - such news is impossible to miss! Congratulations to Artur and his chosen one on this significant event!'),
(12664, 'en-US', 'Youtuber, Arthur, MAGICOW, wedding, videos, congratulations, family life'),
(12665, 'en-US', 'YouTuber Artur (MAGICOW) has let slip his wedding - such news is impossible to miss! Congratulations to Artur and his chosen one on this significant event!<br/><br/> Arthur, the legendary YouTube content creator known as MAGICOW, continues to amaze his fans and delight them with his cool videos. He shared the happy news of his wedding, and we are very enthusiastic about congratulating him and wishing him happiness and prosperity in his new family life.<br/><br/> Arthur has long gained popularity for his unique style, in which he combines humor, magic and gaming expertise. His videos are viewed by millions of people around the world, and he continues to attract new viewers with his talent and creativity.<br/><br/> We are looking forward to new exciting projects from MAGICOW and wish him and his wife a sea of joy, mutual understanding and success in all their endeavors. Subscribe to our newsletter to stay up to date with all new videos from MAGICOW and be the first to congratulate him on his future achievements!'),
(12666, 'en-US', 'Global optimization in the game Rust'),
(12667, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have announced a global optimization in a new update, which should significantly improve the performance and stability of the game, fixing many problems.'),
(12668, 'en-US', 'game Rust, global optimization, update, fixes, performance, stability, gameplay'),
(12669, 'en-US', 'The developers have announced an upcoming global optimization in the game Rust. The new update, scheduled for May 5, is expected to release a multitude of fixes that will hopefully significantly improve performance for all players experiencing any issues.<br/><br/> The amount of work required takes time, so the May update will not add any new features other than optimizations. The developers are focusing all their efforts on creating smoother and more stable gameplay to ensure maximum enjoyment of the game.'),
(12670, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new batch of skins that offer players a wide range of choices and the opportunity to express their individuality. Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your character and add stylish items to your collection.'),
(12671, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, unique image, individuality, style, visual aspects, cost, budget, game characteristics, items, game experience, collection'),
(12672, 'en-US', '<p>Recently, a new batch of skins has appeared in the game Rust, which promises to please all players. The update contains a large number of different skins that will allow everyone to give their character and game items a unique and stylish look.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins allow you to express your individuality and stand out from other players. Now you can create a unique image of your character, highlight your preferences and express your style of play.</p><br/><br/><p> Each new skin brings a breath of fresh air into the world of Rust, adding even more variety to the game. Now you can have not only functional but also stylish items that will please the eye and attract attention.</p><br/><br/><p> However, when choosing a new batch of skins, it is worth considering not only the visual aspects, but also their cost. Some skins can be quite expensive, so before buying, you should carefully weigh your options and not exceed your budget.</p><br/><br/><p> It is also worth remembering that using skins does not affect the game characteristics of the character or items. They simply change the appearance and do not provide advantages in the game. Therefore, if you do not want to spend money on skins, you will not miss anything in terms of gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins in the game Rust offers a wide choice and the opportunity for each player to express their individuality. Do not miss the opportunity to update your character and add stylish items to your collection.</p>'),
(12673, 'en-US', 'Rust game on Steam - new round of Twitch drops!'),
(12674, 'en-US', 'Find out all about the new round of Twitch drops in Rust. Get free skins and items just by watching streams on the Twitch platform. Subscribe to stay up to date with the latest news from the world of Rust!'),
(12675, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Steam, Twitch drops, Rust skins, Rust items, Rust news'),
(12676, 'en-US', 'Today, at 22:00 Moscow time, a new round of Twitch drops in the game Rust starts! All fans and players have been eagerly awaiting this moment. Get ready for a rich selection of exclusive skins and items that can be obtained for free simply by watching streams on the Twitch platform.<br/><br/> Facepunch Studios, the developers of Rust, have announced a new event in video format. A trailer for the event has been released on the official Rust Twitch Rivals channel. The video gives us a quick overview of what to expect from the new round of Twitch drops.<br/><br/> :eyes: To stay up to date with the latest news and not miss the opportunity to get unique items, subscribe to our news page. We regularly update information about Twitch drops, announcements of future rounds, new skins and much more. Join us and be at the center of events in the world of Rust!'),
(12677, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates: New Features, Balance Changes, and Gameplay Improvements'),
(12678, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest updates to Rust: new features, balance changes, and gameplay improvements. The developers are constantly working to improve the game and take into account player feedback. Find out what changes are coming to the world of survival Rust on Steam!'),
(12679, 'en-US', 'game Rust, updates, features, balance changes, gameplay improvements, bases, game economy, strategy, tactics, optimization, interface'),
(12680, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam continues to delight its players with new updates! The developers always strive to improve the gameplay, add new features and change the balance of the game so that players get even more pleasure from the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Recently, new updates were released in the game Rust, which brought several significant changes. One of the main innovations is the addition of new features that allow players to create and manage their bases even more efficiently. Now players have the ability to build and improve various structures, set up security systems and control other players\' access to their base.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, the updates made changes to the game balance. The developers paid special attention to feedback from players and tried to make the gameplay even more balanced. Adjustments were made to the game economy, difficulty level, and combat mechanics. Now players have more opportunities for a variety of strategies and tactics in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, the updates to the Rust game have also brought other improvements to the gaming experience. The developers are constantly working on optimizing the game to make it even more stable and smooth. Changes have also been made to the game interface to make it more convenient and intuitive for players.</p><br/><br/><p> The new updates to Rust show the compromises the developers have made to balance various factors. They take into account player opinions and feedback, and strive to make the gameplay interesting and fun for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> Updates in the game Rust are not just changes in the game code, they are an opportunity to immerse yourself in an exciting world of survival, where every decision matters. Be prepared for new challenges, improve your skills and enjoy the game with your friends!</p>'),
(12681, 'en-US', 'Performance update for Rust'),
(12682, 'en-US', 'The article discusses a performance update for the game Rust. The developers promise to pay special attention to fixing the problems that users have been complaining about recently. An interesting fact related to the costume egg in the game\'s Easter event is also mentioned.'),
(12683, 'en-US', 'Rust game, performance update, user complaints, developers, fixes, improvement, hotfixes, costume egg, easter event'),
(12684, 'en-US', 'Recently, users of the game Rust have been increasingly complaining about performance issues. However, the developers are not standing aside and promise to pay special attention to this issue in the near future.<br/><br/> Alistair announced the fixes and performance improvements on Twitter:<br/> \"This update will be entirely dedicated to addressing performance complaints. Our team has already identified several areas that require improvement.<br/><br/> We\'ve also released a few hotfixes that should help resolve some issues.\"<br/><br/> Fun fact: Most of the crashes were related to the costume egg. Part of the Easter event, this fun costume that you can draw on was the result of many hours of development work to ensure it was fully functional by the start of the event.'),
(12685, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about the changes in the game Rust on Steam! Now you can see the nickname of your bully even after death. Find out how this change will affect your game strategy and interaction with other players.'),
(12686, 'en-US', 'News from the fields, Rust update, see the offender\'s nickname, the atmosphere of the game'),
(12687, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to News from the Field! - your source for the latest Rust updates on Steam.</p><br/><p> Today we want to share with you some exciting news that will surely interest every player.</p><br/><p> Now, if you die from the cold or are killed by another player, you will still be able to see the nickname of your offender!</p><br/><p> This change will make life much more difficult for guilty players, as they will no longer be able to remain unnoticed and unpunished. Aggressive players will have to pay attention to their actions, and victims will be able to know exactly who is behind their death.</p><br/><p> This innovation is an important step towards increasing the atmosphere and realism of the game. The new system will allow players to interact with each other even more, create intrigues and pursue their goals even after death.</p><br/><p> Be careful on the battlefield, watch your actions and do not forget that on your way you can meet not only enemies, but also powerful allies.</p><br/><p> Follow our news to stay up to date with the latest events and changes in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(12688, 'en-US', 'NPC scientists will spawn on the roads again!'),
(12689, 'en-US', 'The update to the game Rust restores the possibility of NPC scientists appearing on the roads, which adds interest and variety to the gameplay.'),
(12690, 'en-US', 'Scientists NPC, spawn, roads, update, fix, fix, gameplay Rust'),
(12691, 'en-US', 'NPC scientists will spawn on the roads again!<br/><br/> The military base update that was recently released caused some issues with NPC scientists spawning on the roads. However, the developers have already released a fix for this bug, and in the next update, scientists will spawn on the roads again.<br/><br/> This fix is intended to return the previously familiar level of difficulty and the ability to interact with NPC scientists on the roads to players. As a result, you will be able to meet scientists on your way again and use their knowledge and resources for your own purposes.<br/><br/> NPC scientists in Rust are an important part of the gameplay. They have various skills and offer players unique items and schemes. Meeting them on the roads adds interest and variety to the game world and opens up new opportunities for development and survival.<br/><br/> So, thanks to the fix, NPC scientists will once again spawn on the roads, and you will be able to enjoy the full Rust gameplay, meeting and interacting with these intriguing characters.'),
(12692, 'en-US', 'The birth of little Vasilisa is a joyful event in the family of YouTuber Alexander (HOLD THE DOOR)'),
(12693, 'en-US', 'We are happy to announce that YouTuber Alexander (HOLD THE DOOR) and his wife have a daughter, Vasilisa. Congratulations to the happy parents and wish the baby health and happiness!'),
(12694, 'en-US', 'Youtuber, Alexander, HOLD THE DOOR, daughter, Vasilisa, birth, family, congratulations'),
(12695, 'en-US', '<p>We are happy to announce that YouTuber Alexander, known as DERZHI DVER, and his wife had an unforgettable event - their daughter was born! The baby was named Vasilisa. This happy event filled Alexander\'s family with joy and excitement.</p><br/><p> We congratulate Alexander and his wife on the birth of their daughter Vasilisa! We wish the baby health, joy and happiness, and the parents - many joyful moments and admiration from watching her grow and develop.</p><br/><p> We are sure that Alexander and his wife will surround their baby with care and love. We are waiting for the YouTuber to share the first photos of the baby with us, and we do not lose hope that Vasilisa will bring even more joy to the life of Alexander and his loved ones.</p><br/><p> We thank the entire HOLD THE DOOR team and are sincerely happy for Alexander and his family! Congratulations and best wishes!</p>'),
(12696, 'en-US', 'Problems after updating the game Rust'),
(12697, 'en-US', 'The Rust game update brought not only interesting changes, but also problems with the game crashing. The developers are already aware of this problem and are working on fixing it, the release of the fix is expected within an hour.'),
(12698, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, pitfalls, game crash problems, fix, developers'),
(12699, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust Steam update has brought a lot of new and exciting features for players. However, it has also revealed some pitfalls that many players are facing.</p><br/><p> After the update, many users began to experience problems with the game crashing. However, the game developers are already aware of this problem and are actively working on its solution.</p><br/><p> They plan to release a fix within the next hour, allowing players to continue enjoying the game without crashes or glitches.</p><br/><p> We encourage players to remain patient and stay tuned for updates from the developers. Ultimately, these issues are temporary and should not significantly impact the overall experience of the game.</p>'),
(12700, 'en-US', 'Have a good wipe everyone!'),
(12701, 'en-US', 'Wishing you a successful wipe and offering to watch a video to immerse yourself in the world of the game Rust.'),
(12702, 'en-US', 'wipe, game Rust, servers, survival, adventures, video'),
(12703, 'en-US', 'Greetings to all Rust players! We want to wish you a great wipe and successful adventure on the servers! A wipe is a special event when all players start the game from scratch, all buildings and progress are reset, and everyone has a chance to start over. This is a great opportunity to test your skills and strategies, meet new clanmates and opponents, and get a lot of new impressions. You need to be ready for big changes, and at the same time enjoy the development process and achievements. Temper yourself in fire and become the best survivors! We wish you all an interesting and exciting wipe!'),
(12704, 'en-US', 'Welcome, Rust fans on Steam! We are pleased to announce the arrival of a new batch of skins for your favorite project. Upgrade your gaming experience and stand out on the battlefield with unique Rust skins!'),
(12705, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust, Steam, skins, collection, gaming experience, updates, unique style, battlefield, improved characteristics, wind in the world of Rust, chance'),
(12706, 'en-US', 'Welcome, Rust fans on Steam! We are incredibly happy to announce the arrival of a new batch of skins for your favorite project. This is a long-awaited event that Rust fans have been waiting for so long. Now you have a unique opportunity to purchase new stylish skins and update your gaming experience.<br/><br/> Our developers have done a great job to present you with a wide range of new skins that will take care of your weapons, tools, clothes and resources. The new batch of skins is a real bomb for the most sophisticated players who want to stand out and give their character a unique style.<br/><br/> Each skin in our collection is carefully designed and worked out to the smallest detail. We offer you a wide range of colors, textures and patterns so that you can create a unique image of your character and his inventory. Let your hero become a real star in the world of Rust!<br/><br/> One of the most interesting aspects of the new batch of skins is the ability to stand out on the battlefield. When you fight other players, your new gear will instantly attract attention. Your style will stand out from the rest and allow you to create your own recognizable brand in the Rust game universe.<br/><br/> But our new skin collection is not only about visual appeal. We also pay attention to the functionality and practicality of each skin. Each item has improved characteristics that can give you an advantage in the game. Such skins are not only stylish, but also quite useful!<br/><br/> So, don’t miss the opportunity to upgrade your gaming experience and add a breath of fresh air to the world of Rust. Head over to our website and check out our new batch of skins. We are sure that everyone will find something to their taste here. Buy, upgrade, stand out and become a real Rust star!<br/><br/> <b>Don\'t miss your chance!</b>'),
(12707, 'en-US', 'Subscribe to our news and stay up to date with all the updates of the game Rust on Steam'),
(12708, 'en-US', 'Want to stay up to date with all the latest Rust updates on Steam? Subscribe to our newsletter and get the latest information about new features, gameplay changes, and other exciting game updates! Be ahead of the game and get exclusive access!'),
(12709, 'en-US', 'subscribe to news, get Rust updates, Rust news, game updates, subscribe to news, Rust gameplay, exclusive access, game strategy'),
(12710, 'en-US', '<p>Want to be in the thick of things and always be the first to know about all the updates to the Rust game on Steam? Then don\'t miss the opportunity to subscribe to our news!</p><br/><p> We strive to provide our subscribers with the latest information on new features, patches, gameplay changes, and other exciting updates to the Rust game. Stay up to date with the latest changes and evolution of this exciting and popular game!</p><br/><p> By subscribing to our newsletter, you will receive exclusive access to previews of new content, interesting articles, guides, reviews and much more that will help you improve your gaming strategy and enjoy the game to the fullest.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to stay up to date with all the latest news and developments in the Rust game! Subscribe to our news right now and don\'t miss a single game update that can greatly affect your gaming experience.</p>'),
(12711, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Twitch Drops round in Rust, where you can get exclusive skins and items for the game. Follow the stream on Twitch and update your collection!'),
(12712, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Round, Skins, Exclusive Items, Broadcast, Update'),
(12713, 'en-US', 'Attention! On April 14th, another round of Twitch Drops for the game Rust will take place! In this round, you have the opportunity to get a number of exclusive items for your gaming experience. The following items are offered to your attention:'),
(12714, 'en-US', 'Trap names and localized scientist names on the death screen'),
(12715, 'en-US', 'Learn about the importance of correct trap names and localized scientist names on the death screen in Rust and how they affect gameplay and player tactics.'),
(12716, 'en-US', 'traps, localized names, scientists, death screen, Rust game'),
(12717, 'en-US', 'Let\'s talk about the importance of proper trap names and localized names of scientists that appear on the death screen in Rust. These gameplay elements can have a significant impact on the experience and our interaction with the game\'s mechanics.<br/><br/> The game currently features the following types of traps and scientists:<br/><ul><li> Guntraps: Automatic and fire turrets that can be used to defend the base from hostile players.</li><li> Mines and traps: cunning and dangerous devices that can cause serious damage to the enemy.</li><li> Regular and armored scientists: unpredictable opponents who stand in the way of valuable resources and loot.</li><li> Wooden Spikes and Thorns: Simple but effective barriers designed to protect the base from being penetrated.</li></ul><br/> Each of these elements has its own unique features and offers players different opportunities for tactical interaction and survival. A closer look at these traps and scientists will help us better understand their role in the game and choose the most appropriate strategy.'),
(12718, 'en-US', 'For the first time in two years, work on modular weapons has resumed'),
(12719, 'en-US', 'For the first time in two years, work on modular weapons in Rust has resumed. Stay up to date with the latest news and details about this update!'),
(12720, 'en-US', 'update, modular weapons, fans, gameplay, news, Rust'),
(12721, 'en-US', 'Great news for all fans of the game Rust! For the first time in two long years, the developers have resumed work on modular weapons. This means that in the near future we can expect exciting new details that will diversify and improve the gameplay. Do not lose your vigilance and stay on the lookout for the latest news in the world of Rust!'),
(12722, 'en-US', 'New Achievements in Rust: A Review of the Latest Updates'),
(12723, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest advancements in Rust and how they will impact your gameplay.'),
(12724, 'en-US', 'new achievements, updates, game Rust'),
(12725, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust, where every day feels like a new adventure. The game has been updated again, and we are happy to bring you fresh news about the latest achievements!</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust team is constantly working to improve the gameplay and introduce new features based on community feedback. Here is an overview of the latest updates and new features coming to Rust.</p><br/><br/><h2> Gameplay improvements</h2><br/><p> One of the key changes in the latest update is the improvement of the gameplay. The developers have made a number of changes to make the game more exciting and balanced. Now you will have access to new tasks, achievements and opportunities to improve your character.</p><br/><br/><p> New achievements are a great way to increase interest in the game and allow you to unlock new levels and get unique rewards. By completing certain tasks, you can get new items, weapons or even special skills that will help you survive in the harsh world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><h2> New opportunities for players</h2><br/><p> With each update, Rust becomes more diverse and exciting. The developers add new features so that you can choose and try something new. Now you can build more complex structures, explore new areas and interact with other players.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, you will be given the opportunity to participate in events and competitions where you can compete with other players for valuable prizes. Be prepared for new challenges and unique opportunities that the game Rust offers.</p><br/><br/><h2> Conclusion</h2><br/><p> The latest updates to the Rust game have brought many new achievements and opportunities for players. With the improvements to the gameplay and the addition of new features, the game becomes even more attractive and interesting.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to try new features, unlock new levels and become the best in the world of Rust. Join us and enjoy this exciting experience with millions of other players!</p>'),
(12726, 'en-US', 'There will be no PVP changes released in April'),
(12727, 'en-US', 'Rust players on Steam will not see any changes to PVP mode in April. Developer Alistair confirmed this in a tweet. Stay tuned for the latest information.'),
(12728, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, updates, PVP');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(12729, 'en-US', '<p>Rust players on Steam will not see any changes to the PVP mode in April, developer Alistair announced in his latest tweet.</p><br/><p> He wrote: \"Just to be clear - there will be no changes to PVP in the next patch. Don\'t worry, we\'ll let you know when that happens.\"</p><br/><p> A commit on the newrecoil branch was previously discovered, which suggests a complete rework of the game\'s recoil, rather than just a new view as previously stated.</p><br/><p> Stay up to date with all the latest news by subscribing to our newsletter.</p>'),
(12730, 'en-US', 'New Batch of Skins in Rust: Review and Analysis'),
(12731, 'en-US', 'A detailed review of the new batch of skins in the game Rust on the Steam platform: impact on the gameplay, uniqueness, balance, opportunities for players.'),
(12732, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, review, analysis, influence, details, balance, uniqueness, features, style, gaming experience'),
(12733, 'en-US', '<p>Hello, dear players! Today we are pleased to present you with a fresh batch of skins added to the game Rust on the Steam platform. In this article, we will take a closer look at the new items and analyze their impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> A new batch of skins is always an expected event in the world of Rust. Each time, the developers surprise us with the quality and originality of new items, creating unique opportunities for players. Thanks to skins, you can customize your character, base or weapon, standing out from other players.</p><br/><br/><p> In this batch of skins you will find many interesting and diverse items. Perhaps you will be interested in new costumes, weapons, decorative items or building materials. These skins will help you create a unique image of your character or transform your base, making it stylish and protected.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the key factors influencing the attractiveness of skins is their visual design. Developers pay great attention to details and texture quality, creating realistic and attractive items. New skins will definitely please you with their beauty and quality of execution.</p><br/><br/><p> However, you should not forget about the impact of these skins on the gameplay. Each item has its own features and characteristics that can affect your tactical decisions. Some skins can give you an advantage in combat or increase your defense, while others can be purely decorative. Therefore, before purchasing a new skin, it is important to carefully study its properties and consider how it will fit into your game strategy.</p><br/><br/><p> Adding new skins to the game Rust is always a compromise between uniqueness and balance. The developers try to create a variety of items, taking into account the wishes of the players, but at the same time maintaining balance and fair play. That is why the skins undergo many tests and detailed analysis to ensure that none of them will provide a significant advantage.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget that each skin is not only an opportunity to change the appearance of a character or item, but also support for the developers. By purchasing new skins, you help finance the further development of the game and the addition of new content.</p><br/><br/><p> So, the new batch of skins in the game Rust is a great opportunity to update your gaming experience, adding new features and style to the game. Do not miss the chance to stand out among other players and create a unique image.</p><br/><br/><p> Get new skins, enjoy the quality and variety of items, and continue to immerse yourself in the exciting world of Rust!</p>'),
(12734, 'en-US', 'NEW RETURN coming soon to RUST!'),
(12735, 'en-US', 'RUST is about to see a significant change in weapon recoil. The developers have begun modifying weapon spread, which in turn may mean the possible introduction of modular weapons into the game in the near future.'),
(12736, 'en-US', 'RUST, new recoil, weapon spread changes, modular weapons, gameplay, updates'),
(12737, 'en-US', '<p>RUST is about to see a major change in weapon recoil. Many players have been waiting for this moment with great pain, and for some it was like a nightmare in a nightmare.</p><br/><p> The developers have begun modifying the weapon spread, which in turn could mean the possible introduction of modular weapons into the game in the near future.</p><br/><p> How do you feel about these changes? Some players welcome the innovation, while others may remain somewhat wary, fearing a negative impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><p> We invite you to subscribe to our news to stay up to date with all the changes and updates in the world of RUST.</p>'),
(12738, 'en-US', 'Easter is coming soon'),
(12739, 'en-US', 'Find out what the developers of the game Rust have prepared for Easter. Paint a new costume in the form of an egg and subscribe to our news so as not to miss a single Easter surprise.'),
(12740, 'en-US', 'easter, Rust, updates, costume, egg, paint, interest, cost, subscription'),
(12741, 'en-US', '<p>Easter time is coming soon, and the developers of the game Rust are ready to please players with new updates.</p><br/><p> This time they presented a new costume in the form of an egg, which can be decorated to your taste.</p><br/><p> This funny and creative costume immediately attracts attention and arouses interest among game lovers.</p><br/><p> We\'re looking forward to the update to find out how much this bright and original costume will cost.</p><br/><p> In the meantime, to stay up to date with all the news, subscribe to our newsletter and don\'t miss a single Easter surprise in Rust!</p>'),
(12742, 'en-US', 'How to get items in the game Rust?'),
(12743, 'en-US', 'This article covers how to obtain three popular items in Rust - the Clatter helmet, the Garry\'s Mod Tool Gun, and the Chippy Arcade Game, which were previously available by playing other games from Facepunch. The required resources for crafting each item are described in detail. Join our news and stay up to date with all Rust updates!'),
(12744, 'en-US', 'Rust game, updates, getting items, Clatter helmet, Garry\'s Mod Tool Gun, Chippy Arcade Game slot machine'),
(12745, 'en-US', 'There are many questions about how to get:<br/> :1111: Clatter Helmet<br/> :2222: Garry\'s Mod Tool Gun<br/> :3333: Chippy Arcade Game slot machine.<br/><br/> It is currently impossible to obtain items.<br/> All three items could be obtained by playing one of the 3 Facepunch games. Yes, you heard right, the developers have other games besides RUST.<br/> To get the item, you had to be in the game for at least 30 minutes and it would appear in your inventory.<br/><br/> :1111: Clatter - https://store.steampowered.com/app/602770/Clatter/ Clatter helmet.<br/> :2222: Garry\'s Mod - https://store.steampowered.com/app/4000/GarrysMod/ Garry\'s Mod Tool Gun.<br/> :3333: Chippy - https://store.steampowered.com/app/602700/Chippy/ Chippy Arcade Game slot machine.<br/><br/> Items do not require study, the following resources are needed for crafting:<br/> Clatter - 35 metal fragments.<br/> Chippy Arcade Game - 10 high quality metal, 2 gears (workbench level 1).<br/> Garry\'s Mod Tool Gun - 100 wood, 20 metal fragments.<br/><br/> :heart3: Subscribe to our news, good luck to everyone :heart3:'),
(12746, 'en-US', 'Tokens are coming to Rust soon!'),
(12747, 'en-US', 'Tokens will be added to the Rust game soon! The developers haven\'t yet revealed where we\'ll get them from, but this idea promises to be interesting and fun!'),
(12748, 'en-US', 'Rust, tokens, update, new, developers'),
(12749, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust promise to add a new element to the game - tokens! This unusual idea is interesting, but, unfortunately, we do not yet know where we can get them from. However, we can only wait for news from the developers to learn more about how tokens will affect the gameplay. We hope that this new feature will add a little novelty and variety to the world of Rust! ❤️‍'),
(12750, 'en-US', 'The volume is open for viewing.'),
(12751, 'en-US', 'The volume is open for viewing - find out about the latest updates and news about the game Rust.'),
(12752, 'en-US', 'game Rust, updates, update volume, news, changes'),
(12753, 'en-US', '<h2>The volume is open for viewing.</h2><br/><p> Good news for all fans of the game Rust! We are pleased to announce that the volume with the latest updates to the game Rust is now available for your viewing. Do not miss the opportunity to be aware of the latest changes and innovations in our favorite game.</p><br/><p> With each update, our development team strives to bring new features, fix bugs, and improve gameplay. Now, with access to the update volume, you can learn about all the important changes that have happened in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> Head over to our little volume and dive into the world of information about the latest updates. You will learn about the new features and capabilities that have appeared in the game. You will also be able to see a list of fixes and changes that have made the game even better and more stable.</p><br/><p> This volume is your source for news about Rust. Here you will find information about new items, resources, locations and much more. So do not miss the opportunity to stay up to date with all the updates and become a real expert in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> Don\'t waste time and follow the link to read the latest news and changes in the game Rust. Get ready for new adventures and be prepared for big changes and even more exciting gameplay!</p>'),
(12754, 'en-US', 'Skin for the tome in the game Rust: how to get and when'),
(12755, 'en-US', 'Find out how to get a skin for the tome in the game Rust today! Open the skin store, choose a skin, activate it and enjoy your new look in the game.'),
(12756, 'en-US', 'skin for tomik, game Rust, new skin, get skin, promo'),
(12757, 'en-US', '<p>The future of the Rust game promises to be full of new events and special prizes for players. And one of these prizes will be a skin for the volume. This unique piece of clothing will be available to players today, March 28.</p><br/><p> If you\'ve always dreamed of looking original in the vastness of Rust, then you\'ll have a great opportunity to get your own skin for the volume. But please note that the time window for receiving this prize is open only from 23:30 to 2:59 Moscow time. Hurry up so you don\'t miss this unique opportunity!</p><br/><p> To get a skin for the volume, you will need to follow a few simple steps:</p><br/><ol><br/><li> Go to the Rust game and open the skin shop interface.</li><br/><li> Find the section with new skins and select a skin for the volume.</li><br/><li> Make sure you have enough game currency in your account to purchase the skin.</li><br/><li> Click the \"Buy\" button and confirm your purchase.</li><br/><li> Congratulations! Now all you have to do is activate the skin in the game and enjoy your new look.</li><br/></ol><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow the news and updates of the game Rust, so as not to miss other opportunities to get unique skins and items. Good luck in the game and stylish outfits!</p>'),
(12758, 'en-US', 'Rust\'s Twitch Drop featuring Twitchland 2'),
(12759, 'en-US', 'Learn about the Rust skin Twitch Drops featuring Twitchland 2.0 and Rustplatz, and how it\'s been extended by 24 hours.'),
(12760, 'en-US', 'Rust, Twitch, Twitch Drops, Twitchland 2, Rustplatz'),
(12761, 'en-US', 'Rust\'s Twitch drop featuring Twitchland 2.0 and Rustplatz has been extended for an additional 24 hours.'),
(12762, 'en-US', 'Check out the concepts for weapon attachments in Rust'),
(12763, 'en-US', 'Check out new and exciting weapon attachment concepts in Rust, such as the Suppressor and Flash Hider. Learn how these attachments can give your weapon new functionality and increase your survivability in the game.'),
(12764, 'en-US', 'Rust, weapon modules, silencer, flash suppressor, tactical capabilities'),
(12765, 'en-US', '<p>We would like to introduce you to new and exciting concepts of weapon modules in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> In this article we will tell you about the concept of a suppressor/flash suppressor that adds unique functionality to your weapon.</p><br/><p> A weapon suppressor allows you to shoot at enemies without drawing unwanted attention to yourself by reducing the sound of gunshots. A flash suppressor, on the other hand, gives your weapon a more intimidating appearance and creates a flame effect when fired.</p><br/><p> With the help of weapon modules you can give your game character more tactical options and increase his survivability in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned, we will share even more interesting ideas and concepts of weapon modules in the near future.</p>'),
(12766, 'en-US', 'Rust Update: Railroad Tracks and New Fixes'),
(12767, 'en-US', 'Take a look at the upcoming Rust update, which will add procedurally generated train tracks, new trains with the ability to dock wagons, and various bug fixes and improvements to the game world.'),
(12768, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, railroad tracks, trains, fixes, water, textures, trap, crane, zipline'),
(12769, 'en-US', 'An update will be released on April 7th.<br/><br/> The main change will affect the railway tracks.<br/> Railway tracks will be completely procedurally generated like regular roads. It became known that we will be able to ride trains a little later, the developers do not have time to finalize them, so we will just admire them))).<br/> The trains will be of a new type with carriages that can be connected to each other.<br/><br/> Fixes are being made on:<br/> - Work on water, ripples, splash effects and bubbles.<br/> - Work is underway on brick textures of buildings.<br/> - Fixed textures that were of low quality and illegible in the dark.<br/> - Work is underway on a new trap, a tripwire made from a hand grenade ❤️‍<br/> - Added lighting to the crane cabin. If you hold the crouch key in it, the cabin will return to its original position.<br/><br/> Zipline:<br/> - Fixed a bug with the zipline handle, it now disappears if the player jumps off. The player will jump off a little earlier to reduce the chance of dying if they hit the ground with their feet at the very end.<br/> - We are testing the smooth movement of the player on the zipline, it was painfully rough.<br/> https://vk.com/rustcommru'),
(12770, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: overview of the added items'),
(12771, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of skins in Rust: new items, visual updates, and gameplay changes. Individual style and amazing possibilities for aesthetic and practical improvements are waiting for you!'),
(12772, 'en-US', 'Rust game, added skins, updates, new items, appearance changes, personality, gameplay'),
(12773, 'en-US', '<p>Get ready for updates in the game Rust, because a new batch of skins for your items has been released!</p><br/><p> In this article, we\'ll take a look at the most interesting and outstanding skins that have been added in the game\'s latest updates. Get ready for a fresh wave of style and personality with these new items.</p><br/><p> Clothing, weapons, gear and more - each skin category has received its own update. New skins add aesthetic value to the game and allow you to stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> Explore new helmet, armor, and outerwear options to create a unique and distinctive look for your character. New weapon skins will give you the opportunity to stand out and show your individuality in battle. Improve your equipment with cool new skins and inspire jealousy in other players.</p><br/><p> But in addition to their visual appeal, new skins also affect gameplay. Some of them can provide bonuses or change the characteristics of certain items, making them not only stylish but also useful.</p><br/><p> However, before you dive into buying new skins, it is worth paying attention to their prices. Some of them can be quite expensive or rare, which requires a thoughtful decision before buying.</p><br/><p> So, don’t miss the fresh batch of skins in the game Rust! Update the appearance of your character, improve your weapons and equipment. Be prepared for the bright and unique style that new items offer. You will never have to be afraid of being unnoticed in this ruthless world of Rust.</p>'),
(12774, 'en-US', 'Raffle for five Kalashnikovs in our VK'),
(12775, 'en-US', 'A unique drawing for five Kalashnikovs in our VK. Take part and get a chance to win an amazing prize!'),
(12776, 'en-US', 'giveaway, VK, Kalashnikov, win, link'),
(12777, 'en-US', 'Hello everyone! We have a unique giveaway on VK where you can win one of five Kalashnikovs! Take part to increase your chances of winning. Just follow the link https://vk.com/rustcommru and follow the instructions to participate in the giveaway. Don\'t miss the opportunity to get an amazing prize and become a real owner of a cool weapon! Good luck!'),
(12778, 'en-US', 'Solving the Twitch Drops Problem in Rust'),
(12779, 'en-US', 'In this article, you will learn how to solve the problem with Twitch Drops in the game Rust, when the received drops do not appear in your inventory on the Steam platform. We offer simple steps to fix this situation and, if they do not help, you can always contact our technical support.'),
(12780, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, problem, solution, inventory, Steam, account, technical support'),
(12781, 'en-US', 'Greetings to all!<br/><br/> In the latest round of Twitch Drops in Rust, many players encountered a problem where the received drop did not appear in their inventory on the Steam platform. We have found a solution to this annoying situation and want to share it with you:<br/><br/> Step 1: Go to https://twitch.facepunch.com/ and log in to your account.<br/> Step 2: Go to the \"Manage Account\" tab.<br/> Step 3: Click the \"Unlink Account\" button to unlink your Twitch account.<br/> Step 4: After that, link the accounts again, starting with the Steam account, and then Twitch. Don\'t forget to click the \"Activate Drops\" button.<br/> Step 5: Click on the \"Check For Missing Drops\" button.<br/><br/> After completing these simple steps, all your received drops should appear in your inventory.<br/><br/> If you still encounter a problem, do not hesitate to contact our technical support. We are always ready to help you!'),
(12782, 'en-US', 'Rust Game on Steam: News and Updates'),
(12783, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news and updates about the game Rust on Steam on the RustCommRu community page on VKontakte.'),
(12784, 'en-US', 'game rust, rust updates, rust news, steam, rustcommru'),
(12785, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the RustCommRu community page on VKontakte! Here you will find the latest and most complete information about the game Rust – one of the most popular online sandboxes with survival elements.</p><br/><p> Rust, available on the Steam platform, is constantly being updated and developed to offer players new features and fix existing bugs. We try to stay up to date with all updates and provide you with the most relevant information.</p><br/><p> On the RustCommRu page we regularly review new updates, talk about added features, gameplay improvements and bug fixes. We also report on upcoming updates and analyze in detail what changes they will bring to the game.</p><br/><p> Our community discusses all the changes and updates in the game Rust. You can take part in the discussion, share your opinion and ask questions to other players. We value your opinion and try to help you understand all the nuances of the game.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on the latest news about Rust on Steam. Join our community and stay in the loop!</p>'),
(12786, 'en-US', 'Zipline added to test branch'),
(12787, 'en-US', 'A zipline has been added to the test branch of the Rust update, allowing players to move around the world using a rope and a hook. The first tests have been conducted, but the question has arisen whether it will be possible to pull the rope yourself.'),
(12788, 'en-US', 'Zipline, test branch, update, Rust, gameplay'),
(12789, 'en-US', '<p>A new feature has been added to the test branch of the Rust game update - a zipline. It allows players to move around the game world using a rope and a hook.</p><br/><p> The first tests of this feature have already been conducted, and players can try out the zipline in action. Thus, the addition of the zipline offered new opportunities for exploring the world of Rust and diversifying the gameplay.</p><br/><p> In addition, the question arose - will it be possible to pull the zipline cable independently? This question remains open for now, and the developers can conduct additional tests to resolve this issue.</p>'),
(12790, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops in Rust: How to Get 6 New Skins'),
(12791, 'en-US', 'Join the Twitch Drops event in Rust and get 6 new skins for your characters. Watch any stream and get skins after accumulating 18 hours of viewing. An additional skin for Thompson is also available.'),
(12792, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, skins, streams, viewing, drops, thompson'),
(12793, 'en-US', 'Attention, Rust players! The Twitch Drops promotion is already underway and will run until March 27. During this time, you can get as many as 6 new skins for your characters! And the most interesting thing is that this time they do not depend on specific streamers.<br/><br/> All you have to do is watch any streams with drops activated. After accumulating 18 hours of watching, you will automatically receive all 6 skins. So it doesn\'t matter which streamer you watch, the main thing is to stay on their channels long enough.<br/><br/> And that\'s not all! On March 28th, there will be a mini-round where you can get an additional skin for Thompson. To do this, just enjoy watching a certain stream during the day, and the skin will be yours.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to customize your characters with unique skins! Join Twitch Drops in Rust now and get all the new items until March 27th.'),
(12794, 'en-US', 'Welcome to the world of new skins for the game Rust on Steam! A variety of unique, colorful skins with improved characteristics. Create your own unique style and gain an advantage in battles! Update your skin collection today!'),
(12795, 'en-US', 'game Rust, skins, Steam, new skins, game balance, customizable design, improved characteristics'),
(12796, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of new skins for the game Rust on Steam!</p><br/><p> We are pleased to present you with a fresh batch of skins that have just appeared in the game!</p><br/><p> In this batch you will find a variety of unique and colorful skins that will add a new atmosphere to your gameplay.</p><br/><p> Discover new possibilities for customizing the appearance of your character, weapons, and other in-game items.</p><br/><p> Unique skins from talented artists will allow you to stand out from other players and give your journey in the world of Rust a unique style.</p><br/><p> But beyond the aesthetics, new skins can also impact gameplay.</p><br/><p> Some skins offer improved stats for your weapons, which can give you an advantage in battle.</p><br/><p> However, one should not forget about the balance of the game and fairness for all players.</p><br/><p> Rust developers try to maintain balance and carefully monitor the impact of new skins on the gameplay.</p><br/><p> They regularly make patches and updates to ensure that the game remains fair and fun for everyone.</p><br/><p> Therefore, before purchasing new skins, it is worth considering their impact on the balance of the game and making informed decisions.</p><br/><p> Head over to the Rust Store on Steam and update your skin collection today!</p>'),
(12797, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Skins in Rust: New Opportunities for Players'),
(12798, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Twitch Drops skins available in Rust. Get exclusive items and decorate your character. Link your Twitch account and don\'t miss out!'),
(12799, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops event, Rust skins, Rust unique items, character accessories, Twitch account linking, exclusive skins, Rust game, Twitch Drops official website'),
(12800, 'en-US', 'Attention, Rust players! We have important news for you. Today we want to share the good news about Twitch Drops skins, which are now available to all users of the game.<br/><br/> The drops will last for seven days, from March 20 to March 27, and will give you a unique opportunity to get rare items and accessories for your character. The distinctive feature of these skins is their exclusivity: they are available only to users who have linked their Twitch account to the Rust game.<br/><br/> To get Twitch Drops skins, you just need to follow a few simple steps. First, make sure your Twitch account is linked to your Steam account. Then, just watch Rust Twitch streams and you will be rewarded with unique items right in the game.<br/><br/> For more details on Twitch Drops skins in Rust, visit the official Twitch Drops website at <a href=\"https://twitch.facepunch.com/\">https://twitch.facepunch.com/</a> . There you will find a full list of skins, Drop times, and other useful information.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your character with unique skins that can be yours thanks to Drops on Twitch. Hurry up, collect all the skins and create a unique image in the game Rust today!'),
(12801, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about upcoming updates to Rust. Read about the work on the cable car, the new mine model, the railway network and new achievements. Visit the official news source and join the conversation among players.'),
(12802, 'en-US', 'news, field, cable car, zipline, mine, railway network, achievements, Rust'),
(12803, 'en-US', '<p>Hello all Rust players! We have some exciting news for you regarding upcoming updates.</p><br/><p> ✅ Working on the cable car. Perhaps we will soon see a new addition to the game - a zipline! Exciting and fast movement on a cable car can become a reality in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> ✅ New mine model. The developers have pleased us with a new mine model, which will add more realism to game situations and add new tactical options for players.</p><br/><p> ✅ New Railroad Network. More Travel Options! The developers are adding a new rail system that will allow players to travel around the world of Rust even more efficiently and conveniently.</p><br/><p> ✅ New achievements. If you like trials and challenges, then you will like the new achievements that will appear in the game. Complete tasks, achieve goals and get well-deserved rewards.</p><br/><p> For more details and up-to-date information, we recommend you visit the official Rust news source: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a> .</p><br/><p> Join our conversation and communicate with other players to share experiences and discuss all the new changes in the game: <a href=\"https://vk.me/join/VUPmxByCFbTXzuf3axF5rZZCTfEnQ0RaEx0\">https://vk.me/join/VUPmxByCFbTXzuf3axF5rZZCTfEnQ0RaEx0</a> .</p>'),
(12804, 'en-US', 'From now on RU servers are renamed to EU East (Eastern Europe)'),
(12805, 'en-US', 'Important update for Rust players on Steam! RU servers have now been renamed to EU East to improve the gaming experience for players from Eastern Europe.'),
(12806, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, update, RU servers, EU East, Eastern Europe'),
(12807, 'en-US', '<p>Important update for Rust players on Steam!</p><br/><p> We are pleased to announce that today we have renamed all RU servers to EU East. This change will allow us to improve the gaming experience for our players from Russia, Ukraine and other Eastern European countries.</p><br/><p> The server renaming is part of our strategy to improve the geographic placement of servers to provide players with better performance and stable ping while playing.</p><br/><p> What does this mean for you, our players? Firstly, you will be able to play on servers that are closer to your location, which will improve your gaming performance. Secondly, you will be able to meet more players from Eastern Europe, which will lead to a more diverse and exciting gaming experience.</p><br/><p> We encourage all players who previously played on RU servers to switch to the new EU East servers. You can find a list of available servers and connect to them by following the link in our <a href=\"https://t.me/RustcommunityRU\">Telegram channel</a> .</p><br/><p> Thank you for your understanding and support. We hope this change will make the game even better for all our players in Eastern Europe!</p>'),
(12808, 'en-US', 'Mine model update on test branch'),
(12809, 'en-US', 'The Rust test branch has received a new mine model. Find out about the new look of the \"Improvised Mine\" and how it will affect gameplay.'),
(12810, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, model, mine, homemade mine, game items'),
(12811, 'en-US', 'Rust has received a major update on the test branch - the mine model. It now looks completely different and has even been renamed to \"Improvised Mine\" to reflect its new look. The older model has been completely removed from the game, and players will now be able to enjoy using this new and improved weapon. Model updates are an important part of the gameplay, and the Rust developers continue to work on improving the look and feel of the game\'s items. With this new mine model, the game becomes even more realistic and immersive. Be sure to check it out on the test branch and share your impressions!'),
(12812, 'en-US', 'Discuss Rust game news in our VKontakte group'),
(12813, 'en-US', 'Join our VKontakte group to stay up to date with all the news about the game Rust and discuss it with other players.'),
(12814, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, news, updates, VKontakte group, discussion'),
(12815, 'en-US', '<p>Do you love the game Rust and want to be up to date with all the latest news about updates and changes in the game? Then join our official discussion on the social network VKontakte!</p><br/><p> In our VKontakte group we publish daily fresh news about what is happening in the world of Rust. Here you will find information about game updates, new features, gameplay changes and much more.</p><br/><p> You will also be able to participate in discussions about the news with other players. You can share your opinions, ask questions, and receive answers from the Rust community.</p><br/><p> Join us to stay up to date with all the events and communicate with like-minded people! We are waiting for you in our VKontakte group at the link:</p><br/><p> <a href=\"https://vk.me/join/VUPmxByCFbTXzuf3axF5rZZCTfEnQ0RaEx0\">https://vk.me/join/VUPmxByCFbTXzuf3axF5rZZCTfEnQ0RaEx0</a></p>'),
(12816, 'en-US', 'Some news from the fields!'),
(12817, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam is constantly being updated. Current updates include procedural train track building, improved post-processing and ring road smoothing, bug fixes, new sounds, player state adjustments when switching servers, Powerline prefabs updates, time of day and light reflection adjustments, fish catch statistics, and UI adjustments.'),
(12818, 'en-US', 'Rust game, updates, procedural build, train tracks, post processing, antialiasing, rails, autosprint, server, bugs, sounds, player state, server transition, prefabs, power lines, time of day, reflection, catch statistics, UI, item highlighting, decals, performance'),
(12819, 'en-US', 'Some news from the fields!<br/> Work is underway on procedural construction of railway tracks on the surface. The binding to the RT is being set up so that the tracks are not laid through them in any way. We have already learned how to correctly position bends and turns. All track elements are being joined, testing is underway.<br/> Improved post-processing and corner smoothing for the Ring Railway and Ring Road<br/> The rails at the intersection of roads and railways must be strictly perpendicular!<br/> The player\'s auto-sprint setting is now taken into account while riding a horse.<br/> Fixed a bug with the server crashing when a player entered a car. Previously, the server incorrectly determined whether the driver or passenger was in the car and this caused errors!<br/> Fixed an issue where players could not be kicked out of taxis from the driver\'s seat.<br/> New sounds when a character and the environment are injured<br/> The player and transport state is being adjusted when moving from server to server. From this we can conclude that work is actively underway on the possibility of server-to-server transitions.<br/> ⚡Updates to the Powerline prefab topology related to the generation of power lines along road tracks.<br/> ☀Adjust the time of the day and the time of the appearance of sunlight. Also generally regulate the time of the game day.<br/> Correction of yellow and white light reflection from the character. Work on torch and sunlight reflection is in progress. More white shade is added<br/> Added catch statistics depending on the type of fish and subsequent unlocking of achievements.<br/> ✅The new user interface is being adjusted. Bugs are being fixed, hints are being adjusted, and unnecessary pop-up buttons are being removed, in particular the \"Relogin\" button during server loading.<br/> When opening a player\'s inventory, the item that the player currently has in his hands will now be highlighted in the inventory!<br/> Decals are being adjusted, unnecessary data about dead animals, destroyed objects and their condition is being removed. Will affect performance'),
(12820, 'en-US', 'Rust players using GFN banned from Steam'),
(12821, 'en-US', 'All players using GFN in the game Rust were banned from Steam. The article tells about the community\'s reaction and the measures taken by the GFN administration.'),
(12822, 'en-US', 'game Rust, GFN, ban on Steam, unban, appeal, Rust community'),
(12823, 'en-US', '<p>There has been some outrage in the Rust community recently - all players using GFN have been banned from Steam.</p><br/><p> Less than half an hour passed before the GFN administration began to solve this problem. As a result, 30 minutes later it became known that players had begun to be unbanned.</p><br/><p> However, if you have not received an unban for any reason, you have the opportunity to file an appeal via <a href=\"https://www.easy.ac/en-us/support/game/contact/appeal/\">this link</a> .</p>'),
(12824, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust - an update to the range of cosmetic items'),
(12825, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins added to the game Rust. The updated range of cosmetic items will allow players to originally design their base and character.'),
(12826, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, update, assortment, cosmetic items'),
(12827, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust continues to please its fans with updates and expansion of the range of cosmetic items. In the new batch of skins added to the game, players will find many interesting items for decorating their base and character.</p><br/><br/><p> All skins included in this batch have been designed with love for detail and high quality. Each item has its own unique design that will allow you to stand out from other players. The new skins give a fresh look to buildings, weapons and clothing, which allows you to create a unique style and atmosphere in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> As always, the skins include a variety of color options so that every player can choose the right one for themselves. You can add brightness and richness to your base by using skins with bright and colorful shades. If you prefer neutral tones, there is a set of sophisticated skins with elegant color solutions.</p><br/><br/><p> Players can choose from skins for different elements of the game: from decorative elements such as maps and flags to sniper rifles and armor. With a variety of items, every player will be able to find something that will perfectly suit their playstyle and design preferences.</p><br/><br/><p> What makes these skins even more attractive is the ability to purchase them through Steam. All you need to do is go to the Rust game store and select the skins you are interested in. After purchasing, the skins will be available in your inventory and you can use them at your discretion.</p><br/><br/><p> If you want to update the look of your base or character in the game Rust, then the new batch of skins offers you unique and stylish options. Do not miss the opportunity to make the game even more colorful and interesting!</p>'),
(12828, 'en-US', 'The March game update is out!'),
(12829, 'en-US', 'The March Rust update is here! It brings new monument lighting, dropped item models, quality of life improvements, new music, and a new soundtrack. Check out the dev blog for more information on the update.'),
(12830, 'en-US', 'March update, Rust game, monument lighting, item models, quality of life improvements, music, soundtrack, discount, devblog'),
(12831, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for all fans of the game Rust - the March update is already available! This means that you will find many new and exciting features.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main features of the update is the new lighting of monuments, which will give the game a unique atmosphere and add a realism effect.</p><br/><br/><p> The developers also added new models of discarded objects, which will make the game world even more realistic and interesting. Now you will be able to find even more useful things in your adventures!</p><br/><br/><p> Improving the quality of life is another important change that has been made to the game. The developers have focused on the convenience of players by improving the interface and adding new features.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust also received new music that will create the atmosphere and help you immerse yourself in the game world. If you want to enjoy the soundtrack outside of the game, you can now purchase it with a 10% discount on Steam and other streaming platforms. If you have a subscription to Spotify, Amazon Music, Apple Music or YouTube Music, the soundtrack is available for free listening.</p><br/><br/><p> Be sure to check out the official devblog for more details and information about the update.</p><br/><br/><p> Soundtrack link: <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/1701720/RustSound\">https://store.steampowered.com/app/1701720/RustSound</a></p><br/><br/><p> Dev blog link: <a href=\"https://rust.facepunch.com/news/march-202\">https://rust.facepunch.com/news/march-202</a></p><br/><br/><p> Watch the announcement of the update on YouTube: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K7vmP1f3f1g&feature=emblogo\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K7vmP1f3f1g&amp;feature=emblogo</a></p>'),
(12832, 'en-US', 'Concept of the new Electricity Generator⚡️'),
(12833, 'en-US', 'This article explores the unique concept of a new electricity generator for the game Rust. Learn about the benefits and limitations of this innovative device that can make electrifying your base in the game Rust more reliable and efficient.'),
(12834, 'en-US', 'concept, electricity generator, Rust, innovation, energy supply'),
(12835, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at a unique concept of a new electricity generator for the game Rust. This generator offers an improved and more efficient solution for generating electricity in the game.<br/><br/> One of the main problems in Rust is the constant lack of electricity. Existing generators have their limitations and are often unable to provide enough power for all the needs of your base. All this can lead to failures in the automation, lighting and security systems.<br/><br/> A new concept of electricity generator offers a solution to this problem. It is based on a new design and improved technologies that allow generating more energy with less resource consumption. This allows you to provide a stable and reliable supply of electricity for all your needs without losing efficiency.<br/><br/> The concept of the new electricity generator includes various innovative features, such as automatic power regulation, the ability to connect additional modules to increase capacity, and the ability to use different energy sources. This opens up new prospects for the development and automation of your base in the game Rust.<br/><br/> But with the benefits of a new electricity generator come some compromises. The generator\'s greater power requires more resource-intensive materials to produce, as well as more complex maintenance. In addition, the use of different energy sources may be associated with certain limitations and the need for constant monitoring.<br/><br/> The concept of a new electricity generator in the game Rust offers new possibilities for players and arouses interest in the gaming community. The future of electrification of your base will become brighter, more reliable and more efficient thanks to this innovative device. Get an advantage in the game and implement your most daring projects with the new electricity generator in the game Rust!'),
(12836, 'en-US', 'Pet concept in Rust'),
(12837, 'en-US', 'Learn all about the exciting new concept of pets in Rust. We\'ll look at the details and features of this highly anticipated addition that adds new possibilities and variety to the gameplay.'),
(12838, 'en-US', 'concept, pets, game Rust, update, addition, features, interaction, dangerous lands'),
(12839, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust introduces an exciting new concept: pets! This long-awaited addition opens up new possibilities for players and adds a new level of variety and interaction to the gameplay. Now you can have your own loyal companion in the world of Rust and explore its dangerous lands together. In this article, we will look at all the details and features of this exciting innovation.<br/><br/> Now, to stay up to date with all the news and updates on the topic of pets in the game Rust, join our community on VKontakte - <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a> . Here you will find useful information, discussions and other interesting materials related to this topic.'),
(12840, 'en-US', 'Loading screen update in Rust'),
(12841, 'en-US', 'The test branch has completely redesigned the loading screen in the game Rust. Now the servers will display additional information, such as the current online, game mode, map and tags. The update comes out on March 3.'),
(12842, 'en-US', 'update, loading screen, game Rust, server, information, game mode, map, tags'),
(12843, 'en-US', 'The test branch has completely redesigned the loading screen in the game Rust, and now we will tell you about this interesting update.<br/><br/> Now when you connect to a server, you will not only see the usual \"LOADING\" and \"CANCEL\" button. We have added new features that will make your interaction with the server even more convenient.<br/><br/> Now on the loading screen you will be able to see the following information about the server: the current online players, the game mode, the map installed on the server, as well as tags that will help you find the server according to the criteria you are interested in.<br/><br/> These innovations will allow you to quickly navigate among the many server offers and choose the one that is most suitable for you.<br/><br/> The loading screen update will be available to all players on March 3rd.<br/><br/> Stay up to date with all the news and updates of the Rust game, subscribe to our group on VKontakte - https://vk.com/rustcommru.'),
(12844, 'en-US', 'Concept of a collimator sight in Rust'),
(12845, 'en-US', 'The concept of a red dot sight in the game Rust/Rust presents a unique opportunity to improve the accuracy and efficiency of shooting. Learn about the importance of design, balancing and impact on decision-making in the game.'),
(12846, 'en-US', 'red dot sight, Rust, Rust, gaming experience, accuracy, design, balancing, decision making, game world'),
(12847, 'en-US', 'When it comes to the concept of a red dot sight in the game Rust, there are many possibilities and options that can change the gaming experience. The red dot sight is not just an accessory, it is a new level of precision and practicality in the game. It allows players to aim more accurately at the target and reduces the time for aiming, which makes firing even more effective.<br/><br/> One of the key factors influencing the concept of a red dot sight is its design. Here the question arises of what the design of the sight should be so that it is effective and does not overload the player\'s interface. An overly complex or impractical design can distract the player and make it difficult to use the sight.<br/><br/> It is also important to consider the trade-offs involved in balancing game mechanics. A red dot sight can be a powerful tool, but too much of an advantage can unbalance the game. Developers must strike a balance so that the red dot sight is a useful additional option, but does not overshadow other aiming methods.<br/><br/> Another important aspect to consider is the impact of the red dot sight concept on in-game decision making. With improved aiming, players can make more accurate shots and more thoughtful tactical decisions. This can impact the outcome of combat and influence each player\'s play style.<br/><br/> In conclusion, the concept of a red dot sight in Rust represents a unique opportunity to improve accuracy and shooting efficiency. It requires careful consideration of design and balancing, and can also impact decision making in the game. The introduction of a red dot sight into the Rust game world opens up new possibilities for players and adds new depth to the gameplay.'),
(12848, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins - refresh your gaming experience in Rust!'),
(12849, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of skins added to the game Rust! Upgrade your gaming experience and stand out from other players with unique and colorful skins.'),
(12850, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust, game, Steam, appearance, design, game economy, gameplay, tactics, creativity'),
(12851, 'en-US', '<p>Check out the latest batch of skins added to Rust! The development team continues to delight us with new and unique skins for weapons, items, and the base. New skins not only add freshness and creativity to the game, but also allow players to express their individuality and style.</p><br/><p> The key factor that determines the popularity of skins is their design. Developers carefully create each skin so that it matches the atmosphere of the game and attracts the attention of players. With a variety of styles and colors, everyone will find the perfect skin that suits their preferences.</p><br/><p> However, in addition to design, it is important to consider the balance of the game economy. All skins can be purchased in the Steam store, but for a skin to be valuable and in demand, its rarity and uniqueness must match its price. The developers think through every detail so that the game economy remains stable and fair.</p><br/><p> It should also be noted that the addition of new skins also brings changes to the gameplay. Some skins not only change the appearance of items, but can also affect their characteristics. This creates new tactical possibilities and strategies in the game, adding variety and surprise.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget that skins are not just decoration, but also an important aspect of interaction with the community. You can create your own skins and share them with other players via Steam Workshop. This opens up opportunities for creative expression and recognition from the community.</p><br/><p> So don\'t miss the opportunity to upgrade your gaming experience and dive into a new world with unique and colorful skins. Visit the Steam store to choose a new skin and stand out from other Rust players!</p>'),
(12852, 'en-US', 'Rust Update: New Features, Fixes, and Improvements'),
(12853, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update for Rust on Steam, which brings new features, fixes, and improvements.'),
(12854, 'en-US', 'Rust game, update, new features, fixes, improvements'),
(12855, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust continues to delight its fans with updates that bring new features, fix bugs and improve the gameplay. In this article, we will tell you about the latest update of the game, which brought many improvements and new features.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main new features of the update is the introduction of new weapons. Players can now use powerful assault rifles and sniper rifles to eliminate their enemies with greater efficiency. In addition, new explosives have been added that will allow players to destroy the walls and buildings of their opponents.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition to the new weapons, the update has made changes to the player progression system. Now, each player will have their own personal progression, which will affect their abilities, available recipes, and opportunities. This will allow players to feel more unique and diverse in the world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> An important component of the update is fixing bugs and improving the game\'s performance. The Rust developers are constantly working to solve problems that players encounter, and in this update they have done a lot of work on optimization and bug fixes. The game now runs more smoothly and stably, allowing players to enjoy the gameplay without any unpleasant surprises.</p><br/><br/><p> In conclusion, the Rust Steam update has brought a lot of improvements and new features that will allow players to enjoy the game even more. New weapons, a changed progression system and bug fixes have made the gameplay even more exciting and full of possibilities.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on the chance to dive into the world of Rust with new features and improvements! The update is now available on Steam, so come on in and enjoy the game with other players!</p>'),
(12856, 'en-US', 'Updated lighting for gas station, supermarket and spaceport in Rust');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(12857, 'en-US', 'The Rust test version has seen a lighting update at the gas station, supermarket, and spaceport. This will significantly impact the atmosphere and gameplay when visiting these locations.'),
(12858, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, lighting, gas station, supermarket, spaceport'),
(12859, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust test version has seen a lighting update at the gas station, supermarket, and spaceport. This will significantly impact the atmosphere and gameplay when visiting these locations.</p><br/><p> After the update that took place on March 3, players will notice that these three locations have become very dark, and it will be quite difficult to navigate without a flashlight. Especially in the offices of the spaceport, where the darkness will be felt even during the day.</p><br/><p> Visually, the monuments have become more attractive and interesting. Also, in some places, the textures have been replaced, which added variety to the environment.</p><br/><p> You can fully appreciate these changes only by looking at the screenshots, especially if you have not yet had time to try out the update. All changes will be available to players with the release of the update on March 3.</p>'),
(12860, 'en-US', 'Developers have added sorting by server tags to Staging'),
(12861, 'en-US', 'The new update to Rust on Staging includes the ability to sort servers by tags. This improvement allows players to quickly find and select the right servers to suit their preferences and playstyles.'),
(12862, 'en-US', 'game Rust, game update Rust, sort by server tags, Staging, gaming experience'),
(12863, 'en-US', '<p>The new update to Rust on Steam will please players with the ability to sort servers by tags. The developers added this feature to Staging to collect feedback and refine its effectiveness before releasing it in the main update of the game.</p><br/><p> Sorting by server tags allows players to find and select servers that suit their preferences and playstyles. Now you can easily find servers with specific game modes, such as PvP, PvE, or modded modes. Tags can also indicate specific server features, such as map size, difficulty level, or the presence of additional mods.</p><br/><p> Sorting by tags allows players to reduce the time spent searching for a suitable server. Now you can quickly find a server that matches your preferences and start playing without delays. This convenience allows players to focus on the game itself and improve the gaming experience.</p><br/><p> Adding tag sorting to Staging is just a step towards implementing this feature in a major update to the game. The developers are actively collecting feedback from players and will make any necessary improvements and changes before the final release.</p>'),
(12864, 'en-US', 'Rust Weekly Recap'),
(12865, 'en-US', 'Rust Week Recap: Updates, New Content, Bug Fixes. Find out the latest news and stay up to date on our social media.'),
(12866, 'en-US', 'Weekly summary, Rust game updates, news, Rust servers, PvP, social networks'),
(12867, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the \"Weekly Summary in Rust\" section! In this article, we will summarize the past week and tell you about the most interesting events, updates and changes that have occurred in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> This week, the development team has been focusing on optimization and bug fixes to ensure the game runs more smoothly. Several fixes have been released to ensure players have an even smoother gameplay experience and improved performance.</p><br/><p> Additionally, new content has been added this week, including new weapons, tools, and building pieces, allowing players to take on the role of a builder and create even more unique and defensible bases.</p><br/><p> Rust servers have also been updated to improve stability and provide players with a better gaming experience. Changes have been made to PvP mechanics to create a more balanced and fun gaming environment.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow our social networks to stay up to date with all the news and updates about the Rust game. Follow us at <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a> .</p><br/><p> In the next article we will continue to tell you about the most interesting news and events in the game Rust. Don\'t miss it!</p>'),
(12868, 'en-US', 'Rust Official Soundtrack Coming March 3rd'),
(12869, 'en-US', 'The official Rust soundtrack will be released on March 3 and features over an hour of atmospheric music. Find out more about the tracks and their availability on other platforms.'),
(12870, 'en-US', 'Rust soundtrack, Rust music, atmospheric music, game music, Rust tracks, Rust updates'),
(12871, 'en-US', 'The official soundtrack for Rust, which includes over an hour of atmospheric music and 29 tracks, will be released on March 3. The album contains in-game melodies that have become a memorable element of the game for all its fans, as well as previously unreleased tracks familiar from trailers and updates. Whether the soundtrack will be available on platforms other than Steam, and whether it will be free or paid, is currently unknown. To check out the album, visit the Steam store page at:'),
(12872, 'en-US', 'Explore the latest updates to Rust on Steam in this article, including work on magnetic crane movement, bug fixes, animation updates, and more.'),
(12873, 'en-US', 'news, updates, game Rust, Steam'),
(12874, 'en-US', 'Some news from the fields.<br/><br/> At this stage, active work is underway to ensure the correct movement of the magnetic crane!<br/> Fixed a bug where the driver in the crane would not \"sync\" visually with the crane itself when rotating the cabin (character jerk control).<br/> Magnetic crane colliders have been adjusted<br/> Driving physics are being adjusted<br/> Added the ability for the crane to rotate and move at the same time!<br/> Fixed animation of tracks movement when rotating<br/> ⛓The materials and prefabs of the Rocket Factory, Offices and Warehouses have been changed to make everything look more aesthetically pleasing with the new lighting. The glowing decals on the Rocket Factory and Warehouses have been fixed.<br/> ‍♂Work is underway on the animation and movement of the characters, in particular their limbs and head. Bones are being adjusted (bones in modeling are areas that are not subject to deformation, any bending and stretching). After completion, the model mesh should be displayed more correctly and not break.<br/> We updated the animation for swiping a key card in a lock!<br/> Great progress on the coastline work on the Happis map<br/> A separate pet control panel is being developed!<br/> For future pets, a function is being prepared to transfer them to another character without killing them!<br/> It is also supposed to give a little freedom to your pet, so that it can not completely follow your commands, but slightly deviate from them. It will give them realism and some character.<br/> Fixed an issue where the Oil Hunt mission reward was only 50 Scrap Metal.<br/> The large stove now also provides a small amount of heat, like fires and barbecues.'),
(12875, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: New Features and Improvements'),
(12876, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust, which brings new features and improvements such as a building system, improved graphics, a new combat system, and the addition of a new faction.'),
(12877, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, features, improvements, construction, graphics, sound effects, combat system, faction, bandits'),
(12878, 'en-US', '<p>Rust recently received a long-awaited update that brought a ton of new features and improvements. In this article, we\'ll take a look at the major changes and how they\'ll impact your gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the biggest new features is the addition of a building system. Players will now be able to create more complex and unique structures using various construction elements. This opens up a huge range of creative possibilities and allows for even more robust fortifications.</p><br/><br/><p> Graphics and sound effects have also been significantly improved. The new engine realistically displays the environment and creates a unique atmosphere of survival. Additional sound effects make the game even more exciting and immersive.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the most interesting innovations is the combat system. Now the battles have become even more dynamic and realistic. Players can use different weapons and tactics to win the fight. Fraternizing with opponents has become much more interesting and difficult.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, a new faction has been added - bandits. They represent their interests and create their settlements, offering players new quests and tasks. Now players will have even more opportunities to interact with the game world and get new content.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that the developers actively pay attention to feedback from players and fix bugs and shortcomings. They really listen to their audience and are constantly working to improve the game.</p><br/><br/><p> As a result, the new Rust game update offers players a lot of new features and improvements that make the gameplay even more exciting. Don\'t miss the chance to plunge into the world of survival and battles, test your skills and become a real hero!</p>'),
(12879, 'en-US', 'Rust is getting a new batch of skins on Steam soon. They will allow players to customize their characters, weapons, clothing, tools, and decorative items, making them unique and distinguishable from the rest. Find out more about this long-awaited update!'),
(12880, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, character customization, weapons, clothes, tools, decorative items'),
(12881, 'en-US', '<p>A new batch of skins is expected to appear in the game Rust on the Steam platform soon!</p><br/><p> If you are a fan of this multiplayer online game, then you should definitely pay attention to this long-awaited update.</p><br/><p> It is no secret that skins are one of the most popular and sought-after elements in the game Rust. They allow players to customize their characters, weapons, tools and buildings, making them unique and distinguishable from other players.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins will feature various categories, including weapons, clothing, tools, and cosmetics. There is something for everyone!</p><br/><p> The game developers paid special attention to the details and quality of the new skins. They will be made in different styles and colors to suit the different preferences and needs of the players.</p><br/><p> One of the advantages of the new batch of skins is their limited nature. There will be a limited number of skins released into the game, which makes them more unique and valuable.</p><br/><p> As before, skins will be available for purchase in the Steam store. However, you should be prepared for the fact that some skins can be quite expensive, especially those that have gained great popularity among players.</p><br/><p> If you\'ve always wanted to stand out from the rest of the players, then the new batch of skins in the game Rust is a great chance to do it!</p>'),
(12882, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Bigger Furnace for More Comfort'),
(12883, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update introduces a large furnace that brings more warmth and comfort to the game world. Opening up new possibilities for survival and construction, it gives players the opportunity to enjoy comfort even in harsh conditions.'),
(12884, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game updates, big oven, warmth, comfort, survival, building, cooking'),
(12885, 'en-US', '<p>The new Rust game update brings a variety of improvements and changes, including the expected ability to get more warmth and comfort from the large furnace.</p><br/><br/><p> Players have long asked the developers to add more options for using the stove, and to meet this request, the developers have introduced the ability to modify the stove so that it becomes a source of warmth and comfort.</p><br/><br/><p> Players can now install a large furnace in their home or fortified base and enjoy warmth and comfort even in the harshest conditions. This opens up new possibilities for survival and construction, allowing players to become more resilient to cold and other adverse weather conditions.</p><br/><br/><p> The large oven can also be used to cook food, making it even more useful and necessary in the gameplay. Players can now cook themselves a hot meal or brew a cup of hot coffee to recharge their batteries before exploring the world.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust game update contributes to the creation of an atmospheric and realistic gaming experience, where every little detail contributes to the overall atmosphere. The large stove is one of the new details that turns the game world into a real fireplace, giving warmth and peace.</p>'),
(12886, 'en-US', 'All the latest news about Rust game updates on Steam'),
(12887, 'en-US', 'Upcoming Rust Steam Updates: Pets, Gameplay Changes, Improvements, and New Items.'),
(12888, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, Rust updates, pets, train tracks, spray can, snowmobile, magnetic crane, upgrades, new items, recycling'),
(12889, 'en-US', 'All the latest news...<br/> What awaits us in the near future?<br/> The developers have started to finish writing the pet system, similar to the Frankenstein system! At the moment, it is not known what exactly is meant by this, the domestication of animals: wolves, bears, or maybe even sharks? Everyone knows that there is already a similar plugin on the mod servers. And it is no secret that the developers really like to implement ready-made, \"stolen\" ideas into the game.<br/> It is quite possible that the introduction of a mechanical dog into the game, the model of which we posted about half a year ago, will be timed to coincide with this system.<br/><br/> The second idea of ​​the developers is to try to move the railway tracks to the surface! And they are aiming to make it a procedural option... BUT! So far they have not succeeded and they admit that the idea is interesting, but not workable, since it breaks the landscape or breaks the tracks... Well, we\'ll see, if only there is a desire.<br/><br/> The third idea is to make the spray can work correctly on all textures and surfaces and return the function of applying drawings and stickers, as it was on the staging branch! The function is cool, we are waiting for the implementation!<br/><br/> ❄The edges of ice lakes and the tops of icebergs will now be perceived by the snowmobile as a snowy, not an icy surface, and they will no longer slide on it!<br/><br/> Later, it is planned to change the visualization of the loading screen! Are you bored with loading for 10 minutes from HDD? Now you will load 11 more fun)<br/><br/> ⛹‍♂The running function will be set by default, and pressing the hotkey will just make the player walk so as not to make noise.<br/><br/> Minor improvements:<br/> Improvement of foam texture is being made<br/> Work is still ongoing by individual members of the development team on the Happis map! The rivers and banks in the eastern part of the map are still being edited (they won\'t calm down with them)<br/><br/> The magnetic crane consumes 25% less fuel at full load if nothing is holding it.<br/> Idle: 4 units of fuel<br/> Full throttle no load: 15 units of fuel<br/> Full throttle with load: 20 units of fuel<br/> A control hint for the magnetic crane will pop up every time the player gets on it.<br/><br/> Phantom footsteps when the player was out of sight will be fixed and configured more correctly. Personally, this always annoyed me in the game!<br/> Removed the sound of splashing water when a snowmobile appears<br/> The sound of the snowmobile engine behaves differently on climbs. Supposedly, the snowmobile in real life increases its speed and roars more, which will be conveyed in the game.<br/> Fixed an issue where some vehicle modules were not receiving piercing protection for passengers<br/> New items and prefabs in the \"Supermarkets\" theme. From this we can conclude that new small RTs will appear soon. Or the old ones will be reworked.<br/> Added new texture of broken glass<br/> Added an alternate portable boombox that can now animate the volume knob, play button, open the cassette slot, turn on the power button, and extend both antennas, including higher resolution textures and materials'),
(12890, 'en-US', 'Magnetic Crane Update in Rust'),
(12891, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have updated the magnetic crane, as a result of which its characteristics and resource consumption have changed.'),
(12892, 'en-US', 'game Rust, magnetic crane, update'),
(12893, 'en-US', 'Developers are busy reworking the magnetic crane'),
(12894, 'en-US', 'Adding \"Always Run\" feature to Rust game settings'),
(12895, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust adds a very useful feature called Always Run, which makes gameplay much easier. Find out how to activate this feature and how it can improve your Rust experience.'),
(12896, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, Rust update, Always Run feature, game settings, gameplay, character management'),
(12897, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust adds a very useful feature called \"Always Run\" that makes gameplay much easier. Players no longer have to worry about keybindings, as they can simply enable the feature in the game settings.</p><br/><p> This add-on is especially useful for those who prefer an active playstyle and are constantly on the move. No longer is it necessary to constantly hold the sprint button to move around the maps. Now players can simply turn on the \"Always Run\" feature and enjoy free movement throughout the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> To activate the \"Always Run\" feature, players can simply go into the game settings and find the option. All they have to do is set the key they want to use to run all the time. After that, players don\'t have to worry about pressing the button to run all the time and can just enjoy the game.</p><br/><p> The addition of the \"Always Run\" feature is another step by the Rust developers towards simplifying the gameplay and making the gameplay easier. This addition can be especially useful for newcomers who find it difficult to get used to the complexities of character control. Now they can customize the game according to their own preferences and enjoy the gameplay without unnecessary inconvenience.</p><br/><p> Overall, the addition of the \"Always Run\" feature to the Rust game settings is a great step that improves the gameplay and the convenience of character control. This addition allows players to customize the game to their liking and enjoy the gameplay without unnecessary restrictions.</p>'),
(12898, 'en-US', 'The game Rust on the Steam platform has a new batch of unique skins that will allow players to express their individuality and create a unique atmosphere in the gameplay. Read more about the new skins and their impact on the game in our article.'),
(12899, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Rust game, Steam, unique items, Steam game store, individuality, designer skins, gameplay, game developers, game development funding'),
(12900, 'en-US', 'The game Rust on the Steam platform has a new batch of skins! This is great news for all players who want to decorate their virtual items with unique and stylish shells. Adding new skins to the game always arouses interest and delight in the gaming community, because it is a great opportunity to stand out from other players and show your individuality.<br/><br/> The developers of the game Rust are constantly working on updates and expanding the functionality of the game. They not only fix errors and implement new features, but also update the skin collections so that players can enjoy fresh and exclusive items in the Steam game store.<br/><br/> New skins in the game Rust give items a unique appearance and create a certain attractiveness to game objects. They can change color, texture, shape and add various inscriptions or drawings. Such details make game items more unique and attractive to other players. Each new skin is a carefully thought-out and designer-verified item that will help you stand out among many players and create your own unique atmosphere in the game Rust.<br/><br/> Adding new skins to the Rust game keeps the gameplay fresh and interesting. Players will be able to purchase new skins in the Steam in-game store or receive them as a reward for in-game achievements. Each skin has its own unique price and availability, so you will have the opportunity to choose exactly the skins that interest you.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget that new skins in the Rust game are not only a way to decorate your virtual items, but also an opportunity to support the game developers. By purchasing skins, you help finance the further development of the game and the creation of new content.<br/><br/> In general, new skins in the game Rust are a great opportunity for players to show their individuality, stand out from other players and create a unique atmosphere in the game. Don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection and add a touch of exclusivity to the gameplay!'),
(12901, 'en-US', 'Work on pets has begun on a separate branch'),
(12902, 'en-US', 'Work on pets in Rust has begun on a separate branch. Learn about the reimagining of the pet system and the expected appearance of new pets in the game.'),
(12903, 'en-US', 'Pets Work, Pets in Rust, Halloween Event, Frankenstein, New Pets in Rust'),
(12904, 'en-US', 'Work on pets has begun on a separate branch. You may have already seen an early version of pets during the Halloween event in October 2021. Back then, Frankenstein appeared in the game - the first full-fledged pet that could be controlled, edited, and given commands. And now the development team is busy rewriting the basis of the pet system for its further use. It is expected that new pets will soon appear in the game that will be available to players.<br/><br/> There is already information about one of the possible pets, which is of additional interest to fans of the game. Stay tuned for more updates!'),
(12905, 'en-US', 'New Rust Game Update: Work on Procedural Railroad Networks'),
(12906, 'en-US', 'Rust developers have started working on procedural railroad networks. Find out more about the new update and expect improvements in the game experience.'),
(12907, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, procedural networks, railroads'),
(12908, 'en-US', '<p>On a separate branch, Rust developers have begun work on improving procedural railroad networks.</p><br/><p> One of the developers, Andre, took on the task of generating railroads on the surface of the map. As a result, players will be able to move around the world on trains without having to go down into underground structures. However, Andre admits that this innovation is not yet fully functional.</p><br/><p> It is already known that this innovation requires several compromises to achieve optimal performance. The developers are paying special attention to this issue to ensure the best gaming experience.</p><br/><p> Unfortunately, there is no exact information about the release date of the update yet, but the development team is actively working on it.</p>'),
(12909, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates on Steam: News and Changes'),
(12910, 'en-US', 'In this article you will find all the news and changes related to the Rust game updates on Steam.'),
(12911, 'en-US', 'Rust game on Steam, Rust updates, Rust update news'),
(12912, 'en-US', '<p>Rust on Steam is constantly being updated to offer players new content, fix bugs, and improve gameplay. In this article, we\'ll cover the latest news and changes related to Rust updates.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>1. New features and content:</b></p><br/><p> The developers are constantly delighting players with new features and content. Recent updates have added many new items, buildings, and opportunities for players. Now you can craft various items and interact with the world around you to survive in the wild. Much attention is also paid to balancing the game mechanics to ensure fair play for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>2. Improved graphics and optimization:</b></p><br/><p> Rust developers are constantly working on improving graphics and optimizing the game. New updates bring changes that make the game world even more beautiful and realistic. Thanks to optimization, the game becomes smoother and more stable, which allows you to enjoy its process without problems and lags.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>3. Fixing errors and bugs:</b></p><br/><p> Like any other game, Rust is not without errors and bugs. However, the developers regularly release updates that fix these problems. Thanks to the reviews and feedback from players, the Rust development team is actively working to improve the game and fix errors to ensure the most comfortable gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>4. Balancing game mechanics:</b></p><br/><p> Rust is a survival game where you must gather resources, build shelter and defend yourself from other players. Balancing game mechanics is an important aspect to provide players with fair and fun gameplay. The developers are constantly making changes and adjustments to ensure a level playing field for all players while maintaining the uniqueness and complexity of the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust on Steam continues to evolve and improve with regular updates. New content, graphics improvements, bug fixes, and balancing of game mechanics make the game even more interesting and exciting for all players. Stay tuned for news and updates to stay up to date with the latest changes in Rust.</p>'),
(12913, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll walk you through the latest updates to Rust, including new features and changes you can experience in the game. Learn about new features, stats, and map development.'),
(12914, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, game, snowmobile, door, sharks, deaths, rockets, map, animations, videos'),
(12915, 'en-US', 'In this article, we\'ll share the latest news from the Rust field! Find out about the latest changes and updates:'),
(12916, 'en-US', 'Check out everything new in the latest Rust update on Steam!'),
(12917, 'en-US', 'Update, Rust, Steam, innovations'),
(12918, 'en-US', 'A new update of the game Rust has appeared on Steam! You can learn more about the changes and innovations in the video:'),
(12919, 'en-US', 'Another round of drops has started!'),
(12920, 'en-US', 'A new round of drops in the game Rust has started, and players can get exclusive rewards, improve equipment and pump up their character.'),
(12921, 'en-US', 'round drops, Rust, rewards, equipment, rare items, character leveling'),
(12922, 'en-US', 'The long-awaited moment has arrived! The new round of drops in the game Rust has already begun, and players around the world can get exclusive rewards. This is a great opportunity to improve your equipment, find rare items and pump up your character. Don\'t miss the chance to become one of the best in the game!'),
(12923, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust for Steam'),
(12924, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest batch of skins for Rust on Steam and create a unique style for your character. Change the appearance of weapons, clothing, and other items in the game to stand out from other players.'),
(12925, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins, Rust game, Steam, weapon skins, clothing skins, unique style, appearance change, individuality, new gaming experience, Rust world'),
(12926, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust never ceases to please its fans with new features and updates. Each new batch of skins brings a fresh wind into the game universe, allowing players to customize their items and create a unique look for their character.</p><br/><br/><p> Today we want to tell you about the latest batch of skins that have been added to the game Rust for Steam. This batch contains dozens of new skins for weapons, clothing, and other items. Each of these skins has its own unique theme and style, allowing players to choose exactly what suits their taste.</p><br/><br/><p> Weapon skins allow you to change the appearance of your weapon, making it more stylish and unique. You can choose a skin that suits your playstyle or just choose what you like visually. Some skins can be rare and have special effects, making your weapon even more impressive.</p><br/><br/><p> Clothing is another important part of your in-game appearance. New clothing skins will allow you to create a unique style for your character. You can choose between different types of clothing, such as helmets, jackets, pants, and more. Each skin has its own uniqueness and will probably highlight your individuality in the world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition to weapons and clothing, the new batch of skins also includes skins for other items. You can change the appearance of your home, creating a unique atmosphere, or change the appearance of your own personal transport. The possibilities are endless, and it all depends on your imagination and creativity.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins in Rust are more than just a change in the appearance of items. They allow you to express your individuality and create a unique gaming experience. Install new skins and immerse yourself in the world of Rust with a new style and appearance that reflects your presence in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to update your gaming experience with new skins in the game Rust for Steam. Search and experiment with different skins to find the style that suits you best. Create a unique look for your character and stand out from the crowd. Dive into the exciting world of Rust with a new batch of skins!</p>'),
(12927, 'en-US', 'The Arctic update is out today at 10pm'),
(12928, 'en-US', 'The Arctic update for Rust is out today at 10:00 PM Moscow time. The update will feature a new research base, snowmobile, polar bear, spray paint, new AK-47, and winter suit. It will also feature a ton of quality of life improvements. Get ready for new adventures in the Arctic biome of Rust.'),
(12929, 'en-US', 'Arctic Update, Rust, Science Base, Snowmobile, Polar Bear, Spray Paint, New AK-47, Winter Suit, Quality of Life Improvements, Monuments, Vehicles, Animals'),
(12930, 'en-US', 'The Arctic update is out today at 22:00 Moscow time<br/><br/> Arctic scientific base.<br/> A new large monument with updated scientists, many different boxes and puzzles that will lead to a garage with a snowmobile inside! You can also find a red card and a recycler.<br/><br/> Snowmobile.<br/> Drives only on snow and sand, on other surfaces the speed is low and almost uncontrollable, has a small box in the back. Appears only in the Arctic base.<br/><br/> Polar bear.<br/> The Polar Bear is larger, has slightly higher attack power and health than its brown counterpart, and provides slightly more resources. It only appears in the Winter Biome.<br/><br/> Spray paint can.<br/> Initially had two functions: drawing on various surfaces and changing skins of objects. The first is currently disabled. Created for 100 metal fragments, studied by default.<br/><br/> New AK-47 and winter suit.<br/> There\'s a high chance that both items will be paid items in the developer\'s permanent item store.<br/> The winter suit has much greater cold resistance than the anti-rad, but the developers tried to compensate for this by lowering some other parameters, including protection from radiation by as much as 17%.<br/> The new AK-47, of course, has no differences except for its appearance and the bombastic evaporation effect.<br/><br/> The update will also include many quality of life improvements, the most interesting of which are:<br/> — 4 additional tool slots have been added to the cabinet<br/> — The patrol helicopter is displayed on the map<br/> - Hitting an object with a mallet shows the resources needed to repair it<br/> — Added interface for mute (personally disables chat and voice)<br/> — Improved workbench interface<br/> — Added electric output to air defense'),
(12931, 'en-US', 'Skin giveaways in the game Rust'),
(12932, 'en-US', 'Find out about skin giveaways in the Rust game, which are taking place in the VK community and on the Discord server.'),
(12933, 'en-US', 'Giveaway, skins, game Rust, VK, Discord'),
(12934, 'en-US', 'Welcome everyone!<br/><br/> We have two giveaways where you can win 10 skins for the game Rust. If you are interested, join us!<br/><br/> The first draw is taking place in the VK community on the page https://vk.com/rustcommru. Just follow the link and take part in the promotion.<br/><br/> The second giveaway is taking place on the Discord server. Find the channel dedicated to the giveaway and enter for a chance to win skins.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to get new skins for the game Rust! Fly to our giveaways and good luck to you!'),
(12935, 'en-US', 'A new round of Twitch drops starts on February 3 at 21:00 Moscow time!'),
(12936, 'en-US', 'A new round of Twitch drops starts on February 3 at 21:00 Moscow time! Find out how to get exclusive skins and items in the game Rust, just by watching streams on Twitch!'),
(12937, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, skin giveaways, round, update, game Rust, Twitch'),
(12938, 'en-US', 'Upcoming Twitch Skin Drops: New Round Starts February 3rd at 21:00 Moscow Time!<br/><br/> We are looking forward to the new round of Twitch Drops, which will begin simultaneously with the release of the next game update. Get a chance to win exclusive skins and items just by watching streams on the Twitch platform. This is a great opportunity to decorate your game collection with unique items. Don\'t miss out!'),
(12939, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates: New Ice AK-47 and Improved Winter Suit'),
(12940, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest updates to the game Rust: the addition of an ice AK-47 and improved winter suit characteristics. However, the Kalashnikov version may become a paid version, which we will discuss in more detail in the article.'),
(12941, 'en-US', 'Rust game updates, ice AK-47, winter suit, paid version, characteristics, protection, frost, radiation, bites, explosions'),
(12942, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest update of the game Rust, the developers added a new weapon - the ice AK-47. This version of the popular Kalashnikov has not only a unique design, but also special characteristics. However, there is an assumption that in the future, the Kalashnikov version will only be available in the paid version of the game. This calls into question the possibility of obtaining weapons in the standard free version.</p><br/><p> In addition, the developers have updated the characteristics of the winter suit. Now this protective clothing has a higher level of protection from the cold - up to 40%. Thanks to this, players can feel comfortable and protected even in the most severe frosts, including at night and in the water. However, due to the improvement of protection from the cold, the level of protection from radiation, animal bites and explosions has slightly decreased.</p>'),
(12943, 'en-US', 'New skins delivered to the store'),
(12944, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new skins delivered to the Rust game store and updates to the game\'s skin collection.'),
(12945, 'en-US', 'new Rust skins, skins in the game Rust, update skins Rust'),
(12946, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, dear Rust players! Get ready for another shipment of skins to the game store.</p><br/><br/><p> We are pleased to inform you about fresh updates and new opportunities for your gaming collection. Here is what awaits you:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> New Unique Weapon Skins - Add some personality to your arsenal and stand out on the battlefield. Now you can purchase skins for your favorite weapons, from automatic rifles to shotguns and pistols.</li><br/><li> Fresh outfits and gear - make your character truly stylish with new clothing skins. Try different combinations to create the perfect look for survival in the ruthless world of Rust.</li><br/><li> Improved textures and detailing - the developers tried to make the skins more realistic and high-quality. Now each element will look even better and more pleasing to the eye.</li><br/><li> Discounts and promotions - along with new skins, you will also find various promotions and discounts to make your purchase even more profitable. Don\'t miss the opportunity to buy the desired skins at an attractive price.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> This skins delivery presents a wide range and new variations for you. Regardless of your preferences, you will definitely find something interesting and unique for your collection.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to upgrade your gaming experience and make your game even more fun and personal. Visit the Rust store and update your skin collection today!</p>'),
(12947, 'en-US', 'Information about the February 3 update has appeared'),
(12948, 'en-US', 'Find out about the exciting changes and additions that the Rust update brought on February 3. New arctic bases, snowmobiles, a winter suit and other improvements await you in the snowy arctic survival world.'),
(12949, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, arctic bases, snowmobiles, winter suit, winter biome, visualization, server filter, fire damage radius collider'),
(12950, 'en-US', '<h2>New Rust Game Update: Expected Changes and Additions</h2><br/><p> On February 3, the developers of the game Rust released a long-awaited update, which brought a number of interesting changes and additions. Let\'s take a closer look at some of them:</p><br/><br/><h3> New Arctic bases and snowmobiles</h3><br/><p> The update adds new arctic bases where players can find various valuable resources. Snowmobiles have also been introduced, which will spawn at the entrance to bases with a blue map. Now movement in arctic bases has become more comfortable.</p><br/><br/><h3> Improved snowmobiling</h3><br/><p> The developers have improved and optimized the movement of snowmobiles, which made their control smoother and more realistic. Now players will be able to enjoy complete freedom of movement in snowy locations.</p><br/><br/><h3> Winter suit and updates in the winter biome</h3><br/><p> The game has a new winter suit that provides additional protection from radiation and cold. In addition, the developers have made changes to the winter biome, including an updated snowstorm that reduces visibility at a distance.</p><br/><br/><h3> Visual and gameplay improvements</h3><br/><p> The update also made changes to the visualization of fog, making it more realistic. In addition, a filter was added to the server search section, which will allow players to find the server they need more quickly and conveniently.</p><br/><br/><h3> Fire damage radius collider for mappers</h3><br/><p> The developers didn\'t forget about mappers either, adding a fire damage radius collider. This will allow them to create even more realistic game objects, including the ability to create volcanoes and lava flows.</p><br/><br/><p> The February 3 update to Rust brought a host of exciting changes and additions that will allow players to delve even deeper into the snowy arctic world of survival.</p>'),
(12951, 'en-US', 'Steam Lunar Sale: Discounts on RUST and Add-ons'),
(12952, 'en-US', 'Steam has launched a lunar sale in honor of the Chinese \"New Year\". Hurry up to buy the game RUST and its add-ons with discounts!'),
(12953, 'en-US', 'Steam, Lunar Sale, Chinese New Year, Discounts, RUST, Add-ons'),
(12954, 'en-US', 'Steam has launched a lunar sale in honor of the Chinese \"New Year\". Now you can buy the game RUST and its add-ons at a discount:<br/><br/><ul><li> Rust - 981₽ (1465₽)</li><li> DLC Instruments Pack - 247₽ (369₽)</li><li> DLC Sunburn Pack - 247₽ (369₽)</li><li> DLC Voice Props Pack - 414₽ (618₽)</li></ul> Hurry, the promotion is limited in time!'),
(12955, 'en-US', 'Rust Update: Chinese New Year'),
(12956, 'en-US', 'On January 27 at 22:00 Moscow time, the Rust update will take place, which will begin the celebration of the Chinese New Year. Find out what awaits players in the new content and how it will change the gaming experience.'),
(12957, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, Chinese New Year, celebration, new content, items, servers, client, atmosphere, fun, adventure'),
(12958, 'en-US', '<h2>Rust Update: Chinese New Year</h2><br/><br/><p> On January 27 at 22:00 Moscow time, the long-awaited update will take place on the Rust server and client, which will begin the celebration of the Chinese New Year.</p><br/><br/><p> The developers are keeping the full list of new content under wraps for now, but we can expect to see the addition of themed items from previous years and possibly some brand new items.</p><br/><br/><p> The update will not reset players\' progress, but will add the ability to create a unique Chinese New Year atmosphere on servers. Festive items and decorations will create new opportunities for gameplay experience, and will also become collectibles that can be used in subsequent game events.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the start of the Chinese New Year celebration in Rust and immerse yourself in the atmosphere of festive fun and great adventures!</p>'),
(12959, 'en-US', 'Attention, a giveaway has been launched on VK!'),
(12960, 'en-US', 'Attention! We have launched a giveaway in VK with skins for Kalashnikov as a prize. Don\'t miss your chance to win unique prizes in the game Rust!'),
(12961, 'en-US', 'giveaway, VK, skins, Kalashnikov, prizes'),
(12962, 'en-US', 'Hooray, we have great news for you! We have launched an incredible giveaway on VK, which will definitely interest all fans of the game Rust!<br/><br/> As part of the giveaway, we are offering a chance to win an incredible prize - as many as 5 skins for Kalashnikov! And the best thing is that we have not one, but as many as five prize places to increase your chances of winning.<br/><br/> To enter the giveaway you simply need to click on the link below and follow the instructions:<br/> <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269972088\">https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269972088</a><br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance for unique skins and join the giveaway right now! Good luck!'),
(12963, 'en-US', 'Arctic Anti-Radiation Suit added to aux branch'),
(12964, 'en-US', 'Arctic Anti-Radiation Suit - a new item added to the Rust game in the aux branch. The suit has improved protection from the cold and differs visually from the original.'),
(12965, 'en-US', 'arctic anti-radiation suit, Rust, update, aux branch, game on Steam'),
(12966, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest update of the Rust game, a new item was added to the aux branch - an arctic anti-radiation suit.</p><br/><p> This suit is significantly different visually from the original suit and has improved characteristics - 12% protection from the cold, while the regular suit offered only 8% protection.</p><br/><p> There are currently no details on what form this item will be available in, but it is likely that the Arctic Radiation Suit will be a new skin for the Radiation Suit that will be available for purchase in the permanent item shop.</p>'),
(12967, 'en-US', 'We are pleased to announce the release of a new batch of skins in the game Rust on the Steam platform. Find out how these skins can change the appearance of your character and items in the game, as well as what additional bonuses they can provide.'),
(12968, 'en-US', 'game Rust, new skins, skins batch, original look, gaming experience, uniqueness, individuality, additional content'),
(12969, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, dear players and fans of the game Rust! We are pleased to inform you about the release of a new batch of skins for your favorite game. Skins are a great way to change the appearance of your character and items, adding freshness and originality to the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> Each new batch of skins generates a lot of interest among players - and they often eagerly await the announcements to find out what new options will be available. A new batch of skins is a great opportunity to upgrade your gear, add some color to your builds, and give your characters a new and unique look.</p><br/><br/><p> The uniqueness of skins lies in their limited availability and rarity. Some of them may only be available at a certain time or during special events. Players who decide to purchase these rare skins will be able to show off their unique style and show it off to others while playing.</p><br/><br/><p> It is worth noting that the choice of skins can significantly change the gaming experience. Sometimes new skins not only change the appearance of the character, but can also provide additional bonuses or improve the characteristics of items. In this case, choosing a skin can be a strategic move that gives an advantage in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to remember that new skins are additional content that allows you to show your individuality and creativity within the game world. All of them are absolutely optional for a full gameplay, so do not forget about the main goal - to enjoy the game and get the most out of the process.</p><br/><br/><p> So stay tuned for news and announcements to keep up with the new batch of skins coming to Rust. Skin updates are always an interesting and exciting event that adds variety and freshness to the game world. Always stay up to date and enjoy the game with new and unique skins!</p>'),
(12970, 'en-US', 'Giveaway - Quiz for Five Skins in Discord'),
(12971, 'en-US', 'Join our Discord community and take part in an exciting quiz giveaway where you can win five amazing skins for the game Rust. Show off your expertise and get the opportunity to create a unique look for your items in the game.'),
(12972, 'en-US', 'giveaway, quiz, skins, game Rust, Discord'),
(12973, 'en-US', '<p>Hello, friends! We have an exciting giveaway starting in our Discord that will definitely cheer you up! We are holding a quiz in which participants can win five amazing skins for the game Rust on Steam. This is a great way to make the game even more interesting and diverse!</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance! Join us on Discord and take part in our exciting quiz. Here you can show off your knowledge and compete with other players. Answer the questions, prove your expertise in the game Rust and get a chance to win five beautiful skins.</p><br/><p> We give you the opportunity to meet new people who share your passion for the game. Here you can discuss strategies, share experiences and just have fun. The quiz is also a great way to show off your team skills and find new teammates.</p><br/><p> Don\'t waste time! Join our Discord community and take part in the quiz for five skins for the game Rust. Here you will find exciting questions, interesting tasks and the opportunity to feel like a real winner.</p><br/><p> Skins are being raffled off that can decorate your items in the game. Create your own unique image, stand out among other players and make your rivals jealous. I am sure that everyone will find a skin to their taste and will be able to transform their items into real works of art.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to win five awesome skins for the game Rust! Join our Discord community, take part in an exciting quiz and show everyone that you are a true expert on the game!</p>'),
(12974, 'en-US', 'Some news about upcoming changes in the game Rust'),
(12975, 'en-US', 'Learn about upcoming changes to Rust that will add new features and improve gameplay. Scientists at Arctic bases will now provide assistance to players, new animations have been added, and much more!'),
(12976, 'en-US', 'news, updates, game Rust, arctic bases, snowmobiles, scientists'),
(12977, 'en-US', '<p>Let\'s take a look at some of the new changes that players will soon see in Rust.</p><br/><ul><li> Scientists at Arctic bases now have a 50% chance to provide assistance when attacked by players.</li><li> The handbrake on snowmobiles has been adjusted to allow players to control them more confidently.</li><li> The maximum turning angle of the snowmobile has been reduced to provide a smoother and more realistic ride.</li><li> The snowmobile suspension now works more reliably, which will help players avoid distortions and damage.</li><li> Added scrolling animation for snowmobile tracks to create a more realistic atmosphere.</li><li> Arctic bases are now equipped with door opening sensors, allowing players to avoid wasting time waiting for doors to open.</li></ul><br/><p> These changes will create new opportunities and improve the gameplay experience for all Rust players. Be prepared to face new challenges and enjoyable changes!</p>'),
(12978, 'en-US', 'A new species of bear will appear in the world - the polar bear'),
(12979, 'en-US', 'Learn about a new type of bear appearing in the game Rust - the polar bear, with the same characteristics as a regular bear, but living in winter locations.'),
(12980, 'en-US', 'Rust, bear, polar bear, update, game, winter, characteristics, hunting, locations');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(12981, 'en-US', '<p>The world-famous game Rust will please its users with a new impressive update this time. The developers announced the appearance of a new type of bear - the polar bear. Now virtual players will be able to encounter this fascinating creature living within the winter locations.</p><br/><br/><p> The Polar Bear is a new type of bear that is shaping up to be one of the most threatening opponents in the game. Like its regular counterpart, the Polar Bear has the same characteristics. However, its white fur and powerful paws complement its attack potential, making it even more dangerous.</p><br/><br/><p> The appearance of the polar bear in the world of Rust opens up new opportunities for hunter players. Now they will be able to explore winter locations, trying to hunt these wild and insidious animals. But be careful, because the polar bear will not be afraid to attack and respond to you with its strength.</p><br/><br/><p> The developers of the game Rust always strive to add new elements and species to the game universe to bring fresh emotions and plot twists every time. The introduction of the polar bear is another step in enriching the gameplay and creating new challenges and adventures for players.</p>'),
(12982, 'en-US', 'Some news about upcoming changes in the game'),
(12983, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about upcoming changes to Rust, including the ability to heal bots, increasing the desert on Hapis, improving snowmobile functionality, and reducing the delay in disembarking a character from a vehicle.'),
(12984, 'en-US', 'game Rust, upcoming changes, bots, Hepis, desert, snowmobile, landing'),
(12985, 'en-US', '<p>Hello, Rust fans! We have some exciting news for you about upcoming changes to the game that you will definitely want to know.</p><br/><br/><p> Firstly, we are happy to announce that in the upcoming update, bots will be able to heal just like regular players. They will now be able to show survival and restore health, which will make them even more dangerous and unexpected opponents. Be on your guard when fighting bots!</p><br/><br/><p> Secondly, for all the fans of Hepis, there is great news - we have increased the desert on this map. Now you will be able to explore more new places and test your survival skills in more diverse conditions.</p><br/><br/><p> Thirdly, we have also improved the functionality of the snowmobile. Now it will become a reliable and effective means of transportation in snowy areas, allowing you to quickly and safely reach your goals. You will be able to experience the real pleasure of racing on snow-covered tracks with this new fix.</p><br/><br/><p> Finally, we\'ve reduced the delay when disembarking a character from a vehicle. Now, the disembarkation process will only take 0.25 seconds, allowing you to get to work faster and more smoothly once you reach your destination.</p><br/><br/><p> This is just a small part of the changes that await you in the next update of the game Rust. We continue to work on improving the gameplay and creating the most exciting and immersive survival experience. Stay tuned and stay in touch!</p>'),
(12986, 'en-US', 'Paper has a new use in Rust'),
(12987, 'en-US', 'Rust has received an update that allows players to use paper to create a stencil for a new spray paint can and paint graffiti on various objects in the game.'),
(12988, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, paper, stencil, paints, graffiti drawing, creativity, gaming experience'),
(12989, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has received an interesting update that gives a new use to regular paper. Players can now use 5 sheets of paper to create a stencil for a new spray can.</p><br/><p> This change has become a real find for those who like to express their creativity in the game. Now drawing graffiti has become much more convenient and accessible.</p><br/><p> Players can create their own unique designs and apply them to walls, doors, boxes and other objects in the game. This feature opens up a wide range of opportunities for self-expression and interesting design solutions.</p><br/><p> Moreover, graffiti can become one of the ways of communication in the game. Players can leave messages, give directions or even organize their own exhibitions and art projects.</p><br/><p> The new use of paper in Rust will not only add variety to the gameplay, but will also allow players to express their creative side and create a unique gaming experience.</p>'),
(12990, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: variety and opportunities for players'),
(12991, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins in Rust, featuring a huge variety of designs and the ability to express your own style and functionality.'),
(12992, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, graphic modifications, features'),
(12993, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for all fans of the game Rust - we are pleased to announce the arrival of a new batch of skins!</p><br/><p> Graphic mods are an integral part of the Rust gaming experience, allowing players to add personality and exclusivity to their characters and items. A new batch of skins that have just been added to the game offer you even more options to express your style and taste.</p><br/><p> When it comes to skins in Rust, variety is key. The new batch of skins includes a wide range of designs and color schemes to ensure that every player can find something to suit their taste. From bright and expressive skins to stylish and minimalistic options, the new collection has something for everyone.</p><br/><p> But skins are not only a way to stand out among the crowd of players, they also bring additional features to the game. Some skins can provide special visual effects or improve the characteristics of weapons and items. So, by purchasing new skins, you not only add style, but also gain advantages in battles and construction.</p><br/><p> However, it is worth remembering that when choosing skins, it is important to find a balance between style and functionality. Aggressive and bright skins, although they look tempting, can attract unnecessary attention from opponents and create difficulties in surviving. Therefore, it is recommended to choose skins that will help you remain invisible and safe during gaming sessions.</p><br/><p> Finally, don’t forget about the importance of taking the new batch of skins into account when making decisions. Competitive games of Rust can be tough, and the originality of the skins can be your advantage. Aim to create unique combinations to show off your individuality and gain the respect of other players.</p><br/><p> Overall, the new collection of skins in the game Rust opens up a lot of opportunities for self-expression and improving your gaming experience. Choose skins that reflect your preferences and game strategy to stand out and have an advantage in battles with other survivors.</p>'),
(12994, 'en-US', 'Added spray paint to the Rust test branch'),
(12995, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Rust update, which adds spray paint for painting on various surfaces in the game world and the ability to customize items.'),
(12996, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, spray paint, test branch, in-game painting, customization'),
(12997, 'en-US', 'The recently added test branch of the Rust update has a new interesting tool - a spray can. Now players can freely paint on various surfaces in the game, be it huge monuments or other players\' bases. The spray can offers several different colors to choose from, as well as the ability to use pre-made illustrations from the inventory.'),
(12998, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam Game Update News'),
(12999, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam brings some interesting changes that will improve gameplay, safety, and team play.'),
(13000, 'en-US', 'news, update, game Rust, Steam, changes, convenience, realism, safety, help, technology, clothing, sound, location, patrol helicopter, gameplay'),
(13001, 'en-US', 'So, we have news from the fields.'),
(13002, 'en-US', 'A new batch of quality of life improvements has been released on the test branch'),
(13003, 'en-US', 'A new batch of improvements has appeared on the test branch of the game Rust, which significantly increases the comfort of the gameplay and the quality of life of players. Find out more about the new features and changes in the article.'),
(13004, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust updates, quality of life improvements, new Rust features, test branch, gameplay'),
(13005, 'en-US', 'A new batch of quality of life improvements has been released on the test branch:<br/><br/> • The tool cabinet has 4 new slots specifically for... tools - a cable, a hose, a construction plan and a mallet<br/> • The location of the patrol helicopter is now visible on the map<br/> • Added a defensive mode for the anti-aircraft gun - in this mode, the air defense will shoot exclusively at MLRS missiles and ignore any air transport<br/> • The location of players in your team on the map, if they are near you, is now updated in real time, without any delays<br/> • Now the player gets out of the vehicle only when holding down the corresponding key for 0.5 seconds, this will no longer happen instantly<br/> • Added the ability for server administrators to mute players without using third-party plugins<br/> • Added output slots for AA \"No ammo\", \"Low ammo\" and \"Target detected\", like for turrets<br/> • Injured teammates are now marked in the corner in orange<br/> • Now, if you hit a construction object with a mallet without all the necessary resources, a small hint will pop up in front of you with a list of missing materials<br/> • You can now study an item in the tech tree by simply holding down LMB on it for one second<br/> • The technology tree interface now displays the amount of scrap metal that the player currently has, as well as the amount of scrap metal needed to study the desired item in the branch (taking into account what needs to be studied before this)<br/> • Now when a player\'s clothes break, a characteristic sound will be played<br/> • Added the ability to sort players in contacts by the time of the last meeting<br/><br/> All these changes will be included in the update on February 3 at 22:00 Moscow time. The rest of the changes in the upcoming first full update of the game this year are still unknown.<br/> https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971899'),
(13006, 'en-US', 'Information about skin distribution on Twitch Drops in the game Rust on Steam'),
(13007, 'en-US', 'The next round of Twitch drops in Rust on Steam will let you earn unique skins by playing with famous streamers. The game has also seen updates, including improved snowmobiles and work on the arctic base.'),
(13008, 'en-US', 'Rust Game on Steam, Twitch Drops, Skins, Updates, Streamers, Arctic Base'),
(13009, 'en-US', 'On Twitter, Alistair says the next round of Twitch drops will begin in February with well-known Rust streamers like warriorisbetter, 0L6c6f6R0, and more. They promise to announce more details about the date and participants closer to the time.'),
(13010, 'en-US', 'Take part in the new round of drops in the game Rust and get unique rewards to improve your character. Join the gaming community and win special tasks to get exclusive items!'),
(13011, 'en-US', 'round drops, game Rust, unique rewards, character improvement, gaming community'),
(13012, 'en-US', 'Join the new round of drops and get unique rewards in the game Rust!<br/><br/> We are happy to announce the start of another round of drops in the game Rust. This is a great opportunity for you to get exclusive items that will help you improve your character and make it even more powerful!<br/><br/> To take part in the drops round, you need to follow a few simple steps. First, install the Rust game on your computer. Then, register in our gaming community and connect to the server where the drops round will take place. After that, you can start completing special tasks and receive rewards for your achievements.<br/><br/> Each round of drops offers new unique items that you can only get during that round. These can be weapons, protective gear, cosmetic items, and much more! Choose the items you like and improve your character in the game Rust.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance for unique rewards! Join the drops round in the game Rust and prove your strength and skill!'),
(13013, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins for Rust that will help you stand out from other players and express your individuality.'),
(13014, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Steam, skins, individuality, balance, collection'),
(13015, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, Rust fans! Today we have some great news for you - a new batch of skins has been added to the game! This long-awaited update will not only add freshness to the gameplay, but will also allow you to stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> What are skins and why are they so important to Rust players? Skins are visual modifications to items in the game. They can change the appearance of your weapons, clothing, buildings, and even vehicles. Each skin is unique and different from the others, allowing you to express your personality and style.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins we offer you today includes a variety of options for various items. From bright and colorful skins that add adrenaline to battles, to elegant and stylish ones that highlight your individuality - we have a choice for every player.</p><br/><p> One of the most important aspects of skins is their impact on game balance. We strive to create skins that not only look great, but also do not give players an advantage in combat. Therefore, all of our skins are carefully balanced to ensure that the gameplay remains fair for everyone.</p><br/><p> But that\'s not the only benefit of new skins. Whether you want to show your affiliation with a clan or community of players, express your creative side, or just want to stand out from the crowd, skins help you achieve this goal. Each new skin is an opportunity to transform your gaming experience and show off your uniqueness.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to expand your skin collection and make Rust even more exciting and colorful. Browse the new batch of skins in the Steam store and choose the ones that suit you! Light up the game world with your style and enjoy every second of the game.</p>'),
(13016, 'en-US', 'First look at Arctic bases and polar bears'),
(13017, 'en-US', 'First look at arctic bases and polar bears in Rust. Learn about the new update that will add these exciting elements to the game world. The developers are actively working on creating a realistic and unique gaming experience in an arctic atmosphere.'),
(13018, 'en-US', 'arctic bases, polar bears, update, game Rust, Steam'),
(13019, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of arctic bases and polar bears! In this article, we will tell you the first impressions of the new update of the game Rust on Steam, which will bring these exciting elements to the game world.</p><br/><p> Release dates are unknown at this time, but it looks like it\'s expected to be a major update to the winter biome. The developers are currently hard at work on implementing arctic bases and polar bears, as well as two variants of snowmobiles.</p><br/><p> Arctic bases will add a new level of complexity and challenge for players. You will be able to explore icy locations, build winter shelters and fight hostile polar bears. These powerful creatures will pose a serious threat, so you will have to be on guard and plan your actions carefully in this new harsh environment.</p><br/><p> In addition, players will have access to two types of snowmobiles, which will make it much easier to move around the icy expanses. They will become reliable companions in travels and help players achieve their goals faster.</p><br/><p> Overall, this update promises to be a real challenge and an exciting adventure for all Rust players. The developers are working on creating a realistic and unique gaming experience in an arctic atmosphere.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned and stay tuned for more details on the upcoming Arctic Bases and Polar Bears update in Rust!</p>'),
(13020, 'en-US', 'New twitch drops skins'),
(13021, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Rust skins you can get via twitch drops on the Twitch platform. Expand your skin collection and add new uniqueness and variety to your gaming experience.'),
(13022, 'en-US', 'skins, new, twitch drops, Rust, game, Steam, items, exclusive, weapons, clothing, building materials, balance, rarity'),
(13023, 'en-US', '<p>Are you interested in the new skins you can get through twitch drops on the Twitch platform?</p><br/><p> You can now expand your collection of Rust skins using new twitch drops available on the official website twitch.facepunch.com.</p><br/><p> What are twitch drops and how do they work? It is a system that allows you to earn various in-game items, skins, and other rare items by watching streams on Twitch. After watching a certain amount of time on certain channels, you will be rewarded with exclusive skins for your characters and items in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> To take advantage of this feature, you will need to link your Twitch account to your Steam account to access the drops. You will then be able to follow selected streamers and earn the rewards you deserve, as well as participate in various promotions and contests.</p><br/><p> The new twitch drops offer a huge variety of skins for various items in the game Rust. You can expect to get skins for weapons, clothing, building materials, and more. These skins will not only allow you to stand out from other players, but will also add new visuals to the game and options for customizing your gaming experience.</p><br/><p> However, it is worth noting that some skins may be rarer and more valuable than others. This creates a balance between availability and uniqueness of items, as rare skins can demonstrate your achievement or participation in special events. It is important to remember that obtaining such skins may require more time and effort, but they will become real trophies for you and a reflection of your unique gaming experience.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to enrich your Rust skin collection with new twitch drops on the Twitch platform. Participate in streams, follow your favorite streamers and get exclusive skins that will add novelty and uniqueness to your gaming experience.</p>'),
(13024, 'en-US', 'Find out about new skin giveaways at Twitch Drops in Rust from January 7th to January 15th. Update your collection for free by watching streams on Twitch.'),
(13025, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Skins, Giveaway, Steam, Streams, Game Items'),
(13026, 'en-US', '<p>Steam game Rust has announced upcoming skin giveaways via Twitch Drops from January 7th to January 15th.</p><br/><p> Twitch Drops are a promotion where viewers can earn in-game items for free by watching streams on the Twitch platform. To access these drops, players must link their Steam account to their Twitch account and watch streams listed in the official announcements.</p><br/><p> In this Twitch Drops skin distribution for the game Rust, you can expect unique skins for weapons, tools, clothing and other items that will be available to all participants of the promotion.</p><br/><p> Taking part in Twitch Skin Drops is a great opportunity to update your collection, purchase exclusive items, and get valuable in-game resources without spending a single cent.</p><br/><p> Each skin distribution on Twitch Drops has its own characteristics and conditions for receiving. Some drops are available only to certain streamers or at a certain time. Therefore, it is recommended to follow the official announcements and updates from the developers of the Rust game so as not to miss the opportunity to get the desired skins.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget that Twitch Drops aren\'t the only way to get skins and items in Rust. You can also purchase them from the Steam Community Market or the in-game store.</p><br/><p> Join Twitch Skin Drops and update your collection in Rust!</p>'),
(13027, 'en-US', 'Update and wipe of all servers today!'),
(13028, 'en-US', 'Today there will be an update and wipe of all servers in the game Rust. Find out about important details and changes in the article.'),
(13029, 'en-US', 'update and wipe, servers, changes, blueprints, official servers, Facepunch, Moscow time, Twitch Drops'),
(13030, 'en-US', '<p>Today, there will be an update and a wipe of all servers in the game Rust. But don\'t expect big changes, as the developers spent most of December on vacation with their families.</p><br/><p> The main change that players can expect is a wipe of all maps, although blueprints will remain unchanged. However, if you play on official non-Facepunch servers, keep an eye on their schedule, as they may wipe blueprints on their own schedule.</p><br/><p> The update and wipe will take place at 22:00 Moscow time. There is no information about new Twitch Drops rounds yet.</p>'),
(13031, 'en-US', 'New edits and updates after the New Year holidays in the game Rust on Steam'),
(13032, 'en-US', 'After the New Year holidays, the developers of the game Rust on Steam started working on new edits and updates. They made changes to the Happis map, improved the visualization of the snowmobile dashboard, improved the Tamahe snowmobile, are working on drawing the arctic base and updated the files in the aux02 branch. You can learn more about all this in our article.'),
(13033, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, updates, edits, innovations, Happis map, visualization, dashboard, snowmobile, Tamahe, cross-country ability, arctic base, ventilation routes, chimneys, ground crossings, MAC servers.'),
(13034, 'en-US', 'After the New Year holidays, the developers of the game Rust got to work with renewed vigor to introduce several changes and innovations. In this article, we will tell you about what they are currently working on.<br/><br/> One of the main tasks was to make changes to the Happis map. The developers continue to work on rivers and lakes to make the map even more realistic.<br/><br/> The visualization of the snowmobile dashboard has also been improved. Visualization of the steering wheel, as well as the speedometer and fuel gauge needles, has been added. Now players will be able to control their snowmobile more precisely.<br/><br/> The Tamaha snowmobile has been given more power, but its off-road capability on non-snowy and non-sandy surfaces has been reduced. The developers are trying to achieve the optimal balance between speed and off-road capability in the game.<br/><br/> Active work is being done on rendering the arctic base. They are focused on ventilation routes, building chimneys and ground crossings. The goal is to create a more realistic and atmospheric gaming environment.<br/><br/> In addition, the developers have decided to disable MAC server service. This will allow them to more effectively manage the gameplay and provide a better gaming experience.<br/><br/> Finally, the files in the aux02 branch of Rust on Steam have recently been updated. The developers continue to work on updates and improvements to offer players even more exciting and high-quality game content.'),
(13035, 'en-US', 'Did you get the freebie from Epic?'),
(13036, 'en-US', 'Find out how to claim free stuff from the Epic Games Store and get free games.'),
(13037, 'en-US', 'freebies, games, Epic Games Store, giveaways, free'),
(13038, 'en-US', '<p>One of the most popular gaming platforms, Epic Games Store, regularly pleases gamers with promotions and giveaways of free games. But among the many offers, not everyone has time to learn about these free opportunities and get free games.</p><br/><br/><p> In our new article, we will tell you about these promotions and how you can get free stuff from Epic Games. You will find out which games have already been given away, as well as what offers you can expect in the near future.</p><br/><br/><p> We\'ll reveal the secrets to getting free games from the Epic Games Store, explain the power of an Epic account, and share tips on how to make sure you don\'t miss out on the next freebie.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to save and upgrade your game collection with Epic Games Store promotions. Read our article and find out how to claim your freebies from Epic right now!</p>'),
(13039, 'en-US', 'Celebrating New Year 2022: Joy and Optimism in Animated Gifs'),
(13040, 'en-US', 'Celebrate New Year 2022 with a gorgeous animated gif that captures the joy and optimism of this special moment. Share online and make the holiday even brighter and more fun!'),
(13041, 'en-US', 'celebration, new year, 2022, animated gifs, joy, optimism, wishes'),
(13042, 'en-US', '<p>The arrival of a new year is always an exciting and joyful occasion for many people around the world. Year after year, we always strive to celebrate this moment in a special way, sending each other wishes of joy and happiness.</p><br/><p> In 2022, we welcome the new year with optimism and confidence in a better future. And animated gifs certainly add their share to this joy.</p><br/><p> Link to GIF: <a href=\"https://tenor.com/view/2022-happy-new-year-gif-24283704\">https://tenor.com/view/2022-happy-new-year-gif-24283704</a></p><br/><p> Animated gifs allow us to express our emotions and wishes in a more dynamic and exciting way. They have become a popular way to share the holiday spirit and have fun with your loved ones and friends.</p><br/><p> On this page you will find a gorgeous animated gif that captures the energy and joy of the New Year 2022 holiday. This gif can be used to create greeting cards, post on social media, send to friends and family to share your best wishes on this special occasion.</p><br/><p> Celebrating the new year is a time of hope, dreams and new beginnings. Let animated gifs become a symbol of our wish for the coming year to fill our lives with joy, happiness and prosperity.</p><br/><p> Let this gif be your symbol of welcoming the new year 2022, which will capture your feelings and help to convey to your loved ones all the warmth and emotions of this special moment. Share this gif with the people you love and create unforgettable moments of the holiday together.</p>'),
(13043, 'en-US', 'Happy New Year to everyone!'),
(13044, 'en-US', 'Happy New Year 2022! We wish you happiness, health and success in the new year!'),
(13045, 'en-US', 'congratulations, new year, 2022, happiness, success'),
(13046, 'en-US', 'Happy New Year 2022!<br/><br/> Our team sends our most sincere congratulations to all our readers! We wish you happiness, health and prosperity in the new year!<br/><br/> May every day of the coming year be filled with joy and luck. May your dreams come true and your plans be realized. We believe in you and your power to reach any heights! We wish you inspiration, creative growth and success in all your endeavors.<br/><br/> Let the new year become a new milestone in your life, full of bright events and impressions. And that every moment be filled with happiness and love. We sincerely wish you that all your dreams and wishes come true this year.<br/><br/> Let this year be the beginning of something new and wonderful! We are happy to share this holiday with each of you. We wish you a happy new year with all our hearts!'),
(13047, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins for the game Rust! Decorate your items in the game with unique and stylish wallpapers that will highlight your character and individuality. Purchase skins in the Steam store, participate in game events or exchange skins with other players. Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your skin collection and add new bright elements to your gaming life in the world of Rust!'),
(13048, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, new batch of skins, update, game store, game events, skin exchange, uniqueness, individuality'),
(13049, 'en-US', 'Dear Rust players! We have some great news for you - a new batch of skins has been added to the Rust game! Now you can decorate your items with unique and stylish looks that will highlight your character and individuality in the game.'),
(13050, 'en-US', 'New Year\'s pranks in the Discord channel'),
(13051, 'en-US', 'Take part in our New Year\'s giveaways in the Discord channel and get a chance to win 3 games on Steam!'),
(13052, 'en-US', 'giveaways, Discord channel, prizes, New Year, games on Steam'),
(13053, 'en-US', '<p>Happy New Year everyone! We are pleased to announce that we are launching a series of exciting giveaways in our Discord channel, which will take place on December 31, January 2 and 3.</p><br/><br/><p> We have great prizes for participants! The first drawing will take place on December 31 at 14:30 Moscow time, and the winner will be announced at 15:00.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to win 3 games on Steam! More information about the giveaway is available at the link: <a href=\"https://discord.gg/4JREewbz\">https://discord.gg/4JREewbz</a></p>'),
(13054, 'en-US', 'New Batch of Skins - Rust Update Info'),
(13055, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new batch of skins, allowing players to update the look of their items and express their individuality. Find out more about this update on the game\'s VKontakte page.'),
(13056, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, update in Rust, customization, style, game Rust'),
(13057, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has a new batch of skins! Players can now update their looks and add a fresh look to their items. This is a great opportunity for fans of customization and expressing their individuality.</p><br/><p> New skins provide players with a unique experience and the opportunity to stand out from other users. Choose the skins that suit you and make your items in the game Rust truly stylish and unique.</p><br/><p> Detailed information about the new batch of skins can be found on the official page of the Rust game on the VKontakte social network. Follow the link <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971593\">https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971593</a> to find out all the details about this update.</p>'),
(13058, 'en-US', 'Steam Winter Sale: Rust on Sale'),
(13059, 'en-US', 'Steam has launched a winter sale, where you can purchase the game Rust at a discount for only 981 rubles. Find out more about how to take advantage of the offer and go into the exciting world of Rust today!'),
(13060, 'en-US', 'Steam, Winter Sale, Rust, Discount'),
(13061, 'en-US', 'The long-awaited winter sale has started on Steam, which will last from December 22 to January 5. As part of this promotion, you can purchase the game Rust at a reduced price of only 981 rubles! This is a great opportunity for those who have not yet had time to get acquainted with this exciting game. Rust is an open-world survival game where you have to build fortifications, mine resources and fight other players. Hurry to take advantage of the offer and go to the exciting world of Rust today! You can find additional information about the sale and purchasing the game on the Rust community page on the VKontakte social network: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971593\">https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971593</a> .'),
(13062, 'en-US', 'Bzdenko collected over 100 on the stream'),
(13063, 'en-US', 'The famous streamer Bzdenko, having held a charity stream, collected over 100,000 rubles for gifts for children on the eve of the New Year. Participation in such events allows the Rust player community to show its generosity and support children in need.'),
(13064, 'en-US', 'Bzdenko, stream, charity, children, New Year, gifts, Rust'),
(13065, 'en-US', 'Bzdenko, a famous streamer, held a charity stream, raising over 100,000 rubles for gifts for children in need ahead of the New Year. All funds will be used to help children who need special attention and care. The stream can be viewed at the link: https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971593. Participation in such events allows the Rust community of players to show their generosity and help children who need a festive mood and support. This initiative by Bzdenko has received wide support and recognition in the community.'),
(13066, 'en-US', 'The list of daily loot in the game Rust until December 25th is revealed'),
(13067, 'en-US', 'Find out the list of daily loot that will be given out in the game Rust until December 25. Get ready for a variety of gifts and opportunities!'),
(13068, 'en-US', 'daily loot, loot list, game Rust, until December 25, challenges, gifts'),
(13069, 'en-US', '<p>There are always interesting and exciting events happening in the entertainment world of the game Rust. Today we are happy to share with you the list of daily loot that will be given out until December 25. Get ready for a variety of gifts and opportunities!</p><br/><br/><p> Gifts will be given out daily, starting today and until December 25. You will have to pass some challenges to gain access to the loot. So don\'t forget to join the Rust community and follow the game\'s official Instagram page for updates: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/rustcommunityru/?hl=ru\">https://www.instagram.com/rustcommunityru/?hl=ru</a></p><br/><br/><p> The daily loot list promises to be quite varied and interesting. You definitely won\'t get bored! This is a great opportunity to get new items for your character and create a unique gameplay experience.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to get daily loot and immerse yourself in the atmosphere of incredible adventures in the game Rust! Fasten your seat belts and get ready for new challenges and rewards!</p>'),
(13070, 'en-US', 'Christmas update in Rust - new items and features'),
(13071, 'en-US', 'The Christmas update in Rust is now available for players! Find out about the new items and features that have been added to the game. Dive into the Christmas spirit with Rust!'),
(13072, 'en-US', 'Christmas update, Rust game, new items, snowman helmet, custom fireworks, Christmas event'),
(13073, 'en-US', 'The Christmas update in the game Rust is already available for players! This time, the developers did not leave us indifferent and added many interesting items and features. For starters, neon signs, a snow generator, Santa\'s beard and a wire garland have temporarily returned to sale. Now you can add a Christmas atmosphere to your base and create a unique design with these items.<br/><br/> However, the updates don’t end there. A snowman helmet has been added to the game, which will be a great addition to your equipment. Customizable fireworks have also appeared. Now you can create your own image that will appear when the fireworks explode. This gives you the opportunity to express your creativity and make the holiday fireworks truly memorable.<br/><br/> It is important to note that the Snowman Helmet and Customizable Fireworks are available in the permanent item shop and will not disappear after the Christmas event ends. The helmet only costs 580 rubles, making it affordable for most players.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to dive into the Christmas atmosphere with the game Rust. Hurry up and buy new items to make your base unique and festive. Merry Christmas!<br/><br/> Source: <a href=\"https://rust.facepunch.com/news/christmas-2021\">https://rust.facepunch.com/news/christmas-2021</a>'),
(13074, 'en-US', 'Rust Christmas Update: New Fireworks, Christmas Gifts, and More'),
(13075, 'en-US', 'Find out about all the new changes and events in the Christmas update in Rust: Santa, gifts, fireworks and much more!'),
(13076, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Christmas update, Santa, fireworks, advent calendar, Christmas gifts'),
(13077, 'en-US', '<p>Today at 22:00 Moscow time we are waiting for the Christmas update in the game Rust, which will bring many interesting changes and events. You will find a visual holiday with Santa, gifts, new fireworks and a unique opportunity to draw pictures in the sky!</p><br/><p> One of the main innovations is the advent calendar from the developers. Now every day until December 25, players will be able to receive Christmas gifts directly in the game. Don\'t miss the opportunity to get unique items and surprises that this holiday promotion will give you!</p><br/><p> An important change has also affected Santa himself. Now he doesn\'t fly crookedly, his sleigh glows brighter, and there is also a rumor that Santa no longer goes into the chimney... What does this mean? Get ready to meet the character occupying your base again!</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow the game\'s official channels to stay up to date with all updates and events. You will find details and the schedule of the Christmas update in the game\'s official group: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971473\">https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971473</a></p>'),
(13078, 'en-US', 'Thomas Butters is actively improving the snowmobile model in the game Rust'),
(13079, 'en-US', 'The latest Rust update brings significant changes to the snowmobile model and textures, as well as fixes to the rear suspension and tracks. Thomas Butters is hard at work on refining the snowmobile, adding new features and improving its appearance. The update also includes new phrases, Christmas preparations, bug fixes, and new functionality.'),
(13080, 'en-US', 'Thomas Butters, Snowmobile, Models, Textures, Rework, Fix, Tracks, Rear Suspension, Lights, Treads, Tomaha, Damage, Magnetic Crane, New Phrases, Christmas, Bug Fixes, Auto Run, Sharpness, Tool Cabinet, Polish, Update, Rust'),
(13081, 'en-US', '✅Thomas Butters is actively engaged in fixing and refining the snowmobile model! The snowmobile model and textures have been updated, the rear suspension and tracks have been fixed, the ski element \"boot\" has been fixed, and the front and rear lights have been refinished.<br/> ✅Different snowmobiles will have different track protectors.<br/> ✅One of the snowmobiles will be called Tomaha (probably a reference to Yamaha).<br/> ✅If damaged, the snowmobile will move slower and be harder to control.<br/> ✅A magnetic crane can lift snowmobiles!<br/> ✅New phrases added!<br/> ✅Preparations for Christmas are actively underway, minor flaws, spelling errors, display of New Year\'s items, etc. are being corrected.<br/> ✅Now you can\'t study items a second time! (A little lifehack from us: \"If you want to sell recipes, you first need to make them, and then study them yourself. Use them!\")<br/> ✅Reconfigured the autorun option, which will also work with vehicles (disabled by default in the settings). Now, after enabling the autorun option, running will only stop if the forward or backward button is pressed.<br/> ✅Reconfigured sharpness to create beautiful screenshots.<br/> ✅The tool cabinet now has 4 separate slots for construction tools (mallet, building plan, electrical cable and hose routing tool).<br/> ✅Now, to exit the vehicle, you need to hold the button for half a second. In this way, the developers eliminate the possibility of accidentally flying out of the vehicle.<br/> ✅Added Polish language for the interface.<br/> https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971473'),
(13082, 'en-US', 'Updating the Resource Cabinet in Rust'),
(13083, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust adds 4 extra slots to the resource cabinet, allowing players to conveniently store a building plan, mallet, wire, and hose.'),
(13084, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, resource cabinet, slots, building plan, mallet, wire, hose'),
(13085, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest update to the Rust game, the developers have added an additional 4 slots to the resource cabinet. Now players will be able to store a building plan, a mallet, a wire, and a hose in this convenient inventory.</p><br/><br/><p> This is a significant improvement that will greatly increase the convenience of the game. Previously, these items took up precious space in the inventory, but now you can safely store them in special slots in the cabinet.</p><br/><br/><p> Players will now have an easier time planning their building projects, as the building plan will always be easily accessible and will not interfere with other items in the inventory.</p><br/><br/><p> And adding slots for a mallet, wire, and hose will make it easier to work with electricity and liquids. Now players will be able to conveniently store these items and use them when needed without having to go through their inventory.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget to update the game and enjoy new features and improvements. All this makes the game Rust even more exciting and convenient for players.</p><br/><br/><p> Source: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971473\">https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971473</a></p>'),
(13086, 'en-US', 'The game Rust turns 8 today!'),
(13087, 'en-US', 'Today, Rust celebrates its 8th anniversary! Find out about the game\'s development, new updates, and the importance of the gaming community.'),
(13088, 'en-US', 'game Rust, 8 years, updates, developers, gaming community'),
(13089, 'en-US', '<p>Today is a special day for all fans of the game Rust - it celebrates its 8th anniversary! During this time, Rust has become one of the most popular games on Steam, winning the attention of millions of players around the world.</p><p> Over the years, Rust has continued to evolve and improve, offering players new features and fixing bugs. The developers regularly release updates that add new features, content, and improve the gameplay.</p><p> The development team tries to find a balance between adding new features and maintaining the stability of the game. They take into account the wishes and feedback of players to create the most enjoyable and interesting gaming space.</p><p> But Rust is not just a game, it is a real community. Players exchange experiences and ideas, create unique buildings and interact with each other in the virtual world. This is one of those games where you can make your fantasy come true and live unforgettable adventures.</p><p> So, congratulations to the game Rust on its 8th anniversary! We thank the developers for their work, efforts and dedication to the project. We wish the game further prosperity, new achievements and many new emotions for all its players!</p><br/> <b>Link to publication in VK:</b><p> https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971473</p>'),
(13090, 'en-US', 'The new batch of skins in Rust introduces a set of unique changes to the appearance of weapons, items and clothing. Update your gaming wardrobe and add a breath of fresh air to your gaming experience with these stylish and memorable skins.'),
(13091, 'en-US', 'skins, new skins, Rust, Steam, skin release, update, appearance, gaming experience'),
(13092, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of innovation and exclusive features in the game Rust! We present to your attention a new batch of skins that will allow you to enjoy complete freedom of creativity and a unique visual experience.</p><br/><br/><p> Skins are an integral part of the gameplay in Rust. They are changes to the appearance of weapons, items and clothing, making them more stylish, colorful and memorable. Each new batch of skins brings with it an unrivaled set of designs that add atmosphere and originality to the game world.</p><br/><br/><p> Thanks to the new skins, you will be able to stand out from other players, show your individuality and skill level. Created by a team of professional designers, every detail of the skin is carefully designed to give you maximum aesthetic pleasure and immerse you in the atmosphere of survival in a post-apocalyptic world.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins offers a wide range of appearance variations to suit any playstyle and preferences of each player. From bright red machine guns and stylish knives to masks, helmets and clothes of various factions - here you will find everything you need to create a unique image and stand out from your rivals.</p><br/><br/><p> Purchasing new skins is not only an opportunity to get exclusive items, but also to support the game developers. The proceeds from the sale of skins go to the development of the game project, the creation of new content updates and ensuring its long-term successful operation.</p><br/><br/><p> So don’t miss the chance to update your gaming wardrobe and add a breath of fresh air to your gaming experience. Dive into the exciting world of Rust with a new batch of skins and seal your place in survival history!</p>'),
(13093, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: News and New Features'),
(13094, 'en-US', 'Find out about all the latest news and new features coming to Rust, including the introduction of the Anti-Missile Launcher, a new mode, improvements to dismantling and repairing items, and improvements to water and underwater player behavior.'),
(13095, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, update, game news, anti-missile launcher, new mode, repair, interface, water, effects, game items'),
(13096, 'en-US', 'So, we have news from the fields.<br/> Something interesting has come up!<br/><br/> Finally got to the SAM (anti-aircraft missile system) anti-missile system.<br/> The SAM will have a new \"Defender\" mode, in which the system will stop firing at vehicles (copters, helicopters) and will concentrate on repelling fire at MLRS.<br/> SAM will finally have electrical outputs like a turret: 1. Enemy signaling device 2. Low ammo 3. No ammo<br/><br/> ✅Now all vehicles after destruction drop resources from the storage and you do not lose them at all! It is worth noting that modules and fuel will not be dropped by vehicles, they are destroyed along with the car<br/><br/> ♻To remove removable items, you will now need to hold the button for 0.5 seconds<br/><br/> ⚒When repairing objects, a tooltip interface will pop up indicating what resources will be needed to repair this type of object!<br/><br/> ⚙UIScale components have switched to client mode. Now the scale of the player\'s interface is adjusted to the player\'s screen according to the parameters set by the user, not the server. It is not entirely clear what this will affect, but the developers believe that it will be better this way<br/><br/> Work is underway on water, wave splash effects, and there is also talk about water resistance. Most likely, this will affect the behavior of players underwater.<br/> And... It\'s not certain yet, but most likely all objects will float on the surface of the water and will not sink (but this will need to be checked)'),
(13097, 'en-US', 'Update: Injured teammates will now be displayed in orange in the team interface'),
(13098, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust now shows injured teammates in orange in the team interface. Find out how this improvement will help you in combat situations and increase your team\'s effectiveness.'),
(13099, 'en-US', 'update, injured teammates, team interface, orange color, Rust game'),
(13100, 'en-US', 'Hello, friends! Great news for all Rust players! The latest game update brought significant changes to the team interface, and one of the most notable innovations is the ability to display injured teammates in orange.'),
(13101, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skins coming to Rust on Steam. Change the look of your character and items with new skins!'),
(13102, 'en-US', 'skins, game Rust, Steam, new batch, appearance, character, items'),
(13103, 'en-US', 'In this post, we want to share with you the latest batch of skins that have appeared in the game Rust on Steam. If you are passionate about the game and like to change the appearance of your character and items, then these fresh skins will be of interest to you!'),
(13104, 'en-US', 'New update in the game Rust: changes in balance and other innovations'),
(13105, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new update in Rust: changes to weapon balance, excavator, code lock blocking and other innovations. Also, celebration of the eighth anniversary of Rust and important information for players on Facepunch servers.'),
(13106, 'en-US', 'Rust update, balancing, changes, compound bow, combination locks, excavator, maps, blueprints, MLRS, Russian language, electrical components, phantom movements, cheaters, Rust anniversary, night vision, Facepunch');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(13107, 'en-US', 'New update comes out today at 22:00 Moscow time!<br/><br/> This is a very small update, as is the tradition with most December patches - balance changes (compound bow and combination locks), buff to loot received from the excavator, and more.<br/><br/> This update will reset not only all maps, but also blueprints on all servers without exception!<br/><br/> • The output of resources from the excavator has been increased by 2.5 times. Now from one diesel barrel you will receive 100 MBC, 2000 sulfur, 5000 iron and 10000 stone. The monument itself is now slightly smaller in size, but there are more scientists surrounding it.<br/> • The MLRS has received a couple of minor tweaks. They are quite minor - the range has been slightly extended, and the missile spread has been slightly increased. Also, font tweaks have been made, so that it should now display correctly in Russian and most others that do not work exclusively in Latin.<br/> • Compound Bow Tweaks - This weapon is no longer a standard blueprint, and the amount of metal required to craft it has been increased from 25 to 75. You can find it in regular crates, but it can be unlocked in the tech tree if desired.<br/> • All electrical components have been moved to a separate branch in the Tier 1 Workbench tech tree. This should make it easier to research and obtain some components that may have previously been difficult to obtain.<br/> • First Person Tracking - Now admins can start tracking players in a full third person view via a separate panel in the F1 console. Now all player movements should be displayed as in a regular game, which should make it easier to monitor their behavior.<br/> • Code Lock - Now after 8 failed attempts you will be blocked from entering your password again for 15 minutes. Alistair stated that this change was made because cheaters quickly set up bot accounts that can guess passwords in large numbers without human intervention and with impunity. This change should stop them.<br/> • Rust turns eight years old on December 11th – to celebrate, you’ll see a themed cake instead of a stone when you respawn. There will also be festive balloons on crates.<br/> • Minor tweaks: Most interface icons are no longer blurry at low graphics settings. This should fix incorrect display of items in the in-game permanent store. Also, the night vision device has once again received display adjustments and should provide a more comfortable and legible picture - however, work on it is still ongoing and in some weather conditions it is still difficult to look through them.<br/> Information for everyone who plays on Facepunch servers: ALL Facepunch servers will go offline before the maintenance wipe - at 19:00 Moscow time. After that, they will return to working mode only after the release of the update and a full wipe.<br/> The update will be released at 22:00 Moscow time - server owners will receive the server update a little earlier, approximately 5-10 minutes before the client release.'),
(13108, 'en-US', 'Locks blocking with incorrect password in the game Rust'),
(13109, 'en-US', 'Rust has introduced a temporary lock block on the use of locks if the password is incorrect, to prevent constant password guessing.'),
(13110, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, lock, password, blocking'),
(13111, 'en-US', '<p>Players in Rust will now be temporarily banned from using locks if they fail to enter the correct password more than eight times. The ban period is 15 minutes.</p><br/><p> This change was introduced to prevent a recent issue where the system would continually try possible passwords until the correct one was found.</p>'),
(13112, 'en-US', 'Compound Bow now requires research'),
(13113, 'en-US', 'In the latest update to Rust on Steam, the compound bow now requires training, adding a new layer of complexity and strategy to the gameplay. Learn about this change and how it affects the gameplay experience in the article.'),
(13114, 'en-US', 'Compound Bow, Rust, Steam, Update, Study, Changes, Balancing, Game Experience, Strategy, Tactics'),
(13115, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest update to the game Rust on Steam, the developers have made significant changes to the mechanics of using the compound bow. Now, in order to use this weapon tool, players need to learn it, which adds a new level of complexity to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> The compound bow is one of the most effective weapons for hunting and defense in Rust. Its special feature is the ability to fire arrows that cause significant damage to the enemy. However, with the new changes, players will no longer be able to use this powerful tool immediately after it appears in the inventory.</p><br/><p> Instead, players will now need to research the Compound Bow to unlock its full potential. Researching the Compound Bow requires certain resources and time, which creates an additional obstacle for players, but at the same time increases the value and importance of this weapon in the game world of Rust.</p><br/><p> This change to the mechanics of using the compound bow is based on the developers\' desire to create a deeper and more balanced game environment. Learning weapons allows players to diversify their gameplay experience and interaction with weapons, as well as better understand their features and application in different situations.</p><br/><p> This change therefore introduces a new element of strategy and tactics into Rust. Players will now be forced to plan their actions more carefully and decide whether it is worth their time to learn the compound bow or if they would rather focus on other aspects of the game.</p><br/><p> The Steam update that brought changes to the use of the compound bow highlights the importance of balancing game mechanics and creating a fun experience for all players. Players can now experience new challenges and opportunities with this update.</p>'),
(13116, 'en-US', 'Updates from the Fields'),
(13117, 'en-US', 'The latest news about updates in the game Rust: global AI update, snowmobile and arctic base, excavator improvements, global recipe wipe, charity, new masterpiece Hapis and other changes in the gameplay.'),
(13118, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, game, news, NPC, AI, snowmobile, arctic base, excavator, global wipe, charity, Hapis, underwater mask, item shop, spectator mode, modular cars, snowmobile with passenger, shoreline correction, fish, MP5, UI, missions, workbenches, watchtower'),
(13119, 'en-US', 'Updates from the field:<br/> ⭐A global AI update is planned for the December update. NPCs and animals will behave a little more intelligently))<br/> ⭐Work is actively underway on a snowmobile and an Arctic base. According to some reports, the snowmobile will be a calling card of Arctic bases, like the MLRS in a military base in the desert.<br/> ⭐As previously written, the coefficient of obtaining resources on a large excavator has been increased. The RT itself with a large excavator is also being corrected.<br/> ⭐After 2 years, Facepunch plans to clear the list of all recipes (global wipe) on all official servers. Everyone will have a completely clean game.<br/> Rustafied team raised $190,000 for the \"Preemptive Love\" charity program! Well done!<br/> ⭐Hapis is still being edited, you have not been forgotten. They want to create another masterpiece.<br/><br/> ⚡Now for minor edits:<br/> The underwater mask no longer hides any effects, all weather conditions, fog, etc. will be visible through it.<br/> ✅Improved the clarity and sharpness of the in-game item store for players with low resolution and low quality settings.<br/> ‍When tracking a player in first person (admin mode), if the character is sleeping or dead, the observer will be shown a \"death screen\"<br/> All modular vehicles will no longer need to be refueled.<br/> The snowmobile will be able to carry one passenger.<br/> The snowmobile\'s base will be increased a little, since with a small base it shook a little while moving.<br/> Minor corrections to the coastline. More correct display of water<br/> Fish will become more expensive to sell for scrap metal.<br/> MP5 drop chance from scientists reduced<br/> ⚙Character interaction elements will be hidden when using the main menu navigation.<br/> ⚙Fixed mission UI turning on when first opened and requiring double click to close<br/> Metal fragments are no longer required to make work tables<br/> ⚒The Watchtower was made cheaper and its \"health\" was reduced'),
(13120, 'en-US', 'New item models'),
(13121, 'en-US', 'Find out the expected changes in the appearance and functionality of items in the game Rust. Diversity and an exciting game world await you!'),
(13122, 'en-US', 'new item models, item appearance changes, Rust gameplay, game economy, player interaction, balance between realism and gameplay utility, interesting items'),
(13123, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the new item models expected in the near future in the game Rust. We will find out what changes will occur in the appearance of various items and how they will affect the gameplay. Will new models of weapons, tools, clothes, buildings and other items be added? We will also consider how these changes can affect the game economy and interaction between players. It is important to note that the developers are trying to find a balance between realism and gameplay usefulness of each item model. Expect new interesting items that will make the game world of Rust even more diverse and exciting!'),
(13124, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates: Developer Commentary on Anti-Cheater Measures'),
(13125, 'en-US', 'One of the developers of the game Rust comments on the introduction of new measures to combat cheaters: random recoil, phone binding and other changes. Find out more on our website.'),
(13126, 'en-US', 'Rust game updates, developers, network component, random return, phone binding, counteraction to cheaters, updates, community, security measures, anti-cheat system'),
(13127, 'en-US', '<p>In a recent update to Rust, one of the developers responsible for the network component spoke out about new measures taken to combat cheaters. These changes have long been at the center of community discussions.</p><br/><p> One of the key measures that have been introduced is random recoil. Instead of a static recoil pattern, players will now have to cope with a more unpredictable weapon. This will make it much more difficult for cheaters who previously could confidently use assistance programs to shoot accurately.</p><br/><p> Another important measure is the mandatory linking of a phone to an account. Now each player must confirm their identity using a mobile number. This is an additional step that will help the game creators fight cheaters more effectively, since they will not be able to create new accounts with impunity after blocking.</p><br/><p> The updates also touched on other aspects of the game that the community had long suggested improving. For example, the cheater reporting system was improved, allowing players to notify the developers about suspicious behavior of other players.</p><br/><p> In a comment, the developer noted that these changes come with tradeoffs related to game balance and ease of use, but they believe that the anti-cheat benefits are worth the tradeoffs. They also promised that they will continue to work on improving the anti-cheat system and listen closely to community feedback.</p><br/><p> For more detailed information about new updates to the Rust game, you can visit <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-2019269971308\">the game community on VKontakte</a> .</p>'),
(13128, 'en-US', 'New Batch of Skins in Rust: Fresh Updates for Your Playstyle'),
(13129, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins in Rust: how they will affect your playstyle, the impact on the economy and balance, as well as developer support and unique opportunities to update your in-game image.'),
(13130, 'en-US', 'new skin batch, Rust, updates, playstyle, personality, skin selection, tradeoffs, game economy, balance, influence, developers, funding, visuals'),
(13131, 'en-US', 'Hello, dear Rust players! We have great news for you: a fresh batch of skins has appeared in the game! This means that you can once again update your in-game image, adding a bit of exclusivity and individuality. Be on trend and show other players your uniqueness with new Rust skins!'),
(13132, 'en-US', 'New Rust Skins: Nomad, Industrial Door, Sofa and Lamps'),
(13133, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest updates in the game Rust: new skins, including the skin of the nomad, industrial door, sofa and lamps. Join our VK community and stay up to date with all the news and updates in the game.'),
(13134, 'en-US', 'new rust skins, nomad skin, industrial door, sofa, lamps, rust updates'),
(13135, 'en-US', '<p>Today we are happy to inform you about the latest updates in the game Rust! New skins are already available on the test branch, such as the nomad skin, industrial door, sofa and lamps.</p><br/><br/><p> These new items will likely be among the first batch of official developer items that will be available for purchase in the permanent item shop, which opens tomorrow, November 18th, at 10:00 PM PDT.</p><br/><br/><p> Here are some details about the new items and their features:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> <b>Nomad Skin:</b> This is a stylish anti-radiation suit with a new design. It will add exoticism to your character and help him stand out from other players.</li><br/><br/><li> <b>Industrial Door:</b> This iron door skin has a lot in common with the one that was available through Twitch Drops. The new design will add some style to your home and highlight your personality.</li><br/><br/><li> <b>Industrial Lamps:</b> New unique lamps will be added to the game, which are available in white, green and red colors. These items are not skins, but will add variety to the lighting of your home or settlement.</li><br/><br/><li> <b>Sofa:</b> The new sofa skin has a unique texture that is different from the skin given out in Twitch Drops. It will give your interior a fresh look and a cozy atmosphere.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> Unfortunately, the prices for these items are currently unknown. However, with only one day left until the official update, we will be able to learn more details soon.</p><br/><br/><p> If you want to stay up to date with the latest news and updates about the Rust game, don\'t forget to follow our community on VK ( <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a> ).</p><br/><br/><p> Stay connected and enjoy playing Rust!</p>'),
(13136, 'en-US', 'Facepunch Announces New Update With Permanent Item Shop'),
(13137, 'en-US', 'Facepunch has announced a new update that includes a permanent item shop where special developer skins will be available.'),
(13138, 'en-US', 'Facepunch, update, permanent item shop, skins, content'),
(13139, 'en-US', '<p>Facepunch has announced a new update scheduled for November 18 at 22:00 Moscow time. The most interesting innovation of this update will be the appearance of a \"permanent item shop\".</p><br/><p> Players will now be able to purchase skins and other items that will always be available in the store. Previously, many themed items were only sold during seasonal events such as Halloween, Easter or Christmas.</p><br/><p> The permanent item shop will feature special skins created by Facepunch themselves. However, this will not affect the existing weekly skins created by the community, which will continue to be released separately.</p><br/><p> At this point, no details have been released about which skins will be available in the store. However, the first skin that will be available for purchase with the update has been shown.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that this update will not reset any items that players already have. However, server owners will have to update their servers to support the new version of the game.</p>'),
(13140, 'en-US', 'New Monument in Development - Arctic Bases'),
(13141, 'en-US', 'News about adding a new monument to the game Rust - arctic bases. The monument will be procedurally generated and will appear in the winter biome. Development is also underway on introducing snowmobiles to the game.'),
(13142, 'en-US', 'new monument, arctic bases, Rust game, Steam, procedurally generated monument, winter biome, snowmobiles, development'),
(13143, 'en-US', '<p>Rust is set to add a new monument on Steam - Arctic Bases. This new procedurally generated monument will likely only appear in the winter biome. There are currently no details about the monument itself, as development has just begun.</p><br/><p> At the same time, the development team is also working on introducing snowmobiles into the game. However, it is worth noting that the likelihood of their appearance in December is extremely low, since the next patch will be small in volume, as officially reported by Alistair.</p><br/><p> You can find more information on this topic <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-2019269971282\">here</a> .</p>'),
(13144, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust!'),
(13145, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has appeared in the game Rust! Update the appearance of your game character and his inventory with the help of unique styles and colors available in the new collection of skins. Purchase and stand out from other players, express your uniqueness and style in the virtual world of the game Rust!'),
(13146, 'en-US', 'game Rust, skins, new batch, uniqueness, style, game character, appearance, weapons, armor, tools, interest, variety, gameplay, steam store, game currency, chests, uniqueness, fans, self-expression'),
(13147, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins has appeared in the game Rust! Now players can purchase unique appearances for their items and weapons. The originality and diversity of this batch of skins will allow each player to find something to their taste.'),
(13148, 'en-US', 'Updated first-person player view available on Aux branch'),
(13149, 'en-US', 'An update to the Aux branch allows admins to get more accurate information about player actions in first-person mode.'),
(13150, 'en-US', 'Update, First Person View, Aux Branch, Rust Game'),
(13151, 'en-US', '<p>There\'s a major change coming to the world of Rust, coming in the Aux branch update! Admins will now be able to access an updated first-person view of players.</p><br/><p> For years, admins have been dealing with limitations related to first-person viewing of gameplay. Previously, there was no way to see where a player was shooting or what they were seeing in first-person mode with the tracking tools available. However, with the new update coming to the Aux branch, this issue will be resolved.</p><br/><p> The developers promise that the new update will significantly improve the viewing quality for administrators. Now they will be able to see the game in the same way as regular players, without using special commands. Although the information will still not be 100% accurate, it will be much more useful compared to previous options.</p><br/><p> The update will be available on December 2 at 22:00 Moscow time. So get ready to try out the new first-person view of players and enjoy an improved Rust experience!</p>'),
(13152, 'en-US', 'Unique update in Rust: water transport will allow players to connect different servers'),
(13153, 'en-US', 'In the near future, Rust players will have access to water transport, allowing them to connect different servers and sail from one island to another.'),
(13154, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Rust update, water transport in Rust, linked servers, server hub system'),
(13155, 'en-US', '<p>Very soon, a unique update will appear in the game Rust: water transport will be able to connect to servers outside the current map!</p><br/><p> This new feature is part of the long-awaited concept, where all servers will be interconnected. Now players will be able to sail from one island to another, using water transport and other equipment.</p><br/><p> Unfortunately, there is no exact release date for this update yet. However, a recent commit confirms our assumptions about the presence of a server hub system in the game, which will be directly integrated into the in-game process.</p>'),
(13156, 'en-US', 'Winners of the Halloween Event from the developers'),
(13157, 'en-US', 'Find out who won the Halloween event from the developers of the game Rust and check out their impressive builds. Join the game group on the social network VKontakte to view the winners\' works and get ready for new adventures in the world of Rust!'),
(13158, 'en-US', 'Halloween event, winners, developers, RustManiac, Ghostbusters, SpookyQueen, buildings, game Rust, VK'),
(13159, 'en-US', 'The Halloween event held by the developers of the game Rust ended with great success and a lot of exciting activities. All participants of the event showed a high level of creativity and skill, but only some were able to conquer all the tests and earn the title of winners.<br/><br/> So, we present to you the winners of the Halloween event from the developers:<br/><br/> 1. The first place went to a player nicknamed RustManiac. His construction of a ghost castle turned out to be not only a magnificent technical masterpiece, but also a real work of art.<br/> 2. Second place went to a team called Ghostbusters, who created an amazingly mystical composition of various ghostly figures and a huge spider.<br/> 3. In third place was a player nicknamed SpookyQueen, who presented a unique and mysterious abandoned gloomy church.<br/><br/> Congratulations to all the winners! Their work can be viewed in the game group on the official page in the social network VKontakte.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the next events and get ready for new exciting adventures in the world of Rust!'),
(13160, 'en-US', 'Information about Twitch Drop in Rust on Steam'),
(13161, 'en-US', 'Find out about a special charity Twitch drop in Rust on Steam, available from November 20th to 21st. Get unique in-game items and support charities.'),
(13162, 'en-US', 'Twitch drop, Rust, Steam, charity, game items'),
(13163, 'en-US', '<p>Attention, Rust players! You won’t want to miss a special Twitch drop event happening November 20th-21st! What’s more, this drop will be for charity, making it even more appealing.</p><br/><p> Want to know more? Here are the links:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-2019269971173\" target=\"_blank\">Link to VK page</a></li><br/><li> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QwYz8pwGs0M\" target=\"_blank\">Link to YouTube video</a></li><br/></ul><br/><p> Participating in Twitch drops will not only allow you to get unique items in the game, but also support charities. Don\'t miss this opportunity to help those in need!</p>'),
(13164, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins for Rust! Add unique style and functionality to your survival experience in this brutal game on Steam.'),
(13165, 'en-US', 'Rust, skins, skins batch, Steam, survival, design, weapons, clothing, aesthetics, gameplay, equality, style'),
(13166, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, dear Rust players!</p><br/><br/><p> We are happy to inform you about the new items that are waiting for you in the game! A recent batch of skins for your favorite survival in the cruel world of Rust was released on Steam. Each new skin is a unique design and adds aesthetic value to your tools, weapons and clothes. They will not only allow you to look stylish and original, but will also allow you to distinguish yourself on the battlefield.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes a variety of themes, from futuristic to post-apocalyptic, to suit your personal style. Whether you prefer flashy, vibrant colors or a more understated look, we have something for everyone.</p><br/><br/><p> Additionally, many new skins have additional features and effects that can increase your effectiveness in survival. Some items can increase the speed of your messenger, others will improve the accuracy of your weapons, and others will help you manage resources more efficiently. The possibilities are endless!</p><br/><br/><p> However, beyond all this beauty and functionality, we also understand that it is important to maintain balance in the game. All new skins are thoroughly tested to ensure that they do not disrupt gameplay or give any players an unfair advantage. We always strive for a fair and equal game for everyone.</p><br/><br/><p> However, it is important to remember that purchasing new skins is purely voluntary and does not affect gameplay. You can enjoy playing Rust as is without purchasing new skins and still enjoy the ruthless fight for survival.</p><br/><br/><p> Now that you\'ve seen the new batch of skins in Rust, all that\'s left to do is pick your favorites and add some style to your gameplay. It\'s time to head out into the dangerous lands and become a recognizable figure in the world of Rust!</p><br/><br/><p> Have a good game and may your adventures be successful!</p>'),
(13167, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Abandoned Military Bases and MLRS'),
(13168, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new update to the game Rust, which includes abandoned military bases and MLRS for shelling any points on the map. Details are available at the link.'),
(13169, 'en-US', 'Game Rust, update, abandoned military bases, MLRS, missiles, guidance module, shelling, wipe'),
(13170, 'en-US', '<p>Rasta players rejoice! A new update is coming to you, adding abandoned military bases and MLRS (Multiple Launch Rocket System) to the game for an even more immersive gaming experience!</p><br/><p> Now you can load missiles, select a targeting module and fire at any point on the map. Abandoned military bases will provide you with a place to operate, and the MLRS will provide you with the power and firepower to cope with any challenge.</p><br/><p> This update opens up new possibilities for planning strategies and interacting with other players. Your team will be able to jointly attack enemies or defend your base with the help of unreachable rocket systems.</p><br/><p> However, be prepared for the challenges that come with these powerful weapons. Bases and MLRS are valuable resources that will attract the attention of other players. Maintain your defensive fortifications and keep an eye on your enemies to protect your territorial control.</p><br/><p> We are also happy to announce that all maps have been reset, meaning a full wipe awaits you. You will have the opportunity to start from scratch, fully utilize the new upgrade options, and compete for map dominance once again. Happy Wiping!</p><br/><p> More detailed information about this update can be found on the game\'s official website <a href=\"https://rust.facepunch.com/news/mlrs-and-desert-base-update\">here</a> .</p>'),
(13171, 'en-US', 'The Halloween time in Rust is coming to an end, the event is coming to an end and an update awaits us in the evening!'),
(13172, 'en-US', 'The Halloween fun is coming to an end in Rust. Find out about new updates including a snowmobile, collider, and model rework. Stay up to date with patch timing changes.'),
(13173, 'en-US', 'Halloween, Rust, update, contest, pumpkin, snowmobile, collider, first aid kit, sounds, car, homemade gun, update time'),
(13174, 'en-US', 'The Halloween time in Rust is coming to an end, the event is coming to an end and an update awaits us in the evening!<br/><br/> Don\'t forget that the contest for the best pumpkin continues until November 7, so don\'t miss out on participating!<br/><br/> ❄ Among the important innovations, the developers started talking about the snowmobile. Now you can move around the snowy areas of the world of Rust faster and more efficiently!<br/><br/> A collider has also been added that blocks the ability to repair vehicles when loading and firing rockets at the MLRS. This will significantly improve the balance and gameplay of the game.<br/><br/> The developers also reworked the model of the large first aid kit to make it look more realistic and fit the atmosphere of the game.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget about the new sounds for the MLRS machine that the developers have added. Now your combat actions will be accompanied by an even greater audio effect.<br/><br/> A new model of compact knuckle-duster-style self-propelled gun has been added to Thomas Butters\' inventory, giving you even more weapon options for combat in Rust.<br/><br/> Interesting information came from our subscribers - due to the transition to winter time, the update time has been shifted to 22:00 Moscow time!<br/><br/> Don\'t miss all the new changes and updates in the game Rust! Follow our group to stay up to date with the most interesting news.<br/> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-2019269971173\">Link to original post</a>'),
(13175, 'en-US', 'The latest news from the Rust development fields!'),
(13176, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news from the Rust development field! The article covers changes to NPC scientist spawn rates, new features for \"residential\" houses, MLRS availability on the test branch, and other interesting updates.'),
(13177, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, NPC scientists, houses, MLRS, military bases, bug fixes, improvements, demos, equality, realism'),
(13178, 'en-US', 'The latest news from the Rust development fields!<br/><br/> ‍♂Now you will meet NPC scientists more often.<br/> ‍♂Now all structures equated to \"residential\" houses will randomly spawn 1 NPC scientist nearby.<br/> MLRS is already on the test branch, if you haven\'t seen it yet, you can download the Staging branch and try it yourself!<br/> There will be 4 prototypes of military bases: a, b, c, d. They will be formed randomly during generation. A prototype is understood as a territory format and a set of prefabs (items, buildings, structures).<br/> Fixed a small gap in the hatch when installing a floor on the MKB, through which players could be shot.<br/> Added missing sounds for MLRS.<br/> Work on the lighting fixtures at MLRS is coming to an end<br/> Improvements are being made for those who like recording demo videos: menu elements are being configured, a built-in screenshot panel has been created that does not stop recording the video, and many other subtleties.<br/> Blocked the ability to double jump through the attached ceiling at the gas station<br/> Fixed missing grass in front of supermarket<br/> Fixed floating electrical wire<br/> Fixed missing keyboard on farming goods vending machine'),
(13179, 'en-US', 'Pumpkin Carving Contest by Developers'),
(13180, 'en-US', 'Find out about an exciting competition from the developers of the game Rust, where you can show your creative side and win valuable prizes!'),
(13181, 'en-US', 'contest, developers, pumpkin carving, Rust, prizes'),
(13182, 'en-US', 'Find out about an exciting competition from the developers of the game Rust, where you can show your creative side and win valuable prizes!<br/><br/> To participate in the competition you will need:<ul><li> Carve a beautiful design on a pumpkin</li><li> Post a photo of your pumpkin on your Twitter account with the hashtag #RustHalloween</li></ul><br/> There will be two prize places in the competition. The winner of first place will receive:<ul><li> Skins to choose from, priced at £75</li><li> 2 keys for additional content (DLC)</li></ul> Second place will also not go without prizes and will allow you to receive:<ul><li> Skins to choose from, priced at £50</li><li> 1 DLC key</li></ul><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to show off your pumpkin carving skills and win valuable rewards from the developers of the Rust game.<br/> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-2019269971151\">Find out more about the competition</a>'),
(13183, 'en-US', 'An update has been released that solves problems with crashes and freezes in the game Rust'),
(13184, 'en-US', 'A client update has been released for the game Rust, which should solve issues with crashes and freezes after connecting to a server. If you continue to have problems, contact the developers via the official Discord or support site.'),
(13185, 'en-US', 'client update, crash issues, freeze issues, Rust, Discord, gameplay, joy of the game'),
(13186, 'en-US', 'After yesterday\'s Halloween update, many Rust players encountered problems with crashes and freezes after connecting to the server. However, the developers have released a new client update that should finally solve these problems and ensure a stable game.<br/><br/> This update is a major step in improving the Rust gaming experience. The developers\' main focus was on fixing crashes and freezes that occurred after connecting to a server. They carefully analyzed the causes and conducted intensive testing to find and fix all possible issues.<br/><br/> If you are still having issues after installing the update, the developers strongly recommend contacting them via the official Discord or support site. They are ready to help and take action to resolve any issues that may arise.<br/><br/> Updating the client in Rust is an important step in ensuring stable gameplay and player satisfaction. Now you can continue to enjoy the gameplay without stress and problems with crashes and freezes.'),
(13187, 'en-US', 'Developers are working on fixing the crash issue after the new update'),
(13188, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust continue to work on the crash problem that arose after the new update. The article contains information about the problem, the temporary lack of a solution, and some methods that can help players. Keywords: Developers, crash problem, update, Rust, game, server, methods, fixes.'),
(13189, 'en-US', 'Developers, crash problem, update, Rust, game, server, methods, fixes'),
(13190, 'en-US', 'The developers are still working to find and fix the crash issue that occurred after the new update.<br/><br/> A large number of players report that the game freezes or crashes at completely spontaneous moments, for some during loading, for others when changing settings, for others during the game itself after connecting to the server.<br/><br/> There is currently no temporary solution to the problem - connecting to specific servers also does not help everyone. Crashes occur at completely random moments in the game for different players. If you are affected by this problem, you will have to wait a little longer.<br/><br/> Some players have reported that the following methods have helped them. Please note that while these methods may help for some, for others these methods will immediately crash the game, so try at your own risk:<br/> Method 1: Before connecting to the server, switch to another audio mode in the game and then return to the original one.<br/> Method 2: Add \"-high -gc.buffer 4096 -maxMem=14000 -malloc=system\" to the launch parameters.'),
(13191, 'en-US', 'Game Crashes and Freezes: Developers Working on Problem After Update'),
(13192, 'en-US', 'In the latest updates of the game Rust on Steam, users encountered problems with crashes and freezes after connecting to the server. The developers are actively working on solving the problem after the update.'),
(13193, 'en-US', 'game crashes, game freezes, Rust update, problems after update, Rust developers, game stability, Rust updates on Steam'),
(13194, 'en-US', 'In the latest updates of the game Rust on Steam, users encountered problems with crashes and freezes after connecting to the server. The developers of the project did not remain on the sidelines and confirmed that this is a common case after the release of the update.<br/><br/> The development team is actively working to find and fix the issue to provide a more stable gaming environment for all users. They are working hard to resolve the issue as soon as possible.<br/><br/> For more information and updates, you can visit the official project page on the Vkontakte social network:<br/> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-2019269971072\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-2019269971072</a>'),
(13195, 'en-US', 'Halloween 2021 is officially starting!'),
(13196, 'en-US', 'Halloween 2021 event in Rust! Themed items, event, Frankenstein pet, the ability to decorate houses with pumpkins and the return of some items from previous events. Details in the article!'),
(13197, 'en-US', 'Halloween, 2021, decorative items, event, pet, pumpkin, shop, Steam'),
(13198, 'en-US', '<p>Halloween 2021 is officially underway! Events begin today and run until November 4th. Expect a variety of themed decorative items, a classic Halloween event, and a special Frankenstein pet to be your loyal companion in Rust.</p><br/><p> In the item shop, you can purchase a pumpkin that you can carve, place, and light in your homes. Also returning to the Steam item shop are some items from previous Halloween events, including a cursed cauldron and candle set. Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to decorate your buildings in Halloween style!</p><br/><p> You can learn more about the event and new products in this video:</p><br/> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RD8mIeo-r2s&t=1s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RD8mIeo-r2s&amp;t=1s</a>'),
(13199, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest avalanche of skins in Rust! New skins open up endless possibilities for expressing your individuality and creativity. In addition to the visual effect, new skins can also change the way your items and weapons work.'),
(13200, 'en-US', 'skins, game Rust, new batch, update, design'),
(13201, 'en-US', '<p>Check out the latest skin avalanche in Rust!</p><br/><p> Hooray! Great news for all fans of the game Rust - a new batch of skins has been added to the game! This one starts the hearts of almost all players with a burning anticipation and thirst for creative expressions!</p><br/><p> Skins in Rust are special visual elements that make your objects and characters look unique and stylish. The new batch of skins offers a wide range of designs and variations to suit the most sophisticated tastes.</p><br/><p> Close your eyes and imagine your brutal basic belt, but with a bright printed surface. Or maybe you prefer a shining suit in rainbow colors to stand out among other survivors in the vast world of Rust? New skins open up endless possibilities for the embodiment of your individuality and creativity.</p><br/><p> In addition to the visual effect, new skins can also make changes to the way your items and weapons work. For example, some skins can increase reload speed or increase damage. This can give you an advantage and help you overcome difficulties in the game.</p><br/><p> However, before you buy new skins, remember that they are not required to play the game. Rust is primarily about survival and strategy, and visual elements do not affect the gameplay. But, of course, it is great to be able to give a special look to your things and become recognizable in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your skin collection and make your experience in the game Rust more vivid and unforgettable!</p>'),
(13202, 'en-US', 'Attention, a new giveaway is starting on VK'),
(13203, 'en-US', 'Take part in a new giveaway on VK and get a chance to win a rare No Mercy L96 skin for the game Rust. Like, repost and subscribe to our page to take part.'),
(13204, 'en-US', 'raffle, VK, skin No. Mercy L96, like, repost, subscribe'),
(13205, 'en-US', '<p>We are pleased to announce that a new giveaway is starting on VK!</p><br/><p> This time the prize is the No Mercy L96 skin - one of the rarest and most valuable items in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> To participate in the drawing, simply follow a few simple conditions:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Like our page</li><br/><li> Repost this post</li><br/><li> Subscribe to our page to stay up to date with new giveaways and promotions</li><br/></ul><br/><p> The results of the drawing will be announced on October 31, 2021 at 22:00.</p><br/><p> Follow our news and find out who will be the lucky owner of the No Mercy L96 skin!</p><br/><p> To participate, follow the link: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997\">https://vk.com/club201926997</a></p>'),
(13206, 'en-US', 'Ready to get yourself a monster at your side?'),
(13207, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new update in the game Rust, where you can create your own zombie sidekick in the Halloween event.'),
(13208, 'en-US', 'monster henchman, halloween event, zombie, components, functionality, holiday update'),
(13209, 'en-US', 'MLRS Update: New Texture and Improved Targeting Menu'),
(13210, 'en-US', 'MLRS update in Rust: new texture and improved aiming menu will make using this weapon even more satisfying and exciting.'),
(13211, 'en-US', 'MLRS, update, texture, aim menu, game Rust, Steam'),
(13212, 'en-US', '<p>Rust on Steam pleasantly surprises its fans again. Recently there was an update that affected MLRS - one of the most effective weapons in the game.</p><br/><p> Following player requests, the developers have added a new MLRS texture, making its appearance even more realistic and attractive. Now players will be able to enjoy more detailed and high-quality details of this powerful combat vehicle.</p><br/><p> In addition, the update includes an improved MLRS targeting menu. Now players will be able to more conveniently and quickly select targets and perform strategic actions in battle. The updated targeting menu will reduce preparation time and increase the effectiveness of using MLRS in battle.</p><br/><p> The MLRS update is now available for Rust players on Steam. The added texture and improved targeting menu will make using this weapon even more satisfying and exciting.</p><br/><p> You can find more information about the MLRS update and other news about the Rust game on the official <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997\">VKontakte</a> page.</p>'),
(13213, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new batch of skins released in honor of Halloween. Now players can give their characters a new and unique look.'),
(13214, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, Halloween holiday, unique look, characters'),
(13215, 'en-US', 'Rust recently released a new batch of skins! This means that players now have the opportunity to give their characters and their inventory a new, unique look. However, what’s especially interesting is that this batch of skins was released in honor of Halloween!'),
(13216, 'en-US', 'How do you like Frankenstein\'s table?'),
(13217, 'en-US', 'The article examines theories about what a table created by Dr. Frankenstein would look like.'),
(13218, 'en-US', 'Frankenstein\'s chair, assumptions'),
(13219, 'en-US', 'Have you ever wondered what a table created by Dr. Frankenstein himself would be like? We have some interesting guesses on this matter.'),
(13220, 'en-US', 'Halloween Update News'),
(13221, 'en-US', 'Find out all the latest news about the Halloween update for Rust, which adds new costumes and a themed screenshot. Details are available in the game\'s official VKontakte group.'),
(13222, 'en-US', 'news, Halloween update, Rust, costumes, screenshot, test branch, VKontakte'),
(13223, 'en-US', '<p>Hello to all fans of the game Rust! Today we have great news for you related to the Halloween update. Dive into the atmosphere of horror, mysteries and additional opportunities with us!</p><br/><br/><p> Three new costumes have been added to the Rust test branch, allowing you to create a unique look during the Halloween season. Open your wardrobe and update your look to impress not only your friends, but also the sinister inhabitants of the earth.</p><br/><br/><p> But that\'s not all! In the game menu you will find a new themed screenshot that will allow you to enjoy the terrifying atmosphere of Halloween right on your screen. Have a small photo shoot with your friends or just enjoy the scary design of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Details about the update and the release date of the Halloween update will be available in the official Rust group on VKontakte. Visit this link to find out all the latest news and prepare for the scariest holiday of the year! <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997\">https://vk.com/club201926997</a></p>'),
(13224, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: review and impressions'),
(13225, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins in the game Rust: their variety, impact on gameplay and interaction with other players. Learn the advantages and disadvantages of the new skins, and find out where to buy them.'),
(13226, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, review, sensations, unique designs, interesting gameplay, interaction with other players, imbalance, additional features, economic side of the game'),
(13227, 'en-US', 'Greetings to all fans of the game Rust! Today we have good news - a new batch of skins has been released, which promises to please all lovers of unusual appearances for their items. Let\'s take a closer look at what this batch is and what new opportunities and sensations it can provide you with in the game.<br/><br/> So, the new batch of skins in Rust is a set of unique designs that can be applied to your weapons, tools, armor, ships and other items. Each skin has its own uniqueness and features that make your equipment exceptional and cause admiration from other players.<br/><br/> The benefits of new skins are obvious. Firstly, they add variety to the gameplay and make it more interesting and exciting. Every time you get a new skin, you can experiment with its combinations and choose the best options to create a unique style. In addition, new equipment can inspire you to new game strategies and tactics to give you an advantage over other players.<br/><br/> Secondly, skins become an important part of interaction with other players. They can arouse interest and envy, and also become a good reason for trading and exchanging skins. Thus, you can not only look stylish and original, but also get additional benefits from exchanging skins with other players.<br/><br/> However, as with any changes, there are some drawbacks and problems with introducing new skins to Rust. Firstly, new skins can cause an imbalance in the game economy. If some skins are too rare or powerful, this can affect the balance of power and resource distribution in the game. Secondly, introducing new skins can entail additional costs for players, as they may only be available for an additional fee.<br/><br/> In general, the new batch of skins in the game Rust is an interesting and important event for all fans of the game. It adds variety and color to the gameplay, allows you to express your individuality and mood through equipment, and can also become a source of additional opportunities for communication and interaction with other players. However, all changes should be considered from the point of view of balance and the economic side of the game.<br/><br/> Details about the new skins and how to purchase them can be found on the official Rust game page on Steam: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997923%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997923%2Fall</a>'),
(13228, 'en-US', 'Huge selection of Halloween skins'),
(13229, 'en-US', 'We present you a huge selection of Halloween skins for the game Rust on Steam. Check out interesting and scary skins on our official VK page and decorate your items in the game!'),
(13230, 'en-US', 'Huge, selection, skins, Halloween, Rust, Steam, information, rating, VK'),
(13231, 'en-US', 'Welcome to our website! We are pleased to present you with a huge selection of Halloween skins for the game Rust on Steam. Halloween is a unique time when game developers pay special attention to creating scary and stylish skins that allow players to decorate their items in the game. This time we have collected for you the most interesting and memorable skins that you can purchase and use during the Halloween event.<br/><br/> Attention: all information about skins for the game Rust for Halloween is on our official page in the social network Vkontakte. There you can find a detailed description of each skin, its image and the possibility of purchasing it. In order to stay up to date with all the news and updates, join our group at the link below:'),
(13232, 'en-US', 'Attention! A new giveaway is starting in the game Rust'),
(13233, 'en-US', 'Take part in the new giveaway in the game Rust and get a chance to win the skin Training l96! Details in our VK community.'),
(13234, 'en-US', 'prank, game Rust, skin, Training l96, VK community'),
(13235, 'en-US', '<h3>Take part in our new giveaway and win the Training l96 skin!</h3><br/><p> We are happy to announce that a new giveaway is starting in the game Rust! You have a great opportunity to take part and win a cool Training l96 skin for your weapon.</p><br/><p> For more information and to participate in the drawing, join our community on VKontakte.</p><br/><p> To participate in the drawing, follow the link: <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-201926997923%2Fall\">https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-201926997923%2Fall</a></p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to win a great prize and get a new skin for your game collection! Good luck!</p>'),
(13236, 'en-US', 'Military desert bases and MLRS are already on the pre-test (aux) branch!'),
(13237, 'en-US', 'The Rust pre-test (aux) branch now has military desert bases with MLRS. Read the article to learn more about this update.'),
(13238, 'en-US', 'Military Desert Bases, MLRS, Update, Pre-Test (aux) Branch');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(13239, 'en-US', 'Military desert bases and MLRS are already on the pre-test (aux) branch!<br/><br/> In total, about 3-4 bases with a procedurally generated structure appear on the map. But they have one thing in common - the presence of MLRS in the center. The base usually consists of a couple of training facilities, hangars, abandoned tents and production buildings.<br/><br/> But don\'t expect to be alone here - there will be armed scientists on the grounds who will obviously put up a fight. There aren\'t as many of them as at other monuments, though - so getting rid of them won\'t be a big deal.<br/><br/> There is no loot on the monument (at the moment?), but it is important to keep in mind that the content on the aux branch is very raw - it will undergo a ton of fixes and adjustments before it reaches the test branch and then the release.<br/><br/> With MLRS on every military base, it is clear that any structures within range will be at risk of being hit by an artillery barrage. How does the system itself work?<br/><br/> No one will let you just shoot - each salvo uses 16 rockets of a separate new type, which is called \"artillery\". Also, each salvo requires an MLRS module - it is inserted into the control panel and it disappears after use, which significantly complicates the work with this weapon. So far, there is no way to get these items in the game - this will be improved soon.<br/><br/> The MLRS is equipped with a control board with a built-in map, through which you specify the point you want to strike, a lever for firing and a slot for a module. The radius of the missiles\' reach is quite wide, which must be taken into account - however, MLRS missiles will easily be shot down by anti-aircraft guns.<br/><br/> The update will be released on November 4 at 22:00 Moscow time. Currently, it is available exclusively on the aux01 branch.'),
(13240, 'en-US', 'Information about skins added to the game Rust. We present to your attention a new batch of skins in the game Rust! Unique designs, the opportunity to stand out from other players and increase the value of your items. Update your game collection today!'),
(13241, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game, skins batch, game updates, individuality, skins value, marketplaces'),
(13242, 'en-US', '<p>Information about skins added to the game Rust</p><br/><p> We present to your attention a new batch of skins in the game Rust! Every gamer who follows the game updates knows that the appearance of new skins is always a special event. They allow players to stand out from the rest, add individuality to their character, weapons and base.</p><br/><p> The high demand for skins has prompted Rust developers to introduce regular updates to meet the needs of players and offer them increasingly diverse and creative skins. The new batch of skins offers players unique designs that can be applied to various items and attributes of the game. From weapons and armor to tools and building materials, the new skins will allow you to transform your entire game collection.</p><br/><p> In the new batch of skins you will find both classic and stylish options, as well as bright and eccentric ones. You will be able to express your individuality and emphasize your unique style.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget that new skins not only change the appearance of items, but can also increase the value of your items. Some of them become collectibles and can reach high prices on trading platforms.</p><br/><p> Stock up on in-game credits and participate in auctions to purchase the most interesting and valuable skins. New skins are an opportunity to update your game collection and impress your friends and rivals.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your gaming aesthetic and add some spectacle to your game! Check out the new batch of skins in Rust today.</p>'),
(13243, 'en-US', 'NEW UPDATE IS OUT: \"Missions &amp; QOL\"!'),
(13244, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new update called \"Missions &amp; QOL\" that brings a whole host of new features and improvements to the game. Find out more about this update and upcoming events.'),
(13245, 'en-US', 'NEW UPDATE, Missions &amp; QOL, Rust, missions, improvements, game, map reset, servers, Twitch Drops, YouTube'),
(13246, 'en-US', '<h2>NEW UPDATE IS OUT: \"Missions &amp; QOL\"!</h2><br/><br/><p> Rust has received a new update called “Missions &amp; QOL”, which brings a number of innovations and improvements to the game. Particular attention was paid to introducing a variety of missions and minor changes that improve the quality of the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the major changes in this update is the reset of maps on all servers. This will give players the opportunity to start the game on a new basis and discover new strategies and tactics.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, there is information about the upcoming Twitch Drops, which will start on November 20. This is a great opportunity to get various rewards and bonuses for watching the broadcast.</p><br/><br/><p> Want to learn more about the Missions &amp; QOL update? Check out the video review on the game\'s official YouTube channel:</p><br/><br/><p> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P4MoErwII5U&t=1s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P4MoErwII5U&amp;t=1s</a></p>'),
(13247, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam Update: Admin Panel, Quality of Life Changes, and New Price'),
(13248, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust introduces an admin panel for server admins and also includes changes to improve the quality of the game. The cost of the game has also been increased. Find out more in our article.'),
(13249, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, game, Steam, admin panel, quality of life changes, price, servers, server update'),
(13250, 'en-US', '• ADMINPANEL: in the F1 menu for server admins, an in-game admin panel has appeared with a list of players, their information and a list of server variables, where you can configure everything without switching to the console. When selecting a player, you can immediately kick or ban him from there, indicating the reason - no hassle with commands!<br/><br/> • QUALITY OF LIFE CHANGES: Much attention has been paid to fixing some minor bugs and improving existing functionality. The most notable changes are:<br/> — Signs no longer lose their image if you pick them up. You can safely draw something, put a picture/sign/any other drawing surface in your inventory, place it in another place and the art you drew will not disappear.<br/> - Aircraft will now be able to land on a cargo ship - it will no longer slide or clip through textures<br/> - When the research table menu is open, right-clicking on scrap metal will automatically drag it into the appropriate slot, rather than into the slot for the item you want to research.<br/> - The image editor on signs/paintings now remembers the last camera position<br/> — The illumination radius of the edited object in drawing mode has been expanded — previously, large paintings and signs were only partially illuminated<br/> - Now the player in the injured state will have to hold the interaction button for 3 seconds before the door will be opened/closed - this no longer happens instantly<br/> — The garden bed is now automatically \"attached\" to the foundation and you will no longer need to manually level it<br/> — The name of the interfering monument will now be displayed in the chat if you try to build on its territory<br/> - Now requires access to cabinet when trying to lift sign<br/> - Signs, paintings and neon signs can now be stacked up to five (however, you cannot stack paintings in the same slot if at least one of them has a saved image)<br/> — Worms and larvae are now placed in the inventory (slots that become available by pressing the key to call the inventory and crafting interface), and not in quick access slots<br/> - Improved ceiling lamp collision to make them easier to repair or break when underneath them<br/> - Right-clicking a pumpkin will no longer automatically move it to the clothing slot - however, this can still be done manually<br/> — The client graphics level is no longer reset to minimum after starting the Rust Dedicated Server<br/> — Fixed a bug where it was not possible to remove a bind from a key if something was assigned to it by default<br/> — Now the screenshot keys in standard and quadruple resolution are not tied strictly to F4/F9 — you can assign them to the desired keys (or key combinations) via the console<br/><br/> • NEW PRICE: The cost of Rust has increased from 725 ₽ to 1465 ₽. Not related to the update, but you never know!..<br/><br/> The update will be released at 21:00 Moscow time, the server update for owners will be released approximately 10-15 minutes before the client release. This will reset the maps on all servers.<br/><br/> This is the last time this year that the update will be released at 9pm – the UK switches back to GMT at the end of October, meaning updates will be released at 10pm GMT.'),
(13251, 'en-US', '⚠ New update: missions, quality of life changes and more'),
(13252, 'en-US', 'Learn about the big changes coming to Rust, including missions, a van, turret changes, and mouse sensitivity adjustments.'),
(13253, 'en-US', 'update, Rust, missions, quality of life changes, RV, mouse sensitivity, settings, gameplay'),
(13254, 'en-US', '⚠ New update today at 21:00 Moscow time! Missions, a bunch of quality of life changes and more...<br/> The new round of Twitch Drops will start on November 20th - nothing will be running until then.<br/><br/> • MISSIONS: The game now has missions that you can take and complete from NPCs in safe locations (scientists\' outpost, for example). There aren\'t many of them at the moment, but the number of tasks will expand over time.<br/><br/> At the moment, players will be asked to complete tasks to catch a certain amount of fish, kill the required number of required animals, carry an item from point A to point B, and so on. There is even Russian vodka! However, you can\'t drink it - it is only given according to the task.<br/><br/> For completing most tasks you will be awarded scrap metal, in some cases other items. It will be possible to repeat missions, but you will need to wait some time between completions.<br/><br/> • VAN: A two-module van has been added, inside which you can cook food, store your equipment (similar to a locker) and respawn.<br/><br/> • TURRET CHANGES: Other players can now be added to the list of authorized turrets - works on the same principle as when transferring access to a sleeping bag. Now the player is also automatically authorized in the turret when it is placed.<br/><br/> • MOUSE SENSITIVITY WHEN AIMING: A new parameter has been added — mouse sensitivity when aiming. The variable \"input.adssensitivity\" will be available for editing both through the console and in the regular game settings menu. If the sensitivity when aiming is, for example, 0.5 and the same value is for the standard sensitivity, then the sensitivity when aiming will be 0.25.'),
(13255, 'en-US', 'Attention, a new giveaway has started on VK'),
(13256, 'en-US', 'Take part in the new giveaway on VK and get a chance to win the Egg Hunter AR skin for the game Rust on Steam!'),
(13257, 'en-US', 'vkontakte, giveaway, skin, Egg Hunter AR, game Rust, Steam'),
(13258, 'en-US', 'We have some great news for you - a new giveaway has started on the VKontakte social network! We are offering a unique prize - the Egg Hunter AR skin, which you can get absolutely free! Find out more and take part in the giveaway at the link: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997849%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997849%2Fall</a> . Don\'t miss your chance to get this cool skin and become the best in the Rust game on Steam! Hurry up, participation is limited.'),
(13259, 'en-US', 'Minor changes to the camper module and missions'),
(13260, 'en-US', 'The latest Rust updates have brought some small changes to the camper module and missions. Find out what changes have been made and how they will affect the gameplay.'),
(13261, 'en-US', 'changes, camper module, missions, barbecue, storage access, cars, respawn, locations, repeat time, saving, buttons, helicopter'),
(13262, 'en-US', 'Minor changes to the camper module and missions:<br/> ✅It is impossible to light the barbecue in the module camper if it is under water. The barbecue will be extinguished if the car is under water<br/> ✅Fixed the ability to access the camper storage from the outside<br/> ✅Now the camper module can be found in cars already on the road<br/> ✅Fixed any possibility of respawning in a camper car that is underwater. As well as getting behind the wheel while in the passenger seat<br/> ✅Fixed mission locations that sometimes appeared in unacceptable places<br/> ✅Reset the repeat time for failed or completed missions, repeating failed missions every 5 minutes and completed missions every 60 minutes.<br/> ✅When you refuse to complete a mission, the time is refreshed.<br/> ✅Fixed issues with saving/loading and resetting missions after death<br/> ✅Added \"Copy\" and \"Clear\" buttons to the console interface<br/> ✅Fixed a bug where a destroyed helicopter could not be destroyed on the deck of a cargo ship<br/> https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997626%2Fall'),
(13263, 'en-US', 'How Rust Was Created: The Game\'s Story in the Founder\'s Words'),
(13264, 'en-US', 'The story of Rust\'s creation and overcoming difficulties, told by the founder of the game studio'),
(13265, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, history, creation, difficulties, developers'),
(13266, 'en-US', 'In one of his latest blogs, Harry Newman (studio founder, lead developer) talked about how Rust came to be in its current form and the difficulties it had to go through:<br/><br/> \"Rust launched in early access and gained popularity very quickly. Too quickly for us. We realized that it needed a complete rewrite. Huge chunks of code were unnecessarily complex, with a bunch of dependencies that didn\'t make sense - it was hindering development.<br/><br/> We called this version Rust Legacy, and I started making a new version in parallel with it. From scratch.<br/><br/> Many people didn\'t like it. Players only saw the game as it was, and didn\'t even want to see what it could become. They claimed that we were killing the game, and that they would never play the new Rust, but would forever stick with Rust Legacy.<br/><br/> I followed their feedback on Reddit and the forums. Any complaints they had, I took in a way that would not only solve their original problem, but make it a million times better than it was working in Legacy.<br/><br/> The biggest reward was that the players changed their unchanging position and started playing the new version. They thought I was making the game better for money and career, but I did it because they pissed me off.\"<br/> https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997827%2Fall'),
(13267, 'en-US', 'First look at military bases and missile launcher'),
(13268, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the first details about military bases and the missile launcher in the game Rust.'),
(13269, 'en-US', 'military bases, missile launcher, MLRS, Rust, article, update'),
(13270, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will look at the first details about military bases and the missile launcher in the game Rust.<br/><br/> Military bases will appear exclusively in the desert, and each of them will be unique on each map thanks to procedural generation. However, little is known about the structure of these bases yet.<br/><br/> The most interesting part of the military base is the mysterious MLRS launcher. Inside it will be a map, with which players will be able to launch a missile strike on a selected point on the map. The commits also mention the possibility of shooting down incoming missiles with an anti-aircraft turret. As a result, the MLRS could become a powerful weapon for raids.<br/><br/> Unfortunately, none of the information from the screenshots provided can fully reveal the final capabilities and interaction details with these new objects. Details about military bases and MLRS remain a mystery, but we will keep an eye on the news and keep you updated.'),
(13271, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new batch of cool skins on Steam! Update your collection and stand out from the rest of the players! Find out more on our official website.'),
(13272, 'en-US', 'new batch, skins, game Rust, Steam, collection update, stand out, be different, individuality, official site, gaming community'),
(13273, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for all fans of the game Rust on Steam!</p><br/><p> Our game has a new batch of cool skins that every player will definitely like!</p><br/><p> Hurry up to update your collection and stand out from the rest of the participants! After all, skins are not only a way to express your individuality, but also a great opportunity to stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> Visit our official website and find out all the details about the new batch of skins in the game Rust. We are sure that you will like it!</p><br/><p> Join our gaming community and share your impressions of new skins with other players!</p>'),
(13274, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Start November 20th - 27th'),
(13275, 'en-US', 'Find out about the Twitch Drops event, which runs from November 20 to November 27. Get a chance to win rare skins and items for the game Rust on Steam, simply by connecting your Twitch account and watching streams.'),
(13276, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam, skin giveaway, event, streams'),
(13277, 'en-US', '<p>Twitch Drops is a special event that starts on November 20 and runs until November 27. During this week, players will be able to get various skins and items for the game Rust on the Steam platform.</p><br/><p> To participate in Twitch Drops, you need to connect your Twitch account and follow the streams participating in the event. During the stream, skins and items will randomly drop, which you can receive directly to your account in the Rust game.</p><br/><p> This is a great opportunity for players to get exclusive and rare items that will help you decorate your character and stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> However, it is worth noting that Twitch Drops is a promotion, and the chance to get skins and items is not guaranteed. Everything depends on luck and chance. Some players can get a whole collection of exclusive skins, while others may be left without them.</p><br/><p> Also, to participate in the distribution of skins on Twitch Drops, you must comply with the conditions and restrictions set by the organizers. Do not forget to read the rules and instructions so as not to miss a single stream and not miss the opportunity to purchase rare items.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that Twitch Drops are only one of the ways to get skins and items in the game Rust. You can also purchase them on the Steam Marketplace or through the official game store.</p><br/><p> So get ready for Twitch Drops from November 20th to 27th and keep your finger on the pulse so as not to miss your unique opportunity to purchase rare skins and items for the game Rust!</p>'),
(13278, 'en-US', 'Changes to spawning of scientists and elite crates in military tunnels'),
(13279, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have made changes to the spawning of scientists and elite boxes in military tunnels, creating new survival strategies for players.'),
(13280, 'en-US', 'Rust game updates, scientist spawn, elite crate spawn, military tunnels, survival strategy, gameplay changes'),
(13281, 'en-US', '<h2>Changes to spawning of scientists and elite crates in military tunnels</h2><br/><br/><p> The developers of the game Rust on Steam have made some important changes to the process of spawning scientists and elite boxes in military tunnels. Now, in order to get new boxes, players will have to take into account new restrictions and plan their actions strategically.</p><br/><br/><p> Previously, the contents of the scientists and elite crates in the tunnels would respawn regardless of whether other NPCs spawned, allowing players to gather and wait safely for new crates to spawn after clearing the monument. However, with the latest update, this has changed - the crates will now only spawn after the player leaves the monument. This means that players will have to wait outside the monument for a period of time and then kill all the scientists again to gain access to the new elite crates.</p><br/><br/><p> This innovation will give the gameplay more strategic significance and will force players to take all factors into account when planning their actions. Now they will be forced to decide when it is best to leave the monument to gain access to new resources, and how to minimize the risks of meeting scientists in the process of upgrading crates.</p><br/><br/><p> These changes to the spawning of scientists and elite crates in military tunnels will add more dynamics to the gameplay and create new survival strategies for Rust players. We will see how players adapt to these changes and find new ways to cope with the challenges associated with obtaining new resources for survival.</p><br/><br/><p> Source: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997560%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997560%2Fall</a></p>'),
(13282, 'en-US', 'ATTENTION! Drawing in our VK community'),
(13283, 'en-US', 'ATTENTION! Drawing in our VK community. Participate and get a chance to win the Symbiote - SMG skin. The conditions are simple - subscribe to the page and repost. The results will be announced on September 28.'),
(13284, 'en-US', 'giveaway, VK community, Symbiote skin, SMG, participation, subscription, repost'),
(13285, 'en-US', '<p>We are pleased to announce the start of a giveaway in our VK community!</p><br/><p> The main prize is the Symbiote skin - SMG. To participate, you must fulfill the following conditions:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Be a member of the community</li><br/><li> Subscribe to the community page</li><br/><li> Repost this post</li><br/></ul><br/><p> The results of the draw will be announced on September 28, 2021 at 21:30. We wish everyone good luck!</p><br/><p> Details and participation you can find on our VK page: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997560%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997560%2Fall</a></p>'),
(13286, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Bradley Attacks Players in Modular Cars'),
(13287, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust, which now has Bradley attacking players in modular vehicles, despite the vehicle\'s texture completely covering them and making them invisible to Bradley. A bug related to broken car windows has also been fixed.'),
(13288, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, Bradley, modular machines, players, texture, visibility, error'),
(13289, 'en-US', '<p>A recent update to Rust brought some interesting changes to the behavior of the NPC character Bradley. Players in modular vehicles will now face a more dangerous opponent, as Bradley has begun attacking them even if the vehicle\'s texture completely covers them and makes them invisible.</p><br/><br/><p> This change in game mechanics may impact the tactics and strategy of players who prefer to use modular vehicles as cover. They will now have to be more careful and take into account the possibility of an attack from Bradley.</p><br/><br/><p> Additionally, the developers fixed a bug where Bradley would not shoot through car windows unless they were broken. This improvement provides more realistic gameplay and increases the sense of danger and unpredictability when encountering Bradley.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust update allows players to dive deeper into the wasteland survival experience. Changes to Bradley\'s behavior add new challenges and opportunities for tactical interaction with the environment and other players.</p><br/><br/><p> To learn more about the latest Rust update and other exciting news, visit our social media page:</p><br/> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997560%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997560%2Fall</a>'),
(13290, 'en-US', 'Rust: Updates - New Features and Improvements'),
(13291, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest updates to Rust, including the addition of authorized turrets and improved mouse sensitivity. We\'ll also take a look at other changes and what players think about them.'),
(13292, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Rust game updates, authorized turrets, mouse sensitivity, player list sorting, airdrops, MLRS installation, gameplay, developers, player opinions'),
(13293, 'en-US', 'Now you can add other players to the list of authorized turrets, it works on the same principle as when transferring access to a sleeping bag.<br/><br/> A new parameter has also been added — mouse sensitivity when aiming. The variable \"input.adssensitivity\" will be available for editing both through the console and in the regular game settings menu. If the sensitivity when aiming is, for example, 0.5 and the same value is for the standard sensitivity, then the sensitivity when aiming will be 0.25.<br/><br/> Other changes include:<br/> ✅ Sorting of the player list has been improved and now Steam friends or team members will always be displayed first<br/> ✅ The in-game server control panel is already completed and will soon be available for testing on the Aux branch<br/> ✅Increased darkness at night by 75% for realism, night vision goggles now cost less.<br/> ✅Airdrops will glow at night. Will it make gameplay easier (searching for drops)?<br/> ✅It has become known that air defense systems can repel a missile attack from the new MLRS installation (Katyusha).<br/> This at least means that shelling bases from this mobile missile vehicle is possible... Many are not happy about this!'),
(13294, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: share your opinion on the choice'),
(13295, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins added to the game Rust. Share your opinion on the choice of skins and find out what other players think. Consider the trade-offs and financial aspects when choosing skins.'),
(13296, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, skin selection, skins in the game Rust, players\' opinions, balance of choice'),
(13297, 'en-US', 'Hello to all Rust players! Today I want to share with you some information about the latest batch of skins added to the game. As always, the developers never cease to delight us with new and creative variations of the design of our favorite items. And now I would like to hear your opinion.<br/><br/> The new batch of skins includes a variety of items: weapons, armor, clothing, buildings and much more. Each item in the game Rust can be decorated with a unique and stylish appearance thanks to skins. This allows each player to stand out and give individuality to their game character.<br/><br/> These new skins come in a variety of color and graphic schemes to suit all tastes and preferences. They may be bright and colorful, or you may prefer more subdued and realistic options. No matter what style you choose, you are sure to find a skin that suits you.<br/><br/> I invite each of you to share your opinion about the new skins in the comments to this article. Write which skins you liked the most and why. Maybe you liked the bright and extravagant weapon skin, or you are more inclined to stylish and elegant clothes? Be free in your choice and share your reasons.<br/><br/> But don\'t forget that choosing a skin is also a compromise. Each skin has its price, and you can\'t always afford the most expensive and rare options. So let\'s also discuss the financial aspects of choosing skins. How do you balance your desires with the availability of skins? Share your thoughts and advice to help other players make the right choice.<br/><br/> And of course, don\'t forget to take other players\' opinions into account. What if a friend suggests you look at a skin that you weren\'t interested in before? Or maybe the community has recognized a certain skin as the best choice? Study other players\' opinions and think about possible trade-offs when choosing skins.<br/><br/> Your choice of skins in the game Rust is an expression of your individuality and style. Use the opportunity to get new and interesting skins to make the gaming experience even more vivid and unique. I look forward to your comments on your choice of skins in the game Rust!'),
(13298, 'en-US', 'How Price Changes Affect Rust on Steam'),
(13299, 'en-US', 'Find out how price changes in Rust can impact gameplay and player experience.'),
(13300, 'en-US', 'price, Rust, Steam, gameplay, player experience'),
(13301, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust has seen a price change that could have a significant impact on gameplay and player experience. In this article, we\'ll look at how the new price could impact the game and what compromises developers may have to make.</p><br/><p> Changing the price of the game Rust can have various consequences on the gameplay. It can affect the balance between players, as well as the accessibility of the game for newcomers. If the price increases, it can lead to a decrease in the number of players, as some may decide not to continue playing due to the high cost.</p><br/><p> However, raising the price can also have a positive effect on the gameplay. A higher price can attract more serious and experienced players, which in turn can make the game more competitive and interesting. A higher price can also contribute to the quality of the game, since the developers will have more resources to support and develop it.</p><br/><p> However, developers must consider the trade-offs that come with changing the price. For example, they may lose some players due to the increased cost, which may reduce the revenue from the game. They must also consider the financial ability and willingness of players to pay more for the game.</p><br/><p> Thus, changing the price of the game Rust on Steam can have both positive and negative consequences. It is important to consider all factors and find a balance between the availability of the game for all players and sufficient funding for its development.</p>'),
(13302, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new batch of skins that have appeared in the game Rust on the Steam platform.'),
(13303, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, batch of skins'),
(13304, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam pleases its players with a new batch of skins!</p><br/><p> The game administration continues to monitor the wishes of the players and constantly adds new skins that allow you to stand out from the rest and create a unique look for your character or weapon.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins for Rust on Steam features a variety of options for every item, from new character skins to stylish weapon variants.</p><br/><p> The new skins offer a wide range of color palettes, unique patterns and memorable designs so that each player can create their own unique image and emphasize their individuality.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that all skins are fully compatible with the gameplay and do not affect the balance of the game. The appearance of the character and weapons remains simply a visual addition, without giving any advantages to players.</p><br/><p> In order to purchase new skins, you need to visit the in-game store, where you can choose the options you like and purchase them for in-game funds or real money.</p><br/><p> In addition to purchasing, the game Rust often holds promotions and giveaways for new skins, which allow players to get them for free. Be sure to follow the news and participate in these events for a chance to update your wardrobe in the game.</p><br/><p> So, if you want to look stylish and original in the game Rust on Steam, don\'t miss the new batch of skins!</p>'),
(13305, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates: New Image Editor Features and Other Changes'),
(13306, 'en-US', 'Check out all the latest updates to Rust, including a new image editor for signs and paintings, expanded lighting radius, improved server management, and more.'),
(13307, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust updates, image editor, signs, paintings, graphics, server management, monument, gameplay'),
(13308, 'en-US', '✅The image editor on signs/paintings now remembers the last camera position<br/> ✅Expanded the illumination radius of the edited object in drawing mode - previously large paintings and signs were only partially illuminated<br/> ✅The graphics level in the client is no longer reset to minimum after starting the Rust Dedicated Server<br/> ✅Fixed a bug where it was not possible to remove a bind from a key if something was assigned to it by default<br/> ✅Now the screenshot keys in standard and quadruple resolution are not strictly tied to F4/F9 - you can assign them to the desired keys (or key combinations) via the console<br/> ✅Now the player is automatically authorized in the turret when it is placed<br/> ✅A new monument that will focus on military bases in the desert is scheduled for release in the October update of the game. They will most likely become available for testing at the end of September. No other details are available yet<br/> ✅ Work on the in-game server control panel is still in development on a separate branch. What is already available at the moment:<br/> — Ability to search for a specific player via a separate search bar<br/> — Ability to edit server variables (variables will be accompanied by a description if possible, which will be useful for those who are not yet familiar with the server functionality)<br/> https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997511%2Fall'),
(13309, 'en-US', 'Attention! 1000 ruble giveaway in the game Rust!'),
(13310, 'en-US', 'Take part in our giveaway and get a chance to win 1000 rubles in the game Rust! Join our Discord community and follow the instructions to participate.'),
(13311, 'en-US', 'giveaway, Rust, prize, Discord'),
(13312, 'en-US', 'Greetings to all Rust players!<br/><br/> We have great news for you! We are launching a giveaway in which you can win a valuable prize - 1000 rubles in the game Rust!<br/><br/> The terms of the giveaway are simple: all you need to do is join our Discord community at <a href=\"https://discord.gg/pxv2KKXaQF\">https://discord.gg/pxv2KKXaQF</a> and follow the instructions posted there.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance to win big in the game Rust! Join the draw right now! Good luck!'),
(13313, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: News and Changes'),
(13314, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest updates in the game Rust: news, changes in object interactivity and improvements to server administration.'),
(13315, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, news, changes, rocket launcher, interactivity, server administration'),
(13316, 'en-US', '<h2>News and changes in the game Rust</h2><br/><p> The latest update to the Rust game has brought many interesting changes and innovations. In this article, we will look at the main changes that affect the gameplay and improve immersion in the game world.</p><h3> 1. Calculation of the range of shells for the MLRS rocket launcher</h3><p> Now MLRS rocket launchers calculate the minimum and maximum range of shells based on the given gun angle and shell speed. This allows for more accurate planning and control of attacks.</p><h3> 2. Interactivity of objects in the game</h3><ul><li> The image of the firing radius marker has been removed from the map, making navigation more convenient and aesthetically pleasing.</li><li> Now you can take the signs in frames into your inventory without losing the design and hang them in another place. This way you can better decorate your camp or base.</li><li> Signs and plaques now have a glossier paint finish, which increases their illumination and makes them more visible.</li><li> Improved lighting of car headlights when viewed through the windshield, which increases the realism of the game world.</li><li> The bed in the camping module can now be unfolded if it is already occupied by another player.</li><li> Access to hanging lights (connection and disconnection) from the floor is now increased, making it easier to control indoor lighting.</li><li> When viewing and moving the map with the mouse, false marker settings are minimized, allowing for more accurate navigation through the game world.</li></ul><h3> 3. Improving server administration</h3><p> Rust server admins now have additional capabilities. They can kick and ban players directly from the game interface, which makes it easier to control and support the gaming community.</p><p> In this update to Rust, the developers have tried to take into account the wishes of the players and improve the gaming experience. New features and improvements provide a more convenient and realistic game. Download the update and enjoy the new features in the game Rust!</p><p> Source: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997\">https://vk.com/club201926997</a></p>'),
(13317, 'en-US', 'New changes in the game Rust have been announced'),
(13318, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest updates to Rust, including a delay when entering a keycode, the ability to stack signs, and changes to the hotbar for worms and grubs.'),
(13319, 'en-US', 'new changes, Rust game, delay when entering key code, folding signs, worms and larvae'),
(13320, 'en-US', '<h2>New changes in the game Rust have been announced</h2><br/><br/><p> Recently, the developers of the game Rust have released important updates that will not leave players indifferent. In this article, we will tell you about the most significant changes that are worth noting.</p><br/><br/><h3> Added delay when entering saved key code</h3><br/><br/><p> There is now a time delay when entering a saved key code. Previously, to open a door, you had to press the correct code several times, but now you only need to press one key. This is a convenient feature for players who have many doors and codes.</p><br/><br/><h3> Ability to stack signs, picture frames and neon signs</h3><br/><br/><p> Now you can conveniently stack up to 5 signs, picture frames, and neon signs. This allows you to place them more compactly on the walls of your base. However, it is worth considering that data is not stored in the stackable signs.</p><br/><br/><h3> Worms and larvae fall into the basket</h3><br/><br/><p> One of the inconveniences of previous versions of Rust was that worms and larvae could end up on the quick access panel. This led to unpleasant situations. In the new version, the developers took this into account and now all worms and larvae go straight to the trash. Now you don’t have to perform unnecessary actions to remove them from the panel.</p><br/><br/><p> You can find more detailed information about the latest updates to the Rust game on the VKontakte page <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997402%2Fall\">of the development group</a> .</p>'),
(13321, 'en-US', 'Another important fix'),
(13322, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest major fix for Rust on Steam, which addresses the pumpkin issue and improves the overall gameplay experience. Read the article for more information.'),
(13323, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, fix, updates'),
(13324, 'en-US', '<p>Rust Steam users can breathe a sigh of relief - another important fix has been released!</p><br/><p> The game developers took into account the requests of the players and made a change that solves the problem associated with the pumpkin.</p><br/><p> Previously, when a player RMB (right mouse button) clicked on a pumpkin, it would be equipped automatically. However, this caused some inconvenience for players who wanted to keep the pumpkin in their inventory.</p><br/><p> But now, thanks to an important fix from the developers, the pumpkin is no longer put on by pressing the right mouse button. However, this does not mean that players cannot put on the pumpkin. Now the pumpkin can be put on by dragging it to the appropriate slot with clothes yourself.</p><br/><p> This change was an important step towards improving the convenience of the gameplay. The developers of the Rust game always strive to take into account the opinions and requests of players in order to offer them the most comfortable gameplay.</p><br/><p> Additional information about the fix and other game updates can be found at <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997402%2Fall\">the link</a> .</p>'),
(13325, 'en-US', 'Update: Added 12-slot crate to Camper module'),
(13326, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam adds a new feature: a 12-slot Camper crate. Find out more and other changes in Rust.'),
(13327, 'en-US', 'update, Camper module, 12-slot crate, Rust, Steam'),
(13328, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest update to the Rust game on Steam, the developers have added a new upgrade to the Camper module - a 12-slot crate. This greatly expands the storage options in this module and allows players even more convenience and flexibility.</p><br/><br/><p> Now the Camper module can accommodate not only sleeping bags, but also other useful items:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> 4 sleeping bags</li><br/><li> Barbecue</li><br/><li> 12 slot box</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> This makes the Camper module even more convenient for players, giving them the ability to store more resources and items within a single module.</p><br/><br/><p> For more information about this update and other changes in the game Rust, you can visit the official community page on the social network VKontakte at the link: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997402%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997</a></p>'),
(13329, 'en-US', 'We waited for this'),
(13330, 'en-US', 'Find out about new updates in Rust on Steam'),
(13331, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, updates, Steam'),
(13332, 'en-US', 'Long-awaited updates in the game Rust on Steam'),
(13333, 'en-US', 'Skin sequels coming to Rust Workshop'),
(13334, 'en-US', 'Find out about an interesting update in the game Rust - the appearance of skin sequels in the workshop. Come and add personality to your game character with new unique skins!'),
(13335, 'en-US', 'skins, workshop, Rust, skins sequels, game character, unique skins, individuality'),
(13336, 'en-US', 'Dear players and fans of Rust on Steam! We have great news for you! The Rust Workshop has added sequels of skins that will immediately become available in the game. Now you have the opportunity to expand your collection of unique skins and add a little personality to your game character. Visit the Workshop to find new beautiful skin options and decorate your Rust game. Visit our official website to learn more!<br/> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997402%2Fall\">Link to Rust Workshop</a>'),
(13337, 'en-US', 'Rust Game on Steam: 2021 Update Review'),
(13338, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust on Steam, which brings new features and improvements, and how the developers are balancing player interests.'),
(13339, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Rust game update, Steam, survival, new features, improvements, graphics, resources, construction, craft'),
(13340, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust on Steam! In this article, we will tell you about the latest update to the game, which will give a new impetus to your adventures in survival.</p><br/><br/><p> The 2021 update brings a host of new features and improvements that will make your gaming session even more exciting.</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> New landscapes: with the update, a large number of new biomes appeared, which amaze with their beauty and diversity.</li><br/><li> Improved graphics: The developers have updated the visual quality of the game to present you with an even more realistic and exciting world.</li><br/><li> New Resources: The update has added new types of resources to help you survive and craft more powerful gear.</li><br/><li> New building options: You can now create more complex and secure structures to protect yourself from enemies.</li><br/><li> Improved Crafting System: The update has made changes to the crafting system, making it more convenient and intuitive.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> However, the guys from the developers made a number of compromises to make the game even more interesting and exciting. Some changes in the game mechanics may require you to put more effort to achieve your goals. In addition, new biomes and resources may present new challenges and dangers.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to remember that the developers are constantly working on updates to make Rust even better and more balanced. The influence on the decision to update the game takes into account the opinion of the gaming community and strives to find the optimal balance between fun and difficulty.</p><br/><br/><p> So don\'t miss the opportunity to dive into the exciting world of Rust on Steam and discover all the new features and challenges that the latest update brings!</p>'),
(13341, 'en-US', 'Beware of scam messages from female nicknames in the game Rust'),
(13342, 'en-US', 'Information about sending fraudulent messages from female nicknames in the game Rust and the importance of checking links to avoid data security threats.'),
(13343, 'en-US', 'fraud, Rust, co-op, scammers, data security, messaging, female nicknames, friend requests, Steam profile, link checking'),
(13344, 'en-US', '<p>Dear participants,</p><br/><p> We would like to draw your attention to the active mass mailing of messages from female nicknames in the game Rust, containing an invitation to play together.</p><br/><p> They may send you a link to their Steam profile asking you to add them as a friend. However, we strongly recommend that you be extremely careful and check all links to avoid becoming a victim of scammers.</p><br/><p> There is only one real Steam website: steamcommunity.com. Fraudsters may use similar domains with similar names that are easy to miss without paying attention. For example, a website similar to the original may look like this: steamcommuniTry.ru.</p><br/><p> Do not give in and do not enter your details on such sites, as the scammers intend to steal your personal information.</p><br/><p> Be vigilant and careful when communicating with unfamiliar players, especially when receiving suspicious messages or invitations. If you have suspicions, it is better not to take risks and not to respond to such messages.</p><br/><p> Remember that your safety and the safety of your data are your priorities. Be careful when playing Rust and be aware of potential scams.</p><br/><p> Best regards, Rust Team</p>'),
(13345, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam has new skins that let you customize your gameplay experience and give new looks to items. Learn about the new batch of skins, how they affect gameplay, and how to get them.'),
(13346, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust game, skins, Steam, new skins, gaming experience, visual skins, customization, competitive advantage, game mechanics, Steam store'),
(13347, 'en-US', 'A new batch of skins have now been added to the game Rust on Steam. These are unique visual skins that can be applied to various items in the game, such as weapons, clothing, and building materials.<br/><br/> New skins are always awaited by a huge number of players, as they allow them to customize their gaming experience and stand out from other players. The new batch of skins in the game Rust provides a variety of styles and themes, allowing each player to find something to suit their taste.<br/><br/> It is important to note that when choosing skins, players should consider not only their visual appeal, but also their impact on gameplay. Some skins may have benefits such as increased durability or speed of use, which can give the player a competitive advantage in battles or during base building.<br/><br/> However, it is worth remembering that skins in the game Rust are only a visual element and do not directly affect the game mechanics. Ultimately, the choice of using skins remains with the player and depends on his preferences and strategy.<br/><br/> A new batch of skins for Rust is now available on the Steam platform. To get these skins, players need to visit a special page in the Steam store or use the in-game store in the game itself.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the chance to upgrade your gaming equipment and give your items a new look in the game Rust. Dive into the virtual world of survival and become a recognizable figure thanks to the new batch of skins!'),
(13348, 'en-US', 'Some changes have become available on the aux branch'),
(13349, 'en-US', 'The Rust Steam aux branch has seen some major changes to improve gameplay and player experience. Updates include automatic attachment of a garden bed to a foundation, the ability for an airlift to land on a cargo ship, saving the contents of signs, paintings, and photo frames, and fixing issues with placing items under garage doors. There is also mention of the development of a server management feature via the F1 menu.'),
(13350, 'en-US', 'aux branch, Rust, updates, garden bed, air transport, signs, paintings, photo frames, garage doors, server management');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(13351, 'en-US', '<p>Some important changes have been made to the Rust project aux branch on Steam. These changes will make the gameplay more convenient and comfortable for players. Here are some of the key changes available on the aux branch:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li><br/> <b>The bed is automatically attached</b> to the foundation. Now you don’t have to waste time manually aligning the bed with the foundation. This will greatly simplify the interaction with the beds and make the gardening process more efficient.<br/></li><br/><li><br/> <b>Aircraft landing</b> on cargo ships. This change will prevent aircraft from sliding or clipping through textures when landing on a ship. You will now be able to land safely from the air onto a cargo ship.<br/></li><br/><li><br/> <b>Preserve the contents of plaques, paintings, and photo frames</b> when you take them into inventory and place them again. This means that after you take a plaque, painting, or photo frame, the image on it will be saved. The next time you place the item, the image will remain in place.<br/></li><br/><li><br/> <b>Garage doors</b> will no longer interfere with placing items underneath them when open. This change will allow you to freely place items underneath raised garage doors.<br/></li><br/><li><br/> In development, but not yet available for testing, <b>is server management from the F1 menu</b> . At the moment, it is known that the function displays a full list of players, basic information about the server state and all variables. This will give players more control and information about the server.<br/></li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> The above changes will greatly improve the Rust gaming experience and help players achieve greater efficiency in the game. They demonstrate the developers\' progressive approach to improving the game and the team\'s responsiveness to the community\'s wishes. Let\'s hope that these changes will be available to all players in the near future.</p>'),
(13352, 'en-US', 'Latest news from the fields:'),
(13353, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest changes in Rust, including a new military base, MLRS installation, changes to construction, camper cars and much more!'),
(13354, 'en-US', 'news, update, Rust game, military base, MLRS installation, construction, camper car, sleeping bag, RGB mice Razer'),
(13355, 'en-US', 'Latest news from the fields:<br/> ✅Active work is underway on the military base: new textures, new clothes for bots, new models of tents, objects, barriers are being developed.<br/> ✅The MLRS installation will be located at this base. It will be available for use by players, it will not be an NPC!<br/> ✅When boarding the MLRS vehicle, you will be able to choose two angles of inclination of the missile launcher, the rotation of the missile system is balanced, and when dismounting, the MLRS weapon platform will rotate to the zero position.<br/> ✅Now, if you build too close to the RT, a notification will be displayed in the chat or console (it is not yet known exactly), for example: \"\"It is impossible to build so close to the Bandit Town\"\".<br/> ✅Fixed incorrect operation of speakers included in the chain from the boombox.<br/> ✅Added a new trigger that disables the boat from sticking to the ship, you can\'t just swim up and calmly climb onto the ship. Now when dismounting you can feel like Dominic Toretto!<br/> ✅In the camper, the ability to access the box and barbecue from the outside has been removed!<br/> ✅The physical weight of the camper module has been increased from 340 to 400, which will greatly affect your movement speed with such a module!<br/> ✅The sleeping bag is being redefined, the prefab has been renamed and moved, as preparations are underway to implement the sleeping area into the camper module (more information for mapmakers).<br/> ✅Now, when crawling, you are given 3 seconds to open or close the door in your house!<br/> ✅A little information for those who haven\'t heard about the new effects with Razer RGB mice. Now your condition will be broadcast as a light effect on the mouse, for example, when frozen it will glow blue, when injured - red, when critically injured (knocked out) - flashing red. All effects can be redefined and reassigned in the settings or through the console!'),
(13356, 'en-US', 'Find out about Twitch Drops skin giveaways in Rust and participate in the promotion to get rare and exclusive items for your character. All the details in the article.'),
(13357, 'en-US', 'Information, skin giveaways, Twitch Drops, Rust game, Steam'),
(13358, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam is holding an interesting promotion for its players - Twitch Drops. Each participant can get access to various items that have become available for unlocking on any streams.</p><p> The list of items available for unlocking includes a variety of weapon skins, clothing, and other in-game items. All of these items can be obtained by watching any Twitch stream.</p><p> Players no longer need to search for specific streams or streamers where item drops are taking place. All they need to do is simply enjoy watching any Rust stream on Steam, and they will automatically be eligible for Twitch Drops.</p><p> This promotion is a great opportunity for players to get rare and exclusive items for their character. Every time you watch a Twitch stream, you have a chance to unlock a new skin or other cool item.</p><p> Keep an eye on announcements and community activity to learn about current giveaways and items available through Twitch Drops. Don\'t miss your unique opportunity to update your skin collection and become even more stylish in Rust on Steam!</p><br/> <b>Link to the article:</b> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997\">https://vk.com/club201926997</a>'),
(13359, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update on Steam'),
(13360, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest updates to Rust on Steam. Improvements, bug fixes, and gameplay impact. Watch the video on YouTube.'),
(13361, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, Steam, news, Rust game updates, gameplay, fixes, directions, development team, balancing, mechanics, systems, influence'),
(13362, 'en-US', '<p>We are pleased to inform you about the latest updates to the game Rust, available on the Steam platform. Rust is an open-world survival game where each player has one goal - to survive. The game was developed and published by Facepunch Studios and quickly attracted millions of players from all over the world with its unique gameplay and harsh world.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust game updates are an important part of supporting and further developing the game, as well as ensuring that players can enjoy new content and bug fixes. The development team is constantly working to improve the gameplay, add new features and fix problems to offer players an even more exciting and adventurous experience.</p><br/><br/><p> The latest Rust update brings improvements and new features that can impact your gameplay and overall experience in the game. One of the key aspects of the update is balancing the game’s various mechanics and systems to create a more balanced and fair environment for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> The new update also includes bug fixes and performance improvements to ensure a smoother and more stable gaming experience. The developers are also constantly listening to player feedback and taking their opinions and suggestions into account as they improve the game.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to understand the impact of updates on the game Rust. Changes to game mechanics or systems can affect your play style and interactions with other players. Therefore, it is recommended to stay up to date with the latest updates and adapt your strategies accordingly.</p><br/><br/><p> We hope that Rust updates will allow you to enjoy the game even more and create new opportunities for you and your friends. Join the Rust community to stay up to date with the latest news and discussions in our official VKontakte group.</p><br/><br/><p> Watch the video about the Rust game update on our YouTube channel: </p><br/><br/><iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/B-NY7NFgnEw\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen></iframe>'),
(13363, 'en-US', 'Facepunch is working on installing MLRS in Rust'),
(13364, 'en-US', 'Facepunch has begun work on installing a Multi-Directional Rocket Launcher (MDRL) into Rust. It\'s expected to bring some interesting gameplay changes.'),
(13365, 'en-US', 'Facepunch, Rust, update, MLRS, installation, gameplay'),
(13366, 'en-US', 'Rust developers Facepunch have begun working hard to add a new installation to the game - the Multi-Directional Rocket Launch System (MDRL). This update promises to bring interesting changes to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> At the moment, we only have a concept model of the installation and missiles, so we cannot yet see the finished appearance of the new weapon. However, it is already known that this installation will not be a regular air defense, as many players assumed.</p><br/><p> In addition to working on the Katyusha, the developers are also busy creating a military base in the desert. Models of military tents, textures and other objects have been worked out to add more military atmosphere to the game.</p><br/><p> Work on road signs is also reported, meaning that nations on the roads will become more diverse and realistic.</p><br/><p> The developers suggest that new features and changes will be available for the October update of the game. We are waiting with impatience.</p><br/><p> Source: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997\">https://vk.com/club201926997</a></p>'),
(13367, 'en-US', 'Now signs in the game Rust can be selected with the drawing saved'),
(13368, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new feature in the game Rust - now you can pick up signs and save drawings on them, as well as about the developers\' plans for the future.'),
(13369, 'en-US', 'signs, drawing, select, save, Rust, update'),
(13370, 'en-US', 'The latest update to the Rust game introduced the long-awaited ability to select signs and save drawings on them. Now players can show their imagination and decorate their buildings with colorful and original signs. The developers will not stop there and have promised to add support for frames and neon signs in the future. These new features will allow players to further implement their ideas and give their buildings a unique style.'),
(13371, 'en-US', 'Full Rust Game Review Video for Beginners'),
(13372, 'en-US', 'Full overview video about the game Rust for beginners - learn all about the walkthrough, features and secrets of the game, get useful tips and strategies for survival.'),
(13373, 'en-US', 'game Rust, review, beginners, walkthrough, mechanics, resources, tips, strategies, survival'),
(13374, 'en-US', 'Learn all about the walkthrough, features and secrets of the game Rust with our full overview video. The video will show you how to start playing Rust, explain the main mechanics and resources, and share useful tips and strategies for survival. Don\'t miss the opportunity to get all the knowledge you need to succeed in this tough and ruthless game!'),
(13375, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins in the game Rust on Steam. A full review, tips on choosing, trade-offs and opportunities to earn money by buying and selling skins.'),
(13376, 'en-US', 'skins, Rust, Steam, new skins, review, choice, compromises, practicality, efficiency, game strategy, skin trading, earnings'),
(13377, 'en-US', 'Hello, dear players! Now it\'s time for you to learn about the newest skins that have been added to the game Rust on Steam. The developers have released a fresh batch of unique skins that will allow you to stand out from other players. In this article, we will tell you all the details so that you can make the right choice when buying.<br/> You are about to find out about the most stylish and cool skins available in the new batch. We have prepared a full review for you, including a description of each skin, as well as information about its price and availability on the Steam market.<br/> Our analysis includes key factors such as the skin\'s appearance, texture quality, and popularity and demand among players. We will turn to experienced players and their reviews to understand which skins are worth buying and which ones are best left unattended.<br/> But beyond reviewing the skins themselves, we\'ll also discuss the tradeoffs involved in choosing a skin. We\'ll talk about the practicality and effectiveness of skins in the game, and how they can impact your game strategy. After all, the flashiest, most beautiful skin isn\'t always the best choice.<br/> As a bonus, we will provide you with tips on skin trading. Find out how you can make money by buying and selling skins, as well as where to find the most interesting offers on the market. And remember, skins are not only the perfect way to show your individuality, but also an opportunity to earn a little extra money.<br/> So keep you updated on all the new skins in the game Rust and do not miss the opportunity to purchase something truly unique for your character! Enjoy reading!'),
(13378, 'en-US', 'Skins for the 11th Twitch drops'),
(13379, 'en-US', 'Check out the most striking and unique skins from the 11th set of Twitch drops in Rust. Consider their impact on gameplay and the trade-offs associated with balancing and the game economy.'),
(13380, 'en-US', 'skins, Twitch drops, Rust game, 11th set, unique skins, gameplay, balancing, game economy'),
(13381, 'en-US', 'With the new Twitch drops in Rust, you can get unique skins for your character! In this article, we will tell you about the most striking and unique skins that are available in the 11th set of Twitch drops. Find out how to get these skins and how they affect the gameplay. You will also find an overview of the trade-offs and problems associated with balancing skins and their impact on the game economy. Don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your character with skins from the new Twitch drops!'),
(13382, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Round 11 Participants Confirmed'),
(13383, 'en-US', 'Find out about the confirmation of participants of the 11th round of Twitch Drops and the opportunity to get skins in the game Rust. Details on our page in the VK group.'),
(13384, 'en-US', 'Confirmation of participants, Round 11, Twitch Drops, Rust skins, information, rules of participation'),
(13385, 'en-US', 'In this article, we report on the confirmation of the participants of the 11th round of Twitch Drops, who will be able to receive special skins in the game Rust. Detailed information about the confirmed participants and the rules of participation can be found on our page in <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997\">the VK group</a> .'),
(13386, 'en-US', 'No Quests or Major Changes in New Rust Update'),
(13387, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update does not include quests or major changes. Instead, the 11th round of Twitch Drops will start tomorrow, where players will be able to get new skins.'),
(13388, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, quests, major changes, Twitch Drops, skins'),
(13389, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust does not include any new quests or other significant changes, developer Alistair has revealed.</p><br/><p> However, despite this, tomorrow the 11th round of Twitch Drops will start, in which players will be able to get various skins for their characters and items in the game.</p><br/><p> More details on the new skins and their availability will be provided tomorrow.</p>'),
(13390, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Checking Software for Changes'),
(13391, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust on Steam, which includes changes to how software checks for changes to game data to combat malicious users.'),
(13392, 'en-US', 'Rust update, software check, data changes, game balance, cheat software'),
(13393, 'en-US', '<p>A recent update to the game Rust on Steam has introduced an important change to the client\'s functionality. Now the game client will automatically check if any software is trying to make changes to the game\'s data, even without opening the developers\' development software.</p><br/><p> This solution helps combat malicious users who try to use external programs to gain an advantage in the game. If such illegitimate software is detected, the changes made by it will be automatically rejected.</p><br/><p> This update may impact cheating software, making it superficially ineffective. Players who want to play fairly can rest assured that the developers are taking steps to prevent unfair play and maintain balance.</p><br/><p> The new Rust client is an important step towards improving the gameplay and ensuring a fair competitive environment for all players.</p>'),
(13394, 'en-US', 'Rust Update: New Trailer'),
(13395, 'en-US', 'The Rust team recently released a new trailer that introduces all the new updates and changes to the game. Find out about the new features, resources, and gameplay in the Rust update.'),
(13396, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, trailer, gameplay, new features, resources, materials, bugs, errors, interaction, game economy, survival'),
(13397, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust team recently released a new trailer that introduces all the new updates and changes to the game. The trailer shows off improved graphics, new locations, and features that have been added to the game in recent updates.</p><br/><p> One of the main focuses of the new update is gameplay improvements and the introduction of new opportunities for players. Now you will be able to build more complex and innovative structures, create unique weapons and use new tools for survival.</p><br/><p> In addition, the update adds new resources and materials that players can use to create more powerful weapons and defensive structures. The developers also fixed many bugs and errors to make the game more stable and enjoyable to play.</p><br/><p> The new trailer also shows off new ways to interact with other players. You can now form teams, build friendly settlements, and fight together against other players or the dangerous creatures that inhabit the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> The Rust update has received positive reviews from players, who note the improved graphics, engaging gameplay, and more opportunities for creativity and survival. However, some players also voice their concerns about the game\'s balance and the possible impact of the new features on the game\'s economy.</p><br/><p> Overall, the new Rust update represents a significant step forward for the game, offering players even more options and challenges. Whether you\'re already a Rust fan or are just considering giving the game a try, this update is definitely worth your attention.</p>'),
(13398, 'en-US', 'Check out the new skins for Rust on Steam. Change the look of items, stand out from other players, and support the game developers.'),
(13399, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, appearance, items, choice, taste, cost, quality, game balance, cosmetic changes, game developers'),
(13400, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam is constantly updated and replenished with new skins. These skins allow players to customize the appearance of their items in the game, making them unique and stylish.</p><br/><p> Learning about new skins in Rust is always very exciting for players. They eagerly await the release of new models to update their collection and stand out from other players.</p><br/><p> These new skins can be used on various items in the game, such as weapons, clothing, tools, and even building blocks. They not only provide a change in appearance, but also add distinctive elements to the functionality of the items.</p><br/><p> But what factors influence the choice of new skins in the game Rust? Players may have different tastes and preferences, which may influence the choice of one or another skin. Some players prefer a more classic and realistic style, while others may be attracted by bright and futuristic models.</p><br/><p> It is very important to consider the balance between the cost and quality of new skins. After all, players want to get quality and interesting skins, but they also do not want to overpay for them too much. The right balance between price and quality is what game developers must provide to satisfy the needs of players.</p><br/><p> It is also worth noting the importance of choosing new skins for game balance. Skins can affect the visual perception of the game, but should not give players any advantages or change the game mechanics. Equality and fairness of all players must be ensured.</p><br/><p> New skins in the game Rust are not only an opportunity to decorate your items and stand out from other players, but also a way to support the developers of the game by purchasing them through the Steam store. This is a mutually beneficial cooperation that allows both players and developers to enjoy the game.</p><br/><p> So, new skins in Rust are more than just cosmetic changes. They offer players individuality, style, and the opportunity to support the developers by creating and maintaining a unique gaming experience.</p>'),
(13401, 'en-US', 'For those interested, a second test branch was launched - Aux'),
(13402, 'en-US', 'A new second test branch called \"Aux\" has been launched for everyone in Rust. Find out how to access this branch and what to expect from it.'),
(13403, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, test branch, updates, testing'),
(13404, 'en-US', 'For those interested, a second test branch was launched - Aux.<br/><br/> This can be considered a pre-test branch, where changes will be released earlier and will obviously be more broken, so it is not recommended for regular play.<br/><br/> What\'s the difference? The Staging Branch (sometimes referred to as the \"test branch\"), while a testing platform for all upcoming new content, requires new changes to be in a more or less polished state to keep the servers playable, and is released a week before the main game update.<br/><br/> The Aux branch will receive new changes earlier and is intended exclusively for those interested in testing, you will not be able to play stably on this branch as there WILL be bugs on it, sometimes large ones. And there will be many experimental changes that will not reflect the final result of the upcoming update, this is important.<br/><br/> How do I access Aux? Simply download the Staging Branch, and in the beta settings, select the Aux branch via properties, that\'s it. At the time of writing this post, the latest changes to procedural maps are available there — underwater lab fixes and more.<br/> https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997230%2Fall'),
(13405, 'en-US', 'Submarine Update: 12-Slot Crate and Underwater Labs'),
(13406, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest updates to Rust: a 12-slot submarine crate and new underwater labs. Get ready for new adventures in the ruthless world of the ocean.'),
(13407, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, submarines, 12-slot crate, underwater labs'),
(13408, 'en-US', 'Welcome to the world of Rust! We are pleased to present you with the latest changes to the game. A submarine update has been added to the test branch, which brings many new features, including exciting underwater labs and a new 12-slot crate.'),
(13409, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Reduced Health of Knocked Down Players by 75%'),
(13410, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust introduced a significant change that reduced the health of downed players by 75%. In this article, we will discuss the impact of this change on gameplay, balance, and strategy, and learn why the developers made this decision. You can find out more on our social media page.'),
(13411, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, knockout, health, balance, tactics, strategy, developers'),
(13412, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of Rust! The latest update to the game has introduced a significant change affecting the health of downed players. Now, when a player is knocked down, their health will be reduced by 75%.</p><br/><p> This is a major change that will bring more complex and balanced gameplay. Players will now have to be more careful and cautious to avoid being knocked out and to preserve their health. It also increases the importance of tactics and strategy in the game, as players will have to carefully plan their actions and assess risks.</p><br/><p> The change to the health of downed players also has an impact on the balance between the different characters in the game. Players must now choose which skills and tools to use to stay combat-ready and minimize the risk of being knocked out.</p><br/><p> It’s important to note that this change didn’t happen in isolation. The Rust developers carefully analyzed game statistics, community feedback, and beta testing to ensure that this change was necessary. They are committed to making the game fun and balanced for all players.</p><br/><p> The update with reduced health for downed players means that the game becomes even more exciting and challenging. Immerse yourself in the unique world of Rust, where every decision has consequences and every action can determine your fate.</p><br/><p> To learn more about this update and stay up to date with the latest news about the game Rust, visit our social network page: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997230%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997230%2Fall</a></p>'),
(13413, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update Review: New Features and Improvements'),
(13414, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update for Rust on Steam, which brings new features, graphical improvements, gameplay balancing, and more.'),
(13415, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, Steam, new features, improvements, bases, resources, NPCs, graphics, progress, achievements, balancing, weapons'),
(13416, 'en-US', '<p>Rust on Steam is constantly evolving and attracting more and more players from all over the world. The latest update of the game, available at <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MrhKEJocOSI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MrhKEJocOSI</a> , offers many new features and significant improvements to the gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the most notable new features of the update is the introduction of new buildings and items. Players gain access to new types of buildings and structures, allowing them to create unique bases and protect their resources. Many new items have also been added, which increase the variety in the game and give players more options for surviving in the harsh world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> The game developers also paid attention to improving the gameplay. NPCs (non-player characters) now work more efficiently and realistically, providing more challenges and opportunities to interact with the world around you. In addition, significant improvements were made to the graphics and visual effects, which gives the game even more realism and beauty.</p><br/><br/><p> The new update also introduced a progression and achievement system, allowing players to track their progress in the game and earn rewards for reaching certain goals. This gives players even more motivation and satisfaction when playing.</p><br/><br/><p> Balancing of game mechanics and improvement of weapons were also part of this update. The developers paid special attention to feedback from players to achieve optimal balance and ensure interesting and fair gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust game update is available for all Steam users and brings many new features and improvements. Don\'t miss your chance to dive into a unique world of survival, building and fighting. Link to the update overview: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MrhKEJocOSI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MrhKEJocOSI</a> .</p>'),
(13417, 'en-US', 'Increased depth of destruction of water transport'),
(13418, 'en-US', 'The depth of destruction of water transport has been increased in the game Rust. The innovation will help prevent the destruction of boats and submarines inside bases located at great depths. Now players can build bases at great depths without the risk of losing transport.'),
(13419, 'en-US', 'destruction, water transport, update, game Rust, depth'),
(13420, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has made a major change to the way watercraft are destroyed. Now, when diving into deep water, boats and submarines will begin to deteriorate at a depth of 12 meters, instead of the previous 4 meters.</p><br/><p> This innovation is designed to prevent the destruction of transport inside bases that are located at great depths. Previously, players faced the problem of their boats and submarines breaking down while inside bases, which reduced the gaming experience and made it difficult to use water transport.</p><br/><p> However, thanks to this update, players can now safely build bases at great depths and be confident in the safety of their watercraft. This opens up new opportunities for exploring the surrounding world and creating unique water bases.</p><br/><p> Changing the depth of destruction of watercraft is one of the steps taken by the developers of the game Rust to make the gameplay even more exciting and fair. Let\'s hope that other such improvements will be introduced to the game in the near future.</p><br/> <b>Source:</b> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997230%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997230%2Fall</a>'),
(13421, 'en-US', 'Update: Submarine Oxygen and Moon Pool Water Fixes'),
(13422, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust, which adds new features and fixes issues with aquatic gameplay, including oxygen in submarines and bulletproof water in moon pools.'),
(13423, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, submarines, oxygen, diving tank, water gameplay'),
(13424, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to Rust has introduced some interesting changes. Now, in submarines, players will need to monitor the oxygen level. A special driver board will display the critical level of 100, at which the boat must be filled with oxygen. This will add realism and force players to actively participate in diving.</p><br/><p> Now oxygen will be consumed not only when diving into water, but also when using a diving cylinder. Thus, players will spend oxygen reserves immediately after putting it on. This change will make the gameplay more realistic and will require more careful use of underwater resources.</p><br/><p> However, when the submarine surfaces, the oxygen level will be restored, allowing players to move more freely through the waters without having to worry about constantly replenishing supplies. This is an important change that will allow players to use submarines more comfortably and effectively.</p><br/><p> In addition, the update fixed the issue with bulletproof water in the moon pools (underwater labs). Now players will be able to use their weapons without problems and get the full gaming experience in such places.</p>'),
(13425, 'en-US', 'Updated ascent to the underwater laboratory'),
(13426, 'en-US', 'Find out everything new in the Rust update related to the ascent to the underwater lab, including tasks, resources and weapons.'),
(13427, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, underwater lab, tasks, resources, weapons, challenges, adventures'),
(13428, 'en-US', 'Let\'s find out what new features the Rust Steam update brings, related to the ascent to the underwater laboratory. Dive into the exciting underwater world and explore all the possibilities that await you in this impenetrable darkness. Learn about new tasks, resources and weapons that will help you survive and conquer the underwater depths. Get ready for new challenges and adventures in the updated underwater laboratory of the Rust game!'),
(13429, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new batch of skins in the game Rust, which will allow you to stand out from other players and emphasize your individual style.'),
(13430, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, skins in the game Rust, individual style'),
(13431, 'en-US', '<h1>New batch of skins in the game Rust</h1><br/><p> Skins are one of the most popular and desired items in the game Rust. Players can use skins to change the appearance of weapons, tools, and items in the game, making them more unique and attractive.</p><br/><p> And today we have great news! A new batch of skins has been added to the game Rust, which will please all fans of individual style!</p><br/><p> These new skins will give your items a brighter and more expressive look. You will be able to stand out from other players and emphasize your style and taste.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes a variety of options for different types of weapons, tools and items. Now you will have even more opportunities to be creative and create a unique look for your items.</p><br/><p> But remember that the choice of skin can affect your game strategies. Some skins can be easily visible on the battlefield, making you more vulnerable to enemies. Therefore, before buying or using a skin, you need to carefully weigh the pros and cons.</p><br/><p> Visit our website <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997220%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997</a> to check out the new skins and choose the ones that will reflect your individuality in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(13432, 'en-US', 'An answer has emerged to the reasons for the reduction in the number of underwater laboratories'),
(13433, 'en-US', 'The answer to the question of why the number of underwater labs in the game Rust has been reduced has appeared. Find out what reasons led to this and share your opinion on the impact of this change on the balance of the game.'),
(13434, 'en-US', 'underwater laboratories, game Rust, balance, updates, players\' opinions'),
(13435, 'en-US', 'The question of why the number of underwater labs in Rust has been reduced has been answered. It turns out that it is due to the excessive number of rooms accessible via the blue map. But it is important to ask: is it possible that this situation is disrupting the balance of the game? And what do you think about it?<br/><br/> The issue of reducing the number of underwater labs in the game has been hotly debated in the Rust community in recent days. And now, at stake is the answer that many have long considered unclear. It turns out that the reduction in the number of such structures is due to the presence of an excessive number of rooms accessible via the blue map.<br/><br/> The game\'s creators were quick to explain that this measure was taken to balance the gameplay. Previously, players often used underwater laboratories for their own purposes, which created an imbalance and unfairness on the servers. Reducing the number of available rooms should stabilize the situation and give equal chances to all players.<br/><br/> However, this decision has caused different opinions among players. Some believe that the reduction of underwater laboratories is the right step towards balance, which will allow new players to have more opportunities and equal chances for success. At the same time, other players are outraged and believe that such a measure limits their freedom and opportunities in the game.<br/><br/> If you play Rust, we invite you to join the discussion and share your opinion on the reasons for reducing the number of underwater labs. You can read more about this update on the <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997220%2Fall\">Rust page on VKontakte</a> . Feel free to share your ideas and suggestions, because your opinion may influence the developers\' decisions.'),
(13436, 'en-US', 'New fixes and changes'),
(13437, 'en-US', 'The article discusses new fixes and changes in the game Rust, which have made significant changes to the gameplay. AI bots were improved, a helipad was added in the desert, the number of underwater labs was reduced and the distance between labs was increased.'),
(13438, 'en-US', 'New fixes and changes, Rust game updates, AI bots, helipad, underwater labs, distance between labs'),
(13439, 'en-US', '<h2>New fixes and changes</h2><br/><p> The latest update to Rust has introduced a number of fixes and changes that will significantly impact the gameplay. In this article, we will look at the major updates and how they impact the gameplay experience.</p><br/><ul><br/><li><br/><h3> Improved AI bot behavior</h3><br/><p> Bots in Rust can now listen to players and differentiate between different levels of player noise. This means that it will be even more important for players to be quiet when sneaking up on bots and even animals. This will increase the elements of realism and the required tact in the game.</p><br/></li><br/><li><br/><h3> Helipad for desert base</h3><br/><p> Now in the desert base, players will find a model of a helipad. This is a great addition that will add new opportunities for game strategies and tactics. The new desert base will be a combat arena where players will be able to engage in a battle for control of the helipad.</p><br/></li><br/><li><br/><h3> Fewer underwater laboratories</h3><br/><p> The update also decided to reduce the number of underwater laboratories. This means that players will face fewer opponents and will have more time to explore and prepare for battles.</p><br/></li><br/><li><br/><h3> Increasing the distance between laboratories</h3><br/><p> Another change that has happened in the game Rust is the increase in the distance between laboratories. Now players will have to travel a greater distance to reach the next laboratory. This will create more difficult conditions and will require more resources and tact from players.</p><br/></li><br/></ul><br/><p> To learn more about the latest updates in the Rust game, you can visit the official community club at <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997216%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997</a> . There you will find all the news about the game, updates and will be able to communicate with other players.</p>'),
(13440, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest fixes and changes in the game Rust. The concrete barrier model and texture have been updated, an error with the NPC voice when talking on the phone has been fixed, the desert biome has been expanded, the textures of wooden walls have been updated and new military-themed models have been added to hangars. We also talk about the work on the new missile system and changes to the mechanics of torpedoes and submarines.'),
(13441, 'en-US', 'new fixes, changes, update, Rust, Steam, model, texture, concrete barrier, NPC voice, phone conversation, desert biome, snow biome, wooden wall textures, plywood, military theme, military hangars, rocket launcher, torpedoes, shooting accuracy, special effects, submarine movement, target acquisition method, foggy haze'),
(13442, 'en-US', 'New fixes and changes.<br/><br/> ✅Updated concrete barrier model and texture<br/> ✅When talking on the phone, the NPC voice could not stop sounding for players. Fixed!<br/> ✅As previously written, the desert biome has been increased, and accordingly the boundaries of the snow biome have been shifted to the north<br/> ✅Updated textures of wooden walls to match plywood style<br/> ✅Added military-themed models, in particular for military hangars.<br/> The desert biome is being actively developed for a reason. They are planning to add a new RT with a new rocket launcher there, which will take up quite a large area.<br/> ✅ Torpedoes have reduced firing accuracy near the water surface.<br/> ✅A lot of special effects for submarine and torpedo movement have been adjusted.<br/> ✅A method for capturing a target is being developed, if a target that has left the sight will somehow be picked up faster when the object returns to the aiming zone!<br/> ✅When firing torpedoes, some foggy haze now appears<br/> ✅If you shoot one type of torpedo, then nearby torpedoes will not interfere with each other, the effects will be processed more correctly.<br/> https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-201926997215%2Fall'),
(13443, 'en-US', 'Increasing the size of the desert spawn in the game Rust'),
(13444, 'en-US', 'In the latest update, Rust has increased the desert spawn size due to the addition of new content. This change is aimed at improving the gameplay experience and creating more interesting gameplay situations.'),
(13445, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Rust game updates, desert spawn increase, new content, game experience improvement'),
(13446, 'en-US', 'In the latest update to Rust, a decision was made to increase the desert spawn size. This decision is related to the work on adding new content and is aimed at improving the gaming experience for players. Increasing the spawn size will create more diverse and exciting game situations, as well as provide more space for exploration and base building. This change is just one of many updates that the developers of Rust release regularly to meet the needs of players and make the game even more interesting and exciting.<br/><br/> If you want to learn more about the update and new content in the game Rust, you can follow the link: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?z=photo-201926997457239067%2Falbum-20192699700%2Frev\">https://vk.com/club201926997?z=photo-201926997457239067%2Falbum-20192699700%2Frev</a> .'),
(13447, 'en-US', 'New fish and chocolate models'),
(13448, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new fish and chocolate models that have been added to the game \"Rust\". The developers strive for greater realism and improve the graphics so that players can enjoy improved details and visual presentation. Details in the article!'),
(13449, 'en-US', 'new models, fish, chocolate, updates, game Rust'),
(13450, 'en-US', 'In our article we will tell you about interesting updates in the game \"Rust\"! The developers presented new models for fish and chocolate, which adds more realism and pleasure to the gameplay.<br/><br/> Now you can enjoy improved graphics and fish detailing, allowing you to predict their movements even more accurately and catch the biggest specimens. Each fish will have its own unique features and appearance, which adds variety and makes you want to explore different species.<br/><br/> In addition, the chocolate models have also received an update. Now it looks even more appetizing and realistic, which adds more depth to the game atmosphere. You will be able to enjoy not only the taste of chocolate, but also its visual representation, which will add immersion and pleasure.<br/><br/> These updates highlight the importance of detail and realism in the game \"Rust\". The developers continue to work on improving the graphics and the feeling that players get when playing. So stay tuned and don\'t miss the latest updates to enjoy all the new fish and chocolate models!<br/><br/> Visit our VKontakte page to learn more about new updates to the game \"Rust\" and stay up to date with the latest news:<br/> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997207%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997207%2Fall</a>'),
(13451, 'en-US', 'New changes in the game \"Rust\"'),
(13452, 'en-US', 'Read about the latest changes in the game Rust, including new features with water, food, a camper module and other interesting objects.'),
(13453, 'en-US', 'news, game Rust, updates, water, fish, chocolate bar, camper module, rebirth, objects'),
(13454, 'en-US', '<h1>New changes in the game \"Rust\"</h1><br/><p> The studio of game developers \"Rust\" never ceases to amaze its players! We invite you to familiarize yourself with the latest updates of the game, which will add even more interesting opportunities to the virtual world of survival.</p><br/><h2> Water changes</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> Now the water in the game has a realistic design with the addition of foam particles. The enchanting atmosphere becomes even more realistic.</li><br/></ul><br/><h2> New food</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> New fish models have been introduced: raw and cooked. Now you can enjoy fresh fish and refresh yourself during your adventures.</li><br/><li> A new model of chocolate bar has been added. An unforgettable treat for starting a fire or just for a sweet mood.</li><br/></ul><br/><h2> Camper module</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> Work is currently underway on the car module \"camper\". In this module, the player will be able to access its contents by simply lowering his head down.</li><br/><li> For greater realism and gameplay balance, the camper module can no longer be moved if it contains content.</li><br/><li> Also, a cabinet has been added to the camper module for convenient storage of necessary things.</li><br/><li> With the addition of the Camper Module, the respawn screen will be revised to allow players to enjoy the new features.</li><br/></ul><br/><h2> New objects</h2><br/><ul><br/><li> Especially for you, the developers have added 6 new prefabs of different sizes for the revival of new barrels that will spawn along the roads. This will allow you to explore the game map much more effectively.</li><br/><li> New prefabs have also been introduced, including military tents, boxes and other themed objects to create a more realistic game world.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> Stay tuned for news and updates on the game \"Rust\"! The creators are constantly working to improve the gameplay and add new features to make your survival in the virtual world even more exciting and fun!</p>'),
(13455, 'en-US', 'Update: Submarines in Rust will now only show up on sonar when the engine is on'),
(13456, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to Rust, which affects submarine mechanics: sonar markers will only appear when an enemy submarine\'s engine is running.'),
(13457, 'en-US', 'Rust game, update, submarines, sonar, engine, enemy'),
(13458, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the news about the update of the game Rust!</p><br/><br/><p> We are pleased to inform you about the latest changes to submarine mechanics. Now you will only see marks on your sonar if the enemy submarine\'s engine is running!</p><br/><br/><p> This is a significant update that will bring more realism and strategic decision to your experience. Previously, when a submarine was found, it would show up on the sonar regardless of engine status. Now, you will have to be more attentive and careful to understand whether an enemy submarine is active or not.</p><br/><br/><p> This change was made by the game developers in order to improve realism and create more tactical options for Rust players. Now you will be able to more accurately determine when and where the enemy may be and what actions to take.</p><br/><br/><p> We hope you enjoy this update and that it adds even more adrenaline and complexity to your game strategy. Stay tuned to stay up to date with the latest changes and improvements in Rust!</p>'),
(13459, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins for the game Rust on Steam. Variety and uniqueness of stylization, as well as advantages of skins in battle. Find out how to buy them and save on the purchase.'),
(13460, 'en-US', 'new batch, skins, game Rust, Steam, impressions, style, advantage, tactics, strategy, purchase, promotions, discounts, game collection'),
(13461, 'en-US', 'This fall, a large batch of new skins arrived in the game Rust on Steam! If you are a fan of this popular game, then be sure to check out our extensive collection of new and stylish skins for weapons, items and clothing.<br/><br/> We offer unique and varied options so that every player can find something to their liking. Exclusive skins from famous designers and authors promise to add new impressions and style to the game. The combination of bright colors, interesting patterns and carefully worked out details make our skins truly attractive.<br/><br/> But in addition to visual appeal, skins in the game Rust can also give an advantage in combat. Each skin can have its own features, such as increased damage or greater durability. Therefore, the choice of skins is also an important element of the tactics and strategy of the game.<br/><br/> How to buy skins? It\'s very simple! Visit our Steam page and check out the full range of new skins. We also regularly offer promotions and discounts, which allows you to save on your purchase and get even more pleasure from playing Rust.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your gaming collection with stylish and unique skins for Rust! Join our community on Steam and stay up to date with all new arrivals.'),
(13462, 'en-US', 'Latest development news'),
(13463, 'en-US', 'This article features the latest Rust development news and updates. Learn about the removal of torpedoes, work on new monuments, and other exciting changes.'),
(13464, 'en-US', 'development news, updates, game Rust, torpedoes, monuments, Hapis, M270 MLRS'),
(13465, 'en-US', '<h2>Latest development news</h2><br/><p> Here are the latest updates and news related to the development of the game Rust:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Removed rising torpedoes from the game because they were too powerful. There will now only be one type of torpedo in the game.</li><br/><li> Work has begun on new monuments - desert military bases. They will apparently appear in the desert, but no details are available yet.</li><br/><li> Work on updating and bringing back Hapis has resumed.</li><br/><li> Work has begun on the implementation of the controlled M270 MLRS - Multiple Launch Rocket System. Judging by the commits, players will be able to control this system. However, there are no details yet on how this will be implemented.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> To stay up to date with all the news and updates, you can follow the official Rust community on the VK social network.</p><br/><p><br/> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997200%2Fall\">Link to VK community</a><br/></p>'),
(13466, 'en-US', 'Rust update lets players deploy in a two-seater submarine'),
(13467, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update allows players to fully unleash their inner crew in the passenger seat of a two-seater submarine. Find out about the new features and benefits it brings.');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(13468, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, two-seater submarine, submarine deployment, gameplay improvements, underwater world of the game'),
(13469, 'en-US', '<p>A new update for Rust on Steam has brought improvements to the two-seater submarine, allowing players to fully turn around while in the passenger seat.</p><br/><p> Previously, players were limited in their movement in the submarine, which could complicate their gaming experience. However, the developers decided to take into account player feedback and add the ability to move completely freely inside the watercraft.</p><br/><p> Players can now sit comfortably in the passenger seat of a submarine and be able to turn in any direction to get a better view of the game\'s surroundings.</p><br/><p> This update not only improves gameplay, but also gives players more opportunities to interact inside the submarine. Now they can more effectively observe the environment, prepare for future battles, or simply enjoy the beauty of the underwater world.</p><br/><p> The update also opens up new opportunities for teamwork. Players can now command and cooperate more effectively within the submarine, improving the group\'s tactical capabilities and strengthening its position in the world of Rust.</p><br/><p> Although this is a small update, its impact on the gameplay experience of submarine players in Rust will be noticeable and will bring more pleasure and comfort when exploring the underwater world of this popular game.</p>'),
(13470, 'en-US', 'Check out the new batch of skins in Rust, offering a wide range of designs and in-game benefits, as well as the opportunity to support the game developers. Update your skin collection and give your character and environment a new and interesting look.'),
(13471, 'en-US', 'New Batch of Skins, Rust, Steam, Skins, Personality, Designs, Game Advantages, Developers, Update, Game Strategy'),
(13472, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to all fans of the game Rust on Steam! We have great news for you: a fresh batch of skins has appeared, which are already available for purchase in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> If you actively play Rust, you probably appreciate the individuality of your character and his environment. With the help of new skins, you can give your items, weapons and clothes a unique and stylish look.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes a wide range of designs, from classic and stylish to extravagant and futuristic. You will be able to express your individuality and attract the attention of other players, making your character truly unique.</p><br/><br/><p> But it’s not just looks that matter! Some skins can also have subtle in-game benefits, such as improved defense or increased accuracy. The updated batch of skins offer unique style combinations and features, allowing you to create your own strategy and playstyle.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget that skins are also a great way to support the game\'s developers. By purchasing new skins, you also help fund the continued development of Rust and the addition of new content.</p><br/><br/><p> So don\'t miss the opportunity to update your skin collection and give your character and environment a new and interesting look. Check out what the new batch of skins in the game Rust on Steam offers and highlight your individuality in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(13473, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update Review with Developer Comments'),
(13474, 'en-US', 'Watch a review of the new Rust update on the popular video hosting site YouTube. In the video, the developers share the latest news about the latest changes and improvements in the game, as well as share their comments and advice.'),
(13475, 'en-US', 'review, update, game Rust, developers, youtube, weapons, locations, changes, updates, tips'),
(13476, 'en-US', '<p>Watch a review of the new Rust game update on the popular video hosting YouTube. In this video, the developers share the latest news about the latest changes and improvements in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> In the video, you will learn about new weapons, updated locations and other interesting additions that will pleasantly surprise you. In addition, the developers share their comments and opinions on the new changes, explaining why they were made and how they will affect the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> This review is a great opportunity to stay up to date with all the latest Rust updates and understand what changes are expected in the next updates. Also in the video you can find unique tips and advice from the developers that will help you cope with new challenges in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss this exciting Rust update preview to stay up to date with the latest news and developments in the gaming world.</p>'),
(13477, 'en-US', 'Update Review: Rust - Attack on Jack Shuck\'s Base'),
(13478, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust saw an epic attack on Jack Shuck\'s base. In the new video, you can see all the changes and learn the tactics and strategy for a successful attack. Subscribe to our channel and stay updated in the world of Rust!'),
(13479, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, attack on base, Jack Shuck, video, tactics, strategy'),
(13480, 'en-US', 'In the latest update of the game Rust, the developers have made many changes that will bring a fresh wind into the world of survival. One of the most exciting updates is the attack on the base of Jack Shuck, which has become a real challenge for players.<br/><br/> In the new video, you will be able to see this grand attack in action and all the changes that have been made to the game. Step by step, you will go through the attack plan, assess the scale of the buildings and the weapons that need to be used to overcome the base\'s defenses.<br/><br/> This update will help you better understand the tactics and strategy in the game Rust. You will learn which tools and weapons are most effective in destroying the enemy base, as well as which tactics to choose to successfully cope with defensive measures.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss this exciting update preview to stay up to date with all the changes happening in the world of Rust, including what new opportunities players will have and what challenges they will face.<br/><br/> Subscribe to our channel and stay tuned to be prepared for new challenges in the world of Rust!'),
(13481, 'en-US', 'There will be no Twitch Drop in August'),
(13482, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Skin Distribution Information for August'),
(13483, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drop, August, Giveaway, Skins, Twitch Drops, Rust'),
(13484, 'en-US', '<p>Dear players of the game Rust on Steam!</p><br/><p> We regret to inform you that there will be no active Twitch Drops in August. The expected skin giveaways via Twitch Drops have been postponed indefinitely.</p><br/><p> Some technical decisions were made related to updating and optimizing the game, which required a temporary break in Twitch Drops in August.</p><br/><p> We understand that Twitch Drops are an important part of our player experience, and we apologize for any inconvenience caused by the lack of drops in August.</p><br/><p> We are working hard to bring back Twitch Drops as soon as possible and make them better and more exciting for all of our players. We thank you for your patience and support.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned for more Twitch Drops skin giveaways on our official communities and communication platforms.</p><br/><p> Sincerely, The Rust Development Team</p>'),
(13485, 'en-US', 'Rust\'s Caves Will Get a Complete Overhaul'),
(13486, 'en-US', 'In a future update to Rust, caves will undergo a complete overhaul. They will become completely procedural, which will add uniqueness and randomization to each map.'),
(13487, 'en-US', 'Rust, caves, procedural generation, update, randomization'),
(13488, 'en-US', '<p>In a future update to Rust, caves will undergo a complete overhaul. Instead of pre-set cave variants with a known route, they will become completely procedural. Just like with underground tunnels and underwater labs.</p><br/><p> This means that each map will have unique caves with different routes and places to build. Details about the date of the cave update are not yet known, but it is likely that work on it will begin after the release of the current update. The game developers continue their efforts to randomize the content on the map.</p>'),
(13489, 'en-US', 'Rust Update Review: New Map, Weapons, and Game Mechanics'),
(13490, 'en-US', 'Find out about all the key changes that came with the Rust update on Steam: a new map, various weapons, and unique game mechanics.'),
(13491, 'en-US', 'Rust update, new map, weapons, game mechanics, survival, adventure, Steam'),
(13492, 'en-US', '<p>The world-famous game Rust on Steam pleases its fans again with a new update! In this article, we will look at all the key changes that appeared in the game and significantly affected the gameplay.</p><br/><p> One of the most notable innovations was the appearance of a completely new map. Now players have a huge world full of various locations and interesting places to explore. Every corner of the map is imbued with a unique atmosphere and secrets, which makes the gameplay even more exciting and unpredictable.</p><br/><p> In addition to the new map, the update also includes a variety of new weapons that allow players to diversify their tactics in combat. From classic small arms to modern experimental prototypes, everyone will find their ideal weapon for survival in this dangerous territory.</p><br/><p> But the changes are not limited to new maps and weapons. The update also introduces unique game mechanics that further immerse players in the game world. Now, every decision made has its consequences, and the choice between survival and socialization becomes even more difficult. Every player action affects the game world and its employees, making the gameplay even more realistic and adventurous.</p><br/><p> In conclusion, it is worth noting that the Rust update on Steam not only improves the gameplay, but also offers players new opportunities for creativity. The improved building editor allows you to create even more unique and protected bases, which makes survival in the world of Rust even more interesting and varied.</p><br/><p> If you\'re looking for new challenges and unforgettable adventures, the Rust update on Steam is the perfect choice for you. Discover a new world where every step is filled with danger and opportunity, and set out to survive and thrive in the vastest wasteland.</p>'),
(13493, 'en-US', 'Rust Update 3.5.0 Review'),
(13494, 'en-US', 'Rust Update 3.5.0 Overview. Learn about new features, weapons, improvements, and optimizations that make the gameplay more interesting and exciting.'),
(13495, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, version 3.5.0, innovations, sniper rifle, building system, character progression, optimization, gameplay'),
(13496, 'en-US', '<p>In the new update of the game Rust - version 3.5.0 - the developers have added many new features and improvements that will make the gameplay even more exciting and interesting.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the key innovations is the addition of a new type of weapon - a sniper rifle. Now players will be able to fight at long distances and deliver accurate and powerful shots. This will provide an opportunity for a variety of tactical decisions when interacting with other players.</p><br/><br/><p> The construction and basing system has also been reworked. Players can now create more reliable and functional fortifications. Thanks to new materials and the ability to improve structures, bases will become more resistant to attacks and hacking.</p><br/><br/><p> Other changes include an improved character progression system. Players will now receive more varied and interesting rewards for their achievements in the game. This will allow them to progress more quickly and feel more powerful in the world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, the developers paid attention to the optimization of the game. Many errors were fixed and performance was improved, which will make the game smoother and more comfortable for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> Update 3.5.0 in the game Rust is a serious step forward in the development of the project. New features, weapons, improvements and optimizations will make the gameplay more exciting and thrilling.</p>'),
(13497, 'en-US', 'Ghost Items and Construction - New Rust Game Update'),
(13498, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam introduces ghost items and an improved building system. Learn about the new features and tradeoffs associated with these changes.'),
(13499, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, ghost items, building system, changes, compromises, balance, realism, players\' opinions'),
(13500, 'en-US', 'Hello to all fans of the game Rust! We are pleased to inform you about the latest update of the game, which brought several interesting changes and innovations to the gameplay. One of the key aspects of this update was the ability to create and use ghost items, as well as an improved construction system.<br/><br/> An important factor in the game Rust has always been the construction of various buildings and bases. With the latest update, the developers have added a new feature - ghost items. This means that you can now pre-place items, view their location and calculate the optimal placement before you start building. This greatly simplifies and speeds up the construction process, as it allows you to save resources and avoid mistakes.<br/><br/> In addition, the developers have also made changes to the construction system itself. Now you have the ability to create bridges and other complex structures, which expands your options when creating bases and buildings. The use of ghostly objects and the new construction system allow you to bring your boldest architectural ideas to life.<br/><br/> However, as with any game, changes and new features can have both positive and negative sides. For example, consider ghost items. Although they make the building process much easier, some players may feel that it simplifies the game too much and deprives it of realism. Also, the new building system can be a challenge for players who are already accustomed to the old system and do not want to change their strategies.<br/><br/> It is important to note that the developers of the Rust game always strive to find a balance between simplifying the gameplay and maintaining the complexity and realism of the game. Careful study of player opinions and conducting tests allows them to make decisions that take into account the interests of a wide audience.<br/><br/> So, the new update of the Rust game has brought ghost items and an improved construction system to the game, opening up new possibilities for players. However, as always, changes have their trade-offs and cause discussions among players. It is necessary to remember that the developers of the Rust game always strive to find a balance and take into account the opinions and interests of the general audience.'),
(13501, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update Review May 12, 2021'),
(13502, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update adds new objects, changes to weapons and ammunition, rebalances the economy and improves the game\'s graphics and performance.'),
(13503, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, innovations, objects, buildings weapons, ammunition, economy, graphics, performance'),
(13504, 'en-US', '<p>Last week, the developers of the game Rust released a new update that brought a number of interesting changes and additions. In this article, we will look at the main innovations, and also discuss their impact on the gameplay and the game economy.</p><br/><br/><h2> New objects and buildings</h2><br/><p> One of the main aspects of the update is the addition of new objects and buildings. Players will now be able to create unique structures such as trading tents, volcanic vents, and dark temples. Each of these objects has its own characteristics and can be used for various strategies and tactics.</p><br/><br/><h2> Changes in weapons and ammunition</h2><br/><p> The update also included changes to weapons and ammunition. Some weapons can now deal more damage and have new modification options. In addition, new types of ammunition have been added, which will allow players to become even more effective in combat.</p><br/><br/><h2> Balancing the economy</h2><br/><p> In order to improve the game balance, the developers have rebalanced the economy in Rust. Now some resources will become more accessible, and others - rarer. This will make the game more dynamic and diverse, and will also increase the players\' opportunities in trading and creating their own base.</p><br/><br/><h2> Improvements in graphics and performance</h2><br/><p> The update also includes improvements to the game\'s graphics and performance. Players will now be able to enjoy more realistic graphics, as well as more stable game performance on various computer configurations.</p><br/><br/><h2> Conclusion</h2><br/><p> The Rust game update from May 12, 2021 has a significant impact on the gameplay and the game economy. New objects and buildings, changes in weapons and ammunition, balancing of the economy, improvements in graphics and performance - all this allows players to enjoy even more interesting and varied gameplay. If you have not tried the update yet, we recommend that you do so and see all the new features it offers.</p>'),
(13505, 'en-US', 'Rust Update Preview: Video from the Dev Blog Show'),
(13506, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam adds new maps, changes to the progression and crafting systems, as well as performance improvements and bug fixes. Find out more in the video from the Dev Blog show on the official Rust channel.'),
(13507, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, Steam, Dev Blog, game, changes, bases, recipes, video'),
(13508, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam continues to delight its fans with new updates and improvements. In the latest episode of the Dev Blog show, the developers presented new features and changes that await players.</p><br/><p> One of the main announcements was the addition of a new map, which is divided into different biomes with unique landscapes and resources. Now players will be able to explore a variety of surrounding worlds and find new opportunities for survival.</p><br/><p> In addition, the developers have made changes to the progression and crafting system. Now players will be able to more flexibly develop their characters and create not only weapons and protection, but also various items for buildings and decor. New materials and recipes will allow you to create more unique and individual bases.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that the developers are also paying attention to improving the game\'s performance and fixing bugs. This will help make the game more stable and enjoyable for players. In addition, new mechanics have been introduced and the game\'s balance has been corrected to ensure a more balanced and interesting gaming experience.</p><br/><p> If you want to learn more about all the changes and innovations, we suggest you watch the video from the Dev Blog show on the official Rust Steam channel. Don\'t miss the opportunity to stay up to date with all the updates and events in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(13509, 'en-US', 'News related to the update of the game Rust: Sharks and fishing'),
(13510, 'en-US', 'The sharks in Rust currently have a few bugs, but the harpoon is fully functional. Fishing has also been added to the game with different types of fish and the ability to sell the catch. The harpoon and fishing rod do not have a crafting cost yet. The underwater update will be released on August 5.'),
(13511, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, sharks, fishing, harpoon, innovations'),
(13512, 'en-US', 'The sharks are currently unfinished and have a few bugs (you might even see sharks hovering over land to chase their prey if you check out the test branch before it gets fixed), but the harpoon is fully functional and works well against sharks. But they\'re not the only fish that\'s been added to the game, as Rust now has full-fledged fishing.<br/><br/> Fishing works quite simply - you put the catch on the hook, throw it into the water, wait for someone to bite, and pull it out, but watch - if you overdo it, the fish will break away. The indicator in the middle will show the current pressure on the line and maintaining balance you will definitely catch someone. Salmon, sardine, small trout, anchovy, herring, small shark and bass were added from the fish. Some of them live only in rivers, so the fishing spot is also important.<br/><br/> Caught some fish? You can sell it in fishing villages and get scrap metal - I won\'t add the exchange cost here yet, as it will 100% change closer to the release.<br/><br/> The harpoon and fishing rod do not have a crafting cost yet, but this will be fixed soon.<br/><br/> The underwater update will be released on August 5 at 21:00 Moscow time.<br/> https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997175%2Fall'),
(13513, 'en-US', 'The underwater game update is available on the test branch!'),
(13514, 'en-US', 'Sharks, fishing, submarines, underwater laboratories and a harpoon - all this awaits you in the new underwater update of the game Rust, which is already available on the test branch!'),
(13515, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, underwater labs, sharks, fishing, submarines, harpoon, loot'),
(13516, 'en-US', 'Sharks, fishing, submarines, underwater labs, harpoon and fish - the underwater game update is available on the test branch!<br/><br/> The water expanses are significantly expanded, and now the seabed becomes a more interesting place for research - underwater you can find underwater laboratories. All over the map spawn 4-6 such laboratories (depending on the size of the map) and in them you can find a lot of loot and puzzles for all levels of access cards.<br/><br/> The loot here looks a little different - there are almost no usual loot boxes like on other monuments, and you will have to run your eyes over the shelves a little to find what items are there. At the moment, you will be able to find both regular loot in the form of components, and elite boxes with rockets and ammo of all types. But everything can change, this is not the final version of the loot!<br/><br/> Keep in mind that each lab will look different. These monuments are procedurally generated and will differ structurally from each other. However, they are also full of NPCs that you could previously encounter in the underground tunnels, so you will not be alone there...<br/><br/> How to get to the underwater labs? There is a familiar option - take flippers, a suit, a mask, an air tank and swim to the bottom, but you will be met by sharks there. They are fast and without a spear gun (aka harpoon) you will most likely go to the next world. No harpoon? There is a safe option - submarines. They are sold in fishing villages and they are divided into two types, for 1 and 2 players. With them, you can safely move around the water and get to the underwater labs as quickly as possible.'),
(13517, 'en-US', 'A little bit about the updates'),
(13518, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest updates to Rust, including the addition of new submarine storage, a change to the tarp model, and an improved fishing system.'),
(13519, 'en-US', 'updates, Rust, storage, torpedo, boat, tarpaulin, fishing, junk'),
(13520, 'en-US', '<p>Hello all Rust players! Today we want to share with you some exciting news about the latest updates to the game.</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> Added torpedo storage to the submarine for two players</li><br/><li> The tarpaulin model has been changed</li><br/><li> Improved fishing system: now, if you use meat and fish as bait, you will not catch junk on your fishing rod. Junk is considered inanimate objects, such as a bucket of water, a bottle of water, and flippers.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> These updates bring new features and improvements to Rust, making it an even more fun experience for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> To find out more details about each of the updates, you can visit the official game page on <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997171%2Fall\">the VKontakte social network</a> .</p><br/><br/><p> We hope that your gaming sessions will become even more exciting with these new improvements. Good luck in the game!</p>'),
(13521, 'en-US', 'New Skins in the Game Rust: Review and Rating'),
(13522, 'en-US', 'In our review, we will look at the new skins in the game Rust, evaluate their appearance, rarity and popularity among players. Find out which skins can make your gaming experience more unique and exciting!'),
(13523, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust, review, rating, cosmetic skins, appearance, rarity, animations, selection, community, survival, gaming experience'),
(13524, 'en-US', '<p>If you are a fan of the game Rust, then you are probably interested in learning about the new skins that were added in the latest update. In this article, we will look at the variety of new skins and give our assessment of each of them.</p><br/><br/><p> Cosmetic skins are an important part of the Rust gaming experience. They allow each player to stand out and add personality to their character and items. However, with regular updates, hundreds of new skins are added to the game, which can make it difficult to choose.</p><br/><br/><p> In our review, we will look at new skins for weapons, armor, tools and other game items. We will analyze their appearance, the quality of textures and animations, as well as the durability and rarity of each skin.</p><br/><br/><p> When evaluating new skins, we\'ll take into account factors such as Steam Market price, player popularity, and value for money. We\'ll also include community opinion in our review to help you make the right choice.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins in Rust offer unique visual effects and can increase your chances of survival in the hostile world of the game. We will conduct a comprehensive analysis of each new skin so that you can determine which one best suits you and your playstyle.</p><br/><br/><p> So don\'t miss our review of new skins in the game Rust - find out about the most interesting and high-quality skins that can make your gaming experience even more exciting and unique!</p>'),
(13525, 'en-US', 'Streamer drops in Rust will be available to everyone on the last day of the round'),
(13526, 'en-US', 'Streamer drops in Rust will be available to all players on the last day of each round. Now you can get exclusive skins and items by watching any stream on this day. Find out more in our article!'),
(13527, 'en-US', 'Streamer Drops, Twitch Drops, Streamer Skins, Exclusive Items, Last Day of Round'),
(13528, 'en-US', '<p>Streamer drops in Rust will be available to all players on the last day of each round. This means you can get exclusive skins and items by watching any stream on that day.</p><br/><p> According to developer Alistair, known for his statements on Twitter, in the next rounds of Twitch Drops, all streamer skins will be transferred to the general category. This decision was made to reduce the pressure on content creators and viewers. However, Alistair notes that in the future, this approach may be changed if it does not bring the expected results.</p><br/><p> This change will allow more players to earn exclusive items without having to be tied to specific streamers or events. Now everyone will be able to easily get loot, even if the round is already ending.</p><br/><p> For more information and discussion of this news, visit the official Rust community on Steam.</p>'),
(13529, 'en-US', 'Rust Update Review: Breaking Down the Major Changes'),
(13530, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust on Steam brings a ton of exciting changes, including new building and repair mechanics, weapon and gear balancing, new items and resources, improved progression, and bug fixes. Find out how these changes will impact your Rust gameplay and experience.'),
(13531, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, Steam, game, changes, building mechanics, repair, balancing, weapons, equipment, items, resources, progression system, character development, errors, performance'),
(13532, 'en-US', '<h2>Rust Update Review: Breaking Down the Major Changes</h2><br/><br/><p> The new update to the game Rust on Steam has brought a lot of interesting changes that will certainly affect the gameplay and gaming experience of millions of players. Let\'s take a look at the main changes you should know.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>1. New mechanics of construction and repair</b></p><br/><p> First of all, the developers have made changes to the mechanics of building and repairing structures. Now players have more opportunities to create fortified bases and protect their property. New materials and tools will make construction even more exciting and diverse.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>2. Balancing weapons and equipment</b></p><br/><p> In addition to changes to construction, the update brought changes to the balance of weapons and equipment. Some weapons became more effective, while others became less powerful. Now players must carefully select their equipment and use strategy in combat to achieve success.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>3. Adding new items and resources</b></p><br/><p> The new update brings new items and resources that are sure to bring some freshness to the Rust game world. This could be anything from new weapons and armor to various decorative items that will allow you to decorate your base and give it a unique look.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>4. Improved character progression and development system</b></p><br/><p> The developers also did not forget about improving the character progression and development system. Now players will have more opportunities to develop their character, opening new skills and improvements. Deeper and more diverse progress will allow you to create a unique character and adapt to various game situations.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>5. Bug fixes and performance improvements</b></p><br/><p> In addition to the new changes, the developers have also fixed a number of bugs and improved the game\'s performance. This will allow you to enjoy a smoother and more stable gaming session, reducing the likelihood of problems and freezes.</p><br/><br/><p> The update to the game Rust on Steam certainly brought many interesting changes that will affect the gameplay and create new opportunities for players. Be prepared for new challenges and discover all the benefits of the update to fully immerse yourself in the amazing world of Rust!</p>'),
(13533, 'en-US', 'New Skin of Streamer Nmplol in Rust Game on Steam'),
(13534, 'en-US', 'Find out about the replacement of streamer Nmplol\'s skin in the game Rust on Steam due to plagiarism and the importance of original content. Details and other news about skins in the game Rust are available on the official page of the VKontakte group.'),
(13535, 'en-US', 'skin, streamer, Nmplol, Rust, Steam, plagiarism, news'),
(13536, 'en-US', '<p>There\'s some exciting news for Rust players on Steam! The Nmplol streamer skin that previously caused quite a stir has been replaced with a new version. The reason for the skin\'s replacement is due to the discovery of a plagiarism of its previous version.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that the developers of the Rust game always strive to create unique and original content. In light of this, detection of plagiarism is a serious violation and can have negative consequences for the authors of the original skins.</p><br/><p> The skin change was an inevitable measure to eliminate the problem of plagiarism and maintain the uniqueness of the game content. The new skin of the streamer Nmplol is a fresh design that will attract the attention of players and allow them to stand out from other characters in the game.</p><br/><p> Rust players on Steam can rest assured that the developers are taking all necessary measures to ensure the quality and originality of the game\'s content. Changing the skin of streamer Nmplol is just one of many steps in this direction.</p><br/><p> To read more news about added skins and updates to the Rust game, you can visit the official VKontakte group <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a> .</p>'),
(13537, 'en-US', 'Removed streamers npmlol and TheWillNeff drops from the round'),
(13538, 'en-US', 'Attention! Drops from streamers npmlol and TheWillNeff have been temporarily removed from the round. Find out the reasons and possible return of drops in our article.'),
(13539, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, streamers, npmlol, TheWillNeff, drops, Twitch'),
(13540, 'en-US', '<p>Attention! Drops from streamers npmlol and TheWillNeff have been temporarily removed from the round.</p><br/><br/><p> According to the latest updates, the drops of these streamers are currently unavailable, most likely due to temporary reasons. Let\'s look at the details:</p><br/><br/><p> <b>Skin npmlol:</b></p><br/><p> It should be noted that the npmlol skin used a pattern that violates copyright. However, the author of the skin is already working on creating a new version, after which the drop will return, but in a different form.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>TheWillNeff:</b></p><br/><p> TheWillNeff has been banned from Twitch. Alistair, a representative of the developers, has already stated that they are trying to contact Twitch regarding this ban. He believes that it was unfair and purposeful. But it is unclear whether the streamer will return before the end of the drop. TheWillNeff himself said that he was most likely banned for talking to a user who was also banned from this platform.</p><br/><br/><p> <b>Update:</b></p><br/><p> WillNeff has a three-day ban, but the developers will not remove his drop and will make it available when watching any stream. However, for now we can only wait for his return.</p><br/><br/><p> If you\'re interested in this topic, you can read more on the <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997164%2Fall\">Rust Steam community</a> page .</p>'),
(13541, 'en-US', 'Torpedoes may appear'),
(13542, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest update to the game Rust, which may bring a unique innovation - torpedoes. Learn about the capabilities, problems and balancing of this new element of the game world.'),
(13543, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, torpedoes, sea battle, survival'),
(13544, 'en-US', '<p>The new Rust game update may bring an amazing innovation - the appearance of torpedoes! This potential added element will allow players to explore and immerse themselves in an even more exciting and realistic world of survival.</p><br/><br/><p> Torpedoes will provide players with completely new opportunities for exploring the waters and waging naval battles. They can be used to capture enemy ships, destroy water bases, or simply explore the ocean depths. The possibilities that torpedoes will open up for players are limitless.</p><br/><br/><p> However, adding such a powerful weapon can also bring new challenges. Balancing torpedoes and their impact on gameplay will be a key consideration for the developers. It is necessary to make sure that torpedoes are powerful enough to be interesting for players, but not completely dominate other aspects of the game. The balancing and decision-making process will be filled with compromises and continuous exploration of game mechanics.</p><br/><br/><p> It is also important to consider the influence that the player community can have on decision-making. Their feedback, suggestions, and views on the implementation of torpedoes in the game can play a decisive role in how this feature is implemented and how successful it is.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, the introduction of torpedoes into Rust can open up a new dimension of survival and great opportunities for players. However, it is important to remember the need for balancing and taking into account the community\'s perception. Look forward to the update and get ready to dive into the exciting world of sea adventures in Rust!</p>'),
(13545, 'en-US', 'First look at the harpoon and underwater laboratories'),
(13546, 'en-US', 'Details on the harpoon, underwater labs and other new features in the Rust game update.'),
(13547, 'en-US', 'harpoon, underwater labs, game Rust, updates'),
(13548, 'en-US', '<h2>First look at the harpoon and underwater laboratories</h2><br/><p> In the near future, the game Rust will be expanded with new features - underwater laboratories will appear, which will be generated procedurally on each map, similar to underground tunnels. They will become a new unique monument, available both for diving in a submarine and for independent exploration.</p><br/><p> The game\'s water world will gain a new dimension with the addition of a harpoon to your gear. You\'ll eagerly track down the first ocean fauna and maybe even encounter a shark... or two.</p><br/><p> Submarines will be available for purchase in fishing villages. This is all the information we have at this time, and it is likely that the submarine and underwater lab upgrade will be available for testing later this month, but no exact timeframe has been set.</p>'),
(13549, 'en-US', 'Added the ability to place small signs on boxes in Rust'),
(13550, 'en-US', 'The ability to place small signs on crates in Rust has been added to the Staging branch. This new feature allows players to organize and label their inventory, making it easier to interact and exchange items.'),
(13551, 'en-US', 'Rust updates, small signs, boxes, Staging branch'),
(13552, 'en-US', 'Rust has a new feature on the Staging branch - players can now place small signs on their crates. This opens up new possibilities for organizing and labeling supplies, as well as interacting with other players. Small signs give players the ability to write small notes or directions about the contents of a crate, making it easier to navigate your storage and exchange items. It\'s a small but important change that will help players be more organized and efficient in the Rust game world.'),
(13553, 'en-US', 'Fishing in development'),
(13554, 'en-US', 'Fishing is a new update to the Rust game that will significantly increase the importance of the ocean in the game. Details about the development of fishing and the release date can be found on the page vk.com/rustcommru.'),
(13555, 'en-US', 'fishing, Rust, update, development, ocean, game, content'),
(13556, 'en-US', '<p>All fans of the game Rust have been waiting for the addition of new game content for a long time, and finally, the developers have released information about the upcoming update - fishing! Judging by the comments, the development of this feature began in May and is still ongoing.</p><br/><p> The official release date has not been announced yet, but it is already clear that the addition of fishing to the game will have a significant impact on the gameplay. It will add a new opportunity for players to use the ocean in the game, making it more meaningful and interesting.</p><br/><p> Details about the new feature can be found on the page <a href=\"https://vk.com/rustcommru\">https://vk.com/rustcommru</a> . There you can find out about the current state of fishing development, as well as follow the news about game updates.</p>'),
(13557, 'en-US', 'New weekly skins'),
(13558, 'en-US', 'Every week new unique skins appear in the game Rust. Update your wardrobe and add individuality to your characters and items. Details in the article!'),
(13559, 'en-US', 'new skins, weekly skins, game Rust, Steam, updates, skin collection'),
(13560, 'en-US', 'A new batch of unique weekly skins for the game Rust has been released on Steam!'),
(13561, 'en-US', 'Streamer List Announced for Next Round of Twitch Drops'),
(13562, 'en-US', 'The list of streamers for the next round of Twitch Drops has been announced, which will begin today at 21:00 Moscow time.'),
(13563, 'en-US', 'Announcement, Streamer List, Next Round, Twitch Drops, Skins'),
(13564, 'en-US', 'The list of streamers who will take part in the new round of Twitch Drops has been announced. Among them are such famous and popular streamers as xQc, Voyboy, Pokimane, Sykkuno, Myth, nmplol, sonii, ludwig, ariasaki, Trainwreck, TheWillNeff, cyr, riqqeloff and SinksR. If you want to get unique skins, then don’t miss the tenth round, which will start today, July 15, at 21:00 Moscow time.'),
(13565, 'en-US', 'Underwater Labs and Submarines: Coming Soon to Rust'),
(13566, 'en-US', 'Learn about the development of underwater labs and submarines in Rust, as well as the upcoming appearance of underwater animals, including a shark, in the new update.'),
(13567, 'en-US', 'underwater labs, submarines, underwater animals, shark, update, Rust'),
(13568, 'en-US', '<p>Underwater labs and submarines are in full swing in Rust, and it looks like the first underwater animals, including a shark, will be coming in the next update.</p><br/><br/><p> But the exact release date for this underwater update is still unknown, and it is unknown whether it will be included in the game\'s August patch. In other words, fans will have to wait for more information.</p><br/><br/><p> Stay tuned to our website to be the first to know about important updates to the Rust game and the appearance of underwater laboratories and submarines!</p>'),
(13569, 'en-US', 'STREAM go take the guys - news and updates in the game Rust on Steam'),
(13570, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news and updates for Rust on Steam. The developers strive to make the game better by adding new features, fixing bugs, and balancing the game mechanics. Learn about the impact of updates on gameplay and how they affect your experience. Stay up to date with all the changes and succeed in this brutal world of survival.'),
(13571, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, game, updates, news, balancing, compromises, changes, developers, game mechanics'),
(13572, 'en-US', '<h2>News and updates in the game Rust on Steam</h2><br/><p> Anyone who plays Rust on Steam knows that it is a gripping survival world where every minute can cost you your life or lead to wealth and prosperity. Every updated patch, every additional feature, every change in game mechanics - all of this affects us, the players, and our survival strategies.</p><br/><p> This is what we will talk about in this article. We will tell you about the latest news and updates in the game Rust, which will help you to stay up to date with all the changes and develop along with the game.</p><br/><h3> Updates in the game Rust</h3><br/><p> With each new update, the developers try to make the game better, improve graphics, fix bugs, add new features and much more. Updates in Rust on Steam are not just fixing bugs, but also constant development of the game, adding new features and content.</p><br/><p> An update was recently released that added new weapons, additional building materials, and improved hostile NPC AI. Our team has looked into these changes and prepared a detailed analysis of each for you.</p><br/><h3> Balancing and compromises</h3><br/><p> All changes and updates in the game Rust are carefully considered by the developers. They strive to find the right balance between realism, satisfying the needs of players and saving game progress.</p><br/><p> Balancing a game is a complex task that requires constant analysis of data, player feedback, and suggestions. The developers of Rust on Steam actively communicate with their users to understand their needs and offer the best solutions.</p><br/><h3> Impact of updates on gameplay</h3><br/><p> Every update in Rust has an impact on the gameplay. Changes in game mechanics, new features and items, improvements to interaction with the surrounding world - all this affects our experience of the game and our perception of the game world.</p><br/><p> Developers try to take into account the wishes and suggestions of players in order to create the most satisfying game experience. However, when deciding on changes, they must consider many factors, such as the balance between game classes, the level of difficulty, and the role of randomness, in order to ensure an interesting and balanced gameplay.</p><br/><h3> Conclusion</h3><br/><p> Rust on Steam is constantly evolving and updating, and this is an amazing opportunity for us, players, to immerse ourselves in the exciting world of survival. New features, fixes and additional content make the game even more interesting and diverse.</p><br/><p> Follow our news and updates to stay up to date with all the changes and improvements in the game Rust. Together we can create a unique gaming experience and achieve high results in this cruel world.</p>'),
(13573, 'en-US', 'Information about Twitch Drops transfer to Rust'),
(13574, 'en-US', 'Find out about Twitch Drops in Rust postponed to July 15 and get unique skins for your character. Details here!'),
(13575, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Transfer, Skins, Event, New Date, Info'),
(13576, 'en-US', '<p>An important announcement for all Rust fans! The next Twitch Drops, which was scheduled for July 12th, has been postponed to July 15th. Be sure to mark this date in your calendar!</p><br/><br/><p> The new event start date is July 15th at 21:00 Moscow time. Make sure you\'re connected to Twitch and ready to get unique skins for your Rust character!</p><br/><br/><p> Details about the promotion and a link to the source can be found on <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?z=photo-201926997457239051%2Falbum-20192699700%2Frev\">this page</a> .</p>'),
(13577, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust Game on Steam'),
(13578, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam has new skins that let you decorate and customize your base, weapons, and other items in the game. Learn more about the new skins and how they affect your gaming experience.'),
(13579, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust, Steam, store, gaming experience'),
(13580, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam has new skins that will allow you to decorate and customize your base, weapons, and other items in the game. The new skins offer a wide range of styles and designs to suit all players. They can add a unique look and personality to your gaming experience and will allow you to stand out from other players.<br/><br/> These new skins are available in the Steam store or can be found in-game. You can view the full range of new skins on <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?z=photo-201926997457239050%2Falbum-20192699700%2Frev\">vk.com</a> . There you will find different categories of skins such as weapons, clothing, buildings and more.<br/><br/> In addition, new skins can have not only aesthetic value, but also affect game mechanics. Some skins can improve weapon characteristics or provide additional bonuses. Therefore, when choosing new skins, pay attention not only to their appearance, but also to their functionality.<br/><br/> However, when using new skins, it is worth considering that they can be the subject of trading or selling between players. This can lead to changes in the prices of skins and the creation of speculation in the market. Therefore, be careful when making decisions about buying or selling skins.<br/><br/> Overall, the new skins are a great way for Rust players on Steam to add variety and personality to their game. They offer the opportunity to decorate your base and show off your creative side. So feel free to experiment with the new skins and create a unique gaming experience.'),
(13581, 'en-US', 'All Twitch Drops Skins!'),
(13582, 'en-US', 'Learn all about Twitch Drops skins in Rust. This article offers a complete list of unique skins available through Twitch Drops and explains how to get them.'),
(13583, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops skins, Rust skins, Twitch Drops, new skins, unique skins'),
(13584, 'en-US', '<p>If you are a fan of the game Rust and want to decorate your base or character with new and unique skins, then you have come to the right place! We have collected for you a complete list of skins available through the Twitch Drops program.</p><br/><p> Now you don\'t have to search through individual pages or watch tons of videos to learn how to get these rare items. We\'ve collected all the skins you can get through Twitch Drops in one place.</p><br/><p> In this list you will find a variety of skins for weapons, armor, tools and much more. Each skin is unique and has its own style and design. You will be able to choose exactly those items that suit your taste and make your character even more stylish and unique.</p><br/><p> To get these skins, you need to be a Twitch Drops subscriber and follow special streams and events that are held by the game developers. For watching these streams and participating in events, you will be rewarded with unique skins that cannot be obtained in any other way.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your gaming collection with new Rust skins, which are available via Twitch Drops! Join the community and stay up to date with all the new events and rewards in the game. Unique skins are waiting for you!</p>'),
(13585, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops!'),
(13586, 'en-US', 'An article about Twitch Drops - an opportunity to get exclusive skins for the game Rust on Steam through streams on Twitch.'),
(13587, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust Skins, Steam, Streams, Twitch'),
(13588, 'en-US', 'In this article, we will tell you about Twitch Drops - a unique opportunity to get exclusive skins for the game Rust on Steam just for watching streams on the Twitch platform! Currently, 5 skins are available, but this is just the beginning! Stay up to date with the news, follow the updates and do not miss the opportunity to get unique items for your hero in Rust.'),
(13589, 'en-US', 'List of streamers participating in Twitch Drops'),
(13590, 'en-US', 'Get exclusive Rust skins with Twitch Drops! Find out which popular streamers will be streaming and sharing game tips.'),
(13591, 'en-US', 'streamers, Twitch Drops, Rust, skins, broadcasts, exclusive, account');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(13592, 'en-US', '<h2>List of streamers who will be participating in Twitch Drops!</h2><br/><p> If you are into the game Rust and want to get exclusive skins, then you are in luck!</p><br/><p> The following list features popular streamers who will be streaming Rust with Twitch Drops.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Streamer1 - Streamer1 is expected to host a long stream of Rust where he will unlock various Twitch Drops skins and share base building tips.</li><br/><li> Streamer2 - Streamer2 positions himself as an expert in PvP battles in Rust. In his broadcast, you can see epic battles and get a chance to Twitch Drops skins.</li><br/><li> Streamer3 - Author of strategy guides for the game Rust. If you want to learn how to build effective bases, then this stream is perfect for you.</li><br/><li> Streamer4 - An experienced Rust player who often hosts tournaments and competitions. Subscribe to his streams and get Twitch Drops of skins while watching the broadcast.</li><br/><li> Streamer5 - Streamer5 will be participating in official Rust events where there will be a chance to get exclusive Twitch Drops skins. Don\'t miss the event!</li><br/></ul><br/><p> Be sure to follow Rust on Twitch for the latest news and information about future Twitch Drops events.</p>'),
(13593, 'en-US', 'Independence Day on the Steam Store: Fireworks Kits Available!'),
(13594, 'en-US', 'In honor of Independence Day, fireworks sets are now available for purchase in the Steam store. The festive collection of fireworks sets offers a wide selection of different pyrotechnics that will help you create a bright and unforgettable light show in honor of this holiday. Find out more about the available sets and their effects in our article.'),
(13595, 'en-US', 'Independence Day, Steam Store, Fireworks Kits, Celebration, Pyrotechnics'),
(13596, 'en-US', '<p>Celebrating Independence Day is a special time when we gather with loved ones, cook delicious food, and enjoy fireworks. And now we can add a special atmosphere to the holiday with new fireworks sets that are now available in the Steam Store!</p><br/><p> The Festive Fireworks Kit Collection on the Steam Store features a wide variety of pyrotechnics to create unforgettable light shows and fill the sky with bright lights to celebrate Independence Day.</p><br/><p> The sets contain everything you need to launch fireworks successfully. From colorful rockets and whirling firecrackers to colorful firework balls and fountains. Each set is unique and offers a variety of effects to highlight the individuality of your celebration.</p><br/><p> The Steam store has always been known for its wide variety of games, but now you can also purchase pyrotechnics to create impressive fireworks displays. Fireworks sets will be a great addition to your gaming sessions, and are the perfect way to celebrate Independence Day with friends.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to add some brightness and fun to your celebration! Visit the Steam Store and choose a fireworks set that will give you an unforgettable experience and create a unique atmosphere of celebration.</p>'),
(13597, 'en-US', '«WOUNDING UPDATE» и Voice Props DLC ВЫШЛИ!'),
(13598, 'en-US', 'Learn about two new updates for the game Rust - \"WOUNDING UPDATE\" and Voice Props DLC. Experience improved damage mechanics and new voice effects in the game.'),
(13599, 'en-US', 'Rust, Updates, \"WOUNDING UPDATE\", Voice Props DLC, Game Content'),
(13600, 'en-US', 'Hello, dear players! We are excited to announce the release of two new updates for the game Rust on Steam - \"WOUNDING UPDATE\" and Voice Props DLC.<br/><br/> \"WOUNDING UPDATE\" is a long-awaited update that brings many new features and improvements to the game. Now you can expect new ways to deal damage to enemies, improved mechanics for planning attacks and excellent animations of injuries. From now on, you will be able to feel every blow and shoot with precision accuracy worthy of a true master of survival. This update will allow you to immerse yourself in the world of Rust like never before and enjoy even more realistic gameplay.<br/><br/> Voice Props DLC is additional content that will add new voice elements to the game. Now your character can communicate with other players not only through text chat, but also through voice. You will be able to use various sounds: from greetings and thanks to commands and reactions to what is happening. This is a great opportunity to communicate and interact with other players on a deeper level.<br/><br/> We are confident that new updates and DLCs will bring you even more joy and pleasure from playing Rust. Try out all the new features and watch your experience become even more exciting and thrilling. Happy Wiping!'),
(13601, 'en-US', 'Learn about the newest and most interesting skins in Rust on Steam, how they affect your gameplay experience, and what to consider when choosing which to use. We\'ll discuss the tradeoffs and balancing involved with these skins.'),
(13602, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game, Steam, changing appearance, weapons, impact on game experience, choice of use, balancing, compromises, decision making'),
(13603, 'en-US', 'In the article \"New Skins in Rust on Steam\" we will look at the latest additions of skins to the popular game Rust. We will learn about the most interesting and unique items that can be used to change the appearance of the character and weapons. We will also discuss their impact on the gameplay experience and consider factors to consider when choosing to use them. We will examine the different approaches to balancing and trade-offs associated with these skins and find out why they are so important for making decisions in the game.'),
(13604, 'en-US', 'SCIENTISTS ON MONUMENTS'),
(13605, 'en-US', 'This article covers the latest updates to Rust, including scientists appearing on monuments, DLSS support and rendering scale, new environmental details, and upcoming Twitch drops.'),
(13606, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, updates, scientists, monuments, DLSS, render scale, birds, Twitch'),
(13607, 'en-US', '»» SCIENTISTS ON MONUMENTS<br/> The developers are starting to gradually introduce scientists to all major monuments in the game. In this update, they started with the introduction of NPCs at the airfield and water treatment facilities. They will be found in underground parts of the monument or closed areas in small numbers.<br/><br/> »» DLSS SUPPORT AND RENDERING SCALE<br/> Owners of RTX graphics cards now have the opportunity to play Rust with DLSS support, which allows for a sharper picture without losing performance. According to Alistair, this technology has doubled the FPS in 4K resolution.<br/><br/> Along with DLSS, the ability to change the rendering scale in the game has appeared and this is available to everyone - you can set a value from 0.5 to 1, which should help players who want to reduce the scale of the picture without having to change the resolution. In general, the game also began to feel a little different due to slightly adjusted colors - more shades of blue began to be noticed in the image, which is especially noticeable in the winter biome. This should somewhat change the perception of the already familiar types of game.<br/><br/> »» BIRDS<br/> A fairly small change, but it adds a little more life to the environment on the map - now when you chop down a tree, birds will fly away from it. This does not change anything in terms of gameplay and these are not new NPCs, just a small interesting detail.<br/><br/> »» TWITCH DROPS<br/> This month there will be two rounds of drops in a row - the first one will start on July 5! At the moment, the list of participants and skins have not been announced, so we are waiting for new information that should appear very soon. It will be published in a separate post for convenience, so do not forget to check the group!<br/><br/> The update will be released at exactly 21:00 Moscow time. It will reset the maps on all servers, the blueprints wipe the servers themselves at their own discretion - check this issue with your administration. Server owners can expect the server update at approximately 20:30 - 20:45 Moscow time.<br/><br/> https://vk.com/club201926997'),
(13608, 'en-US', 'Rust Update and Wipe: New Injury System, Underground Tunnels, and DLC'),
(13609, 'en-US', 'Today, a major update and wipe is expected in the game Rust. In this article, we talk about changes in the wound system, the addition of underground tunnels and a new DLC.'),
(13610, 'en-US', 'update, wipe, Rust, injury system, underground tunnels, DLC'),
(13611, 'en-US', '⚠ UPDATE AND WIPE ALREADY TODAY AT 21:00 MSK! Wounded state system rework, underground tunnels update, new DLC, DLSS support, rendering scale, birds, scientists on monuments and more...<br/><br/> After a rather minor update in June, Rust starts July with some pretty big changes! This time, the developers have touched not only gameplay elements, but also made some technical changes that may be useful for many players...<br/><br/> »» NEW WOUND SYSTEM<br/> Now, when falling, players will initially be able to crawl and close/open doors, and the chance to get back on their feet will be 20% - but they will not be able to stay in this state for long, and upon reaching a certain level of HP (or if someone starts looting the player), they will go into the usual state where the player lies in place.<br/><br/> The player can be raised by a syringe on the right mouse button - the animation will last 5 seconds before the syringe takes effect. The player also has a 100% chance to rise if at the time of injury there was a large first aid kit in the quick access slots. For other players, the chance to rise to their feet can be increased to 25% if at that moment the player completely filled the hunger and thirst bars.<br/><br/> »» BUNKS AND NEW ENTRANCES TO THE TUNNELS<br/> The map will feature an entrance to a bunker with a glowing antenna that will allow you to reach the underground tunnels without having to approach the monuments.<br/><br/> »» NEW DLC: VOICE PROPS DLC!<br/> The new DLC is finally here! You\'ll be given a whole set of items that will allow you to play music or your voice from various devices, connect a sound source to a dance floor that will shimmer in time with the music, and even dance with three new gestures.<br/><br/> You can see more about the items in this post. The DLC will cost the same as the previous additions - $12 or, converting to our rate taking into account regional adjustments from Steam, 259 rubles.'),
(13612, 'en-US', 'New achievements have appeared in Rust'),
(13613, 'en-US', 'Learn about new achievements in the game Rust, which allow players to earn rewards and unlock new opportunities. Explore the game world, overcome challenges and fight hostile creatures to achieve success in the game.'),
(13614, 'en-US', 'Rust, achievements, new achievements, rewards, game world, challenges, goals, resources, character improvement, exclusive content, strategies, battles, risks, gameplay, depth, variety, development'),
(13615, 'en-US', 'Rust introduces exciting new achievements that will allow players to interact with the game world even more. Each achievement represents a special challenge or goal that players can complete to earn rewards and unlock new features.<br/><br/> New achievements provide players with new challenges and goals to achieve in Rust. These can range from simple tasks such as collecting resources or building a certain structure to complex and epic feats such as defeating a powerful boss or conquering a certain territory.<br/><br/> Each achievement in Rust not only gives satisfaction from completing it, but also rewards players for their efforts. Rewards can be varied, including new items, resources, character upgrades, or even access to exclusive content.<br/><br/> New achievements also help players explore and try out different aspects of the Rust game world. They encourage players to learn new skills, strategies, and tactics, making the gameplay more interesting and varied.<br/><br/> However, to achieve new achievements in Rust, players will have to overcome some obstacles and risks. Some achievements may require a joint effort with other players or difficult battles with hostile creatures. Players will have to develop effective strategies and use all the resources and skills they have.<br/><br/> Overall, the new achievements in Rust add even more depth and variety to the gameplay. They offer players new goals to achieve, rewards, and opportunities to progress. So join the game Rust and challenge yourself to complete the new achievements!'),
(13616, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates and News on Steam'),
(13617, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest updates and news about Rust on Steam. Explore gameplay changes, new features and items, and the importance of developer engagement.'),
(13618, 'en-US', 'game Rust, updates, news, Steam, developers, gameplay, construction, weapons'),
(13619, 'en-US', '<p>Rust on Steam is a sandbox with survival elements, where players fight for resources, build a base and fight other players. The game is constantly updated and developed, offering new features and fixing errors. In this article, we will look at the latest updates and news related to the game Rust on Steam.</p><br/><br/><p> The latest updates to the Rust game on Steam include various changes and additions. The developers are actively working on improving the gameplay, adding new items, implementing new features and fixing bugs. One of the recent updates included a new construction mechanic, allowing players to create more complex and unique structures. New types of weapons and tools were also added, allowing players to have more options in the fight against other players.</p><br/><br/><p> News related to the game Rust on Steam can be found from various sources. Social networks such as VKontakte, Twitter and Discord are the most popular platforms where developers make official announcements of updates and news. There are also specialized forums where players can share their experiences and learn the latest news about the development of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> It’s important to note that Rust Steam updates come with trade-offs. New features and changes can lead to unbalanced gameplay or introduce new bugs. The developers try to take player feedback into account and release patches with fixes, but it’s always difficult to find a perfect solution. Therefore, it’s important for players to actively communicate with the developers and provide feedback to help make Rust on Steam even better.</p><br/><br/><p> In conclusion, Rust on Steam is constantly evolving and offering new opportunities for players. News about updates and new features can be found from various sources, as well as official announcements from the developers. It is important to remember that updates may have their own trade-offs, and players need to actively engage with the developers to help improve the gameplay.</p>'),
(13620, 'en-US', 'This article covers the latest updates to Rust on Steam, including content additions, gameplay balancing, bug fixes, and performance improvements.'),
(13621, 'en-US', 'Rust game on Steam, updates, news, gameplay, content, balancing, bug fixes, performance improvements'),
(13622, 'en-US', '<p>News related to the update of the game Rust on Steam</p><br/><p> The game Rust on Steam continues to please its fans with updates that improve the gameplay and add new features. In this article, we will look at the latest changes that have appeared in the game and how they have affected the gameplay.</p><br/><p> One of the main changes is the introduction of new content. The developers are constantly adding new items, weapons, resources and building blocks so that players can get new opportunities and expand their gameplay. New items and resources allow you to create better weapons, protective structures and other useful things.</p><br/><p> In addition, the developers pay special attention to balancing the gameplay. They analyze data from players and make changes to various aspects of the game to achieve an optimal balance between different elements. For example, they can change the characteristics of weapons, improve protective structures, or change the survival mechanics.</p><br/><p> In addition, the developers of the game Rust on Steam also focus on fixing bugs and improving performance. They are actively working on detecting and fixing bugs so that players can enjoy a more stable and smooth gaming experience. In addition, they are optimizing the game so that it works better on different computer configurations and does not cause performance issues.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that all Rust Steam game updates are based on player feedback. The developers listen carefully to the player communities and take their opinions and suggestions into account when making decisions about changes to the game. This allows us to create a more satisfying gaming experience and take into account the interests of different players.</p><br/><p> In conclusion, Rust on Steam continues to be updated to provide players with the best gaming experience. Players can expect new content, bug fixes, performance improvements, and gameplay balancing. Don’t miss the opportunity to dive into the exciting world of survival and try out all the new features that Rust on Steam has to offer.</p>'),
(13623, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest batch of skins added to the game Rust. Available links for more detailed information.'),
(13624, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, skins review, skins batch, updates, VK'),
(13625, 'en-US', 'In this post, we will tell you about the latest batch of skins that have been added to the game Rust. We have prepared for you a detailed overview of the new types of skins that will be available to players. If you want to learn more about the new skins, just follow the link below and visit our group on the social network VK.<br/><br/> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997109%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997109%2Fall</a>'),
(13626, 'en-US', 'Rust Gets New Official Trailer'),
(13627, 'en-US', 'Rust has received a new official trailer that offers exciting moments and possibilities in this survival sandbox. Watch the trailer on the official Rust YouTube channel.'),
(13628, 'en-US', 'Rust, trailer, official, game, YouTube'),
(13629, 'en-US', 'Rust has an impressive new official trailer that will grab the attention of both experienced players and newcomers. The trailer shows exciting moments of gameplay, promising incredible adventures and possibilities in this survival sandbox.<br/><br/> You can watch the trailer on the official Rust YouTube channel here: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LGcECozNXEw&t=1s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LGcECozNXEw&amp;t=1s</a> . Will you see your next unforgettable story in Rust?'),
(13630, 'en-US', 'Steam Summer Sale Has Begun'),
(13631, 'en-US', 'The summer sale on Steam has begun. Rust and all DLCs have received a -50% discount. The full set for only 362 rubles. The discount is valid until July 8.'),
(13632, 'en-US', 'summer sale, Steam, Rust, discounts, DLC, games'),
(13633, 'en-US', '<p>Summer is a time for vacations and sunny joys, but it is also a time when you can buy your favorite games at a discount! And here is the good news - the summer sale on Steam has begun!</p><br/><p> One of the most popular games of recent years, Rust, also made it onto the discount list. Now you can buy the game with all DLCs at a -50% discount! The full game set is now available for only 362 rubles.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to save money and dive into the world of survival and construction.</p><br/><p> The promotion will last until July 8, so you have time to think and make the right choice.</p><br/><p> You can find details and make a purchase on the page:</p><br/><p> <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997105%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-201926997105%2Fall</a></p>'),
(13634, 'en-US', 'Rust Will Get DLSS Support in July 1st Update'),
(13635, 'en-US', 'Learn what DLSS is and why its support in the July 1st update will be a revolutionary step in improving the graphics and performance of Rust.'),
(13636, 'en-US', 'Rust, DLSS, update, video card, graphics, performance'),
(13637, 'en-US', 'Rust is coming soon with DLSS (Deep Learning Anti-Aliasing), which will be a revolutionary step in improving the game\'s graphics and performance. Find out what DLSS is and how it will impact your gameplay.<br/><br/> DLSS (Deep Learning Super Sampling) is an AI-powered rendering technology developed by NVIDIA for GeForce RTX graphics cards. It improves graphics quality while simultaneously improving performance by using specialized tensor cores.<br/><br/> What does this mean for Rust players? First of all, you will need an RTX series graphics card to take advantage of DLSS. However, thanks to this technology, you will be able to enjoy the game with higher graphics quality and smoother gameplay.<br/><br/> Official information says that DLSS support will be added in the update on July 1. This means that soon you will be able to appreciate all the advantages of this technology in your favorite game.<br/><br/> Stay tuned for news and updates to stay up to date with all the changes related to DLSS in Rust. Keep in mind that you will need a suitable graphics card to enable this feature, but the results are worth it. Unleash the full graphical potential of Rust with DLSS!<br/><br/> Source: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-20192699798%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-20192699798%2Fall</a>'),
(13638, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: updates and new items'),
(13639, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest updates and new features in the game Rust - a new batch of skins has arrived on Steam.'),
(13640, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, updates, game Rust, Steam'),
(13641, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust continues to please its players with new updates and novelties. This time, the developers present a new batch of skins that have been added to the game and are available on Steam.</p><br/><br/><p> Skins in Rust are special visual changes to items and weapons that allow players to stand out from the crowd and add uniqueness to their gaming experience. The new batch of skins will bring even more options for self-expression and stylization to the game.</p><br/><br/><p> The updates include different categories of skins such as weapons, clothing, buildings, and more. Each item has its own unique appearance and can be achieved by earning or purchasing from the Steam store.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins can also impact gameplay by providing additional bonuses or enhancements. For example, some weapon skins can increase their damage or accuracy, giving players an edge in battle.</p><br/><br/><p> However, it is important to note that skins in Rust are cosmetic and do not affect the gameplay advantage. The balance between game mechanics and visual changes is carefully maintained to provide players with a fair and fun gaming environment.</p><br/><br/><p> If you are a fan of the game Rust or just interested in new updates, the new batch of skins is sure to please you. Check them out in the Steam store and bring your wildest ideas to life in the game world of Rust.</p>'),
(13642, 'en-US', 'Updated wounded state system in development'),
(13643, 'en-US', 'A revamped wound system is in development for Rust. Learn about the key changes coming to the game and how they impact gameplay and balance. Check out the new mechanics of using first aid kits and syringes to restore and revive the player. Stay tuned for more news on Rust updates!'),
(13644, 'en-US', 'update, wounded state system, development, Rust game, first aid kits, syringes'),
(13645, 'en-US', '<p>A revamped wound system is in development for Rust. In this article, we\'ll look at the key changes coming to the game, as well as discuss the potential impact these changes may have on gameplay and balance.</p><br/><p> One of the main innovations will be the ability for wounded players to crawl. This action will help to survive dangerous situations and get to a safe place.</p><br/><p> An important change is related to the use of first aid kits from quick access slots. If a large first aid kit was in the quick access slots at the time of receiving a wound, the player will be able to recover from 20 HP after some time. In this case, the first aid kit will be used and will disappear from the inventory, but the player will have to undergo additional treatment.</p><br/><p> The old mechanic of using syringes to instantly heal and raise the player is also returning. If absolutely necessary, the player will be able to use the syringe on the right mouse button and instantly return to the fight. This mechanic was removed in 2016, but will now be available again.</p><br/><p> It\'s important to note that these are just a few of the many changes that could make it into the final release of the update. The new wounded state system is still in development, and an exact release date is not yet known.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned for more news and stay up to date with all the changes in the Rust game!</p>'),
(13646, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest Rust Steam updates and settings that affect gameplay. Stay up to date with changes and innovations to be ready for new challenges in Rust!'),
(13647, 'en-US', 'game Rust, Rust updates, game Rust on Steam, game Rust news, changes in Rust'),
(13648, 'en-US', '<p>Rust on Steam is constantly improving and evolving, which leads to regular updates and changes. In this article, we will look at the latest news and changes in the Rust game, which will help you stay up to date with all the events and prepare for new challenges.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the main aspects of updates in the game Rust is balancing various factors. The developers are constantly analyzing game data, feedback from players and exploring different approaches to achieve the maximum balance between the diversity of possibilities and maintaining the fairness of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Each update to Rust adds new features, weapons, building blocks, and other gameplay elements. However, when implementing new features, the developers also face balance issues. Some changes may be too powerful or useless, requiring additional adjustments and rebalancing in future updates.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the biggest compromises that developers face is accommodating a variety of playstyles and player preferences. There are many different ways to approach Rust, whether it’s base building, exploration, PvP combat, or creating an economy. The developers try to accommodate all of these aspects and provide each player with the opportunity to enjoy the game in a way that suits their preferences.</p><br/><br/><p> Another important aspect of Rust updates is the focus on the player community. The developers actively interact with players, listening to their opinions, suggestions, and comments. Feedback from the player community allows the developers to understand what changes need to be made to make the game experience even more fun and interesting for everyone.</p><br/><br/><p> In conclusion, it should be noted that the game Rust on Steam remains one of the most popular and exciting games, thanks to constant updates and changes. News and changes in the game Rust allow players to be aware of all the innovations and prepare for new challenges in the unique world of survival and construction.</p>'),
(13649, 'en-US', 'COST OF CRAFT'),
(13650, 'en-US', 'The cost of crafting items in the game Rust and information about the upcoming DLC'),
(13651, 'en-US', 'Crafting Prices, Rust, DLC'),
(13652, 'en-US', 'Prices for items and materials for crafting in the game Rust:'),
(13653, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates: External Speaker, Microphone, Loudspeaker, and More'),
(13654, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust adds new items such as an external speaker, microphone, loudspeaker, and portable phone, as well as party tools such as a disco ball, twinkle lights, and a dance floor. It also adds a notification system to the cargo ship.'),
(13655, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, external speaker, microphone, loudspeaker, portable phone, disco ball, club, cargo ship'),
(13656, 'en-US', '• External Speaker - You\'ll be able to connect the audio from your speaker to louder audio players and chain them together, which can be useful for an unusual alarm at your base or... if you just want everyone to hear your music. Just like in real life.<br/><br/> • Microphone - it works like... a microphone! You stand in front of the microphone and start talking, obviously it should be connected to a sound player, and here speakers can also be useful. The microphone has three modes of operation - standard (without sound changes), and low/high tone.<br/><br/> • Loudspeaker - do you want everyone around you to hear what you\'re thinking? Then this item is for you! Just pick it up, press LMB and, obviously, you\'ll speak much louder than usual.<br/><br/> • A portable telephone is a rather interesting item that will allow you to communicate with players by telephone outside the base and without telephone booths.<br/><br/> • Disco ball, flickering lights, lasers, dance floor and dance animations. Owners of the DLC will receive three different types of dances in the gesture menu that they can play wherever they want, and everything else will allow you to create almost your own club.<br/><br/> The disco ball spins and sparkles, the musical lamps create a party atmosphere (the flickering can be reduced in the game settings if this creates difficulties for someone), the lasers simply look beautiful, and the dance floor can beautifully glow in different colors and even adapt to the rhythm of the music if you connect a speaker to it.<br/><br/> • The cargo ship will have a notification system at the very top - go to the microphone and say what you wish for everyone else who is claiming loot on the ship.'),
(13657, 'en-US', 'Audio players, internet radio, dance floor and more - what awaits us in the next DLC'),
(13658, 'en-US', 'What awaits us in the next DLC of the game Rust on Steam? As part of it, new functional items will appear, such as audio players, internet radio and even a stationary dance floor. Find out more about these new items and how they will affect the gameplay.'),
(13659, 'en-US', 'updates, DLC, audio players, internet radio, dance floor'),
(13660, 'en-US', 'Audio players, internet radio, dance floor and more - what awaits us in the next DLC.<br/><br/> Foreign update reviewer SHADOWFRAX received early access to the new paid add-on that will be released in July and told us the main details about it. Here are the items that will be available to us:<br/><br/> • Cassette player - you can pick it up, insert a cassette into it and then record any sounds by pressing the voice button, be it your voice or sounds around you. This way you can even record the sounds of playing instruments or explosives, as SHADOWFRAX did in his video. You can throw the player and it will stick to any surface - the cassette will play on repeat until you pick up the player.<br/><br/> There will be three types of tapes - 10, 20 and 30 seconds, and by default they will already have random recordings on them, over which you can record your own. In the inventory, you can also sign the tapes as you wish.<br/><br/> Cassettes can be used in regular telephones - when someone calls you, but no one picks up, the caller will automatically play the audio recording from the cassette, after which he will be asked to leave a message.<br/><br/> • Boombox - take it with you anywhere, insert the desired cassette and then walk with it on your shoulder like the coolest player on the island. If you try to turn on the boombox without a cassette, then the Internet radio menu will open for you - enter the link to any audio stream in pls or m3u format and you will be able to listen to any Internet radio directly from the game. (those who wish can turn this off in the settings, it may be useful for streamers)<br/><br/> • A stationary speaker is the same boombox, but you can place it. It requires 10 units of electricity to operate. The functionality is the same - listen to either cassettes or Internet radio, there are no restrictions.'),
(13661, 'en-US', 'Developers tease new DLC'),
(13662, 'en-US', 'Rust developers tease new DLC that will feature the ability to record and play back in-game moments. Details will be revealed on the test branch on Thursday. Stay tuned!'),
(13663, 'en-US', 'Developers, teaser, new DLC, Rust, gameplay moments'),
(13664, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have prepared a surprise for us - a new add-on will be released in July. Although information about it is still limited, there is one interesting fact: players will be able to record and play back their gaming moments using special devices. More detailed information will be available on the test branch this Thursday. Stay in touch and follow the updates! You can watch the video teaser on our Vkontakte page: https://vk.com/rustcommru?w=wall-20192699788%2Fall'),
(13665, 'en-US', 'First look at the bunkers'),
(13666, 'en-US', 'Learn more about the new bunkers in Rust - an alternative way to enter underground tunnels located away from monuments. Explore new features and content in the July update.'),
(13667, 'en-US', 'bunkers, update, underground tunnels, rebalance, content, game Rust'),
(13668, 'en-US', 'In the latest update to the Rust game, the developers added a new feature - bunkers. They have become an alternative way to get into underground tunnels, and are located away from monuments, which creates an additional element of intrigue and challenges for players. In this article, we will take a closer look at the new bunkers and their capabilities.<br/><br/> Bunkers are an important part of the underground tunnels rebalance, which will bring more content diversity and new entry points. Most likely, players will be able to explore the new bunkers in the July update. For more information and updates, follow our official community: <a href=\"https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-20192699781%2Fall\">https://vk.com/club201926997?w=wall-20192699781%2Fall</a> .'),
(13669, 'en-US', 'Join our Rust Discord community!'),
(13670, 'en-US', 'Join our Rust Discord community and get the latest news, help with questions, chat with other players and a chance to win great skins!'),
(13671, 'en-US', 'Discord, community, Rust, game, news, communication, help, contests, skins'),
(13672, 'en-US', 'Hello, friend! Do you want to stay up to date with the latest news on the game Rust? Then we invite you to join our large and friendly Discord community! We already have more than 2 thousand participants, where you will find current game news, be able to communicate with like-minded people, get help with questions and take part in exciting competitions.<br/><br/> And we have great news! If you join us right now, you can participate in a contest where amazing skins for the game Rust are being raffled off!<br/><br/> Don\'t miss your chance! Join our Rust Discord community right now and become a part of this amazing gaming community!<br/><br/> Link to join: https://discord.gg/f4hS5n5D9k'),
(13673, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Overview of Updates and Features'),
(13674, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new skins in Rust, their impact on the game\'s atmosphere, availability, and variety. Consider the factors that influence the selection and addition of skins, as well as the trade-offs that arise in the process.'),
(13675, 'en-US', 'New skins, Rust game, Steam, updates, skins in Rust, game atmosphere, game world, balancing, variety, availability, price, modding, creative designer'),
(13676, 'en-US', '<p>Rust, developed by Facepunch Studios, continues to delight its players with new skins added to Steam. Each update brings unique skins for weapons, clothing, and items, allowing each player to express their individuality and style in the game world.</p><br/><br/><p> The new skins in Rust offer a wide range of options for all types of items. From bright and colorful designs to more serious and atmospheric images, everyone will find a suitable option. What factors influence which skins are added to the game and why do the developers pay so much attention to this process?</p><br/><br/><p> One of the key factors is balancing and matching skins to the game aesthetics and features of the Rust game world. The developers strive to select skins that complement the game\'s atmosphere without destroying its integrity and realism. This requires careful analysis and selection of designs, excluding overly bright and inappropriate options.</p><br/><br/><p> Another important aspect is the variety and originality of new skins. The developers strive to surprise players and offer them something new that will attract attention and create interest. Thus, each update adds variety to the game world and allows players to constantly find new interesting items for their hero.</p><br/><br/><p> However, with the addition of new skins, there are also some compromises. Some players may find some skins too expensive or not to their tastes. The developers try to find a balance between accessibility and price so that every player can find a suitable option among the new skins.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust game on Steam supports modding, which means that players can also create their own skins and share them with other players. This adds even more variety and uniqueness to the Rust game world, where everyone can become a creative designer and contribute to the development of the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Of course, adding new skins to the game Rust is an important process that requires constant analysis of the desires and needs of players. The developers try to offer a variety and high quality of new skins that will please players and make the game world of Rust even more interesting and attractive.</p>'),
(13677, 'en-US', 'Birds have appeared on the test branch'),
(13678, 'en-US', 'Rust\'s test branch now features birds. This update adds more realism to the game environment and creates an atmosphere of a living world.'),
(13679, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Rust news, game update, birds in Rust'),
(13680, 'en-US', '<p>Hello! We would like to share with you the latest news about the game Rust on Steam.</p><br/><p> Today we introduce you to the birds on the test branch of the game Rust. Now they will decorate your game environment and create an atmosphere of a living world. Birds prefer to rest on tree branches, so be careful not to scare them away when cutting down trees. In this case, they will simply fly to other trees.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that birds are not new NPCs at this time and cannot be interacted with by players. They simply provide additional detail to the game world and create atmosphere.</p><br/><p> We are excited to introduce these changes to Rust. Even a small detail like the appearance of birds can add more realism to the game environment. We are looking forward to your feedback on this update!</p>'),
(13681, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skins added to Rust on Steam'),
(13682, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust, Steam, game, additions, updates'),
(13683, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam constantly pleases its players with new premium and unique skins that allow you to make your personal style of play even more exclusive and unique.</p><br/><br/><p> Here\'s a quick look at some of the most interesting new skins added to Rust on Steam:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> Skin 1: \"Skin Name\". This skin allows you to change the appearance of your weapons or items in the game. It features a bright design and unique elements that give your character a unique style.</li><br/><br/><li> Skin 2: \"Skin Name\". This skin offers a completely new look to your buildings and structures. It will make you stand out from other players and add a special atmosphere to your game.</li><br/><br/><li> Skin 3: \"Skin Name\". This skin gives your characters an original and stylish look. You will be able to choose the perfect combination of the skin and other clothing elements to create a unique look in the world of Rust.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> All these new skins are available in the Steam store, where you can choose and purchase them to your liking. Each skin has its own cost and a limited number of copies, so do not delay with the purchase, so as not to miss the opportunity to add something unique to your collection.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t forget to follow the game updates, because the developers are constantly working on adding new skins and improvements to make the Rust gameplay even more exciting and diverse.</p><br/><br/><p> Happy shopping and enjoyable gaming adventures in the world of Rust on Steam!</p>'),
(13684, 'en-US', 'Demoshot update and other news in the game Rust'),
(13685, 'en-US', 'Learn about the latest changes to Rust, including the new Demoshot editor, the ability to change the color of wires and hoses, and information about Twitch Drops and upcoming updates.'),
(13686, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, Demoshot, recording editor, camera moves, colored wires, hoses, Twitch Drops'),
(13687, 'en-US', '• Demoshot (recording editor) — demos received a convenient interface for quick movement along the entire demo recording timeline, as well as the ability to record camera movements taking into account the movement settings and DOF (Depth of Field) and then play them again. These are far from all the changes and in the future it will be possible to render and save video directly from the game, but you will have to wait.<br/><br/> • Colored wires and hoses - now, for the convenience of working with complex circuits, you will be given the opportunity to change the color of wires and hoses.<br/><br/> There will be no Twitch Drops this month — the news came almost at the last minute and was a surprise to many. The reasons remain unknown, so don\'t expect any free skins this time.<br/><br/> Compared to the previous update, this may seem like a small thing to you - but the developers promise more interesting news in July...<br/><br/> The update will be released at 21:00 Moscow time. It will reset maps on all servers without exception, the wipe of blueprints is carried out at the discretion of the server owners.'),
(13688, 'en-US', '⚠ New Rust game update: new AI, contact system and updated animal models'),
(13689, 'en-US', 'Today at 21:00 Moscow time, a new update for the Rust game is coming out, which brings interesting innovations: new AI, a contact system, updated animal models, and much more.'),
(13690, 'en-US', 'Rust update, new AI, contact system, animal models, post editor, game update'),
(13691, 'en-US', '⚠ NEW GAME UPDATE IS OUT TODAY AT 21:00 MSK! Updated AI (artificial intelligence), contact system, new animal models, post editor for content creators, fixes and more await you!<br/><br/> • CONTACT SYSTEM: Now when you meet random players, you will remember their nickname and then view information about them in a new interface called \"Contacts\", which can be accessed through the crafting or inventory menu. Initially, all players will fall into the \"met\" category - there will be their nickname, current status and a screenshot from the moment of your last meeting in the description. You can mark them as friends or enemies as you wish, after which a blue or red dot will appear above them, respectively.<br/> The nickname is now displayed when you wave your hand using the appropriate gesture, and it will be visible even at long distances - it will be useful if you need to show that you are not an enemy.<br/><br/> If you are killed by a player previously from the \"encountered\" category, he will automatically be transferred to \"enemies\".<br/><br/> • New AI: the game has received a new artificial intelligence system. It is important to note that this change is important primarily for the developers themselves and players will not notice much - previously the game used three different AI systems for NPCs at the same time, which is obviously out of bounds. Players can expect more coordinated animal actions, a changed attack radius for scientists near mountains with garbage and wolf packs. The most important thing is the new appearance of all animals (except chickens), which now look more realistic than before, and with new animations!'),
(13692, 'en-US', 'News related to the Rust update on Steam. Find out about the latest updates, balancing and decision-making in the game.'),
(13693, 'en-US', 'Game Rust, Steam, updates, balancing, decision making'),
(13694, 'en-US', '<p>All fans of the game Rust on Steam, rejoice! In this article, we will tell you about the latest updates that brought a fresh wind to the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> The developers continue to listen carefully to the community and try to implement all the most interesting ideas into the game. However, they also face some problems and difficulties related to balancing game mechanics and decision-making.</p><br/><br/><p> Balancing is a key factor in game development. It is important to find the right balance between different aspects of the game, such as weapons, resources, buildings, characters, and more. Over-powering weapons can make the game unpleasant for new players, while underpowering weapons can kill the interest of experienced players. Developers conduct tests and analyze player data in search of the right balance.</p><br/><br/><p> However, balancing can create trade-offs and cause some confusion among players. There are many opinions and preferences in the community, and it is not always possible to please everyone. The developers try to take into account many factors and responses to create a pleasant gaming experience for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> Decision making is another important aspect of game development. Every update of the Rust game on Steam comes with various decisions to make, such as changing game mechanics, adding new features, or fixing bugs. Making these decisions can be difficult, especially when it comes to satisfying multiple players with different preferences. Developers must consider many factors, such as game balance, technical limitations, and community feedback, to make the right decision.</p><br/><br/><p> So, it is important to understand that Rust Steam game updates are the result of compromises related to balancing various factors and making decisions. The developers do their best to provide an interesting and enjoyable gaming experience for each player. They carefully analyze data and feedback to make the game better and better.</p><br/><br/><p> We\'re always excited to see how developers can combine all of these factors to create a Rust game on Steam that\'s fun and exciting to play.</p>'),
(13695, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates on Steam'),
(13696, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about Rust updates on Steam. Gameplay changes, new content, and bug fixes are all available to Rust players through the Steam platform.'),
(13697, 'en-US', 'Rust game on Steam, Rust game updates, Rust update news, Rust gameplay, Rust new content, Steam updates'),
(13698, 'en-US', 'Rust is constantly being updated on Steam, offering players new content, improvements, and bug fixes. In this article, we will look at the latest updates to Rust that are available for download through the Steam platform. We will discuss changes to gameplay, new features, added game modes, and issues that may arise when updating the game. Rust updates on Steam play an important role in ensuring the balance and fun of the gameplay, and also take into account the opinions of players and factors affecting the development of the gaming industry as a whole. At the same time, we must not forget about the importance of taking into account the confusion and discontinuity in the text to make the article interesting and understandable to a wide audience. If you are a fan of the game Rust, then this article will certainly be of interest to you.'),
(13699, 'en-US', 'All work will be assessed on the following points:'),
(13700, 'en-US', 'The article describes how entries will be judged in a contest related to the game Rust on Steam. Participants will have the opportunity to win prizes if their entries meet criteria such as creativity, balance, playability, quality of execution, and design. The announcement of the winner and communication with the developers will be in English.'),
(13701, 'en-US', 'all works, rating, competition, creativity, balance, playability, quality of execution, design, detail, winner announcement, developers, English language, prize');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(13702, 'en-US', '<p>All entries submitted to the competition will be assessed on several important points. Participants will be assessed by the Facepunch team based on the following criteria:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Creativity - how original and innovative the work is;</li><br/><li> Balance - compliance of work with game mechanics and gameplay;</li><br/><li> Playability - how interesting and exciting it is to play on a given map;</li><br/><li> Quality of execution - the degree of elaboration and polish of the content;</li><br/><li> Design and detailing - the level of visual design and attention to detail.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> The judging process will be based on the work submitted. Attention will be given to each participant, but there will be no feedback on each individual work until the winner is announced.</p><br/><p> To enter the contest, you must submit your map using the form available at the following link: <a href=\"https://forms.gle/teheGK6zZ1uoJtNw7\">https://forms.gle/teheGK6zZ1uoJtNw7</a> Once submitted, the map will be evaluated and, if necessary, the winner may be asked to make some edits to optimize the map for the server.</p><br/><p> The results of the competition and the announcement of the winner will take place in the July Community Update.</p><br/><p> Please note that all communication with the development team will be in English. The winner must receive their prize within one month of the announcement.</p><br/><p> We wish good luck to all participants!</p>'),
(13703, 'en-US', 'Facepunch Announces Custom Map Competition in Rust'),
(13704, 'en-US', 'Facepunch has announced a custom map competition for Rust. Participants can submit their original map for a chance to be recognized by the development team and win valuable rewards, including having the map featured in a community update and skins worth up to £90.'),
(13705, 'en-US', 'Facepunch, contest, custom maps, Rust, game update'),
(13706, 'en-US', 'https://vk.com/rustergamess?w=wall-20192699738<br/> Facepunch has announced a custom map contest - the event will run until July 14, 2021.<br/><br/> The developers invite all map makers to take part in the competition, where the winner will receive the following:<br/> • The map will be installed on Facepunch Small servers and will stay there for 2 months<br/> • The map will be shown in the next Community Update<br/> • Skins worth a total of 90 pounds (about 9,300 rubles)<br/> • 3 any Rust merch, keys for all DLC, including the upcoming new addition<br/> • The right to show off (I just translated it as it was, no complaints to me!)<br/><br/> Prizes for those who were close to winning (second place and beyond):<br/> • The map will be shown in the next Community Update<br/> • Skins worth a total of £50 (around 5,100 roubles)<br/> • Keys for all DLC, including the upcoming new addition<br/> Competition rules:<br/> • The card size must be between 3200 and 3700<br/> • No plugins or mods (no Oxide/uMod)<br/> • You can only send one card (you can work as a team)<br/> • Card acceptance closes on July 14<br/> • The map must be completely original and not previously published anywhere<br/> • Cards with poor performance (low FPS) will be rejected<br/> • The map must visually correspond to the game and its balance:<br/> — Monuments must use access cards<br/> - No fantasy, flying stones/islands<br/> - No structures that defy the laws of physics'),
(13707, 'en-US', 'Meet the fresh delivery of skins in the Rust game store! Unique and stylish skins for your character and weapons will allow you to stand out from other players and show your individuality in the game.'),
(13708, 'en-US', 'new skins delivery, skins shop, Rust game, unique skins, visual design'),
(13709, 'en-US', 'Meet the fresh delivery of skins in the Rust game store! In this expanded collection, you will find many interesting and unique skins for your character, weapons and base. From bright and eccentric options to more strict and stylish ones, you are presented with a wide choice of visual design.<br/><br/> Skins are not just items that add uniqueness to your gaming session. They also serve as a way to express your individuality in the gaming world. Each skin has its own story and can help you stand out from other players.<br/><br/> When choosing a skin, you should pay attention to its characteristics and the effects it can add to your appearance or weapon. Some skins can even improve your gaming capabilities or make you more invisible on the battlefield.<br/><br/> However, when buying skins, do not forget about the balance between appearance and functionality. Sometimes the most beautiful skin is not the most useful. Therefore, it is important to carefully read the description and features of the skins before buying.<br/><br/> Skins for the game Rust are available for purchase in the Steam store. The new skin delivery adds more variety and options to create a unique look for your character or elements of your base. Hurry, because the best skins can sell out quickly!<br/><br/> And don\'t forget to visit the store regularly, because the developers of the Rust game are constantly working on adding new skins and updating old ones. So there is always a chance to find something unique and perfect for you. Don\'t miss your chance to stand out from other players and show your individuality in the Rust game!'),
(13710, 'en-US', 'Rust AI Update and New Animal Models'),
(13711, 'en-US', 'Rust AI Update and New Animal Models. Learn about the significant changes that optimize gameplay and add realism.'),
(13712, 'en-US', 'Update, AI, Animal Models, Rust, Game, Twitch Drops'),
(13713, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has received a major update that has affected the AI and animal models. The wolf, deer, bear and boar have been completely redesigned, now their appearance has become even more realistic, and new animations have been added.</p><br/><p> An important change was the rewriting of the entire artificial intelligence from scratch. Animals became more dangerous and mobile, and scientists received more accurate spatial orientation skills. Some changes affect the technical part of the game, but you will definitely notice these innovations.</p><br/><p> Another update has been made to the demo player for content creators, which now includes a time slider and the ability to record and replay camera movements and additional options like depth of field adjustment.</p><br/><p> The update will be available for download on June 3 at 21:00 Moscow time. A new round of Twitch Drops is also expected at the same time, so be prepared!</p>'),
(13714, 'en-US', 'Rust Steam Update: Everything You Need to Know'),
(13715, 'en-US', 'Find out all about the latest updates to Rust on Steam, including new features, gameplay changes, and general compromises made by the developers. Stay up to date with future plans and how updates will impact gameplay. Rust on Steam is always evolving, and we\'re covering all the important stuff!'),
(13716, 'en-US', 'game Rust, Steam, updates, innovations, changes, gameplay, balance, bug fixes'),
(13717, 'en-US', 'The game Rust, available on the Steam platform, is being updated again, and we have collected all the most important changes and innovations for you. In this article, you will find information about the latest updates to the game and their impact on the gameplay, and you will also be informed about future changes that the developers are preparing for you.<br/><br/> The importance of updates in the game Rust is undeniable. New updates often fix bugs and vulnerabilities, make changes to the gameplay, introduce new features and content, and make the game even better. However, these updates can also cause changes in the balance of the game, which can affect the gameplay and the opinion of players.<br/><br/> We\'ll take a closer look at the latest updates: new features, improvements, and bug fixes. What innovations have the developers added to the game? How have these changes affected the gameplay and balance? We\'ll also discuss player feedback on the updates and the compromises the developers had to make to achieve the desired balance.<br/><br/> But that\'s not all! We\'ll also tell you about the developers\' plans for the future: what changes they\'re preparing for the game Rust. Perhaps you\'ll learn about upcoming updates and innovations that are already causing heated discussions among players.<br/><br/> Rust on Steam is a constantly evolving game, and game updates are an integral part of its development. We invite you to check out the latest updates and stay up to date with all the changes and innovations in this amazing game.'),
(13718, 'en-US', 'New model of boar'),
(13719, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new boar model coming in the Rust Steam update. The updated AI system will change the animals\' behavior and add new models and animations.'),
(13720, 'en-US', 'new boar model, update, artificial intelligence system, animals, models, animations, development'),
(13721, 'en-US', '<p>All updated animal models, including the boar, will be part of a major update to Rust on Steam. This updated AI system is completely rebuilt from the ground up, which will result in noticeable changes to animal behavior and the introduction of new models and animations.</p><br/><p> At this point, there are no further details beyond this information. This update has been in development for over six months, but there is no specific release date yet.</p>'),
(13722, 'en-US', 'A new era of style and individuality has arrived in the world of Rust! The developers are introducing a stunning new batch of skins that will allow each player to express their uniqueness. In this article, we will look at the most interesting and exciting skins, and discuss their impact on gameplay and balance.'),
(13723, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, game Rust, skins, style, personality, gameplay, balance'),
(13724, 'en-US', '<p>A new era of style and individuality has arrived in the world of the popular game Rust! The development team is pleased to present you with a stunning new batch of skins that will bring a fresh wind of change and allow each player to express their uniqueness. In this article, we will look at the most interesting and exciting skins that have been added to the game Rust.</p><br/><p> You will love the new skins for their uniqueness and diversity. They reflect various themes and styles, from industrial elements to post-apocalyptic details. The developers paid attention to every detail to make these skins truly high-quality and realistic.</p><br/><p> In addition to being visually appealing, new skins also have practical value. Some of them have improved characteristics or special effects that will help you survive and overcome difficulties in the game. This gives you the opportunity not only to look stylish, but also to gain real advantages in the gameplay.</p><br/><p> But of course, it is worth considering that every coin has two sides. When choosing new skins, it is worth paying attention to the balance of the game. Some skins can be attractive and powerful, but they can also make changes to the game economy and the experience of other players. Deciding on such a balance is always a difficult task for developers, so they constantly analyze the feedback and reactions of the gaming community.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that taking into account the impact of new skins on gameplay and balance is almost the main task of the developers. Rust strives to maintain a fair and honest game experience for all players, so balancing between visual appeal and gameplay impact is always a priority.</p><br/><p> So, dear players, get ready for an amazing update to your skin collection! The new batch of skins in the game Rust is a unique opportunity to add a touch of style and individuality to your gaming life. Do not miss the chance to express yourself and immerse yourself in the world of amazing opportunities that these skins will bring. Play, enjoy and be sure that the style and advantages of the new skins will definitely please you!</p>'),
(13725, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update Analysis: New Video on Youtube'),
(13726, 'en-US', 'The game Rust on Steam is updated again, and the developers offer us a new video on Youtube, where we can see all the innovations of the latest update of the game Rust. Find out about all the changes, trade-offs and balance between updates and preserving the gaming experience in our article.'),
(13727, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, new video, Youtube, game changes, balance, compromises'),
(13728, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam is updated again, and the developers offer us a new video, available on Youtube at the link <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W1b7WjxfOy0\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=W1b7WjxfOy0</a> .</p><br/><p> In this video we can see all the new features that were included in the latest update of the Rust game. By watching the video we can get a better idea of what was added or changed in the game.</p><br/><p> Rust game update is always a big interest for players, so this video will be a real treasure for them. We know that updates often bring different changes to games, and they can affect the gameplay and balance. So by watching this video, players will be able to prepare and adapt to the new changes in Rust.</p><br/><p> However, despite all the innovations that are being introduced to the game, it is important to understand that the developers are making a difficult compromise to find a balance between adding new content and maintaining an interesting gaming experience. In their video, they will likely talk about the decisions made and the rationale behind the changes to keep players interested and explain to them why their gaming experience may change.</p><br/><p> Studying the updates on your own can be time-consuming, so YouTube videos are a great resource and will allow us to get the most important points of a Rust update without having to spend a lot of time reading patch notes or other numbers and data.</p><br/><p> Ultimately, the Rust game update video is an opportunity for players to learn about all the changes in the game, prepare for new content, and determine what compromises the developers are making to achieve a balance between updates and preserving the game experience.</p>'),
(13729, 'en-US', 'Wires can now be assigned different colors'),
(13730, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new update in the Rust game that allows you to assign different colors to wires and hoses. This will make it easier to work with complex circuits and add some color to your in-game builds.'),
(13731, 'en-US', 'Rust game, update, wires, hoses, color, electrical diagrams, construction'),
(13732, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust Steam update, available since June 3, introduced a new feature - now players can assign different colors to wires and hoses. This improvement will make working with complex circuits much more convenient and will allow for more diverse designs.</p><br/><p> Previously, all wires and hoses were of one standard color, which made it difficult to distinguish them on large construction sites. Now, thanks to the update, players will be able to choose the color for each wire or hose separately. This will make it easy to determine which system they belong to and will greatly simplify the necessary manipulations.</p><br/><p> The new feature is a great addition for those who love complex electrical circuits and industrial structures. They will be able to manage energy more efficiently and control the operation of various systems.</p><br/><p> As a result, players will be able to create more interesting and colorful buildings that will not only be functional, but also visually appealing.</p><br/><p> The update with the ability to change the color of wires and hoses in the Rust game on Steam will be available from June 3. Don\'t miss the chance to add brightness and convenience to your game buildings!</p>'),
(13733, 'en-US', 'New skins for the game Rust: welcome to the world of diversity!'),
(13734, 'en-US', 'Check out some exciting new skins for Rust that will add variety and uniqueness to your gaming experience.'),
(13735, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust, skins, new skins, updates, gameplay, appearance, personality'),
(13736, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the exciting world of Rust, where new skins await you that bring freshness and variety to the gameplay! In this article, we will tell you about the newest and most exciting skins that appeared in the latest batch of game updates.</p><br/><br/><p> The balance between visual pleasure and gameplay utility is one of the key components in the world of new skins for Rust. The game\'s development team carefully selects each skin so that it not only looks impressive, but also does not interfere with the gameplay. Players have the opportunity to choose skins that suit their gaming style and aesthetic preferences.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins add unique textures, colorful designs, and details to the game that make your gaming experience even more exciting and memorable. They can change the appearance of your weapons, clothing, buildings, and other items in the game, allowing you to stand out from other players and show your individuality.</p><br/><br/><p> Skins in Rust can also be a valuable asset for trading and selling. Some of them are rare and sought after, which makes their price on Steam even higher. You can be sure that new skins are a “champion” way to stand out in the game and feel unique.</p><br/><br/><p> So, if you want to add more variety to your gaming experience and stand out from other players, be sure to check out the new batch of skins in the game Rust. You will definitely find something special for yourself that will allow you to make your game even more exciting and fun.</p><br/><br/><p> Get ready to dive into a world of new possibilities and visual delights in the game Rust with new skins!</p>'),
(13737, 'en-US', 'Solar Panel Model Update in Rust'),
(13738, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Solar Panel skin in Rust'),
(13739, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, solar panel, model'),
(13740, 'en-US', '<p>Rust is about to get an update regarding the solar panel. In the previous version of the game, this model was temporary, but now the developers have worked on improving it.</p><br/><p> The main innovation is that the new solar panel model will visually match other items that players can create in the game. This will add more realism and aesthetic pleasure when building a base or crafting items.</p><br/><p> The developers have done a lot of work on the details and textures of the new model. Now it will look more attractive and realistic, which will emphasize the quality of the graphics and attention to detail in the game.</p><br/><p> The solar panel model update is just one of many steps the development team is taking to improve the gameplay experience. Regular updates add new features, fix bugs, and balance game mechanics.</p><br/><p> Stay tuned for the update coming soon to enjoy the new look of the solar panel and feel even more involved in the world of Rust!</p>'),
(13741, 'en-US', 'New batch of Rust skins - find out all about the latest updates!'),
(13742, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skin updates in Rust and learn all about the new items available for your character and base. Upgrade your gaming experience with the new batch of Rust skins on Steam!'),
(13743, 'en-US', 'Rust skins, new Rust skins, Rust skins updates, Rust skins batch, Rust Steam store'),
(13744, 'en-US', '<p>Check out the latest updates to Rust with a new batch of skins! New skins are another chance to spice up your gaming experience and stand out from the crowd.</p><br/><br/><p> In this article, we will tell you about the latest skin updates in the game Rust and find out what new items are now available for your character and base.</p><br/><br/><p> Each batch of new skins offers unique customization options for your character and the environment. You will be able to choose from a wide variety of weapons, protective gear, clothing, and decorations for your base.</p><br/><br/><p> Skins can not only change the appearance of your items, but also have some special characteristics. They can provide you with bonuses in the form of increased durability, improved characteristics, or even special effects.</p><br/><br/><p> However, choosing new skins is always a compromise. You have to consider not only the appearance, but also the functionality of the items. Some skins may be more effective and useful, but not as visually impressive. Others may be great in design, but not provide the same benefits in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> An important factor in choosing skins is their availability. Some skins may only be available for purchase for real money in the Steam store, while others can be obtained in-game or by trading with other players.</p><br/><br/><p> However, it is important to remember that skins are merely cosmetic changes and do not affect game balance or performance. Rust remains as addictive and fun as ever. Skins simply add beauty and personality to the game world.</p><br/><br/><p> So if you\'re looking to upgrade your gaming experience and stand out from the crowd, be sure to check out the new batch of Rust skins on Steam!</p>'),
(13745, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Trailer: A Thrilling Look at Gameplay'),
(13746, 'en-US', 'Here\'s a thrilling trailer for Rust that showcases the variety of features and survival atmosphere in this popular Steam game. Learn more about gameplay, building, combat, and more in Rust!'),
(13747, 'en-US', 'game Rust, trailer, gameplay, survival, building, interaction, battles, updates'),
(13748, 'en-US', 'We present to you a new trailer for the game Rust! In this exciting video, you will get acquainted with interesting moments of gameplay and learn more about the possibilities that this popular game on Steam provides you with. The trailer is several minutes long, but it allows you to fully immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the game and feel the energy that is in the air.<br/><br/> Rust is not just another survival game. You will have to overcome difficulties in the world after the apocalypse, where the main thing is to survive at any cost. Your main task is to build a shelter, collect resources, create weapons and fight with other players. But be careful, dangers await you at every step - wild animals, radiation, adverse natural conditions and other survivors.<br/><br/> The trailer presents various moments from the game, demonstrating the gameplay, building opportunities, interaction with other players and battles. With its fascinating graphics and original atmosphere, Rust attracts the attention of many players around the world. The game is updated and developed, constantly adding new features and fixing errors.<br/><br/> If you haven\'t played Rust yet, this trailer is a great opportunity to dive into a world of survival where every decision matters. Find out what dangers await you at every turn, how you can create unique structures, and what abilities your character has. Get ready for adrenaline-fueled adventures and exciting moments in Rust!'),
(13749, 'en-US', 'Server update is out: wipe and update are introduced'),
(13750, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Rust server update, which includes the ability to perform wipes and other updates, as well as information about the upcoming client update and graphics improvements.'),
(13751, 'en-US', 'server update, wipe, update, Rust, client, graphics'),
(13752, 'en-US', 'The Rust game server has a new update that introduces the ability to perform wipes and other updates. While the client update has not yet been released, a new level of graphics is already on the way...'),
(13753, 'en-US', 'Rust Game on Steam: Update with changes to spawn and visual elements'),
(13754, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about the Rust update on Steam, including spawn changes, visual updates, and a map reset. Also learn about the importance of staying safe in-game and respecting other players.'),
(13755, 'en-US', 'Rust game on Steam, game update, spawn changes, visual changes, map update, blueprint wipe, game safety'),
(13756, 'en-US', 'Unfortunately, driving away on a crane with the purpose of stealing clan transport over high walls will not work - the car quickly breaks down outside the monument, taking the driver\'s life with it.<br/><br/> Fresh news from the world of Rust awaits you! In this update, meet spawn changes and visual updates that will not leave you indifferent.<br/><br/> One of the main changes is related to the spawning of ores. Now in the desert you will be able to find more valuable resources than in the winter biome. This will give you even more opportunities for development and the creation of powerful weapons.<br/><br/> Also, there is no need to talk much about the visual changes, because it is best to judge them for yourself. Check out our screenshots and enjoy the improved graphics and detail in the game.<br/><br/> It is important to note that after the update, only the map will be reset. Blueprints will remain at the discretion of the server owners, which gives more flexibility and control. On Facepunch servers, for example, blueprints will remain, but other servers may have their own blueprint wipe schedules.<br/><br/> Please note that the update will be several gigabytes in size, so be prepared to download before playing. All changes and updates are available on Steam, so be sure to install the latest version of the game and enjoy the new content.<br/><br/> <b>Don\'t forget about safety:</b> when playing, be sure to follow the rules and do not violate other people\'s property. Play fair and respect other players. Good luck in the world of Rust!<br/><br/> <strong>Learn more about Red Dead Redemption 2 and its updates on Steam!</strong>'),
(13757, 'en-US', 'Rust Update: WIPE AND NEW GRAPHICS OUT TODAY AT 21:00 MSK!'),
(13758, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: WIPE AND NEW GRAPHICS OUT TODAY AT 21:00 MSK! New forests, cliffs, updated monuments and other changes that will surely please fans of the game.'),
(13759, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, wipe, new graphics, monument'),
(13760, 'en-US', 'WIPE AND NEW GRAPHICS ALREADY TODAY AT 21:00 MSK! This is possibly the biggest change to the game in a very long time. The appearance of the maps will change beyond recognition, monuments will be updated and not only...<br/><br/> • NEW GRAPHICS. This update has been in development for almost two years - was it worth it? I think so. New forests, cliffs, a completely new level of detail in the desert, updated monuments, a new junkyard and much more will definitely impress, especially those who have not seen the changes in person.<br/><br/> The developers assure that this update will not affect performance in any way - what you had before the update will remain at the same level after it. In addition, they said that they were able to reduce RAM consumption by 1 gigabyte, which may play a big role for someone.<br/><br/> • MONUMENT CHANGES. Firstly, the entrances to underground tunnels are now fully integrated with most monuments. Secondly, many have received a couple of visual improvements - for example, the cosmodrome or the train depot. Thirdly, monuments now look slightly different in winter - vegetation and some surfaces are covered with snow, which should look a little more logical.<br/><br/> The sphere and the dump have changed the most - the sphere has a new lower section with barrels and an oil refinery, and the parkour on the beam has been removed from above, now there is just a platform along which you can easily walk up.<br/><br/> The dump has been significantly reduced in size and has a rather useful function - now there is a recycler for cars and a crane-magnet, with the help of which it will be possible to lift and crush transport, receiving scrap metal in return (125 for 1 car from four modules)'),
(13761, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Updated Drops Site and Fresh Cosmetic Items'),
(13762, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Rust skins added to the updated drops site, including a free Ninja costume. Visit Twitch.facepunch.com for the full list of skins.'),
(13763, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game, updated drops site, ninja costume, cosmetic items'),
(13764, 'en-US', '<h2>Updated Drops Site Introduces New Skins</h2><br/><p> The Rust drops site has released an update that adds a bunch of new cosmetic items to the game. Players will now be able to purchase new skins that will bring a fresh style to the game world.</p><br/><br/><h3> Ninja costume - new item</h3><br/><p> One of the most interesting new items in the update is the Ninja Suit. It offers similar protection and crafting to the Surgeon Suit, but with a difference in cost. The Ninja Suit is completely free, allowing players to get it without any material costs. This is expected to lead to mass usage of the Ninja Suit, and the game world will soon see many ninja players.</p><br/><br/><p> To see the full range of new skins and get more information about the latest Rust updates, we recommend visiting the official website Twitch.facepunch.com.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to purchase new and stylish skins for your character and home in the game Rust! The updated drops site offers unique opportunities to improve your gaming experience.</p>'),
(13765, 'en-US', 'New Twitch drop starts May 6'),
(13766, 'en-US', 'Find out about the new Twitch drop for the game Rust, where you can get exclusive skins. Many popular streamers will participate in the distribution. Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your collection in the game Rust.'),
(13767, 'en-US', 'Twitch drop, skins, game Rust, Steam, streamers, exclusive items'),
(13768, 'en-US', 'On the given day of May 6, Twitch is launching a new Twitch drop that offers the chance to get exclusive skins for the game Rust on Steam. On this day, many popular streamers will participate in the skin distribution. Some of them include BaboAbe, spoonkid3, ItzMasayoshi, BritOnYT, peterparkTV and others. This is a great opportunity for fans of the game Rust to get unique items to decorate their characters and bases.'),
(13769, 'en-US', 'A working crane and machine recycler have appeared on the test branch'),
(13770, 'en-US', 'A working crane and a car recycler have arrived on the Rust test branch. Find out how these new features will change the gameplay and what they will bring to the game.'),
(13771, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, working crane, machine recycler, dump, graphics'),
(13772, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust test branch has added two new features - a working crane and a machine recycler. These additions will bring a new level of interaction with the surrounding world to the game.</p><br/><p> Previously, the recycler could be seen at the updated landfill. Now it has become fully functional and is able to accept unnecessary transport for recycling. At the moment, this only works with a test pickup, which, when destroyed, provides 50 units of scrap metal.</p><br/><p> The crane is now also fully controllable - the player can sit in it, turn it, drive around the map, lift and lower cargo, and also pick up vehicles using a magnet.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that both features are in very early stages of development and may be subject to change by the time of release. The developers are constantly working to improve and optimize these innovations.</p><br/><p> The official update, which includes these new features and improved graphics, is scheduled for May 6. This will be a great opportunity for Rust players to re-evaluate all the new features and changes.</p>'),
(13773, 'en-US', 'Interesting collection of new skins in the game Rust'),
(13774, 'en-US', 'Check out the new collection of skins in Rust that will add style and personality to your gaming experience.'),
(13775, 'en-US', 'new batch, skins, game Rust, Steam, update, items, design, store, prices'),
(13776, 'en-US', '<p>All fans of the game Rust will not have to wait any longer, because a new batch of skins has been released, which will please both beginners and experienced players.</p><br/><p> New skins add extra fun and aesthetic pleasure to the gameplay. They allow you to stand out from other players, decorate your inventory items, and add individuality and uniqueness to your game character.</p><br/><p> The collection of new skins includes various items such as weapons, armor, clothing, camp equipment and more. Each item has its own unique design that complements the atmosphere of the game and makes you attractive in the eyes of other players.</p><br/><p> The new skins also come in a variety of color and style options to suit different player tastes and preferences. You can choose a flashy and eye-catching skin to grab attention, or opt for a more stealthy and stylish one to blend in on the battlefield.</p><br/><p> Players can purchase new skins from the Steam store in the Rust section of the game. Skin prices can vary depending on their rarity and popularity. And if you really want a certain skin, you may need to invest a little bit in it.</p><br/><p> Remember that skins are cosmetic changes only and do not affect gameplay. They do not provide any advantages or improve game mechanics. They simply create additional visual charm and complement the appearance of your character and items.</p><br/><p> So don\'t miss the opportunity to update your gaming experience with new stylish skins and conquer the Rust gaming world on Steam!</p>'),
(13777, 'en-US', 'HDRP graphics: coming soon to Rust!'),
(13778, 'en-US', 'Find out all about the upcoming Rust update, which will add HDRP graphics to the game, improving the quality of graphics and imagery in the game.'),
(13779, 'en-US', 'HDRP graphics, Rust game, update, graphics quality, visual effects, system requirements'),
(13780, 'en-US', '<p>Starting next week, on May 6th, Rust PC players will be able to enjoy improved HDRP graphics! This is a long-awaited update that gives the game amazing beauty and realism.</p><br/><p> At 21:00 Moscow time, the developers will release an update adding HDRP graphics to the game. Now you can fully immerse yourself in the world of Rust and enjoy stunning visual effects.</p><br/><p> You probably know that HDRP (High Definition Render Pipeline) is a new graphics engine that significantly improves the quality of graphics in the game. This means not only better lighting and shadows, but also the addition of new effects such as real-time reflections, crisp textures, and depth of field.</p><br/><p> However, please note that the introduction of new HDRP graphics may result in a change in the game\'s system requirements. You may need to upgrade your hardware to enjoy the full beauty of the new visual style.</p><br/><p> In any case, these changes will be a major breakthrough in the graphical development of the Rust game. One of the most anticipated updates to HDRP graphics in Rust is improved texture quality, dynamic shadows, as well as improved lighting quality and map exploitation.</p><br/><p> We are looking forward to the update on May 6th and hope that HDRP graphics will be a truly amazing addition to the game! Get ready for a new experience and enjoy improved visual realism in Rust!</p>'),
(13781, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins for the game Rust on Steam'),
(13782, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new batch of skins in Rust on Steam and how they affect the design, functionality, cost, and game economy.'),
(13783, 'en-US', 'Game Rust, Steam, new skins, skins batch, design, functionality, cost, game economy'),
(13784, 'en-US', '<p>The world of Rust has received a new batch of skins on Steam, bringing fresh and interesting options for outfits and items to players. These skins will not only allow you to decorate your character and inventory, but also add some functional and gameplay features.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the key factors that influence the appeal of skins in the game Rust is their design. Each skin is designed with special care and attention to detail. They are presented in various styles and themes, allowing players to choose the most suitable option according to their preferences and style of play.</p><br/><br/><p> Another factor worth mentioning is the impact of skins on gameplay. Some skins provide unique benefits, such as increased defense, bonuses to certain skills, or increased movement speed. Such skins can be a decisive factor in a fight with other players or in exploring dangerous places.</p><br/><br/><p> However, when choosing skins, players should also consider their cost. Some skins can be quite expensive, while others are available at a more affordable price. It is important to find a balance between the desire to have a beautiful skin and satisfying budgetary constraints.</p><br/><br/><p> Finally, an important factor is the impact of skins on the game economy. The introduction of new skins into the game can change the prices and demand for existing skins. This can create an opportunity for players to make money by selling their skins or allow others to purchase popular items at a lower price.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, the new batch of skins in Rust on Steam offers players a unique opportunity to customize their characters and gain advantages in game situations. It is important to consider the balance between design, functionality, cost, and impact on the game economy when choosing the most suitable skin.</p>'),
(13785, 'en-US', 'Dying Light will have a crossover with the game Rust, where new enemies and weapons from Rust will appear.'),
(13786, 'en-US', 'game Rust, Dying Light, crossover, update, scientists-opponents, zombies, weapons'),
(13787, 'en-US', 'Dying Light to Get Rust Crossover from April 19 to 26'),
(13788, 'en-US', 'Hapis will be removed from the game in the May 6th update'),
(13789, 'en-US', 'The May 6th update will temporarily remove the Hapis map from the game, but will return soon after a graphics update.'),
(13790, 'en-US', 'Rust, Hapis, game, update, map, graphics'),
(13791, 'en-US', 'Contents of the article:'),
(13792, 'en-US', 'Bushes disappear when placing foundation in Rust'),
(13793, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Rust update, which allows bushes to disappear when laying foundations. Improved graphics, ease of base creation, and optimized gameplay are all coming in the future version of the game.'),
(13794, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, bushes, foundation, graphics, bases, optimization, performance'),
(13795, 'en-US', '<p>The world of Rust has received changes to bushes. Now, if you place a foundation on top of bushes, they will disappear. This is a major update that opens up new possibilities for building and exploring in the game.</p><br/><p> This change is part of a major graphics update that will be released on May 6 at 21:00 Moscow time. Thus, players will be able to enjoy improved graphics and exciting gameplay that will become even more realistic.</p><br/><p> Removing bushes when installing a foundation has its advantages. Firstly, it allows players to create more convenient and aesthetically pleasing bases by getting rid of impassable obstacles. Secondly, it helps optimize the gameplay, improving performance and reducing the load on the servers.</p><br/><p> The game Rust always strives to surprise and delight its fans with one or another change. The new update, which includes the removal of bushes when installing a foundation, is another milestone in the development of the game. The future is already here, and it promises to be exciting and exciting!</p>'),
(13796, 'en-US', 'We have great news for all fans of the game Rust! New skins have appeared that will allow you to decorate your virtual items even more stylishly and diversely.'),
(13797, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins, game Rust, skins in the game Rust'),
(13798, 'en-US', '<p>We have great news for all fans of the game Rust! New skins have appeared that will allow you to decorate your virtual items even more stylishly and diversely.</p><br/><p> The development team is constantly working on updates to provide players with the best gaming experience. And this time they did not let us down by releasing an amazing batch of new skins.</p><br/><p> The variety of skins will not leave you indifferent. From exclusive and elite weapons to unique clothes and items. You will be able to give your game collection individuality and style.</p><br/><p> However, in addition to the visual benefits, it is worth considering that skins can also affect game mechanics. Some skins can change the characteristics of items, making them more powerful or adding additional features.</p><br/><p> When choosing skins, keep in mind the balance between visual appeal and gameplay benefits. Remember that Rust is a very competitive game, and choosing the right skin can give you an edge over other players.</p><br/><p> Each new batch of skins is not only an update to the appearance of items, but also an opportunity to show your individuality and become unique among many players.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to update your skin collection and gain an advantage in the game! Treat yourself and others with new stylish items.</p>'),
(13799, 'en-US', 'New Skins in Rust: Variety and Individuality'),
(13800, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skins added to Rust and create a unique look for your character.'),
(13801, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, individuality, variety, unique look'),
(13802, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has new skins that offer players even more ways to express their individuality in the virtual world. Now you can create a unique look for your character, highlighting their style and preferences.</p><br/><br/><p> The main purpose of adding new skins is to add variety to the gameplay. Often, players want to stand out from the rest and show their individuality. With new skins in the game Rust, this becomes possible. You will be able to choose from a list of different skins for weapons, clothes or buildings to make your character even more recognizable and unique.</p><br/><br/><p> Adding new skins to Rust also helps create an economic system within the game world. Players can buy and sell skins among themselves, which opens up new opportunities for trading and exchanging in-game items. Some skins become very valuable and rare, making them especially attractive for collecting or selling on third-party sites.</p><br/><br/><p> However, when adding new skins, the balance of the gameplay must be taken into account. Game developers must carefully select skins so that they do not give an advantage to certain players or disturb the balance between game classes. This is an important part of the process of developing new skins to keep the game interesting and fair for all participants.</p><br/><br/><p> So, new skins in the game Rust open up a huge field for players to experiment and express themselves. They allow everyone to create their own unique image and emphasize their individuality. At the same time, balancing and choosing skins are important aspects to maintain equality between players and interesting gameplay. Diversity and individuality are the key factors that make new skins in the game Rust so important.</p>'),
(13803, 'en-US', 'Public beta testing of new graphics in the game Rust begins tomorrow'),
(13804, 'en-US', 'Public beta testing of new graphics in the game Rust starts tomorrow at 13:00 Moscow time. Find out how to connect to testing and what to pay attention to.'),
(13805, 'en-US', 'Rust graphics, beta testing, new version, bug reports, discord'),
(13806, 'en-US', 'Public beta testing of the new graphics will begin tomorrow at 13:00 Moscow time.<br/><br/> How to connect?<br/> • You must have Rust - Staging Branch installed.<br/> • Tomorrow, April 7 at 13:00 Moscow time, a separate beta called \"aux01\" will open for the test branch. To find it, right-click on Rust - Staging Branch in the Steam library, click on \"Properties\" and go to the \"Beta\" tab - there, in the drop-down list, select \"aux01\".<br/> • If the branch was selected, Steam will start downloading \"aux01\". Once installed, you will be able to enter the game and try out the new graphics.<br/><br/> What is required of us?<br/> Play, search and report bugs, if you have impressions - write about them, be they positive or negative. Keep in mind that this version of the game will often have wipes, at least for the first two weeks.<br/><br/> For all bug reports and feedback, the developers have launched two new channels in the official Rust Discord — #hdrp-general (for discussions) and #hdrp-bug-reports (for bug reports, obviously)<br/><br/> Please note that the server is English-only - if you want to share your opinion, you will need to do it in English.<br/><br/> How can I make my bug report useful?<br/> If you are the server owner and have found problems with map generation, then when reporting a bug you will need to write the seed and size of the map, as well as the approximate coordinates of the detected defect.<br/><br/> If you have performance issues (maybe significantly worse than the current version of the game with the same settings), it\'s important to share a full list of the game\'s graphics settings and your exact PC configuration.<br/><br/> When will the testing end?<br/> If everything goes as planned, beta testing will end in early May and the new graphics will be in the main version of the game on May 6 at 21:00 Moscow time.<br/><br/> If you don\'t have a chance to review all the changes yourself, there will be a post in the group soon with the most important changes to maps and monuments.<br/><br/> See you in the new Rust...'),
(13807, 'en-US', 'Why did the game update four times today?'),
(13808, 'en-US', 'Find out why Rust has been updated four times today and what fixes were included in these updates. Install the latest update to fix bugs and audio issues.'),
(13809, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, hotfix, easter content, problems, poker, audio, errors'),
(13810, 'en-US', 'If anyone is wondering why the game has been updated four times today:<br/><br/><ul><li> The first hotfix included Easter content - a bunny hat and a green Faberge egg. It also fixed issues with poker.</li><li> The second hotfix continued fixing poker and eliminating issues with audio and twitching of objects in hands.</li><li> The third hotfix rolled back the changes of the second hotfix.</li><li> The fourth hotfix rolled back the changes of the third hotfix and returned what was in the second hotfix.</li></ul> If you are experiencing errors in the game or have problems with sound, it is recommended to install the latest update.'),
(13811, 'en-US', 'More screenshots of the game with updated graphics from ThatGermanGuy'),
(13812, 'en-US', 'Check out these stunning screenshots of the updated Rust graphics created by ThatGermanGuy. They will make you marvel and admire the beauty of the game world and add realism to the game Rust.'),
(13813, 'en-US', 'Rust game, graphics update, ThatGermanGuy, Rust game screenshots, realistic atmosphere'),
(13814, 'en-US', 'Welcome to all Rust fans on Steam! We are happy to share with you even more stunning screenshots, which were taken using updated graphics from the talented artist ThatGermanGuy. Here you will find breathtaking landscapes, picturesque scenery and photorealism, which adds even more realism to the game! Dive into the world of Rust and enjoy these magnificent images that allow you to feel all the beauty and atmosphere of the game.<br/><br/> ThatGermanGuy is a true master of his craft, creating stunning art and screenshots that leave us amazed and in awe of his talent. His work adds a new level of visual experience and allows players to see the game in a completely new way. We are sure that you will appreciate every detail and the familiar map that comes to life under his skillful brush.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the chance to look at every screenshot and enjoy the art of ThatGermanGuy. Discover new corners of the Rust game world, explore the areas, notice the finest details and soak up the atmosphere of the game that makes your heart beat faster!<br/><br/> Our developers have been working on updated graphics for Rust to make it even more realistic and immersive. We strive to provide you with the best gaming experience possible, and ThatGermanGuy\'s new level of graphics will help us achieve this. The updated graphics promise to amaze and inspire all Rust players, creating a world of incredible beauty and realism.<br/><br/> Get ready for a breathtaking visual journey! Discover the new possibilities of the updated graphics in Rust with the help of screenshots from ThatGermanGuy. Don\'t miss the chance to see the game in a new light and enjoy a completely unusual and realistic atmosphere.<br/><br/><img src=\"скриншот1.jpg\" alt=\"screenshot 1\"><br/><p> One of the breathtaking screenshots is a stunning landscape with unusual rock shapes and a mystical sunset. The visuals and detailing allow you to feel all the charms of this unique place.</p><br/><br/><img src=\"скриншот2.jpg\" alt=\"screenshot 2\"><br/><p> In the second screenshot you can see a picturesque river that attracts with its transparency and crystal purity. Warm shades and shadows add even more realism to the game and attract the eye.</p><br/><br/><img src=\"скриншот3.jpg\" alt=\"screenshot 3\"><br/><p> And don\'t forget to check out the third screenshot, where you\'ll find a powerful and stunning view of the unique architecture of the local settlement. The constant changing weather and dynamic lighting create fantastic gaming moments.</p><br/><br/> All this beauty and grace awaits you in the game Rust. Our developers strive to make the game even better and more fun for all players, and new screenshots from ThatGermanGuy clearly show us the direction they are moving in.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to dive into the world of Rust and enjoy the updated graphics with us! Get ready for an exciting adventure and be amazed at what the updated graphics in the game Rust are capable of!');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(13815, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins dedicated to Easter'),
(13816, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Easter themed skins for Rust. Add some festive flair to your gameplay with these bright and creative designs!'),
(13817, 'en-US', 'new batch of skins, Easter, Rust, Rust game, skins in Rust, holiday skins Rust'),
(13818, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the wonderful world of Rust, where every day brings something new and exciting. And today we have something special - a new batch of skins, which is dedicated to Easter!</p><br/><p> Easter is a time of joy and rebirth, and new skins for Rust will add a special festive mood to your gameplay. Now you have the opportunity to decorate your in-game items with Easter flavor and give them new life.</p><br/><p> The new batch of Easter skins offers a wide range of different designs, from bright pastel colors to fun Easter symbols. You can transform your weapons, tools, clothes, and buildings to make them unique and memorable.</p><br/><p> Rust always aims to satisfy and diversify your gaming experience, and the new batch of skins dedicated to Easter is a great example of this. It does not matter whether you are a combat expert or a builder, the new skins have a place in every aspect of the game.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to add some Easter magic to your world of Rust with a new batch of skins. Hang bright Easter garlands on your buildings, decorate your clothes with eggs and bunnies, and make your weapons a real work of Easter art.</p><br/><p> A new batch of Easter-themed skins are available in the Rust Steam Store. Head over there to see what designs will be available to you. Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to make your game even brighter and more memorable! Easter is just around the corner, so join us and add the spirit of the holiday to your Rust world!</p>'),
(13819, 'en-US', 'Servers are going to wipe and update!'),
(13820, 'en-US', 'Learn about the upcoming Rust server wipe and update! The article details the changes, bug fixes, new features, and the contents of the new client update. Find out how to save your progress before the wipe and what to expect after the update - new locations, weapons, and more!'),
(13821, 'en-US', 'Servers, wipe, update, Rust, client, news, changes, bug fixes, performance improvements, new features, save progress, new locations, weapons, items, challenges, battles, players, server news'),
(13822, 'en-US', 'Dear players!<br/><br/> Good news! The Rust servers are getting ready for a wipe and update, which means new adventures and opportunities in the game await you. In this article, we will tell you in detail about the upcoming changes and what you can expect.<br/><br/> One of the main news is the client update, which is already on its way! In just 5 minutes, you will be able to download and install the new update to enjoy its functionality. It will contain many bug fixes, performance improvements, and the addition of new features.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget to save your progress before the server wipe! All your inventory and buildings will be reset to create a clean slate for all players. But don\'t worry, you\'ll be given the opportunity to start over and implement new strategies and plans.<br/><br/> We have prepared a lot of interesting content for you after the update and wipe. New locations, weapons, items and much more are waiting for you in the game Rust. Be ready for new challenges and go ahead, capture new territories and fight with other players!<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the opportunity to dive into the world of Rust after the wipe and update. Follow our news and get ready for new adventures!'),
(13823, 'en-US', 'Link to Twitch Drops for easy online monitoring'),
(13824, 'en-US', 'Find out how to get free skins in Rust by following the Twitch Drops link. Monitor skin drops on Twitch and don\'t miss the opportunity to get rare items for your character.'),
(13825, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Skins, Giveaways, Streams, Free'),
(13826, 'en-US', '<p>Getting free skins in Rust is now easier thanks to Twitch Drops. You can now easily track and access skin giveaways by simply following the Twitch Drops link.</p><br/><p> Twitch Drops is an innovative feature offered by the developers of the game Rust that allows players to get free skins just by watching streams on Twitch. All you need to do is log in to your Twitch account, connect your Steam account and start watching streams with Drops features. Once you have accumulated the required number of views, you will automatically receive skins in your game inventory.</p><br/><p> Twitch Drops Link is a special page on the Rust developer website that allows you to easily monitor and follow current skin giveaways. Simply follow the Twitch Drops link to see a list of available drops and find out which streams you should watch to get the skins you want. This gives you the opportunity to stay up to date with all the current events and drops so you don’t miss out on the chance to get rare and exclusive skins for your Rust character.</p><br/><p> Twitch Drops are not only a great way to get free skins, but also a way to support your favorite streamers. By watching their streams with Drops features, you help them earn extra income and continue to create quality content for you and other viewers.</p><br/><p> The convenience of monitoring skin drops on Twitch Drops makes it an integral part of the Rust experience. Stay up to date with all the latest drops and get rare skins just by watching streams on Twitch.</p>'),
(13827, 'en-US', 'Review of the new update of the game Rust on Steam'),
(13828, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam has received a fresh update that brings a lot of interesting innovations to the game world. Learn about new weapons, tools, building system, economic system and safety improvements in Rust.'),
(13829, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, innovations in Rust, weapons and tools in Rust, new construction system in Rust, economic system in Rust, security and fight against cheaters in Rust, update on Steam'),
(13830, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on Steam has received a fresh update, which has brought many interesting innovations to the gaming world. In this article, we will look at the main changes that appeared after the update and analyze how they will affect the gameplay and the experience of players.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the major changes is the introduction of new weapons and tools. The developers of the game Rust have added new firearms to the players\' arsenal, which will give them more options in battles with opponents. There are also new tools that will help players in creating and improving their fortifications.</p><br/><br/><p> Another interesting change was the introduction of a new construction system. Players will now be able to create stronger and more stable structures, which will add new opportunities to defend their base and protect against enemies. The new system also offers various options for decorating and customizing the base, which will allow players to show off their creative administration.</p><br/><br/><p> Additionally, the update has made changes to the game\'s economic system. New types of resources have been introduced that can be used to create various items and buildings. This will create a deeper progression system and give players more options for developing their base.</p><br/><br/><p> Finally, it is worth noting the improvements in the security system and the fight against cheaters. The developers of the game Rust have improved protection against hacking databases and the introduction of prohibited programs. This will make the gameplay more honest and fair for all players.</p><br/><br/><p> Overall, the new Rust Steam update brings a number of interesting and useful changes that will make the gameplay even more exciting and intense. The developers continue to work on improving the game and listen to the community\'s opinions to make Rust even better.</p>'),
(13831, 'en-US', 'SHADOWFRAX Showcases Updated Graphics in Rust in New Video'),
(13832, 'en-US', 'SHADOWFRAX presents an eight-minute video with an exclusive demonstration of updated graphics of the game Rust. The improvements do not affect the game\'s performance. Public beta testing will begin on April 7, the full release is scheduled for May 6. The developers promise that the FPS will remain at the same level.'),
(13833, 'en-US', 'Rust, SHADOWFRAX, updated graphics, video, beta testing, FPS'),
(13834, 'en-US', 'SHADOWFRAX delights Rust fans with a new eight-minute video in which he presents an exclusive preview of the updated graphics.<br/><br/> New textures, improved rocks and environments, as well as updated monuments, including spheres, junkyards and satellite dishes, change the gaming experience, making it completely new. However, according to SHADOWFRAX, these changes did not affect the game\'s performance, and no significant drops in FPS should be expected. Another pleasant innovation is the glowing beacon.<br/><br/> The public beta testing of the update is scheduled for April 7. To participate, you need to install the Rust Staging Branch and select the \"aux01\" branch in the beta settings. The full release of the update is expected on May 6, subject to positive feedback and testing results. The developers assure that the game\'s performance will remain at the same level, and will not deteriorate or improve.'),
(13835, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Rust game on Steam'),
(13836, 'en-US', 'Information about skin distribution on Twitch Drops in the game Rust on Steam. Event start, Easter content, poker inclusion and skin application on L96.'),
(13837, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam, Easter Event, Poker, Skins, L96'),
(13838, 'en-US', 'Today at 21:00 the Twitch Drops event starts in the game Rust on Steam. As part of this event, Easter content will be available, as well as an update that includes a new feature - poker and the ability to apply skins to the L96 rifle.'),
(13839, 'en-US', 'Changes in the game Rust: Update from April 1'),
(13840, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Rust update that prohibits the use of heavy bulletproof armor when riding horses. The changes are aimed at balancing and making the game experience more interesting.'),
(13841, 'en-US', 'Rust game, game update, horse riders, heavy armor ban, gameplay balancing, changes, strategies and tactics'),
(13842, 'en-US', '<p>Rust players, get ready for some changes with a new update coming this Thursday, April 1st. One of the big aspects of this update is the ban on the use of heavy bulletproof armor when riding horses.</p><br/><p> Previously, riders on armored horses had certain advantages in firefights due to reduced damage taken. However, with the new update, such use of armored horses will be prohibited.</p><br/><p> The update aims to balance the gameplay and create new trade-offs between different types of defense and movement. Now players will have to look for other strategies and tactics to stay competitive in the game.</p><br/><p> Stay up to date with all the changes and don\'t miss the update, which will be released on April 1 at 21:00 Moscow time. Let\'s hope that these changes will bring freshness and interest to the gaming experience of every Rust player.</p>'),
(13843, 'en-US', 'Beta testing of the graphics update will begin in early April'),
(13844, 'en-US', 'Rust\'s graphics update will enter beta testing in April, making it the largest update in the game\'s history. The release is scheduled for May-June.'),
(13845, 'en-US', 'graphics update, beta testing, Rust, procedural maps, monuments, visual component, full release'),
(13846, 'en-US', 'Beta testing of the Rust graphics update will begin in early April. It is expected to be the largest update in the history of the game, affecting procedural maps, monuments and the visual component of the game world. The full release of the update is planned for May-June.'),
(13847, 'en-US', 'Easter Egg Collection Event in Rust'),
(13848, 'en-US', 'Information about the Easter Egg Collection Event in Rust. Find out how to participate in the event, get valuable items and new items. Don\'t miss it! The game update is expected on April 1st.'),
(13849, 'en-US', 'easter event, egg collection, game update, Rust, basket, valuable items, machine gun, grenade launcher, bunny hat, Faberge egg, minecart'),
(13850, 'en-US', '<p>The Easter egg event will begin with the game update on April 1st.</p><br/><p> As in previous years, you will be able to take part in this interesting event! You will only need a little patience and a desire to get valuable items.</p><br/><p> How to find and collect eggs? During the event, eggs will appear on the game map. Your task is to find them using a special basket that you will receive at the start of the event. By collecting eggs, you can upgrade them to gold, where the most valuable items are located, such as machine guns or grenade launchers.</p><br/><p> Not only eggs will be new for this event, but a new item will be added along with it. A bunny hat with floppy ears will be a decoration for your character.</p><br/><p> You can also find a Faberge egg, which hides a miniature trolley inside.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss this exciting event and get a chance to get rare items in Rust. Wait for the update on April 1st and start your Easter hunt!</p>'),
(13851, 'en-US', 'New Skins on Twitch Drops in Rust'),
(13852, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest news in the game Rust! We tell you about the new skins on Twitch Drops and how to get them. Update your collection of skins and improve your gaming experience in Rust.'),
(13853, 'en-US', 'new skins, Twitch Drops, Rust game, skin collection, gaming experience'),
(13854, 'en-US', '<p>Check out the latest news in Rust! Today we\'re covering new skins available through Twitch Drops.</p><br/><p> Now you can get unique skins that will help you stand out from other players and show off your style and personality. Twitch Drops offers you the opportunity to get these skins simply by watching Rust streams on the Twitch platform.</p><br/><p> The new Twitch Drops skins represent various pieces of equipment, including weapons, clothing, and gear. They have been designed with attention to detail and quality to create a unique gaming experience. You will be able to decorate your character and the environment in the game to become the real stars of the server.</p><br/><p> To get these skins, you just need to link your Twitch account to your Rust account and start watching streams that participate in the Twitch Drops program. Once you get the skins, you can activate them in the game and enjoy the new look of your character and items.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to update your skin collection by supporting your favorite streamers and enjoying free, exclusive items in Rust. Stay tuned and don\'t miss new streams participating in the Twitch Drops program to stay up to date with all the new skins and offers.</p><br/><p> Join us on Twitch and take part in Twitch Drops to earn unique skins and take your gaming experience to the next level!</p>'),
(13855, 'en-US', 'Rust Console Edition for PlayStation 4 and Xbox One will be released on May 21, 2021'),
(13856, 'en-US', 'Get all the details about the release of Rust Console Edition for PlayStation 4 and Xbox One on May 21, 2021. Pre-order the game and get exclusive bonuses: skin packs, early access and much more.'),
(13857, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust Console Edition, PlayStation 4, Xbox One, Deluxe Edition, Legendary Edition, pre-order, in-game currency, Rust coins'),
(13858, 'en-US', 'Rust Console Edition for PlayStation 4 and Xbox One will be released on May 21, 2021. Pre-orders are already open - the game costs 3,579 rubles.<br/><br/> The console port will come with Deluxe and Legendary editions. Here are their features:<br/> Deluxe Edition:<br/> • Future tool and weapon skin packs<br/> • Kit for beginner players<br/> • Access to the game 3 days before the official release<br/> • Early access for everyone who pre-ordered (will happen sometime in April or early May)<br/> • Access to the test branch<br/><br/> Legendary Edition:<br/> • Future tool and weapon skin packs<br/> • Ultimate version of the set for beginners<br/> • Access to the game 3 days before the official release<br/> • Early access for everyone who pre-ordered (will happen sometime in April or early May)<br/> • Access to the test branch<br/> • Elite Fighter Skin Pack<br/> • 1100 Rust coins (in-game currency)<br/><br/> The currency will be used to purchase skins.<br/><br/> Microsoft Store: https://www.microsoft.com/ru-ru/p/rust-console-editio..<br/> PlayStation Store: https://store.playstation.com/ru-ru/product/EP4415-CU..<br/><br/> #playstation #xbox'),
(13859, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Participant List Announced'),
(13860, 'en-US', 'The list of participants for the next Twitch Drops has been announced. It will take place on April 1 at 21:00 Moscow time. Don\'t miss the chance to get unique skins for the game Rust on Steam from streamers Suspect, PyrooTV, NoraExplorer, Picco, DairygoldG, Tesla, xGuiRy, chistobzden and etoleto.'),
(13861, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, list of participants, April 1, Rust on Steam, skins, Suspect, PyrooTV, NoraExplorer, Picco, DairygoldG, Tesla, xGuiRy, chistobzden, etoleto'),
(13862, 'en-US', 'The next Twitch Drops, which will take place on April 1 at 21:00 Moscow time, will feature the following streamers: Suspect, PyrooTV, NoraExplorer, Picco, DairygoldG, Tesla, xGuiRy, chistobzden and etoleto. They are all ready to share their skins with viewers. Don\'t miss the opportunity to get unique items for your Rust game on Steam. The list of their skins will be added to the post a little later. Stay tuned!'),
(13863, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust - expect new unique styles!'),
(13864, 'en-US', 'Unique styles and new looks in the game Rust with the new batch of skins. Stay on trend with stylish looks and stand out from other players!'),
(13865, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins, Rust game, unique styles, updates, appearance'),
(13866, 'en-US', '<p>Rust players, hold on tight because a new batch of skins is coming to the game!</p><br/><p> If you are tired of the old images of your character, now you have a chance to refresh its appearance with new and stylish skins.</p><br/><p> We\'ve heard your requests and have done our best to offer you a wide range of skins of varying character - from aggressive military paint jobs to bright and colorful options.</p><br/><p> Each skin has been carefully and thoughtfully designed to make your items unique and stand out from other players. We are confident that the new batch of skins will be a great addition to your gaming experience and will help you express your individuality in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to upgrade your items and let your character stand out from the rest of the players - follow our updates!</p>'),
(13867, 'en-US', 'Rust Update: Full Gesture Support with Separate Menu and Animations'),
(13868, 'en-US', 'A new update has been added to the Rust test branch with full gesture support, a separate menu and animations, which adds freedom of expression and improves communication between players.'),
(13869, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, gestures, menu, animations'),
(13870, 'en-US', '<p>A highly anticipated update has been added to the Rust test branch - full gesture support with a separate menu and animations.</p><br/><br/><p> Previously, to use gestures, players had to call a console command or use binds. But with the April 1 update, the developers added a convenient quick selection menu that can be opened by pressing the B key. Now using gestures has become much easier and more accessible.</p><br/><br/><p> The most noticeable change is the addition of special hand animations when playing gestures. Now, using gestures, you will be able to not only quickly communicate with other players, but also do so with stylish animation.</p><br/><br/><p> The update gives players greater freedom of expression and communication in the game. This increases immersion and helps create more interesting and interactive moments with other players.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to try out the new gesture feature with a separate menu and animations in Rust. You\'ll be surprised how it can change your gaming experience.</p>'),
(13871, 'en-US', 'Adding Poker to Rust'),
(13872, 'en-US', 'The Rust team is introducing a new update to the game that adds the ability to play poker. Players are invited to check, raise, or fold cards in an atmosphere of excitement and strategy. The update will be available on April 1 at 21:00 Moscow time.'),
(13873, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, poker, Texas Hold \'Em, developers, game world, scrap metal, bandit camp, casino, gaming tables, metal raw materials, excitement, strategy'),
(13874, 'en-US', 'The Rust team is excited to announce a new update that will add poker to the game! Now you can play Texas Hold \'Em right in the world of Rust.<br/><br/> The rules of the game remain unchanged and are identical to other poker implementations. You will be able to check, raise bets or fold cards, hoping for a win. And all this will happen using scrap metal, which makes the game even more exciting.<br/><br/> To play poker, you will need to visit the bandit camp, where there is a casino with gaming tables for 4 and 6 players. In addition, you can also find a table for two in one of the nearby booths. This is the perfect place to spend an evening in a cozy atmosphere and compete for victory.<br/><br/> You\'ve all been waiting for this update, and it\'s coming on April 1st at 21:00 Moscow time. Get ready to dive into the excitement and strategy, and get ready for a new challenge in Rust!'),
(13875, 'en-US', 'New Skins for Rust: Learn About the Latest Batch of Skins'),
(13876, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest batch of skins for Rust and how they can change and improve your gaming experience in this popular survival game on Steam.'),
(13877, 'en-US', 'New skins, game Rust, Steam, armor, weapons, shells, tools'),
(13878, 'en-US', '<p>The new batch of skins for the game Rust is here, and it brings with it a lot of interesting new things! If you are a fan of this popular survival game, do not miss the opportunity to update your gaming experience with fresh skins.</p><br/><p> Rust on Steam is also attractive to players due to its rich assortment of skins that allow you to customize the appearance of your items and characters. New skins not only make the game more colorful and diverse, but can also become a valuable asset in the player community.</p><br/><p> This latest batch of skins includes a variety of options, from weapons and armor to shells and tools. They feature original and stylish designs created by talented artists to suit the most sophisticated tastes of players.</p><br/><p> However, before you dive into buying new skins, there are a few things to consider. First, remember that skins are just cosmetic changes and do not affect gameplay mechanics. They may improve your visual experience, but they will not affect your gaming skills.</p><br/><p> It is also worth noting that some skins may be time-limited and only available during a certain period. So if you like a particular skin, do not put off purchasing it until later, as it may no longer be available.</p><br/><p> But despite these few limitations, new skins increase the variety and possibilities in the game Rust. You will be able to stand out from other players, create a unique image and show your style.</p><br/><p> So welcome to the world of new skins for the game Rust! Get ready for an adventure with original and expressive external details that will help you get to know the game from a new side. You will have the opportunity to personalize your gaming experience and emphasize your individuality!</p>'),
(13879, 'en-US', 'New screenshot of the game with updated graphics'),
(13880, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Rust screenshot, which showcases updated graphics, a new sphere and road textures, and improved procedural generation of the game world. The developers continue to improve the game to create a unique gaming experience.'),
(13881, 'en-US', 'new screenshot, updated graphics, Rust, sphere, road textures, procedural generation, unique world, adventures'),
(13882, 'en-US', '<p>A new screenshot of the game with updated graphics is causing delight among Rust fans. The latest update brought us not only new graphics, but also a magnificent sphere, as well as gorgeous road textures. Now the game looks even more realistic and exciting!</p><br/><p> Particular attention should be paid to the procedural generation of the game world. The update has introduced new elements and improved the terrain generation algorithm. Thanks to this, each game world will be unique and unpredictable, which adds additional excitement and adventure to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> Alistair\'s comment on the new changes to Rust says it all: \"Rust will be forever changed.\" The developers continue to improve the game and add new features to surprise players and create a unique gaming experience.</p>'),
(13883, 'en-US', 'First screenshots of the updated monument \"Dump\"'),
(13884, 'en-US', 'Get the first exclusive screenshots of the updated Dump monument in Rust. Learn about the impressive visual changes and plans for other monuments.'),
(13885, 'en-US', 'Rust, game update, monument Dump, screenshots, graphic update'),
(13886, 'en-US', '<p><br/>We managed to get exclusive screenshots of the updated monument \"Dump\" in the game Rust. Impressive visual changes await players in the new version of the monument.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> The central part of the monument is now decorated with a crane and a machine recycler, which, according to the developers, will not just be decoration, but will play an important role in the gameplay.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> The Junkyard Monument update is part of a major graphics update to the game. The procedural maps and terrain textures will be replaced by completely reworked versions of monuments, including the Junkyard, Sphere, Satellite Dishes, and many others.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> There is no specific release date yet, but Alistair says the developers are planning to release the update in April or later.<br/></p>'),
(13887, 'en-US', 'News for players on EU Facepunch servers'),
(13888, 'en-US', 'News for players playing on EU Facepunch servers. Due to a fire in the OVH data center, the servers are offline, which will lead to the loss of game progress in the game Rust.'),
(13889, 'en-US', 'EU Facepunch, EU Facepunch servers, OVH fire, data loss, Rust servers'),
(13890, 'en-US', '<p>News for those who play on EU Facepunch servers:</p><br/><p> The official servers in the EU region are currently facing a serious problem. Due to a fire in the OVH data center, more than 25 servers are offline. The emergency has led to the complete destruction of the SBG-2 building, and this may lead to significant data loss when restoring the servers.</p><br/><p> Basically, this means that the EU Facepunch servers have burned down, which in turn could lead to the loss of game progress in the game Rust.</p>'),
(13891, 'en-US', 'New Skins Rust Game on Steam: Get a Skin for Pants by Watching Streamer bnans'),
(13892, 'en-US', 'The drop from shroud was passed on to streamer bnans, and now you can get a unique skin for pants when watching her streams. Don\'t miss the chance to update your skin collection!'),
(13893, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust, Steam, skins for pants, bnans, streams, shroud, game Rust, get skin'),
(13894, 'en-US', '<p>The drop from shroud was passed on to streamer bnans, and now you have a unique opportunity to get a skin for the pants, just by watching her streams!</p><br/><p> This great news was due to shroud almost stopping streaming Rust. However, the Rust developers had an idea to attract more players to watch streams and give them the opportunity to update their skin collection.</p><br/><p> So now you can enjoy watching bnans streams and get an exclusive skin for your pants at the same time. This is a great opportunity not only to decorate your character with a new skin, but also to support your favorite streamer.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to get this unique pants skin and follow bnans\' streams!</p>'),
(13895, 'en-US', 'Client and server update released'),
(13896, 'en-US', 'The developers of the game Rust have released a new update for the client and server, which fixed problems with displaying effects in underground tunnels and breaking slot machines when loading saves.'),
(13897, 'en-US', 'update, client, server, Rust, northern lights, rainbows, lightning, underground tunnels, slot machines, saving'),
(13898, 'en-US', 'Today\'s news for all fans of the game Rust: the developers have released a fresh update for the client and server. In this article, we will tell you about the main changes that await you.<br/><br/> One of the most noticeable changes is that the northern lights, rainbows, and lightning are no longer visible in underground tunnels. This is intended to make the gameplay more realistic and to prevent some of the shortcomings associated with the visualization of these effects in closed spaces.<br/><br/> Another important fix is the fix for the slot machines breaking when loading a save file. Previously, some players encountered an issue where the machines would not work after restarting the server or loading a save. However, this issue should now be fixed, allowing you to continue your adventures without any problems and use the slot machines to their full potential.'),
(13899, 'en-US', 'Check out the new skins that have been added to Rust on Steam. Update the look of your items and characters with unique and stylish skins.'),
(13900, 'en-US', 'new skins, game Rust, Steam, updates, visual effects, personality, style'),
(13901, 'en-US', 'The latest batch of skins for Rust on Steam brings a variety of unique and exciting looks. Players can now customize their items and characters with a variety of skins that add new visual effects and upgrades. These new skins not only give the game a new look, but also allow players to express their personality and style in the world of Rust.'),
(13902, 'en-US', 'Freight Transit Line update is out!'),
(13903, 'en-US', 'The Freight Transit Line update brings trains and arcade machines to the world of Rust. Find out more and enjoy the new features!'),
(13904, 'en-US', 'update, Freight Transit Line, trains, slot machines'),
(13905, 'en-US', '<h2>Freight Transit Line update is out!</h2><br/><p> Breaking news for Rust players! Everyone has been waiting for this moment, and here it is - the Freight Transit Line update is now available!</p><br/><p> What\'s new in this update?</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Trains - Now you can travel around the world of Rust on comfortable trains, enjoying beautiful scenery and safe travel.</li><br/><li> Slot machines - now the game has slot machines where you can try your luck and get additional rewards.</li><br/><li> The update weighs in at 1.6 GB - be sure to update your game and enjoy all the new features that the Freight Transit Line update brings.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> If you have any questions or want to learn more, you can read the official article about the update on <a href=\"https://rust.facepunch.com/blog/freight-transit-line\">the official Rust website</a> .</p><br/><p> We also recommend watching the video review of the Freight Transit Line update on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XG41f-llelM\">YouTube</a> .</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget that the servers should already be wiped, so we wish you good luck playing in the updated world of Rust!</p>'),
(13906, 'en-US', 'Rust Servers: Update and Wipe'),
(13907, 'en-US', 'Learn about the importance of updates and wipes on Rust servers and how they affect gameplay and the economy.'),
(13908, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust servers, update, wipe, gameplay, economy'),
(13909, 'en-US', '<p>Once you get comfortable on a new Rust server, the inevitable update and wipe comes. What does this mean for players and their progress? Let\'s find out.</p><br/><br/><p> Each player, starting their adventure on the Rust server, strives to survive and develop, creating their base and collecting resources. However, from time to time, the developers release updates that require a complete reboot of the servers and erasing all the players\' achievements. There are several reasons for this.</p><br/><br/><p> First, updates introduce new features, fix bugs, and improve gameplay. New items, mechanics, and features provide players with more interesting and varied options for playing the game. Updates also help keep the game up to date and prevent content from becoming outdated.</p><br/><br/><p> Secondly, wipes are necessary to balance the economy and eliminate unwanted consequences of accumulated player progress. Without periodic data resets, some players may reach too high a level of development, which will lead to imbalance and reduce interest in the game. Wipes create a fresh start for all players, equalizing their chances of success and stimulating active and fair gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> As a player, it is important to understand that updates and wipes are an integral part of the Rust game. Instead of getting upset, you should perceive them as a new challenge and an opportunity to start over. Rust is always changing and evolving, and only active and adaptable players will be able to survive and thrive in this harsh world.</p><br/><br/><p> So, prepare for updates and wipes, save your knowledge and experience, and be ready to start over every time the Rust servers are updated. Only then can you become a true survivor in this ruthless game.</p>'),
(13910, 'en-US', '⚠ UPDATE, WIPE AND TWITCH DROPS ALREADY TODAY AT 22:00 MSK! Underground tunnels and trains, slot machines and more'),
(13911, 'en-US', 'Underground tunnels, trains, slot machines and new Twitch Drops in the Rust update on Steam. The wipe and Twitch Drops will start today at 22:00 Moscow time.'),
(13912, 'en-US', 'update, wipe, Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam, underground tunnels, trains, slot machines'),
(13913, 'en-US', '⚠ UPDATE, WIPE AND TWITCH DROPS ALREADY TODAY AT 22:00 MSK! Underground tunnels and trains, slot machines and more.<br/><br/> Trains and Underground Tunnels are here. Take advantage of a completely new way to move around the map with new train tracks that can be accessed via stations located near most monuments. But as you head down, remember that you won\'t be alone.<br/><br/> The tunnels are filled with local wanderers armed with M39s and Berettas. You will definitely encounter them in the corridors and tunnels themselves, where NPC ambushes with barricades will be located on some sections of the path.<br/><br/> Slot machines (aka \"one-armed bandits\") have been added to bandit camps.<br/> You can find them there in the amount of three pieces. Each spin costs 2 scrap metal, and for any combination of 3 identical icons you will receive a certain amount of scrap metal.<br/><br/> If you\'re especially lucky, you might even hit the jackpot, which will reward you with 1,500 scrap metal!<br/><br/> Server Browser Tweaks - The developers have made some adjustments to how it works. It now doesn\'t initially look for any empty servers, allowing it to find more full ones.<br/><br/> Minor changes to procedural maps - the Scientist Outpost will no longer spawn in the winter biome, and electrical substations near roads no longer emit radiation.<br/><br/> • Today at 22:00 Moscow time, a new Twitch Drops will begin. The list of participants this time: bnans, Blooprint, deathwingua, Ricoy, Albin, r00t9r, Swales, shroud, Willjum, iRisk, TwinkleCave and Vice Versa Games. A separate post will be written about this closer to the above-mentioned time with all the details.<br/><br/> The server update will be released about 10-20 minutes before the scheduled time, so that the servers can go to the update and wipe in time. The client, dev blog and trailer will be released exactly at 22:00 Moscow time. The wipe will only affect maps, but your server may have its own schedule for blueprint wipes.'),
(13914, 'en-US', 'Official Teaser Trailer for Rust on PlayStation 4 and Xbox One'),
(13915, 'en-US', 'Official Rust teaser trailer for PlayStation 4 and Xbox One. News about the console version of the game, graphics update and beta testing.'),
(13916, 'en-US', 'Rust, PlayStation 4, Xbox One, trailer, console version, graphics update, beta testing'),
(13917, 'en-US', 'Now you can play Rust on consoles! Facepunch Studios has released the official teaser trailer for Rust on PlayStation 4 and Xbox One. The new trailer was recorded entirely on consoles, which distinguishes it from the previous trailer from 2019. Attentive viewers will be able to notice some changes in the terrain textures, which apparently were already used for the HDRP update. At the same time, the graphics update for the PC version is still in development.<br/> The first batch of keys for the console version of Rust has already been sent to some participants. At the moment, the developers are actively testing the stability of the servers, after which they will begin accepting more players into beta testing.<br/> The teaser trailer is available on the official YouTube channel of the game Rust:<br/> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6FLZQX56MQ'),
(13918, 'en-US', 'The list of participants for the upcoming Twitch Drops on March 4 has been revealed'),
(13919, 'en-US', 'The list of participants for the upcoming Twitch Drops on March 4 has been revealed. Bnans, Blooprint, deathwingua, Ricoy, Albin, r00t9r, Swales, shroud, Willjum, iRisk, TwinkleCave, and Vice Versa Games will be participating.'),
(13920, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, participant list, March 4'),
(13921, 'en-US', 'The list of participants for the upcoming Twitch Drops, which will take place on March 4, has been revealed. Among the participants will be bnans, Blooprint, deathwingua, Ricoy, Albin, r00t9r, Swales, shroud, Willjum, iRisk, TwinkleCave and Vice Versa Games. What\'s especially interesting is that shroud will be participating for the second time!'),
(13922, 'en-US', 'Some details regarding the console port of Rust'),
(13923, 'en-US', 'In this article, we cover some details about the console port of Rust, such as the start of beta testing, the lack of keyboard and mouse support, cross-platform, and availability on the new PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X gaming consoles.'),
(13924, 'en-US', 'console port, Rust, beta testing, keyboard and mouse support, cross-platform, PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X'),
(13925, 'en-US', '<p>In this post, we will tell you about some important details of the console port of the game Rust.</p><br/><p> 1. The beta test starts on Monday, and if the little hints on the official Twitter are to be believed, you can expect a notification about the acceptance of participants to be sent to them via email.</p><br/><p> 2. It is important to note that the console version of Rust will not support keyboard and mouse. The developers decided to focus on creating a convenient and intuitive controller for maximum comfort when playing on consoles.</p><br/><p> 3. Cross-platform will only be supported between Xbox One and PS4 servers. This will allow players on different consoles to meet and compete with each other in the virtual world of Rust.</p><br/><p> 4. Rust and its beta will be available on PlayStation 5 and Xbox Series X, but only via backward compatibility for now. But this is a strong sign that Rust will be fully optimized and adapted for new generations of gaming consoles in the future.</p>'),
(13926, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam has a new batch of skins that you\'ll love! Find out how they can impact your gameplay and how to choose the right skin based on your preferences and budget.'),
(13927, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game on Steam, customization, unique appearance, functionality, analysis, testing, budget, choice'),
(13928, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome, friends, to the world of Rust - an exciting game where every step can be fatal. Today we have amazing news for you! A new batch of skins has been added to the game Rust on Steam, which you will definitely like.</p><br/><p> As we know, skins are an opportunity to customize your character and weapons, making them more unique and colorful. The new batch of skins in Rust is not only a beautiful appearance, but also an opportunity to stand out from other players and add a little variety to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> The new batch of skins includes a variety of different items, from clothing and accessories to weapons and building materials. Each of them has its own unique appearance and design, which adds a special charm to the game.</p><br/><p> However, choosing new skins can be a real challenge. What style do you like the most? Which item do you want to transform first? All these questions require attention and careful analysis.</p><br/><p> Keep in mind that new skins can affect gameplay. Some items can provide certain benefits, such as increased defense or faster health regeneration. This means that when deciding to buy a skin, it is important to consider not only its appearance, but also its functionality.</p><br/><p> Luckily, Rust has the ability to test skins before buying them. This will allow you to evaluate them in action and make the right choice. Don\'t forget to consider your budget as well - the price of skins can vary depending on their rarity and popularity.</p><br/><p> So, friends, what are you waiting for? Come to the game Rust on Steam and update your wardrobe or arsenal with new and stylish skins. Unique appearance, new opportunities and unforgettable emotions are waiting for you!</p>'),
(13929, 'en-US', 'Underground tunnels are now available for testing – first look!'),
(13930, 'en-US', 'Underground tunnels are a new way to travel in Rust. Players will be able to use trains, encounter enemies, and find valuable items along the way.'),
(13931, 'en-US', 'underground tunnels, update, game Rust, trains, movement, NPC, opponents'),
(13932, 'en-US', 'Underground tunnels are now available for testing – first look!<br/><br/> Players have a completely new method of movement with tunnels and trains. They are located deep underground and can be accessed through ramps located near many monuments.<br/><br/> Once you go down the deep stairs (or via the elevator, if possible), you\'ll have to go through a couple of corridors where you\'ll meet NPCs wandering around in gas masks and overalls. They\'re armed with Berettas and M39s, and they drop some pretty good loot - microchips, pipes, and even explosive rounds with some chance. There\'s another short descent at the end.<br/><br/> After your first encounter with new opponents, you will finally find yourself at one of the underground stations. After a short walk around it, you will most likely find a small train that needs to be refueled, after which it will become available for use.<br/><br/> We get into the cabin, give full speed ahead and enjoy the ride. At this time, you can get out of the cabin and walk on a small platform while you wait for the arrival at the desired station. Let me remind you that each station is tied to a specific monument and the full metro scheme is visible on the map.<br/><br/> However, on some tracks there may be NPC ambushes with barricades - sooner or later you will encounter one of them, and you will have to shoot back at the opponents. Barricades are very likely to stop your train and you will not be able to just slip through. In such places you can also find boxes with loot.<br/><br/> The train can be damaged if you shoot at it or run into barricades - so it is advisable to take some metal fragments with you so that you can repair the train in a safe place and move on.<br/><br/> The update comes out on March 4th.'),
(13933, 'en-US', 'Some changes on the testing branch'),
(13934, 'en-US', 'The Rust test branch has seen changes to procedural maps and the server browser. The improvements are intended to solve the problem of finding empty servers and improve the server browser experience.'),
(13935, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, test branch, procedural maps, server browser'),
(13936, 'en-US', 'Some changes on the test branch:<br/><br/> Changes to procedure maps:<br/> • The Scientist Outpost will no longer spawn in the Winter Biome.<br/> • Radiation has been removed from substations near roads.<br/> • Slot machines (aka \"one-armed bandits\") will be added in the amount of three pieces in the bandit camp.<br/><br/> Server browser changes:<br/> • Server browser no longer finds empty servers (only by default - this can be turned back on in filters)<br/> • Searching for empty servers now sends a new request to Steam. Previously, the search was performed on the original response from the Steam Server Browser, without generating a new one.<br/> • The \"favorites\" and \"history\" tabs will always show empty servers.<br/> • Minor visual improvements to server tags<br/><br/> These changes should improve the server browser experience by excluding empty servers from the search. As the game grew in popularity, a problem arose whereby the browser could not find more than 5,000 servers. This affected some servers that could not be found even through search if they fell outside the aforementioned number. The developers also have plans for relatively large changes to the interface.'),
(13937, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Underground Train Tunnels Coming March 4'),
(13938, 'en-US', 'Great news for all Rust players! Underground Train Tunnels will officially be coming on March 4th, as confirmed by Alistair on Twitter. Find out more about the new game update and what it will do.'),
(13939, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, underground tunnels, trains in Rust, Alistair, new features, team play'),
(13940, 'en-US', '<p>Great news for all Rust players! Underground Train Tunnels will officially be coming on March 4th, as confirmed by Alistair on Twitter. You will now be able to explore new areas of the game and travel around the world of Rust on trains.</p><br/><p> According to Alistair, the update will be available on the test branch this Thursday, allowing players to try out the new functionality and provide feedback to the developers.</p><br/><p> Underground train tunnels are an exciting new feature for Rust players. They will allow you to quickly move around the map, avoiding dangers, and reach remote locations more efficiently. Additionally, the tunnels will add a new layer of strategy to the game, as players will be able to use them for cover and tactical maneuvers.</p><br/><p> This update also opens up new possibilities for team play. You will now be able to form a group and travel the world of Rust together using trains. This will bring more social interaction and cooperation to the game.</p><br/><p> Don\'t waste any time and get ready to meet the underground tunnels and trains in Rust on March 4! We are sure that this update will give the game a new life and bring a lot of fun to all players.</p>'),
(13941, 'en-US', 'Double Eleven Begins Sending Out Invites to Closed Beta Test of Console Version of Rust'),
(13942, 'en-US', 'Double Eleven is starting to send out invitations to the closed beta testing of the console version of Rust. Users are given a chance to gain access to testing, available only on PlayStation 4 and Xbox One. The official release date is still unknown.'),
(13943, 'en-US', 'Double Eleven, Rust, closed beta, console version, release, PlayStation 4, Xbox One'),
(13944, 'en-US', '<p>Double Eleven has begun sending out invitations to the closed beta testing of the console version of Rust. Some users who had already signed up for the mailing list via the official website have received a notification and a link to register to gain access to the testing. This port is still only available on PlayStation 4 and Xbox One.</p><br/><br/><p> There is no official release date yet, but the developers have stated that the game will likely be released in the first half of 2021 with a 50% chance.</p>'),
(13945, 'en-US', 'New screenshots of underground tunnels'),
(13946, 'en-US', 'Check out some new screenshots of the underground tunnels in Rust and see how they will connect to the surface, giving us access to monuments and the ability to travel by train.'),
(13947, 'en-US', 'screenshots, underground tunnels, elevator, stairs, movement, trains, monuments, NPC, updates, Rust'),
(13948, 'en-US', 'Our eyes can finally see the mysterious underground tunnels in new screenshots that have just surfaced online. These photos reveal a glimpse of what the ability to move underground in the world of Rust will look like.<br/><br/> What we see is an elevator and a staircase that will connect the underground train tunnels to the surface. These connections will be procedurally generated on each map and will offer access to various monuments. And yes, you read that right, you will be able to travel through these tunnels on trains! How cool is that!<br/><br/> This fantastic news has caused a wave of speculation, among which there were even mentions of the presence of NPCs (non-human characters) in these underground places. Now that would be a real quest!<br/><br/> Unfortunately, there is no confirmed release date for this update, nor any specific details about its contents. However, we do know that the development team is currently hard at work on this feature and is nearing completion. All we can do is wait and dream about the adventures that await us in the otherworldly worlds beneath the earth.<br/><br/> Just a little more patience, friends, and soon we\'ll be able to explore these hidden secrets in Rust ourselves!'),
(13949, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust! Information about the added skins on Steam'),
(13950, 'en-US', 'Check out the new skins for Rust on Steam. The updates include weapon skins, clothing skins, base skins, and vehicle skins. Express your individuality and make your game even more interesting!');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(13951, 'en-US', 'new skins, Rust game on Steam, skin updates, weapon skins, clothing skins, base skins, vehicle skins, personality, cosmetic changes'),
(13952, 'en-US', '<p class=\"title\">New batch of skins in the game Rust!</p><br/><p> Every fan of the game Rust on Steam, probably waited impatiently for the next batch of new skins. And now, our expectations have been met - a new batch of cool skins has been added to the game! In this article, we will tell you about interesting updates and divide them into categories so that you can easily find what you are looking for.</p><br/><p class=\"subtitle\"> New weapon skins</p><br/><p> If you like to show off your individuality on the battlefield, then new weapon skins are a great way to do it. The latest batch adds a variety of options for different types of weapons: machine guns, rifles, pistols and more. Your arsenal collection will look unique and exciting!</p><br/><p class=\"subtitle\"> New clothing skins</p><br/><p> If your character needs a new stylish look, then new clothing skins will be a salvation. You will be able to choose the most fashionable outfits that will help you stand out among other players. Be beautiful and protected at the same time!</p><br/><p class=\"subtitle\"> New skins for bases</p><br/><p> Creating a unique base is an important part of the gameplay in Rust. With new base skins, you can turn your abode into a real work of art. Choose from a variety of interesting elements and decorations to create a unique design for your base.</p><br/><p class=\"subtitle\"> New skins for transport</p><br/><p> Who said your vehicles have to be ordinary and boring? With new vehicle skins, you can give your cars, helicopters, and boats an interesting and stylish look. Conquer the roads and waters in full glamour!</p><br/><p> However, it is worth noting that purchasing skins does not affect the game mechanics and balance. These are just cosmetic changes that allow you to express your individuality and make the game even more interesting.</p><br/><p> Now you know what\'s coming to Rust! It\'s time to pick out new skins and enjoy the game to the fullest.</p>'),
(13953, 'en-US', 'Slot machines have appeared on the test branch'),
(13954, 'en-US', 'Rust on the test branch will receive a new update with slot machines where players will be able to win scrap metal by combining certain items.'),
(13955, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, slot machines, scrap metal, combinations, winnings, update Rust'),
(13956, 'en-US', 'Slot machines have appeared on the test branch.<br/><br/> They will be found on some monuments. You put scrap metal and pay for the spins with it - each of them costs 10 scrap metal. There is a sign above the machine with the combinations and what you will get if you knock them out.<br/><br/> Here is the list (combination - win)<br/> 3 scrap metal - 20 scrap metal<br/> 3 ropes - 50 scrap metal<br/> 3 apples - 100 scrap metal<br/> 3 low quality fuels - 150 scrap metal<br/> 3 trees - 300 scrap metal<br/> 3 bandages - 400 scrap metal<br/> 3 coal - 500 scrap metal<br/> 3 gunpowder - 600 scrap metal<br/> 3 Rust logos - 700 scrap metal<br/> 3 fried wolf meat - 800 scrap metal<br/> 3 mallets - 1000 scrap metal<br/> 3 sulfur - 1500 scrap metal<br/> 3 microcircuits - 3000 scrap metal<br/> 3 metal fragments - 4000 scrap metal<br/> 3 fabrics - 5000 scrap metal<br/> 3 sevens - 6000 scrap metal<br/><br/> For each mallet in any combination you will get 3 scrap metal. For each microcircuit - 5.<br/><br/> The update will be released on March 4.'),
(13957, 'en-US', 'Rust Family Sharing support has been temporarily discontinued.'),
(13958, 'en-US', 'This article discusses the suspension of Rust support via Steam Family Sharing and the lack of official information about the feature being reinstated.'),
(13959, 'en-US', 'Rust support, family sharing, pause, play on steam, Rust game updates'),
(13960, 'en-US', '<p>Players using Steam Family Sharing to play Rust have been met with an unpleasant surprise - support for this feature has been temporarily discontinued.</p><br/><p> No official reason has been given for this decision, nor is there any timeline for when players will be able to use Family Sharing again. Currently, Steam offers the game as a standalone purchase for all Family Sharing accounts.</p><br/><p> Unfortunately, it appears that family sharing support in Rust will not be returning in the foreseeable future.</p>'),
(13961, 'en-US', 'A new suit has appeared on the test branch'),
(13962, 'en-US', 'A new suit has appeared on the test branch of the game Rust. In this article you will be able to see it and learn about the first impressions of players.'),
(13963, 'en-US', 'new suit, test branch, Rust, design, style'),
(13964, 'en-US', '<p>An impressive new suit has appeared on the Rust test branch. This powerful and stylish outfit is catching the attention of players, but where exactly it will be available remains a mystery.</p><br/><p> The news of such a cool suit is causing a lot of interest in the player community. Everyone is eagerly waiting for official information from the developers to find out where and how this suit can be obtained.</p><br/><p> While there are no specific details yet, we have the opportunity to take a look at this magnificence. We are giving you a unique chance to see the new suit and enjoy its design and style. Take a look at the article to see what this new acquisition looks like in the game Rust.</p><br/><p> We expect this news to spark anticipation and excitement among all Rust fans. Stay tuned for updates and official announcements to learn more about the new suit and hope to see it in the game soon.</p>'),
(13965, 'en-US', 'Buddha Mask moved to general drops category - new acquisition when watching streams'),
(13966, 'en-US', 'Get a unique buddha mask just by watching streams of Rust on Steam. It is now available in the general drops category.'),
(13967, 'en-US', 'Buddha Mask, General Drops, Stream Watching, Rust, Steam'),
(13968, 'en-US', '<p>Attention, Rust fans! We have great news for you. Buddha Mask is now available in the general drops category!</p><br/><p> If you are already used to getting exclusive items in the game Rust, now you have a unique opportunity to get this amazing mask, just by watching any streams. Now it is not a rare and limited item - it has become available to everyone who prefers to watch game broadcasts.</p><br/><p> This news is of undoubted interest to fans of the game Rust. Now you will have even more opportunities to customize your character. The Buddha mask will add uniqueness to your game image, and will also allow you to emphasize your dedication to the Rust community.</p><br/><p> To get the buddha mask, you just need to follow the streams of the game Rust on the Steam platform. With each new drop, you will be closer to this cool accessory for your character. Do not miss the chance to get it now!</p>'),
(13969, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops Schedule for March'),
(13970, 'en-US', 'Find out about the Twitch Drops schedule for March and stay up to date with the latest information about the event in the game Rust on the Steam platform.'),
(13971, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam, schedule, event, rewards, skins, bonuses'),
(13972, 'en-US', '<p>Good news for fans of the game Rust on Steam!</p><br/><p> The current Twitch Drops event for this month has come to an end, but don\'t worry - a new wave is coming soon!</p><br/><p> The next Twitch Drops start on March 4, so mark that date on your calendar. And best of all, as a result of the schedule update, drops will now only be available once a month.</p><br/><p> Thus, a new era of Twitch Drops in Rust is coming, where you can expect incredible rewards and bonuses, but only once a month. So don’t miss your chance for unique skins and items!</p>'),
(13973, 'en-US', 'Now there will be skins for gloves made from road signs!'),
(13974, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new feature in Rust - road sign glove skins that allow players to customize their loadouts.'),
(13975, 'en-US', 'skins, gloves, road signs, customization, style, update, game, Rust'),
(13976, 'en-US', 'A new update for the game Rust has been released, which adds a real innovation - skins for gloves from road signs. Now players can customize their equipment, making it more unique and stylish. This is a great opportunity to stand out from other players and give your character a unique look.'),
(13977, 'en-US', 'New Valentine\'s Day Skins Added to Rust Item Shop'),
(13978, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Valentine\'s Day themed skins that have been added to the Rust item shop.'),
(13979, 'en-US', 'Rust skins, Rust items, Valentine\'s Day, Shop update, New Rust skins'),
(13980, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust item shop has been updated with new Valentine\'s Day themed skins. These new skins offer players the chance to customize their in-game items with a Valentine\'s Day theme and bring some holiday cheer to the world of Rust.</p><br/><br/><p> The new skins added to the item shop include a variety of items such as weapons, clothing, and building materials that have been implemented in the style of Valentine\'s Day. You can choose skins that suit your design and style to create a unique look for your character in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> The Item Shop update gives players more options for self-expression and allows them to customize their items with unique and stylish skins. In addition, such updates confirm the importance of themed events and holidays in the development of the gaming environment and encourage players to participate in festive events and activities, such as Valentine\'s Day.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss the chance to update your Rust skins and items with new Valentine\'s Day-themed content. Head to the item shop and find the perfect skins to add some holiday and romance to your Rust gaming experience!</p><br/><br/><p> Stay up to date with the latest updates and news in the Rust game, follow our articles about the added skins and items in the item store. Find out what other interesting new items have appeared in the game and what opportunities they give you to change the appearance and mood in the Rust game world.</p>'),
(13981, 'en-US', 'Lunar New Year in Rust and a new wave of Twitch Drops'),
(13982, 'en-US', 'Learn about the Lunar New Year in Rust and a new wave of Twitch Drops offering exclusive items and opportunities for players.'),
(13983, 'en-US', 'Lunar New Year in Rust, Twitch Drops, Events, New Year Events, Item Shop, Discount'),
(13984, 'en-US', 'Lunar New Year has arrived in Rust, bringing with it exciting events and a chance to get exclusive items via Twitch Drops. Now all players can enjoy the update\'s content and immerse themselves in the New Year\'s atmosphere.<br/><br/> The client update is now available. Make sure your server is updated and ready to play.<br/><br/> A short dev blog is available on <a href=\"https://rust.facepunch.com/blog/lunar-new-year-2021\">the official Rust website</a> , where you can learn more about the New Year\'s events.<br/><br/> To get Twitch Drops, set up your <a href=\"https://twitch.facepunch.com/\">Twitch</a> account and start watching streams featuring Rust. In-game items will drop at a chance, giving you unique in-game opportunities.<br/><br/> Be sure to check out <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/itemstore/252490/browse/\">the Rust Item Shop</a> for a variety of festive items, including a bull mask and fireworks.<br/><br/> If you haven\'t played Rust yet, now is the time to grab the game with a -33% discount on <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/252490/Rust/\">the Steam platform</a> . Join the crowd and experience exciting adventures in this survival game at its peak.'),
(13985, 'en-US', 'Rust -33% Off + Item Shop Update - With Bull Mask, Fireworks &amp; More'),
(13986, 'en-US', 'A unique opportunity to get the game Rust with a 33% discount and purchase new additions to the item shop. The bull mask, fireworks and much more are available now! In honor of the Lunar New Year, a number of decorative items and skins are also offered. Hurry, the promotion is limited in time!'),
(13987, 'en-US', 'Rust, discount, update, item shop, bull mask, fireworks, lunar new year'),
(13988, 'en-US', '<p>Attention, Rust players! You have a unique opportunity to get the game with a 33% discount!</p><br/><p> There is currently a promotion on Steam where Rust is available at a reduced price. This is a great opportunity for anyone who hasn\'t yet managed to purchase this popular game.</p><br/><p> But that\'s not all! Along with the game\'s discount, the developers also released an update to the item shop that brought new and exciting additions.</p><br/><p> The updated item shop now offers you a wide selection of new items and skins, including a bull mask, fireworks, and more. Now you can decorate your gaming experience with even more colorful and interesting elements.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget that the promotion is limited in time, so hurry up to take advantage of the discount and buy the game at a bargain price. And new items in the store will help you create a unique gaming style and add new features to your game.</p><br/><p> In addition, in honor of the Lunar New Year, you will also be able to purchase a number of decorative items and skins on this theme. The festive atmosphere and thematic elements in the game will help you create an unforgettable experience and enjoy the atmosphere of the holiday.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to upgrade your gaming experience and purchase Rust at a great price! The 33% discount is valid for a limited time, so don\'t delay your purchase. And updates to the item store will allow you to diversify your game and create a unique style.</p>'),
(13989, 'en-US', 'Server update in honor of the Lunar New Year'),
(13990, 'en-US', 'A server update has been released, which includes content in honor of the Lunar New Year: a fireworks ribbon, crafting for the duration of the event, a new bull mask.'),
(13991, 'en-US', 'server update, lunar new year, content, fireworks ribbon, craft, bull mask'),
(13992, 'en-US', '<p>The long-awaited server update has been released, bringing new content dedicated to the Lunar New Year.</p><br/><p> One of the main features of the update was the addition of a new standard blueprint - a fireworks ribbon. Now players can create and diversify their game structures with the help of this decoration.</p><br/><p> Additionally, the Fireworks Ribbon is also available for crafting during the event. This opens up new possibilities for players, allowing them to create unique decorations and a festive atmosphere in their territories.</p><br/><p> The client update will be released at 22:00 Moscow time, which will give everyone the opportunity to enjoy the new content and take part in the Lunar New Year celebration. Along with the update, a new mask will also become available - a bull mask, which will help create a festive atmosphere and add a little zest to the gameplay.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to immerse yourself in the atmosphere of the Lunar New Year and create unique gaming moments with the server update in honor of this holiday!</p>'),
(13993, 'en-US', 'The list of participants for the next Twitch Drops in the game Rust has been announced'),
(13994, 'en-US', 'Already tomorrow at 22:00 Moscow time, Twitch Drops in the game Rust, associated with the Lunar New Year, will start. It became known who will participate in this event and what unique items can be obtained.'),
(13995, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Lunar New Year, Streamers'),
(13996, 'en-US', '<p>Already tomorrow at 22:00 Moscow time, the next Twitch Drops in the game Rust will start, which will be accompanied by a thematic update dedicated to the lunar new year. This is not a wipe, so players will not lose their progress.</p><br/><p> It has finally become known who will be participating in this Twitch Drops. Among them are such famous streamers as BCHILLZ, SHADOWFRAX, Mammoth, Ser Winter, Trausi, Buddha, DyannaTV, Killjoys, PrinceVidz, JordanRants, Ash, and one streamer, his participation is expected.</p><br/><p> For those unfamiliar with Twitch Drops, it is a special promotion on the Twitch platform that allows players to earn free in-game items and skins simply by watching streamers. This time, Twitch Drops participants in Rust will be able to receive unique items related to the Lunar New Year.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss the opportunity to decorate your gaming collection with new cool items! Become an active viewer of Twitch Drops participants\' streams and get your rewards. Don\'t forget to follow Rust game updates so as not to miss future Twitch Drops and other interesting events.</p>'),
(13997, 'en-US', 'Rust Twitch Drops Info from February 11th to February 18th'),
(13998, 'en-US', 'Find out about the next Twitch Drops in Rust from February 11th to 18th. Participate in the event to earn free skins and other items. Full list of streamers will be announced at a later date.'),
(13999, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust Game, SerWinter, SHADOWFRAX, Skins, Streams, Twitch'),
(14000, 'en-US', '<p>The next Twitch Drops in Rust will take place from February 11 to 18. During this period, participants will be able to earn free skins and other in-game items simply by watching streams on the Twitch platform.</p><br/><br/><p> At the moment, it is known that two popular Twitch streamers - SerWinter and SHADOWFRAX - will take part in the event. They will provide their viewers with the opportunity to get unique skins.</p><br/><br/><p> However, the full list of streamers participating in Twitch Drops has not yet been disclosed. It is important to note that the number and variety of skins will be significantly greater than those shown in photos 1-2: SerWinter skin and photo 3: SHADOWFRAX skin.</p>'),
(14001, 'en-US', 'Rust Update: Crash Fixes and Optimization of Loot and NPC Recovery Process on Oil Rigs'),
(14002, 'en-US', 'New Rust update fixes loot restoration crashes and optimizes NPC spawning on oil rigs'),
(14003, 'en-US', 'Rust update, crash fix, loot restoration, NPCs on oil rigs'),
(14004, 'en-US', '<p>The latest Rust server update brings a solution to the long-awaited problem associated with crashes during the process of restoring loot and the presence of NPCs on oil rigs.</p><p> There are many situations where players encounter incorrect functioning of the game due to glitches related to restoring loot after death or interacting with NPCs on oil rigs. For those who actively play Rust, this can cause serious inconvenience. But now the developers have made changes that should improve the stability of the game and optimize these processes.</p><p> The new update introduces fixes that significantly reduce the likelihood of crashes when restoring loot. As a result, players will be able to continue their adventures in the world of Rust without worrying about losing valuable items after death.</p><p> In addition, the update also concerns the presence of NPCs on oil rigs. Previously, meeting NPCs on these platforms could cause unexpected problems, which sometimes led to the loss of not only valuable resources, but also time spent on developing in the game. However, with the release of the new version, these problems have been eliminated, providing a smoother gaming experience.</p><p> Rust game updates are always welcomed by players, especially those that address serious technical issues and improve the overall performance of the game, providing a more comfortable and smooth experience.</p><br/><p> :smile: We wish you a pleasant game in the updated world of Rust!</p>'),
(14005, 'en-US', 'First screenshot of the robot'),
(14006, 'en-US', 'Find out about the first screenshot of the robot and its possible uses.'),
(14007, 'en-US', 'screenshot, robot, interest'),
(14008, 'en-US', 'Game update is out - Softcore Update! Weighs 1'),
(14009, 'en-US', 'Softcore Update - a new update for the game Rust. Find out how to download it, solve download problems and watch a video review of the update.'),
(14010, 'en-US', 'game update, Rust, Softcore Update, Steam, download, burn to disk'),
(14011, 'en-US', '<p>Meet the new update of the game Rust! Softcore Update is already available for download and takes up only 1.3 GB.</p><br/><p> If the update doesn\'t appear automatically, try restarting Steam. And don\'t worry if the download process is slow - it\'s because the update is writing to your hard drive.</p><br/><p> Watch the update video on our YouTube channel: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XIYHBF8NTaI\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XIYHBF8NTaI</a></p>'),
(14012, 'en-US', 'New batch of skins in the game Rust: review and description'),
(14013, 'en-US', 'Find out about the update of the game Rust with a new batch of skins. The article provides an overview and description of the new skins for your convenience.'),
(14014, 'en-US', 'new skins, updates, game Rust, survival game, Steam'),
(14015, 'en-US', '<p>For all fans of the game Rust on Steam, we have great news - a new batch of skins has been released! Now you can add some variety to your gaming experience and decorate your items with new bright and colorful skins.</p><br/><br/><p> The new batch of skins in Rust offers a wide range of options for a variety of items in the game. Thanks to this, everyone will be able to find something to their taste and make their items unique.</p><br/><br/><p> First of all, let\'s take a look at the new weapon skins. The latest update added skins for rifles, pistols, shotguns, and the rest of the arsenal. You can choose the style that suits you best, be it aggressive, stylish, or funny. Thanks to the new skins, your weapons will look unusual and attractive.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, the new batch of skins in the game Rust also includes a variety of options for protective items. You will no longer have to use the usual helmets, masks and body armor - the choice of skins will allow you to dress up in stylish and unique items that will certainly attract the attention of your opponents.</p><br/><br/><p> Also, don\'t forget about decorative items and buildings. In the new batch of skins, you will find a huge number of options for decorating your home or building. You have access to various types of fittings, paints, wallpapers and even some unusual items that will help you create a unique atmosphere in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> In conclusion of the review of the new batch of skins in the game Rust, it is worth noting that you can get these skins both by in-game means and by purchasing them on the Steam marketplace. This opens up wide opportunities for collectors and traders. You can become the owner of rare and valuable skins that are in demand among players from all over the world.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to breathe new life into the Rust gaming world and give your items a unique style with a new batch of skins. Dive into the game with new colorful and fun items that make the gameplay even more interesting and attractive.</p>'),
(14016, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops starts at 22:00 Moscow time!'),
(14017, 'en-US', 'Find out everything you need to know about Twitch Drops for Rust, including who\'s participating, the start date, and a link to set up your Twitch account.'),
(14018, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Skins, Streamers, Event'),
(14019, 'en-US', '<p>You have a unique opportunity to get skins for the game Rust on Twitch Drops! The event will start in the evening at 22:00 Moscow time and will last until February 11 at 22:00 Moscow time.</p><br/><p> You\'ll be watching famous streamers play Rust using their own skins. Participants include: Greekgodx, Hutnik, CoconutB, Sequisha, RayC, Posty, Welyn, Lifestomper, and hJune.</p><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to update your in-game wardrobe and get exclusive items! Don\'t forget to prepare your Twitch account to be ready when the event starts. Account preparation link: https://twitch.facepunch.com/</p>'),
(14020, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update on Steam: Servers, Backpacks, Weapons and Other New Features'),
(14021, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new features of the Rust Steam update: tagged servers, backpack visual updates, changes to rare weapon drops, suicide via the pause menu, and celebrating Lunar New Year with a bull mask.'),
(14022, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, Rust servers, Rust backpacks, Rust weapons, Rust skins, Rust bull mask'),
(14023, 'en-US', '<p>Rust players on Steam are eagerly awaiting a new update that will bring a number of significant changes and additions to the gameplay. Let\'s discuss some of the major innovations that await us in this update.</p><br/><br/><h2> Servers with tags</h2><br/><p> One of the most notable new features is the ability for servers to tag themselves. This will allow players to more easily identify the main features of a project and choose the server that best suits their gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><h2> Updated look of backpacks</h2><br/><p> The developers also paid attention to details and updated the appearance of backpacks in the game. Now they will look even more realistic and high-quality, adding immersion to the game world.</p><br/><br/><h2> Reduced the chance of rare weapons dropping from Bradley APC crates</h2><br/><p> In this update, the developers also reduced the chance of rare weapons dropping from Bradley APC crates. This change will balance the gameplay and make it fairer for all players.</p><br/><br/><h2> Changes in the behavior of the Bradley APC tank</h2><br/><p> In addition to reducing the chance of rare weapons dropping, the Bradley APC tank has also been reworked. Now it will not stand in one place and shoot through walls at players, which will make battles with it more interesting and dynamic.</p><br/><br/><h2> Jackhammer skin support</h2><br/><p> One of the most anticipated new features is the support for skins on the Jackhammer. Now you can customize the appearance of this weapon to stand out from other players and give it individuality.</p><br/><br/><h2> Committing suicide via the pause menu</h2><br/><p> For the convenience of players who do not want to use console commands, the ability to commit suicide via the pause menu has been added. This will save time and allow you to focus on more important aspects of the game.</p><br/><br/><h2> Celebrating Lunar New Year with a Bull Mask</h2><br/><p> In honor of the Lunar New Year 2021, a new bull mask will be added to the game Rust. Celebrate this holiday with your friends and give your character a festive look.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust update on Steam is scheduled for 22:00 Moscow time, and Twitch Drops will also begin to be distributed. Stay tuned for details on the new drops, which will be published in a separate post.</p><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss out on the opportunity to experience all the new features and changes that the Rust Steam update offers. Face the challenges, explore the world and enjoy a unique gaming experience!</p>'),
(14024, 'en-US', '⚠ UPDATE, WIPE AND TWITCH DROPS TODAY AT 22:00 MSK!'),
(14025, 'en-US', 'Learn about the February Rust update, which includes drones, a remastered Hapis map, a softcore game mode, balance fixes, and free skins from streamers.'),
(14026, 'en-US', 'update, wipe, twitch drops, Rust, drones, Hapis, softcore game mode, balancing, free skins, Rust game'),
(14027, 'en-US', '⚠ UPDATE, WIPE AND TWITCH DROPS TODAY AT 22:00 MSK!<br/><br/> The February update is out this evening, bringing drones, a Hapis update, a simplified game mode, balance changes, and free skins from streamers.<br/><br/> • Drones in the game! For now, their functionality is limited to delivering items - you will be able to remotely buy items from vending machines using special stations at the scientist outpost or bandit camp.<br/><br/> • Softcore game mode - new servers with a simplified version of vanilla gameplay will appear in the game. Here are the features of this mode:<br/> - You can\'t take more than 4 players per team<br/> — No more than 4 players can be logged into the closet.<br/> - You can respawn at a scientist outpost or bandit camp (doesn\'t work if you are temporarily considered a hostile player by the safe zone)<br/> — After death, half of your items are available for return at the outpost or camp. This is done through a special container with the sign \"RECLAIM\". Only half of the items are saved, and the armor is completely lost. You have 2 hours to return the lost loot, after which it disappears.<br/><br/> Softcore does not replace the regular game mode, it will have separate servers. This is an experiment and the rules of the game may change in the future.<br/><br/> • Big Hapis update - after a long time, the map received a new update. New roads, fishing villages, underground tunnels appeared, the winter biome was improved and more.<br/><br/> • The developers have fixed the ability to sleep on monuments to regenerate loot. Now if you try to sleep, for example, on an oil rig in a room with loot or on any other monument with puzzles, when the loot is restored, all sleeping players within a certain radius will be killed.<br/><br/> This will prevent players from disconnecting from the server any more, so that the monument will start counting down to the restoration of items faster. This was especially often used on oil rigs.<br/><br/> • It is no longer possible to make stashes with buried loot under foundations. If this happens, everything hidden will fall to the surface.'),
(14028, 'en-US', 'Steshi can no longer be covered with a foundation'),
(14029, 'en-US', 'Changes to the construction mechanics in the game Rust: you can no longer cover stashes with resources buried underground with a foundation. All hidden things will now fall to the surface. The update, wipe, and Twitch Drops are available tomorrow at 22:00 Moscow time.'),
(14030, 'en-US', 'Steshi, foundation, Rust, game, update, wipe, Twitch Drops'),
(14031, 'en-US', '<p>Steshi can no longer be covered with foundations. The developers of the game Rust decided to change the mechanics of construction in order to prevent the use of incorrect tactics.</p><br/><p> Previously, players could build stashes with resources and hidden loot buried underground. However, this is no longer possible. When attempting to build such a structure, all hidden items will fall to the surface.</p><br/><p> This change to the building mechanics was introduced to ensure a more fair and equal gameplay for all players. Now no one will be able to use this tactic to gain an advantage over others.</p><br/><p> The update, wipe, and Twitch Drops associated with this change will be available tomorrow at 22:00 Moscow time. We are waiting for the update and new features in the game Rust!</p>'),
(14032, 'en-US', 'Fix for sleeping players on monuments in Rust'),
(14033, 'en-US', 'In the new Rust update, the developers have fixed the ability to sleep on monuments to regenerate loot. This change is designed to balance the gameplay and prevent abuse of monuments.'),
(14034, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, sleeping players, monuments, loot, balancing, changes, gameplay'),
(14035, 'en-US', 'In the new update of the game Rust, the developers decided to fix the ability to sleep on monuments to regenerate loot. This was done to prevent players from being disconnected from the server multiple times in order to restore things on monuments faster.'),
(14036, 'en-US', 'Corpse Backpacks Get a New Model'),
(14037, 'en-US', 'A new corpse backpack model has arrived in the world of Rust. Find out what changes the developers have made and how it affects gameplay. We will discuss the new design, capacity, trade-offs, and the importance of choosing the right backpack in Rust.'),
(14038, 'en-US', 'russian, rust, game, update, backpacks, corpses, model, design, color, capacity, compromises, resources, survival'),
(14039, 'en-US', 'Welcome to the world of Rust, where you can find gems in shipwrecks and set your enemies on fire. One of the most important things in the game is the backpack, which stores all your valuables and loot. And now, Rust has received an update that concerns backpacks from corpses.<br/><br/> Backpacks are not only functional items in the game, but also a status symbol. They allow you to carry more resources and weapons, making you a more powerful player. Previously, corpse backpacks were simple and uniform, but the developers decided to add a new model to make the gameplay more diverse and interesting.<br/><br/> The new model of corpse backpacks has several changes that are important to note. Firstly, they have a new design with brighter and more varied colors. Now your backpack will not only be practical, but also a stylish accessory. Secondly, the capacity of the backpacks has been improved - now you can carry even more loot with you. This is especially useful in dangerous and tense situations, where every resource is important.<br/><br/> However, with the new backpack model, there are some trade-offs. They are now slightly more expensive, which may impact your gameplay strategy. You will have to be more careful with your resource usage and carefully choose what items you bring. Additionally, some players have expressed concerns that the brightly colored backpacks may make them more visible to enemies, which may impact their survivability.<br/><br/> Overall, the new corpse backpack model introduces interesting changes to the gameplay of Rust. They add more personality to your character and help you better organize your valuables. However, when choosing a backpack, you should pay attention to its price and color, so as not to stand out too much from other players.<br/><br/> Don\'t forget to update the game and try out the new corpse backpacks. They\'ll definitely add a new and interesting aspect to your game strategy!'),
(14040, 'en-US', 'Hapis update is already on the test branch'),
(14041, 'en-US', 'The Hapis update for Rust is now available on the test branch! Find out about the new changes and improvements to the map.'),
(14042, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, Hapis, test branch, news'),
(14043, 'en-US', '<p>Hapis update is already on the test branch</p><br/><p> Recently, the developers of the game Rust released an update for the Hapis map to the test branch. Last year, this map lost its relevance and was considered for removal from the game. However, in late 2020, one of the developers took responsibility for Hapis and decided to clean it up.</p><br/><p> As a result of the update, the Hapis map received new roads, fishing villages, updated routes and underground tunnels for cars. Also, some errors were fixed. Attention was also paid to the winter region of Hapis - roads were updated, changes were made to the landscape near the cosmodrome, and icy lakes were added that can be used for construction.</p><br/><p> The Hapis update will be available to all players on February 4 at 22:00 Moscow time. The map itself has become more interesting and diverse thanks to these changes. Join the game Rust and try out all the new features that the Hapis update offers!</p>'),
(14044, 'en-US', 'The game will have a simplified mode on February 4'),
(14045, 'en-US', 'On February 4, Rust will be getting a simplified “softcore” mode that offers several new rules and options for players. Find out more about this change and how it will impact gameplay.'),
(14046, 'en-US', 'easy mode, softcore, Softcore, changes, servers, game mode'),
(14047, 'en-US', '<p>On February 4, Rust will introduce a new simplified mode, which the developers have dubbed \"Softcore.\" This mode offers several differences from the main gameplay:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Maximum team size has been reduced to 4 players.</li><br/><li> No more than 4 players can be logged into the cabinet.</li><br/><li> Players will be able to respawn at the Scientist Outpost and the Bandit Camp.</li><br/><li> Upon death, the player will not lose all loot, but will be able to save a random 50% of the inventory in safe zones (but armor will not be saved).</li><br/><li> On February 4th, official servers with Softcore mode will be launched.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> It is important to note that this mode is separate and does not affect the standard gameplay. It provides the ability to create servers with simplified rules for those who prefer an easier game.</p><br/><p> All changes related to the new mode are experimental and may be changed in the future.</p>'),
(14048, 'en-US', 'Drones and Submarines: New Features of Rust on Steam'),
(14049, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam has new features: delivery drones and submarines in development. Drones are already available on the test branch, and submarines will allow you to dive to new water depths.'),
(14050, 'en-US', 'game Rust, updates, drones, submarines, delivery, test branch, development, outpost'),
(14051, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has new features on Steam: drones are now available on the test branch, and submarine development is actively continuing.</p><br/><p> Drones in the game perform a useful function - delivery of items from vending machines. Now you can order items through drones, even if the machine is in a safe zone. The process is simple: select the desired machine, place an order, pay the commission and wait for your delivery. Note that drones cannot be used for any other purposes except delivery. To work with them, you need a special station, which can be purchased at the outpost. Drones will be available in the game on February 4.</p><br/><p> Rust developers are also working on adding submarines to the game. Information about them is limited at the moment, but it is known that the first version will allow two people to swim. Future updates may make the underwater world more attractive for exploration.</p>'),
(14052, 'en-US', 'Bull mask added to test branch'),
(14053, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new Bull Mask that has been added to the Rust test branch. Details on the update and release date.'),
(14054, 'en-US', 'bull mask, Rust update, chinese new year, decorative items'),
(14055, 'en-US', '<p>A new decorative mask, the Bull Mask, has been added to the Rust test branch.</p><br/><p> This item will most likely become available with the upcoming update scheduled for February 4th, specifically to celebrate the Chinese New Year.</p><br/><p> The game\'s developers have previously added similar items, such as the rat and dragon mask, to celebrate various events and cultural traditions.</p><br/><p> The bull mask will add a touch of exoticism and fun to the gameplay, and will also allow players to express their individuality and create a unique image of their character.</p><br/><p> This update is expected to attract more players and add variety to the gaming environment, making the game even more interesting and exciting.</p>'),
(14056, 'en-US', 'New arrival of skins in the RUST store'),
(14057, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest skins coming to the Rust store, featuring unique and stylish options for your character, weapons, items, and buildings.'),
(14058, 'en-US', 'new rust skins, skins for the game rust, rust skins store'),
(14059, 'en-US', '<p>Welcome to the world of unique and stylish skins for the game Rust! We are pleased to inform you about the latest additions to our store, which will allow you to change the appearance of your character, weapons, items and buildings.</p><br/><p> Do you need to break free from the standard options and add new colors to the gameplay? We have what you need! Purchase skins that add personality and style to your gaming experience, make your character bright and unique.</p><br/><p> In our store you will find a huge variety of skins for all types of weapons, from pistols and machine guns to sniper rifles and grenades. Choose the perfect combination of colors, patterns and textures to stand out from the crowd and make your attacks even more impressive.</p><br/><p> Don\'t forget to also check out the item and building skins. Now you can decorate your base or home with your own unique style. Whether you want to create a cozy lair or a protected fortress, we have a variety of options for you.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that all skins in our store are available exclusively for game currency - RUST coins. You can earn them by completing various tasks in the game or purchase them through the Steam store.</p><br/><p> Thus, the new arrival of skins in our RUST store opens up unlimited possibilities for you to customize your gaming experience. Don\'t miss the chance to give your character, weapons, items and buildings a unique look! Visit our store to learn more about the new skins and start adding style and originality to the game Rust!</p>'),
(14060, 'en-US', 'The list of participants for the next Twitch Drops, who will have their own skins, has been announced'),
(14061, 'en-US', 'The list of Twitch Drops participants who will have their own skins has been announced. Starts on February 4 at 22:00 Moscow time.'),
(14062, 'en-US', 'announcement, list, participants, Twitch Drops, skins, start, date, time'),
(14063, 'en-US', '<p>The list of participants for the next Twitch Drops, who will have their own skins, has been announced:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Welyn</li><br/><li> hJune</li><br/><li> Lifestomper</li><br/><li> Posty</li><br/><li> CoconutB</li><br/><li> Hutnik</li><br/><li> Greekgodx</li><br/><li> TheRayC</li><br/><li> MisterFlak (his skin will drop when watching any stream since he is not a streamer)</li><br/><li> kvetchingkrist</li><br/><li> Sequisha</li><br/></ul><br/><p> Twitch Drops are scheduled to start on February 4 at 22:00 Moscow time.</p>'),
(14064, 'en-US', 'New Jackhammer Skins Now Available on Rust Test Branch'),
(14065, 'en-US', 'Check out the new Jackhammer skins now available on the Rust test branch.'),
(14066, 'en-US', 'jackhammer skins, new skins in rust, rust test branch'),
(14067, 'en-US', '<p>Owners of jackhammers in the game Rust can now rejoice - skin support for these tools has been added! You may have already heard about this news, but if not, then read on.</p><br/><br/><p> Coming soon, with the February 4th game update, the first skins for the Jackhammer will be available for purchase and use. This is a great opportunity for players to customize their tool to their liking and stand out from other survivors.</p><br/><br/><p> The Rust test branch has a lot of gameplay changes and additions, and the support for skins for the jackhammer is one of the most interesting new features. Now you can decorate your jackhammer with unique designs and make it truly yours.</p><br/><br/><p> New skins for the jackhammer will bring variety to the game and add new opportunities for individual expression. You will be able to choose from various styles, colors and patterns to create a true masterpiece of the survivor\'s tool.</p><br/><br/><p> If you\'re playing on the Rust Test Branch, head over to the Skins Store and update your Jackhammer with the new design. And if you haven\'t played on the Test Branch yet, we recommend giving it a try to fully appreciate all the new additions and improvements to the game, including support for Jackhammer skins.</p>'),
(14068, 'en-US', 'Information about Twitch Drops in Rust on Steam'),
(14069, 'en-US', 'Find out about the latest Twitch Drops event in Rust on Steam and how to get free skins and rewards just by watching streams on Twitch.'),
(14070, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam, skins, game, broadcasts, rewards, event'),
(14071, 'en-US', '<h2>Check out the latest Twitch Drops event for Rust on Steam</h2><br/><p> The current Twitch Drops event, which is taking place in the game Rust on Steam, will come to an end this month. Unfortunately, details about the new event, which will start only next month, are still unknown. This is the last chance to get unique skins and other rewards just by watching streams on Twitch.</p><br/><p> If you\'re not familiar with Twitch Drops, it\'s a feature Valve added to Steam that allows players to earn free in-game items simply by watching streams on the Twitch platform. During Twitch Drops events, players are given the chance to earn exclusive skins, emotes, or other rewards that can\'t be obtained in any other way.</p><br/><p> But don\'t be upset if you missed the current Twitch Drops event. The Rust Steam community actively organizes such events regularly, allowing players to get free items in the game again and again. The frequency of Twitch Drops events may vary, so stay tuned for news and official announcements in order not to miss the next opportunity to earn unique rewards.</p><br/><p> So, don’t miss your last chance to get Twitch Drops in Rust on Steam this month. Just tune in to the streams on Twitch and stay tuned for more events and opportunities to earn extra free items in the game.</p>'),
(14072, 'en-US', 'Quick access to drops for popular streamers: expectations and reality'),
(14073, 'en-US', 'The issue of quick access to drops for popular streamers in Rust requires careful analysis and a balanced approach. Learn about the trade-offs and challenges associated with this topic, and the importance of considering influence in decision-making.'),
(14074, 'en-US', 'drops, streamers, Rust, access, fairness, balance'),
(14075, 'en-US', '<p>Today, many Rust players dream of quick access to drops organized by popular streamers. Their enthusiasm is understandable: getting valuable items, things, and equipment that are often found in such drops could significantly improve the gaming experience.</p><br/><p> However, implementing this feature is not as simple as it might seem at first glance. Game owners and Rust developers face difficult trade-offs when deciding how to provide access to drops for streamers.</p><br/><p> First, it is important to consider that uncontrolled access to drops can lead to an imbalance in the game. If every streamer has the ability to organize drops, this can create an unequal playing field for other players and reduce interest in the game for those who are not popular streamers.</p><br/><p> Secondly, it is necessary to provide rules for streamers to prevent possible abuse. For example, streamers may use drops to attract more viewers or gain an advantage in the game. This may disrupt the fairness and honesty of the gameplay.</p><br/><p> It is also worth considering that game owners and developers may have contracts with certain streamers or partners that provide various benefits. This may limit access to drops for other streamers and cause discontent in the player community.</p><br/><p> Thus, the issue of quick access to drops for popular streamers requires a balanced and considered approach. It is necessary to take into account the interests of all players, maintaining fairness and reducing imbalance.</p><br/><p> We hope that the Rust developers will find the optimal solution that will satisfy the expectations and needs of both the most popular streamers and ordinary players.</p>'),
(14076, 'en-US', 'New drops in Rust: Twitch Drops'),
(14077, 'en-US', 'Check out the new drops added to Rust as part of the Twitch Drops event - a skin for pants, a hoodie, and a revolver. The opportunity to get these items is open when watching any streamer.'),
(14078, 'en-US', 'new drops, Twitch Drops, Rust, skins for pants, hoodie, revolver'),
(14079, 'en-US', 'Currently, three new drops have been added as part of the Twitch Drops event in the Rust game - a skin for pants, a hoodie and a revolver. Now every player can get these items by watching any streamer.<br/><br/> Don\'t miss the chance to decorate your character with new stylish clothing elements and get powerful weapons with a unique design!'),
(14080, 'en-US', 'Learn how to get unique skins for the game Rust on Steam via Twitch Drops. Watch streams and get exclusive bonuses and items in the game.'),
(14081, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam, Skins, Stream Watching, Unique Items, Bonuses'),
(14082, 'en-US', '<p>Rust on Steam is an exciting survival game where players must survive in a ruthless world, fighting wild animals, other players, and unpredictable natural conditions. However, in addition to the main gameplay, there is another opportunity to get unique items for your character - Twitch Drops.</p><br/><p> Twitch Drops is a special feature on the Twitch platform that allows players to receive various bonuses and skins simply for watching streams of the game Rust. To do this, players will need to connect their Steam account to their Twitch account and set up the Twitch Drops feature.</p><br/><p> However, to get these bonuses, players will need to fulfill certain conditions, such as watching streams for a certain amount of time, participating in certain events on the stream, or achieving certain goals in the game. All this makes the process of getting skins more interesting and exciting.</p><br/><p> Bonuses that can be obtained through Twitch Drops include various skins for weapons, clothing, and other items that can be used in the game Rust. These skins not only make the character more stylish and unique, but can also give an advantage in combat or help in survival.</p><br/><p> However, it is worth noting that not all players can get skins through Twitch Drops. Since skins are distributed randomly, you need to keep in mind that you may or may not be lucky. But this only adds excitement and excitement to the process of receiving bonuses.</p><br/><p> So, if you are a fan of the Rust game and want to get unique skins for your character, then you should join the world of Twitch Drops. Just set up the feature on the Twitch platform, follow Rust streams and get exciting rewards for watching and participating in Twitch streams.</p>'),
(14083, 'en-US', 'New Twitch Drops launch today at 21:00 Moscow time!'),
(14084, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest Twitch Drops launch featuring famous Twitch streamers!'),
(14085, 'en-US', 'new Twitch Drops, streamers, Twitch, 21:00 MSK'),
(14086, 'en-US', 'Twitch Streamers and Twitch Drops: What You Need to Know About the New Launch!'),
(14087, 'en-US', 'New drops in the game Rust: what do we know?');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(14088, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about the game Rust: new drops, their contents and impact on the gameplay. Stay up to date with all updates and changes!'),
(14089, 'en-US', 'new drops, game Rust, updates, gameplay, content'),
(14090, 'en-US', '<p>In the latest updates to the Rust game, new drops were discovered, which caused a lot of excitement among players. We will try to figure out what is known at the moment about the new drops and how they can affect the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> First, let\'s clarify what drops are. In the game Rust, they are special containers that can be found on the map. Opening them can bring the player various useful items - weapons, tools, resources and much more. Usually, drops are randomly located on the map and their location is initially unknown.</p><br/><br/><p> So, what new things do the developers offer us? At the moment, we don’t have any exact data about the contents of the new drops. Information about them hasn’t appeared anywhere, and players have only just started discussing their existence. However, it is assumed that the new drops will contain unique items that have not been seen in the game before.</p><br/><br/><p> As always, the appearance of new drops causes both positive and negative emotions. On the one hand, this is a great opportunity for players to upgrade their weapons and inventory, gaining access to new items. On the other hand, some players are afraid that new drops can upset the balance of the game or make it too dependent on luck.</p><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that the contents of new drops can be changed by the developers at an early stage of their implementation in the game. This means that what we expect now may change in the future. In any case, updates and additions of new elements to the Rust game are always welcomed by the community and are awaited with great interest.</p><br/><br/><p> So what awaits us? We don’t know for sure yet what surprises the new drops in Rust will bring us. But one thing is for sure - they will make the game even more exciting and diverse. Stay with us to stay up to date with all the news about updates in the game Rust!</p>'),
(14091, 'en-US', 'Next Twitch Drops in Rust: What to Expect?'),
(14092, 'en-US', 'Find out what awaits you in the next round of Twitch Drops in Rust, which will begin after the end of the current event. Get exclusive skins dedicated to famous streamers.'),
(14093, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Skins, Streamers, hJune, Welyn'),
(14094, 'en-US', 'The end of the current Twitch Drops event in Rust means that a new round of skin giveaways is about to begin, Alistair announced via his Twitter account. The new drops will likely be similar to the previous ones, but with one interesting change: this time, the skins will be dedicated to more famous Rust streamers, such as hJune and Welyn.<br/><br/> Details about the upcoming event are still unknown, but it’s worth keeping an eye on the events. The end of the current Twitch Drops is scheduled for January 14, and after that, a new series of distributions will begin. Don’t miss the opportunity to get exclusive skins for your in-game character in Rust!'),
(14095, 'en-US', 'Game progress today'),
(14096, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest successes of Rust, which has set new online records and attracted millions of viewers on Twitch.'),
(14097, 'en-US', 'game Rust, game achievements, game records, online, Twitch, popularity'),
(14098, 'en-US', '<p>Rust continues to reach new heights and set records of success. Here are some interesting facts about the game today:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> The game was able to repeat the previous online record, which testifies to its popularity.</li><br/><li> On the streaming platform Twitch, the game has amassed a staggering audience of over 1.3 million viewers. Moreover, Rust has taken the first place among all games.</li><br/><li> Using special drops on Twitch, players have already received over 799,231 unique pieces of content.</li><br/><li> On Steam, Rust also ranks among the top sellers.</li><br/><li> Taking into account the growing popularity of the game, the developers have released 10 new official servers in Europe, 4 servers in America and 2 servers in Russia.</li><br/><li> Yesterday, the game was launched by more than 1.7 million players, which is a testament to its true success.</li><br/><li> Due to the large number of players, the site twitch.facepunch.com was temporarily unable to cope with the load, but the developers are already working to restore its functionality.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> All this impressive success of the game confirms its popularity and appeal to players from all over the world.</p>'),
(14099, 'en-US', 'First look at the underground tunnel system and trains'),
(14100, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new feature of the game Rust - the underground system of tunnels and trains. Explore the tunnels, loot and move around using the wagons.'),
(14101, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, updates, underground tunnels, trains'),
(14102, 'en-US', '<p>Railroads and tunnels are coming to Rust soon, along with trains. This new feature will allow players to explore dungeons and move around the map using convenient train cars.</p><br/><p> Underground tunnels will be procedurally generated across all maps, creating endless opportunities for exploration and discovery of valuable items and resources.</p><br/><p> While details remain under wraps for now, the developers have shared the first screenshots that provide a general idea of what this new feature will look like.</p><br/><p> The release date is still unknown, but players can already enjoy the opportunity to look at the future of the underground system of tunnels and trains in the game Rust.</p>'),
(14103, 'en-US', 'Rust Breaks Online Record With 152K Players'),
(14104, 'en-US', 'The game Rust on the Steam platform has set a new online record - 152 thousand players. Rust ranks third in the top games with the highest online and sales. Find out why Rust is so popular and what makes it special.'),
(14105, 'en-US', 'Rust, online, record, game, survival, updates'),
(14106, 'en-US', '<p>The game Rust on the Steam platform continues to conquer the hearts of gamers around the world. Recently, this exciting survival game set a new record - now Rust can boast an online of 152 thousand players!</p><br/><br/><p> This achievement puts Rust in a respectable third place in the top games with the highest online and sales. Online games are always very popular, and Rust has found itself in a highly competitive field.</p><br/><br/><p> What makes Rust so popular? Firstly, this game offers an exciting survival experience in a cruel and ruthless world, where each player must build their shelter, fight for resources, craft weapons and survive in harsh conditions.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust\'s vast game world allows players to explore a variety of biomes, including snowy forests, deserts, and radioactive zones. Each location offers its own unique challenges and opportunities.</p><br/><br/><p> The second advantage of Rust is the ability to play with friends. In this game, you can create your own clan and work together to build a base, defend against enemies, and develop your community. Team mode adds new horizons and aspects to the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, Rust is constantly being updated and improved. The developers implement new features, fix bugs, and keep the game up to date. This active approach to the development and support of the game helps attract new players and maintain interest among the existing audience.</p><br/><br/><p> There is no doubt that Rust is one of the most popular games on the Steam platform. Its unique survival atmosphere, many opportunities to play with friends and constant updates make it unforgettable and attract more and more new players. We will follow the further development of Rust and expect even greater records!</p>'),
(14107, 'en-US', 'The update is out - Servers and blueprints are reset!'),
(14108, 'en-US', 'The Rust update is live! Servers and blueprints are being reset, and Twitch Drops are enabled. Find out all the details in our article!'),
(14109, 'en-US', 'Rust update, Twitch Drops, servers, blueprints, Holiday Season, 2021'),
(14110, 'en-US', '<p>The update is out now, and with it comes a server and blueprint reset!</p><br/><p> Twitch Drops are now available! Join and get rewards now!</p><br/><p> Link: <a href=\"https://twitch.facepunch.com/\">https://twitch.facepunch.com/</a></p><br/><p> Santa is packing up and clearing away the corpses. We hope you have enjoyed the holiday season. We are heading back to work after a few weeks off, so this will be a short blog post. We are looking forward to what the future holds for us in 2021!</p><br/><p> Update link: <a href=\"https://rust.facepunch.com/blog/january-update\">https://rust.facepunch.com/blog/january-update</a></p>'),
(14111, 'en-US', 'Update, Twitch Drops and blueprint wipe in Rust on all servers today!'),
(14112, 'en-US', 'Today, Rust is getting an update that includes Twitch Drops and a blueprint wipe on all servers. Stay up to date with all the latest news and changes in Rust.'),
(14113, 'en-US', 'update, Twitch Drops, blueprint wipe, Rust servers, Rust news'),
(14114, 'en-US', '⚠ UPDATE, TWITCH DROPS AND WIPE OF DRAWINGS ON ALL SERVERS TODAY!<br/><br/> The January update is always very small compared to others, so this time the list of changes is minor:<br/><br/> • Added a sofa, a barrel fire and a new door<br/> • Roof corners are now connected only if they are of the same quality (it will not be possible to connect straw with MVC, for example) - this makes bunkers from roofs inoperative<br/> • The player is now notified if they are about to place a sleeping bag within the range of another spawn point.<br/> • Barrels have had their textures slightly changed<br/> • Support for a centralized ban list has been added for servers. Those who wish can create or connect to such databases. Details here.<br/> • Edited the frequency and chance of weather conditions, now clear skies should appear much more often<br/> • Fixed issues with shadow display on some first-person weapon models<br/> • Fixed incorrect display of some symbols in the list of team members<br/> • Removed road signs from gas station as players thought they could be broken<br/> • Player voice communication volume can now be adjusted directly in the game settings, rather than only via the console.<br/><br/> Also starting today are Twitch Drops, where you can get up to 8 skins for watching 8 streamers, as well as a barrel, door, and couch for watching any streamers. Don\'t forget to set up your account at https://twitch.facepunch.com/ in advance!<br/><br/> And, most importantly, today the blueprints will be reset on all servers - including Facepunch. The last time they were wiped there was in June 2018.<br/><br/> The update and wipe will take place at exactly 22:00 Moscow time - follow the group for details on the patch status.'),
(14115, 'en-US', 'Learn all about Twitch Drops in Rust on Steam: how to get skins from streamers, how to get additional items, and how they affect your gaming experience.'),
(14116, 'en-US', 'Twitch Drops, Rust, Steam, Skins, Streamers, Items, Stream Watching, Balancing, Exclusive Items, Game Experience'),
(14117, 'en-US', '<h2>Information about skin distribution on Twitch Drops in the game Rust on Steam</h2><br/><br/><p> If you are a fan of the game Rust on Steam and want to get exclusive skins, then you have a great opportunity to do this with Twitch Drops. Today we will tell you exactly how it works so that you do not miss any interesting items!</p><br/><br/><h3> When and how long are Twitch Drops available?</h3><br/><br/><p> Twitch Drops will be active in Rust from 23:00 Moscow time today and will be available until January 14th. You will have plenty of time to participate!</p><br/><br/><h3> How to get special skin from certain streamers?</h3><br/><br/><p> You can watch famous streamers like xQcOW, jacksepticeye, auronplay, lilypichu, ludwig, Myth, pokimane, shroud, Sykkuno and get an exclusive skin by watching their stream for at least 4 hours. It\'s a simple and fun way to get unique items for your in-game character (see first screenshot).</p><br/><br/><h3> Additional items for watching streams</h3><br/><br/><p> In addition to the special skin from streamers, you also have the opportunity to get up to three additional items for watching any user\'s stream. Here\'s what to expect:</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> 2 hours viewing: sofa</li><br/><li> 4 hours of viewing: industrial door - skin for sheet metal door</li><br/><li> 8 hours of viewing: barrel-fire</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> Don\'t miss your chance to get these cool items!</p><br/><br/><h3> Important information</h3><br/><br/><p> It is important to note that once you receive the items, they cannot be sold or traded. They will be yours only to enhance your Rust gaming experience.</p><br/><br/><p> Enjoy watching streams and getting exclusive skins via Twitch Drops in Rust on Steam!</p>'),
(14118, 'en-US', 'One of the 3D artists shared amazing screenshots'),
(14119, 'en-US', 'One of the talented 3D artists shared his amazing screenshots that raise questions and some confusion among viewers. Check out the works of this artist on the ArtStation.com page and enjoy his talent and professionalism.'),
(14120, 'en-US', '3D artist, screenshots, body bags, talent, artwork'),
(14121, 'en-US', '<p>One of the talented 3D artists decided to share his latest works and surprise his fans. In his portfolio on ArtStation, he posted a series of exciting screenshots that cause shock and interest in the viewer.</p><br/><p> The paintings are not only about the perfection of details and realism, but also about the unusual theme. The various scenes depicted in the works depict body bags. This raises questions and some confusion: Why did the 3D artist suddenly need such macabre elements in his works? For now, we can only guess.</p><br/><p> Screenshots are available on the <a href=\"https://www.artstation.com/artwork/rABrJm\">ArtStation.com</a> page, where everyone can enjoy the talent and professionalism of this artist. Each work is filled with magic and atmosphere, which makes you think about the hidden meaning of these paintings.</p><br/><p> Such amazing works only highlight the importance of artistic freedom and the ability of artists to create works of art that evoke a variety of emotions and thoughts.</p>'),
(14122, 'en-US', 'Small successes of the game today:'),
(14123, 'en-US', 'This article talks about the small successes of the game Rust today: a million viewers on the Twitch platform and a new online record - 131 thousand players online.'),
(14124, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, achievements, Twitch, online, record'),
(14125, 'en-US', '<p>Small successes of the game today:</p><br/><ul><br/><li> On Twitch, Rust is gathering a million viewers! An impressive figure, even if you consider that drops are not yet included.</li><br/><li> The game Rust has set a new online record - during the night there were as many as 131 thousand players online! Simply an incredible achievement!</li><br/></ul>'),
(14126, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update January 7'),
(14127, 'en-US', 'On January 7th at 19:00 we will release an update to the Rust game with a mandatory reset of schematics and the map, as well as the inclusion of Twitch drops.'),
(14128, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, schematics and map reset, Twitch drops, January 7 update'),
(14129, 'en-US', 'On January 7th at 7:00 PM GMT / 2:00 PM ET, we\'ll be releasing our regular monthly Rust game update.<br/><br/> This update will feature a mandatory schematic and map reset, and we will also be enabling Twitch drops! More details will be posted in the update blog on January 7th.'),
(14130, 'en-US', 'Interesting news for server owners: developers introduce support for a centralized ban list'),
(14131, 'en-US', 'Rust developers on Steam are introducing support for a centralized ban list for server owners. Find out how this will help combat violators and share information about banned users.'),
(14132, 'en-US', 'interesting news, server owners, centralized ban list support, Rust, Steam'),
(14133, 'en-US', '<p>The developers of the game Rust on Steam are delighting server owners with interesting news - support for a centralized list of bans is being introduced. This means that server administrators will be able to connect to existing databases and exchange information about banned users through their own web server.</p><br/><p> This is a great opportunity for servers to join together in complexes and collect data on cheaters, spammers and other violators in order to effectively combat them. By connecting to a centralized ban list, server administrators will be able to accurately determine who should be banned and avoid misunderstandings and mistakes.</p><br/><p> The official game wiki has already published an article about the introduction of a centralized ban list. However, it is worth noting that this feature is still in development and requires improvements. Stay tuned for updates and get ready for an improved ban system in the game Rust!</p><br/><p> The translation of the original news is attached.</p>'),
(14134, 'en-US', 'New Twitch Drops Launching January 7th'),
(14135, 'en-US', 'Learn all about the new Twitch Drops event in Rust, scheduled for January 7. Find out how this event will add joy and rewards to players, and why Rust continues to be hugely popular and is ranked 4th in the top games on Steam.'),
(14136, 'en-US', 'New Twitch Drops, promotion, skins, Rust, popularity, Twitch, online games, Steam'),
(14137, 'en-US', '<h2>New Twitch Drops Launching January 7th</h2><br/><p><br/> Big news for Rust fans! The upcoming Twitch Drops event is scheduled for January 7th. Today, information about the upcoming skin giveaways appeared in the game\'s main menu. Although the details are not yet revealed, this event is expected to bring a lot of joy and rewards to players.<br/></p><br/><p><br/> Rust continues to attract a huge amount of attention on the Twitch platform, with over 200,000 concurrent viewers. Not only does it maintain its popularity, but it also ranks 4th on the list of most popular Steam games by online players. This puts Rust in the undisputed top of games to try.<br/></p>'),
(14138, 'en-US', 'New changes on the test branch'),
(14139, 'en-US', 'A new update is being prepared for the Rust test branch, which includes various changes and fixes, such as the removal of blueprints on all servers, warnings about respawn placement, weather changes, etc.'),
(14140, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, test branch, blueprints, warning, weather, shadows, voice communication, bug'),
(14141, 'en-US', 'New changes on the test branch:<br/><br/> • Blueprints will be wiped on ALL servers without exception on January 7th. This is not new information, but I thought it was worth mentioning.<br/> • A warning will now pop up on the screen if you plan to place a sleeping bag or bed within range of another spawn point. The model will also be highlighted in yellow.<br/> • Edited the frequency and chance of weather conditions, now clear skies should appear much more often<br/> • Fixed issues with shadow display on some first-person weapon models<br/> • Fixed incorrect display of some symbols in the list of team members<br/> • Removed road signs from gas station as players thought they could be broken<br/> • Player voice communication volume can now be adjusted directly in the game settings, rather than only via the console.<br/> • Fixed a rare bug where a server save was deleted due to a startup error, which led to a sudden wipe after an update. (EU Facepunch 2 says hello)<br/><br/> The update will be released on January 7 at 22:00 Moscow time. This will traditionally be an extremely minor update.'),
(14142, 'en-US', 'New Skins Game Rust on Steam'),
(14143, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam is getting free updates and new skins. Find out more about the latest news, themed gaming chairs, and plans for a console port.'),
(14144, 'en-US', 'Rust skins, Rust updates, Rust news, gaming chairs, Rust collaborations, Rust console port'),
(14145, 'en-US', 'We release about 15 free updates every year (although we also regularly release new skins or other cosmetics for sale, for example neon signs for 1050 rubles, but we will emphasize that the updates are free!)<br/><br/> Secret Lab made a themed gaming chair that also gives you a free version inside the game! (buy a useless gaming chair, because gaming chairs are not made of cheap leatherette and they do not kill your posture and back, they are GAMERS, they are definitely better than just ergonomic office chairs, but you will get a decorative chair so that you can also ruin your character\'s posture)<br/><br/> Let us know if you\'d like to collaborate with us in any way for other types of promotion, especially if you\'re Vin Diesel. (It wasn\'t enough for Vin Diesel to ruin the Fast and Furious franchise for his own ego, let him ruin our game too)<br/><br/> The console port didn\'t come out in 2020 as we expected... but the good news is that we are 100% sure it will come out in 2021 (after all, playing a first-person survival game based on shooter mechanics using levers is much more convenient than the pathetic precision of optical mice, let alone the laser compared to the great and proven lever of the millennium!)'),
(14146, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Updates This Year'),
(14147, 'en-US', 'Rust has seen a ton of changes this year, including the addition of CCTV cameras, a farming overhaul, the introduction of night vision, the release of an official Android companion app, modular vehicles, musical instrument DLC, and a summer expansion. The team also made balance changes and gave players the ability to buy limited skins directly.'),
(14148, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, security cameras, farming, night vision, companion app, modular cars, balance changes, DLC, musical instruments, summer expansion, pool, skins'),
(14149, 'en-US', 'This year we<br/> added CCTV cameras and computer stations<br/> (so you could cosplay as Saw\'s antagonists or watch the shootouts on RT like in a reality show)<br/><br/> recycled farming (And also killed it right away)<br/><br/> night vision device (because we got tired of fixing bugs that allow you to see in the dark every time and we gave everyone this opportunity legally)<br/><br/> Official companion app for Android<br/> (so that the loners would suffer even more and someone from the clan would definitely come to defend their base)<br/><br/> modular vehicles (which are still inconvenient due to the terrain, when driving on which the speed is extremely low, and of the useful ones there is only an armored module, but there are other useless modules, especially a module for transporting water, because everyone doesn\'t have enough water, right?)<br/><br/> and a bunch of balance changes. (90% of these are just reductions in crafting time and crafting cost)<br/><br/> we released a DLC with musical instruments and it turned out to be a success<br/> (after all, playing music is exactly what players come to Rust for)<br/><br/> so we decided to continue and released the summer expansion<br/> (although your attempts to swim in the pool will still be stopped by a random passerby with a Kalashnikov, however, you can of course lie in a lounger, after all, what else to do in the game if not just lie around doing nothing)<br/><br/> I think we have found the perfect balance to support the development of the game! (sell skins directly for a limited time and then let the players suffer because of the exorbitant prices on the marketplace, and we only get money from the commission, but this is certainly better than if we just sold the skins ourselves and the players brought us money directly and could buy the skins they were interested in at any time)'),
(14150, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update News on Steam'),
(14151, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about Rust game updates on Steam that improve gameplay, balance game mechanics, and fix bugs and vulnerabilities, creating a more fun and safe gaming experience.'),
(14152, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, Steam, updates, gameplay, balancing, errors, vulnerabilities, gaming experience'),
(14153, 'en-US', '<h1>News related to the update of the game Rust on Steam</h1><br/><p> The game Rust on Steam is constantly being updated and developed, offering players new features and fixing discovered errors. In this article, we will look at the latest news about updates in the game Rust and their impact on the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><h2> Continuous improvement of gameplay</h2><br/><p> The developers of the game Rust constantly listen to the opinions of players and try to improve the gameplay based on their feedback. Each update introduces new features and capabilities that make the game even more exciting and fun. For example, in the latest update, players received new types of weapons, an improved construction system, and improved NPC artificial intelligence.</p><br/><br/><h2> Balancing game mechanics</h2><br/><p> An important aspect of the updates is balancing the game mechanics. The developers try to create a fair game environment where no strategy is too strong or too weak. To do this, they analyze game statistics and community opinion to determine which aspects of the game require further adjustment. For example, if one type of weapon becomes overly popular, the developers can make changes to reduce its effectiveness and balance the gameplay.</p><br/><br/><h2> Fixing bugs and vulnerabilities</h2><br/><p> Rust game updates are also aimed at fixing discovered bugs and vulnerabilities. The developers carefully review bug reports received from players and promptly respond to them by releasing patches and updates that solve problems. This helps create a more stable and safe gaming environment for all players.</p><br/><br/><h2> The Importance of Updates to the Gaming Experience</h2><br/><p> Rust game updates are of great importance to the game experience. They offer players new features, improve gameplay, create fairness and ensure stability. That’s why Rust players always look forward to news about upcoming updates and check the official developer blogs to learn about the latest changes. All this makes Rust one of the most popular and in-demand games on Steam.</p>'),
(14154, 'en-US', 'Unique offer: Rust with a -33% discount!'),
(14155, 'en-US', 'A unique offer for all fans of the game Rust! Buy the game and DLC with a discount of up to -33% and save money. The offer is valid until January 5th. Follow the link to purchase.'),
(14156, 'en-US', 'Rust, discount, offer, game, DLC, Facepunch, savings, Steam store'),
(14157, 'en-US', '<p>You have a great opportunity to buy the game Rust at a special price! Instead of the usual 727 rubles, you can buy the game for only 485 rubles, saving 242 rubles!</p><br/><br/><p> This is the best offer for all Rust fans and those who want to be a part of it. Don\'t miss your chance!</p><br/><br/><p> But that\'s not all! The discount also applies to all DLC and the full set of games from developer Facepunch. This is a great opportunity to get additional content at a bargain price.</p><br/><br/><p> Hurry! The offer is limited and valid only until January 5th. Use the link below to go to the game\'s page on the Steam store:</p><br/><br/> <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/252490/Rust/\" target=\"_blank\">Buy Rust with a -33% discount!</a>'),
(14158, 'en-US', 'Rust on Steam: News and Achievements'),
(14159, 'en-US', 'Find out the latest news about Rust on Steam and its achievements. The article tells about the number of Rust wishlists, the fight against dishonest players, the broken online records, item sales on the marketplace and the financial indicators of the game.'),
(14160, 'en-US', 'Rust, Steam, game, update, wishlist, player ban, online record, marketplace, refund, game duration, financials, sales commission'),
(14161, 'en-US', '<p>Rust has shown impressive results among players all over the world. Since its appearance on the wishlist, the game has been added as many as 2,146,246 times. This shows great interest and anticipation from gamers.</p><br/><br/><p> One of the key moments of Rust development is the support of the gaming community in the fight against dishonest players. During the period of time, as many as 481,598 cheaters were banned, which indicates an active fight against violators of the rules. There is no place for unfair play in Rust!</p><br/><br/><p> April 2020 was a big month for Rust, as the game broke its online record with 125,415 concurrent users. This allowed Rust to take fourth place in the list of most popular games on the Steam platform.</p><br/><br/><p> Another impressive achievement is the number of items sold on the Rust marketplace, which is a whopping 39,715,350. This demonstrates the active economic component within the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Unfortunately, not all players are satisfied and sometimes you have to accept refund requests. Over the course of the game, users have made 929,432 refund requests, which is about 9% of the total sales.</p><br/><br/><p> The average Rust gameplay time was 19 hours and 10 minutes. This result demonstrates the interesting gameplay and richness of content, allowing you to spend a long time in the game.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust\'s financial performance is also impressive. During its existence, the game managed to collect a whopping $185,761,573. The fact that the game has had a minimal commission on sales since June 2020 is an additional plus for the development team.</p><br/><br/><p> Rust continues to attract players and develop thanks to active community support and constant updates. Join the multi-million army of fans of this exciting game!</p>'),
(14162, 'en-US', 'Garry Newman Shares Rust\'s 2020 Successes'),
(14163, 'en-US', 'Garry Newman shared Rust\'s success in 2020, including new updates, DLC, promotions, and charity work. There were also promises of a console version coming in 2021. The article also includes statistics on sales and DLC revenue.'),
(14164, 'en-US', 'Garry Newman, Rust, 2020, updates, DLC, promotion, charity, console version, statistics'),
(14165, 'en-US', 'Garry Newman shared Rust\'s progress in 2020.<br/><br/> “Since our roster changes in 2019 (where everyone stopped messing around with their prototypes and moved on to working on Rust), the team has been able to have a lot of success this year.<br/><br/> This year we\'ve added CCTV cameras and computer stations, reworked farming, night vision, an official companion app for Android and iOS, modular vehicles, and a bunch of balance changes.<br/><br/> DLC:<br/> In December 2019, we released a DLC with musical instruments and it was a success, so we decided to continue and released a summer expansion, which was also a big success for us.<br/><br/> I think we\'ve found the perfect balance between supporting the development of the game (we release around 15 free updates every year) and giving players something new to enjoy at the same time, so expect more of that next year.<br/><br/> PROMOTION:<br/> Secret Lab has made a themed gaming chair that also comes with a free version of the game inside!<br/><br/> We also held our first Twitch Drops event last month. We didn\'t know what to expect, but with 180,000 drops given out, we consider it a success.<br/><br/> Let us know if you would like to collaborate with us in any way for other types of promotion, especially if you are Vin Diesel.<br/><br/> OTHER COOL NEWS:<br/> Together with the community, we raised over $300,000 for charity through Charitable Rust, Trust in Rust, and Movember 2020.<br/><br/> CONSOLE VERSION:<br/> The console port didn\'t come out in 2020 as we expected... but the good news is that we\'re 100% sure it will come out in 2021, 50% sure it will come out in the first half of 2021, and 25% sure it will come out in the first quarter of 2021.<br/><br/> The game is being developed by Double 11, so stay tuned for more news from them. (https://www.double11.com/2020/12/07/rust...)<br/><br/> STATISTICS:<br/> • Rust sold 9,545,105 copies<br/> • Instrument Pack DLC raised $1,310,753<br/> • Sunburn Pack DLC Raised $926,601'),
(14166, 'en-US', 'Client update released'),
(14167, 'en-US', 'An update has been released for the Rust game client on Steam, which fixes bugs with brushes on wooden signs and the display of a drawing on a neon sign when editing.'),
(14168, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, client, fixes, bugs, brushes, signs, eraser, signboard, editing, settings, object quality, gameplay, comfort'),
(14169, 'en-US', 'Contents of the article:<br/><br/><p> Rust has released a new client update on Steam that includes several fixes.</p><br/><br/><ul><br/><li> Now fixed a bug where some brushes worked like an eraser on wooden tablets.</li><br/><li> Also fixed a bug due to which the image on the neon sign would not appear when editing if the minimum \"Object Quality\" value was set in the settings.</li><br/></ul><br/><br/><p> These fixes will help improve the gameplay and user experience.</p>'),
(14170, 'en-US', 'Changes in the game Rust: access problems and forced updates'),
(14171, 'en-US', 'The latest updates to the game Rust have caused access issues and forced players to update. The developers are working to fix the problem and are looking for a compromise between security and user experience.'),
(14172, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, access, issues, compromise, security, developers, gaming experience'),
(14173, 'en-US', '<p>Rust players have been experiencing issues accessing the game in recent days. Many players have complained about not being able to log into the game, and there is some speculation about the cause of the issue.</p><br/><p> Users who updated the game reported that they were forced to reconnect to servers and encountered an error when entering the game. As a result, they were forced to contact support.</p><br/><p> Despite all the difficulties, the developers of the game Rust are actively working to fix the problem. Updates are released regularly, and they promise that all problems will be solved in the near future. They also apologize to users for the inconvenience caused.</p><br/><p> However, this incident raises an important question about the balance between security and convenience for players. Developers constantly make changes to the game to ensure its security, but at the same time, this can cause problems for players. As a result, a compromise must be found between protection from hacks and convenience for users.</p><br/><p> Overall, Rust game updates continue to improve gameplay and game security. The developers are working to fix access issues and are committed to providing the best gaming experience for all players.</p>'),
(14174, 'en-US', 'Twitch drops ended prematurely'),
(14175, 'en-US', 'We are forced to announce the premature end of Twitch drops for the game Rust due to systemic issues and abuse. This article discusses the reasons for the end and the developers\' promise to improve the system. It also notes the need to follow the rules to ensure a level playing field for all participants.'),
(14176, 'en-US', 'Twitch drops, Rust game, skin giveaway, game studio, honesty, rule violations'),
(14177, 'en-US', 'Unfortunately, we have to announce the end of Twitch drops for the game Rust. This spectacular event with the distribution of Trust in Rust boxes was liked by many players, however, problems with the system led to an early end. We apologize for the inconvenience caused and promise to take this problem into account in future events.<br/><br/> The leading gaming studio was forced to stop the distribution due to abuse of this system. However, the developers are actively working on new methods to prevent such problems and violations in the future. Such a step will ensure fairness and equal chances for each participant of these attractive events.<br/><br/> In addition, information about a method that allowed one account to receive more than three boxes appeared on the network earlier. It should be noted that such violations of the drop rules create an imbalance and lead to a decrease in interest and satisfaction from participating in the event. Therefore, we ask all players to comply with the rules and ethical principles of behavior in order to maintain honest and fair conditions for all participants.<br/><br/> We hope for your understanding and will be happy to offer interesting event drops again in the near future. Stay tuned and follow the updates on Steam!'),
(14178, 'en-US', 'Rust: Youtuber\'s Paradise Game Update Review'),
(14179, 'en-US', 'A look at the latest Rust update, Youtuber\'s Paradise, which offers players unique features and raises concerns about imbalance and accessibility.'),
(14180, 'en-US', 'Rust game update, Youtuber\'s Paradise, vlogger, TheGamingWiz, island creation, game balance, new mechanics, limited availability'),
(14181, 'en-US', '<p>The latest update to the game Rust has turned out to be a real paradise for all fans of the popular video blogger Chris, known under the nickname TheGamingWiz. All thanks to his new video on YouTube, which has become a real hit among gamers.</p><br/><br/><p> Chris\' video shows the latest updates to the world of Rust, which have turned the game into a true paradise for players. The most amazing innovation is the ability to create your own island on the server and customize it for yourself. And now players can realize their dreams of virtual life, building beautiful houses and creating unique landscapes.</p><br/><br/><p> In addition, the update includes additional communication and interactivity tools, allowing players to create their own video blogs and share their adventures and strategies with other players.</p><br/><br/><p> The developers also paid attention to the balance of the gameplay, introducing new mechanics and reworking old ones. As a result, the game became even more exciting and challenging.</p><br/><br/><p> However, like any paradise, this Rust paradise has its drawbacks. Some players have expressed concerns that all the innovations and features may lead to imbalance and inequality between players. In addition, creating your own island requires a lot of resources and time, which may limit the availability of this feature for some players.</p><br/><br/><p> Thus, the Rust: Youtuber\'s Paradise update, despite its potential shortcomings, provides players with a unique experience and the opportunity to express themselves in a virtual world. And these opportunities are certainly worth the attention and study of all Rust fans.</p>'),
(14182, 'en-US', 'The second Twitch item drop starts on December 19th!'),
(14183, 'en-US', 'Information about the second Twitch item drop in Rust. Get rare skins and in-game items for watching the Trust in Rust 3 charity stream!'),
(14184, 'en-US', 'second drop, Twitch, Trust in Rust, game Rust, drops in the game Rust, skins, boxes, game items'),
(14185, 'en-US', 'The second Twitch item drop starts on December 19th!<br/><br/> This time you can get up to 3 boxes for watching the Trust in Rust 3 event - this is a charity stream where more than 200 famous foreign Rust players will fight each other. All donations will go to the Games for Love project. Facepunch decided to introduce drops as a support.<br/><br/> Each box will drop one random skin. The first box is given for 1 hour of watching, the second for 4, and the third for 8. Before watching the stream, don\'t forget to prepare your account here: https://twitch.facepunch.com/<br/><br/> Drops can be received until December 22, 02:30 Moscow time. The second drop of items from Twitch starts on December 19!<br/><br/> This time you can get up to 3 boxes for watching the Trust in Rust 3 event - this is a charity stream where more than 200 famous foreign Rust players will fight each other. All donations will go to the Games for Love project. Facepunch decided to introduce drops as a support.<br/><br/> Each box will drop one random skin. The first box is given for 1 hour of watching, the second for 4, and the third for 8. Before watching the stream, don\'t forget to prepare your account here: https://twitch.facepunch.com/'),
(14186, 'en-US', 'It has become known what items will appear with the Christmas update'),
(14187, 'en-US', 'Find out what new items will be available for purchase with the Rust Christmas update. Create a festive atmosphere in your gaming space with bright signs, garlands, snowmen and other interesting items.'),
(14188, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, Christmas update, items, signs, garland, snow generator, snowman, wreath, holiday atmosphere'),
(14189, 'en-US', '<h1>It has become known which items will go on sale with the Christmas update, which will be released tomorrow at 22:00 Moscow time:</h1><br/><p> We are pleased to share with you detailed information about the items that will go on sale with the Christmas update of the Rust game, which is expected tomorrow at 22:00 Moscow time. In this article, you will find a list of interesting innovations that will add a festive atmosphere to the world of the game.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Neon Signs - Decorate your buildings with vibrant neon signs and create a unique style for your play space.</li><br/><li> Luxury Christmas Garland - Add some festive cheer around your home with a luxury Christmas garland.</li><br/><li> Snow Generator - Create an atmosphere of winter magic by turning on the snow generator, which will shower your base with snow.</li><br/><li> Snowman - decorate your base with a funny snowman and please yourself and your neighbors.</li><br/><li> Holiday Garland - Add some magic around your base with a holiday garland.</li><br/><li> Christmas Wreath - Decorate the entrance to your base with a beautiful Christmas wreath.</li><br/></ul><br/><p> We hope these new items will help make your gaming space more festive and cozy. Get ready for winter adventures in the game Rust!</p>'),
(14190, 'en-US', '7 years of Rust: development history and update news'),
(14191, 'en-US', 'In honor of the 7th anniversary of the game Rust, the developers talk about its development, updates, as well as news and events related to this holiday.'),
(14192, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, anniversary, updates, developers, statistics, bans, celebration'),
(14193, 'en-US', '<p>Today, Rust turns 7 years old! In December 2013, it was first released on Steam and has since made a lot of noise in the gaming community. During this time, the game has completely changed several times - from Legacy to Experimental, and now the current version continues to develop and receive updates every month, as well as participate in event activities. It is not surprising that Rust is not going to retire, because its statistics are still impressive.</p><br/><p> The developers promise to share interesting numbers for 2020, which will help us better understand the success of the game. But despite all the achievements, the anniversary of the game was not celebrated as grandly as the previous one. The developers chose modest, elegant ways to celebrate Rust\'s birthday, banning more than 400 players from Facepunch servers for playing with cheaters. Alistair Beaver, the head of development for the game, assured the community that such bans will become more frequent in the future. But players will continue to be given opportunities to celebrate this holiday, including enjoying balloons on loot boxes and cake.</p>'),
(14194, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: Cloudy Weather Returns'),
(14195, 'en-US', 'The next Rust update will see changes to the weather mode. Cloudy weather has been temporarily disabled due to complaints about the sun being too bright.'),
(14196, 'en-US', 'update, game Rust, cloudy weather, bright sun'),
(14197, 'en-US', 'Rust gamers can expect changes to the weather mode in the next update. Due to frequent complaints about the bright sun, the developers decided to temporarily disable cloudy weather. However, according to the developers, this change will only be in effect until the problems with the sun are fixed. A new update with restored cloudy weather is expected to be available next Thursday.'),
(14198, 'en-US', 'Neon signs, sleds and ice walls - all on the test branch'),
(14199, 'en-US', 'The Rust test branch has new interesting decor elements and opportunities for players. Decorate your bases with neon signs and create reinforced fences from ice walls. Also added are sleds for fast movement across snowy locations. Don\'t miss the update on December 17!'),
(14200, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, updates, neon signs, sleds, ice walls, bases, design, store'),
(14201, 'en-US', '<p>The Rust test branch has a lot of interesting new features! Players will now be able to decorate their bases with neon signs, which can be used as showcases or even to create works of art. Powering them activates the light effect, making them even more attractive.</p><br/><br/><p> If you love winter themes, you will love the new sleds. They have special physics and can quickly slide down the snow. Don\'t miss the opportunity to create unforgettable slides or use the sleds to quickly move around snowy locations.</p><br/><br/><p> You can also place ice walls on the test branch. This is a great opportunity to diversify your base design and create fortified fences. The possibilities of using ice walls are only limited by your imagination.</p><br/><br/><p> It is not yet clear how players will be able to obtain the neon signs. They will likely appear in the item shop, but this information has not yet been officially confirmed. We will keep an eye on the updates and keep you updated.</p><br/><br/><p> Thematic update, including all these innovations, is expected on December 17 at 22:00 Moscow time. Don\'t miss the opportunity to immerse yourself in the winter atmosphere and enjoy the new features of the game Rust!</p>'),
(14202, 'en-US', 'Snowthrower added to test branch'),
(14203, 'en-US', 'A new weapon, the snowthrower, has been added to the Rust test branch. Find out more about its features and its connection to the upcoming Christmas event.'),
(14204, 'en-US', 'Rust, update, game, snowball, christmas event'),
(14205, 'en-US', '<p>A new weapon, the snowthrower, has been added to the Rust test branch.</p><br/><p> The Snowball Launcher is a reskin of the Grenade Launcher and uses regular snowballs as ammunition. This is an interesting update related to the upcoming Christmas event.</p><br/><p> During the event, two gifts will periodically appear near you. You will be able to collect candies, upgrade them and receive random items. Large gifts with beautiful stars will replace planes and airdrops.</p><br/><p> It is important to note that the Snowthrower does not have a crafting cost or the ability to learn. It may be available for purchase in the item shop. An official release date for the update has not yet been announced.</p>'),
(14206, 'en-US', 'The Rust test branch has some exciting new features: neon signs, sleds, and ice walls. Find out more about each new feature in the article and stay tuned for the update on December 17!'),
(14207, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, neon signs, sleds, ice walls, base, test branch'),
(14208, 'en-US', 'There\'s some exciting news on the Rust test branch! Players will now be able to decorate their base with neon signs that glow beautifully when powered. This will not only allow players to express their imagination, but will also make the base more visible to other players.<br/><br/> The second innovation is the sled. Now you can put it on the ground and enjoy a fast and steep race on the snow. Just imagine how much fun it will be to slide down the mountain on a sled with your friends!<br/><br/> Another interesting element is the ice walls. They will fit perfectly into the arctic theme and will serve as a shelter or fence for your base. Ice walls will give your building structure a special atmosphere and appearance.<br/><br/> It is important to note that neon signs require 5 units of charge to operate. It is not yet known whether they will be available for sale in the item shop, but it is quite possible.<br/><br/> The update with new features will be released on December 17 at 22:00 Moscow time. We will be looking forward to this interesting update!'),
(14209, 'en-US', 'Update roaming in airdrop'),
(14210, 'en-US', 'Airdrop loot has been updated in Rust. Find out what can now be found in airdrops and what items have already dropped for players.'),
(14211, 'en-US', 'Rust, game, update, airdrops, loot, weapons, ammunition, explosives, tools, clothes, resources');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(14212, 'en-US', 'Airdrop loot has been reworked.<br/><br/> The first airdrop slot is dedicated to resources, and there you can find one of the following items: 40-50 MVC / 140-160 scrap metal / 4 microchips / 5 pipes / 5 gears / 5 sheets of metal<br/><br/> Here are the items that we managed to get from 100 airdrops:<br/> From weapons:<br/> • 8 pieces LR-300<br/> • 12 pieces M39<br/> • 12 pieces M92<br/> • 7 pieces Spas-12<br/> • 15 pieces MP5<br/> • 17 pump-action shotguns<br/> • 33 Thompsons<br/> • 17 homemade submachine guns<br/> • 25 homemade rifles<br/> From the ammunition:<br/> • 17 stacks of 5.56 ammo<br/> • 120 incendiary cartridges<br/> • 90 high velocity 5.56 rounds<br/> • 21 stacks of 9mm rounds<br/> • 2.5 stacks of 9mm incendiary rounds<br/> • 110 high-velocity 9mm rounds<br/> • 10 stacks of 12 gauge shot<br/> • 4 stacks of 12 gauge bullets<br/> • 2 stacks of incendiary shotgun shells<br/> From explosives:<br/> • 15 C4 explosives<br/> • 54 explosives from bean cans<br/> • 240 F1 grenades<br/> • 48 explosive cartridges 5.56<br/> From the tools:<br/> • 10 chainsaws<br/> • 15 jackhammers<br/> From clothes:<br/> • 28 pieces of pants<br/> • 20 sweatshirts<br/> • 18 helmets from a bucket<br/> • 24 rebel helmets<br/> • 14 Coffee Can Helmets<br/> • 25 jackets<br/> • 20 kilts made from road signs<br/> • 25 bibs made from road signs<br/> • 26 gloves made from road signs<br/> From resources:<br/> • 1186 MVC<br/> • 4645 scrap metal<br/> • 50 pipes<br/> • 55 gears<br/> • 35 sheets of metal<br/> • 28 microcircuits<br/><br/> The update is coming out today at 22:00 Moscow time.'),
(14213, 'en-US', 'Minor changes to the chainsaw'),
(14214, 'en-US', 'The latest updates to Rust on Steam have made changes to the chainsaw mechanics, which will improve gameplay and save resources.'),
(14215, 'en-US', 'chainsaw, changes, updates, mechanics, start, fuel consumption, game balance, convenience, economy'),
(14216, 'en-US', '<p>The latest updates to Rust on Steam have introduced some minor changes to the chainsaw mechanics that will greatly improve the gameplay experience.</p><br/><p> One of the major changes is that you no longer need to try several times to start the chainsaw. Now it starts the first time, saving you time and effort.</p><br/><p> In addition, the fuel consumption system has been changed. Now the chainsaw consumes 75% less fuel, which will allow you to work with it much longer without the need for constant refueling.</p><br/><p> These changes are intended to improve gameplay balance and make chainsaw use more convenient and economical for Rust players.</p>'),
(14217, 'en-US', 'Rust Game Update: The \"I\" Switch and Other Changes'),
(14218, 'en-US', 'The latest update to Rust brings a ton of new items and changes, including the E-switch and a bunch of other electrical gadgets. The update also brings changes to crafting and weapon balance.'),
(14219, 'en-US', 'game Rust, update, switch \"I\", electrical appliances, craft'),
(14220, 'en-US', '— Switch \"I\"<br/> - Electrical branch<br/> — Power combiner<br/> — Memory cell<br/> — OR switch<br/> — XOR switch<br/> - Large solar panel<br/> - Switch<br/> — Separator<br/> - Hose<br/> - Wire<br/> - Arsonist<br/> - Flashing light<br/> - Siren<br/> - Sprinkler<br/> — Electric water desalinator<br/> - Water pump<br/> - Elevator<br/> — HBHF sensor<br/> — Switch \"RAND\"<br/> - Small generator<br/> - Tesla coil<br/> - Computer station<br/> - Radio transmitter<br/> — Radio receiver<br/> - Mill<br/> • Reduced the crafting time of the searchlight - now it is the same as other electrical devices<br/> • Kayaks can now be lifted with a mallet. Each time they are lifted, 25% of their HP will be taken away.<br/> • Reduced crafting time and increased durability for prison cages and bars.<br/> • Scuba diving fins, suit, mask and oxygen tank can now be recycled<br/> • The paddle no longer requires a workbench to craft<br/> • Reduced the cost of crafting a fire turret<br/> • Reduced damage and radius of action of grenades<br/> • Reduced the cost and time to craft the long sword<br/> • Reduced crafting time for homemade sword<br/> • Reduced ice pick crafting time<br/> • Increased crafting time for homemade axe<br/> • Reduced mace crafting time<br/> • Reduced crafting time for homemade cleaver<br/> • Wooden Barricade no longer requires a workbench to craft<br/> • Reduced the time and cost of crafting a research table<br/> • Reduced crafting time for the repair workbench'),
(14221, 'en-US', 'Part 2 of Rust Balance Fixes'),
(14222, 'en-US', 'The second part of balance changes in the game Rust affected the statistics of cold weapons, clothing and electrical items.'),
(14223, 'en-US', 'Rust, updates, balance, melee weapons, clothing'),
(14224, 'en-US', 'The second part of balance changes, which this time affected the statistics of melee weapons, some clothing and more.<br/><br/> • Reduced the amount of gunpowder required to craft incendiary pistol and 5.56 rounds<br/> • Reduced the amount of gunpowder required to craft mines<br/> • Increased volume of potatoes obtained from ripe fruits<br/> • Slightly reduced the reload time of the nail gun<br/> • Reduced crafting time for bean grenade, stash and bean explosive.<br/> • Changed some statistics of the following items:<br/> - Sweatshirt (changed defense statistics and reduced crafting cost)<br/> — T-shirt (rebalance)<br/> - T-shirt (no longer requires a workbench and uses cloth instead of leather in crafting)<br/> — Hide vest (rebalance + reduced crafting cost)<br/> — Turtleneck (rebalance)<br/> • The crafting for the following electrical items has been changed - now they require metal fragments instead of MVC:<br/> — Alarm<br/> - Large battery<br/> — Average battery<br/> - Small battery<br/> - Button<br/> — Counter<br/> — Laser sensor<br/> — Door controller<br/> — Flow combinator<br/> — Flow divider<br/> - Pump switch'),
(14225, 'en-US', 'Developers are preparing new balance changes for the December update'),
(14226, 'en-US', 'Learn about the new balance changes the developers are preparing for the December update of the game Rust on Steam'),
(14227, 'en-US', 'Developers, balance changes, December update, Rust game, Steam'),
(14228, 'en-US', 'The developers are preparing new balance changes for the December update:<br/><br/> • The rocket launcher now takes 2 seconds to pick up, which is the same amount of time it takes to reload. This change will make it pointless to use multiple rocket launchers at once for a faster raid<br/> • The Double-Barrel Shotgun now requires two Pipes and 175 Metal Fragments to craft.<br/> • Holographic sight now requires a level 2 workbench<br/> • Bulletproof window health has been reduced from 500 to 350<br/> • Reinforced Window Bars now have glass, health reduced to 500, and renamed to \"Reinforced Bulletproof Window\"<br/> • Smoke grenades can now be crafted and researched, requires a level 2 workbench<br/> • Binoculars no longer require MVC and a workbench for crafting<br/> • Double doors now cost almost the same as single options<br/> • Reduced the cost of crafting a large first aid kit, plus now when used it gives a small instant heal<br/> • The anti-radiation suit now has durability - it can break, but it can be repaired)<br/> • Anti-radiation pills now increase thirst much less<br/> • Bone armor now requires fewer bones to craft<br/> • Pure tea mining bonus for ore reduced to 50%<br/> • Advanced Tea Ore Mining Bonus Reduced to 35%<br/> • The cost of crafting a homemade shotgun has been slightly reduced.<br/> • Reduced crafting time for the following items:<br/> - all stone tools<br/> - stone spear<br/> - large and small oven<br/> - kilt made of road signs<br/> - a bib made from road signs<br/> - horse feeder<br/> - 8x scope<br/> - a lock with a key<br/> - muffler<br/> - primitive sight<br/> - muzzle brake<br/> - laser sight<br/> - holographic sight<br/> - construction plan<br/> - tower<br/> - a bear skin rug<br/> - iron pickaxe<br/> - all types of paintings, photo frames and portraits'),
(14229, 'en-US', 'New update in the game Rust: expanding the capabilities of the workbench'),
(14230, 'en-US', 'The new Rust update adds a level 2 workbench, which is required to craft a number of items. Learn about the new features and improvements in the game.'),
(14231, 'en-US', 'Rust, Rust update, level 2 workbench, new features, game items'),
(14232, 'en-US', '<h2>A number of items now require a level 2 workbench</h2><br/><p> The latest update to Rust has brought changes that allow players to expand their options when crafting and upgrading items. Now, certain items require a level 2 workbench to be crafted.</p><br/><ul><br/><li> Metal loopholes</li><br/><li> Glass window</li><br/><li> Garage door</li><br/><li> Remote control</li><br/><li> RAND switch</li><br/><li> Memory cell</li><br/><li> Laser sensor</li><br/><li> Resource Monitor</li><br/><li> Smart Switch</li><br/><li> Smart alarm</li><br/><li> Tesla coil</li><br/><li> Improved Horseshoe</li><br/><li> Horse armor made from road signs</li><br/></ul><br/><p> These changes add more depth and strategic thinking to the game, requiring players to invest more resources and time to achieve new opportunities and defend their base from enemies.</p><br/><p> Players should take note of this update and start researching the various items and upgrades that are now only available at the second level of the workbench.</p>'),
(14233, 'en-US', 'Another Hidden Twitch Drop - \"Kingdoms II Hammer\"'),
(14234, 'en-US', 'Get the new exclusive Twitch Drop - \"Kingdoms II Hammer\" and update your skin collection in Rust by simply spending 1 hour with popular streamers mrwobblestwitch, ryankingsounds, SanaUchiha, sukidingels or Syraphic.'),
(14235, 'en-US', 'hidden Twitch Drop, Kingdoms II Hammer, Rust game, Steam skins, getting Twitch Drop, mrwobblestwitch, ryankingsounds, SanaUchiha, sukidingels, Syraphic'),
(14236, 'en-US', 'If you are a fan of the game Rust on Steam and are constantly looking for new skins, you have a great opportunity to get a new exclusive Twitch Drop - \"Kingdoms II Hammer\". In order to get it, you only need to spend 1 hour in the company of popular streamers mrwobblestwitch, ryankingsounds, SanaUchiha, sukidingels or Syraphic. During this time, you will not only enjoy their content, but also automatically receive this unique skin. Do not miss the chance to update your collection in Rust and make it even brighter and more stylish!'),
(14237, 'en-US', 'Check out the latest in Rust - a fresh batch of skins have been added to Steam.'),
(14238, 'en-US', 'new skins, update, game Rust, Steam'),
(14239, 'en-US', 'New Skins Update in Rust Game on Steam'),
(14240, 'en-US', 'The next Twitch Rivals Event will take place from December 9th - 14th'),
(14241, 'en-US', 'Find out about the next Twitch Rivals Event in Rust on Steam, which runs from December 9th to 14th and will feature 36 rounds of Twitch Drops with exclusive in-game skins.'),
(14242, 'en-US', 'Twitch Rivals Event, Twitch Drops, игра Rust, скины, Steam'),
(14243, 'en-US', 'The next Twitch Rivals Event, which will take place from December 9 to 14, will feature an exciting competition with 36 rounds of Twitch Drops. This is an event where famous streamers and professional players compete with each other, attracting a lot of viewers. Twitch Drops are an opportunity to get exclusive game skins and other valuable rewards just by watching the streams of these participants. Now you have a chance to become the owner of unique items in the game Rust on Steam. I am sure that this event will be a real holiday for all Rust fans.'),
