(14771, 'en-US', 'Changelock update'),
(14772, 'en-US', 'The new Changelock update brings a host of changes and improvements to Rust on Steam. Check out all the new features and improvements, including additional fridge inventory slots, easier surgeon suit crafting, and more.'),
(14773, 'en-US', 'Rust game, Rust update, Changelock update, refrigerator, surgeon suit, vending machines, dynamic pricing, alarm, crossbow, water pump, propane'),
(14774, 'en-US', '<p>Rust on Steam is getting an update with the Changelock patch! In this article, we\'ll tell you about the new changes and improvements that await you in the game.</p><p> One of the main innovations is the addition of additional inventory slots in refrigerators. Now you can store more food and resources!</p><p> You will also no longer need a workbench to craft the surgeon suit. This will save you time and resources, so you can focus on other quests and adventures.</p><p> Vending machines have received changes to their pricing mechanism. Now, prices for items sold will change dynamically depending on supply and demand. Initial prices for fish will be 50% lower and will increase if the item is not selling.</p><p> Another change is related to the manufacture of the alarm. Now to create an alarm you will need 2 empty tin cans and 30 metal fragments. This will make the process of creating an alarm easier and more accessible.</p><p> The basic prefab build now includes a mini crossbow model and some scripts. This will add new features and variability to the game.</p><p> The Water Pump can now be used in new rivers as the minimum depth for it to work has been reduced. This will give you more places to use the pump and get water.</p><p> Finally, the propane tank stack has been increased from 5 to 20, allowing you to store more gas and use it in your adventures in the game.</p><p> Changelock is the latest update to Rust on Steam, adding new features and improvements for players. Don\'t miss your chance to enjoy new content and an improved gaming experience!</p>'),
