(18167, 'en-US', '? Upcoming Rust Updates: Jungle, Easter, and New Features! (April 3, 2025)'),
(18168, 'en-US', '<p>Facepunch Studios is preparing a large-scale update with a new biome \"Jungle\", an Easter event and gameplay improvements. We tell you what awaits players in the near future and how to prepare for the innovations!</p>'),
(18169, 'en-US', '<h2><strong>? Jungle - a new biome and hidden threats</strong></h2><p> The developers are actively working on <strong>the \"Jungle\" biome</strong> , which will add to the game:<br> ✅ <strong>New RT \"Ziggurat\"</strong> - a mysterious location with unique loot.<br> ✅ <strong>Dangerous animals</strong> - panthers, snakes and crocodiles.<br> ✅ <strong>Exotic weapons</strong> - a blowpipe and a boomerang for stealth hunting.</p><p> ⏳ <strong>When will it be released?</strong><br> There is no exact date yet, but testing is already underway. Most likely, the release will take place <strong>no earlier than May</strong> .<br><br></p><hr><h2> <strong>? New blade - \"Sunken Dagger\"</strong></h2><p> <strong>A rusty knife</strong> with a unique design has appeared in the test branch:</p><ul><li><p> For now it has the characteristics of a regular <strong>combat knife</strong> .</p></li><li><p> Possibly part of the <strong>Abyss</strong> DLC (underwater content).</p></li></ul><hr><h2> <strong>? Easter Event 2025</strong></h2><p> In April, Rust will traditionally hold <strong>an egg hunt</strong> :<br> ? <strong>New</strong> - chicken-style horse costumes (3 options).<br> ? <strong>The mechanics</strong> will remain the same: searching for eggs and \"seeing\" hidden objects.<br><br></p><hr><h2> <strong>⚙ Base Defense Improvements</strong></h2><p> Now you can <strong>visualize the zones of action</strong> :</p><ul><li><p> Turrets</p></li><li><p> Gantrapov</p></li><li><p> Heartbeat sensors</p></li><li><p> Tesla coils</p></li></ul><p> ? You can <strong>disable</strong> this function in the settings if it bothers you.<br><br></p><hr><h2> <strong>♻ Other changes</strong></h2><ul><li><p> Bread now <strong>spoils gradually</strong> , not instantly.</p></li><li><p> <strong>A new submarine,</strong> the \"Rover Submarine\", is under development.</p></li><li><p> Improvements to <strong>the Softcore mode</strong> (for beginners).<br><br></p></li></ul><hr><h2> <strong>? Rust on sale - the best time to start!</strong></h2><p> The game is now <strong>cheaper than usual</strong> - a great chance to play with friends!</p><p> ? <strong>Advice:</strong> If you want to play <strong>without restrictions</strong> , join our servers.<br><br></p><hr><p> <strong>What are you most interested in in the new update?</strong> Write in the comments!</p>'),
