(18175, 'en-US', 'Global wipe in Rust 03.04 at 21:00 Moscow time! New loot, Easter event with horse costumes, gameplay improvements. Update with wipe of all servers. Connect and play!'),
(18176, 'en-US', '<p><strong>? Rust update + global wipe 03.04 at 21:00 Moscow time!</strong></p><p></p><p> Global wipe on all our servers.<br> ? <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\">IP of our servers</a></p><p><br> What awaits you in the update?<br> ? <strong>New loot</strong><br> \"Sunken Dagger\" (as a combat knife for now)</p><p> ? <strong>Easter event</strong><br> Egg hunt<br> 3 new costumes for horses</p><p> ⚙️ <strong>Improvements</strong><br> Visualization of turret/trap zones<br> Gradual spoilage of bread</p><p> <em><a href=\"https://prostoj.store/posts/rust-news/update/post--upcoming-rust-updates-jungle-easter-and-new-features-april-2025\">Read more about the update here</a> .</em><br><br> ❗️ <strong>HOW MUCH IS THE WIPE?</strong><br> 03.04.2025 at 21:00 MSK <strong><br><br>We wish you a successful game!</strong></p>'),
(18177, 'en-US', 'Rust Vanilla - Classic Survival Without Mods'),
(18178, 'en-US', 'Find out what Rust Vanilla is, why it\'s the best option for true survival fans, and join our server for a fair and tough game!'),
(18179, 'en-US', '<h2>What is Rust Vanilla?</h2><p> Rust Vanilla is a pure version of the game without mods and changes. No extra items, simplified mechanics or donation advantages. Just you, other players and a harsh world where the strongest survives.</p><p> Many players choose Vanilla because everything is real here. You need to extract resources, build bases, fight and survive, relying only on your skills. No \"simplified\" - only hardcore!</p><h2> Why play on Vanilla servers?</h2><ul><li> <strong>Fairness.</strong> All players are on equal terms, no paid advantages.</li><li> <strong>Classic gameplay.</strong> The same Rust as the developers intended it to be.</li><li> <strong>Real survival.</strong> You have to think, plan and fight for every resource.</li></ul><p> If you are tired of servers with a bunch of mods and donations, try our Vanilla server <strong>[Name of your server]</strong> . Here only pure play and real emotions!</p><h2> What other modes are there in Rust?</h2><p> While Vanilla is the classic, Rust has other popular modes:</p><ul><li> <strong>Modded.</strong> Servers with mods: increased stacks, teleports, whales and other changes.</li><li> <strong>RolePlay (RP) -</strong> Players assume roles, create cities, trade and interact.</li><li> <strong>PvE.</strong> No PvP, only against NPCs and the environment.</li><li> <strong>Minigames.</strong> Arenas, races, deathmatch and other minigames.</li><li> <strong>Hardcore.</strong> Complicated Vanilla with increased risks.</li></ul><p> But if you want real Rust - choose Vanilla. Come to our server <strong>[Name of your server]</strong> and test your strength in honest survival!</p><p> Server IP: <strong>connect 195.18.27.169:35300</strong><br> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\">Select another server</a></p>'),
(18180, 'en-US', 'How to buy Rust in Russia in 2025?'),
(18181, 'en-US', 'Want to play Rust, but Steam won\'t accept payments due to sanctions? We\'ll tell you how to top up your balance via MTS Bank with a minimum commission, catch a discount, and start playing on our server for beginners!'),
(18182, 'en-US', '<h2>How to top up Steam in Russia in 2025?</h2><p> Due to sanctions, you can\'t top up Steam directly with a Russian bank card. But there is a working method - through <strong>MTS Bank</strong> . We\'ll tell you step by step:</p><h3> Method 1: Via the website payments.mts.ru (fast, but more expensive)</h3><ol><li> Go to <a href=\"https://payment.mts.ru/cyber/steam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">payments.mts.ru/cyber/steam</a> .</li><li> Enter the top-up amount (minimum 100 rubles).</li><li> You indicate your Steam ID.</li><li> You can pay with a card from any bank.</li></ol><p> <strong>Minus:</strong> commission 50 rubles + ~4% for currency conversion. For small amounts, this is unprofitable.</p><h3> Method 2: Via the MTS Bank app (cheaper, but you need to get a card)</h3><ol><li> <strong>Open an account at MTS Bank</strong> (you need a passport and SNILS/TIN).</li><li> You top up your card via SBP (no commission).</li><li> In the application, go to the section <strong>\"Payments\" → \"Games\" → \"Steam\"</strong> .</li><li> Enter the amount and Steam ID.</li><li> You pay - the commission is only ~4% (less 50 rubles).</li></ol><p> <strong>Example:</strong> if you deposit 100 rubles, Steam will receive ~96 rubles (versus ~46 rubles in the first method).</p><h2> How to buy Rust after replenishing Steam?</h2><p> Official Steam page of the game: <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/252490/Rust/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Rust on Steam</a></p><ol><li> Go to Steam → Store → find \"Rust\" or follow <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/252490/Rust/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">the link</a> .</li><li> Click \"Add to cart\" and complete your purchase.</li><li> Done! All that\'s left is to download and start playing.</li></ol><h3> When are there discounts on Rust?</h3><p> The standard price of Rust is about <strong>1,500 rubles</strong> , but several times a year the game takes part in sales with discounts of up to 50%:</p><ul><li> ? <strong>Winter sales</strong> (late December - early January)</li><li> ? <strong>Summer sales</strong> (late June - early July)</li><li> ? <strong>Spring sales</strong> (March-April)</li><li> ? <strong>Halloween Discounts</strong> (October)</li></ul><p> If you don\'t want to overpay, add the game to your wishlist and Steam will send you a discount notification.</p><h2> Where to play for a beginner? Our server for beginners!</h2><p> Rust is a difficult game, and on normal servers you will quickly be \"closed\" by experienced players. Therefore, we recommend starting with <strong>our server for beginners</strong> :</p><ul><li> ✅ No cheaters and aggressive clans</li><li> ✅ Help from the administration and players</li><li> ✅ Moderate rules to get used to</li><li> ✅ Regular events and training</li></ul><p> <strong>Connect via F1 in the game:</strong><br> Server IP: <strong>connect 195.18.27.169:35100</strong><br> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\">Select another server</a></p><p> Now you know how to buy Rust in 2025, save on discounts and where to play without stress. Good luck in survival!</p>'),
(18183, 'en-US', 'Rust Guides: Tutorials, Secrets, and Tactics'),
(18184, 'en-US', 'This section contains useful guides - from the basics for beginners to advanced tactics for experienced players. Find out how to quickly farm resources, build impregnable bases, win in PvP and use hidden game mechanics.'),
(18185, 'en-US', 'How Often Do Events Spawn in Rust? A Complete Guide to Timers'),
(18186, 'en-US', 'Want to know how long it takes for a military helicopter, Bradley or cargo ship to spawn? This article contains the exact spawn timers for all Rust events and tips on how to farm them effectively.'),
(18187, 'en-US', '<h2>? General rules for event spawning</h2><p> Events in Rust are divided into <strong>three types</strong> :</p><ul><li> ? <strong>Static</strong> (appear immediately after a wipe)</li><li> ? <strong>Dynamic</strong> (spawn on timer)</li><li> ? <strong>Conditional</strong> (depends on the players\' actions)</li></ul><h2> ⚡ Timers of main events</h2><h3> 1️⃣ Abandoned military base (Launch Site)</h3><ul><li> ⏱️ <strong>Spawn:</strong> Immediately after wipe</li><li> ? <strong>Loot respawn:</strong> 30-40 minutes</li><li> ⚠️ <strong>The MLRS MLRS vehicle</strong> respawns every 10 minutes after use </li></ul><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 400px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/12234_mlrs.jpg\"></p><h3> 2️⃣ Military helicopter (Attack Helicopter)</h3><ul><li> ⏱️ <strong>First spawn:</strong> 2-3 hours after wipe</li><li> ? <strong>Respawn:</strong> Every 2-3 hours</li><li> ✈️ Flies over monuments and bases </li></ul><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 400px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/12234_vert.jpg\"></p><h3> 3️⃣ Bradley (Armored personnel carrier at the spaceport)</h3><ul><li> ⏱️ <strong>Spawn:</strong> Immediately after wipe</li><li> ? <strong>Respawn:</strong> 2 hours after explosion</li><li> ? Extremely dangerous without preparation </li></ul><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 400px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/12234_tank.jpg\"></p><h3> 4️⃣ Cargo Ship</h3><ul><li> ⏱️ <strong>First spawn:</strong> 1 hour after wipe</li><li> ? <strong>Respawn:</strong> 2 hours</li><li> ? Visible on the map </li></ul><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 400px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/12234_cargo.jpg\"></p><h3> 5️⃣ Oil Rig</h3><ul><li> ⛽ <strong>Big tower:</strong> Respawn 30 min</li><li> ?️ <strong>Small tower:</strong> Respawn 25 min</li><li> ? Scientists respawn faster than loot</li><li> ? For respawn it is important that there is no one on the oil rig </li></ul><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 400px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/12234_neft.jpg\"></p><h3> 6️⃣ Underwater laboratory</h3><ul><li> ⏱️ <strong>Spawn:</strong> Immediately after wipe</li><li> ? <strong>Loot respawn:</strong> 40 minutes</li><li> ? Need a diving suit </li></ul><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 400px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/12234_lab.jpg\"></p><h3> 7️⃣ Chinook (cargo helicopter)</h3><ul><li> ⏱️ <strong>Spawn:</strong> 60 minutes</li><li> ? Drops green boxes</li><li> ? It can be knocked down </li></ul><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 400px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/12234_chiln.jpg\"></p><h2> ? Farming tips</h2><ul><li> ⏰ Keep track of time ( <code>/time</code> )</li><li> ? Prepare your gear in advance</li><li> ? Work in a team</li><li> ? Use transport</li></ul><h2> ? Our servers</h2><p> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\">Select a server to play on</a></p>'),
(18188, 'en-US', 'Easter Event 2025 - Egg Hunt and Exclusive Rewards!'),
(18189, 'en-US', 'From April 10 at 21:00 Moscow time, the annual Easter Event will start on our servers! Collect colorful eggs, get valuable prizes and purchase unique seasonal skins, including a new horse costume and a luxurious Faberge egg.'),
(18190, 'en-US', '<p><em>? From April 10 at 21:00 Moscow time, the annual Easter Event starts on our servers! Collect colorful eggs, get valuable prizes and purchase unique seasonal skins, including a new horse costume and a luxurious Faberge egg.</em></p><h2> ? Main events of the event:</h2><ul><li> ? Island-wide Easter Egg Hunt</li><li> ? Exclusive rewards for collected eggs</li><li> ?️ New in-game items:<ul><li> ? Horse costume (3 unique colors)</li><li> ? Faberge Egg (elite decorative item)</li></ul></li><li> ⏳ Limited time: April 10 - April 17, 2025</li></ul><p><br> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\">Select a server to play on</a></p><p> ? <strong>Don\'t miss your chance to get rare items and have fun!</strong></p>'),
(18191, 'en-US', '<p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 400px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/20250408124953_1-Edit.png\"></p><p></p><p> <em>? From April 10 at 21:00 Moscow time, the annual Easter Event starts on our servers! Collect colorful eggs, get valuable prizes and purchase unique seasonal skins, including a new horse costume and a luxurious Faberge egg.</em></p><h2> ? Main events of the event:</h2><ul><li> ? Island-wide Easter Egg Hunt</li><li> ? Exclusive rewards for collected eggs</li><li> ?️ New in-game items:<ul><li> ? Horse costume (3 unique colors)</li><li> ? Faberge Egg (elite decorative item)</li></ul></li><li> ⏳ Limited time: April 10 - April 17, 2025 </li></ul><p></p><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 400px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/20250408123848_1-Edit.png\"></p><p> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\">Select a server to play on</a></p><p> ? <strong>Don\'t miss your chance to get rare items and have fun!</strong></p>'),
(18192, 'en-US', 'Rust May 1st 2025 Update: Twitch Drops, Jungle, and New Skins'),
(18193, 'en-US', 'Facepunch is making several surprises for players at once: new Twitch rewards, a large-scale update \"Jungle\" with completely new gameplay and exclusive skins that have already caused a stir on the marketplace. Find out first what awaits you in the coming weeks!'),
(18194, 'en-US', '<p><em>The world of Rust is getting ready for some major changes: new Twitch Drops, the long-awaited Jungle update, and fresh skins. We\'ll tell you everything we know so far.</em></p><h2> ? New Twitch Drops are coming </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: 300px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/1458_20db034df339d0b84ca484a5b0de5c4f.jpeg\"></p><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: 300px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/1458_6ca41dd7f5d41adf1aaed13f924177a8.jpeg\"></p><ul><li> ? The exact date has not yet been announced</li><li> ? Possible skins for drops have already appeared in the Steam Workshop</li><li> ? Developers hint at an imminent announcement</li></ul><h2> ? Jungle Update - May 1st </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: 300px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/1458_145d2f602791638906599476b6083e4c.png\"></p><ul><li> ? New biome with a unique atmosphere</li><li> ? Dangerous animals: panthers, crocodiles, snakes</li><li> ? New weapons: blowpipes and boomerangs</li><li> ? New NPC: Outbreak Scientist (linked to Ziggurat)</li></ul><h3> ? Available for testing:</h3><p> You can already try the update in the \'aux03\' test branch:</p><ol><li> On Steam: Right click on Rust → Properties</li><li> Select the \"Betas\" tab</li><li> From the drop down menu select \"aux03 - Staging Branch\"</li></ol><h2> ?️ New Skin: Jungle Stone Building </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: 300px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/1458_332b2d2018b87dfec6ac70dc9f4407e9.png\"></p><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: 300px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/1458_5231f766eac535ab420bdfcd50ff0191.png\"></p><ul><li> ? Coming May 1st with the update</li><li> ? Already impacted the market: the price of Aztec Door has increased 10 times</li><li> ? Unique jungle style design</li></ul><h2> ? New skins this week </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: 300px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/1458_d2b5ca33bd970f64a6301fa75ae2eb22.png\"></p><p> A fresh batch of skins has been added to the store - hurry to buy them before the prices change!</p><p></p><p> ? <strong>Stay tuned - more information coming soon!</strong></p><p> ? <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\">Our servers</a> will be updated on the day the patch is released</p>'),
(18195, 'en-US', 'Receiving items'),
(18196, 'en-US', 'Big Cat Pie'),
(18197, 'en-US', 'A delicious crocodile pie that\'s always too hot. Replenishes hunger, health, and hydration. Grants better night vision, including tree markers and ore hotspots, for a short time.'),
(18198, 'en-US', 'Crocodile Pie'),
(18199, 'en-US', 'Delicious crocodile meat. Its consumption will restore health, quench hunger and thirst.'),
(18200, 'en-US', 'Crocodile meat'),
(18201, 'en-US', 'Raw crocodile meat. Eating it will harm your health, try cooking it first.'),
(18202, 'en-US', 'Raw crocodile meat'),
(18203, 'en-US', 'Tasty snake meat. Eating it will restore health, quench hunger and thirst.'),
(18204, 'en-US', 'Snake meat');
INSERT INTO `language_translate` (`id`, `language`, `translation`) VALUES
(18205, 'en-US', 'Tasty meat of a big cat. Eating it will restore health, quench hunger and thirst.'),
(18206, 'en-US', 'Big cat meat'),
(18207, 'en-US', 'Can be used as a melee weapon or as a throwing weapon. Once thrown (right click) it flies in an arc before returning to you.'),
(18208, 'en-US', 'Boomerang'),
(18209, 'en-US', 'A blow gun that shoots darts with various effects.'),
(18210, 'en-US', 'Blow tube'),
(18211, 'en-US', 'A high-damage automatic rifle in the Jungle Relic style.'),
(18212, 'en-US', 'Assault Rifle \"Jungle\"'),
(18213, 'en-US', 'A melee weapon crafted from obsidian. Good for scavenging carcasses.'),
(18214, 'en-US', 'Obsidian bone knife'),
(18215, 'en-US', 'Snake venom. Used to create dart darts.'),
(18216, 'en-US', 'Snake venom'),
(18217, 'en-US', '? Jungle Update!'),
(18218, 'en-US', 'New biome, weapons, animals and much more...'),
(18219, 'en-US', '<h1>? Jungle Update ? </h1><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 400px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/1461_d2b5ca33bd970f64a6301fa75ae2eb22.png\"></p><p> Already this Thursday at <strong>? 21:00 Moscow time!</strong></p><p> ? This month we will have:</p><ul><li> ? New biome \"Jungle\"</li><li> ⚔️ New weapons: Blowpipe ? and Boomerang ?</li><li> ? More exotic animals:<br> ▸ Tigers ?<br> ▸ Crocodiles ?<br> ▸ Panthers ?<br> ▸ Snakes ?</li><li> ? Ability to climb trees ? and swing on vines</li><li> ? New monument - Ziggurat</li><li> ? New skin for stone buildings</li><li> ? DLC \"Jungle\":<ul style=\"list-style-type: \'▸ \'; padding-left: 25px;\"><li> ?️ Wooden armor</li><li> ? Shelves for the base</li><li> ? Skin for AK-47</li><li> ?️ Storage barrels</li><li> ? Machete knife</li></ul></li></ul><p> ✨ <em>Plus a ton of bug fixes and gameplay improvements!</em> ✨</p><p> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\">Select a server to play on</a></p><p> ? <strong>Don\'t miss your chance to get rare items and have fun!</strong></p><p> ✅ <strong>Play with us!</strong></p>'),
(18220, 'en-US', 'Game Update Review May 1, 2025: Jungle, Animals, Weapons, etc.'),
(18221, 'en-US', 'Review of new items, jungle, animals, weapons...'),
(18222, 'en-US', '<div class=\"jungle-theme\"><h1 align=\"center\">? Secrets of the Jungle: Update ?</h1><h3 align=\"center\"> <em>Exclusive from PROSTOY RUST</em></h3><h2 class=\"section-title\"> ? Jungle Dwellers</h2><div class=\"entity-block\"><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Tiger</strong><br> The advanced behavior algorithm combines wolf tactics with unique patterns. Reacts to combat actions within a 200m radius, creating unpredictable conflicts between players and NPCs.</p><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Crocodile</strong><br> Master of underwater camouflage. Capable of making 5-meter jumps from the water with a stunning effect. Particularly dangerous during twilight game time.</p><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Snake</strong><br> The details of the behavior are not disclosed. It is known that the developers are testing the mechanics of poisonous bites and camouflage. </p><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: 300px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/1462_1af199128182aaece066f760090c515b.jpg\"></p></div><h2 class=\"section-title\"> ?️ New Weapons</h2><div class=\"entity-block\"><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Boomerang</strong><br> An ancient weapon with a boomerang trajectory. On the return path, it deals 30% of the damage of the initial strike + a disorientation effect for 3 sec.</p><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Blowpipe</strong><br> The proposed mechanics include different types of ammunition, from paralyzing needles to explosive capsules with plant poison.</p></div><h2 class=\"section-title\"> ? Structures and Monuments</h2><div class=\"entity-block\"><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Abandoned Temple</strong><br> Multi-level location with dynamic traps. Rewards and internal structure remain a mystery.</p><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Tropical swamp</strong><br> It differs from the standard one by its unique vegetation and increased humidity, which affects movement.</p><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Lianas</strong><br> Vertical climbing structures. Mechanics are similar to nets, but with an increased coverage area. </p><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; height: 300px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/1462_827ae90dcf8793f5308d487d1e900430.jpg\"></p></div><h2 class=\"section-title\"> ? Unique Flora</h2><div class=\"entity-block\"><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Bamboo</strong><br> Source of exotic resources. Presumably used to craft the Blowpipe.</p><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Tubular tree</strong><br> Produces standard wood, but has a unique visual model with hollow trunks.</p><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">?</span> <strong>Mimosa</strong><br> Ornamental plant. Can be sold to merchants or used in crafting.</p><p> <span class=\"entity-emoji\">☠️</span> <strong>Monster Bush</strong><br> Aggressive flora. Attacks players within a 2 meter radius, dealing damage over time.</p></div><div style=\"margin-top: 20px; color: #5a8f72;\" align=\"center\"> <em>⚠️ Full immersion in the dangerous jungle!?</em></div><p> ? <strong>Stay tuned - more information coming soon!</strong></p><p> ? <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\">Our servers</a> have been updated!</p></div>'),
(18223, 'en-US', 'Rust discount on Steam!'),
(18224, 'en-US', 'You can buy the game with a 50% discount!'),
(18225, 'en-US', '<h2 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\">? PROMOTION FROM FACEPUNCH! ?</h2><p style=\"font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"> Until <strong>Saturday, 21:00</strong> — the game <strong>Rust</strong> and all its DLCs are available with a <strong>50%</strong> discount on Steam!</p><h2 style=\"margin-top: 30px;\"> ? Rust + DLC Bundle — discounted bundle</h2><p> Collect everything you need for full-fledged survival in the world of Rust:</p><hr><h2> ? Main game</h2><p> <strong>Rust</strong> is a cult multiplayer survival game where the main goal is to stay alive at any cost: crafting, construction, raids, battles.</p><ul><li> <strong>Full price:</strong> <s>1499 rub.</s></li><li> <strong>With discount:</strong> <strong>749 rub.</strong> (-50%)</li></ul><hr><h2> ? DLC 1: Instruments Pack</h2><p> Adds musical instruments to the game, from guitar to drums. Play for friends around the campfire or host concerts on the server.</p><ul><li> <strong>Full price:</strong> <s>280 rub.</s></li><li> <strong>With discount:</strong> <strong>140 rub.</strong> (-50%)</li></ul><hr><h2> ? DLC 2: Sunburn Pack</h2><p> Summer collection of beach-themed items: swimsuits, umbrellas, sun loungers, pool, toys and other items for a relaxing holiday by the water.</p><ul><li> <strong>Full price:</strong> <s>280 rub.</s></li><li> <strong>With discount:</strong> <strong>140 rub.</strong> (-50%)</li></ul><hr><h2> ? DLC 3: Voice Props Pack</h2><p> Adds sound devices to the game: megaphones, microphones, phones, players and audio recording. A great way to communicate and role-play scenarios.</p><ul><li> <strong>Full price:</strong> <s>360 rub.</s></li><li> <strong>With discount:</strong> <strong>180 rub.</strong> (-50%)</li></ul><hr><h2> ? Total cost of all DLCs</h2><ul><li> <strong>Total price without discount:</strong> <s>1080 rub.</s></li><li> <strong>Price with 50% discount:</strong> <strong>540 rub.</strong></li></ul><hr><p> <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/252490/Rust/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">? Go to the game page on Steam</a></p>'),
(18226, 'en-US', 'Security Camera Passwords in Rust'),
(18227, 'en-US', 'Full list of passwords for CCTV cameras in Rust: oil rigs, peaceful zones, bandit camp, sphere and airport. Convenient for raiders and reconnaissance.'),
(18228, 'en-US', '<p>Use the Computer Station to monitor activity at important sites in Rust. Below are all the working camera codes, from oil rigs to camps and domes.</p><h2> ? Peaceful City (Outpost)</h2><p> The Peaceful City provides several useful chambers, especially for trading and resource gathering.</p><table class=\"table\"><tbody><tr><th> Camera name</th><th> Password</th></tr><tr><td> Street</td><td> COMPOUNDSTREET</td></tr><tr><td> Oil refiner</td><td> COMPOUND CRUDE</td></tr><tr><td> Music scene</td><td> COMPOUNDMUSIC</td></tr><tr><td> Recreation area</td><td> COMPOUNDCHILL</td></tr></tbody></table><h2> ? Bandit Camp</h2><p> Cameras are useful for monitoring players as they gather at casinos or retail outlets.</p><table class=\"table\"><tbody><tr><th> Camera name</th><th> Password</th></tr><tr><td> Weapon shop</td><td> TOWNWEAPONS</td></tr><tr><td> Casino</td><td> CASINO</td></tr></tbody></table><h2> ? Large Oil Rig</h2><p> One of the most dangerous objects, cameras allow you to track the activity of bots and players on the floors and helipad.</p><table class=\"table\"><tbody><tr><th> Camera</th><th> Password</th></tr><tr><td> Floor L6D</td><td> OILRIG2L6D</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L6C</td><td> OILRIG2L6C</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L6B</td><td> OILRIG2L6B</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L6A</td><td> OILRIG2L6A</td></tr><tr><td> Exhaust pipe</td><td> OILRIG2EXHAUST</td></tr><tr><td> Helipad</td><td> OILRIG2HELI</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L5</td><td> OILRIG2L5</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L4</td><td> OILRIG2L4</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L3B</td><td> OILRIG2L3B</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L3A</td><td> OILRIG2L3A</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L2</td><td> OILRIG2L2</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L1</td><td> OILRIG2L1</td></tr><tr><td> Pier</td><td> OILRIG2DOCK</td></tr></tbody></table><h2> ? Small Oil Rig</h2><p> Ideal for reconnaissance before an assault, the cameras cover all levels and the landing point.</p><table class=\"table\"><tbody><tr><th> Camera</th><th> Password</th></tr><tr><td> Floor L4</td><td> OILRIG1L4</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L3</td><td> OILRIG1L3</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L2</td><td> OILRIG1L2</td></tr><tr><td> Floor L1</td><td> OILRIG1L1</td></tr><tr><td> Pier</td><td> OILRIG1DOCK</td></tr><tr><td> Helipad</td><td> OILRIG1HELI</td></tr></tbody></table><h2> ? Airport (Airfield)</h2><p> Convenient for assessing the workload of a location, raid, or waiting for boxes.</p><table class=\"table\"><tbody><tr><th> Camera</th><th> Password</th></tr><tr><td> Helipad (new)</td><td> AIRFIELDHELIPAD</td></tr><tr><td> Garage (old)</td><td> AIRFIELD GARAGE</td></tr></tbody></table><h2> ? Sphere (Dome)</h2><p> A rare but useful spot - especially at the beginning of a wipe.</p><table class=\"table\"><tbody><tr><th> Camera</th><th> Password</th></tr><tr><td> Bottom part</td><td> DOME1</td></tr><tr><td> Upper platform</td><td> DOMETOP</td></tr></tbody></table><p> ? Use these codes with a computer desk in your home or any hideout to monitor map activity. Great for raiding, defense, and scouting!</p>'),
(18229, 'en-US', 'After purchase, wait for the administrator, do not forget to provide your SteamID64!'),
(18230, 'en-US', 'Panthers'),
(18231, 'en-US', 'Crocodiles'),
