(18238, 'en-US', 'Product with choice'),
(18239, 'en-US', 'short_key (in-game)'),
(18240, 'en-US', 'In-game identifier'),
(18241, 'en-US', 'Rust Skins Giveaway'),
(18242, 'en-US', 'CS2 Skins Distribution'),
(18243, 'en-US', 'Select wipe...'),
(18244, 'en-US', 'Large selection of skins for 14 days. You can add your own skins through <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/custom-skins\" target=\"_blank\">this section on the site</a> .<br> To use skins, write the command <span style=\"color: #aaf16e;\">/s</span> in the server chat'),
(18245, 'en-US', 'Large selection of skins for 30 days. You can add your own skins through <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/custom-skins\" target=\"_blank\">this section on the site</a> .<br> To use skins, write the command <span style=\"color: #aaf16e;\">/s</span> in the server chat'),
(18246, 'en-US', 'Large selection of skins for 90 days. You can add your own skins through <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/custom-skins\" target=\"_blank\">this section on the site</a> .<br> To use skins, write the command <span style=\"color: #aaf16e;\">/s</span> in the server chat'),
(18247, 'en-US', '<div style=\"text-align: left\">After purchasing, you will have access to building skins and commands for 14 days:<br> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #aaf16e;\">/bskin</span> - opens a menu for setting the default building skin.<br> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #aaf16e;\">/bskin build</span> - updates the skin of the block you are viewing and everything connected to it.</div>'),
(18248, 'en-US', 'When turned on, sucks in any fallen objects within range.'),
(18249, 'en-US', 'Funnel'),
(18250, 'en-US', 'Fresh changes in RUST!'),
(18251, 'en-US', 'Biomes, marine system and weapon modules update!'),
(18252, 'en-US', '<h3>Fresh changes in RUST: update of biomes, marine system and weapon modules </h3><ul style=\"list-style: none; padding-left: 10px;\"><li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 15px; position: relative;\"> <span style=\"color: #ff3b30; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;\">•</span> <strong>Changes to the spawn system:</strong> the jungle biome is no longer used as the starting location for players.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 15px; position: relative;\"> <span style=\"color: #ff3b30; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;\">•</span> <strong>New naval system:</strong> added sailing ships of various sizes with the ability to install masts of different levels.</li><li style=\"margin-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 15px; position: relative;\"> <span style=\"color: #ff3b30; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0;\">•</span> <strong>Tactical weapon module:</strong> new tag functionality requires 125 scrap to research and is created from 15 MVC + 10 microcircuits. Allows you to effectively mark targets in combat.</li></ul><p style=\"color: #666; font-style: italic;\"> The update is aimed at improving game balance and expanding tactical possibilities.</p>'),
(18253, 'en-US', 'Update and wipe in SIMPLE!'),
(18254, 'en-US', 'Game update and global wipe on our servers!'),
(18255, 'en-US', '<div class=\"header\"><div class=\"update-time\">The update will be released this Thursday at 21:00 Moscow time! And immediately after it, a wipe on all our servers!</div></div><div class=\"features\"><h2> This month we have:</h2><ul><li> Weapon modules (silencers/tags)</li><li> Increased MP5 Durability</li><li> Bee bombs</li><li> Accelerated LR deployment</li><li> Changing the cannabis bush</li><li> Rotting vegetables (48 hours)</li><li> Floor and Ceiling Wallpaper (DLC)</li><li> Decreased performance of the automatic turret</li></ul></div><div class=\"warning\"><p> ? Only players who have played on our servers for more than 1 hour can vote for the map!</p></div><div class=\"maps\"><h3> Don\'t forget to vote for the maps:</h3><ul><li> MAX3 - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max3\">https://prostoj.store/maps/max3</a></li><li> X2-[weekly] - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/classicx2\">https://prostoj.store/maps/classicx2</a></li><li> NOLIMIT - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/nolimit\">https://prostoj.store/maps/nolimit</a></li><li> MAX8 - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max8\">https://prostoj.store/maps/max8</a></li><li> X2-[2 weeks] - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/classic14x2\">https://prostoj.store/maps/classic14x2</a></li><li> MAX4-X2 - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max4x2\">https://prostoj.store/maps/max4x2</a></li><li> VANILLA-X10 - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers/x10\">https://prostoj.store/servers/x10</a></li></ul></div>'),
(18256, 'en-US', 'WIPE on servers SIMPLE RUST'),
(18257, 'en-US', 'Wipe on our servers!'),
(18258, 'en-US', '<div><h1>? WIPE ON SERVERS ?</h1><p> <strong>THIS FRIDAY WIPE ON ALL OUR SERVERS!</strong></p><p> <strong>THERE WILL BE A GLOBAL WIPE ON X2-[WEEKLY] AND MAX4_X2</strong></p><p><mark> June 20 at 16:00 Moscow time</mark></p><p> Only players who have played on our servers for more than 1 hour can vote for the map! ??</p><h2> Don\'t forget to vote for the maps:</h2><div class=\"maps\"><ul><li> MAX3 - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max3\">https://prostoj.store/maps/max3</a></li><li> X2-[weekly] - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/classicx2\">https://prostoj.store/maps/classicx2</a></li><li> NOLIMIT - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/nolimit\">https://prostoj.store/maps/nolimit</a></li><li> MAX8 - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max8\">https://prostoj.store/maps/max8</a></li><li> X2-[2 weeks] - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/classic14x2\">https://prostoj.store/maps/classic14x2</a></li><li> MAX4-X2 - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max4x2\">https://prostoj.store/maps/max4x2</a></li><li> VANILLA-X10 - <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers/x10\">https://prostoj.store/servers/x10</a></li></ul></div><p> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\">?Select a server to play on</a></p><p> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/prostoj\">?Our Discord</a></p><p> <a href=\"https://vk.com/prostoj_rust\">?Our VK</a></p><p> <a href=\"https://t.me/ProstojServerBot\">?Our Telegram</a></p><p> ? <strong><a href=\"https://prostoj.store/skindrops\">Don\'t miss your chance to get free skins and have fun!</a></strong></p> ✅ <strong>Play with us!</strong></p></div>'),
(18259, 'en-US', 'Rust Update, News, Downtime'),
(18260, 'en-US', 'Game update, simple growth'),
(18261, 'en-US', '<article><header><h1>? Latest news from the world of Rust: new respawns, helicopters and sea adventures</h1><p><time datetime=\"2025-06-19\"> June 19, 2025</time> | Rust News</p></header><section><h2> ? Respawn in the city? Now with an official cooldown!</h2><p> Rust has begun actively developing a mechanic for respawning in <strong>NPC cities</strong> , such as Outpost. But it\'s not that simple - to resurrect among friendly NPCs, you first need <em>to unlock this feature</em> , and then wait <strong>30 minutes</strong> until the next respawn.</p><p> Adds strategy and a bit of spice to the fight - now every frag can be worth the time!</p></section><section><h2> ? Fishing Village: New Chance After Death</h2><p> The already familiar Peaceful City is joined by <strong>a fishing village</strong> as a new safe zone for respawn. However, first you need to complete a quest from a new <strong>NPC character</strong> (each biome has its own), and only then will the coveted respawn point open up to you.</p><p> Like other safe zones, there is a <strong>30 minute</strong> timer, so there is time to admire the waves between deaths.</p></section><section><h2> ? Patrol helicopter has moved to the controls of updates</h2><p> A complete <strong>rework of the patrol helicopter</strong> has begun. The <code>patrolhelirevision_2</code> branch is already in the works: new routes, improved models and, probably, smarter AI. Perhaps now it will not circle above you forever, but will still do the job according to the instructions ?</p></section><section><h2> ? Marine update is coming</h2><p> The waters of Rust are getting more content-rich, with work continuing on <strong>floating cities</strong> and a boat building station. It looks like we\'ll soon have a full-fledged \"Hell on Water\"!</p></section><section><h2> ? Important bugfix: the rate of fire is now stable</h2><p> Fixed a bug due to which <strong>the rate of fire depended on FPS</strong> . Now even on weak hardware your shots sound as they should. Without lags - literally!</p></section><footer><p> Stay tuned for Rust updates — there\'s still a lot of interesting stuff ahead. In the meantime, reload your ammo, repair your armor, and don\'t forget <em>to complete the quest before respawning</em> ?</p><p> #Rust #RustNews #RustUpdate #FPSFix #SafeZones #MarineUpdate</p></footer></article>'),
(18262, 'en-US', 'New Party System in Rust - Spawning with friends is now possible!'),
(18263, 'en-US', 'The Rust test branch has a \"Party\" system that allows you to spawn next to your friends when you first log into a server. Find out how it works and when to expect the release!'),
(18264, 'en-US', '<article><header><h1>? The \"Party\" system in Rust - now spawning with friends is not just a dream</h1><p><time datetime=\"2025-06-19\"> June 19, 2025</time> | Rust News</p></header><section><h2> ? Party system is already on the test branch</h2><p> Finally, what thousands of survivalists have been waiting for: a new <strong>\"Party\"</strong> system has been added to <strong>the Rust test branch</strong> - a full-fledged group mechanic for starting with friends. The release is expected <strong>in July</strong> , so there is not much time left!</p></section><section><h2> ? How does it work?</h2><p> It\'s simple: go to the menu, create a group and <strong>invite your friends from Steam</strong> . No more endless runs to each other with a stone and a fire in hand!</p><p> Now, when <strong>you first spawn</strong> on the server, all party members will be <strong>within a 100 meter radius</strong> of the first player who entered. This will save you nerves and time, especially during full wipes.</p></section><section><h2> ? Important to know</h2><p> This system <em>only works the first time you log</em> into the server. Further respawns are as usual, by sleeping bags or points.</p><p> However, this is already a huge step towards a comfortable co-op start. And yes, no teleports - just honest proximity!</p></section><footer><p> Prepare your team, fix your microphone and call your friends - with the new party system, surviving will not only be easier, but also more fun!</p><p> #Rust #RustPartySystem #SurvivalInThePack #RustUpdate #SpawnNearby</p></footer></article>'),
(18265, 'en-US', 'Your verification skin, once it is verified it will appear in the list below and on the servers.'),
(18266, 'en-US', 'Not enough'),
(18267, 'en-US', 'The store on the server you are on is closed until 06.06.2025 21:00 Moscow time!'),
