(18272, 'en-US', '<div style=\"text-align: left\">After purchasing, you will have access to building skins and commands for 14 days:<br> <span style=\"font-size: 18px; color: #aaf16e;\">/bskin</span> - opens a menu for setting the default building skin.</div>'),
(18273, 'en-US', 'Update and Global Wipe on SIMPLE!'),
(18274, 'en-US', 'Game update, simple rust, global wipe rust, skins'),
(18275, 'en-US', '<div class=\"announce\"><h2 style=\"color: #f10f0f; margin-top: 0;\">? THIS THURSDAY THERE IS A GLOBAL WIPE!</h2><p> <span class=\"emoji\">⏰</span> <strong>July 3 at 21:00 Moscow time</strong></p><p> <span class=\"emoji\">?</span> Players with &gt;1 hour of play can vote</p><h3> Vote for the server:</h3><ul class=\"server-list\"><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max3\">「⏩」MAX3</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/classicx2\">「⏩」X2-[weekly]</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/nolimit\">「⏩」NOLIMIT</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max8\">「⏩」MAX8</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/classic14x2\">「⏩」X2-[2 weeks]</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max4x2\">「⏩」MAX4-X2</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers/x10\">「⏩」VANILLA-X10</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"divider\"> ? Now for the update:</div><div class=\"update\"><h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #3498db; padding-bottom: 5px;\"> ? News from the fields!</h2><div class=\"feature\"><h3> ? Binding objects</h3><p> New \"Snapping\" system for precise placement of objects against walls and in relation to each other.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><h3> ? Invitation system</h3><p> Invite friends via <code>party.inviteparty</code> with notifications on Discord/Steam.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><h3> ? Smart scientists</h3><p> Improved AI: tactical reinforcements, smoke grenades, smart combat behavior.</p></div><div class=\"feature\"><h3> ? Livestock</h3><p> New animals (cows) for farming and resources.</p></div><h3> ♻ Other changes:</h3><ul style=\"columns: 2; list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;\"><li> • Updated outposts</li><li> • New ESC menu</li><li> • Engine optimizations</li><li> • Improved fog</li><li> • Naval Update</li><li> • Pilot DLC</li><li> • Decor Lighting</li><li> • Turret balance</li></ul></div>'),
(18276, 'en-US', 'Rust Artists Tournament - Prize Sign Drawing Competition!'),
(18277, 'en-US', 'Take part in the Rust Artists Tournament: draw on signs in Rust, send screenshots and win skins! Only handmade. Prize fund up to 1500₽!'),
(18278, 'en-US', '<p>Do you like <strong>Rust drawings</strong> and want to win valuable prizes? From July 3 to 6, <a href=\"https://prostoj.store\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">prostoj.store</a> is hosting a unique contest for all creative players!</p><h2> ? Dates of the event</h2><p> ⏳ From 03.07 at 21:00 to 06.07 at 21:00</p><h2> ? Prize fund</h2><ul><li> ? 1st place - 1500₽ on skin balance</li><li> ? 2nd place - 1000₽ on skin balance</li><li> ? 3rd place - 500₽ on skin balance</li><li> ? Top works will be featured in our post!</li></ul><h2> ? Terms of participation</h2><ul><li> ? The size of the sign is any</li><li> ? Screenshot in good quality</li><li> ? You can see the sign itself and the inscription <strong>prostoj.store</strong> in the corner</li><li> ✍ Please indicate your nickname when submitting your work</li><li> ? <strong>/sil is prohibited</strong> - only handwork</li></ul><h2> ? How are the winners chosen?</h2><p> We\'ll select <strong>the top 10 best works</strong> , and then players will vote for their favorites. Everything is fair!</p><p> Don\'t miss your chance to prove yourself! <strong>Rust pictures</strong> are not just decoration, but real art in the world of survival. Good luck!</p><p> #Rust #Rustevents #Rustdrawings #Rustsigns #prostojstore #RustArt</p>'),
(18279, 'en-US', 'Events'),
