irts, bathing suits</li></ul><h2 id=\"arctic\"> ❄ Arctic Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/iceassaultrifle.jpg\" alt=\"Arctic Pack DLC\"></p><p> DLC for snow biomes. Items look like expedition gear.</p><ul><li> Arctic Hazmat Suit</li><li> Fur hoods, wraps</li><li> Snow camouflage</li></ul><h2 id=\"instrument\"> ? Instrument Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/ss_383b5d3c204dd6fd7dc6eac1643f14de35293363.1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"Instrument Pack DLC\"></p><p> The first music DLC in Rust. Allows you to play instruments manually or with a MIDI keyboard.</p><ul><li> Guitar, bass guitar</li><li> Xylophone, keys, drums</li><li> Trumpet, saxophone</li><li> Bongo, pots</li></ul><h2 id=\"voice\"> ? Voice Props DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/Rust-Voice-Props-DLC-803x452.jpg\" alt=\"Voice Props DLC\"></p><p> An audio supplement for lovers of creativity and atmosphere.</p><ul><li> Speakers (sound reproduction)</li><li> Cassette recorder and cassettes</li><li> Radio and voice amplifiers</li><li> Microphones, disco lights</li></ul><h2 id=\"ancient\"> ? Ancient Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/cDjTrmjWNic3QEmhkeWuLQ.jpg\" alt=\"Ancient Pack DLC\"></p><p> Stylization of ancient civilizations: columns, stone patterns, tarnished metal.</p><ul><li> Stone walls with symbols</li><li> Clay and bronze elements</li><li> Torches and columns</li></ul><h2 id=\"abyss\"> ? Abyss Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/F0X0GjYaQAAl9MG.jpg\" alt=\"Abyss Pack DLC\"></p><p> Underwater theme. Great for ocean bases and deep caves.</p><ul><li> Helmet with backlight</li><li> Dark suits with steel accents</li><li> Decorations for underwater buildings</li></ul><hr><h2> ? Where to buy DLC Rust?</h2><ul><li> <strong>Steam</strong> - all official DLCs are sold on the game page.</li><li> <strong>Rust DLC Bundle</strong> - sometimes available during sales.</li><li> <strong>FunPay</strong> - accounts with already activated DLC (unofficial).</li></ul><h2> ? Buying tips</h2><ol><li> Expect seasonal discounts (summer, autumn, winter, spring).</li><li> Buy DLCs as a set.</li><li> Do not use DLC Unlocker - it violates Steam rules and may result in a ban.</li></ol><h2> ✅ Conclusion</h2><p> The most useful DLCs are <strong>Frontier (barrels)</strong> , <strong>Arctic (cold protection)</strong> , <strong>Instrument</strong> and <strong>Voice Props</strong> for creativity. The rest are for atmosphere and base customization. Choose based on your playstyle!</p>'),
