h.tv/drops/inventory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">your Drops inventory</a> , you can see how much is left until the next drop.</p><h3> ? Is it possible to watch multiple streams at once to speed up?</h3><p> No. Only <strong>one active channel</strong> works - the rest are not taken into account.</p><h3> ⏱ When will the drop appear on Steam?</h3><p> Usually within 10 minutes after clicking “Claim”. If not after 30 minutes, check <strong>your Steam to Twitch link</strong> .</p><h3> ? Do you need Twitch Prime?</h3><p> No, a regular Twitch account and Rust in your Steam library are enough.</p><h3> ? How to unlink an old Twitch and link a new one?</h3><p> Go to <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/drops\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">the Drops page</a> on Steam, click “Unlink Account”, then connect your new Twitch.</p><h3> ? If I haven\'t bought Rust yet, will the drops be saved?</h3><p> Yes, if you <strong>managed to pick</strong> them up. They are stored for up to 180 days. After purchasing Rust, just check the binding and click “Check for Missing Drops”.</p><h3> ? What are Crates for?</h3><p> These are Steam Crates containing one random Rust item. To open:</p><ol><li> Launch the game Rust</li><li> Go to the menu - Inventory</li><li> Select Crate and click “Open”</li></ol><hr><h2 id=\"extra\"> ? Useful links</h2><ul><li> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/drops/campaigns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Active Twitch Drops Campaigns</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/drops/inventory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">My inventory of drops</a></li></ul>'),
(18314, 'en-US', '<p>DLC (Downloadable Content) are extensions to Rust that add unique items, styles, musical instruments, voice capabilities, and even change the visual appearance of buildings. Below, we have collected a complete description of all available DLC for 2025.</p><h2> ? Quick links</h2><ul><li> <a href=\"#jungle\">Jungle Pack</a></li><li> <a href=\"#frontier\">Frontier Pack</a></li><li> <a href=\"#sunburn\">Sunburn Pack</a></li><li> <a href=\"#arctic\">Arctic Pack</a></li><li> <a href=\"#instrument\">Instrument Pack</a></li><li> <a href=\"#voice\">Voice Props</a></li><li> <a href=\"#ancient\">Ancient Pack</a></li><li> <a href=\"#abyss\">Abyss Pack</a></li><li> <a href=\"#pilot\">Pilot Pack DLC (Pilot Hazmat)</a></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"jungle\"> ? Jungle Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/jungle-pack-og.jpg\" alt=\"Jungle Pack DLC\"></p><p> Give your base a tropical makeover with jungle-inspired furniture, decor, and textures.</p><ul><li> Palm bed</li><li> Bamboo chairs and tables</li><li> Wall Mask Reptile</li><li> Wooden Totem Torches</li></ul><h2 id=\"frontier\"> ? Frontier Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/rust_frontiersman_hero_02.jpg\" alt=\"Frontier Pack DLC\"></p><p> DLC with barrels is one of the most useful sets for PvE and RP bases. Stylized as \"Wild West\".</p><ul><li> <strong>Barrel Storage</strong> - a large storage unit (like a large box)</li><li> Saloon Door - Double Cowboy Door</li><li> Chandelier, wooden furniture, gun rack</li></ul><h2 id=\"sunburn\"> ? Sunburn Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/sunburn-header.jpg\" alt=\"Sunburn Pack DLC\"></p><p> Summer aesthetic: beach vacation at your own base. Pairs well with RP.</p><ul><li> Inflatable pool</li><li> Sun loungers, umbrellas</li><li> Towel (spawnpoint)</li><li> Clothing - glasses, t-shirts, bathing suits</li></ul><h2 id=\"arctic\"> ❄ Arctic Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/iceassaultrifle.jpg\" alt=\"Arctic Pack DLC\"></p><p> DLC for snow biomes. Items look like expedition gear.</p><ul><li> Arctic Hazmat Suit</li><li> Fur hoods, wraps</li><li> Snow camouflage</li></ul><h2 id=\"instrument\"> ? Instrument Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/ss_383b5d3c204dd6fd7dc6eac1643f14de35293363.1920x1080.jpg\" alt=\"Instrument Pack DLC\"></p><p> The first music DLC in Rust. Allows you to play instruments manually or with a MIDI keyboard.</p><ul><li> Guitar, bass guitar</li><li> Xylophone, keys, drums</li><li> Trumpet, saxophone</li><li> Bongo, pots</li></ul><h2 id=\"voice\"> ? Voice Props DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/Rust-Voice-Props-DLC-803x452.jpg\" alt=\"Voice Props DLC\"></p><p> An audio supplement for lovers of creativity and atmosphere.</p><ul><li> Speakers (sound reproduction)</li><li> Cassette recorder and cassettes</li><li> Radio and voice amplifiers</li><li> Microphones, disco lights</li></ul><h2 id=\"ancient\"> ? Ancient Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/cDjTrmjWNic3QEmhkeWuLQ.jpg\" alt=\"Ancient Pack DLC\"></p><p> Stylization of ancient civilizations: columns, stone patterns, tarnished metal.</p><ul><li> Stone walls with symbols</li><li> Clay and bronze elements</li><li> Torches and columns</li></ul><h2 id=\"abyss\"> ? Abyss Pack DLC </h2><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/F0X0GjYaQAAl9MG.jpg\" alt=\"Abyss Pack DLC\"></p><p> Underwater theme. Great for ocean bases and deep caves.</p><ul><li> Helmet with backlight</li><li> Dark suits with steel accents</li><li> Decorations for underwater buildings</li></ul><h2 id=\"pilot\"> ✈️ Pilot Pack DLC (Pilot Hazmat)</h2><p> The latest <strong>Pilot DLC</strong> adds aviation elements to Rust. This pack combines <em>a mystical atmosphere</em> with military aesthetics. Visuals and new sounds make it one of the most atmospheric and unusual packs of 2025.</p><p> The update will be available from 07.08.2025 </p><p><img style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 600px;\" src=\"https://storage.prostoj.store/blog/dlc/photo_2025-07-23_10-18-22.jpg\" alt=\"Rust DLC Pilot Hazmat - weapons, chair and skins in aviation style\"></p><p> <strong>What\'s included in the DLC:</strong></p><ul><li> <strong>M15 (Pawn Reskin)</strong> - Unique weapon skin with <em>glow in the dark</em> and reworked firing sounds.</li><li> <strong>Pilot Hazmat</strong> is a suit skin with flight gear, helmet and breathing mask.</li><li> <strong>The skin for the combination lock</strong> is stylized as an aircraft panel, looks technological and unusual.</li><li> <strong>Small Crate Skin</strong> - discreet dark design with air container details.</li><li> <strong>Pilot\'s chair</strong> - a massive chair with metal elements and blue glow, reminiscent of an ice throne. Fits perfectly into command bases.</li></ul><p> <strong>For whom:</strong> For collectors, headquarters builders, as well as players who value unique appearance and sound effects.</p><hr><h2> ? Where to buy DLC Rust?</h2><ul><li> <strong>Steam</strong> - all official DLCs are sold on the game page.</li><li> <strong>Rust DLC Bundle</strong> - sometimes available during sales.</li><li> <strong>FunPay</strong> - accounts with already activated DLC (unofficial).</li></ul><h2> ? Buying tips</h2><ol><li> Expect seasonal discounts (summer, autumn, winter, spring).</li><li> Buy DLCs as a set.</li><li> Do not use DLC Unlocker - it violates Steam rules and may result in a ban.</li></ol><h2> ✅ Conclusion</h2><p> The most useful DLCs are <strong>Frontier (barrels)</strong> , <strong>Arctic (cold protection)</strong> , <strong>Instrument</strong> and <strong>Voice Props</strong> for creativity. The rest are for atmosphere and base customization. Choose based on your playstyle!</p>'),
(18315, 'en-US', 'Useful for getting inside buildings. It can be detonated remotely: to do this, select C4 in your inventory and press \"#rf_on\", this will enable remote mode, then specify the frequency on which C4 will wait for a signal and throw it where you need. As soon as a signal appears on the specified frequency, it will detonate! Tip: if during a raid you need to detonate several C4 (for example, when raiding a wall), you can use remote detonation, just set the required number of C4 to one listening frequency, then stick them where you need them, and then detonate them using a remote control set to the C4 frequency. This will reduce the number of audible explosions for the areas around the raid object.'),
(18316, 'en-US', '30 day study'),
(18317, 'en-US', 'GLOBAL WIPE | SIMPLE RUST'),
(18318, 'en-US', 'Wipe on all servers is simple'),
(18319, 'en-US', '<h2>? THIS THURSDAY THERE WILL BE A GLOBAL WIPE ON ALL OUR SERVERS!</h2><ul> ⁠<li> ? August 7 at 21:00 Moscow time</li><li> ? Only players who have played on our servers for more than 1 hour can vote for the map!</li></ul><h2> Don\'t forget to vote for the maps:</h2><ul><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max3\">「⏩」MAX3</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/classicx2\">「⏩」X2-[weekly]</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/nolimit\">「⏩」NOLIMIT</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max8\">「⏩」MAX8</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/classic14x2\">「⏩」X2-[2 weeks]</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/maps/max4x2\">「⏩」MAX4-X2</a></li><li> <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers/x10\">「⏩」VANILLA-X10</a></li></ul>'),
(18320, 'en-US', 'Hardcore wipe in RUST - new server without donations and with skins giveaway'),
(18321, 'en-US', 'Today at 21:00 Moscow time — global wipe and launch of the RUST Hardcore server! Complete lack of donations, fog of war, compass, new mechanics and skin giveaway. Join and survive for real!'),
(18322, 'en-US', '<h2>? Today is the wipe and launch of the Hardcore server!</h2><p> <strong>? Today, Thursday, at 21:00 Moscow time</strong> — a global wipe on all our <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">prostoj.store</a> servers and the launch of a new <strong>Hardcore</strong> mode!</p><h3> ? What awaits you on the new Hardcore server?</h3><ul><li> ☠️ <strong>Complete absence of donations</strong> - only skill and survival</li><li> ? <strong>Compass and \"fog of war\"</strong> instead of a standard map</li><li> ? Reworking of crafting weapons and cartridges</li><li> ? <strong>Skins giveaway</strong> among active players</li></ul><h3> ? The August \"Hard Core\" update includes:</h3><ul><li> ? New <strong>\"fog of war\"</strong></li><li> ? <strong>Compass</strong> as part of navigation</li><li> ? Changes in the creation of weapons and ammunition</li><li> ? Metal detector improvements</li><li> ☁️ Volumetric clouds, fog and other atmospheric improvements</li><li> ⚙️ Optimizing game loading</li><li> ? New in-game menu</li><li> ? <strong>Pilot Hazmat Kit</strong></li></ul><h3> ? How to connect?</h3><p> You can log in right now:<br> <code>connect 195.18.27.169:35300</code></p><p> Or choose one of our servers here: <a href=\"https://prostoj.store/servers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">prostoj.store/servers</a></p><h3> ? Join our <a href=\"https://discord.gg/prostoj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Discord community</a> and stay up to date!</h3><p> <strong>Feel the real RUST. This is your chance to survive for real.</strong></p>'),
(18323, 'en-US', 'Purchases of this product over the last 3 days are taken into account, each subsequent purchase increases the cost by +{PARAM_PERCENT_DROP}% for this product.<br/><br/> Purchases of goods by other players do not affect your cost.'),
(18324, 'en-US', 'This product has a floating price: <span class=\"text-link-color-default\">+{PARAM_PERCENT_DROP}%</span> per purchase.'),
