(18481, 'en-US', 'A cheap door to protect your base. It is vulnerable to fire and explosives, so it is nothing more than a temporary solution. Due to these drawbacks, you should consider upgrading to a stronger door, such as sheet metal. The wooden door can use two types of locks - a regular door lock and a combination lock. To pick up the door, remove the lock from it, open it, then hold down the \'E\' (USE) key and select \'Pick up\'.'),
(18482, 'en-US', 'Trade safely with other players by creating lots for sale. If someone gains access to the back panel, they can take everything inside, so keep it secure.'),
